window.AKK_CHARM_BIG_SHOTS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_CHARM_BIG_SHOTS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1","paragraphs":["The surrounding noise and clamor continued to rise.","Ye Qiusuo opened her eyes, reached up to rub her temples, and looked at the few people sitting on the stage in the middle, laughing, chatting, and touching up their makeup. She then glanced towards the side of the stage below, where several camera lenses were trained on those individuals.","She suddenly froze.","She remembered. These people were recording a knowledge competition show, and she had been invited by a friend at the last minute to fill a spot as a guest participant.","Having spent several consecutive days holed up in the laboratory before being dragged here, it was now the mid-show break. She had been sitting in her seat with her eyes closed, resting, and had subsequently had a dream.","In the dream, she was actually a minor supporting character in a book, while the female celebrity sitting on the right side of the stage was the female lead. The female lead shone brilliantly on this show; with her decent educational background and good looks, once the program aired, she directly leapt from a second-tier star to a first-tier celebrity, receiving an endless stream of resources.","The female lead stepped over a bunch of ordinary participants to rise to fame, establishing a \"top student\" persona in the entertainment industry. Ye Qiusuo was the ordinary participant trampled most harshly in the first episode. Because her looks among the ordinary participants were no less than the female lead's, the author used her as the perfect stepping stone for this female lead's perfection, being utterly outmatched by the female lead in both answering questions and breadth of knowledge.","However, Ye Qiusuo basically didn't appear again in the later parts of the book, a complete extra.","In the dream, Ye Qiusuo was forced to read the entire book, which was all about the female lead using the fame from this show to harvest various male idols and business tycoons in the entertainment circle, with fan-shipped couples (CPs) being hyped like crazy.","Ye Qiusuo: \"?\"","Leaving aside whether this dream was real or fake, using her as a stepping stone in this kind of knowledge show? Had the author's logic been eaten by a dog?","While Ye Qiusuo was still pondering, the program recording resumed. The question-and-answer session between the guests on stage and the fifty ordinary participants had already begun, and every development was exactly the same as described in the dream.","This knowledge show mainly followed a pattern of answering questions + discussion. The answering questions part involved both the resident guests on stage and the ordinary participants answering together, followed by an expanded discussion. With fifty ordinary participants answering, after one recording session, the top thirty scorers could stay and continue to the next episode's recording. This continued, with a corresponding number of ordinary guest participants being eliminated each round, until finally five ordinary participants remained to compete against the five guests on stage.","The five resident guests on stage included a host from the cultural and entertainment industry, a crosstalk performer, actor celebrities, and so on.","Essentially, they were all insiders in the industry. The female lead, Wan Yurou, was the only young female celebrity among the five guests. There was also a male actor around her age, while the other three were middle-aged men.","In the dream, what happened next was that Wan Yurou answered all questions correctly, while Ye Qiusuo, as the lowest scorer in the entire venue, had the camera shoved in her face. Two equally young and good-looking women made for a very striking contrast. Having not rested well for several days, dragged in by a friend at the last minute to make up numbers, and with the program crew not providing makeup or styling for the fifty ordinary participants, her complexion naturally wasn't as good as the meticulously made-up female lead sitting on stage.","The stark contrast in scores, coupled with Wan Yurou's eloquent and articulate speech versus Ye Qiusuo's taciturnity, created an 'exciting' comparison that was immediately highlighted by the post-production team in their editing.","Once the show aired, Wan Yurou unsurprisingly became wildly popular, while Ye Qiusuo, used as the stepping stone, naturally faced scorn from netizens, with comments like \"brainless star\" and so on.","And in reality, events were also developing towards the plot in the dream, specifically manifested in Ye Qiusuo's answer button device being broken, with only the A option registering when pressed.","In the dream, Ye Qiusuo was just there to make up the numbers and couldn't be bothered to find a staff member to replace the broken device. She closed her eyes to rest in the guest seat, only to end up being stepped on by the female lead on her way up.","If she hadn't had this dream, given Ye Qiusuo's character of preferring to avoid trouble, she might have really let the button device stay broken and get the recording over with sooner.","But now...","Ye Qiusuo wanted to see what would happen if she didn't follow the so-called plot development from the book.","She directly stood up and walked down from the guest seating area.","The cameras were still following. Staff below saw an ordinary guest participant coming down and immediately someone rushed over: \"We're still recording. Guests cannot come down now.\"","Ye Qiusuo opened her palm, revealing the button device: \"This only registers the A button. It's broken.\"","The staff member was taken aback for a moment, then said, \"Please wait a moment.\" He immediately took the button device from her hand to test and discuss with others.","After a group discussion, the staff member from before returned with a new button device: \"Sorry about that. We've replaced it with a new one; this one works. However, we can't re-record the previous answers, so...\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded, took the device from his hand, turned around, and walked back up to the tiered seating.","Sitting down with the working button device, Ye Qiusuo leaned back loosely in her seat, listening carefully to the questions. These questions seemed varied, covering astronomy, geography, humanities, history, etc., but they were actually just superficial questions from various fields, meant to impress non-professionals.","And moreover... the book mentioned in passing that Wan Yurou had access to the question bank and had seen it beforehand; she was simply memorizing the questions.","Ye Qiusuo listened to the questions being presented on stage and pressed the selection button along with everyone else present. Although she had no score for the first half, after the obstacle of the broken device was removed in the second half, she got a perfect score.","Yet this score was completely inconspicuous among the fifty ordinary participants.","\"How many points does Yurou have now?\" One of the celebrity guests on stage turned to ask the young woman beside him.","\"Four hundred and seventy points,\" Wan Yurou replied with a light smile, seeming somewhat embarrassed. \"I got two wrong.\"","\"Only two wrong? I think I got about twenty wrong,\" another guest, the crosstalk performer, calculated his own score and said.","\"Twenty? Hahaha, Lao Jiang, your knowledge is a bit lacking,\" one guest joked.","The crosstalk performer nodded earnestly: \"Indeed, I need to learn more from Yurou.\"","The entire competition had fifty questions in total, with ten points for each correct answer. Only the final question remained.","The final question appeared on the large screen. It was a technology question, with four options as usual, asking about the common method for battery-free electronic skin systems. Ye Qiusuo glanced over it and pressed her button. After everyone had made their selections, the guests on stage were still debating, each with their own guesses and opinions.","\"Personally, I think it's option B, Near-Field Communication. If I remember correctly, the smart medical watch from Tianqiu Technology uses this method.\" Wan Yurou, wearing a white long dress, sat in the guest seat, speaking at a gentle pace, appearing extremely elegant and refined among the group of middle-aged guests arguing heatedly with red faces.","\"Yurou, you even know about this?\" The crosstalk performer next to her was very surprised.","Wan Yurou brushed aside the stray hair by her ear and smiled lightly: \"I just learned a little about it before.\"","\"Speaking of which, Tianqiu Technology is really impressive. Several projects they've developed in recent years have had a big impact on our lives.\"","\"Why would Yurou go and learn about Tianqiu Technology's projects?\"","The five guests on stage began to chat casually, but clearly everyone was very interested in the information Wan Yurou had just revealed.","Facing a barrage of cameras, Wan Yurou showed no timidity. With a light smile, she said, \"During university, I once visited Tianqiu Tech with a professor. The guide there mentioned it once.\"","Everyone present couldn't help but let out a collective sigh of admiration.","As everyone knew, Tianqiu Tech had consecutively developed several electronic tech products in recent years that significantly impacted daily life, yet the company was famously mysterious and low-key.","It was said their employee salaries were exceptionally high, making their staff highly sought-after in the dating market in recent years.","Ordinary people rarely got the chance to visit such a company. Looking at Wan Yurou again, everyone's gaze instantly changed—truly worthy of a top graduate from Caltech, having even been to Tianqiu Tech.","\"Host, hurry up and reveal the answer, let's see who got it right,\" the crosstalk actor Jiang Fei called out to the host.","\"Alright, let's reveal the final question and see who scores,\" the host raised a hand, and the correct answer immediately appeared on the large screen.","As expected, the correct answer was B. Wan Yurou's score reached a staggering 480, the highest in the room.","\"Now, let's see which of our civilian guests chose the correct answer. There are... thirty-five people!\" The host stood facing the fifty guests. \"Good, then we'll randomly select one civilian guest to explain why they chose this answer.\"","When Ye Qiusuo heard this, she was looking down at her own score: a total of five hundred points. She had scored two hundred and fifty, having chosen all A's in the first half and gotten zero points.","A spotlight roamed among the fifty civilian guests' seats, finally settling on Ye Qiusuo's position.","The light dazzled Ye Qiusuo's eyes. She slowly raised a hand to shield her brow: \"...\" Was this forcing her to confront the female lead?","\"Guest number 43, could you tell us why you chose B?\" the host asked with a smile.","The white circular spotlight shone on Ye Qiusuo. She could even guess that several cameras were now trained on her.","\"Near-field communication is abbreviated as NFC.\"","As soon as Ye Qiusuo uttered this first sentence, everyone in the room immediately nodded as if suddenly enlightened. NFC was far more familiar than the term 'near-field communication'; it had been heavily promoted for mobile phones in recent years, though the general public wasn't entirely clear on the specifics, only knowing it was commonly used for access control or transit cards.","Ye Qiusuo's second sentence was to correct what Wan Yurou had said earlier: \"Tianqiu's smart medical watch does not use near-field communication methods. The algorithms involved are complex and cannot be summarized by a single method.\"","On stage, Wan Yurou probably hadn't expected a civilian guest to correct her. After a momentary daze, she regained her composure, offering a somewhat apologetic tone: \"It should be one of the methods. That's all I remember.\"","The implication was that she still believed she was correct.","\"It has never used near-field communication,\" Ye Qiusuo denied once again, quite displeased with this female lead's habit of speaking offhandedly.","—Knowledge requires rigor.","The atmosphere grew slightly awkward because Ye Qiusuo said this without a trace of a smile, coupled with her cool gaze, which to the uninformed eye seemed somewhat aggressive.","Crosstalk actor Jiang Fei, wanting to ease Wan Yurou's embarrassment, said to Ye Qiusuo, \"Since guest number 43 says the algorithms are complex, perhaps that near-field... NFC is one of them.\"","Ye Qiusuo's seat was relatively high. When she glanced down at the guests below, there was an intangible sense of aloof superiority in her demeanor; under the camera's lens, her expression appeared icy.","\"I already said,\" Ye Qiusuo was not appeased. Having had several sleepless nights, being dragged into the show, and then discovering she was inexplicably serving as a stepping stone for the female lead in a book, her mood was far from good. Yet, she still explained calmly, \"Battery-free electronic skin systems commonly use near-field communication, but Tianqiu Tech's medical watch has never employed near-field communication.\"","Before Wan Yurou and the host could respond, another young male guest retorted, \"How can you be so sure?\"","Under the lights and cameras, Ye Qiusuo enunciated each word clearly: \"Because the R&D for that project at Tianqiu Tech is under my purview.\"","Everyone present: \"...\"","Had they just kicked an iron plate?","The host quickly stepped in to salvage the situation: \"Haha, so guest number 43 is the project lead at Tianqiu Tech? Alright, now let's see who the top thirty finalists are.\" The topic shifted extremely swiftly, without even expanding on the identity of 'Tianqiu Tech project lead.'","The spotlight and camera on Ye Qiusuo were swiftly moved away. She didn't mind, sitting quietly in her seat, recalling the book she had seen in her dream.","After the scoring, Ye Qiusuo happened to rank twenty-ninth, qualifying her for the recording of the second episode.","...","\"Where's the file for contestant number 43? Find it,\" the director asked his assistant backstage after the recording.","All civilian guests had to fill out a information form before entering, basically containing name, contact details, and occupation.","\"I'll go look... Here it is.\"","The director sat in a chair, holding the information form for guest number 43—Ye Qiusuo. His gaze fell on the occupation column, which clearly stated: Teacher.","The term 'teacher' encompassed too broad a range.","\"Look up who the project lead is for that Tianqiu Tech medical watch,\" the director said, looking up.","The assistant searched on the computer for a while and said, \"Director, it only shows a surname. This seems to be a confidential project.\"","\"What's the surname?\"","\"Ye.\"","The director nodded: \"So the lead is guest number 43.\"","Another staff member nearby chimed in: \"A project lead at Tianqiu Tech wouldn't be that young, would they? And have time to record our show? I heard everyone at that company brings a folding bed to work, pulling all-nighters regularly.\"","The director thought for a moment and asked the assistant, \"What else did you find?\"","\"Not much. It only says the project's collaborating university is Huajing University.\"","\"Huajing University?\" The staff member perked up. \"Director, then guest number 43 definitely isn't the project lead. I have a relative whose child studies there. There is indeed a very accomplished Professor Ye in that field, but she's not that young.\"","Before the director could speak, the assistant beside him quickly looked up this Professor Ye at Huajing University.","—Ye Qiusu, a leading figure in the tech field, renowned as the solitary beauty professor.","But however much of a beauty, she was already forty this year.","The director looked at the photo on the online encyclopedia; it was completely different from guest number 43's appearance.","\"Even using a similar-sounding name. Could guest number 43 be someone planted by some small company trying to pull a stunt?\" a staff member voiced a guess.","The director's face immediately turned cold. Such impersonations were common in the industry—all sorts of fake heirs were everywhere—but he hadn't expected someone to dare impersonate an academic heir now.","\"Get me the post-production editing team on the line,\" the director said, standing up with a dark expression.","..."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo returned to her residence after recording the program and slept for a full day and night. When she woke up, it was five in the morning. She didn't go back to sleep. Instead, she got up, washed up, drank a glass of cold water, and sat down at her desk to turn on her computer.","Various messages kept popping up, along with research topics sent by the several graduate students she was supervising. Ye Qiusuo spent an hour and a half dealing with these matters, then sent a text message to one of the students.","Ye: [Bring your project and come find me this afternoon. There are a few points I want to discuss with you.]","After sending this message, Ye Qiusuo began writing her own paper.","She had completed her Ph.D. at the university last year and stayed on as a faculty member after graduation. Not only did she have to write papers and mentor students, but she also had several projects in hand. Taking a full day and night off like this was an immense luxury for Ye Qiusuo.","Outside, the sun gradually rose. A beam of light shone through the unevenly drawn living room curtains, moving from the floor all the way onto the grid of the wine cabinet.","It wasn't until one in the afternoon that Ye Qiusuo closed the document, marking the end of her morning's work. She rummaged through the fridge and found the bread she had bought the day before yesterday. Checking that it wasn't expired yet, she used it as her lunch.","Unlike her usual habit of eating while continuing to work, Ye Qiusuo sat on the sofa, bread in hand, unusually distracted.","She was still thinking about the dream she had at the recording site that day.","Casually turning on the TV, Ye Qiusuo didn't tune into the news channel she watched daily. Instead, she wanted to switch to an entertainment channel.","However, having not watched other channels for years, she wasn't very familiar with them. After flipping past a few channels playing advertisements, she finally stopped on Gaoxing Channel Two.","She had recorded a program at Gaoxing TV last time.","Moreover, this Gaoxing TV station appeared numerous times in the book from her dream.","Ten minutes later.","Frowning, Ye Qiusuo stared at the brightly colored cartoon characters on the TV screen for a long time, watching them bounce around joyfully, and began to suspect that she had simply been too exhausted that day and had a false dream.","Before she could ponder further, the doorbell suddenly rang. Ye Qiusuo got up to answer it; it was the student she had asked to come over.","\"Hello, Professor.\" The student standing outside was actually the same age as Ye Qiusuo, but he addressed her as 'Professor' sincerely, even with a hint of admiring respect.","\"Come in first.\" Ye Qiusuo stepped aside to let him in, closed the door after he entered, took the stack of documents from his hand, flipped through them, and got straight to the point without any preamble. \"There's a problem with the data on line six of page 12. Go to the lab and complete the final test yourself, then revise it.\"","The student seemed already accustomed to her direct, no-nonsense style. He turned and replied, \"Professor, that line of data is cited from a Tier 1 journal paper. It shouldn't have any issues.\"","Ye Qiusuo shot a glance at the student. \"Shouldn't?\"","The student was taken aback. The first author of the paper he cited was a well-known scholar in the field, whose published papers always had extremely high impact factors. This paper had just been published recently; its data and other aspects were relatively new and very suitable for his project.","\"The data is problematic. There's no need to extend from it further. Find another set.\" Ye Qiusuo stated bluntly.","The student hesitated for a moment. \"But...\" He found it hard to believe. After all, the paper was already published in a Tier 1 journal, and its citation rate had skyrocketed in less than a week. How could there be a problem?","Just then, the student's phone rang. It was someone from the same research group. He sneakily glanced at his professor, noticed she wasn't paying attention to him but was instead staring at the TV, so he answered the call and asked quietly, \"What's up?\"","\"There's a problem! The author of the paper we cited on page 12 has voluntarily retracted the article!\" The voice on the other end was anxious. \"You haven't shown it to the professor yet, have you?\"","The student: \"...When?!\"","\"Just five minutes ago. They said there were some issues with the data, and the author requested a retraction.\" The person on the other end had just discovered this when logging onto the journal website to look for materials.","\"......\"","\"Finished talking?\" Ye Qiusuo shifted her gaze back, calmly watching the student hang up the phone. \"The paper you cited will probably be retracted in a few days. Remember to find other data.\"","The student lowered his head in shame. \"It's already been retracted.\" Professor Ye is still Professor Ye, after all.","The speed surprised Ye Qiusuo. It seemed the author must have discovered their mistake early. There were many capable people in academia; with that set of data published, someone would have eventually found the error—it was only a matter of time.","Ye Qiusuo walked to her computer desk, picked up a USB drive, and handed it to the student. \"There are some materials inside that you can use for reference.\"","\"Thank you, Professor!\" Relieved that he wasn't scolded, the student let out a sigh. Out of the corner of his eye, he caught sight of the cartoons on the TV screen. His mouth running ahead of his brain, he remarked casually, \"Professor, you watch Gaoxing Channel Two too? My niece loves it.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at the student impassively.","The student: \"......\"","In an attempt to salvage the awkward situation, the student desperately tried to recover. \"Both Gaoxing Channel One and Two are great, hahaha.\"","\"What's on Channel One?\" Ye Qiusuo suddenly asked.","Since Professor Ye was initiating conversation, the student immediately became an open book. \"It's the entertainment channel. My younger sister loves watching it; many of the celebrities she likes have been on Channel One.\"","Ye Qiusuo seemed thoughtful. She picked up the remote, searched for a while, and finally found a channel called Gaoxing Channel One. It was indeed an entertainment channel; even the advertisements featured various young celebrities.","If she remembered correctly, the program she recorded last time should air on this channel this Saturday. According to the book, Wan Yurou would use this program to directly trend on social media, subsequently solidifying her 'beauty scholar' persona firmly.","Gaoxing Channel One was playing something, but Ye Qiusuo didn't see it clearly. She was too busy recalling the plot from the book.","Now that the plot had changed, she wondered if the trending topics would still involve her.","\"Professor, if there's nothing else, I'll head back first...\" the student said softly.","Ye Qiusuo snapped back to attention and waved her hand. \"Remember to change the data set. Return the USB drive to me next week.\"","The student scurried out. Just as he left, his phone rang again. It was someone from his group asking about the situation.","\"The professor had already discovered the data was problematic earlier. I didn't believe it at first,\" the student said after explaining for a bit, sighing in admiration. \"Professor Ye is too impressive.\"","They were the first group of students Ye Qiusuo was mentoring—five in total. Initially, upon learning they had been assigned to a young professor, none of them were pleased.","After all, in these science and engineering fields, a supervisor with shallow experience meant they likely wouldn't get good projects and would have little influence.","Of the five, two had been selected by Ye Qiusuo herself. There was also a high-scoring student who had made a mistake. He originally intended to choose Professor Ye Qiusu, but didn't expect there to be two Professor Ye's at the university this year, and their names sounded somewhat similar.","This mistaken student had long heard of Professor Ye's reputation but had never met her. In a momentary lapse of judgment, he directly chose Ye Qiusuo, feeling that this name sounded more formidable.","This person was naturally the student called over by Ye Qiusuo today, Lin Lu.","The remaining two students were essentially the ones leftover after other professors had made their picks, then tossed to Ye Qiusuo.","In short, not a single one had come voluntarily.","However, after starting school, these students realized something was off—their teacher was actually quite impressive. This was evident in her effortless command of various materials and data, her exceptional strength, and the high regard the school had for her.","\"But the teacher seems to like watching cartoons,\" the students whispered in gossip. \"When I first arrived, her living room was playing 'Three Little Sheep'.\"","Who would have thought that a distinguished professor would be watching \"Three Little Sheep\" at home? To cover it up, she had even quickly changed the channel. Remembering this, the students felt Professor Ye wasn't so intimidating after all.","Professor Ye, who enjoys cartoons, was now staring intently at the TV.","On screen was a recently launched singing competition show, arguably the highest-rated program this year, with Xie Xi serving as a mentor.","—Xie Xi is the only male supporting character in the entire story who does not fall for the female lead.","Ye Qiusuo watched Xie Xi on TV. If she remembered correctly, this was where his star began to plummet, eventually becoming a stepping stone for the male lead in the book.","Standing in front of the sofa, Ye Qiusuo quietly observed the young, handsome man on the screen, deep in thought.","...","On Saturday, \"Knowledge Q&A\" officially premiered on Gaoxing Channel One.","Wan Yurou performed remarkably well on the show. Especially as a celebrity, her score was actually higher than top performers from various other industries, naturally attracting everyone's attention.","The show's first trending topic was about Wan Yurou. After all, celebrities often carry certain stereotypes in the audience's mind. Her performance, significantly above the typical celebrity standard, won the favor of many viewers.","#WanYurouHighScore#","The comments under this trending topic were all praising Wan Yurou. Many netizens said they were seeing her in a new light, never expecting her to be so knowledgeable.","But as the program continued, another trending topic soon emerged: #Celestial Sphere Tech Guest#","This topic kept rising, even beginning to surpass Wan Yurou's.","If nothing else, the mere words 'Celestial Sphere Tech' were enough to capture the public's attention.","The company was usually very low-profile, but its capabilities were anything but. Their products in recent years had permeated every aspect of daily life. Their latest smart medical watch hadn't even been released yet but had already attracted significant attention.","It was said to be at the forefront globally.","The trending topic featured a short clipped video. After the host finished speaking, the spotlight fell on one of the fifty guests. Bullet comments immediately flooded the video:","[Huh, Contestant 43 looks kind of good.]","[Is Contestant 43 a celebrity too?]","[What does this have to do with the Celestial Sphere Tech guest?]","Several people on the show mentioned that Near-Field Communication was one of the methods used in that Celestial Sphere Tech project. Only Contestant 43 disagreed. Her somewhat cold remarks made the guests on stage appear awkward for a moment.","[Contestant 43 is a bit clueless, isn't she? Everyone said it might be one of the methods, and she just has to argue.]","[Probably trying to show off her knowledge?]","[Everyone was clearly trying to smooth things over, but she just had to keep talking, completely oblivious.]","In the next moment, actor Xia Zhoubing stepped in to ask Contestant 43 why she was so sure, voicing everyone's thoughts. When Contestant 43 on stage stated expressionlessly that the project was under her charge, the camera deliberately panned across the audience, capturing their unmistakable looks of astonishment.","Even the bullet comments paused for a second, followed by a frenzy of comments.","[Damn, she's in charge of that project?!]","[Her name? Why doesn't Contestant 43 have a name tag? Everyone else does.]","But the program's editing at this point cast doubt on whether Contestant 43 was truly the project lead at Celestial Sphere Tech, immediately steering the audience in another direction.","[Contestant 43 looks like she's barely in her early 20s. She could be in charge of a project at Celestial Sphere Tech? I don't buy it.]","[Building a persona shouldn't be done like this. Isn't she afraid of overreaching?]","[This amateur has some big ambitions. Not afraid of being exposed while pretending to be something she's not.]","Guided by the show's editing, camera angles, and captions, the audience's reaction shifted from initial surprise to disbelief, and they began criticizing Contestant 43 for using any means necessary to get famous.","Netizens started digging into the Celestial Sphere Tech project, but like the director's assistant before, they couldn't find much useful information. The project was currently in a confidential phase; the person in charge was only listed by surname, followed by the title 'Professor'.","Netizens went to the official website looking for a Professor Ye, only finding a Ye Qiusu.","As they dug deeper, the netizens reached the same conclusion as the staff.","—This Contestant 43 was impersonating Professor Ye Qiusu from Huajing University.","In comparison, Wan Yurou was clearly more likable to the audience.","Wan Yurou's management team also hadn't expected a contrast with such an unscrupulous amateur guest impersonating a professor, which further elevated Wan Yurou's image. Her trending topic began to climb, eventually reaching number one.","\"Saved us the cost of buying a hot search,\" the agent said to Wan Yurou in the dressing room.","...","Professor Ye was still busy with her thesis. She didn't even know the show had aired on Saturday. She had to guide her students with experiments, and on top of that, Celestial Sphere Tech had built a new wind tunnel lab that she needed to inspect for any issues.","She was so busy every day that her feet barely touched the ground, with no time to even think about being a minor character in a book.","\"Yezi, we're recording the second episode on Sunday. Can you make it?\" a friend from the program team called to ask.","Second episode?","Ye Qiusuo finally remembered. She took the phone from her shoulder with her left hand, straightened up, and held it to her left ear. She gestured for the lab staff around her to continue, then walked out.","\"Has the show aired already?\" Ye Qiusuo stood by the glass railing, looking down at the company employees coming and going below.","\"...It has.\"","Hearing her friend's tone, Ye Qiusuo asked directly, \"Are Wan Yurou and I on the trending topics?\" According to the plot, both she and Wan Yurou should be. She had made some changes, but it seemed they hadn't made a difference.","\"Yeah. The netizens are saying your claim of being the project lead is fake.\"","Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment and asked, \"Are they also calling Wan Yurou an academic genius?\"","Since the netizens were still singling her out, the female lead should have successfully established that persona.","Her friend on the other end wasn't surprised, assuming Ye Qiusuo had seen the trending topics on Weibo, and comforted her, \"Don't pay attention to those comments. Those netizens don't know anything.\"","Truthfully, her friend wasn't entirely sure what Ye Qiusuo did either. They were high school classmates. Ye Qiusuo had skipped a grade, they were only in the same class for half a year before Ye Qiusuo skipped ahead again, but they had been close back then.","Running into Ye Qiusuo on the street that day was a coincidence; she had been desperate and asked for a favor.","Ye Qiusuo continued, \"What time tomorrow?\" In the book, she was eliminated in the first episode. Participating in the second was the result of her changes.","\"9 PM. It'll probably record for about three hours. Are you coming?\"","\"I'll be there.\""]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3","paragraphs":["On Sunday evening, there was a program recording, so Ye Qiusuo drove herself over.","Gaoxing TV Station has an underground parking lot, but only the station's own vehicles or those of invited guests are allowed in. Ordinary people like her couldn't drive in, so she had to park on the street near the station. Fortunately, there were empty spots.","It was late October, and the nights tended to be chilly. When Ye Qiusuo got out of the car, she casually picked up a coat from the passenger seat and draped it over her wrist.","As she approached the entrance of the TV station, Professor Ye noticed crowds of girls lining both sides, holding various support banners. A van was parked horizontally right in front of the main door.","Ye Qiusuo's gaze swept over the banners, which read things like 'Take care of yourself, Xixi,' 'Go Xixi!'...","Unfamiliar.","Professor Ye continued walking forward just as people began to disembark from the van. A man and a woman were shielding a tall, slender man as they moved ahead.","Big fans on both sides were trying to maintain order, but in that moment, screams still pierced the night sky.","Ye Qiusuo could only see the man's tall, straight back, not his face. She gave a brief, indifferent glance and didn't look again, failing to notice that the group had stopped, with the man being shielded to the side to sign autographs for fans.","Professor Ye remained completely unaffected. With the blue access pass hanging around her neck, she strode forward purposefully, utterly indifferent to the screams from both sides.","The fans nearby, seeing her walk forward nonchalantly, couldn't help but whisper to each other.","\"Who is that?\"","Her walking aura alone seemed extraordinary, and she was good-looking too.","\"Maybe a minor celebrity?\"","\"Doesn't seem like it. Would a minor celebrity have such a presence? Maybe she's some powerful agent?\"","Professor Ye was unaware of their discussions about her and walked straight into the Gaoxing TV recording studio. The recording would last three hours, meaning she probably wouldn't get back until after 1 a.m.","As the recording began, all the civilian contestants once again took their previous seats, except the lights over the twenty eliminated contestants' seats were now off.","In the center of the stage sat the same five resident guests.","\"Which of the following four options is the standard for domestic transport networks?\" the host asked. \"A. PHD, B. SDH, C. DWDM, D. OTN.\"","Ye Qiusuo's finger hovered over the D answer button. After hesitating for a moment, she moved to another button. Just as she was about to press it, the host on stage spoke up.","\"Don't rush to choose yet. Starting from the second episode, as the questions become more specialized and difficult, we'll discuss first and then select our answers.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned. This format wasn't supposed to appear until the third episode. It was through this 'discuss first, choose later' mode that the female lead would later attract more fans, and a group of civilian contestants would start following her answers.","Regardless of Professor Ye's thoughts, the premature change in rules was an indisputable fact.","Naturally, the five resident guests spoke first, from left to right. The first to speak was Dong Junjian, the eldest among them, who had spent his first thirty years as a host before moving behind the scenes.","\"I'm not really clear on this sort of thing, just picked an answer randomly.\"","\"I don't understand it either. Young people probably know more about this?\" Jiang Fei turned to ask the two younger people beside him.","Xia Zhoubing immediately waved his hands. \"Brother Jiang, I'm not sure either. This sounds too technical.\"","\"What about Yurou? I think you know,\" Jiang Fei said affirmatively.","Wan Yurou, with her long hair cascading over her shoulders and wearing a soft yellow short skirt that day—gentle yet lively—smiled lightly and said in a soft voice, \"It should be D, OTN.\"","\"See? Xia, you should learn more from Yurou,\" Jiang Fei tapped the table. \"Both young people, yet such a big difference.\"","Wan Yurou explained from the side, \"The standard we used before was DWDM, but with the advent of the 5G era, we now use OTN. OTN technology primarily uses point-to-point, chain, star, and ring networking methods.\"","The guests on stage were confused and clearly not understanding, but this string of technical terms made them instantly feel that Wan Yurou was impressive.","Sitting in her seat, Professor Ye heard the latter part of her explanation and couldn't help but frown: Did she remember it wrong?","After the resident guests finished, the host then randomly selected civilian contestants to explain their reasoning. The first contestant thought it was A, giving the reason that it looked familiar.","Ye Qiusuo looked down at the answer button in her hand. Several people were called upon, some of whom knew a bit about OTN, but no one corrected Wan Yurou's mistake.","As a professor with a rigorous nature, she couldn't quite tolerate such a low-level mistake.","At that moment, the host cued her: \"What does contestant number 43 choose?\"","The director had specifically instructed today to give contestant number 43 more screen time, enough shots, firstly to let her expose herself, and secondly to generate program popularity. This kind of person that the audience hates easily attracted traffic.","Once again under the spotlight and camera, Professor Ye: \"...\"","The production team really had it out for her.","Thinking calmly, Ye Qiusuo spoke succinctly: \"D.\"","Sure enough, the host's next question asked for her reason.","Professor Ye embarked on the path of correction: \"A is the first-generation technology, B the second, C the third, and D is the current latest, fourth-generation technology.\"","\"Additionally, OTN typically uses ring, mesh, and other networking methods. What Wan Yurou mentioned earlier were the DWDM networking methods.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Even without knowing the truth, contestant number 43 seemed more convincing than Wan Yurou on stage.","Having learned from the previous episode, Wan Yurou reacted very quickly this time. She immediately corrected herself with a faint smile: \"Perhaps I didn't remember clearly. Thank you, contestant number 43, for the correction.\"","These were all the analyses she had memorized verbatim. If asked to explain in detail, Wan Yurou couldn't either, and she wasn't sure if she had remembered incorrectly.","Moreover, her assistant below, holding a phone, kept making gestures at her. Seeing the gestures, Wan Yurou understood she had made an error.","“Yurou, knowing this much is already quite impressive. After all, you’re not a professional,” Jiang Fei comforted her on stage.","Professor Ye frowned. If one isn't professional, one shouldn't speak out, especially since this program was aimed at the public.","However, she didn't say anything more. The guests on stage weren't her students; there was no need for excessive criticism.","However, clearly, the production team had no intention of letting Ye Qiusuo off the hook. Throughout the rest of the recording, they frequently cued her.","Professor Ye: \"...\"","Since she had to answer, Professor Ye answered flawlessly, explaining meticulously in more detail than even what the staff could find on Baidu, even pointing out errors on the Baike page.","By the end, everyone on stage, in the audience, and behind the scenes: \"...\"","Putting aside the malicious behavior of this person impersonating Professor Ye and taking over the project leader for Tianqiu Tech, her strength was truly impressive.","As she was leaving, Ye Qiusuo was called over by a friend.","\"Ye Qiusuo.\" Her friend, who had been watching from backstage, also noticed the production team's maneuvering and said somewhat apologetically, \"You attracted a lot of attention in the last episode. The director probably wants to keep more footage of you, that's why they... If you feel it's affecting your life, you can get eliminated early. Just answer randomly or get things wrong, it's fine.\"","\"I know,\" Ye Qiusuo said calmly. It was just that they kept calling on her, and Professor Ye's professional habits kicked in; she couldn't help but explain and correct the mistakes.","\"Sorry for dragging you into this.\" Her friend had just started the job, only a small intern. Recruiting Ye Qiusuo back then was out of sheer necessity, and she didn't want to cause her any trouble.","\"I chose to stay myself.\" Ye Qiusuo waved her hand. Now, she just wanted to see how much the plot would change if she kept participating.","Her friend wanted to say more but was called away to pack up props, so she had to leave.","...","\"Director, the name of contestant number 43... should we add it to the subtitles?\" asked the post-production staff member.","In the first episode, contestant number 43 had neither a name tag nor her name added in post-production subtitles. Viewers were already asking about it.","\"Did you find anything else on Huajing University's official website?\" The director turned to ask his assistant.","\"There are several professors surnamed Ye, but only Professor Ye Qiusu is relevant in terms of specialization. I called the department's number, but no one answered.\" The assistant had been checking the staff list on Huajing University's official website for several days and hadn't found any professor named Ye Qiusuo.","Generally, a prerequisite for leading a project at such a tech company is a doctoral degree.","The director thought for a moment: \"Put her name up. Remember to make a name tag for her for the next episode.\"","The 'project lead' title might be fake, but her performance this episode was undeniable—it wasn't just a little impressive. The entire second episode was captivated by Ye Qiusuo. Broadcasting it would definitely generate a lot of buzz. As for later when netizens might dig up the fake credentials, the production team could simply kick her out then.","\"Director, could someone have leaked the question bank in advance? And she studied all the questions beforehand?\" The staff member who had earlier pointed out there was a Professor Ye Qiusu at Huajing University stepped forward and whispered his guess.","\"This...\" The director frowned. The whole thing did seem odd from top to bottom. He looked at his assistant beside him. \"You guys go investigate. Also, find out who recruited contestant number 43 and bring them here to ask.\"","While the second episode was still being edited, the show \"Knowledge Q&A\" had already begun its massive promotional campaign across major platforms. As a locally produced program by a high-rated TV station, it received significant attention.","Even Lin Lu, who spent every day in the lab, had heard about it—of course, it was strongly recommended by his enthusiastic younger sister.","\"The data should be fine this time. Remember to give it to Professor Ye later,\" a team member said, handing the compiled data to Lin Lu before leaving.","After finishing his organization, Lin Lu wanted to relax a bit and clicked on the show his sister had so strongly recommended.","Watching the first half, Lin Lu almost fell asleep. This show wasn't suitable for people like them. A lot of the knowledge sounded professional but was really just to impress laymen. Anyone with slightly broader knowledge would find it uninteresting.","He completely didn't understand what the barrage comments were praising the guests for.","By the second half, Lin Lu was ready to exit, but then the host suddenly called on a contestant. The camera cut to her, and Lin Lu instantly woke up.","Wasn't that his professor?!","Lin Lu immediately sat up straight, watching as the professor meticulously corrected the mistakes made by the guests on stage.","How did the professor have time to participate in such a show? It didn't seem like Professor Ye's style.","While he was still pondering, Lin Lu suddenly saw a wave of barrage comments mocking Professor Ye. Later, when the teacher said she was the project lead for Tianqiu Tech, the barrage filled the entire screen, all saying she was impersonating the lead. The few comments praising contestant number 43 were quickly drowned out.","Lin Lu's hand slipped, and he exited to search for the show on Weibo, only to find everyone saying contestant number 43 would do anything for fame.","What a mess of comments!","'Do anything for fame'? His teacher was so young and accomplished, did she need such tactics?","Although Lin Lu wasn't entirely clear on whose hands the project was actually in, it was true that Tianqiu Tech had always collaborated with Huajing University. There were only a few professors in their department; Professor Ye wouldn't lie. It was likely the professor had set up the project with other students.","Lin Lu quickly found the gossip influencer posting these Weibo messages and privately messaged them, saying Professor Ye was amazing and couldn't possibly be lying, that they must have misunderstood.","He typed out a long argument describing why Professor Ye absolutely could not be impersonating a project lead, wanting to show how incredibly brilliant their young professor was!","\"Data revised?\" Ye Qiusuo asked casually as soon as she entered, seeing her student leaning against the wall playing with his phone.","Hearing the very person he was describing appear before him, Lin Lu panicked, his hand jerked, and his phone clattered to the floor.","\"What's the rush?\" Ye Qiusuo bent down, picked up his phone for him, and handed it directly over without looking at the screen. She asked him, \"Is the thesis revision done? Let me see. I have the whole afternoon today.\"","Lin Lu took the phone and immediately stuffed it into his pocket, not daring to take it out again. He hurried over to the computer, opened the file, and let Ye Qiusuo check it.","He didn't know the gossip influencer had already received and seen his half-finished private message.","Lin Lu had only managed to righteously declare how amazing Professor Ye was; he hadn't written out any actual accomplishments yet. The entire message didn't even contain a complete name.","Seeing this kind of private message content, the gossip influencer sneered, then immediately posted it: 【So contestant #43 is starting to hire influencers for brainwashing now? Too bad I don't take money; I do this purely as a hobby. Maybe check your own looks and age before impersonating a project lead.】","This influencer account was maintained by a certain company and acted quite arrogantly towards news unrelated to the company's artists.","The comments below immediately praised the influencer for being bold, and for a while, the account attracted even more traffic.","That day was a Friday, one day before the broadcast of the second episode."]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4","paragraphs":["The gossip influencer posted the content of this private message, along with a statement of his righteous refusal to cooperate. Immediately, netizens caught the scent of drama and swarmed over.","[Is Contestant No. 43 shameless? Don't you need at least some basis in fact before lying to create a persona?]","[The blogger is so bold. The industry needs more principled gossip influencers like you.]","[What's Contestant No. 43's name? She didn't get a name tag, and the post-production didn't add subtitles for her. We still don't know her name. What's the show playing at?]","[Girls in their early twenties these days are so brazen they can directly impersonate a tech project lead. Impressive, impressive!]","...","The comments were almost unanimously critical. Someone, it seemed, had bought a trending spot. By evening, this Weibo post was firmly entrenched at the top of the hot search list. It not only caused the influencer's follower count to skyrocket but also brought a significant surge of traffic and attention to \"Knowledge Q&A.\"","Contestant No. 43 was dragged into the spotlight once again. Some netizens even compiled a list of celebrity persona collapses over the years, crowning No. 43 as \"the fastest persona collapse in entertainment history.\"","\"You can start the experimental testing for this group. Report to me for anything you need.\" Ye Qiusuo, completely unaware of the online storm, finished checking her students' work in the lab and corrected a few issues before speaking.","\"Professor, isn't starting now a bit too soon?\" Lin Lu felt somewhat dazed.","In their STEM field, launching a project required substantial funding, usually applied for from the university or secured through collaboration with external companies. Budgets were always tight, with every penny needing to be spent wisely.","Was their advisor really just letting them start like this?","\"Do you need a few more days off?\" Ye Qiusuo looked at her student's face with surprise, not detecting any particular signs of exhaustion. He had been enrolled for less than two months, and the course load wasn't heavy. Was he already feeling overwhelmed?","Lin Lu was taken aback and quickly shook his head. \"No need for a break. I can start today.\"","\"It's already late today. Head back now and start tomorrow.\" Ye Qiusuo glanced out the window; it was completely dark. It was time for students to finish up and return to their dorms.","In a daze, Lin Lu followed his professor out of the lab before they parted ways. Halfway back to his dorm, he suddenly let out an excited whoop and quickly contacted the other two members of his group to announce they could start the project!","...","The second episode aired as scheduled on Saturday night. While some viewers tuned in for Wan Yurou and Xia Zhoubing, even more were there to watch the spectacle surrounding Contestant No. 43. They wanted to see what other outrageous moves the contestant who impersonated the project lead of Tianqiu Tech would pull this time.","However, after watching the second episode, they didn't witness any outrageous moves. Instead, everyone remembered the name 'Ye Qiusuo' crystal clear.","Out of fifty questions, Ye Qiusuo didn't get a single one wrong from start to finish. She even corrected mistakes made by other guests and pointed out errors in the host's provided explanations.","[Holy crap, she's like a walking encyclopedia! That's terrifying!]","[I'm starting to believe she might actually be the Tianqiu Tech project lead. After all, geniuses do exist.]","[What genius looks that good? This is probably just the show's script. Ye Qiusuo must be someone the show is trying to promote. It's all staged.]","[To the comment above, look up the 'Mother of Wi-Fi.' Attractive, talented, and young women do exist. I think Ye Qiusuo is telling the truth.]","After the second episode ended, some people switched sides and began to believe Ye Qiusuo hadn't lied, given the formidable knowledge she displayed on the show.","Of course, a large majority still didn't believe it. They specifically searched for the name 'Ye Qiusuo' on Huajing University's official website and found no professor by that name. There was only a female professor named 'Ye Qiusu.' The photo on the official website showed a young-looking woman, but her appearance was completely different from Ye Qiusuo's. Moreover, calculating her age, she would be forty this year.","Soon, #YeQiusuo quickly climbed the hot search rankings. Viewers who had watched the show focused their attention entirely on Contestant No. 43, eagerly discussing her true identity. Wan Yurou, in contrast, received little discussion.","\"Have you memorized the answers for the next episode? Don't mix up the explanation content again.\" Wan Yurou's manager reminded her.","The manager had gone to great lengths to obtain this question bank, only for a civilian contestant to steal the spotlight in the second episode.","Wan Yurou's expression was unpleasant. She held a stack of stapled A4 papers. \"Sister Mo, some of the explanations for the questions here aren't accurate.\"","To solidify her persona for this show, she had spent a huge amount of time memorizing these answers and explanations. But in the last episode, Ye Qiusuo had even managed to find errors in the explanations.","The manager sighed. \"I'll find someone to review these question explanations for you and try to correct any potential mistakes.\"","The question bank and answers had been sent over together from the other side. The staff preparing the explanations had simply copied them from Baidu Baike, but anyone can edit that encyclopedia, so it's not entirely accurate.","\"By the way, I've cleared all your appointments for next Thursday,\" the manager remembered. \"I've booked a meeting for you with the real Professor Ye from Huajing University. She'll take you to visit Tianqiu Tech. Remember to take a photo together.\"","Wan Yurou was startled. The real Professor Ye? That Ye Qiusu?","\"That Ye Qiusuo is probably backed by some small company, but they did a more thorough job than us.\"","\"Sister Mo, you mean... she's still an impostor?\" Wan Yurou, sitting on the stage that day and seeing Ye Qiusuo's calm explanations, had almost believed she was the real deal in that moment.","The manager snorted coldly. \"Since we could get the question bank, it's not impossible for others to get it too. And I got word that the show's director contacted Huajing University and found there's only one Professor Ye, named Ye Qiusu. I checked; she happens to have a project collaboration with Tianqiu Tech. This Ye Qiusuo might even have a fake name.\"","Wan Yurou's heart instantly felt much lighter. That day, she had actually thought Ye Qiusuo was a real professor in charge of Tianqiu Tech's medical watch project.","...","Ye Qiusuo was completely unaware of these undercurrents. She was too busy; she didn't even have time to check the hot searches.","\"Xiao Ye, have you taken your photo yet?\" The dean came to her office specifically to find Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo was holding a stack of documents. She had mild nearsightedness and wore glasses when she needed to spend long hours reading materials. She slowly pushed her silver-rimmed glasses up and finally remembered. \"I forgot.\"","The dean shook his head. \"I figured you'd forget, you're so busy. I came today specifically to remind you. Take the photo when you have time in the next few days. The university needs to update the official website information uniformly.\"","As the youngest professor in the school, and arguably the entire university, the dean was very invested in getting Ye Qiusuo's information uploaded to the official website. The website information was always lagging; faculty and staff profiles were updated once a year, and Ye Qiusuo's information from her hiring this year hadn't been entered yet.","\"Understood. I'll get the photo taken today.\"","\"Alright. Remember, it needs to be a blue background.\" The dean finished speaking and shook his head again before leaving.","After the dean left, Ye Qiusuo spent the entire afternoon in her office reviewing documents. Only then did she go to a photo studio off-campus to take her picture. After receiving the digital copy of the photo, she immediately sent it to the dean's email.","Then she left the photo studio, got in her car, and headed home, encountering traffic on the way.","While waiting for the traffic to clear, Ye Qiusuo inadvertently turned her head and glanced at the LED advertising screen on the building next to her: a young man dressed in white stood barefoot on the beach, with an endless expanse of blue sea behind him. His black, tousled hair was slightly messy from the sea breeze. His originally somewhat sharp brows and eyes were softened by the smile at the corner of his lips. His pitch-black eyes seemed to be sprinkled with shattered light, and the lazy seaside sunlight bathed his entire figure, making him extraordinarily handsome.","However, what caught Ye Qiusuo's attention wasn't the young man's looks, but the name displayed at the end of the LED screen—Xie Xi.","Doing a quick mental calculation, she realized he should be about to get slammed by netizens soon.","It was rare for Professor Ye's mind to be occupied with irrelevant people and matters. She then remembered that today was the broadcast date for the second episode of the show she had recorded. She wondered how it would differ from the original novel.","Ye Qiusuo picked up her phone and tapped into the trending searches. She didn't see Wan Yurou's name, but instead found her own name prominently featured at the top.","\"...\"","Professor Ye frowned and clicked in to take a look, discovering they were still debating whether she was the project lead or not.","After reading just a few comments, the road ahead cleared. She put her phone away, not giving the matter much thought.","Since it wasn't connected to the female lead, Ye Qiusuo didn't care what the netizens said. The project itself was under confidentiality, so there was no need to explain the lead investigator issue, lest it invite more trouble.","Sunday night still required recording the show. As soon as Ye Qiusuo entered the building, she saw her friend waiting for her.","\"What's wrong?\"","\"The day before yesterday, our program director called me over and asked about you,\" her friend explained helplessly. \"The director asked about your background. I inquired around; he even specifically checked if there was any possibility the question bank had been leaked.\"","It had indeed been leaked.","Professor Ye lowered her gaze to the floor, thinking, just not by her.","\"I explained to him that you hadn't seen the questions.\" Her friend knew Ye Qiusuo studied at Huajing University but wasn't aware of other details. Still, she assured the director that Ye Qiusuo wasn't lying and couldn't be someone packaged by another company, because she was the one who had pulled Ye Qiusuo in as a last-minute replacement.","\"Do I still need to participate in the show?\" Ye Qiusuo asked.","Her friend was taken aback, then quickly nodded: \"Yes, yes. After I explained, the director didn't have much else to say.\"","Ye Qiusuo smoothly finished recording the third episode. Unlike the other civilian guests who stayed behind to chat, she walked straight into the elevator to head back.","Just as the elevator doors were about to close, a hand suddenly reached in to stop them. The doors reopened, and a man walked in.","Ye Qiusuo was originally standing in the very center of the elevator and got a clear view of the person who entered.","His deliberately styled black, tousled hair fell across his forehead. His somewhat sharp brows and eyes carried a hint of impatience, and his face was so strikingly handsome it could blind someone.","More importantly, he looked exactly like the man Ye Qiusuo had seen on the roadside building's LED advertising screen the night before.","Therefore, Professor Ye spoke up: \"Xie Xi.\"","Xie Xi had walked out halfway through recording the show after realizing the program team was manipulating his choices. It was obvious some contestants had connections. He simply dropped everything and left, even leaving his assistant and life manager behind.","So, upon entering the elevator and hearing someone call his name, his first reaction was to turn his head and ask impatiently, \"What is it?\"","After confirming it was Xie Xi, Professor Ye said calmly, \"Your lipstick is smudged.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","The camera consumes makeup, so both men and women need to wear it on screen. The makeup artist had indeed applied a layer of lip color on him today.","The big star Xie Xi tilted his head and stared expressionlessly at his reflection in the elevator mirror. Sure enough, there was a red smudge at the corner of his mouth, probably from drinking water before he left.","He raised his hand and forcefully wiped away the stain. Before his hand even lowered, the elevator suddenly jolted and stopped moving.","The emergency light in the elevator came on immediately.","Ye Qiusuo slowly looked up at the surveillance camera inside the elevator. It was at this moment that the fact this world was a novel truly felt real.","The novel had mentioned in passing that today, the power at Gaoxing TV Station would be cut by a dismissed employee, and the backup generator would also be damaged, leading to a blackout lasting three hours. During this time, the female lead and Xia Zhoubing were together, sitting in the stairwell chatting by flashlight—an incident that served as a prelude to Xia Zhoubing developing feelings for the female lead.","Almost simultaneously with the blackout, Xie Xi's life manager called to ask where he was.","\"I'm in the elevator,\" Xie Xi said nonchalantly, thinking he'd be out soon.","\"Wait inside for a bit. I'm already finding someone to help,\" the life manager said, surrounded by noisy chatter. Xie Xi could barely make out what she was saying.","\"Hmm.\" Xie Xi hung up and then leaned against the elevator to play a game on his phone, acting as if the other person didn't exist.","Ye Qiusuo's presence in the elevator was indeed low-key. She stood quietly in one corner, diagonally opposite Xie Xi—the farthest distance possible.","Half an hour later, the last bar of battery on Xie Xi's phone drained, and it shut down automatically.","Impatiently, he put his phone in his pocket, pressed the emergency call button inside the elevator—no one answered—and the life manager who said she was on her way still hadn't arrived.","Finally, Xie Xi leaned against one side of the elevator and closed his eyes to rest. His schedule had been packed, and he hadn't had a proper sleep for a whole week.","An hour later, the emergency light in the elevator flickered a few times before plunging the interior into complete darkness.","Noticing this, Xie Xi opened his eyes. He instinctively wanted to call his assistant and life manager, only to remember his phone was dead.","He hadn't thought much of it initially, but the person diagonally opposite hadn't moved at all since the beginning. Even when the emergency light went out, she neither moved nor took out her phone to turn on the flashlight.","\"Hey, are you okay?\" Xie Xi hesitated for a moment before asking.","He'd heard some people had claustrophobia; maybe this person did too.","Hearing no response, Xie Xi asked again. The corner remained silent.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Finally, relying on his memory of the elevator layout, he groped his way over in the dark, extended a slender finger, and slowly poked the person in the corner.","Professor Ye had been thinking about her project funding and hadn't noticed the emergency light going out. What brought her back to the present was someone poking her arm.","\"What is it?\" Ye Qiusuo took out her phone and turned on the flashlight. The beam inadvertently shone directly on his face.","Xie Xi stepped back, raising a hand to shield his eyes, and muttered something under his breath that Ye Qiusuo didn't catch. She pointed the flashlight towards the ceiling of the elevator, illuminating the space considerably.","Another half hour or so passed. Xie Xi had changed his standing position several times and finally couldn't help but ask the person in the corner who was quietly holding the flashlight, unnervingly still: \"Can I borrow your phone to make a call?\"","Ye Qiusuo handed her phone over.","Xie Xi took it and immediately saw her phone screen—even the wallpaper was the default one. This person must be utterly boring.","When he went to dial, he realized he didn't remember his assistant's or life manager's phone numbers. He could only hand the phone back to Ye Qiusuo.","\"Are you a staff member here?\" The impatience that had been lingering on Xie Xi's face finally subsided. He leaned against the elevator and asked the person in the corner.","\"No.\"","\"Are you here to record the show then?\" Xie Xi recalled that this person had looked rather attractive when he first stepped into the elevator.","Ye Qiusuo didn't speak. She was calculating a set of data in her mind; she didn't want to waste these three hours.","\"Just debuted? I haven't seen you in the industry before.\" Normally, Xie Xi wasn't this talkative, let alone with a stranger. It was just that this person seemed too frightened, standing there without uttering a word.","Today, his sympathy was overflowing a little more than usual.","Although Ye Qiusuo had only just begun supervising graduate students, she had taught undergraduate classes during her PhD. So, when disturbed, Professor Ye instinctively said sternly, \"Xie Xi, be quiet.\""]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5","paragraphs":["The elevator was filled with an eerie silence.","In all his life, Xie Xi had never been told to 'shut up' by anyone, yet he had actually fallen silent.","For a moment, he felt as if he were back in school, with a teacher at the podium trying to maintain order.","By the time he snapped out of it, the person in the corner had fallen silent and said nothing more, with only the faint sound of breathing proving she was still there.","The big star Xie felt utterly humiliated.","She told him to shut up, so he was determined to speak.","However, talking to her again was out of the question.","After a while, a clear and melodious singing voice began to resonate within the elevator.","Xie Xi, whose fee for singing a single song on stage could reach a million, was now casually singing in the dark elevator just to salvage his pride.","After finishing one song, the other party showed no reaction whatsoever. Xie Xi started a second song, determined to annoy the person in the corner.","Inside the sealed elevator, without any musical accompaniment, there was only the pure, clean sound of a male voice.","After finishing the second song, Xie Xi finally realized that he seemed to have... let her get the better of him.","Just now, two million worth of songs had been sung.","He regretted it immensely.","Xie Xi immediately stopped singing, crossed his arms, and turned his back to Ye Qiusuo.","From the very first line Xie Xi sang, Ye Qiusuo had stopped thinking about the data from her project. She lowered her gaze to the floor, quietly listening to him sing.","He truly lived up to his early reputation in the book as the 'Million-Dollar Singer.' He sang so beautifully, yet he ended up with such a fate in the end.","\"You sing very well,\" Professor Ye suddenly said.","A long time passed after she spoke before a disdainful snort finally echoed in the elevator.","Another half hour later, Xie Xi's assistant and personal manager, Sister He, arrived with a group of people. It seemed they had brought a whole crowd, and it was very noisy outside.","\"Xixi, the whole building has lost power. We'll get you out soon,\" Sister He shouted from outside.","\"What about their backup generator?\" Xie Xi asked from inside the elevator.","A TV station building like this usually has a backup generator to prevent sudden power outages. After all this time, it seemed the generator hadn't kicked in.","\"The generator is broken,\" Sister He replied, masking her anxiety and trying to sound nonchalant.","They had been on the 33rd floor when the power went out suddenly. It took them a while just to get down the stairs. The building itself was very tall with a large footprint, and there were at least ten elevators. The security team brought the elevator repair crew, but it wasn't enough.","Only after some people managed to get out did they realize that only the TV station building was without power. The person in charge called the power company and found out there was no outage in the area at all.","The entire building was without power, and the backup generator wasn't working. This immediately put the TV station on high alert. They were busy comforting those trapped inside and helping them evacuate while also having security investigate.","Apart from a few key personnel, no one knew what was happening. Everyone was being escorted out of the building. Sister He and the assistant were also blocked outside. Initially, knowing the rescue and repair teams were insufficient, they went to hire additional help. By the time they returned, Xie Xi's phone was unreachable, and the TV station wouldn't let them back in.","After all the back and forth, it was only now that Sister He could finally bring her own people over.","Just as the repair crew managed to open the elevator doors, the TV station finally restored the main power and fixed the generator. They also apprehended the former employee who had deliberately sabotaged the power supply.","\"The power's back on,\" the assistant said, looking up from outside the elevator shaft.","Sister He quickly crouched near the elevator opening. \"Xixi, come on out.\"","Xie Xi didn't reach for the hands offered from above. Instead, he turned to look at the person in the corner. Now, with the light from outside shining in, he could see her clearly. She was indeed quite good-looking.","She just seemed like a bit of a fuddy-duddy.","Not a hint of the entertainment industry vibe about her.","\"Hey, you go up first,\" Xie Xi said generously, letting her go ahead, not holding her 'shut up' remark against her.","Ye Qiusuo didn't argue either. She stepped forward and was pulled out by someone.","Xie Xi looked up and told the people above to make way. With his long legs and height, he easily pushed himself up with his arms on the ground.","By the time he got up and scanned the surroundings, the person who had told him to shut up had already disappeared.","\"Sister He, where did the person who came up just now go?\"","Sister He was taken aback. \"I didn't notice. Dongzi, did you see?\"","\"No.\"","Their attention had been entirely on Xie Xi; they had been worried sick, how could they have paid attention to anyone else?","\"What's wrong?\" Sister He asked.","Xie Xi changed the subject. \"I want to go back and rest.\"","\"Um... Xixi, the program director came to apologize earlier. He said he won't give special treatment to contestants anymore. Please finish recording this show properly. We just won't accept his shows in the future,\" Sister He said cautiously, observing Xie Xi's expression.","Xie Xi was a big star, and the penalty for breaching the contract was astronomical. If he quit filming, the cost would be extremely high.","Sure enough, upon hearing this, impatience flashed across Xie Xi's face. \"It's just singing. If he's going to manipulate the votes, then he should just pick the winners himself. Why bother inviting me?\"","\"I've already spoken to the director about this. Our contract is very clear. If he does it again, we can leave directly.\"","...","Heavenly Sphere Technology Company high-level meeting room.","\"Three votes against, three votes in favor, and two abstentions,\" announced the person at the head of the round table during the Heavenly Sphere high-level meeting.","\"If this project's development is successful, it will have decisive significance for the company's other projects,\" Ye Qiusuo stated calmly from the right side. \"It could save a significant amount of investment funds in the future.\"","\"Professor Ye, you said 'if successful',\" a middle-aged man across from her asked sternly. \"But what if it fails? One-third of our company's liquid assets would be consumed by your project.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned. \"I will succeed. It's only a matter of time.\"","Another person said with difficulty, \"The annual investment for this project is so huge. Over a few years, it could completely cripple our company. Professor Ye, it's not that we don't trust you, it's just that the company really can't afford that much money. It's a bottomless pit.\"","At the end of the meeting discussion, no one could convince anyone else. The 'New Artificial Brain Neural Synapse' project could only be temporarily shelved.","After leaving the meeting room, the person who had announced the votes came over. \"Yezi, let's put this on hold for now. Once Heavenly Sphere Tech's profits increase, we'll invest in it for you.\"","\"Now is the best time,\" Ye Qiusuo said, then fell silent.","Zhang Chengjue rubbed his forehead and let out a long sigh. \"The shareholders will never agree to a project requiring such a massive amount of funds. I'll lobby for you some more, but at most we can only get half.\"","Back when they had founded this company together, Ye Qiusuo provided the plans, established projects, and delivered results, while Zhang Chengjue handled the investment. Now that the company was growing bigger, there were also more constraints.","Ye Qiusuo suddenly said, \"Half is fine too.\"","Zhang Chengjue was startled. \"What about the other half?\" Heavenly Sphere Tech couldn't possibly let other companies invest in the project.","\"I have some money of my own.\"","Zhang Chengjue immediately understood. \"You want to put in all the money you've earned these years?\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded, looking up at Zhang Chengjue. \"If the project is delayed by a year, the chance of others achieving it first increases.\"","Zhang Chengjue frowned. \"Even with all your savings, it still won't cover the entire project cost.\"","Professor Ye, who had never before worried about project funding, fell silent for a moment. \"...I can earn it.\"","The man standing beside her at the railing smiled and, before leaving, said, \"Alright, I'll help you gather half the funds as soon as possible.\"","Ye Qiusuo stood upstairs, gazing down thoughtfully. The building's main structure was white, with railings spiraling half-turn by half-turn up each floor, corridors staggered on different levels, surrounded by transparent glass. Looking down, one could see people coming and going on the floors below. Every detail symbolized technology—cold, rational, yet filled with a powerful, awe-inspiring force.","This building had cost a considerable sum, designed by a renowned architect.","She and Zhang Chengjue had argued about this matter for a long time back then. He thought it unnecessary to spend money on such things, but Ye Qiusuo wanted a building that would integrate offices and laboratories for the future. History proved her decision correct.","In just a few short years, Tianqiu Tech's projects had multiplied. Thanks to the solid architectural foundation laid initially, converting spaces into laboratories was now remarkably convenient.","Ye Qiusuo stood in the corridor for a while longer. Just as she was about to leave, her gaze paused: Was that Wan Yurou downstairs?","She took another look, then headed to her own laboratory, paying it no further mind.","The female lead might be important, but her experiment could not be postponed.","...","This was Wan Yurou's second visit to Tianqiu Tech. In truth, her previous visit had only been a tour of the first-floor lobby.","At Tianqiu Tech, floors above the second level were off-limits to non-project personnel, and researchers from different projects couldn't freely access other floors either.","Professor Ye Qiusu brought Wan Yurou up to the fourth floor via elevator, where her project laboratory was located. However, after exiting the elevator, there was another security gate requiring a temporary employee card to pass through.","\"Professor Ye, do you usually work here?\" Wan Yurou asked curiously. Entering this space evoked a solemn atmosphere, from the surrounding equipment and decor to the quiet people coming and going.","\"Aside from teaching classes, I'm currently working here all the time,\" Professor Ye Qiusu replied, leading Wan Yurou on a tour of the fourth floor's peripheral areas. She didn't let her enter the laboratories, as Tianqiu Tech explicitly forbade all external personnel from entering them.","\"How has your experience been collaborating on a project with Tianqiu Tech, Professor Ye?\" Wan Yurou asked, seemingly offhandedly, as she stood by the corridor railing looking down.","\"It's more complex than previous projects I've collaborated on. The standards here are quite high, but I can manage,\" Ye Qiusu said, though an undisguised pride seeped through her words.","In the past two years, Tianqiu Tech had become a benchmark in the industry. Any professor who secured a collaborative project here would see their professional standing increase by more than double afterward.","\"Professor Ye, let's take a photo together.\" Wan Yurou stopped in the very center of the corridor, turned, and pulled Ye Qiusu over for a picture, making sure the Tianqiu Tech logo above the main entrance was perfectly framed in the background.","\"Wait a moment.\" Ye Qiusu smoothed her hair and positioned herself at Wan Yurou's side before allowing the photo.","Wan Yurou took several shots in a row and handed her phone to Professor Ye Qiusu. \"Which one do you think looks best?\"","Ye Qiusu looked through the photos repeatedly, unable to decide.","\"Professor Ye, you look wonderful in all of these—elegant, intellectual, with the natural bearing of a scholar,\" Wan Yurou said sincerely beside her.","Everyone enjoys hearing compliments. Pleased inwardly, Ye Qiusu pointed to a photo with good angles and lighting. \"This one will do.\"","Wan Yurou used an app to retouch the photo slightly, making both of them look even better. Then she asked, \"Professor Ye, would you mind if I posted this photo on Weibo? Meeting you today was so exciting, I'd like to share it with my fans.\"","Ye Qiusu laughed. \"You young girls always enjoy doing these things.\"","Having gotten what she wanted, Wan Yurou discussed it with her manager that evening. They decided to post the photo on Saturday, the day of the program."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6","paragraphs":["The third episode of \"Knowledge Q&A\" officially aired, achieving record-high ratings that day.","The audience was a group of stubborn yet curious people. While some thought Ye Qiusuo was just crafting a persona, they couldn't help but tune in, as watching her answer questions was thrilling nonetheless.","\"Is the teacher really on the show?\"","\"Yes, I watched the first two episodes.\" Lin Lu sat in the middle with a tablet in front of him, flanked by classmates from the same project.","Since the project began, the three of them had been holed up in the lab every day, voluntarily sacrificing their rest time. Today, Lin Lu had specifically dragged them out to watch the program.","As the show began, the camera swept over the celebrity guests on stage before its first close-up landed on Ye Qiusuo.","\"It really is Professor Ye!\"","The three of them immediately got excited upon seeing Ye Qiusuo.","\"Last episode, the teacher corrected their mistakes one by one; it was so satisfying,\" Lin Lu gossiped excitedly.","After sending that private message last time, Lin Lu had mostly forgotten about it. Having such significant responsibility for the first time, he was happily busy with the newly started project. He had only found time to finish the second episode over several days.","In this episode, both the celebrity guests and the production team seemed to have adjusted their answers, with basically no mistakes.","After Wan Yurou finished her explanation, the host specifically cued Ye Qiusuo: \"Does guest number 43 have anything to say?\"","Up to now, the host had never once addressed Ye Qiusuo as 'Professor.' For other doctoral candidates or guest experts from various fields, he would at least respectfully call them 'Teacher.'","On screen, Ye Qiusuo remained unchanged, sitting in her seat and speaking methodically: \"What she said is correct.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Even though Wan Yurou had technically won, the people present didn't feel the sting of a rebuttal at all.","Whenever there was no mistake and the host cued her, Ye Qiusuo would only say one phrase: 'What XX said is correct.'","And she meticulously changed the pronoun according to who was asked, showing great precision.","Subtly, the expressions of several people on stage turned somewhat sour, as if they had a stifling feeling in their chests they couldn't release.","To say Ye Qiusuo had suddenly lost her edge would be wrong.","For questions that Wan Yurou couldn't remember clearly or forgot the analysis for, Ye Qiusuo still knew them and could answer perfectly.","By now, they had reached the fortieth question. The difficulty of the last ten questions had noticeably spiked, making even reading the question stems somewhat challenging, let alone selecting the correct option and providing an analysis.","At this point, both on and off stage, aside from those outside the professional fields, most people were just guessing randomly.","Wan Yurou was also struggling with her answers.","It was true she had access to a question bank, but it was the master bank. Each episode randomly drew questions from it, and she couldn't possibly remember everything, especially the difficult ones.","Yet, Ye Qiusuo could answer them and even explain the reasoning in detail.","[Why does everything she says sound so infuriating?]","[Putting aside everything else, Ye Qiusuo is truly amazing at answering questions; she hasn't been wrong yet.]","[Wan Yurou's complexion seems to have changed; I feel sorry for her for three seconds.]","[Tsk, Ye Qiusuo must have the question bank, right? Can a normal person know this much, even the analysis down to the last detail?]","The barrage was filled with all sorts of discussions and speculations.","Then, Xia Zhoubing suddenly spoke up: \"Guest number 43, you seem to know every professional field. You're that impressive? One might think you have the question bank.\"","[Whoa, whoa, is our Xia Xia being this bold?!]","[He actually called her out directly? 666. I'm really curious how Ye Qiusuo will explain this. The breadth of her knowledge is indeed suspicious.]","In the laboratory.","\"Who is this guy?\" the girl on Lin Lu's left said disdainfully. \"His own general knowledge is weak, so he doubts Professor Ye?\"","Professor Ye was someone who could cite data from the page and line of academic journals decades old. This kind of broad, general knowledge was even more within her grasp.","\"Looks like it says Xia Zhoubing. I need to warn my sister to steer clear; this guy seems rather shallow,\" Lin Lu said, pursing his lips.","While they were discussing, the program's spotlight had already shifted, fully exposing Ye Qiusuo on camera.","She glanced lightly at Xia Zhoubing and said slowly, \"I am somewhat impressive.\"","Xia Zhoubing: \"...\"","[So mad, so mad! Why is Ye Qiusuo so good at provoking people?!]","[Ahhhhh! Even though she didn't say anything directly confrontational, putting myself in the others' shoes, I feel so angry!]","Xia Zhoubing was also furious; he felt provoked.","As a moderately popular star with eight million Weibo followers, being challenged like this by her, he laughed immediately: \"Is memorizing a question bank impressive?\"","At this moment, the barrage was instantly flooded with comments praising him for being bold, though a minority of viewers felt Xia Zhoubing's statement was a bit too absolute.","Then, Ye Qiusuo actually let out an \"Mhm\" of agreement.","Not only everyone on the show, but even the barrage was stunned.","The same thought popped into everyone's mind: She actually does have the question bank?","The next second, Ye Qiusuo started counting backwards from the fortieth question, stating the source of each question, or rather, where she had seen it. Some questions had appeared in previous specialized exams, while others were knowledge from professional textbooks.","For exam questions, she specified the exact year and question number. For textbook knowledge, she pinpointed the exact page and line number.","Here, the program team used post-production editing.","Going through the sources for all forty questions would take the entire episode.","After Ye Qiusuo explained the sources for ten questions, the editing fast-forwarded, then cut to her finishing explaining the source of the first question.","[Damn... a real-life question bank.]","[From now on, regardless of whether she's really the person in charge of that Tianqiu Tech project or not, I'm a fan.]","[First time seeing someone like this. Is this the so-called genius?]","The direction of the barrage instantly did a complete turnaround.","\"Professor Ye is just awesome!\"","The three in the lab were also thoroughly engrossed, their expressions excited.","After the third episode ended, Ye Qiusuo had two consecutive hashtags trending.","#YeQiusuoIsInfuriating#, #YeQiusuoTheHumanQuestionBank#","Now, very few people were discussing whether she was the fake person in charge. Most were shocked by her performance in the third episode and rapidly turning into fans.","\"Should I post the photo now?\" Wan Yurou asked, unwilling to accept this.","Originally, according to the plan, all this attention should have been hers. But after the first episode, the next two had completely spiraled out of the team's control.","\"Post it. Why not? We need to remind netizens about her being a fake project head,\" the manager said, instructing Wan Yurou to post the photo from Thursday and then contact a professional team.","Wan Yurou took her phone and posted the group photo of her and Ye Qiusu, along with an edited caption: [So honored to have another opportunity to visit Tianqiu Tech. Professor Ye Qiusu was very patient in explaining my simple questions. I hope to have the chance to learn from Professor Ye again next time~]","Almost an hour later, the sentiment on Weibo began to shift. A wave of comments started occupying the top positions.","[Everyone, go check out Wan Yurou's Weibo to see the real person in charge of the Tianqiu Tech project. No matter how capable a fake is, they're still a fake.]","[Ye Qiusuo pretending to be the Tianqiu Tech project head is pretty much confirmed, right? Even the name is a knock-off. Disgusting!]","[The person next to Wan Yurou is the real Professor Ye from Huajing University.]","[No matter how capable, lying isn't okay, right? My favorable impression of a scheming woman like Ye Qiusuo just vanished.]","...","It was as if an invisible hand instantly reversed the direction of the public opinion on the Weibo hot search comments, and Ye Qiusuo's reputation took another hit.","However, this public sentiment was reversed once again the very next day.","The reason was a post on a certain fan website, which was later picked up and shared by gossip-loving bloggers, quickly capturing everyone's attention.","[Shocking! That so-called human answer machine who was accused of being a fake project lead yesterday morning appeared on the Huajing University official website's faculty list. Is this a sign of the prestigious university's moral decay or...?]","The original post stated that the poster had casually clicked into Huajing University's official website out of curiosity that morning to look up Professor Ye Qiusu, only to find Ye Qiusuo prominently listed. Her ID photo was clean and attractive, her education listed as a Ph.D., and her achievements section was filled to the brim.","[What's going on? Ye Qiusuo wasn't on the official website yesterday. Did she bribe Huajing University too?]","[Current Huajing University undergrad here. The university uniformly updated the faculty profiles for all schools and departments this morning.]","[Are those achievements in her profile real? How old is she? Not even twenty-five.]","[Even if there are two Professor Ye's in the same field at Huajing University? Ye Qiusuo still lied about her project lead identity, right?]","[Well... as someone in the industry, I have to say, Tianqiu Tech actually has many, many projects. Some get approved but don't necessarily succeed and just quietly fade away. It's possible for both Professor Ye's to have projects.]","Once a lead appears, some netizens can promptly transform into detectives.","A significant portion of Tianqiu Tech's internal architecture features special glass, originally designed for future renovations. There are large glass panels on both sides of the company logo. Wan Yurou's photo deliberately captured the logo in the background. While observing the logo, a netizen inadvertently noticed the reflection in the nearby glass, zoomed in, screenshotted it, and asked others to take a closer look.","[Is it what I think it is???]","[Putting aside everything else, that superior side profile... there's no second person with one like Ye Qiusuo's.]","[She was inside Tianqiu Tech too, so... she really is a project lead there?]","The originally 'candid photo' deliberately arranged by Wan Yurou's team to imply Ye Qiusuo was a fake project lead ended up providing strong evidence that she was telling the truth.","\"Anyone who didn't know better would think you, Sister Mo, and the team were working for Ye Qiusuo,\" Wan Yurou said self-deprecatingly.","\"Yurou, we messed this up. We only proceeded because we got word that the program director's team had checked with Huajing University and confirmed there was no Ye Qiusuo there. We'll make sure they're more careful next time,\" the agent said, not having anticipated that the message had been distorted and amplified after passing through several channels.","\"Sister Mo, I'm not blaming you. It's just that a well-laid plan suddenly turned out like this. I didn't control my emotions well, I'm sorry,\" Wan Yurou stood up and said sincerely.","The agent comforted her, \"Since Ye Qiusuo is a university professor, she'll probably go back to that after this episode airs. She won't really be competition for you.\"","\"Mhm.\"","After the agent left, the smile vanished from Wan Yurou's lips: Having tasted the dazzling allure of the entertainment industry's spotlight, who would ever want to leave it?","...","Ye Qiusuo had been in the limelight for the past couple of days. Even when she went to record the fourth episode the next day, the program crew's attitude had noticeably improved. However, by Monday, the discussion heat surrounding her was snatched away by someone else.","Even when the celebrity guests from \"Knowledge Q&A\" appeared on the hot search, some netizens still didn't know who they were, let alone Ye Qiusuo, who was just a regular person.","But the big star Xie Xi was different. The moment his name appeared, paired with the accompanying tag, it exploded.","#XieXiUneducated","The singing competition show he was a judge on also aired on Saturday, with recording on Sunday. Typically for such talent shows, besides the first episode highlighting the judges for hype, the focus later shifts to promoting the newcomers.","This time, it started because someone suddenly captured screenshots from several shots in the episode showing the words Xie Xi wrote on his whiteboard.","Forget about the handwriting being poor; netizens discovered that nine out of ten characters he wrote were wrong, and the remaining one looked wrong at a glance too.","Where there's one, there's more. Anonymous netizens gradually dug up instances of Xie Xi's writing from other events, and almost none of the characters were correct.","Celebrities and artists having poor handwriting or low education isn't particularly rare; some of them dropped out of school early, which is fairly normal.","But Xie Xi exuded an air of refined nobility from head to toe, like a perfect young aristocrat, making this revelation shatter the fan filter instantly.","[Don't tell me people still don't know Xie Xi didn't even finish junior high?]","Someone below steered the narrative, and Xie Xi was immediately thrust into the storm. Combined with his reputation for being difficult and blunt since his debut, it was all now attributed to his low education and poor character.","\"I'll have someone issue a clarification,\" his agent said, having come specifically to Xie Xi's residence.","Xie Xi, half-reclining on the sofa, raised a hand to turn on the TV and said expressionlessly, \"Clarify what? It's true I didn't finish junior high.\"","\"But...\" The agent wanted to say something but fell silent under Xie Xi's glance.","After a moment, the agent tried to negotiate, \"We still need a solution for this.\" She knew Xie Xi didn't want to bring up that past incident with his audience and fans.","Xie Xi lowered his head to look at his phone, scrolling through Weibo.","The agent thought he was looking at his own hot search and suggested, \"How about I arrange for you to do a pretend study session with a tutor? We can find one with high recognition.\"","Xie Xi glanced up at the person on the TV, then looked back down at Weibo, his expression strange, temporarily ignoring the agent.","The agent asked again, \"Xi Xi, are you willing?\"","Xie Xi silently turned to look at his agent, then suddenly raised his hand, pointing at a person on the TV, and said, \"I think she seems pretty impressive.\""]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7","paragraphs":["The incident involving Xie Xi had caused quite a stir.","His influence was immense, with a single song's performance fee even reaching a million. After the news broke, even an official channel weighed in, hinting that entertainers needed to improve their cultural literacy.","For a time, ridicule was everywhere. It seemed that overnight, everyone had turned against him.","Xie Xi's agent, Sister Wei, felt somewhat uncomfortable about the whole situation. If the program crew hadn't played a part in this from the very beginning, she wouldn't be surnamed Wei, and all her years as an agent would have been for nothing.","Previously, shows and media outlets who knew Xie Xi's handwriting was a mess would deliberately avoid filming it. Yet, just last week, after Xie Xi had a falling out with the production team of a singing competition show, that very episode featured several shots clearly showing the whiteboard where Xie Xi was writing.","Now that it had exploded online, getting the production team to retract those shots was impossible. The only option was to try and steer netizens away from continuing the discussion.","At the same time, they needed to arrange further education for Xie Xi. Of course, they couldn't announce this online immediately. They had to wait for the storm to subside, then subtly leak the news that he was diligently studying to improve himself because of this incident.","This would multiply the support from netizens.","Sister Wei naturally couldn't contact Ye Qiusuo directly. Fortunately, she had a friend who knew the dean of that faculty and could arrange an introduction.","Deep down, Sister Wei wasn't keen on sending Xie Xi to Ye Qiusuo. The two were close in age and both possessed strikingly good looks. What if netizens started wild speculation...","She'd have to deal with more trouble.","But she knew Xie Xi's temperament; once he decided on something, he wouldn't change his mind.","However, the person Xie Xi had chosen was interesting. She had become quite famous recently, the only drawback being she was too young and had the kind of good looks common in the entertainment industry. Sister Wei had watched that \"Knowledge Q&A\" show; her expertise was solid enough. Anyway, Xie Xi was just going through the motions; they didn't actually expect him to learn much.","\"Go get ready, and don't wear that piece of clothing.\" Sister Wei told assistant Dongzi to put down the ripped denim jacket and rummaged through the walk-in closet, pulling out a light grey coat. \"We're visiting Professor Ye today. Don't dress too outrageously.\"","Hearing the word 'Professor', Xie Xi pursed his lips. Indeed, he couldn't be outrageous; that person definitely seemed like a stick-in-the-mud.","In the end, he wore white pants with a black shirt, topped with the light grey coat. A hairstylist was specially called in to change his hairstyle.","His originally sharp and handsome features were softened, instantly giving him a more scholarly air.","\"What a pity Xie Xi doesn't act with this look of his,\" He Feng sighed, looking at his face.","Sister Wei also smiled. \"Does Xie Xi want to try acting? I can get you scripts.\"","Over the years, numerous directors had approached Xie Xi for roles, but he always refused.","Sure enough, Xie Xi, who had been fiddling with his coat, looked up at the mirror and said nonchalantly, \"No. Scripts have too many words; I don't want to memorize them.\"","If netizens heard him now, it would probably cement Xie Xi's reputation as culturally deficient, disliking study, a fish that slipped through the net of nine-year compulsory education.","But the people in the room showed no particular reaction to his words, instead humoring him, saying it was fine if he didn't want to.","When they set out, only Sister Wei accompanied Xie Xi. They drove all the way to Huajing University and met with the dean.","\"Xiao Ye should be in the lab at this time. I'll take you there.\" The dean was unpretentious and didn't treat Xie Xi any differently.","The group arrived at the laboratory building, with students occasionally coming and going.","\"Dean, our Xie Xi is a bit of a slow learner. We'll have to ask Professor Ye to be patient with him,\" Sister Wei said, setting expectations in advance.","The dean glanced at the handsome young superstar beside him and said calmly, \"Actually, to learn foundational knowledge, finding a teacher from the College of Liberal Arts might be better. But if Xiao Ye is willing to teach him, that's fine too.\"","There was an eighty percent chance Xiao Ye wouldn't agree. She was swamped with various commitments; where would she find the time to tutor a celebrity?","When they reached Ye Qiusuo's laboratory, the dean asked the two to wait outside while he knocked and went in.","Xie Xi stood outside bored, looking around. He had never attended university, let alone seen this kind of lab building.","This lab didn't even have a window. Weren't they afraid of developing psychological issues from staying in there too long?","\"This is Xie Xi,\" the dean introduced as he and Ye Qiusuo came out together.","When Ye Qiusuo emerged, she was still wearing a white lab coat. Because she had been adjusting instrument data, she was wearing glasses today, giving a different feel from that night in the elevator.","Of course, only Xie Xi present noticed the difference.","\"What's the matter?\" Ye Qiusuo glanced at Xie Xi and then asked.","Sister Wei immediately stepped forward with a smile. \"Professor Ye, it's like this. Our Xie Xi would like you to tutor him and help him learn a few things. If it's convenient for you... you can set the hourly rate.\"","Ye Qiusuo swept her eyes over Xie Xi without speaking. She was thinking about the plot.","According to the plot, after being criticized, Xie Xi sought out a professor from the College of Liberal Arts at a top university. That professor had appeared on several major cultural programs and was quite well-known.","Going to study with the professor was originally a move by Xie Xi's team to improve his public image later. Unexpectedly, that professor once gave a lecture at a school, using a certain male singer as an example, saying his cultural literacy was too poor, he couldn't even recognize many characters properly, yet he came to seek out a professor like him.","Although no name was mentioned, anyone who followed the news knew the professor was talking about Xie Xi.","This incident fermented repeatedly, causing Xie Xi's reputation to plummet. Later, to pave the way for the male lead's rise, the author simply wrote that Xie Xi was too ashamed to show his face again, disappearing from the entertainment industry altogether.","Having been forced to read the entire book, Ye Qiusuo could only think the author's logic was... touching.","Forget about the role of a top singer's professional team; the idea that Xie Xi would 'shamefully' retire over this incident itself defied logic. When Xie Xi first entered the industry and became hugely popular, he weathered storms much bigger than this. Not to mention the author had previously written that the reason he often got characters wrong and only attended school until junior high was because Xie Xi had dyslexia.","Perfectly square characters looked like dancing symbols in Xie Xi's eyes.","Ye Qiusuo suspected the author had forgotten the character traits she herself had established earlier.","Hearing no reply for a while, Sister Wei thought Professor Ye was unwilling to take Xie Xi on and was about to mention other forms of compensation when Xie Xi suddenly interjected from beside her.","\"One of my songs costs a million. You listened to two of my songs.\" Xie Xi slowly held up two fingers. That night in the elevator, she had even said they sounded good.","Sister Wei: \"?\"","The situation was a bit awkward. Xie Xi's words carried a hint of coercion.","And also...","\"Xie Xi, did you know Professor Ye before?\" Sister Wei asked with a smile on her face, but her hand firmly pulled on Xie Xi's arm, signaling him not to be willful now.","Contrary to Sister Wei's expectations, Ye Qiusuo didn't seem angry. Instead, she said calmly, \"I know.\"","Her students were still waiting in the lab. Professor Ye met Xie Xi's eyes. \"Every Sunday afternoon, in Room 212 of the Wenhe Building. Is that acceptable?\" Since the plot was already derailed, she was happy to watch it derail even further.","Xie Xi struggled to recall his schedule and agreed. \"Acceptable.\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded, said a word to the dean, and turned back into the laboratory.","Sister Wei, a seasoned and savvy top agent, found herself failing to react promptly several times today. Was that it?","The dean was a bit surprised that Ye Qiusuo agreed, because they knew each other? Then why did he need to be brought in to mediate.","\"Since Xiao Ye agrees, that's fine. I'll give you a temporary pass for accessing the teaching building,\" the dean said, waving them over.","\"Thank you, Dean.\" Sister Wei suppressed the various thoughts rising in her mind and smiled.","It wasn't until they were seated in the car that Sister Wei turned to ask Xie Xi: \"Did you know Professor Ye before? What's your relationship?\" And singing, too.","\"I didn't know her.\" Xie Xi leaned back against the seat as soon as he got in the car, picking up the earphones beside him to put on, but was stopped by Sister Wei.","\"Then what did you mean by what you said earlier?\" Sister Wei asked seriously.","Xie Xi had his life manager and assistant keeping tabs on him daily, with monthly summaries sent to her. When did he get to know Professor Ye? She had no idea.","Xie Xi said lazily, \"Last week, I was stuck in an elevator, and she listened to two of my songs for free.\" As for the initial reason being to bother Ye Qiusuo, he kept that to himself. Anyway, she had agreed.","Sister Wei thought for a moment before recalling that both of them had been recording programs at Gaoxing TV Station, secretly letting out a sigh of relief.","\"I think that Professor Ye seems like a decent person. Even if you don't learn well, your attitude should be good,\" Sister Wei instructed. Xie Xi had a bit of a temper; those close to him knew he meant no harm, but outsiders might not understand.","\"So how long do I have to study?\" Xie Xi tapped his fingers on the earphones and asked.","\"Two months. Once your album is out, you won't need to study anymore.\"","When the album is released, Xie Xi is sure to attract attention. If nothing else, his singing truly has few equals in the current music scene.","It would be the perfect time to hint to the public that he's been furthering his studies.","...","After receiving a call from Zhang Chengjue, Ye Qiusuo rushed from the university to Tianqiu Technology Company.","She held a purple ID card in her hand. There were only two of these cards in the entire company, held by her and Zhang Chengjue respectively, granting access to any floor and laboratory in the company.","\"You're here.\" Zhang Chengjue stood by the floor-to-ceiling window in the top-floor office and turned around upon hearing the knock.","\"Did they agree to fund the project?\" Ye Qiusuo asked as soon as she entered.","Zhang Chengjue pulled out a chair for her, saying helplessly, \"Is that the first thing you ask?\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't speak, just looked at him quietly.","\"I asked you to come precisely because of the project.\" Zhang Chengjue walked over and sat down opposite her. \"I've been working on those shareholders for several days, and they've finally relented. They can fund this project, but...\"","Ye Qiusuo waited for his next words.","\"...but the funding has been cut to one-third.\" Zhang Chengjue sighed. \"The funding gap for the project is too large this way. Who knows how many years it will take to succeed? Your own money would last at most a year.\"","Every project undergoes internal company evaluation. Even though Ye Qiusuo is a 'founding member' of Tianqiu Company, the evaluators unanimously considered this project too radical.","With the company currently on a strong upward trajectory, this project was deemed completely unnecessary.","\"One-third is fine. I must do this project.\" Ye Qiusuo stood up. \"Call a meeting now.\"","Zhang Chengjue was taken aback: \"A meeting?\"","Major shareholders have the right to convene temporary meetings. Usually, high-level meetings are organized by Zhang Chengjue. After all these years of Ye Qiusuo not being involved, he had almost forgotten she was also a major shareholder.","\"You still have those ongoing projects on your hands. Now you want to take on this one too. Can you handle it all?\" Zhang Chengjue asked.","\"For those projects, I only need to oversee the general direction; they don't require much time.\" Ye Qiusuo remained firm.","Zhang Chengjue placed his hand on the phone on the desk and finally notified his assistant to have the shareholders attend the meeting.","The meeting went surprisingly smoothly, on the condition that the company only had to provide one-third of the project's funding. Of course, the overall decision-making power for the entire project lay almost entirely with Ye Qiusuo.","Having gotten what she wanted, Ye Qiusuo stood up and left.","Most people had left the conference room, leaving only Zhang Chengjue and two others. One middle-aged man loosened his tie and said, \"That one-third would be much better invested in other projects. This 'artificial synapse' thing is clearly going to be money down the drain.\"","\"Enough, you can say that in front of me, but that's it.\" Zhang Chengjue frowned. \"She's a major shareholder. Can't she run a project?\"","Ye Qiusuo, of course, was unaware of the opinions a few in the meeting room held about her. As soon as she left the company, she flipped through her schedule and realized she still had to tutor Xie Xi the day after tomorrow.","...She had no idea what to teach him.","Might as well start with writing."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8","paragraphs":["The Wenhe Building belongs to the School of Literature, some distance from Ye Qiusuo's laboratory, but it's empty on weekends. Xie Xi is a major celebrity; as long as the news doesn't leak, no one should go there to cause a commotion.","After spending the morning in the lab, Ye Qiusuo went out for lunch at the cafeteria. Preparing to return and check the test data, she suddenly noticed someone bundled up tightly, crouching at the entrance of the laboratory building.","They had agreed to meet at two o'clock. Xie Xi arrived at the university's main gate at one. He sent his assistant and personal manager away, thinking he could squeeze in an extra half-hour of gaming. However, once inside, he realized he didn't know where the Wenhe Building was. After navigating for a long time, he ended up circling near the laboratory building.","At the front of the lab building, there was a bulletin board. Xie Xi glanced at it; large swathes of swirling, distorted characters jumped before his eyes, giving him a headache. He shifted his gaze to the photos on the board.","Xie Xi looked over and found quite a few people who were 'bald from being too clever'. Reaching the last section, Ye Qiusuo's photo seemed out of place, glaringly incongruous among the doctors and professors in their forties and fifties.","He tried to read about Ye Qiusuo's achievements, but the characters in his vision were fragmented and seemed to move.","Xie Xi simply took a photo of it and sent it to his assistant, asking him to read it out loud via voice message.","The assistant replied quickly: \"Bro, is this what they call a genius?!\"","Xie Xi: \"I asked you to read it, not to look at it yourself.\"","Assistant: \"Oh, it says Professor Ye entered the doctoral program at nineteen, graduated four years later, and stayed on to teach at the university the same year. During that time, she received awards... well, a lot.\" The assistant stared for a long time; these terms were too convoluted for a non-specialist to read aloud.","Seems pretty impressive.","Xie Xi raised an eyebrow. Someone like that probably has no entertainment life to speak of; her focus is likely entirely on research. Whoever ends up with her in the future is in for a rough time.","That dean last time mentioned Ye Qiusuo is always in the lab. Xie Xi decided not to go to the Wenhe Building either, opting to wait right at the entrance of the laboratory building.","After waiting a while, he couldn't resist taking out his phone, crouching down to play a game.","Until Ye Qiusuo stood before him.","\"Didn't we agree on the Wenhe Building?\" Ye Qiusuo couldn't see his face, hidden as it was by a mask and hat, but those slender, clean hands holding the phone in a gaming posture instantly reminded her who it was.","Xie Xi looked up, stating matter-of-factly, \"I got lost.\"","\"Wait here a moment. I have a set of data to record.\" Ye Qiusuo walked past him, heading upstairs as she spoke.","By the time Xie Xi looked down again, his game character was already dead. He stopped playing, put his phone in his pocket, and quietly stood guard like a door god.","Students coming and going nearby would instinctively glance at him. Some people, even with their faces unseen, have a presence different from ordinary folks.","Ye Qiusuo finished recording the separated data, left a message for the students in the project, and then went downstairs carrying a stack of books she had prepared.","\"This is your assignment.\" Ye Qiusuo handed a thick stack of loose-leaf notebooks to Xie Xi.","Xie Xi's eyes, the only part visible, held a clear question: \"I haven't even had a class yet.\" To already have homework.","\"We can have class now.\" Regardless of his mood, Ye Qiusuo took the lead, walking ahead to show the way.","He had chosen this teacher himself; it was too late for regrets now. Xie Xi could only follow her to the Wenhe Building.","Because Xie Xi has dyslexia, Ye Qiusuo didn't test his knowledge reserve with written exams, only using verbal questions.","After over an hour, she found he had a decent grasp of basic foundational knowledge. It was just that his handwriting was a mess, and reading was a struggle for him.","Successfully completing his studies in this condition would indeed be difficult.","\"Did you have specialized tutors before?\" Ye Qiusuo asked, standing in front of Xie Xi.","\"Yes,\" Xie Xi replied lazily, leaning back in his chair. \"One tutor, and one narrator for reading.\"","Many of his books and knowledge were acquired by 'listening'.","\"Since you understand those basics, there's no need for me to teach you that.\" Ye Qiusuo now understood why the Xie Xi in the book only went through the motions with that professor from Tsinghua or Peking University.","\"Can I skip this homework then?\" Xie Xi pushed the thick stack of notebooks forward. After Ye Qiusuo's oral questioning earlier, he thought his manager had already told her about his dyslexia.","Ye Qiusuo pushed the homework back, rigidly stating, \"No.\"","Xie Xi frowned. \"You just said there's no need to teach.\" He had hoped to just come here every weekend to slack off and play games.","\"The notebooks are specially made. Write down the characters you see on them once a week.\"","The structural components used in Chinese characters are finite. Even with reading difficulties, one can perceive some elements. If he could write down the structures he sees, perhaps some patterns could be summarized.","\"This kind of copying is for elementary school kids.\" Xie Xi didn't want to do it.","Professor Ye stood in front, unmoved. \"Seven pages a week. Bring them to me for correction every weekend.\"","The facts proved that a certain someone was all bark and no bite. In the end, he still picked up a pen and wrote down the characters as he saw them.","Xie Xi sat in the classroom copying. Ye Qiusuo leaned against a desk, looking down as she texted the company's data researchers, asking them to collect data on how text appears to people with dyslexia.","Someone from the lab asked if she was starting a new project.","Ye Qiusuo replied it wasn't for now.","\"I don't want to write anymore.\" Xie Xi put down his pen after half a page, his foot tapping the table leg intermittently, creating a rhythmic sound.","Ye Qiusuo turned around, picked up the loose-leaf notebook from his desk. It was filled with various chaotic strokes. Only half an hour had passed. \"Finish it.\"","\"I'm dizzy,\" Xie Xi said, half-truthfully. \"Looking at so many characters for so long is uncomfortable.\"","Ye Qiusuo doesn't have dyslexia; she can even read ten lines at a glance. Holding the notebook, she thought for a moment and said, \"You have a ten-minute break.\"","Seizing the break time, Xie Xi immediately pulled out his phone and started gaming.","Ye Qiusuo watched him for a while. \"Playing games doesn't make you dizzy?\"","\"Games don't have many words,\" Xie Xi said, thinking Ye Qiusuo was being lenient. Young professors like her probably don't know how to teach students. He even began to imagine how he could turn these weekend afternoons into his personal gaming sessions.","Ten minutes later.","\"You can continue copying now.\"","\"Let me finish this round,\" Xie Xi said without looking up.","Ye Qiusuo stood up, took the phone from his hand, directly exited and closed the game. \"Break time is over.\"","This celebrity couldn't even focus for an hour.","Xie Xi: \"...I was still rescuing someone.\"","Ye Qiusuo took the phone from his hand, tossed it onto another desk, and watched him quietly.","In the end, Xie Xi could only pull the notebook back and continue copying, muttering under his breath, \"What's the point of copying this?\"","If he had known earlier, he wouldn't have chosen her. So rigid and inflexible.","It took Xie Xi two hours to finish one page. By then, his assistant and personal manager had already arrived outside the campus to pick him up.","\"Come directly here next week. The lab building has people on weekends.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't want to see him causing a stir on campus.","Xie Xi responded half-heartedly, casually putting on his mask and hat, inwardly complaining about Ye Qiusuo for being an old fuddy-duddy despite her young age.","Seeing that Ye Qiusuo was about to leave, Xie Xi reached out and grabbed the collar of her clothes from behind. \"Professor, let's exchange contact information.\"","Nearly stumbling from the tug, Ye Qiusuo said expressionlessly, \"...Let go.\"","Professor Ye, who spent her days and nights in the lab and was highly respected by researchers and students alike, had never had her collar suddenly grabbed like this before. She felt a subtle sense of her dignity being violated.","Xie Xi slowly loosened his fingers. \"Will you add me?\"","Ye Qiusuo turned around, raised her hands to meticulously straighten her collar, and then, still without expression, reached out to take his phone, inputting her number.","\"And WeChat.\" Xie Xi preferred voice messages; typing was troublesome for him.","Ye Qiusuo added him on WeChat as well, entered her name in the contacts on his phone, then shoved the phone back to him and turned to leave.","Watching Ye Qiusuo walk away, Xie Xi raised an eyebrow and slowly changed the contact name she had saved.","...","The program was recorded on Sunday evening. Yesterday, the ratings for the fourth episode of \"Knowledge Q&A\" soared once again. As netizens grew increasingly curious about Professor Ye, the show's success became more assured.","This led to a shift in the director's attitude. What he pursued was the show's ratings and audience acclaim, not promoting any particular person. Naturally, the focus was now fully on Ye Qiusuo. The host's script changed repeatedly, and the central figure had already shifted from the original Wan Yurou to Ye Qiusuo.","During the recording of the fifth episode, everyone present could sense the change.","The host sought opportunities to converse with Ye Qiusuo more and more frequently, especially as the number of non-celebrity guests kept dwindling.","\"Professor Ye, you're usually knowledgeable about this area as well?\" the host asked after Ye Qiusuo explained a piece of traditional Chinese literature knowledge. \"If I remember correctly, your specialty is purely in the sciences.\"","\"I've looked into it occasionally.\" Ye Qiusuo was also surprised by the program team's actions. She hadn't watched the previous episode, but in the original book, Wan Yurou would trend on social media after each episode, solidifying her public persona firmly.","Last night, she had glanced at the trending list. She didn't see Wan Yurou's name, but she did spot a trending topic about herself. However, Ye Qiusuo didn't click to see; she had no interest in knowing.","In fact, had she watched the recent episodes, Ye Qiusuo would have noticed the program team gradually reducing Wan Yurou's screen time without it being obvious.","Halfway through the recording, there was a mid-session break.","Seeing a message from a student asking a question, Ye Qiusuo walked out directly to call the student and explain in person.","\"Right, the C-band isn't sufficient. Try switching to the L-band...\" Ye Qiusuo pushed open a door and walked to a corner of a stairwell, which was slightly quieter.","Listening to the student's reply, Ye Qiusuo suddenly looked up towards the floor above. Someone was also on a phone call up there.","\"...It all comes down to that one vote from Xie Xi. He won't listen to the director,\" the person upstairs was still saying, voice lowered. \"Next week, arrange the revival segment. I need to get in. Then, after being revived, I'll win the championship. Isn't that kind of dramatic twist exactly what the audience wants to see?\"","\"Just steer the online discussion a bit. They'll definitely want me to win the championship... He's so arrogant only because he got famous early.\"","\"I know. I haven't told anyone about my connections. That person who had the voting dispute with Xie Xi before was the director's person.\"","Ye Qiusuo suddenly realized who the person on the phone upstairs was.","—Lu Mingzhe, the male lead from the book."]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9","paragraphs":["Lu Mingzhe, as the male lead in the original book, once again fully embodies the dross of the author's writing style.","Ye Qiusuo was forced to read the entire book at the time and disliked the characters in it immensely. She doesn't read many novels of this type and lacks the vocabulary to describe it.","If someone who frequently reads romance novels were to say it, Lu Mingzhe is the classic, old-school flavor of an overbearing young master.","His family background is decent. As the second son, with his older brother holding things up, he is free to focus on having fun. Entering the entertainment industry was merely a whim. With his brother paving the way for him behind the scenes, his path has been smooth sailing, even to the point of completely stealing Xie Xi's thunder.","The author did not detail the incident of Lu Mingzhe making a phone call in the stairwell in the book, only mentioning in passing that while others were gathered in groups talking, he went to the stairwell to avoid too much interaction with the contestants, solely to portray his overbearing side and his act of doting on Wan Yurou.","Looking at it now, many things the author didn't elaborate on could also be said to mean that everyone has their own calculations, not as simple as depicted in the original text.","Ye Qiusuo walked back, finished her last sentence with the student, and hung up the phone. She stood in the corridor, glancing sideways at the closed door.","So this is the original male lead.","\"Hey, Professor Ye, the program is about to start, you should hurry inside.\" A staff member specifically came out to find her.","Ye Qiusuo nodded and went in with the staff member.","The moment she entered, the recording studio fell silent for an instant before everyone pretended to converse nonchalantly.","This person had attracted everyone's attention.","\"What is the Chinese name for MLCC? A. Composite Ceramic Camera B. Multilayer Ceramic Chip Capacitor...\"","As soon as Ye Qiusuo sat down, the host said a few words of interlude and then began reading the question.","\"What do our guests think about this question?\"","\"I think it's A. Its Chinese translation, when turned into an abbreviation, just happens to be MLCC,\" a guest raised their hand and said.","Only ten civilian guests remained on stage, so speaking had become much more casual than before. They could simply raise their hands, and the host would call on them.","Without a second thought, Ye Qiusuo pressed B.","Host: \"... Our Professor Ye has already made her choice? Won't you reconsider?\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded.","\"Have any of our celebrity guests on stage started choosing?\" The host turned to look at the five people on stage and noticed two had already made their selections. \"Our Teacher Dong made his choice very quickly this time. Are you sure of the answer?\"","The other person was Wan Yurou, but obviously, calling on her wouldn't generate as much buzz.","Dong Junjian chuckled and said, \"How would I know what that abbreviation stands for? Following Professor Ye's choice is sure to be right.\"","Ye Qiusuo narrowed her eyes slightly. This was a plot point from the book appearing, only the target had been switched to her.","Sure enough, next, two more guests on stage chose the same answer as Ye Qiusuo.","Wan Yurou sat upright, a proper smile on her face, but inwardly she was feeling somewhat irritated. She had also chosen B, yet everyone seemed to be ignoring her.","\"I'll choose the same answer as Yurou.\" Xia Zhoubing specifically stood up and peeked at the answer on Wan Yurou's screen beside him.","The host laughed, \"Esteemed guests, this kind of freedom will end in the sixth episode. In the final championship round, none of you will be able to see each other's answers.\"","\"Let's see the correct option quickly.\" Dong Junjian urged.","\"The correct answer is... B.\"","\"See, following Professor Ye never leads you wrong.\"","Even without a camera on Ye Qiusuo, someone was cueing her into the scene. Once this episode aired, it would be hard for Ye Qiusuo not to attract attention.","After the recording finished, even a staff member came over to ask if she needed a parking pass.","These passes were originally only given to celebrities, staff, and the like. Civilian guests didn't have this privilege of being able to drive directly into the TV station's underground parking lot.","Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment and accepted it.","\"Professor Ye.\" Wan Yurou came over from the stage area, smiling brightly. \"I didn't know you were also at Tianqiu Tech Company that day, so I didn't say hello. Would you like to go get some supper together tonight?\"","\"No need.\" Ye Qiusuo declined. She preferred to go back.","Xia Zhoubing walked over, his eyes sweeping between Ye Qiusuo and Wan Yurou before saying, \"Professor Ye, we're all young people, and we've recorded five episodes together now. Let's have supper and get to know each other.\"","\"I already know who you are.\" Ye Qiusuo remained unmoved.","\"We just want to befriend Professor Ye, that's all.\" Xia Zhoubing's expression turned somewhat ugly. He wasn't used to being rejected by young women and felt he was losing face.","Wan Yurou tucked a stray strand of hair behind her ear, breaking the awkward silence gently. \"It's getting late. Professor Ye probably needs to go back and rest. We won't disturb you then. Let's get together next time we have the chance.\"","One doesn't hit a smiling face. Ye Qiusuo also had no intention of getting entangled with them. She nodded as a polite response and then turned to leave.","\"This Professor Ye is way too arrogant.\" Xia Zhoubing felt rather annoyed inside.","Senior Dong Junjian, who was passing by, glanced at him, thinking to himself that refusing to have supper with them was considered arrogant? This kid, young as he is, has sure picked up the bad habits of the industry quickly.","...","News of Ye Qiusuo recording the show, spread by who knows which meddlesome students, reached the office. People greeted her all the way, and even the dean and her colleagues found out.","\"Xiao Ye, you must win glory for our university.\" The dean said with great seriousness, \"I will definitely watch the show every week.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","The dean pulled Ye Qiusuo aside and whispered, \"The president specifically called yesterday to ask about you.\"","In the later subtitles, every time Ye Qiusuo appeared, the introduction given was \"Project Lead at Tianqiu Tech Company,\" never mentioning Huajing University. The president found it rather distressing.","Huajing University has had a tough time in recent years, often labeled a 'declining 985'. It's not that they lack top-tier programs, but the names of those programs don't sound impressive or lofty, so students aren't aware.","\"During the next recording, I'll ask if the introduction can be changed.\" Ye Qiusuo understood the dean's meaning.","The dean immediately beamed with joy. \"Our faculty will have to rely on you from now on, Xiao Ye.\"","If the president is happy, applying for project funding will be easier in the future.","Ye Qiusuo entered her office. Not long after she sat down, there was a knock on the door.","\"Come in.\" Ye Qiusuo looked up towards the door and saw it was one of the students she supervised. \"What is it?\"","\"Professor Ye, I... I want to change advisors.\" The student came in and hesitated for a moment before speaking.","The pen Ye Qiusuo was holding paused on the page of the book. She put down the pen and leaned back slightly. \"Have a seat first.\"","The student gauged her expression, felt that Ye Qiusuo wasn't as angry as imagined, and relaxed a bit as they sat down.","\"Can you tell me the reason?\" This was the first time Ye Qiusuo was supervising students, and in less than three months, one already wanted to change advisors.","Changing advisors isn't extremely difficult, but it's not a simple matter either.","This student was a high-scoring student assigned initially, partly because the faculty wanted to support Ye Qiusuo as a new advisor.","\"I don't really adapt well to your teaching style, so...\" the student said awkwardly.","\"Which advisor would you like to follow? I can speak to them for you.\" Ye Qiusuo understood perfectly well that the student was making excuses. It had only been a few months; some advisors hadn't even begun teaching their students yet, so how could teaching style be an issue?","The student was taken aback, clearly not expecting Ye Qiusuo to be so accommodating, and grew bolder.","\"I'd like to follow Professor Ye Qiusu. I originally thought I would be assigned to her, but I ended up with you instead.\" The student had pondered this for a long time, always feeling that Ye Qiusuo was too young and was just a gimmick for university recruitment. He wanted to follow Professor Ye Qiusu, work on more projects, and secure a better future.","\"Go back and wait for news. I'll communicate with Professor Ye.\" Since the student wanted to leave, Ye Qiusuo did not try to persuade him to stay. As for the projects she had been planning to assign to them, she would naturally put those on hold for now.","The student left in high spirits, completely unaware of what he had just missed.","He could never have imagined just how much he would come to regret it in the future."]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10","paragraphs":["Changing advisors might not be a major issue, but it's certainly not a minor one either. Upon hearing the news, the dean rushed over.","\"What's going on? Why change advisors all of a sudden?\" This student had been personally selected by the dean and assigned to Ye Qiusuo, who initially seemed outstanding with high scores and a good background.","\"He doesn't adapt well to my teaching style.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't mention that the student had requested the change; she didn't really care about that.","The dean was taken aback, then tried to persuade her: \"This student transferred from Tsinghua or Peking University, his foundation is solid, he'd be easy to guide. Why not give it another try?\"","Ye Qiusuo was a new advisor. Having a student with a strong foundation would save a lot of trouble.","\"I've already contacted another advisor for him to transfer to.\"","The dean: \"...Alright then.\"","But the matter wasn't so easily resolved.","Ye Qiusu, of course, was willing to take on a high-achieving student, especially since the student's family had some connection to hers. She had had her eye on him during the initial assignment but he was given to Ye Qiusuo by the dean's office.","Now, with Ye Qiusuo approaching her directly, Ye Qiusu seized the initiative. She agreed to take the student, but on the condition that Ye Qiusuo also take one of her own students.","\"I have too many students to manage properly. An exchange would be just right,\" Ye Qiusu said, sitting in her office and pulling out a student file. \"This student. You take him.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned. Taking on another student wasn't the issue, but swapping students so openly as an advisor—what would the student think?","Ye Qiusu had held significant sway in the department for years and never considered the students' feelings. She had been dissatisfied with that particular student for a long time. He had transferred from an ordinary second-tier university, his foundation was terribly weak, and he was all thumbs in the lab.","Since Ye Qiusu wouldn't budge, the matter was settled.","To avoid making the student feel awkward, Ye Qiusuo called her students together and specifically explained the situation.","\"Ding Hong isn't very familiar with the lab yet. Make sure you all help him out,\" Ye Qiusuo said, not mentioning the departing student, just instructing her group to look after the new arrival.","This was partly the dean's oversight. He had thought Ding Hong, despite his weaker foundation, might fare better under Ye Qiusu's guidance, never expecting she would dislike him.","As soon as Ye Qiusuo left, her students erupted in discussion. If they had reservations about her before the semester started, after these few months, everyone was convinced by her competence and grateful she was their advisor.","\"Meng Weiren kept saying he didn't belong here recently. Did he ask to change advisors?\"","\"Most likely.\"","\"I heard Professor Ye Qiusu called Ding Hong in yesterday and told him to leave.\"","\"That's not very decent of Professor Ye.\"","It all happened very suddenly, especially for Ding Hong. That day, he had even gone to the lab to record his latest data, wanting to see things through properly.","Meanwhile, Meng Weiren had already moved all his belongings in and was chatting amiably with the other lab students as if he, not Ding Hong, had been working there all along.","Ding Hong had worked so hard, transferring from a second-tier university to the flagship program at Huajing University, arriving full of hope. He never imagined that within just a few months, his advisor would tell him to change his research topic and switch advisors.","Technically, the student's consent was needed, but with the advisor holding so much power, refusing risked future retaliation. Ding Hong had no choice but to agree.","\"Ding Hong?\"","Someone stood at the lab door, knocked, and called his name.","Everyone inside looked over. Seeing it was Ye Qiusuo, Meng Weiren averted his eyes, quietly turned his back to the door, and pretended to calibrate an instrument.","Ye Qiusuo didn't enter, just stood at the doorway. \"Get your things. I'll take you to see the new lab.\"","No one expected Professor Ye to personally come and collect the student. For a moment, all the students in the lab looked at Ding Hong with surprise.","Ding Hong, a young man in his twenties, suddenly felt his eyes sting. He lowered his head, pressed his lips together, swallowed the lump in his throat, and gave a low acknowledgment.","Ye Qiusuo waited quietly for the student to record his final set of data on the computer. After he came out, she didn't say much, simply leading him to the new lab.","Thanks to her instructions and the other students' sense of empathy, Ding Hong was met with rare warmth.","\"You've really landed a sweet deal,\" Lin Lu said, pulling Ding Hong aside after their advisor left. \"Let me tell you, our advisor is more than just a bit better than the other professors in the department. You'll see. Meng Weiren is the fool for jumping ship in such a hurry.\"","\"Exactly. He'll probably regret it someday.\"","...","With the student matter settled, Ye Qiusuo found some free time to sort out her finances.","Apart from Tianqiu Tech, she also took on interesting projects from other companies and even owned a few firms herself. Consequently, she had accumulated a decent sum. However, after calculating everything, she realized her funds would only last a year or two at most.","Time to make money.","For the first time, Professor Ye, who had never worried about money, felt a sense of urgency.","Thus, she requested payment from Xie Xi's agent.","They had agreed on an hourly rate, so Ye Qiusuo calculated it based on the standard fee for a Tsinghua/Peking University professor mentioned in the original book.","Sister Wei didn't find this odd. She mentioned it to Xie Xi, who, to her surprise, seemed somewhat reluctant.","During their weekend tutoring session, Xie Xi looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"What if I pay you with a song instead?\"","Xie Xi didn't know what came over him to suddenly suggest such a thing.","\"No.\" Ye Qiusuo flatly refused. She wanted money. What good was a song?","She didn't voice that last thought, but her expression conveyed it perfectly, thoroughly irritating Xie Xi.","The papers on the desk rustled loudly as he flipped through them, betraying his agitation.","Professor Ye sat at another desk, listened for a moment, then turned her head. \"Are you a child?\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Once Xie Xi had calmed down, he couldn't stand the quiet in the room and struck up a conversation. \"What's it like being a PhD?\"","Having been paid, Professor Ye dutifully answered his question. \"Not much to it.\"","She had skipped grades all through school and was used to being strong.","Xie Xi glanced at Ye Qiusuo, clearly dissatisfied with her perfunctory answer, but he didn't press further, switching topics instead.","\"How did it feel seeing yourself on TV?\"","\"Didn't feel anything.\" A laptop sat open in front of Ye Qiusuo. She glanced at the literature website, then at his motionless hands. \"Xie Xi, stop stalling.\"","Xie Xi: \"...So annoying. Every time she says my name, the back of my neck goes cold.\""]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11","paragraphs":["The Sunday evening program recording was an unchangeable fixture, and Ye Qiusuo adapted quickly. In her view, recording the show was essentially clocking in on time to answer questions. Moreover, a friend had mentioned that the overall top scorer would receive a five-million-yuan prize.","Professor Ye now... her spirit would waver a little whenever money was mentioned.","However, she still underestimated the female lead's influence.","As soon as she arrived this evening, everyone was suddenly notified that the program would be delayed by an hour because Wan Yurou had been invited to participate in \"Tomorrow's Star\" as a guest performance partner. It was unclear how Wan Yurou's team and the program crew negotiated it, but they actually managed to get the director to agree to delay the recording by an hour.","This plot development was not unfamiliar to Ye Qiusuo; the original book had written about it. However, the book stated that Wan Yurou would be a guest performance partner during the finals, whereas now it was several episodes earlier.","The finals would invite three guest performance partners, who should be formidable figures from the music industry. Coincidentally, Wan Yurou had shot to fame through \"Knowledge Q&A.\" As a female lead who could both sing and act, she was naturally invited, even though she didn't have any representative musical works, yet the audience raised no objections. Simultaneously, the song she sang with the male lead, Lu Mingzhe, was beautifully dubbed by fans as their \"love anthem.\"","As for now... since Professor Ye was still on the program, the discussion heat around Wan Yurou was calm and peaceful, perfectly fitting a lower-tier B-list celebrity, with no signs of having shot to fame.","But after all, she was the female lead from the book. Even under these circumstances, she could still become a guest performance partner for \"Tomorrow's Star.\"","\"Are we supposed to just wait here for an hour?\"","\"Wouldn't it be better to postpone recording this episode altogether?\"","\"Why didn't anyone inform us about this beforehand?\"","\"Exactly, the program crew should have at least given us a heads-up.\"","...","The guests on and off stage didn't look too pleased. Several guests from within the entertainment industry still cared about saving face and wouldn't speak bluntly, but the civilian contestants had no such reservations and openly complained.","\"Our Yurou was also called to help at the last minute; it was a sudden situation. Please understand.\" Wan Yurou's two assistants brought in a pile of snacks and drinks, apologizing to each guest inside. \"Everyone, have something to eat first, replenish your energy, just consider it a break.\"","Wan Yurou's team had actually contacted the program crew about this matter several days prior and reached an agreement. However, the program crew felt that delaying by an hour didn't warrant specifically notifying these guests. Furthermore... if they were unhappy, they would blame Wan Yurou.","There was a hint of deliberately stirring trouble in this.","\"Director, since we have nothing to do anyway, why don't we all go visit the set next door?\" Xia Zhoubing suddenly called out.","\"Xia Zhoubing is right. Sitting here is just idle waiting,\" Jiang Fei nodded. \"We can watch for a bit and then come back.\"","Once these words were spoken, the civilian contestants were somewhat tempted. Coupled with the constant encouragement from the two celebrity guests, the director finally had to concede. Those who wanted to go could go, and those who didn't could wait here.","Ye Qiusuo sat in her seat, thought for a few seconds, then stood up and followed the group. She wanted to see if the female lead was still collaborating with the male lead.","\"Tomorrow's Star\" was recording its revival round tonight. There were three hundred audience members present and a large stage, so they had temporarily moved to the first floor, where there was more space for setup.","With the program crew's coordination, Ye Qiusuo and the others easily entered to watch, except they didn't have voting devices like the three hundred audience members.","The stage occupied two-thirds of the entire space. Pushing the door open, one could immediately feel a wave of musical heat, but only the three seated mentors were on stage; the contestants were probably all backstage preparing. Female audience members made up the majority. Ye Qiusuo was tall, so squeezed in the middle she could still see the stage fairly well.","She saw Xie Xi sitting in the mentor's chair. The audience below was screaming his name hysterically, while the two mentors beside him seemed almost anonymous.","On stage, Xie Xi lowered his head, bored, flipping through the notebook on the table—more precisely, his own homework notebook. That afternoon, he had deliberately dragged his feet. He still had a few lines left on a one-page assignment, and he hadn't finished last week's tasks either, lying that he hadn't brought them. At the time, Ye Qiusuo had said to have his assistant bring them to her during the evening recording.","Thinking of that young professor, Xie Xi couldn't help but pout: Didn't a PhD know that his kind of dyslexia was incurable?","Just as these thoughts crossed his mind, Xie Xi caught sight of a familiar figure from the corner of his eye.","His hand paused. He turned to look—it really was her.","The area below was filled with audience members who screamed from time to time and others who excitedly swayed to the music. Ye Qiusuo stood motionless in the middle, exceptionally conspicuous.","Xie Xi's first reaction: Had Professor Ye become so dedicated to her job that she chased him to the venue to check his homework?!","At that moment, Xie Xi did exactly what many students do when caught by their teacher while trying to finish homework: he straightened his back and slowly, bit by bit, moved that homework notebook on the table downward, trying to hide it.","In fact, after glancing at Xie Xi initially, Ye Qiusuo hadn't looked at him again. Instead, her gaze fell on the mentor sitting next to him.","In the original book, this person should have had a plot point... She couldn't recall.","This was extremely unusual for Ye Qiusuo. Her memory was excellent, let alone the fact that less than a month had passed since she read the book.","Professor Ye had to make a hypothesis: would her memory of this book become increasingly blurry in the future?","On stage, seeing Ye Qiusuo frown, Xie Xi felt a chill on the back of his neck and a sudden surge of guilt.","Would she rush up later and drag him out, like those homeroom teachers grabbing students from internet cafes?","He had never had such an experience in public before. It seemed a bit... thrilling.","The music in the venue suddenly stopped. The host came on to speak, and the competition officially began. The audience below quieted for a moment, then erupted in screams again, this time shouting the names of various contestants.","The revival round, also called the challenge round. Among those previously eliminated, four would reappear on the stage tonight. They could freely challenge the bottom four of the nine contestants who advanced from the previous episode. If no challenger succeeded, the revival round would end. If multiple challengers advanced, they would continue to compete against each other until only one remained to enter the top nine.","There were two ways for an individual to advance. First, successfully challenge a contestant to revive, taking the eliminated contestant's ranking. Second, the competition would give the contestant a choice to continue challenging a higher-ranked contestant, but if they failed, both the challenge result and their revival would be voided.","Simultaneously, four guest performance partners would also take the stage, appearing with the challengers. The challenged top-nine contestants would also collaborate with guest performance partners. The key lay in who adapted better and whose synergy with the guest performance partner appealed more to the audience's votes.","Clearly, the challenge round wasn't easy. The first three challengers all failed, leaving the stage regretfully once more. When it was the fourth challenger's turn to come on stage, another wave of screams surged from the audience below.","Ye Qiusuo looked up. The fourth challenger was Lu Mingzhe. His appearance was indeed handsome and upright, fitting the novel's description of the male lead. However, ever since overhearing that phone call he made in the stairwell, Professor Ye had doubts about this male lead's character.","Since Lu Mingzhe was the fourth to appear, he had no choice left and directly faced the contestant ranked sixth.","The challenger was to perform first. Lu Mingzhe, dressed in a sapphire blue suit, took the stage, gave a brief speech about his return, and prepared to begin the competition.","\"The song we will perform is 'Colorful Grid.'\"","All the stage lights went out. A deep, magnetic voice came through the microphone, reaching the audience's ears and eliciting waves of screams.","At that moment, a single spotlight lit up in the center of the stage, shining on two people. One of them was Wan Yurou. She wore a light purple gown, with one hand resting on Lu Mingzhe's shoulder and the other holding a microphone, her index finger raised to her lips in a 'shush' gesture, while she sent a wink towards the camera.","It was a perfect blend of playfulness and gentleness.","The two looked like a perfect match as they performed the song.","When they finished, the audience erupted into the loudest cheers of the night so far.","\"Alright, let's ask our two performers to take a short rest while the other contestant prepares,\" the host said, ushering them to the side.","Next was the collaboration between Wan Yurou and the contestant in sixth place.","People are visual creatures. With such a hard act to follow, no matter how Wan Yurou and the sixth-place contestant tried to pair up, it just didn't seem right. This contestant was only wearing casual clothes and had an average build and appearance.","Wan Yurou also didn't include the little gestures and the intimacy during the duet that she had shown before.","The supporting role of the guest singer was greatly diminished, even to the point of becoming a hindrance.","As expected, when the two contestants were invited back on stage, the judges' evaluations all leaned in favor of Lu Mingzhe.","\"What do you think, Xie Xi?\" the female judge next to him asked.","\"Lu Mingzhe and his guest singer performed better overall. They could drive the atmosphere. However...\" Xie Xi, leaning on the table with one hand and holding the microphone, continued, \"There was a problem with the music arrangement team. The backing track for the later contestant was faster.\"","'Colorful Grid' is a sentimental love song. With a faster backing track, that lingering, melancholic atmosphere naturally diminished.","The stage and audience fell silent instantly.","\"I don't think so. I just listened, and it sounded the same to me,\" male judge Wu Xuezheng was the first to speak up.","\"Yes, I didn't hear any difference either. Maybe there's an issue with your in-ear monitor?\" the female judge also chimed in.","\"My in-ears are fine. The problem was with the arranged backing track,\" Xie Xi stated with absolute certainty.","Lu Mingzhe's heart skipped a beat. What kind of ears did Xie Xi have? He could tell even though they had only sped it up by less than a second. Even the other contestant himself hadn't noticed.","Everyone said there was no mistake. Xie Xi still wanted to argue his point, but the sixth-place contestant himself gave up first, saying his performance in this round really wasn't satisfactory and it wasn't the fault of the music arrangers.","Xie Xi frowned, put down his microphone directly, crossed his arms, leaned back in his chair, and couldn't be bothered to argue further.","\"Alright, let's ask the audience judges to begin voting,\" the host quickly interjected.","For this comeback round, the judges had no voting power; only the 300 votes from the audience counted.","The result was predictable. Lu Mingzhe succeeded in his challenge with an absolute advantage.","The sixth-place contestant, as is the obligatory segment of such competitions, was on stage, tears streaming down his face, expressing his feelings about leaving the competition.","Normally, each judge would say a few words of comfort and encouragement at this point. Today, Xie Xi only had one sentence: \"Nothing to say.\"","What is there to say to someone who doesn't even believe in themselves?","\"How can he be like that? The contestant is crying. He could at least say something.\"","\"Sigh, if he weren't arrogant, he wouldn't be Xie Xi.\"","...","Ye Qiusuo stood quietly offstage, listening to the girls around her chattering similar remarks.","Before leaving, she turned for one last look at Xie Xi on the stage. He was looking down at the contestant information cards on the table, utterly detached from everyone else in the venue."]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12","paragraphs":["After the guest performance ended, the guests of \"Knowledge Q&A\" left with a sense of unfinished business. The competition wasn't over yet, and they felt that staying at the venue might let them witness some unexpected gossip.","\"That stage performance by Lu Mingzhe and Wan Yurou just now was quite good.\"","\"When Xie Xi was speaking, I noticed the expressions of those two mentors looked a bit off.\"","\"How could they look normal? They're all musicians, yet none of them noticed the issue, only he said it was too fast. That's a slap in the face, isn't it?\"","\"I thought both accompaniments sounded pretty similar, didn't notice any problem.\"","On their way up, several people chatted casually, and some even directly asked Wan Yurou, who was with them, if she felt any difference between the accompaniments in the two rounds.","Wan Yurou had only changed her clothes; her stage makeup, with a touch of glamour at the corners of her eyes, was still on. She smiled and said, \"My skills are limited; I didn't notice any difference.\"","This was a clever answer, offending no one. Even if there was a problem with the accompaniment, her first half provided the caveat of her 'limited skills.'","However, those around her clearly chose to hear only the latter half, immediately feeling emboldened to continue discussing whether Xie Xi was throwing his weight around or was merely overrated.","For someone standing at an unreachable peak, ordinary people not only look up in admiration but also sometimes harbor darker thoughts of wanting to pull that person down.","\"Those two mentors' skills have always been inferior to Xie Xi's, haven't they? It's normal they couldn't hear it,\" Ye Qiusuo suddenly spoke up as they exited the elevator.","Everyone: \"...\" They were all too familiar with this tone. It felt like if they refuted even one sentence, Professor Ye would immediately list various data to prove them wrong.","\"Hahaha, seems that's the case.\"","\"Speaking of which, Xie Xi's songs are truly great to listen to.\"","The entire topic immediately shifted direction.","Wan Yurou turned to look at Ye Qiusuo and asked, as if casually, \"Professor Ye, do you know Xie Xi?\"","Professor Ye answered matter-of-factly, \"His advertisements are plastered all over the streets and alleys.\"","Wan Yurou was left speechless. Was that the kind of 'knowing' she meant?","By the time they entered the recording set, the guests' small talk had already shifted from the accompaniment issue to how high Xie Xi's endorsement fees might actually be. However, after just a few sentences, everyone began preparing to record the program.","Only Professor Ye remained seated, her mind wandering: ...Xie Xi's fee for a single endorsement is actually that much? It's enough to cover half the funding for one of my projects.","\"Welcome our five celebrity guests and twelve civilian guests to the sixth episode of 'Knowledge Q&A.'\"","As soon as this voice sounded, the sense of achievement Wan Yurou had just gained from \"Tomorrow's Star\" instantly dissipated. This place had now become Ye Qiusuo's domain.","The recording proceeded in an orderly manner. Listening to Ye Qiusuo explain the answers, Wan Yurou felt numb inside, only wanting to finish recording this program as soon as possible and find the next show that could make her popular.","Ye Qiusuo answered all the questions, once again achieving a perfect score, moving one step closer to the one million prize. Her mood improved a little.","As soon as the director signaled the end of recording with the light, Professor Ye immediately walked out, ready to return to work. She had recently taken on several freelance jobs with good pay.","\"Professor Ye.\"","A young man in his twenties called out to Ye Qiusuo at the doorway.","It was Xie Xi's assistant, Zhang Dong.","\"Did you bring Xie Xi's homework?\" Ye Qiusuo asked, then glanced at his empty hands.","\"The homework... Brother Xi, uh, I left it next door. Professor Ye, could you wait here a moment?\" Zhang Dong stammered, then turned and ran off.","Ye Qiusuo frowned, a flicker of confusion in her eyes, but she quickly masked it and stood to the side, waiting.","In an empty room nearby.","Xie Xi was hunched over a vacant counter, scribbling something.","\"Brother Xi, are you done yet?\" Zhang Dong hurried back in a fluster, urging Xie Xi. \"Professor Ye is waiting outside!\"","\"Just a little bit more, what's the rush?\" Xie Xi turned his head, looking strangely at his assistant.","Zhang Dong said awkwardly, \"Brother Xi, I feel for you. Professor Ye really does seem intimidating.\" He even looked at Xie Xi with eyes full of sympathy.","\"Did she get angry because you didn't bring the homework?\" Xie Xi panicked a little; he had sent Zhang Dong to scope things out.","\"Not really,\" Zhang Dong scratched his cheek. \"Professor Ye even nodded at me.\"","Relieved that she hadn't gotten angry about the homework, Xie Xi asked, \"Then what did you mean just now?\"","\"Brother Xi, don't you feel your legs go a bit weak when you see Professor Ye?\" The assistant recalled how Professor Ye had first looked at his face, then his hands, with a gaze that seemed to see right through everything, eerily similar to a high school principal.","\"No,\" Xie Xi glanced at his assistant. \"No backbone.\"","His legs had never gone weak. At most... the back of his neck felt a chill.","Xie Xi sped up, finished writing the last line, rubbed his eyes, and tossed the homework to his assistant. \"Give it to her.\"","After finishing the recording, he had rushed here to make up the homework. For him, looking at words was like watching them dance. After filling several pages, he felt dizzy and his eyes ached.","Zhang Dong took the homework and ran outside. Xie Xi thought for a moment and followed him out.","\"Professor Ye, this is our Brother Xi's homework. Please take a look.\" Zhang Dong saw her actually start flipping through it and quickly added, \"Our Brother Xi does the homework you assign every single day. He's very diligent.\"","Ye Qiusuo flipped to the last page, lightly brushed her fingertip across it, and a black smudge appeared. She raised a brow slightly. \"Did he just finish making this up?\"","\"How could that be? Our Brother Xi finished writing all this yesterday. He's at home now.\" Although his legs felt a bit weak, Zhang Dong, as an assistant, bravely covered for Xie Xi.","Ye Qiusuo was merely asking, not intending to pursue the matter. Instead, someone exposed themselves.","Xie Xi, who had followed behind his assistant, had originally been standing around the corner. But seeing Zhang Dong's fawning smile—a smile he'd never even shown to Xie Xi himself—and unable to hear what the two were saying, he finally just walked straight over.","Just as Zhang Dong finished saying Xie Xi was at home, Xie Xi appeared right behind him.","Ye Qiusuo closed the homework book and handed it directly to the person behind Zhang Dong.","Zhang Dong turned around, confused. \"?!\"","\"Don't rush your homework next time; it's easy to make mistakes.\" Professor Ye offered this advice, then prepared to turn and leave.","\"Hey.\"","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at him.","\"...Professor Ye.\" Under her gaze, Xie Xi immediately changed his tone, lacking the air of a big star entirely. \"Besides writing this, you should teach me other things too. I paid for it.\"","Mentioning money, Xie Xi straightened his chest, the guilt from making up the homework instantly fading.","\"Brother Xi, you can't even finish these few pages of homework,\" Zhang Dong leaned in to remind Xie Xi quietly.","Xie Xi pushed away the assistant who had leaned in and looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"My previous private tutors used to read to me every week. Next week, you should read something to me too.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at him for a moment, then nodded. \"Fine.\"","So agreeable?","After Ye Qiusuo left, Xie Xi's confidence swelled.","\"No backbone. What's there to be afraid of with a professor?\" Xie Xi expressed his disdain for his leg-weakening assistant.","\"Well, I'm still scared,\" Zhang Dong muttered quietly as he followed behind.","...","The first few days of the week passed uneventfully. When Saturday arrived, Xie Xi parked himself in front of the TV, ready to watch \"Knowledge Q&A.\" He had recently become somewhat hooked on this show.","If nothing else, watching Ye Qiusuo lay out the answers point by point with evidence gave him a strangely satisfying feeling.","There's always this feeling: So this is what a genius is like?","\"In the field of engineering, the system pressure for pneumatic transmission generally falls within the range of 0.4 to 0.7 MPa...\"","Xie Xi had just started watching Ye Qiusuo explain a question about cylinder selection when his agent, Sister Wei, suddenly came in and turned off his TV.","\"I'm studying,\" Xie Xi said with a straight face.","\"Did you watch the program recorded last week?\"","\"The Star of Tomorrow\" aired earlier than \"Knowledge Q&A.\"","Sister Wei sighed. \"I shouldn't have let you take on that show. I didn't expect the production team to be so reckless.\"","Originally, she thought it would be good for Xie Xi to try something new and assumed no one in the industry would dare openly bully the most popular singer in the music scene. Yet, \"The Star of Tomorrow\" dared to secretly trip him up, their editing twisting nothing into something.","\"Now everyone is saying you threw a tantrum in front of the contestant.\"","\"I was throwing a tantrum,\" Xie Xi said, growing impatient at the memory. \"He himself couldn't even tell if he sang well or not, and he still wanted me to hug him and offer blessings?\"","Sister Wei sighed again. \"Forget it. If you changed, you wouldn't be Xie Xi anymore. I'll go find someone to handle this.\"","After Sister Wei left, Xie Xi wasn't in the mood to continue watching the program. He called his assistant over. \"Read the trending searches to me.\"","Zhang Dong had just sneakily finished checking the trends and really didn't want to read them. \"Brother Xi, maybe we could read them tomorrow morning?\"","\"Read,\" Xie Xi said, opening the trending list on his own phone and tossing it in front of Zhang Dong.","“Okay,” Zhang Dong replied, holding the phone with trembling hands as he read, “Xie Xi rejects eliminated contestant's hug; Lu Mingzhe and Wan Yurou hold hands and gaze tenderly at each other; challenged contestant openly expresses sadness...”","\"I'm in the number one spot?\"","\"Brother Xi, your popularity is high, it's unavoidable.\"","Xie Xi scoffed. \"They write about every trivial thing. Read the comments under my trending topic.\"","\"...Xie Xi is getting more and more arrogant; feel bad for the contestant; XiXi started to help him by mentioning the accompaniment issue, but the contestant himself said it was fine, who wouldn't be upset by that?\"","\"Why are my fans' comments ranked so low?\" Xie Xi asked upon hearing the third comment.","Xie Xi's fanbase was massive. In the past, whenever he clapped back at some shady reporters, fans would always come out to defend him, getting their comments liked to the top.","“Brother Xi, the wind direction in the industry has been a bit strange lately. There must be new capital entering the scene,” the assistant said helplessly. “Sister Wei suspects someone is specifically targeting you.”","Active fans can't always compete with team data.","This kind of situation had happened before, back when Xie Xi first rose to fame—widespread negative press—and only faded completely after he reached his current status.","\"Brother Xi,\" Zhang Dong said, as the atmosphere between them grew increasingly serious, suddenly remembering a crucial matter. \"Have you finished your homework?\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Seeing his expression, Zhang Dong knew the answer was definitely no.","\"Why didn't you remind me earlier?\" Xie Xi shifted the blame.","\"I reminded you the morning before yesterday, while you were gaming,\" Zhang Dong said, feeling wronged. He really didn't want to deliver homework to Professor Ye again; it always made him nervous. Last Sunday night, he even had a nightmare about being back in high school.","All that talk of negative press and trending searches became irrelevant to Xie Xi. Right now, his mind was solely focused on pulling an all-nighter to finish his homework."]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13","paragraphs":["#Lu Mingzhe & Wan Yurou Sweetness#","Late at night, this hashtag rose to the top of the trending list, surpassing the one about Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo.","Netizens thought the two looked particularly sweet standing together singing a duet with deep emotion. The marketing accounts made excellent GIFs, which spread extremely widely for a time.","\"It looks like Lu Mingzhe's side bought the trending spot,\" Mo Hong said in a good mood, scrolling through the hot search list.","\"What's his background?\" Wan Yurou sat in front of the mirror, carefully smoothing eye cream with her slender fingers, and asked her agent.","\"It's still not very clear yet. It's said he has some connections behind him. It would be best if you could build a relationship with him.\" Mo Hong scrolled through her phone and suddenly smiled mockingly. \"It seems Xie Xi and his team haven't been having much luck lately.\"","Wan Yurou gave her agent a strange look, not understanding why she was so focused on Xie Xi. Their two teams shouldn't have had any contact.","\"There's a banquet. You should attend. I heard Lu Mingzhe will be there. Take the chance to chat with him more,\" Mo Hong instructed.","Wan Yurou turned her head and asked, \"He's going too? Has he already signed with a company?\"","\"Xinyou has already signed him to a five-year contract, with two solo albums to be released.\" This information wasn't hard to find out.","Wan Yurou turned back to patting essence onto her face, but she now had a new impression of Lu Mingzhe.","Getting a champion's contract before even winning the championship? Who would believe he had no background.","It seemed this connection was worth holding onto carefully.","Wan Yurou gave her reflection in the mirror a soft, charming smile.","...","In one evening, Sister Wei visited every well-known musician in the industry she could. She wanted to know if there was really a problem with the accompaniment track.","The show had already aired. Sister Wei had someone clip the video of Lu Mingzhe and the sixth-place contestant singing \"Color Grid\" and took it to various top musicians for comparison, including the original singer.","It was proven that the accompaniment at the time was indeed half a second too fast.","Some musicians didn't notice it at first but realized it after slow-motion playback.","\"You could call this amount of time an error, but the accompaniment technicians for \"Star of Tomorrow\" are considered top-tier in the industry,\" a musician privately told Sister Wei. \"The possibility of tampering is greater.\"","Since it wasn't Xie Xi's fault, Sister Wei had even fewer reservations.","At 6 AM sharp on Sunday morning, nine top musicians from the industry jointly issued a statement saying the contestant's accompaniment on \"Star of Tomorrow\" had problems.","\"It's rare to see Xie Xi comment on the accompaniment. I listened repeatedly to the song the two contestants sang yesterday and found the accompaniment indeed had a problem. The melody is the core of \"Color Grid\"; once the accompaniment is off, it greatly affects the contestant.\"","This was from a renowned musician in the industry with absolute pitch.","Several others who followed said similar things.","Early in the morning, there weren't many people online for the gossip, but by 10 AM, the matter swept through the entire music circle like a whirlwind.","The hashtag criticizing Xie Xi hadn't even faded when a new one with his name popped up again.","Netizens were shocked. These big shots usually stayed out of sight; it was the first time they appeared together in front of the public, and all for half a second?","[Xixi is in trouble, help comes from all sides, hahahaha.]","[Actually, their rigorous attitude is exactly the hope for the music scene.]","[So just because it was half a second fast, Lu Mingzhe couldn't advance in the competition?]","[How is that possible? Later, Lu Mingzhe directly challenged the first place and took their spot. Being eliminated earlier was purely an accident; he has the strength to win the championship.]","[Then what's there to discuss about this half-second? Can't there be an error?]","[The accompaniment technicians hired by \"Star of Tomorrow\" are touted as the best in the industry. Half a second is a mistake. That means the sixth-place contestant's individual performance was flawless; he lost because he didn't mesh well with his guest singer.]","[Speaking of which... I always felt that guest female singer in the first round was particularly sweet and put in a lot of effort, but seemed a bit perfunctory in the later round.]","[Same feeling.]","There were all sorts of comments mixed in, but the overall direction was the same: they believed Xie Xi was overly diligent, and the reason he didn't say more comforting or encouraging words on the show was just because he was frustrated by the lack of effort.","Of course, there was team manipulation involved; otherwise, public opinion couldn't have been reversed so quickly.","The funniest thing later was that the eliminated sixth-place contestant, after seeing the news, suddenly came out himself to subtly imply the program team had a mishap, causing him to not perform to his full potential.","But that's a story for later.","\"How many favors do I owe now?\" Xie Xi had been catching up on homework until 1 AM yesterday and didn't get up until 11 AM. Hearing his assistant read the Weibo posts from those musicians, he turned to ask his agent.","Sister Wei pushed a glass of milk towards him: \"A few are repaying favors from before. Old Rong wants you to collaborate on a song with him. The rest don't have any requests for now.\"","\"Got it.\" Xie Xi picked up the milk and drank it in one gulp, then stood up to have his assistant help him change clothes.","\"Going to Professor Ye's place this afternoon?\" Seeing him nod, Sister Wei said, \"I'll go with you to record the show tonight. With this blow-up, their accompaniment technician will probably have to be replaced.\"","Sister Wei didn't stay long. After seeing Xie Xi get up and finish his meal, and giving a few more instructions, she left.","After changing, Xie Xi didn't see his agent: \"Sister Wei left?\"","\"Something came up at the company. Xixi, when are you going to see Professor Ye?\" asked his life manager, Sister He.","\"Still early. Zhang Dong, remember to put my homework in the car.\" He had stayed up late to finish it and was even a little proud; he couldn't forget to bring it.","After saying this, Xie Xi curled up in front of the TV to play games again. He particularly liked brightly colored games.","...","\"Professor, are you in a hurry?\"","Ding Hong stayed in the lab all weekend. Today, he had a question he didn't quite understand, so he sent a message to his advisor. Unexpectedly, the professor asked if he was in the lab and came directly to answer his question.","He had been at Huajing University for a few months, but this was the first time he received such detailed guidance. He couldn't help getting excited and poured out all his doubts. Professor Ye answered each one carefully and even helped him shore up some basics.","Even during the meal, Ding Hong kept asking questions. After returning to the lab, Professor Ye was still willing to guide him. However, after 1:30 PM, Professor Ye glanced at her watch several times while speaking.","\"I have an appointment at two, I need to leave. If you have any more questions, send an email.\" Ye Qiusuo looked down at her phone and discovered Xie Xi had actually sent a voice message.","\"Okay, thank you, Professor.\" Ding Hong called out \"Professor\" with genuine respect this time, his earlier forced advisor-change resentment completely gone.","Ye Qiusuo only opened that voice message after leaving the lab building.","\"Professor Ye, I finished my homework!\"","Professor Ye: \"...\" What's so special about finishing it?","Clearly, Professor Ye, who was accustomed to completing tasks ahead of schedule from a young age, didn't quite understand the joy of procrastinating on homework, let alone the pleasure of finishing it right at the deadline.","Ye Qiusuo pushed open the classroom door. This time, Xie Xi wasn't buried in a game. Instead, he sat up straight, his eyes shining brightly as he looked at the door. As soon as he saw her, he immediately stood up, holding his homework notebook.","\"I finished this week's homework.\"","\"Hmm.\"","Hmm? He stayed up late to finish his homework and all he got was a 'Hmm'?!","The big star Xie was internally indignant. Just as he was about to speak, a look from Ye Qiusuo made him quiet down immediately.","Ye Qiusuo picked up his homework notebook and slowly flipped through it, her gaze stopping on the last page. After a long moment, she looked up. \"Did you write these six pages all in one go?\"","Xie Xi felt a bit guilty. \"No.\"","\"They get messier towards the end.\"","\"That's because I... wasn't feeling well.\" Xie Xi lowered his eyes halfway, putting on a 'heartbroken' expression. \"Everyone online is attacking me.\"","That incident from the show? She hadn't paid attention to the trending searches these past couple of days, but with the male and female leads starting to collaborate, according to the plot, Xie Xi getting targeted was normal.","\"Did you cry?\" Ye Qiusuo turned a page back, pointing at a circular stain on it.","Xie Xi stole a glance. That was from last night when he accidentally dripped some juice on it.","\"Professor.\" Xie Xi, wearing a look of 'enduring grief,' pulled the notebook back. \"I need to start my homework now.\"","If he didn't start writing soon, the fruity scent still clinging to the notebook would give him away.","Ye Qiusuo frowned, watching Xie Xi return to his seat and start copying with his head bowed. Was his psyche this fragile?","Could it be that he left the entertainment industry later because of psychological issues?","For a moment, Professor Ye felt some sympathy for Xie Xi. He hadn't done anything wrong, he was simply blocking the male lead's path and didn't like the female lead, and was thus sidelined.","Since he was already her student, Ye Qiusuo thought perhaps she could attend more psychology-related courses herself.","\"Last week you said you wanted to listen to me read?\" Ye Qiusuo asked, pulling out Xie Xi's homework notebook.","\"Professor Ye, if you read, do I still have to do the copying today?\" Xie Xi's first thought was to reduce his homework load.","Ultimately, the student's mental health was more important.","\"You don't have to write today.\" Ye Qiusuo found an inspirational essay on her computer and prepared to read it to Xie Xi.","Xie Xi immediately straightened his posture, ready to listen earnestly to whatever obscure, difficult book the PhD professor was about to read.","\"One must learn to be open-minded and let go. If online gossip is troubling, unplug the network cable and seek your true self. Here is a short story...\" It was Ye Qiusuo's first time reading this kind of chicken-soup-for-the-soul article.","As Professor Ye continued reading, Xie Xi's spine gradually relaxed more and more, until he finally just slumped over the desk, his mind filled with nothing but 'Is this it?'","\"Professor Ye, could you switch to something more interesting?\" Xie Xi said, then covered his mouth with his slender fingers to stifle a yawn.","\"You don't like listening to this?\"","What normal person would enjoy this? Xie Xi looked Ye Qiusuo up and down. Who would have thought a respected PhD would actually like this kind of inspirational fluff.","\"What else do you PhDs usually read besides this stuff?\" Xie Xi was very interested in the life of a doctoral student.","\"Research literature.\"","Those two words alone sounded incredibly boring.","Xie Xi pressed on. \"And what else? What leisure reading do you usually look at?\"","\"I don't read for leisure.\" Professor Ye's time was precious; she wished she could split every minute in two. Where would she find time for leisure reading?","Such an old fuddy-duddy.","\"Next week, I'll bring a book, and you can read that?\" Xie Xi wasn't very interested in being read to; he just wanted to slack off and write one less page of homework.","\"We only agreed on reading for this session. Next week you continue writing.\" Clearly, Professor Ye wasn't taking the bait.","Seeing that Ye Qiusuo had stopped reading and was about to make him start writing again, Xie Xi quickly said, \"Professor, please read that story from just now again. I feel I've gained some insight.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up at him, repeating, \"You've gained insight?\"","\"Yes!\" Xie Xi said firmly. \"It made me think about my own situation.\"","After listening to this story, he could coast through this week.","Ye Qiusuo said okay, feeling that perhaps it had started to have an encouraging effect on him.","Two hours passed quickly. Before leaving, Ye Qiusuo looked deeply at Xie Xi and encouraged him, \"Lu Mingzhe doesn't sing as well as you do.\" The author is purely writing nonsense.","Xie Xi: \"?\""]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14","paragraphs":["In less than half a day, the incident had blown up online. The production team of \"Tomorrow Star\" had no choice but to issue a public apology, acknowledging the issue with the backing track and replacing the sound engineer.","Wei Qi had specially come from the company today, personally driving Xie Xi to the program recording.","The program director knew Wei Qi. A decade ago, this woman was a formidable force in the industry, capable of turning clouds and rain, of painting black as white. The top agents at various companies today were simply not in her league. However, in recent years, Wei Qi had only managed Xie Xi, gradually fading from the public eye.","Today, he not only saw Wei Qi but also got a taste of her methods.","\"Sister Wei, what brings you here in person?\" The director pushed his assistant aside and stepped forward with a smile.","Wei Qi smiled back: \"Our Xi Xi is a bit delicate. He feels quite wronged. As his agent, I'm here to understand the reason.\"","The director glanced over. Xie Xi was currently looking down, engrossed in a game on his phone, not showing a hint of being \"delicate.\"","But some things made him guilty. He laughed it off: \"If there's anything we haven't been attentive enough about, please let us know. We'll definitely improve.\"","Wei Qi let out a faint, derisive snort, but it disappeared so quickly the director thought he'd imagined it. Looking closely, her face still wore a perfectly polite smile: \"Next month is the Music Awards ceremony. Barring any surprises, the Decade Achievement Award should go to our Xi Xi. At that time...\"","Ten years ago, the entire music scene was in a state of generational disconnect. Insiders once thought the industry might face a break, but then Xie Xi debuted spectacularly, directly picking up the baton. Back then, he was young, his voice not even fully developed. Those optimistic about his future were about fifty-fifty. Yet, he withstood all kinds of pressure and reached his current status.","If Xie Xi won the Achievement Award, his influence would be far greater than it is now. If the director had offended Xie Xi, it would become much harder for him to work on music-related programs in the future.","The director choked, rendered speechless by the veiled threat. With Xie Xi's talent and Wei Qi's maneuvering, this was entirely possible.","\"I've watched the previous episodes. The lighting on our Xi Xi isn't very flattering. Remember to use more fill light.\" Wei Qi placed a hand on the director's shoulder, patting it familiarly.","The \"lighting\" was a pretext; her real meaning was not to edit him unfairly.","\"Play less games. Be more thoughtful with your critiques on stage later.\" Wei Qi reached out and took Xie Xi's phone, saying seriously, \"Don't give them any leverage.\"","\"I want milk tea,\" Xie Xi suddenly blurted out.","Wei Qi narrowed her eyes: \"Why would you drink that stuff?\"","\"I see students walking around drinking it.\"","Wei Qi was taken aback, her thoughts drifting. Xie Xi didn't just want milk tea; he wanted to experience what it felt like to be a student.","She smoothed Xie Xi's hair for him. \"It's almost your turn to go on stage. I'll bring you milk tea during the mid-show break.\"","\"From near Huajing University.\"","\"Fine, I'll go buy it there.\"","Xie Xi held up a finger: \"One more cup. My teacher is also on this floor.\" Professor Ye probably had never tried this kind of thing.","\"Alright.\"","...","Ye Qiusuo was also recording a program. This episode had only seven civilian contestants left. To extend the program time, the number of questions was doubled, and the opening round became a buzzer round.","This was a good opportunity to score points, and Professor Ye was not about to let it pass. Her hand hovered over the buzzer. Often, before the host even finished reading the question stem, she could guess what was being asked, press the button, answer, and score.","The other contestants were still going \"???\" by the time she finished scoring.","\"Professor Ye, could you go a little easier on us? We haven't even heard the full question yet,\" Wan Yurou said with a touch of helplessness.","\"At least let the question finish. If you want to show off, there are better ways,\" Xia Zhoubing chimed in from the side, completely unconcerned about offending a civilian.","Ye Qiusuo looked at the host: \"Isn't this a competition?\" She was in a hurry to score points and get the prize money.","The host: \"...Hahaha, yes, it is a competition.\" It's just that your dominance is a bit too brutal.","Since it was confirmed as a competition, Ye Qiusuo felt at ease and ignored Wan Yurou and Xia Zhoubing from start to finish.","When the buzzer round continued, before the host even began reading the question, Ye Qiusuo directly pressed the buzzer. Whatever it was, she could answer it.","The others, who could at least hear the questions before: \"...\"","Fortunately, the buzzer round wasn't the entire format, otherwise the competition would have become Ye Qiusuo's solo show—though in reality, it wasn't far off.","During the mid-show break, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","Ye Qiusuo looked down, replying to messages from her research project, not noticing a minor commotion at the door.","Until someone suddenly called her name.","\"Professor Ye.\"","Ye Qiusuo turned to look. It was Xie Xi, whom she had met just that afternoon. He walked over and held out a cup of something to her.","\"What is this?\"","Xie Xi simply took the milk tea out of the bag: \"For you.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked down at the object in his hand. She had seen this before; Lin Lu and a few other female students often carried a cup.","Xie Xi even felt like Professor Ye's eyes were flashing with chemical symbols at that moment, analyzing the components of this cup of milk tea.","\"To make up for the meeting gift.\" Xie Xi placed the milk tea on Ye Qiusuo's desk, winked at her, and meaningfully called out, \"Teacher.\"","Professor Ye, having received the superstar's wink, remained utterly unmoved. Watching his retreating figure, she even suspected this student might be expecting a return gift.","Do you have to give gifts to students when tutoring now?","The recently-turned mentor, Professor Ye, took out her phone and Baidu'd it.","After Xie Xi left, the people from the program team seemed to finally feel the aftershocks, all turning their gazes towards Ye Qiusuo, who remained completely unaffected.","\"Professor Ye, are you close with Xie Xi?\"","This question came from Dong Junjian. Xie Xi was too famous, both inside and outside the industry. Everyone was curious.","Once he asked, all ears in the vicinity perked up.","Wan Yurou was also listening. She knew Ye Qiusuo couldn't possibly resist the glamour of the entertainment world; she just hadn't expected Ye Qiusuo to connect with Xie Xi so quickly.","Ye Qiusuo, pondering what meeting gift to give this temporary, serendipitous student of hers, replied casually, \"He's my student.\"","Wei Qi hadn't discussed confidentiality with her, so Ye Qiusuo saw no need to hide it.","Given the overwhelming strength Ye Qiusuo displayed every time on the program, for a moment, no one questioned what she was teaching Xie Xi.","The milk tea sat right beside Ye Qiusuo's hand. When the camera later panned over her, it inevitably caught the cup in the shot as well.","In the neighboring program's set, Xie Xi also brought his milk tea into frame. However, he drank his, and by the time the program was nearing its end, his cup was almost empty.","...","On Monday, the department held a major meeting. The advisors brought their students. It was the first full gathering of all students and advisors since the semester began, and there was an announcement about a million-yuan project grant to be awarded to one of the advisors.","A large rectangular table stood in the room. A projector and a computer sat in the center of the table. The seat at the head was empty. Advisors sat on either side, while students brought chairs to sit behind their respective advisors. The dean sat in the farthest seat.","\"By now, everyone should have met their own advisor. As for the other advisors, you've likely seen their photos on the website or the bulletin board, so we won't waste time introducing them here.\" The dean's gaze swept across the room. \"Now, we'll have each advisor present their project proposal. Afterwards, I will allocate funding to one of them.\"","The advisors went up one by one. They were all seasoned veterans, explaining everything clearly as needed.","Following convention, the college's funding this time wouldn't be substantial—it was essentially for the students to 'have some fun.'","Naturally, the advisors' proposals couldn't be overly detailed and carried a hint of perfunctoriness. After all, it rotated yearly, and this year it was supposedly Ye Qiusu's turn.","Ye Qiusuo was unaware of this convention, and even if she knew, she wouldn't have cared. Standing at the front, she spoke with the same seriousness as every time she sought funding for her own projects. She presented the project content without notes, explaining each part with remarkable clarity and appeal.","The difference in caliber among the advisors was immediately apparent.","When Ye Qiusuo finished and stepped down, the dean led the applause, then looked at the students behind her. \"You are fortunate to have Professor Ye as your advisor.\"","When it came time to allocate the funds to Ye Qiusuo, the other advisors hadn't reacted much. However, the dean then announced the amount: one million.","This sum was far beyond what was meant for students to simply 'play around' with.","\"Dean, this is unacceptable,\" a professor immediately objected. \"My project last week wasn't approved, and hers, this one...\"","\"What can students possibly do with such a large sum of money? It's a waste.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up. \"I am their advisor. Every step will go through me.\"","\"Precisely because you are their advisor, it's even more likely to be wasted,\" the middle-aged professor across from her retorted disapprovingly. \"You're also spending a significant amount of time recording some TV program. How much energy can you possibly have left for your students?\"","\"Young advisors often lack this kind of focus; it's normal,\" someone chimed in.","\"What use is this approach to academia? We need single-minded dedication,\" the middle-aged professor said coldly. \"You're advising five students. Don't let their futures be ruined in your hands.\"","Ye Qiusuo stood out far more conspicuously than Ye Qiusu, the sole female professor back in the day. Since her arrival, she had almost become a target for everyone.","\"Recording the program is done on my personal time,\" Ye Qiusuo said calmly, her eyes sweeping over all the professors. \"Perhaps you'd like to compare academic achievements with me?\"","Compare, my foot.","Precisely because Ye Qiusuo had graduated with her Ph.D. this year and stayed on as a professor, their Huajing University's world ranking had shot up. Which professor present could claim to have achieved that?","World rankings were evaluated by many metrics, one of which concerned the number of paper citations. Ye Qiusuo had published over a hundred papers in SCI journals, with an exceptionally high impact factor, directly influencing Huajing University's ranking.","An eerie silence momentarily fell over the conference room."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15","paragraphs":["Her project presentation wasn't as polished as others', and in pure academics she couldn't outmatch them either, but this grant funding was untouchable—it belonged to Ye Qiusuo.","For these professors, the money wasn't the most important thing; it was mainly the blow to their pride today.","\"Alright, that concludes today's meeting,\" the dean said with a beaming smile. \"All mentors, take this rare opportunity to spend more time communicating with your students.\"","Before leaving, the dean made a slight hand gesture, seemingly wanting to call Ye Qiusuo out, but ultimately lowered his hand and left on his own.","That was just Ye Qiusuo's nature; talking to her wouldn't change anything. Let those professors stew in it.","\"Professor, that grant...\" Lin Lu leaned in, holding up one finger, \"Is it really this much?\"","Ye Qiusuo glanced at her student, who had grown bolder lately, and replied calmly, \"The grant goes to Ding Hong and the others. The three of you head back.\"","Lin Lu immediately pushed Ding Hong forward. \"Understood, we'll return to the lab shortly.\"","Their professor had secured the grant right under the noses of other esteemed professors, filling her students with a sense of pride and joy.","\"You've both been involved in this project,\" Ye Qiusuo said, looking at her students. \"If there's anything you don't understand, message me directly. I'm on campus Mondays and Fridays, you can also come find me then.\"","\"Understood.\" Ding Hong's expression remained largely unchanged, but his hands were clenched tightly. This was the first time in his life he had participated in such a practical project.","From start to finish, Ye Qiusuo paid no attention to the other students. After saying this, she left directly.","The students chatted excitedly behind her.","\"Did you see that professor's face just now? It turned bright red all of a sudden, hahaha!\"","\"How many papers has our professor actually published?\" Ding Hong wasn't very clear.","\"It's not about the number of papers. The key is our professor's impact factor is terrifyingly high.\"","\"Not just that,\" Lin Lu shook his head. \"The papers are just the surface. In reality, our professor has almost single-handedly rebuilt a sub-discipline branch systematically.\"","\"That impressive?!\"","\"The professor is low-key; she doesn't talk about it much.\"","Meng Weiren overheard their conversation as he passed by, his expression souring. Why hadn't he known about this before? He stepped forward, trying to greet his former lab mates, but they merely glanced at him without responding.","...","\"What banquet?\" Xie Xi sat in front of the TV, game controller in hand, asking somewhat distractedly.","\"Old Master Lu's 85th birthday. They've invited you to sing.\" Wei Qi waved the invitation in front of Xie Xi.","\"A birthday party inviting me to sing?\" Xie Xi said, unimpressed. \"Not going.\"","He wasn't short on money.","Wei Qi blocked the TV. \"It's Old Master Lu. All the prominent figures in the entertainment industry will be there. And for singing one song, this much.\" She gestured with her fingers.","Xie Xi looked up at the number his agent indicated and raised an eyebrow. \"My price went up?\"","\"So, are you going or not?\"","In the end, Xie Xi agreed.","At the same time, Ye Qiusuo also received a banquet invitation.","She was discussing a project collaboration with Lu Minglang. The technology wasn't particularly complex; it was purely a business partnership.","Lu Minglang was the son of the eldest branch of the Lu family, deeply favored and exceptionally capable.","After they finished discussing the project, he handed her an invitation, hoping she could attend so they could talk in more detail later.","It wasn't until just before the banquet started that Ye Qiusuo suddenly realized why the address seemed familiar.","The book described the female lead attending this banquet, where she clashed with someone in the industry, was pushed into the swimming pool, and the male lead heroically saved her, sparking mutual affection.","They could have their romance. Ye Qiusuo was there to discuss business cooperation. Whether next year's project would have enough funding depended entirely on today.","The guests from the entertainment and business worlds were all prominent figures. The cars pulling up could practically host a luxury car exhibition. Yet, mixed in was Ye Qiusuo's ordinary car, standing out conspicuously.","\"Whose car is that? Don't let just anyone slip in,\" Mrs. Lu frowned, looking down from the second floor.","\"Mom, that's Professor Ye's car,\" said Lu Minglang, dressed in a custom-made black suit that accentuated his handsome, tall figure. \"I'll go greet her first.\"","Hearing it was her son's future business partner, Mrs. Lu's expression softened considerably. \"You go ahead. I'll accompany your grandfather.\"","Ye Qiusuo parked her car, and as soon as she got out and closed the door, someone stood before her.","\"I knew it was you,\" Xie Xi said, his eyes curving into a smile as he stood in front of Ye Qiusuo, looking as surprised as a student seeing their teacher out socializing.","\"Here for some business,\" Ye Qiusuo said, looking at Xie Xi. \"Is your homework done? Don't leave it all to the last minute to make up.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","\"Professor Ye, I was just telling Xi Xi it couldn't possibly be you,\" Wei Qi came over from behind, greeting her with a smile.","\"What brings you two here?\" Ye Qiusuo tried to recall if Xie Xi appeared at this banquet in the book, but her mind drew a blank, only remembering the female and male leads would be present.","\"To sing,\" Xie Xi said, plucking a red rose from a vase on a nearby table and twirling it in his hand.","He was wearing a white suit today—a difficult color to pull off, yet Xie Xi wore it with effortless ease. The same lights shone on him, but he seemed like a deity who had stepped out of the moonlight.","Professor Ye glanced at the flash of red between his fingers. Perhaps a not-so-proper deity.","Lu Minglang was waylaid by several people as soon as he came downstairs. By the time he made his way over, he found someone already standing in front of Professor Ye. The two were talking face-to-face, creating an unexpectedly harmonious picture.","\"Professor Ye,\" Lu Minglang stepped forward with a smile. \"Have you been here long? Let me show you around.\"","He nodded towards Xie Xi and Wei Qi opposite him, then turned his attention solely to Ye Qiusuo, clearly intending to escort only her.","\"I'd like to join the tour too,\" Xie Xi insisted on inserting himself.","Lu Minglang: \"...\" Could this singer not take a hint?"]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16","paragraphs":["The banquet was held at the Lu Family Villa. Lu Minglang was showing Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi around the estate, though a closer look would reveal his smile was barely holding on.","The singer behind him kept striking up conversations with Professor Ye, to the point where Lu Minglang couldn't even get a word in edgewise.","\"Professor Ye, you should try this. It's wine made from our own vineyard,\" Lu Minglang said, bringing over a bottle, uncorking it personally, and pouring a glass for Ye Qiusuo.","\"I don't drink,\" Ye Qiusuo refused. She had driven herself and needed to work later, requiring a clear head.","\"I'd like some,\" Xie Xi said, looking at the glass in Ye Qiusuo's hand.","\"I'll pour you another...\" Lu Minglang began, but before he could finish, Ye Qiusuo had already handed her glass to Xie Xi.","Xie Xi swirled the glass, watching the deep red liquid slosh before settling. He took a small sip. \"Not bad.\"","Even though Lu Minglang was the host, Xie Xi completely stole the spotlight just by standing there, drawing the attention of everyone around.","\"Xi Xi, let's go.\" Wei Qi found him and asked him to go backstage to prepare with the other performers.","Xie Xi placed the wine glass on a tray and winked at Ye Qiusuo. \"Teacher, see you later.\"","Ye Qiusuo's brow furrowed slightly. She always felt there was an extra layer of meaning whenever Xie Xi called her 'teacher'.","\"I never expected the famous singer Xie Xi to be so... lively,\" Lu Minglang said pointedly. \"I'm curious, Professor Ye, how did you two meet?\"","\"By chance,\" Ye Qiusuo said, not dwelling on the topic, and directly began discussing the unfinished project with Lu Minglang.","The other man also turned serious, clearly placing great importance on this business collaboration.","\"I thought Professor Ye would give this project to Tianqiu Tech,\" Lu Minglang said, finally relaxing the moment they signed the contract, his tone now carrying a hint of jest.","He had looked into Ye Qiusuo beforehand. Her ties with Tianqiu Tech ran deep; the company's foundational project had come from her hands, and several subsequent projects were major reasons for the company's current status.","\"It's just one project,\" Ye Qiusuo said, placing the contract in her bag. Next year's funding was secured.","Giving the results of this project to Tianqiu Tech would definitely not have fetched this much money. Short on funds, Professor Ye was a practical person.","Besides, there was no rule saying she could only work with Tianqiu Tech.","Just one project. Lu Minglang lowered his eyes with a faint smile. Only someone like Ye Qiusuo could say such a thing with such confidence. Others would try to milk a single project for a lifetime.","\"Professor Ye, shall we go over together?\" For the rest of the day, aside from accompanying his grandfather for the birthday, the eldest young master Lu stuck close to Ye Qiusuo.","...","Grandpa Lu's 85th birthday celebration was extravagantly grand. The vast villa estate was surprisingly crowded everywhere.","\"That area over there is the waiting zone for the performers who will go on stage later. They're all influential figures in the industry. Seize the chance to greet them,\" Mo Hong whispered to Wan Yurou, pulling her aside. \"As for the people on the other side, engage if you can, but don't offend anyone if you can't.\"","She had only managed to get two invitations through connections, ensuring Wan Yurou attended in her finest attire, all for the purpose of networking with industry bigwigs or figures from politics and business.","\"Xie Xi is here too,\" Wan Yurou spotted him immediately in the very center.","When she had gone to record the show as a guest performer, they had been extremely close, even exchanging glances. Xie Xi had also commented on her singing. Wan Yurou couldn't help but feel a sense of familiarity upon seeing him.","Moreover, so many influential people were gathered around Xie Xi.","Wan Yurou felt her heart flutter, tinged with envy. \"If only I had that kind of status,\" she murmured, to be the focus of everyone's attention and admiration.","\"You will, sooner or later,\" Mo Hong said, standing beside Wan Yurou and adjusting her shoulder strap. \"Xie Xi is good for nothing but singing. Your educational background is leagues above his. You can sing and dance. All you need is the right opportunity to break out.\"","\"He's recently casting for the female lead in a new MV. I want to try out,\" Wan Yurou tugged at Mo Hong's sleeve. \"Mo-jie, could you contact his manager for me?\"","\"It's already cast. Going now would be useless,\" Mo Hong refused.","Wan Yurou watched Xie Xi amidst the crowd, biting her lip in frustration.","Xie Xi was the benchmark for male and female celebrities in the industry. His rise to fame had been too fast, and he had stayed on top for too long. Everyone wanted to pull him down.","Unaware that he was a living target under everyone's gaze, Xie Xi, standing in the crowd, asked boredly, \"Can I go on first?\" He wanted to finish singing early and go back to gaming.","\"No, you're the finale,\" Wei Qi pressed him down. \"By the way, what were you doing following Professor Ye earlier?\"","\"I was curious about what they were talking about,\" Xie Xi said, twirling a rose in his hand. He carefully plucked off all the thorns and tucked it behind his ear. \"Does it look good?\"","The fiery red rose tucked behind his ear accentuated his already stunningly handsome features, adding a breathtakingly gorgeous flair.","Wei Qi gasped in shock. \"...Take it off, Xi Xi! Behave yourself!\"","She was going to die from anger because of him one of these days.","Reluctantly, Xie Xi took the rose from behind his ear. \"It's just a flower. Why so serious?\"","He's unconventional, he's unconventional... Wei Qi repeated to herself several times before finally calming down. \"It'll be your turn to sing in at most an hour.\"","\"Once you're done singing, you can go back and rest, play games as long as you want,\" Wei Qi said with a smile, though inwardly she thought that since Professor Ye was also here today, it was a good chance to ask her to adjust the teaching plan.","In the end, Xie Xi properly placed the rose in his suit jacket's breast pocket and sat in his seat, waiting for his turn.","Just then, Grandpa Lu was helped out, greeting everyone with a smile. Lu Minglang, as the eldest grandson, stood beside him.","Due to Grandpa Lu's physical strength, the speech duties were handed over to Lu Minglang. Standing on the stage, his appearance rivaled any celebrity's, his every move carrying the refined elegance of someone from a prominent family.","Ye Qiusuo glanced towards the lower area. The Lu family seemed to be gathered together, and Lu Mingzhe was also seated nearby.","According to hints in the book, Lu Mingzhe came from a well-off family and had an older brother. Connecting this with Lu Minglang, Ye Qiusuo naturally guessed that Lu Mingzhe was the second young master of the Lu family.","After finishing his speech, Lu Minglang stayed by his grandfather's side. Before stepping off the stage, he specifically nodded towards Ye Qiusuo.","\"Is that Ye Qiusuo?\" Wan Yurou, seated below, naturally saw the eldest young master Lu's nod. Following his gaze, she spotted a familiar face.","Mo Hong frowned. \"It seems they know each other.\"","\"If she's managed to latch onto the Lu family, it should be a breeze for Professor Ye to enter the industry,\" Wan Yurou said flatly, adjusting her shoulder strap, unable to completely hide her jealousy.","\"Not necessarily. Looking at that section, it's all business people. I remember Young Master Lu happens to own a tech company. They might have a collaborative project,\" Mo Hong, being a manager, quickly figured out the likely connection.","No matter how unbalanced Wan Yurou felt inside, there was nothing she could do.","Because of Young Master Lu's nod earlier, Mo Hong paid more attention to Ye Qiusuo. Later, she noticed Xie Xi's manager talking to her, and they also seemed quite familiar.","\"Professor Ye, could we possibly adjust the teaching content for our Xi Xi a bit?\" While Xie Xi was backstage, Wei Qi hurried over to find Ye Qiusuo.","\"In what direction?\" Ye Qiusuo looked up and asked. Xie Xi's cultural level wasn't low; there wasn't much she could teach him. The copying assignments were merely to summarize the fonts as seen by someone with dyslexia.","Wei Qi coughed, a bit embarrassed. \"Our Xi Xi is a little too... unpredictable. He seems quite receptive to your discipline, Professor Ye. If you could just manage him a little...\"","Ye Qiusuo glanced at the person stepping onto the stage to sing. \"That might be a bit difficult.\"","\"Professor Ye, money is not an issue. We can increase the salary.\" Wei Qi gestured with a number. \"His temper isn't well-received in the industry. If it could be tempered just a little, it would be better than the current situation.\"","\"I haven't noticed any particular problem with his temper.\" Ye Qiusuo was about to refuse.","Wei Qi grasped Ye Qiusuo's hand. \"Professor Ye, you don't need to teach him anything specific! Just... if Xi Xi could learn even a tiny bit of steadiness from you!\"","Otherwise, she felt like she was babysitting every day.","On stage, Xie Xi stood before the standing microphone, softly humming a nameless tune. A single line captured everyone's attention; the entire mountain villa fell silent, as if his voice was the only sound between heaven and earth.","Ye Qiusuo withdrew her hand and nodded to Wei Qi, essentially agreeing. She then looked up, listening intently to his song.","No matter who had sung before or what they had sung, at this moment, everyone's eyes and hearts held only Xie Xi.","After he finished singing, Grandpa Lu stood up to applaud him personally for the first time.","Xie Xi gave a graceful bow. When he came down, he was already holding a phone with a game open on the screen.","\"Sister Wei, are we heading back?\" Xie Xi asked, cradling his phone without looking up.","\"Grandpa Lu might want to see you. Wait a little longer.\" Wei Qi wiped her forehead, feeling somewhat guilty. After approaching Professor Ye earlier, she felt like she had secretly sold Xie Xi out.","Having stayed this long, Xie Xi wasn't in a particular hurry. Cradling his phone, he wanted to find a quiet spot to play his game.","\"Brother Xie Xi.\" Wan Yurou suddenly appeared in front of him to greet him.","\"Yes?\" Xie Xi glanced up; she looked somewhat familiar.","\"I heard you're recruiting for your MV...\"","\"That's not under my purview.\" Xie Xi said and made to leave.","Wan Yurou moved aside to let him pass. In that instant, seemingly lost in thought, she suddenly twisted her ankle and fell directly into the swimming pool beside them.","Xie Xi: \"?\"","He put away his phone and slowly, deliberately crouched by the pool's edge. \"Are you trying to scam me?\"","Wan Yurou: \"...\"","Shouldn't a normal person feel guilty and then proactively offer her an opportunity?","A delicate female lead falling into the water, wearing a long dress, her chest offering an unlimited view in the water—this was the scene Ye Qiusuo came upon when she arrived."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17","paragraphs":["\"What are you all doing?\"","After speaking with the old master for a few words, Lu Minglang got up to look for Ye Qiusuo. The two of them walked towards a less crowded area while talking, only to come across Xie Xi squatting by the swimming pool and Wan Yurou, struggling hard in the water in her long dress.","When Lu Minglang asked this question, there was a certain amount of schadenfreude in his tone, but he had underestimated just how shameless Xie Xi could be.","Originally, Xie Xi had also wanted to watch the show; this woman clearly knew how to swim, as her first reaction after falling in was to float. Seeing Ye Qiusuo approach, he immediately stood up and backed away towards her in quick steps.","\"Professor, she's trying to frame me,\" Xie Xi said, pointing innocently at the person still struggling in the pool.","Wan Yurou: \"...\" Are you even a man, damn it?!","But now there were people nearby. She couldn't climb out nor could she stay down, so she had no choice but to let go of her act and pretend to be drowning.","Deep down, Ye Qiusuo was ultimately a rather proper and upright person. Since Xie Xi called her 'Professor,' she regarded him as a student.","In the book, Xie Xi repeatedly fell into the hands of the male and female leads. If this wasn't handled properly this time, a bad reputation was a certainty.","She glanced into the distance; people were already starting to head over upon hearing the commotion. The party was not without media reporters.","\"Stand over there.\" Ye Qiusuo stepped forward, pulling Xie Xi aside. Then, she broke off a nearby ornamental bamboo and extended it towards Wan Yurou.","The two men by the pool stood far away, with no intention whatsoever of reaching out to pull Wan Yurou up.","\"Seems a bit short. Maybe we shouldn't bother saving her,\" Xie Xi suggested, peering over from the side.","Please, just get lost!","Wan Yurou, who was almost at her acting limit, immediately pretended to struggle and swam forward half a meter to grab the bamboo pole.","Wan Yurou's fishtail dress had a high slit, and her shoulder strap had slipped due to her vigorous movements, exposing the front of her chest. The moment she was pulled up, her figure was almost completely exposed.","Clutching Ye Qiusuo, she cried pitifully, sobbing, \"Professor Ye, thank you.\" There was even a hint of genuine emotion in her voice.","Ye Qiusuo looked over at Xie Xi, but he seemed to have misunderstood her meaning. He suddenly tugged at his suit jacket, wrapping it tightly around himself with both hands.","\"...\"","\"Yurou, what happened?\" Lu Mingzhe followed the noise over and, seeing Wan Yurou crying so bitterly, couldn't help but feel a pang of heartache.","Although they had only sung a duet together once, he held quite a bit of goodwill towards her.","He quickly took off his suit jacket and helped Wan Yurou put it on.","The male lead had arrived.","Ye Qiusuo pushed Wan Yurou away. She looked down, frowning at her own clothes—they were still wet.","\"Brother, I'll take Yurou to change,\" Lu Mingzhe said to Lu Minglang beside him.","Seeing that the two knew each other, Lu Minglang dismissed the thought of having someone else escort Wan Yurou away.","\"Sorry for breaking one of your bamboos,\" Ye Qiusuo turned and apologized to Lu Minglang.","\"Just one bamboo, it can stay here and continue to be useful,\" Lu Minglang said sincerely. \"If someone falls in later, they can be rescued promptly too.\"","Ye Qiusuo smiled slightly and changed the subject: \"Was that your younger brother just now?\"","Lu Minglang: \"Cousin.\"","Though he said cousin, they were actually somewhat distantly related. However, Lu Minglang wasn't interested in going into details about such internal family matters.","Not a biological younger brother?","She remembered the book mentioning that Lu Minglang had a biological younger brother.","\"Professor, your clothes are wet,\" Xie Xi suddenly sidled over, offering his jacket to Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at him, accepted the jacket, then averted her eyes. After exchanging a few more words with Lu Minglang, she left with Xie Xi.","After walking some distance away, Ye Qiusuo stopped and asked, \"Since she was trying to frame you, why didn't you just leave?\"","Squatting by the poolside without even extending a hand to help—if someone took a picture or if word got out, it would absolutely affect his reputation.","That's just how the world is. Often, regardless of right or wrong, the perceived weaker party is seen as being in the right.","\"You sound just like Sister Wei right now,\" Xie Xi muttered under his breath. Only his manager would care about whether his reputation was good or bad.","Ye Qiusuo handed the clothes back to Xie Xi: \"I'm heading back first. Don't act like you did today in the future.\"","Acting like he did today, no wonder he ended up being blacklisted by the entire internet in the book.","Wei Qi also heard about the pool incident through the grapevine. Since Xie Xi wasn't implicated, she didn't pay it much mind, just treating it as an amusing anecdote on the way back.","\"I heard Wan Yurou fell into the swimming pool, and it was Professor Ye who pulled her out,\" Wei Qi turned her head to smile at Xie Xi in the back seat. \"Probably originally wanted to fool around with someone.\"","Xie Xi, leaning his head against the car window, said lazily, \"That matter has nothing to do with Professor Ye. She was just helping me.\"","Wei Qi: \"!?\"","\"Xie Xi, what do you mean?\" Wei Qi asked urgently, even using his full name.","After Xie Xi finished recounting the whole story, Wei Qi first breathed a sigh of relief, then added Wan Yurou to her personal blacklist.","\"Thank goodness for Professor Ye this time. Don't wander off alone in the future. What if you really got stuck with the blame?\" Wei Qi said earnestly. \"No matter how much you explain, the audience only wants to see what they want to see.\"","Xie Xi hugged his suit jacket, secretly hiding his phone inside it and opening a game interface, while putting on a pitiful act: \"I know, Sister Wei. Professor Ye already lectured me about it earlier.\"","\"Xie Xi,\" Wei Qi said through gritted teeth, \"your phone screen is reflecting light.\"","Otherwise, she might have actually believed his pitiful act.","Xie Xi quickly lowered the brightness, pretending nothing had happened.","...","On Tuesday, Ye Qiusuo took five students to visit Celestial Sphere Tech. Her ID card had high clearance, and coupled with her involvement in several projects, the students could tour several floors consecutively.","\"All mobile phones and communication devices need to be placed aside. You can pick them up when we go back down,\" Ye Qiusuo briefed the students before going up.","\"Professor, are we really going up just like this?\" Lin Lu asked, somewhat incredulous.","\"There's additional security screening upstairs. Just follow me,\" Ye Qiusuo said, taking out her ID card and leading the students up.","The areas the students could enter were all projects Ye Qiusuo herself was involved in, making explanations easier and more straightforward. However, some places involving core designs still required confidentiality.","Fortunately, the students weren't thinking that deeply; they were just there to broaden their horizons.","\"Qiusuo, your students?\" Zhang Chengjue, holding a tablet, passed by and was taken aback upon seeing the students behind her.","\"I brought them for a look,\" Ye Qiusuo said naturally.","\"Little Zhao, go to the 7th floor and entertain Professor Ye's students. Bring some snacks over,\" Zhang Chengjue said, turning his head slightly to speak into his earpiece. Then, smiling at Lin Lu and the others, he added, \"You can consider our Celestial Sphere Tech after graduation.\"","\"Could we really come here?!\" Lin Lu exclaimed excitedly.","\"Of course. You are Qiusuo's students, after all,\" Zhang Chengjue said. Seeing his assistant bringing down a cart of food, he turned to Ye Qiusuo. \"I actually have something to discuss with you. Shall we go up and talk?\"","Ye Qiusuo turned to her students: \"Wait here for a bit.\"","\"These are made from ingredients grown by our own Celestial Sphere Tech. Everyone, please try some,\" Assistant Zhao said, pushing a small cart and beckoning Lin Lu and the others.","Watching the two of them leave in the elevator, Lin Lu couldn't help but nudging Ding Hong, sighing with emotion: \"Zhang Chengjue, the big boss of Tianqiu Tech! I actually got to see him in person. My life is complete.\"","Ding Hong was surprisingly calm: \"Your mentor owns half the sky at Tianqiu Tech. Why are you still so excited?\"","Assistant Zhao, who was distributing snacks, paused his hand and glanced at Ding Hong.","\"Hmm, you're right.\" Lin Lu thought it over carefully. The several foundational projects that established Tianqiu Tech's market position were all his mentor's achievements. Strictly speaking, the real mastermind behind Tianqiu Tech should be his mentor, Ye Qiusuo.","\"Qiusuo, help me close the door.\" Zhang Chengjue walked into the office first. He looked down and flipped through some documents on the desk, then looked up and spoke to Ye Qiusuo at the door.","Ye Qiusuo closed the door. \"What did you want to talk to me about? Is there a problem with the project funding?\"","\"You only care about the funding.\" Zhang Chengjue smiled helplessly. \"I wanted to ask on behalf of several shareholders about your collaborative project with Shuanglu Tech. They're all discussing why you didn't just come to our own company.\"","Shuanglu was the tech company in Lu Minglang's hands. It wasn't large in scale, but it was backed by the Lu family conglomerate.","\"It's better to earn money from others,\" Ye Qiusuo said bluntly. \"Besides, Shuanglu's offer is far higher than Tianqiu's.\"","Zhang Chengjue raised a hand to massage his forehead. \"Qiusuo, don't say that last part in front of the shareholders, or it might create discord.\"","\"This project isn't that useful anyway,\" Ye Qiusuo frowned. She wasn't bound to Tianqiu Tech by a lifetime contract, and project signings were inherently free.","\"You know, they all see you as part of Tianqiu, so it's hard for them not to overthink things,\" Zhang Chengjue said helplessly. He pushed a document toward Ye Qiusuo. \"This is the approved funding. Check if the amount is correct.\"","Ye Qiusuo reached out and took the document, flipping through it. It was indeed the approved funds. \"Thank you.\"","\"Don't thank me yet. The shareholders hope you'll finish the projects currently in hand first before starting this new one.\" Zhang Chengjue tapped his finger on the desk. \"I heard you've been recording some show recently? You should probably put that on hold for now. I remember you weren't this playful before.\"","\"Recording the show doesn't interfere with the project delivery timeline. And after finishing the show, I should be able to get a bonus,\" Ye Qiusuo did not agree to his suggestion.","Zhang Chengjue was stunned for a moment, then laughed. \"How much is the bonus?\"","\"Five million.\"","\"Only five million?\" Zhang Chengjue was somewhat surprised. \"You're wasting your time.\"","\"It's not a small amount,\" Ye Qiusuo felt that spending three or four hours a week recording a show to earn five million was still worthwhile. That time slot was originally her rest time anyway.","\"You've fallen into the money pit,\" Zhang Chengjue shook his head in resignation. \"Forget it, you do your thing. I have other matters to attend to.\"","Ye Qiusuo took the funding approval document and headed to the 7th floor. As the elevator doors opened, she saw several students slumped on the hallway benches, looking utterly stuffed.","\"Professor Ye.\" Assistant Little Zhao pushed a cart into the elevator and greeted her. As they passed each other, he slightly bent his waist, almost like a bow.","Ye Qiusuo's gaze was fixed on the students and she didn't notice his gesture.","\"Mentor, these snacks are sooo good,\" Lin Lu's cheeks were flushed, and even his accent slipped out.","\"Where's my phone? Let me search for the same brand!\" A girl sitting on another bench pawed at a robot pacing back and forth, shaking it as she spoke.","Even the usually quiet Ding Hong seemed a bit dazed, his eyes unfocused. Upon seeing Ye Qiusuo, he immediately stood up and declared loudly, \"Mentor, I will definitely study hard!\"","After saying that, he bent at a ninety-degree angle, then gradually went further down until he was completely flat on the floor at a hundred and eighty degrees.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","So, what new snack did the lab develop?"]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18","paragraphs":["All five students were in a dazed state, causing a commotion right there in the hallway.","If Ye Qiusuo hadn't stopped him, Ding Hong would have been pinned to the ground by another student.","She snatched the so-called snack pack from Lin Lu's hands, wanting to see what was inside.","\"Give it back!\" Lin Lu struggled to grab it back.","Frowning, Ye Qiusuo blocked the student's hand and looked down at the snack packaging. The main ingredient was a type of mushroom cultivated in the lab, which contained mild toxins.","She remembered the lab had specifically worked on removing the toxins from this mushroom while preserving its original medicinal properties, but a side effect was that it could cause hallucinations.","Fortunately, the hallucinations came and went quickly. Within ten minutes of stopping consumption, the group recovered.","\"Why are you hugging me?\"","\"Eww—\"","Chaos ensued upon regaining clarity. Ye Qiusuo waited for them to slowly regain their senses.","\"The food contained hallucinogenic mushrooms. Now that you're sober, come downstairs with me.\"","\"Hallucinogenic mushrooms?! Are they poisonous?\" Lin Lu covered his mouth; he had eaten the most earlier.","\"No, it's a food-grade medicinal ingredient. Consider it a welcome gift.\" Ye Qiusuo threw the small snack pack back to Lin Lu. \"Finish it here. You can't take this outside.\"","She had heard before that they planned to turn this mushroom into a product for the medical market, but she hadn't expected it to be in this form.","However, the hallucinogenic side effect was still too strong; it probably wouldn't easily enter the market.","\"Will I hallucinate again if I eat it?\" Lin Lu was afraid to continue.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at him: \"After the hallucinations occur, consuming more within twenty-four hours won't produce the same effect.\"","\"Then I'll finish it.\" Lin Lu really did eat the last pack right there on the spot.","Everyone stared at him intently, waiting to see if he would hallucinate.","But as Ye Qiusuo had said, Lin Lu showed no reaction after eating it.","\"Time to go. I'll bring you all again next time if there's a chance.\" Ye Qiusuo led the students to retrieve their belongings.","Ding Hong had only brought a phone. After getting his things back, he walked over to Ye Qiusuo and asked, \"Professor, does the company also research food?\"","\"The Biology and Agriculture departments are responsible for that area.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed upstairs. \"The eighth and ninth floors.\"","She had fought for those two floors. Initially, the company hadn't agreed to add these departments, wanting to stick solely to a technology-focused path.","Technology serves life. Combining biology and agriculture is also a form of technology that can improve lives. Thus, Ye Qiusuo convinced the shareholders to add these two departments.","This mushroom was developed by their department, though Ye Qiusuo hadn't expected their progress to be so fast.","Although she had advocated for establishing the two departments, Ye Qiusuo didn't pay much attention to them usually, focusing instead on her own field.","...","The Saturday broadcast of \"Tomorrow's Star\" brought Lu Mingzhe back into the public eye.","#LuMingzhe'sHighNotesAreAmazing#","In the top five competition, he sang a highly difficult song, receiving excellent reviews from the judge-mentors. As soon as the episode aired, Lu Mingzhe trended on social media.","\"He's from the Lu family,\" Wan Yurou stated with certainty while watching the program.","\"Are you sure?\"","\"That day at the banquet, I heard him call Lu Minglang 'brother.' And also...\" Wan Yurou, seemingly remembering something, blushed slightly. \"When he took me to change clothes, you could tell he was very familiar with the villa's interior.\"","Mo Hong thought carefully and said, \"Right, I was wondering why the backing behind him was so strong. If he's from the Lu family, then everything makes sense.\"","Wan Yurou brushed her long hair aside as if to conceal. \"Sister Mo, do you think he can win the championship?\"","\"Not winning the talent show championship isn't a big deal. The key is the resources afterward,\" Mo Hong said seriously, sitting in front of Wan Yurou. \"You were his duet partner before; you can cheer for him on Weibo.\"","\"Isn't that a bit inappropriate?\" Wan Yurou had concerns. \"What if others say I'm riding on his coattails?\"","\"Riding on what coattails? You're practically a second-tier star with ten million fans. Build a good relationship while Lu Mingzhe hasn't fully risen yet.\" Mo Hong's mind was busy calculating.","That night, Wan Yurou posted a Weibo: 【Go go go, Mingmingzi is the best! @LuMingzhe】","This post was deleted one minute after being sent, once fans had seen it and her agent had screenshotted it.","Mo Hong immediately created a trending topic.","#WanYurouAccidentallyUsesMainAccountToCheerForLuMingzhe#","Hahaha, this is hilarious, a certain actress's main account exposed for fan-girling.","【Wanwan is so adorable! I like Mingzhe too; he's handsome and sings so well.】","【If you like Lu Mingzhe, we're friends!】","【@LuMingzhe, please tone down the charm.】","Lu Mingzhe's team was online and quickly saw the trending topic.","\"Is this an attempt to share the spotlight?\" Being industry insiders, they recognized the coincidence of this move.","Seeing the hot search, Lu Mingzhe couldn't help but smile. He actually quite liked Wan Yurou. Even if this was a deliberately orchestrated topic by her team, he didn't mind.","He simply replied directly with his main account: 【Deleting is useless, I've already seen it @WanYurou】","After posting, Lu Mingzhe directly followed Wan Yurou on Weibo.","His Weibo account was registered when the \"Tomorrow's Star\" competition started. He only followed the three mentors and the official show account. Now, adding just Wan Yurou made it too obvious; fans noticed the extra follower immediately.","【Ahhhhh! I ship them!】","When I saw them singing together, I thought they looked so sweet. Wuu, Lu-Wan is real, no rebuttals accepted.","【This is hilarious, Wanwan you goof. If you hadn't used the wrong account, who knows how long you would have secretly liked Mingzhe.】","A trending topic where everyone was happy—both sides benefited, and netizens were entertained by the topic.","Except for one person.","\"Why is it always entertainment news trending? It's getting tiresome,\" Xie Xi said, lying on the carpet, his eyes almost closed from drowsiness.","\"Brother Xi, you're also in the entertainment industry,\" his assistant Zhang Dong whispered.","Back when Xie Xi was at his peak, he was jokingly called a \"yearly subscription user\" of hot searches, where his every move could trend, all genuinely pushed by fans and media.","\"Forget it, stop reading. Bring me my homework,\" Xie Xi said, bored enough to start doing homework.","However, if he could settle down to write homework, he wouldn't be Xie Xi.","After writing a few characters, he threw the pen away and turned to look at his assistant. \"Professor Ye hasn't been trending?\" He was actually quite interested in hearing about her.","\"Not this week,\" Zhang Dong shook his head.","\"Then search for her information and read it to me,\" Xie Xi suddenly became interested.","The human audiobook assistant dutifully began reading from an online encyclopedia entry, with exclamations of amazement sounding in the room from time to time.","\"She didn't study her current major before?\"","\"She has two doctoral degrees.\"","Xie Xi sounded like someone who had never seen the world, his exclamations never ceasing.","The promotional board at Huajing University only mentioned the achievements Ye Qiusuo made during her doctorate, never mentioning her past. But the online encyclopedia recorded everything clearly.","Ye Qiusuo had already earned her Ph.D. by the age of fifteen. She had also studied and worked abroad, not returning until she was nineteen. She then re-enrolled for another doctoral degree at Huajing University and eventually stayed on as a faculty member.","Her assistant read this with a sense of numbness; the gap between people was simply too vast. In comparison, it felt like their own brains were full of water.","Xie Xi felt around the edge of the carpet for his phone, tapped on Professor Ye's name, held down the voice message button, and casually asked, \"You got your Ph.D. at fifteen. Why did you come back to study for another doctorate?\"","There were still some differences between domestic and foreign Ph.D. programs.","The assistant beside him gasped. \"Bro Xi, you're just going to disturb Professor Ye like that?!\"","Having just finished reading a certain online encyclopedia entry, the assistant's image of Professor Ye was now infinitely elevated in his mind.","\"Just chatting.\" As long as homework wasn't mentioned, Xie Xi wasn't afraid of Professor Ye.","Half an hour passed, and no message came from Professor Ye.","\"Why isn't she responding?\" Xie Xi cradled his phone, extending a finger to poke at Ye Qiusuo's profile picture again.","It was a scenic picture of a lotus flower, utterly staid. Just looking at the profile picture, Xie Xi would have guessed she was over forty.","\"Professors are probably very busy,\" Zhang Dong guessed.","After waiting a while longer, Xie Xi lost interest and went to listen to his demo.","It wasn't until after three in the morning that Ye Qiusuo, having finished her work, found time to see the voice message from Xie Xi on her phone. Before opening it, she thought he had a study-related question, but it turned out he was asking about her doctoral studies.","Ye Qiusuo typed a line of text, then remembered it might be inconvenient for him to read, so she finally sent a voice message back as well.","She rested at four a.m. and got up at seven to go to the university.","She didn't force her students to stay in the lab, but several of them loved to be there on Saturdays and Sundays anyway. Ye Qiusuo would go check on them when she had time.","\"Professor, there's been a consistent error with this set of measurements,\" Ding Hong asked, his tone somewhat gloomy. He kept feeling it was because he wasn't familiar enough with the instrument, leading to improper operation and problematic data.","But measuring data for this project had always been his responsibility, while another student had their own tasks.","Ye Qiusuo glanced over the large data set and understood. \"This lab isn't completely sealed. The error is still within the normal range. You didn't make a mistake.\"","Ding Hong was taken aback. \"Is that so?\"","\"You have too little experience measuring data. You'll know with more time.\"","Ye Qiusuo left the lab, took off her glasses, and rubbed her eyes.","Perhaps because she had stayed up late the night before, her vision had been a bit blurry when she woke up, so she had worn her glasses over.","She still had to tutor Xie Xi in the afternoon. Remembering what his agent said at the banquet the other day, Ye Qiusuo turned to go borrow some books from the library.","Reading some books on cultivating one's character might help a bit?","By the time Xie Xi got up, it was already eleven in the morning, so he combined breakfast and lunch. His assistant and life manager were used to it; as long as he got enough sleep and was healthy, it was fine.","\"Where one gets a doctorate is the same. The university makes no difference to me.\"","Xie Xi had just sat down at the table and opened his phone when he saw the voice message Ye Qiusuo sent at three a.m. He casually tapped on it and heard that sentence.","Xie Xi raised an eyebrow, surprised that someone as staid as Professor Ye could say something so arrogant.","In reality, Ye Qiusuo meant that the depth of research in this field was currently similar both domestically and internationally. The area she wanted to research was a new branch, and university resources were comparable.","\"Bro Xi, I put your homework in your bag, but it looks like there are still a few lines left unfinished,\" Zhang Dong suddenly said.","Xie Xi: \"...Next time, wait until I finish eating before you mention that.\" It was hard to swallow.","...","\"Me, read this?\" Xie Xi flipped through the inspirational \"beautiful mind\" book on the table, feeling a bit novel.","\"Read along.\" Ye Qiusuo had specially brought an audio cassette tape and a player. She had never tutored a student like this before and found it somewhat challenging, having even consulted a colleague.","\"This book has a cassette tape?\" Xie Xi said in shock, flipping to the publication info—a twenty-year-old chicken soup for the soul book.","This chicken soup was probably spoiled by now.","\"Xie Xi.\" Ye Qiusuo's brow furrowed slightly as she tapped the page. \"Read.\"","His personality had led him to suffer setbacks at the hands of the male and female leads not once or twice. Thinking of the plot from the book gave Ye Qiusuo a headache. Grinding down his edges a bit would be good.","\"Oh.\"","As soon as the play button was pressed, music full of a sense of a bygone era flowed out, accompanied by an overly solemn male voice.","It was supremely 'healing'.","A hint of disdain flickered in Xie Xi's eyes, but he still followed along, reading slowly.","The book was useless in his hands.","Xie Xi naturally felt dizzy looking at the words in the book. Additionally, he was extremely sensitive to sound and could easily repeat the audio from the tape player.","After returning from taking her student to Tianqiu Tech, Ye Qiusuo had been staying up late. She propped her head on the desk, dozing off slightly. Her glasses, placed beside her, had been pushed to the floor without her noticing.","Across from her, Xie Xi was still mechanically chanting along with the voice from the machine, but his eyes were darting towards Ye Qiusuo.","How many days had she not slept? There were dark circles under her eyes.","Side A of the tape finished. Xie Xi waited for a long moment, then finally got up to proactively flip it to Side B, only to step on Ye Qiusuo's glasses, which had fallen on the floor.","A 'crunch' sound, quite jarring in the quiet classroom.","Ye Qiusuo woke up, following the line from his foot upwards to look at Xie Xi.","Xie Xi: \"...\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19","paragraphs":["The classroom was unusually quiet. Xie Xi stiffly lifted his foot. The metal frame of the glasses was bent under his shoe, and the resin lenses had fallen to the floor, one of them cracked.","\"I...\" Xie Xi stammered, a rare occurrence for him. This incident was a bit beyond his expectations.","He had only meant to flip the tape over.","Ye Qiusuo pressed her fingers to her temples, then bent down to pick up the lenses and the frame. She forcefully bent the frame back into shape, slotted the lenses back in, wiped them clean, and put them on to test.","They were barely usable.","Xie Xi hadn't yet recovered from the shock of having stepped on and bent Ye Qiusuo's glasses. Seeing her perform this series of fluid actions, he couldn't help but exclaim in astonishment, \"The lens is cracked.\"","In his view, the rightful place for those glasses was the trash can in the corner.","\"There's just a crack at the bottom. It doesn't affect my vision,\" Ye Qiusuo said. Her prescription wasn't strong; she only wore glasses when her eyes were overworked.","Xie Xi stared at Ye Qiusuo for a moment, realizing she was exactly that type of person—someone who could wear the same coat for ten or twenty years, paying little attention to food, clothing, shelter, or transportation, with her mind wholly dedicated to academic research.","Like now, with her glasses broken. As long as they could be worn, she'd pick them up, wipe them clean, and continue using them.","Xie Xi sat down opposite Ye Qiusuo and said seriously, \"Using broken glasses instead of getting new ones is bad for your eyes.\"","Ye Qiusuo paused. That was something she hadn't considered, and it was indeed a possibility.","Xie Xi picked up her glasses and tossed them into the trash can behind the door.","\"Professor, since I broke them, let me buy you a new pair,\" Xie Xi declared righteously. \"How about we go to the glasses market now to get you new glasses?\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up at him. \"By the time we finish, there'll be no time for class.\" His little scheme was quite transparent.","Xie Xi's eyes darted around evasively. \"You could lecture on the way.\"","\"I have nothing to lecture about on the way.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed at the desk in front of him. \"If you don't want to follow along with the recording, you can continue copying the text.\"","Xie Xi: He didn't want to do either.","Soon, Ye Qiusuo heard long sighs and heavy breaths from across the table.","\"What kind of behavior is that?\" Professor Ye said, looking at Xie Xi with dissatisfaction. \"Pull yourself together.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","This was the melancholy of a beauty! Ye Qiusuo showed not a hint of appreciation. If it were his fans, they'd be falling over themselves to comfort him!","Not only was she a young fuddy-duddy, but she was also utterly lacking in romance.","Xie Xi's chest was full of theatrical, affected emotions, all blocked by her icy sentence, leaving him feeling stuck and frustrated.","Professor Ye was impervious to both soft and hard tactics. In the end, Xie Xi chose to follow along with the video tape, chanting the text.","Not only did his emotions stabilize, they became as still as stagnant water.","...","While recording the show that evening, Ye Qiusuo seemed low on energy, barely speaking unless prompted, focusing solely on answering questions.","\"I heard from the director they're changing the competition format next episode.\"","\"With so many people at the start and only five left, they have to change the format.\"","The few guests who had successfully advanced were discussing backstage. Ye Qiusuo wasn't paying attention; she always left right after recording.","On her way back, she drove slowly. Passing by an optical shop, she hurriedly got a new pair of glasses.","She hadn't rested well for days, and getting glasses at night didn't help. When she woke up well-rested the next day, the new glasses felt uncomfortable no matter how she wore them.","She simply put them away, too lazy to wear them.","Glasses Market.","\"Brother Xi, this place is packed with people,\" the assistant whispered, sneaking along beside Xie Xi. \"If we don't head to the company soon, Sister Wei Qi is going to blow her top.\"","Today was the day Xie Xi was supposed to go to the company.","\"Wait a bit. I need to get glasses made first.\" Xie Xi took out the glasses he had retrieved from the trash can.","\"Brother Xi, since when are you nearsighted? Last month when your vision was tested, it was 20/20, wasn't it?\"","\"It's to repay Professor Ye.\" Xie Xi handed the glasses to the shop owner. \"Please make lenses with this prescription.\"","\"Professor Ye?!\" Zhang Dong immediately imagined a scenario where Xie Xi, dissatisfied with Professor Ye's tutoring, got into a physical fight with her, ending with the sacrifice of Professor Ye's glasses.","Never mind that Professor Ye was a woman—his Brother Xi bullied people regardless of gender.","\"Sir, would you like to pick a new frame? This frame has been stepped on. It definitely won't be comfortable to wear,\" the shop owner said, examining the glasses carefully.","\"Which ones are better?\" Xie Xi had never gotten prescription glasses before and was completely clueless.","\"Generally speaking, the lighter the frame, the less pressure on the bridge of the nose, making it more comfortable to wear.\" The owner led Xie Xi to the most luxurious glass cabinet, which held only a few frames. \"These are made of alloy, exceptionally light, and also quite expensive.\"","\"We can adjust this frame on-site here to fit the face shape, using that machine.\" The owner reached up to pull down Xie Xi's mask to measure the distance between his eyes and eyebrows.","\"It's not for me to wear,\" Xie Xi said, leaning back slightly to avoid the owner's hand.","\"Oh... then it's really best for the person themselves to come, to ensure the most comfortable fit.\"","Xie Xi thought of Ye Qiusuo. She would absolutely not waste time coming here with him.","The great professor was busier than the big star.","\"It's a gift. She can't come.\"","\"Do you have a photo? Let me see,\" the owner asked.","Where would Xie Xi have a photo of Ye Qiusuo? He pulled Zhang Dong over and asked quietly, \"Is there a photo of her on her Baidu page?\"","\"Professor Ye? Last time I looked, it seemed to be a photo from her teens. It hasn't been updated.\" Zhang Dong was about to suggest looking for screenshots on Weibo.","But Xie Xi had already taken out his phone, opened the \"Knowledge Q&A\" program, and showed it to the owner, pointing at Ye Qiusuo on screen. \"Just base it on her.\"","\"Isn't that Professor Ye?\" The owner recognized her immediately. \"I often watch this show with my daughter. It's great! Young man, are you also a fan of Professor Ye?\"","Having run his shop here for over twenty years, the owner had seen all sorts of people and naturally assumed Xie Xi was a fan of Ye Qiusuo.","\"You can think of me as one,\" Xie Xi said, placing his phone on the glass counter. \"Can you make them?\"","\"Let me get a better look at her face. I think I can manage.\"","Xie Xi had opened the latest episode, which he hadn't had time to watch yet. The owner clearly hadn't seen it either. In the end, the two of them stood in front of the counter and started watching the show right then and there.","\"Brother Xi, let's go!\" The assistant anxiously squeezed over. At this rate, Sister Wei Qi was probably already at the company.","\"What's the rush? Let us finish watching.\" Xie Xi stood with the owner, nervously watching Ye Qiusuo buzz in to answer questions on the show.","\"Another correct answer!\" The owner exclaimed excitedly. \"If my daughter could be even a fraction as smart as Professor Ye in the future, that would be enough.\"","\"What was the last question? I didn't see it clearly,\" Xie Xi said, his eyes glued to the screen, afraid of missing anything, though he couldn't make out the words, only hearing the sounds.","\"Something about a gymnast doing a several-hundred-degree flip, or something like that. I didn't see it clearly either.\"","The assistant, squeezed to the outside: \"...\" Did these two even remember what they originally came here to do?","Only after the episode finished did Xie Xi suddenly remember to ask the owner, \"Can you adjust it now?\"","\"Roughly, yes.\"","Xie Xi picked a silver frame of the same style, but made of a new alloy material. It felt almost weightless in his hand.","The owner took the frame for minor adjustments, then showed it to Xie Xi. \"This should do.\"","Xie Xi took it, pulled down his mask, and tried it on. \"It fits me perfectly, so it should be a bit small for her.\"","The shopkeeper looked Xie Xi up and down: \"This is the smallest adjustment I can make. Any smaller and it won't be comfortable to wear. How about this...\" The shopkeeper pulled a chain from a drawer and attached it to the temple of the glasses: \"Use this, it prevents slipping.\"","After they tried them on again, the newly fitted lenses were finally installed into the frames.","\"Brother Xi, we're half an hour late.\"","Xie Xi raised a hand to cover his ear: \"Can't hear you.\"","Zhang Dong thought: His fans really should see how childish their idol can be.","By the time they arrived at Huayun Culture, Wei Qi, as expected, asked why they were late.","\"I accidentally stepped on Professor Ye's glasses last week. I just went to get a new pair made to give her during class this weekend,\" Xie Xi explained, holding up the bag from the glasses store.","Hearing it was about Professor Ye, the deep furrow in Wei Qi's brow relaxed considerably. A formidable person like Professor Ye commanded everyone's respect.","She pointed at the bag in Xie Xi's hand: \"Since they're already ready, give them to Professor Ye today. Saves her the inconvenience.\"","\"It's Monday. Students are mostly in class, and the campus is crowded. I'll help you deliver the glasses.\" Wei Qi didn't let Xie Xi go personally.","\"In that case, if there's nothing else, I'll head back.\" Xie Xi put down the bag and turned to leave.","\"Hold on.\" Wei Qi pulled him back. \"The company has called over the potential MV leads. Let me take you to see who might be suitable.\"","Xie Xi went to make the selection. For his upcoming album, he needed to shoot a story-based music video, which required an MV male lead and female lead.","The company had done an initial screening, his agent had shortlisted two pairs, and now it was up to Xie Xi to make the final decision.","\"This is Xia Zhoubing, a rising-generation actor,\" the presenter introduced from the side.","\"He looks familiar,\" Xie Xi said, glancing at Xia Zhoubing before whispering to his assistant.","Zhang Dong leaned close to Xie Xi's ear: \"He was a celebrity guest on 'Knowledge Q&A'.\"","Xie Xi suddenly remembered: \"Is he the one who kept interrupting and getting put in his place?\"","Zhang Dong coughed, reminding Xie Xi that the person in question was right there.","\"Choose the other actor.\" Xie Xi didn't even wait to see the performance, tossing out the sentence directly.","This kind of willfulness was commonplace for him at the company. The others, used to it, simply showed Xia Zhoubing out.","Xia Zhoubing didn't even get a chance to introduce himself. As he left, his young, handsome face was clouded with gloom.","...","When the knock came on Ye Qiusuo's office door, she was on a call with a classmate abroad, discussing recent trends in their industry.","\"Someone's at your door? Let's stop here. I'm returning to China in a few days, shall we meet up then?\"","\"Sure, give me a call when you arrive.\" Ye Qiusuo ended the video call and got up to answer the door.","\"Professor Ye, sorry to disturb you,\" Wei Qi said apologetically from the doorway.","\"Come in and have a seat.\" Ye Qiusuo stepped aside to let her in. Her first thought was, \"Did something happen to Xie Xi?\"","Wei Qi was taken aback, then smiled: \"He's perfectly fine, just finished selecting the MV leads. It's about your glasses that he damaged. Xie Xi specially went to get a new pair for you. I thought the campus would be crowded, so I didn't let him deliver them himself.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at the bag being pressed into her hand: \"I've already had new glasses made.\"","\"Our Xie Xi is always a bit impulsive, doesn't plan things out. Professor Ye, please try these on first. If you don't like them, just set them aside. It'll at least give him some closure.\"","With things put that way, Ye Qiusuo could only take out the glasses to try.","They were indeed much more comfortable than the pair she'd bought hastily that night, and the chain prevented slipping.","Wei Qi watched as Ye Qiusuo put on the glasses. A flash of admiration crossed her eyes, though her expression remained perfectly composed: \"These glasses suit you very well, Professor Ye. If Xie Xi saw you wearing the glasses he bought, it would probably ease his guilt quite a bit.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't respond to that remark. Instead, she asked: \"He's selecting MV leads? May I ask who he chose?\"","Wei Qi didn't know why Professor Ye was interested in this, but it wasn't a secret, so she told her the names of the selected male and female leads.","A thoughtful look flashed in Ye Qiusuo's eyes. In the original book, the male lead for this MV was Xia Zhoubing. Now, it differed from the plot."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo planned to invite five students to her home for a meal today. Early in the morning, she went to buy ingredients. However, upon entering the supermarket, someone suddenly shouted, \"Professor Ye!\"","She turned and nodded at the person—perhaps a student, she didn't think much of it.","Yet the next second, the person rushed over: \"Are you Professor Ye? Can... can we take a photo?\"","Professor Ye: \"?\"","\"I'm your fan!\"","The concept of \"fans\" felt too distant for Ye Qiusuo. Before she could react, a crowd gathered around her, directly taking photos with their phones.","Ye Qiusuo could only hurriedly leave the supermarket, without even having time to buy the groceries.","\"Quiz Showdown\" now consistently ranks in the top three for viewership ratings, and Ye Qiusuo is the most dazzling guest on the show. Unable to find her Weibo, netizens created a super topic for her, where fan activity is extremely high.","\"Professor, can we come over now to help?\"","Sitting in her car, Ye Qiusuo tapped open a voice message from Lin Lu.","\"...Could you trouble yourselves to buy the groceries and bring them over? I can't get out right now.\" Ye Qiusuo sent Lin Lu the menu she had written the night before.","\"Sure thing!\" Lin Lu agreed immediately.","\"How is it?\" Ding Hong asked, standing beside him.","\"The professor asked us to buy the groceries.\" Lin Lu promptly forwarded the menu to the five-person group chat.","The group huddled together, divided up the shopping list, and prepared to split up to make the purchases.","Observing their barely concealed excitement, Ding Hong felt a wave of emotion.","In his previous research group, people also competed to do things for their professor, especially personal errands, as it helped them gain visibility and build a good relationship. When the professor was in a good mood, they might give you a leg up.","This was an unspoken rule tacitly acknowledged among many students.","A senior from Ding Hong's past had mentioned this to him, and even on certain forums, similar sentiments were often expressed below posts.","Therefore, he had previously accepted this mode as the default, considering such maneuvering and scheming entirely normal.","But in fact, not all professors are like that.","Their current team was probably the dream environment for all STEM students. There was no sense of a hierarchical struggle with the professor; each student had their own projects, and everyone helped each other out.","Ding Hong even began to feel grateful for Meng Weiren's departure back then.","\"Let's go, we'll buy the drinks.\" Lin Lu called for Ding Hong to go with him.","...","The students arrived with the ingredients, helped wash and chop the vegetables, and some even helped with the cooking. In the end, Ye Qiusuo was ushered into the living room to rest.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","Since morning, things had developed beyond Professor Ye's expectations.","The cooking task fell to Ding Hong and Lin Lu, who claimed to be experts. The others, after washing and prepping the ingredients, came out and sat with their professor to watch TV.","The idea of inviting her students for a meal was actually suggested by a colleague, who said she should at least treat them once a year to help them relax a bit.","\"No need to be too formal.\" Professor Ye wanted her students to relax. \"We're all around the same age.\"","The students: \"...\" They felt even more flustered and somewhat ashamed.","They were all around the same age, yet Professor Ye was already supervising graduate students, while they still felt they knew nothing.","\"What would you like to watch?\" Ye Qiusuo tried to hand the remote control to a student.","\"Professor, we'll watch whatever you're watching.\" The students sat upright on the sofa, each as restrained as a timid new bride.","She'll definitely watch the news or a science/technology documentary channel. A high-achieving young professor like her would never waste any time to absorb knowledge.","The students communicated this with their eyes.","Professor Ye pressed the remote a few times and switched to Galaxy TV Channel 2, which was replaying the mentor performance episode of \"Star of Tomorrow.\" She put the remote down.","Students: \"?!\" What about the science channel?","On TV, the stage was dazzling, and the musical intro began to play.","\"Ahhh! XiXi!\" one student suddenly screamed.","\"What are they watching?\" Lin Lu curiously peeked out from the kitchen.","Xie Xi stood on the performance stage, a black and gold robe draped over him, holding a microphone as if incarnating a demon king. His originally clear, bright voice had also taken on a deeper, more alluring quality.","It felt completely different from when he sang in the elevator.","Ye Qiusuo watched the person on screen. She liked his singing; there was always a special power in it.","As the song ended, the student who had screamed excitedly was already moved to tears: \"Our XiXi is amazing, sob sob, Mommy loves you so much!\"","Professor Ye, hearing her student's words: \"...\"","What is this 'Mommy' thing?","This was Professor Ye's first encounter with a 'mom fan,' having never followed celebrities before.","Thanks to this student's outburst, the others relaxed considerably and started speaking more freely.","\"Xie Xi really sings well.\"","\"Of course! Our XiXi is absolutely phenomenal, especially live. It's so much better than these recorded versions.\"","\"You've been to a live show?\"","\"I managed to get a ticket for a concert last year. Unfortunately, I was too far away to see our XiXi's face clearly.\"","Listening to her students' chatter, Ye Qiusuo recalled the song Xie Xi sang in the elevator. It was truly pleasant to listen to. She even felt that if the accompaniment and production weren't done well, it could easily detract from his voice.","\"Ah, I remember now!\" Sun Jiajia's eyes lit up as she looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"Professor, you were at the 'Star of Tomorrow' live recording before, right? Did you see XiXi?!\"","\"Wasn't the professor recording for 'Quiz Showdown'?\" Lin Lu asked casually, bringing out a dish.","\"During the 'Star of Tomorrow' challenge round, I saw the professor in the audience. I think all the 'Quiz Showdown' guests went that time,\" said a student who followed both shows.","\"I did go,\" Ye Qiusuo answered patiently. \"Xie Xi's singing is indeed very good.\"","\"Sob sob sob!\" Sun Jiajia suddenly became teary-eyed. \"I have no regrets now!\"","Professor Ye frowned, finding her student rather peculiar.","What she didn't know was that this student was shipping them as a couple.","\"Star of Tomorrow\" and \"Quiz Showdown\" aired on the same day during different time slots. Some netizens, watching one after the other, developed rather peculiar ideas.","Xie Xi, needless to say, was a top figure on a certain video site. Statistics showed his clips accounted for half of all 'shipping' edit videos.","Ye Qiusuo, as the dark horse guest on \"Quiz Showdown,\" attracted a group of netizens with her excellent looks and incredibly precise answering style.","She wasn't a celebrity, and there was very little video material of her online. Thirsty netizens could only work with the footage from \"Quiz Showdown.\"","A small group of netizens started editing videos pairing Ye Qiusuo with Xie Xi.","Sun Jiajia was one of them. She enjoyed watching Xie Xi paired with others in fan edits; as long as they looked good together, she could 'ship' it. When study pressure was high, she'd ship for relief; when feeling down, she'd ship for a pick-me-up.","One day, Sun Jiajia suddenly came across a fan edit pairing her own professor with Xie Xi, and from then on, she fell deep into the ship, unable to extricate herself.","Now, hearing her professor personally say that XiXi sang well—this was clearly sugar!","Even if it was imaginary sugar, a sugar-seeking girl could still immerse herself in her own fabricated happiness.","Who else could get close to one of the actual people involved? Who else!","If the professor weren't right there, Sun Jiajia would be 'squealing with delight' right now.","The dishes in the kitchen were almost ready. Several students got up to help bring out the food, insisting the professor stay seated and rest.","Ye Qiusuo casually picked up her phone and noticed Xie Xi had sent a voice message. She tapped to play it.","Xie Xi’s deliberately drawn-out voice instantly came through: \"Teacher—\"","Ye Qiusuo replied, \"Xie Xi, speak properly.\"","\"We’re recording the music video on Sunday afternoon and might not make it in time. Can we reschedule the lesson?\" Xie Xi’s voice immediately returned to normal.","Sun Jiajia, who was just bringing out the dishes: \"...\" She was so immersed in her fangirling that every voice started to sound like her idol Xie Xi.","Ye Qiusuo didn’t notice her student. She held down the voice message button: \"I’m free Friday morning or Saturday evening. See which one works for you.\"","A few minutes later, Xie Xi replied choosing Saturday evening.","\"Professor, try this sweet and sour pork ribs—Ding Hong made them.\" Lin Lu, bolder than the other students, directly picked up a piece of freshly cooked ribs with her chopsticks, offering to feed Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo instinctively leaned back and took hold of the chopsticks. \"I’ll help myself. Everyone, sit down and eat.\"","The students gathered around, and naturally, the most enjoyable topic was gossip. Lin Lu, influenced by her sisters at home, could always keep up with Sun Jiajia’s chatter, and the others listened with great interest.","\"Over the past two years, if we’re talking about the most striking-looking male actor, it has to be Xia Zhoubing,\" Sun Jiajia said enthusiastically. \"He’s bound to get famous sooner or later.\"","\"Isn’t Xia Zhoubing the one who challenged our professor on that show?\" Lin Lu narrowed her eyes. \"His character doesn’t seem great.\"","\"Really?\" Sun Jiajia didn’t know about this. She had only watched fan-edited clips and hadn’t actually seen \"Knowledge Q&A,\" as all her time was spent following her idol, Xie Xi.","Also, she and Lin Lu weren’t on the same project and hadn’t watched the show together.","Lin Lu promptly explained, \"He once accused the professor of having a question bank, but was proven wrong on the spot.\"","\"I didn’t know about that...\" Sun Jiajia whispered, sneakily glancing at Ye Qiusuo across the table.","Ye Qiusuo, holding her chopsticks, looked at her student. \"It’s fine that you like him. Don’t worry about me.\"","In the original story, Xia Zhoubing would indeed become popular. Once Xie Xi’s album was released, it set new records. As the male lead of the music video, Xia Zhoubing naturally received immense attention. Moreover, Xia Zhoubing had landed a role in a drama that would also become a huge hit.","Although the plan for him to appear in the music video had suddenly fallen through.","The students had come to a consensus through their interactions: their professor never lied.","Sun Jiajia felt half-relieved, but her fondness for Xia Zhoubing suddenly diminished significantly.","...","After the students left, Ye Qiusuo stood in the living room for a moment, then took her phone, intending to search for Xia Zhoubing.","Calculating the timeline, today should be the day the drama officially announced Xia Zhoubing as the male lead.","However, before Ye Qiusuo could search, as soon as she opened Weibo, Xia Zhoubing’s name was prominently featured on the hot search list.","His name was linked with that new drama, becoming a trending topic.","\"Xia Zhoubing to Star in 'The Wanderer'\"","Ye Qiusuo clicked in and saw that he had already finished shooting his official character posters.","This drama was a double male lead production. The other male lead was a veteran actor, and with a competent director and solid script, the entire cast was generally skilled. Regardless of Xia Zhoubing’s own performance, under such conditions, once it became a hit, even a dog passing by in the series would be praised by the audience for its great acting.","Professor Ye felt somewhat conflicted. In the original text, the author described Xia Zhoubing as someone who always repaid grievances. Anyone who offended him or Wan Yourou would face retaliation.","It was hard to imagine that Xia Zhoubing wouldn’t hold a grudge over Xie Xi rejecting him for the music video male lead role.","Especially that day, when Xie Xi’s agent mentioned the matter, his expression was odd, seemingly also puzzled about why Xia Zhoubing wasn’t chosen.","When it came to offending people, probably no one could surpass Xie Xi.","But Professor Ye felt that Xie Xi shouldn’t be forced out of the industry by scandal. Perhaps if he acted a little more restrained, offended fewer people, then if trouble arose later, there wouldn’t be so many ready to kick him when he was down.","Ye Qiusuo sat down at her computer, found an audio file of the \"Heart Sutra,\" forwarded it to Xie Xi, and added a note: [\"Cultivate your mind and character. Remember to listen to this often.\"]","Xie Xi, who opened it directly: \"???\""]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21","paragraphs":["Recently busy with his vlog, Xie Xi had been in the recording studio, his phone connected to the sound system.","When Ye Qiusuo sent a link, Xie Xi didn't notice the text above it and casually tapped.","A serene, Buddha-nature-filled chanting sound slowly flowed out, and everyone in the recording studio turned to look.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","\"Xixi, you want to use this material?\" the musician beside him asked in surprise. \"This is a bit novel. Combining it might just be a hit.\"","The people in the studio naturally assumed Xie Xi had played this on purpose and actually started enthusiastically discussing the feasibility of incorporating this Buddhist chant.","Xie Xi turned off his phone and said calmly, \"I'll think about it, but I don't think it'll work. Let's forget it.\"","Someone even sounded a bit regretful: \"Not using it? I thought the idea was quite good.\"","\"Just stick to the original plan,\" Xie Xi refused immediately. He didn't want to chant scriptures in his vlog.","Even before leaving, a musician was still hung up on that \"Heart-Calming Sutra\": \"Xixi, maybe you could give it a try, really.\"","Sitting in the car, Xie Xi opened Ye Qiusuo's WeChat, trying hard to make out what that one sentence she had sent was, based on his vague memory.","The more he looked, the angrier he got. He reached out and poked her profile picture hard, as if that could vent his emotions.","However, WeChat had recently updated, and tapping the profile picture twice would trigger a \"You patted [person].\"","Xie Xi watched helplessly as a line of small gray text suddenly appeared on the interface: 'I patted Professor Ye.'","!","How do you delete this?","To make matters worse, a voice message came from the other side very quickly: \"Xie Xi, you patted me. Is something wrong?\"","Clearly, Professor Ye on the other end didn't understand what this was either.","Xie Xi: \"I... I'm submitting my homework.\"","At this moment, Xie Xi had to admire his own quick wit. He directly started chanting.","Although he had only heard it once in a hurry, he could recite it completely.","Professor Ye, listening to someone chant scriptures late at night, was uncharacteristically stunned. After he finished sending the long voice message, she thought for a moment and said, \"This is not the homework.\"","\"Okay, goodbye, teacher,\" Xie Xi replied briskly.","Zhang Dong in the front seat asked somewhat suspiciously, \"Brother Xi, does Professor Ye usually just teach you to chant scriptures?\"","Don't tell me he's joined some cult. I've heard those kinds of groups have infiltrated universities these days.","\"Don't mention the word 'chanting' in front of me,\" Xie Xi said, covering his ears, lying back in the seat, wrapping himself in his clothes, and closing his eyes to rest.","He had none of the aura of a big star.","...","The tutoring time had changed, so the location naturally had to change. The main doors of the teaching building were locked by staff on weekend nights, so Xie Xi couldn't get in. Ye Qiusuo told him to come directly to her office.","\"Brother Xi, that room ahead should be Professor Ye's office,\" Zhang Dong led Xie Xi all the way there.","\"You go back first. Come pick me up in two hours,\" Xie Xi said and then walked into the office.","Zhang Dong looked at that office, scratched his head, and couldn't shake the feeling that late at night, the office carried a hint of a rosy, romantic shadow.","Ye Qiusuo was reviewing materials, wearing those silver-rimmed glasses with a chain. Under the lamp, the frames gleamed with a cold light. As she looked up at Xie Xi, the chain that had been resting on her collarbone fell and swayed gently.","Xie Xi was momentarily dazed but quickly regained his composure. He took out his homework notebook and placed it on Ye Qiusuo's desk: \"Finished.\"","By 'finished,' he meant he had filled this entire notebook.","Surely there was no need to copy texts anymore, Xie Xi thought confidently. He hated copying so much; looking at the characters made him dizzy.","Ye Qiusuo reached into a drawer beside her and pulled out a new homework notebook: \"Copy from this one from now on.\"","Xie Xi looked at the new notebook, somewhat incredulous: \"Why do I still have to copy?\"","This is something only elementary school students do.","Ye Qiusuo opened his old homework notebook and examined it carefully. Sure enough, although Xie Xi couldn't see the characters clearly, the fixed character structures were still presented in a different pattern.","\"The first book was relatively simple. This later one has more complex characters.\"","\"Then I'll copy one page every two days,\" Xie Xi, knowing he couldn't change the task, immediately started bargaining.","Ye Qiusuo's hand, which was flipping through the notebook, paused. She then looked up at him: \"Fine.\"","Copying is indeed difficult and uncomfortable for someone with dyslexia.","That Xie Xi had persisted in finishing the first notebook was something Ye Qiusuo hadn't fully anticipated either.","He was more reasonable than imagined.","It was hard to dislike him.","There was only one desk in the office, but fortunately, it was large. Ye Qiusuo had Xie Xi sit across from her to copy.","Sitting face to face, each other's movements were clearly visible, leaving no room for slacking off.","Xie Xi wrote stroke by stroke with extreme seriousness and slowness, dragging out the time.","Almost an hour passed, and Xie Xi now understood why Ye Qiusuo could become a professor at such a young age.","She read at an incredibly fast speed, completely incomparable to ordinary people, and her concentration was extremely high. For such a long time, aside from the action of turning pages, she had basically not moved.","\"This is bad for your neck,\" Xie Xi suddenly blurted out.","Ye Qiusuo finished reading the page in her hand before looking up at him: \"Don't get distracted.\"","\"Just a reminder,\" the big star Xie felt wronged.","At that moment, Ye Qiusuo's phone rang. She glanced at the screen, a flicker of surprise crossing her eyes.","Across from her, Xie Xi watched as Ye Qiusuo took her phone and stood up, answering the call by the window.","\"You've arrived now?\" Ye Qiusuo held the phone, looked up at the wall clock, and said to the person on the other end, \"I'm at the university. It'll be another hour before I finish.\"","Listening to Ye Qiusuo talking to the person on the phone, Xie Xi suddenly pushed off with his feet, sliding his chair back to the window, and looked up at her: \"Do you have something to do? Go ahead.\"","Ye Qiusuo covered the phone's receiver: \"I promised you we'd have class today.\"","There's an order to things. She couldn't cancel Xie Xi's lesson just because the other person was her good friend.","\"I'll sit here and copy. You go ahead,\" Xie Xi suggested.","Ye Qiusuo looked hesitant. Her friend hadn't returned to the country in a long time, and things had changed so much domestically that someone really did need to go meet her.","\"I promise to write properly, no distractions,\" Xie Xi was practically raising his hand to swear.","Ye Qiusuo weighed the options for a moment and agreed to his suggestion: \"I might not be back in an hour. After you finish writing, lock the door. I'll get it back tomorrow when I go to Gaoxing TV Station.\"","Xie Xi took the key from her hand, the picture of an obedient student. He watched Ye Qiusuo leave and even waved.","Once Ye Qiusuo was gone, he couldn't keep up the act. He lifted his hand, closed the homework notebook, sat in the chair, and spun around a few times by pushing off the floor with his feet.","He looked around the office. It was pitifully sparse: only one desk, a few chairs, and a bookcase behind it filled with A4-sized documents.","What a boring person.","Such a large office didn't even have a small potted plant. Xie Xi could even imagine Ye Qiusuo coming in and out every day, doing nothing but research and academics.","Xie Xi took out his phone and sent a voice message to his assistant: \"Zhang Dong, when you come, buy me a few potted plants.\"","\"Brother Xi, what kind of plants do you want?\"","Xie Xi spun in his chair, thought for a moment, and said, \"The kind that can live well without anyone taking care of them... like a cactus.\"","\"Small ones or big ones?\"","\"Small ones, the kind you can put on a desk.\"","\"Alright.\" After agreeing, Zhang Dong suddenly sent another voice message, \"Brother Xi, don't you have class? Does Professor Ye allow you to use your phone in class?\"","Xie Xi replied flawlessly, \"It's break time right now.\"","His assistant, suspecting nothing, dutifully trotted off to the garden center late at night to pick out a cactus.","As class end time approached, Ye Qiusuo indeed hadn't returned. Xie Xi waited for his assistant instead.","\"Where's the cactus?\"","\"Here.\" Zhang Dong took a small pot of cactus out of a box. The pot was clearly chosen with care.","Xie Xi carried the little cactus into the office and placed it on Ye Qiusuo's desk.","\"Brother Xi, why isn't Professor Ye here?\" Zhang Dong, who had followed him in, asked curiously.","\"She had something come up and left early.\" Xie Xi pulled out a piece of white paper from nearby, tore off a small strip, wrote something on it, and finally stuck it onto the cactus.","After finishing this, he stood up. \"Let's go back.\"","...","Ye Qiusuo drove to the airport. Her good friend was already waiting for her on a bench at the arrivals exit.","\"Seems like this place hasn't changed much either.\" Rong Shiyun stood up with a smile upon seeing Ye Qiusuo.","\"The airport really hasn't changed much.\" Ye Qiusuo looked at her friend. \"Why the sudden return? You said you'd give me a heads-up before.\"","\"Saw a cheap last-minute ticket and just came.\" Rong Shiyun pulled up the handle of her suitcase. \"What were you busy with on Saturday night?\"","\"Tutoring a student.\"","\"Tutoring? Even in university they need that now?\" Rong Shiyun was somewhat shocked. How many years had she been gone? Was university tutoring a trend now?","Ye Qiusuo shook her head. \"Not a student from the university.\"","Rong Shiyun remained puzzled. How much money could tutoring an off-campus student make? For people like them, it was a waste of time.","But clearly, Ye Qiusuo had no intention of explaining further.","\"That glasses look pretty good on you,\" Rong Shiyun remarked after looking Ye Qiusuo over for a moment.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\" She wasn't good at responding to comments like that.","Driving back, Rong Shiyun exclaimed the whole way about how much things had changed.","Because her friend had arrived unexpectedly, Ye Qiusuo took Rong Shiyun to her own home. By the time they settled in, it was already over an hour past the scheduled end of the tutoring session.","After some thought, she sent a voice message asking if Xie Xi had left.","\"I've already left. There's a little cactus on the desk. Teacher, you must take good care of it.\" After saying this, Xie Xi even attached a photo of the cactus.","The tiny pot sat on the desk, looking utterly forlorn.","To think he could produce a cactus just because she was gone for an hour.","Next time, she'd have to make sure to watch him finish the entire lesson.","Professor Ye thought silently to herself, while Xie Xi, on the other end, remained completely unaware that he had just dug a pit for himself.","...","On Sunday evening, there was a program recording. Rong Shiyun was very interested upon hearing about it, but unfortunately, she had to have dinner with her former mentor.","\"Qiusuo, I'm coming to watch your recording next week,\" Rong Shiyun said before leaving.","\"Mhm.\"","Ye Qiusuo originally planned to find Xie Xi to get her key back before the recording, but they didn't run into each other, and the program recording preparations began.","This episode, the competition format had changed. The questions were no longer from a question bank; instead, top figures from various fields were invited to set questions related to knowledge points in their industries.","The difficulty instantly shot up.","In the previous episodes, Ye Qiusuo had consistently scored full marks, making the outcome too predictable. After discussion, the production team decided to increase the difficulty.","Just as the production team expected, Ye Qiusuo began to answer incorrectly. After all, she was human, with limited knowledge reserves. Moreover, there were some industries she had no contact with at all, such as knowledge about film and music.","Questions of this type were mostly scored by Wan Yurou.","\"Please listen to the question: In 'Autumn Waters,' what was the final sentence Lan Yiren said while standing by the river?\"","Professor Ye: \"...\" She didn't even know what 'Autumn Waters' was.","Wan Yurou on stage seized this question and successfully answered it.","\"Yurou is amazing, you can even remember that!\" The crosstalk actor beside her immediately chimed in with praise.","\"I really love watching movies and singing,\" Wan Yurou finally regained her confidence, smiling faintly with pursed lips. \"'Autumn Waters' is my favorite movie; I've watched it at least thirty times.\"","The host marveled, \"Thirty times? No wonder Yurou remembers it.\"","Ye Qiusuo was experiencing a rare setback, and everyone present was pleased. They had been suppressed for too long and had started to doubt their own intelligence.","During the mid-show break, everyone was in high spirits. Ye Qiusuo stood up and went out, wanting to find Xie Xi to get her office key back.","Wan Yurou stood at the center of the group. Glimpsing Ye Qiusuo leaving, a smile touched her lips. She politely excused herself to those around her, saying she needed some fresh air.","Xie Xi was also on his break. He came out and returned the key to Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo stared at the key in her hand for a long moment, almost not recognizing it as her own. After just one night, the key ring had transformed from an ordinary metal one into... a yellow soft rubber ring, with a little yellow duck attached to the side.","The entire key was a glaring, brilliant yellow.","\"I gave it a little makeover,\" Xie Xi said, holding his fingers a tiny distance apart, looking utterly innocent. \"Teacher, don't be mad at me.\"","He firmly refused to admit that he had broken the other's keychain out of sheer boredom and then replaced it with a new one.","Professor Ye stared at the dazzling little yellow duck in her hand for a long time before finally looking up at Xie Xi. She said seriously, \"Xie Xi, you can't impose your own will on others.\"","Xie Xi was taken aback. \"Are you angry?\"","Ye Qiusuo wasn't angry because he had replaced her keychain. Rather, she was thinking about his behavior and how it led to his eventual withdrawal from the industry in the future.","There was... perhaps some element of regretting wasted talent involved.","His singing was so beautiful, his talent in that area unmatched. Yet, in the end, he was surpassed by Lu Mingzhe.","Moreover, Xie Xi's nature wasn't bad; in fact, he was considerably better than that original male lead.","\"Don't do things like this in the future,\" Ye Qiusuo frowned, unsure how best to admonish him.","Xie Xi gave a low 'oh.' \"I won't in the future. Don't be angry.\"","...","The two of them standing together talking, and Xie Xi handing over the key, were all seen clearly by Wan Yurou from around the corner of the corridor."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22","paragraphs":["Autograph?","Before Xie Xi could even process what was happening, Ye Qiusuo had already taken out a small notebook and a pen. She flipped to the first page and waited for him to sign.","Xie Xi, a major star who had signed countless autographs, found himself at a loss for the first time on how to begin.","He coughed lightly into a fisted hand, took the pen from Ye Qiusuo with his other hand, and bent his head, writing for a long time.","When Ye Qiusuo took it back to look, she saw he had drawn a simple sketch on the paper. It was a little figure wearing glasses, sitting on the ground with a serious expression. Next to it was an arrow pointing to the words 'Professor Ye', and behind the figure's bottom were a few little black stars.","Apart from the beautiful signature and sketch in the bottom right corner, those three characters 'Professor Ye' were written crookedly, with strokes missing.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","\"My friend really likes you. I'm asking for the autograph on her behalf,\" she explained instinctively.","Xie Xi was taken aback; he had thought she wanted it for herself.","\"What's her surname?\" Xie Xi instantly switched to his official, professional mode.","In reality, Xie Xi mostly just signed his name and rarely did personalized 'to' autographs. His team always tried to avoid having him write anything more in public. On the rare occasions when he was in a good mood, he would draw a simple sketch on it and add a few stars.","This quirk had become something of a peculiar legend among celebrity autographs. Given that Xie Xi was often labeled 'difficult' by journalists during interviews, it was hard to imagine him doing something so slightly childish.","\"Rong.\" Ye Qiusuo turned to another blank page.","Xie Xi lowered his head and swiftly signed his name, adding 'To Rong:' very properly at the front.","\"All done.\" He handed the pen back to Ye Qiusuo.","\"Thank you.\" Professor Ye said earnestly.","The mid-session break was almost over, so the two parted ways, completely unaware that someone was standing around the corner.","Wan Yurou had originally come out hoping to proactively befriend Ye Qiusuo. The biggest buzz around this show was centered on Ye Qiusuo. Her agent had advised her to get on good terms with Ye Qiusuo—perhaps invite her out for a meal, or take some selfies together to dispel those online 'rumors' pitting them against each other. Then they could buy a trending topic, which might help regain some attention.","At the very start of the program, Wan Yurou's real-time search volume had actually been skyrocketing, especially during the initial comparisons between her and Ye Qiusuo. Even though she lost badly, there was discussion. However, in the later stages, perhaps because Wan Yurou and Ye Qiusuo were simply not on the same level, her attention rapidly declined. Even marketing accounts couldn't generate buzz by tagging her.","Starting from this episode, only ten guests remained, and the five celebrity guests among them had also entered an elimination round, with one person leaving each episode. Wan Yurou had scored quite a few points in the first half today and was in a good mood, which was why she had followed Ye Qiusuo out.","She never expected to witness this scene.","Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi were standing face to face, very close, and Xie Xi was handing something like a key to Ye Qiusuo.","Malicious thoughts often surface inadvertently.","Xie Xi, as a top-tier singer with looks far above average, had an extremely large fan base. In the past, when a female star tried to latch onto him for publicity, she was boycotted by his fans and still hadn't recovered.","Wan Yurou abandoned the idea of befriending Ye Qiusuo. Standing nearby, she flipped her hair with one hand, opened her camera, and took several consecutive selfies.","She had the TV station's interior design to thank for this. Perhaps because many celebrities and artists frequented the place, there were various large and small mirrors everywhere.","After taking the photos, she posted on Weibo a set of four pictures in a grid with the caption: [Mid-session break, hoping to score well in the next half~]","Among the four photos, one had a corner of a mirror in the background where you could clearly see Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi standing face to face.","Last time, at Tianqiu Tech, Ye Qiusuo had been accidentally captured in the background of a photo. This time, Wan Yurou was deliberate.","Wan Yurou didn't have time to check the comments before being called back to record the second half of the show, but she could already imagine the uproar that would erupt online. Xie Xi's fans would surely swarm to attack Ye Qiusuo.","After all, male idol fans always had particularly strong combat power.","Compared to transparent glass, a mirror obviously provided a much clearer view.","Almost a minute after the Weibo post went up, netizens spotted something fishy.","[Is my eyesight failing me in the bottom left corner of the third photo?]","[Are those people in the mirror Xie Xi and... who?]","[It really is Xie Xi. The person facing him looks familiar too.]","[...Isn't that Professor Ye?]","Whenever the words 'Xie Xi' were involved, marketing accounts instantly caught the wind and either reposted Wan Yurou's Weibo or edited new hashtags.","Soon, the matter appeared on the hot search list.","'Xie Xi in Wan Yurou's Selfie'","As soon as Xie Xi's fans saw their idol's name, they immediately clicked in. Traffic and click-through rates surged, pushing the hot search ranking even higher. The comments under the first marketing account to repost and edit had already surpassed ten thousand.","The mirror in Wan Yurou's photo was magnified several times, making it very clear that the two people were Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo.","However, the fans' reaction this time was beyond everyone's expectations.","[My gege's side profile is absolutely killer! That perfect nose, those heaven-defying long eyelashes! I could slide down his eyelashes!]","[Professor Ye's side profile is also good-looking. She actually isn't overshadowed by Xixi. These two could be video game character models.]","[What is Xixi doing?]","Actually, Wan Yurou had deliberately chosen her angle when taking the photo. From that perspective, you could only see the two standing face to face. The notebook in Ye Qiusuo's hand was small to begin with, and the pen was a retractable portable one. At first glance, it looked like they were in an intimate, hand-holding stance.","But this couldn't escape the fans' sharp eyes. They guessed based on Xie Xi's posture.","[He should be holding a pen in his hand. When Xixi holds a pen, his index finger always likes to lift up a little bit.]","[Is he signing an autograph? Did Professor Ye ask Xixi for an autograph?!!! Does Professor Ye like our Xixi too?]","[Ahhhhh! Worlds are colliding! My two favorite people!]","[Our Xixi is truly worthy of being liked. He is a treasure among men, Professor Ye @Ye Qiusuo]","[Xixizi is good-looking, can sing, liking him is definitely not wrong! Professor Ye @Ye Qiusuo]","The comments were instantly derailed, all crazily recommending Xie Xi to Ye Qiusuo.","The fans praised Xie Xi in every imaginable way, listing his achievements over the years, and all @'ed Professor Ye.","Ye Qiusuo, a young and accomplished professor, was somewhat different from entertainment industry celebrities in the minds of netizens. She carried an academic halo in the public eye, and the fans were eager for Ye Qiusuo to like Xie Xi.","It would prove their Xixi's charm was boundless!","There was just one problem: Ye Qiusuo had not opened a verified account. A bunch of netizens had @'ed the wrong person.","There was one person on Weibo called 'Professor Ye', with 110,000 followers.","It was Ye Qiusu.","Several years ago, a research project she had worked on made the news, and she herself was hailed by netizens as a beautiful professor. That's when she gained those followers.","Ye Qiusu was an active Weibo user. That day, being @'ed by so many people, especially after realizing netizens had mistaken her for Ye Qiusuo, immediately put her in a bad mood.","For a professor accustomed to a high position in her field, it felt like her territory was being encroached upon.","Actually, most netizens who have followed \"Knowledge Q&A\" know that Ye Qiusu doesn't have an official Weibo account. But Weibo is a place where non-existent accounts can be created, and these people casually posted, not expecting Professor Ye to be a real person.","Ye Qiusu soon posted a Weibo, asking those netizens not to spread misinformation and affect her.","Of course, being a professor, she wouldn't say it outright. She seriously wrote about a hundred words, with enough implication between the lines for netizens to understand she dislikes being mistaken for someone else.","Fans who saw this post spontaneously tried to rein in others in the comments, but everyone's focus remained on Ye Qiusu and Xie Xi.","Meanwhile, under the trending topic, an entertainment blogger suddenly posted: [\"Is no one shipping Professor Ye and Xixizi? [Animated GIF]\"]","The GIF was from the scene when Xie Xi first arrived at Gaoxing TV Station to record \"Tomorrow's Star,\" signing autographs and taking photos with supporting fans. Then, Ye Qiusu suddenly walked through the shot, holding her jacket in one hand, striding forward, just as Xie Xi glanced toward the camera.","The blogger later slowed down the GIF. Professor Ye had an aura of a big boss passing by, while Xie Xi's sidelong glance... fans could secretly imagine all sorts of emotions between them without any editing.","This Weibo post attracted many fans.","[Wow, when was this from?!]","[Professor Ye looks exactly like a mafia boss passing by, so alpha! I'm done for, I think I'm bending.]","[Wuwuwu, our Xixizi's eyes are so beautiful. How could Professor Ye not even look at him! Look at him, please!!!]","[I beg the video editors, let our Xixizi turn the tables in this scenario. I just can't stand seeing Xixizi being slighted.]","[Back then, Professor Ye ignored our Xixizi, but now she's asking him for an autograph. The 'truth comes out' law might be late, but it never misses.]","The situation gradually developed in a bizarre direction. People actually started digging up various video clips of the two, wanting to create a saga of love and hate.","Of course, the main theme was Xie Xi's later comeback.","Many hands make light work. As netizens dug deeper, they suddenly discovered some small details.","[The milk tea Professor Ye drank in a certain episode is actually the same brand as Xixizi's?!]","[Not just that, during that knockout round, I remember the \"Knowledge Q&A\" guests were standing below the audience seats. Everyone around was excitedly cheering, but Professor Ye just stood there with a serious face.]","[I'm feeling it! I'm feeling the vibe! Please, great editors, cut the video quickly!!!]","The video editors got right to it, fueled by passion, and soon produced a fan-made shipping video for the two.","Their first encounter at the TV station entrance: Professor Ye walks right past Xie Xi, completely ignoring him, while Xie Xi falls for her at first sight. Later, he secretly sends her the same brand of milk tea—the screen splits to show both of them holding a cup. Then, Professor Ye receives Xie Xi's invitation to his concert and stands expressionless in the audience.","A voiceover from a movie line is added, suggesting that Professor Ye actually liked Xie Xi early on too, but had to hide her feelings due to family reasons.","Yes, in the video, Ye Qiusu's surface identity is a professor, but she's actually from a mafia family.","After going through various trials, Professor Ye finally has an epiphany, goes to find Xie Xi, and they stand face-to-face as she confesses her admiration.","[Hahaha, our Xixizi's charm is irresistible!]","[Suddenly happy. Professor Ye and I like the same person, so by extension, we're sisters!]","[Ahhhhh, this is so good to ship! Is there any creator who can make a story about a top student and a slacker? I'd love to see that!!!]","After finishing recording the show, Wan Yurou opened Weibo only to see this kind of trending topic and comments. Everyone had suddenly started shipping this pair.","Wan Yurou: \"...\"","This feeling of things not going her way was something she hadn't experienced in a long time.","Mo Hong, after all, was the agent who managed Wan Yurou. She soon called to ask if the photos on Weibo were intentionally posted by Wan.","\"In the future, if you do something like this, tell me in advance. And don't do it yourself personally. It's better to have an outsider 'accidentally' leak your photos,\" Mo Hong said, already formulating a counter-strategy. She told Wan Yurou to rest early as she had an audition the next morning.","Most netizens only see what others show them. That night, Mo Hong hired a batch of marketing accounts and paid commenters to control the narrative, forcefully clearing Wan Yurou of suspicion and even pushing her onto the trending list to generate goodwill among netizens.","#WanYurouInTheShot","Major marketing accounts spoke in unison, all saying that Wan Yurou always manages to get others in her shots, having her spotlight stolen—poor her.","Comments below expressed sympathy for Wan Yurou, saying she was unlucky. They advised her to improve her photography skills and avoid taking selfies anywhere with glass or mirrors from now on.","With good enough marketing, black can be spun into white.","However, people within the industry can spot this kind of marketing at a glance.","Wei Qi hadn't paid much attention to Wan Yurou initially. After all, they were all recording at the TV station, on the same floor; it was possible Xie Xi accidentally walked into the shot.","But the reaction from Wan Yurou's team made Wei Qi realize this might not have been an 'accident' after all.","Mo Hong had worked under Wei Qi for two years in the past. She wasn't particularly clever. She had the ambition of an agent but lacked the skill, only being average at best.","For her to seize this opportunity out of thin air to generate heat for Wan Yurou—Mo Hong didn't have that kind of marketing instinct. It was only likely due to certain reasons that she took this step.","Working backwards, Wei Qi deduced that the photos were intentionally released by Wan Yurou herself.","Wei Qi had only managed Xie Xi all these years, practically treating him like her own son. Someone scheming against Xie Xi naturally earned a mark in her mental book.","Pushing open the balcony door, Wei Qi stepped outside and made a call to a director she knew.","\"Director Liu, I heard you're recently casting for the female lead in 'Red Ear'? Our company just signed a new girl, very spirited, absolutely perfect for the female lead's image.\" Wei Qi didn't manage other artists herself, but that didn't stop her from recommending talents from within the company.","\"When did you start handling actor-artists?\" Director Liu asked curiously on the other end.","Wei Qi laughed. \"I don't. Xixizi alone keeps me busy enough. It's just that I heard you were searching everywhere for the female lead. I've read the original novel for 'Red Ear,' and I happened to see that girl the other day. I thought she was especially suited for the role.\"","A recommendation from someone with no vested interest carries the most sincerity. Director Liu on the other end was indeed swayed. \"Then have her come for an audition tomorrow.\"","\"Alright.\" Wei Qi hung up, a trace of mockery flashing in her eyes.","The news of Wan Yurou going for the audition had made quite a stir, and it was true Director Liu had been leaning towards her.","However, the newly signed girl at the company wasn't weak either—gentle, soft-spoken, and full of spirit.","What Wei Qi had said to Director Liu wasn't entirely false. She really had read \"Red Ear,\" and that company girl was much more suitable for the role than Wan Yurou.","...","As for one of the key figures in this whirlwind, Xie Xi, he remained completely unaware. He was lying on the carpet playing games until He Feng chased him onto the sofa.","\"The weather's getting cool. Don't just lie on the floor. Play for twenty more minutes, then go upstairs and rest.\" He Feng worried endlessly about Xie Xi, who always had these little bad habits.","Xie Xi lay on the sofa with his phone, playing for a while. Then, catching the aroma of food, he turned his head and saw Zhang Dong having a late-night snack.","\"...Zhang Dong, eating so late will make you gain weight.\"","Zhang Dong had just finished a large prawn. He looked up, wiping his mouth. \"Bro Xi, it's fine. I'm not a celebrity.\"","Xie Xi put his phone down and got up, intending to mooch some of the snack, but He Feng slapped his hand away.","\"You have twenty minutes before bedtime.\"","He had already come back quite late, and Xie Xi still wanted to play games. If he ate a late-night snack now, sleep would be out of the question.","Moreover, Xie Xi's stomach had always been delicate and couldn't handle this kind of takeout.","Xie Xi sat down next to Zhang Dong. \"Read me what's trending today.\"","\"Bro Xi... let me finish this prawn first.\" His brother Xi was doing this on purpose. The assistant's heart was bitter as he reluctantly swallowed the last bite of prawn.","He Feng stood nearby shaking her head. \"Zhang Dong, you should eat less too. I'm going back to my room first. Xixizi, you go upstairs to sleep in twenty minutes.\"","Zhang Dong scrolled through the trending list a few times and suddenly exclaimed in shock, \"Bro Xi, you and Professor Ye are on the hot search together!\"","Xie Xi wasn't bothered. \"It's not the first time.\"","When two of their shows aired on the same day, he and Ye Qiusu sometimes both ended up on the hot search.","\"No, Bro Xi, let me read it to you.\" Zhang Dong read out both of their hot search topics, then clicked open a fan-edited video. \"Bro Xi, there's even a video of you and Professor Ye here.\"","Xie Xi leaned over to watch the entire video, finding it quite interesting. \"How did they know I was the one who sent the milk tea?\"","\"Bro Xi, they just edited it together randomly.\" Zhang Dong never expected there were people shipping the professor and his brother Xi. How could anyone digest this CP? Didn't they find it bizarre?","After all, Professor Ye was different from others—she was a professor! Not that his brother wasn't good, but someone like Professor Ye, with that scholarly aura, just didn't seem suited for the entertainment world.","Xie Xi, however, found it very amusing. He had Zhang Dong share the video with him, then went back to the sofa to get his phone and forwarded the video to Ye Qiusu.","He also sent a voice message, clearly finding it extremely funny.","\"Professor, so you're secretly a mafia boss.\"","Ye Qiusu didn't reply, obviously not having her phone nearby.","Xie Xi went upstairs holding his phone, but didn't sleep. He was scrolling through videos.","Other video editors had created different versions, which Xie Xi watched with great relish.","Even after waking up the next day, stories of love and hate between the two of them were still echoing in Xie Xi's mind.","...","\"Once you secure the female supporting role two, we'll treat the company to a dinner today.\" Mo Hong reached out to tidy Wan Yurou's hair. \"With Director Liu's production and this big IP, it's bound to be a hit.\"","In \"Red Ear,\" the designation of female supporting role two is just one way of dividing it. Because the male lead ends up with the female lead and not with her, she's called the female supporting role two. In fact, among the book's fans, there has always been controversy over this classification of female lead and female supporting role two.","\"Sister Mo, thank you for yesterday's matter,\" Wan Yurou said intimately, holding Mo Hong's hand.","\"Just don't be so rash next time. Do well in the audition later.\"","\"Mhm, I will definitely get the female supporting role two.\" Wan Yurou was very confident about this audition. She had previously spoken with Director Liu, and besides, she had read the original novel several times and could already recite the female supporting role two's lines by heart—all things Director Liu knew.","\"Number 12, you can come in now,\" a staff member called out from inside the room.","Wan Yurou checked her number. She was number 13. It was almost her turn.","\"Where is number 12?\"","\"Here.\"","A girl squeezed through from the back of the crowd, waving her number plate in her hand.","Wan Yurou instinctively turned to look, and her heart immediately sank: This person looked almost as if she had stepped right out of the pages of \"Red Ear.\""]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23","paragraphs":["\"It'll be your turn soon.\" Mo Hong was somewhat excited, already envisioning the envy of the other agents in the company once Wan Yurou landed this role.","An ominous premonition kept gnawing at Wan Yurou's heart. The person who had just walked in looked too much like the character, as if she had stepped right out of \"Red Ear.\"","\"Yurou? Yurou?\" Seeing Wan Yurou distracted, Mo Hong called her name a few more times. \"What's wrong?\"","Wan Yurou snapped back to attention. \"It's nothing, Sister Mo. I'm just going to the restroom.\"","\"Alright, be quick. They'll call you in as soon as the person inside comes out.\"","Wan Yurou skirted around the crowd and entered the restroom, standing before the mirror. Her hairstyle had always been black, voluminous waves, complementing her gentle and delicate face—a mix of charm and fresh beauty. However, she had straightened her hair just the day before yesterday.","She took a small red floral hair tie from her bag and tied her hair into a low ponytail, exactly the style described for the female supporting character in the original novel.","Looking at her reflection in the mirror, with many small details from the original work faithfully recreated, the unease in Wan Yurou's heart dissipated considerably.","The director was sure to notice her dedication.","After Wan Yurou came out, she waited for nearly twenty minutes before a staff member opened the door and called, \"Is Wan Yurou here? Come in.\"","The staff didn't call a number but directly named her, causing a stir among those still waiting outside.","This was clear enough indication that Wan Yurou was a top contender for the role; otherwise, she wouldn't have been called in by name.","\"Yurou, don't be nervous. This role is yours for the taking,\" Mo Hong said, unable to hide her delight.","\"Contestant number twelve hasn't come out yet,\" Wan Yurou said, her heart sinking once more.","Mo Hong was taken aback, only then realizing that the twelfth contestant who had gone in earlier had not yet emerged. Before, it had always been one person out, then the next person in.","\"Come in quickly, everyone's waiting for you,\" the staff member urged, seeing her hesitate.","Wan Yurou followed the staff member inside. The director, producers, and a few others were seated at the far end, chatting among themselves, not even glancing her way.","The twelfth contestant who had entered earlier was sitting to the side, holding a thermos and drinking from it.","The director turned and, seeing she had entered, said, \"Yurou's here. Perform the scene where the two characters reunite.\"","In this reunion scene, the female supporting character has to shed tears, portraying a complex mix of sudden joy and sorrow.","Wan Yurou was very familiar with the original work; she had indeed put in the hard work. She also intended to show off her skills in front of the twelfth contestant, so she began her performance immediately.","As she took the tissue handed to her by a staff member and wiped her tears, she could see the satisfied expressions on the faces of the director and the others, which greatly reassured her.","\"Ding Zi, did you see that? Her emotions need to be complex, not just simple joy after the reunion. This is something Yurou did better than you,\" the director said, turning to the twelfth contestant, who was holding her steaming thermos.","\"I understand. Thank you, Director,\" Ding Zi nodded earnestly.","Wan Yurou: \"?\"","Director Liu was satisfied. \"Alright, you can both go back and wait for news. We'll send out notifications in a week.\"","Wan Yurou stood rooted to the spot, not yet processing what had happened. Had she come in and performed like that just for the twelfth contestant to watch?","\"Director, how did you think my performance was?\" Wan Yurou didn't leave. Instead, she took a few steps forward and asked.","Director Liu was flipping through the profiles of the remaining candidates. Hearing her voice, he looked up and smiled. \"Yurou, your performance was excellent. You fully captured the emotions of the female supporting role. I'm very impressed. As for the casting decision, we still need to follow procedure and watch all the remaining auditions. We'll notify everyone in a week.\"","His tone was official, clearly polite and perfunctory.","As soon as Wan Yurou stepped out, Mo Hong approached her. \"How did it go? What did the director say?\"","The others waiting for their auditions subtly listened for Wan Yurou's response.","\"The director thought I fully captured the emotions,\" Wan Yurou said calmly, maintaining a composed demeanor.","Mo Hong, thinking the role was practically secured, immediately smiled triumphantly and led Wan Yurou away.","Once seated in the car, Wan Yurou's face fell. \"Sister Mo, find out what background contestant number twelve has.\"","\"Number twelve? But the director...\"","\"Director Liu had me perform for number twelve to watch,\" Wan Yurou said through gritted teeth. She had never been subjected to such humiliation before.","Mo Hong's smile also faded as she speculated, \"I've never even seen her before. She's probably a nobody. If she gets the part, she must have connections.\"","Wan Yurou said impatiently, \"Her looks fit the original character better than mine. Director Liu clearly favors her.\"","If someone could have been pushed into the role through connections, Director Liu wouldn't have gone to such lengths to search for the female supporting actress.","As it turned out, Wan Yurou's premonition was correct. A week later, \"Red Ear\" officially announced Ding Zi as the female supporting actress.","Wan Yurou spent a day at home smashing things, but it did nothing to vent her anger. She couldn't shake the feeling that she shouldn't have lost this role. Ever since \"Quiz Quest,\" it seemed like everything had gone wrong.","...","\"Wahhh, is this really our Zai Zai's autograph? Look at this beautiful penmanship! How abstractly artistic this 'Rong' character is written!\" Rong Shiyun pressed the torn piece of paper against her cheek, nearly moved to tears.","Ye Qiusuo: \"How did he become your... Zai Zai?\"","Last time, her student also called herself a 'mom.'","Rong Shiyun squeezed next to Ye Qiusuo to explain. \"There are many types of fans. For example, girlfriend fans see their idol as a boyfriend. Me, I'm a mom fan. I see our Xixi as my Zai Zai.\"","From the nickname 'Xixi' for Xie Xi, it's clear that mom fans make up a significant portion of his fanbase.","\"Hmm.\" Professor Ye found them a bit odd but wouldn't interfere.","\"I'm leaving tomorrow,\" Rong Shiyun sighed. \"I've only been here a few days.\"","\"Come back after you finish your project,\" Ye Qiusuo said seriously.","\"After I complete this current project, I plan to return to China for good,\" Rong Shiyun said, reaching out to touch the autograph. \"It'll be much easier to chase stars back home.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","\"Never thought you'd be recording TV shows now. Tsk tsk, I watched a bit. The people on it didn't seem all that impressive,\" Rong Shiyun shook her head.","She and Ye Qiusuo were around the same age, both child prodigies. However, Ye Qiusuo later changed her field, returned to China to re-do her PhD, and had been there for four or five years.","\"I was helping a friend initially, as a temporary guest. Then I just stayed on,\" Ye Qiusuo explained.","Rong Shiyun rested her chin on her hand. \"It's good to relax occasionally sometimes.\"","Unlike others their age who were just starting in their fields, they had been in the industry for many years. Being young and without many burdens, they had a lot of freedom outside of research. Yet, Ye Qiusuo worked 365 days a year without a break. Her appearing on TV completely surprised Rong Shiyun.","\"The champion gets prize money,\" Ye Qiusuo added.","Rong Shiyun: \"...\"","She should have known. Ye Qiusuo always had a purpose and a plan for everything. There was no way she'd waste a whole Sunday evening otherwise.","\"Are you short on money?\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded. \"The project needs funding.\"","Rong Shiyun thought about it and felt something was off. Given Ye Qiusuo's current achievements, securing project funding would be a matter of minutes; some might even offer it proactively.","\"What about Tianqiu Tech? Aren't they investing?\" Rong Shiyun asked. \"You could also contact other companies.\"","\"They're covering part of it. The experimental equipment for the project is only available domestically at Tianqiu Tech,\" Ye Qiusuo said. These were decisions she had made after careful consideration.","Currently, when the public thinks of Tianqiu Technology, the first person that comes to mind is Zhang Chengjue. However, in reality, the initial company framework was entirely facilitated by Ye Qiusuo. Those few unique instruments in the country were also acquired by her through various connections; money alone couldn't have bought them.","\"What kind of thorny project are you working on that even Tianqiu Technology isn't willing to fully fund?\" Rong Shiyun asked casually.","\"Money can always be earned.\"","For some reason, the word 'money' sounded oddly discordant coming from Professor Ye's mouth.","Rong Shiyun glanced at her friend: \"Why don't you take this opportunity to enter the entertainment circle and make a bundle? I heard some half-baked scholar from Tsinghua or Peking University joined the entertainment industry and is now rolling in money by spouting hollow, pseudo-intellectual inspirational nonsense for the artsy middle-aged crowd.\"","Ye Qiusuo actually thought it over seriously for a moment: \"If the schedule can stay as it is now, I could go.\"","Professor Ye, in her quest to secure project funding, was now ready to resort to any means.","Rong Shiyun shook her head: \"Your life is all about research, with no fun at all.\"","Unlike Ye Qiusuo, although Rong Shiyun had a high IQ, started school early, and had some achievements in her field, her mental state was no different from that of an ordinary girl in her twenties. She liked everything girls typically enjoy and was passionate about chasing stars.","Ye Qiusuo didn't respond. Holding her laptop, she went upstairs, clearly intending to continue working.","\"I'm leaving tomorrow, and you won't even chat with me!\" Rong Shiyun shouted from below.","\"Go to bed early. I'll take you to the airport at seven tomorrow morning.\" Professor Ye's steady voice came from upstairs.","Rong Shiyun's fantasy of sitting and chatting with her bestie was instantly shattered. Professor Ye was completely unsuited to being a girlfriend—a rigid, straight-as-an-arrow woman.","...","Ye Qiusuo, who had gone to bed at two a.m., got up at six, woke her friend, then washed up and had breakfast.","\"Why do I have to eat bread even after returning to China?\" Rong Shiyun complained while eating the bread on her plate.","Professor Ye looked down at her phone and noticed Xie Xi had sent two messages.","One was a forwarded video, the other a voice message.","Ye Qiusuo clicked on the voice message first. A clear, pleasant male voice came through the speaker, tinged with a leisurely calm.","Before she could even react, the sound of a plate shattering suddenly came from across the table, followed immediately by Rong Shiyun scrambling over: \"Was that my Zai Zai talking just now?!\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded.","\"Can you let me hear it again?\" Rong Shiyun looked at Ye Qiusuo with pleading eyes. This was her closest chance to get near Xixi.","Ye Qiusuo hadn't heard the full message earlier due to the interruption, so she played it again, listening as Xie Xi called her a gangster.","Gangster?","Frowning, she clicked on the forwarded video above.","Accompanied by a perfectly fitting background score, the love-hate saga of two people unfolded before Ye Qiusuo and Rong Shiyun's eyes.","Professor Ye, always upright and never exposed to such edited CP videos, watched in bewilderment.","\"Wah...\" Rong Shiyun beside her suddenly burst into tears as she watched. \"Our Zai Zai is so good, why would you treat him like that? You heartless woman!\"","Professor Ye: \"...\"","\"I've never had feelings for him.\" Professor Ye had no idea where these videos came from; they were pure fabrication.","Tears hanging at the corners of her eyes, Rong Shiyun stared blankly for a moment before suddenly wailing: \"Why don't you like him? Zai Zai is so handsome, sings so well, and is so kind!\"","Listen to that. That's the unified train of thought for Xie Xi's fans.","Their Xixi is so wonderful, how could anyone in the world not like him!","Professor Ye lowered her head, held her phone, and pressed the voice message button: \"Utter nonsense.\"","Rong Shiyun: \"???\"","\"You're even scolding our Zai Zai?!\"","Ye Qiusuo put down her phone and, using her height advantage, held back Rong Shiyun's advancing head. \"Time to go to the airport.\"","The entire way to the airport, Rong Shiyun kept nagging Ye Qiusuo to be nicer to Xie Xi and not to scold their Xixi, clearly projecting the video's narrative onto reality—after all, she was one of the few who knew about their teacher-student relationship.","Ye Qiusuo paid no attention, focusing on driving her friend to the airport.","As for Xie Xi, he didn't hear this voice message until ten in the morning. When he clicked on it and heard Professor Ye's serious words, a chill instantly ran down the back of his neck.","What if she got angry and assigned more homework?"]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo's goal was to win the championship of the show. Now, with a change in the competition format that involved eliminating celebrity guests, a large portion of the content was about knowledge of music, films, and other topics—things she had never been exposed to before.","In order to secure the championship, Professor Ye had been spending two hours every night lately acquainting herself with this knowledge. She didn't have time to watch films, so in the end, she selected fifty classic movies and searched online to memorize their more famous lines.","The show probably wouldn't test on irrelevant lines anyway.","As for music, Ye Qiusuo skimmed through music history and picked out over a hundred classic songs. She didn't listen to them; instead, she searched for the lyrics and forced herself to memorize them.","She was in a state of intense last-minute cramming, just like before an exam.","During the day, she was usually at the company or the university. Today, she had classes at the university and needed to mentor her students, so Ye Qiusuo arrived at the school early in the morning.","\"Morning, Professor Ye.\" A colleague from the neighboring office greeted her.","Ye Qiusuo responded while taking out her keys to unlock the door, \"Morning, Professor Li.\"","Professor Li was in his fifties and, compared to other colleagues in their prime, was much more laid-back.","He looked at the bright yellow duck in Ye Qiusuo's hand. \"Professor Ye, where did you buy this? It's much more exquisite than my grandson Doudou's little yellow duck.\"","Doudou was Professor Li's grandson.","Ye Qiusuo clicked the door open. \"...It was a gift from someone. I don't know where to buy it.\"","She didn't pay much attention to such worldly possessions. Although she had said a few words to Xie Xi about it last time, she couldn't be bothered to change it after returning.","\"Professor Ye, could you ask for me?\" Professor Li also opened his office door, looking somewhat embarrassed. \"Doudou was angry with me yesterday. I want to buy him something to cheer him up.\"","Ye Qiusuo hesitated for a moment. \"Alright.\"","Entering her office, Ye Qiusuo didn't turn on her computer immediately. Instead, she glanced at her phone, which she had just placed on the desk.","She stared at it for a while before picking it up, opening Xie Xi's WeChat, and asking, \"Xie Xi, may I ask where you bought your duck?\"","In the recording studio, Xie Xi was discussing with the accompaniment teacher. His phone was with Zhang Dong when it dinged.","\"Brother Xi, there's a WeChat message.\"","\"Who is it?\" Xie Xi asked from a distance.","\"Professor Ye.\"","His phone was still connected to the sound system. Was Ye Qiusuo sending some kind of scripture again? Xie Xi's heart skipped a beat. He stood up directly from his chair, wanting to retrieve his phone.","However, Zhang Dong habitually opened it for Xie Xi.","Instantly, the entire recording studio echoed with the phrase, 'where did you buy your duck'.","Since ancient times, the Chinese language has been profound, with a single word capable of extending into various meanings.","Their superstar Xie couldn't possibly be cooking, so the ingredient 'duck' could be ruled out immediately. That left...","Everyone in the recording studio began to give Xie Xi awkward looks.","Was this some new trendy euphemism, looking for a 'duck'?","Xie Xi: \"...\"","He walked over to Zhang Dong, took back his phone, and disconnected it from the sound system. \"Don't open her messages next time.\" He also decided he couldn't connect his phone here anymore in the future.","\"Got it, Brother Xi.\" Zhang Dong stood to the side, wanting to say something but hesitating, wondering if he should tell Sister Wei that Brother Xi and Professor Ye had an improper relationship.","Xie Xi walked out of the recording studio with his phone and asked with a light laugh, \"Professor, do you like my duck?\" His tone carried a hint of 'I knew it'.","\"My colleague wants to buy one for his grandson.\" Professor Ye mercilessly shattered Xie Xi's fantasy.","Xie Xi decisively swallowed the words, 'I have other ducks at home'. He changed his tack. \"It was bought on the third floor of that mall in the city center. A limited edition.\"","Ducks have limited editions?","Professor Ye clearly couldn't comprehend this, but she had gotten the information she wanted. \"I see. Thank you.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\" That's it?","At this moment, Xie Xi recalled the indignation of his many fans: Was he not good-looking enough, or did he not sing well enough, that she could be so dismissive of him!","He felt sad for Xie Xi.","Oh, it was the Xie Xi in the group chat, not the real Xie Xi.","...","Ye Qiusuo told Professor Li where to buy the little duck and then headed towards the laboratory.","\"Ding Hong, you're here so early?\" Ye Qiusuo looked at him with some surprise. She rarely went to the lab this early; she usually organized materials and read literature in her office.","\"Good morning, Professor.\" Ding Hong came this early every day, thinking he could familiarize himself more with the instruments to make up for his shortcomings.","Ye Qiusuo nodded and then asked, \"How are you getting along with Sun Jiajia?\"","\"She's very capable and willing to teach me.\" Ding Hong's hands hung by his sides, clenched. He was truly grateful for changing advisors. This atmosphere of freely conducting experiments with guidance from classmates and professors was exactly the graduate student life he had dreamed of.","\"That's good then.\" Ye Qiusuo took the opportunity to ask Ding Hong a few questions to test him. His answers weren't outstanding, but his foundational knowledge was solid enough.","Ye Qiusuo wandered around the lab for a few rounds, and just then Sun Jiajia also arrived at the lab. She thought she might as well test this student's abilities.","However, throughout Sun Jiajia's answers, she kept looking at Ye Qiusuo with a resentful gaze.","This kind of look...","Sure enough, after Ye Qiusuo finished asking questions and was about to leave, Sun Jiajia suddenly whispered plaintively from behind, \"Xixi is so wonderful.\"","...","By the day of the show recording, Ye Qiusuo had already memorized all the lyrics of the classic songs and completed all the planned movie lines.","The program's live event once again became Professor Ye's solo performance.","The host: \"...\" He couldn't help but feel that the show didn't need to continue; this was clearly a case of a \"dimensionality-reduction strike\"—an overwhelming mismatch in ability.","\"There are five questions left. Now, please listen: What is the title of the lead single from Xie Xi's album last year?\"","Ye Qiusuo was taken aback. She hadn't studied this part; she had only memorized classic songs found online.","Dong Junjian successfully buzzed in and answered this question first: \"It's 'Starlight'.\"","\"It seems Teacher Dong also likes Xie Xi's songs,\" the host teased.","Dong Junjian didn't try to avoid it at all: \"I bought all his albums and have been listening to them.\"","The camera swept over Professor Ye, her face bearing a rare look of bewilderment. The question had touched on a blind spot in her knowledge.","Although the questions were supposedly drawn at random from the question bank, the last five questions today unexpectedly were all about Xie Xi's songs. Professor Ye suffered a crushing defeat once again; the buzzer and the answer button in her hands seemed to malfunction one after another.","Dong Junjian secured the points for the last five questions, proving he truly was a die-hard fan of Xie Xi.","When Ye Qiusuo was leaving the television station, she happened to run into Xie Xi, who had just finished judging a competition on the first floor.","She felt a rare twinge of guilt. One moment, her mind replayed the words of her student and friend; the next, she recalled how she had been completely unable to answer the questions about Xie Xi's songs just now.","\"Professor, how many points did you get today?\" Xie Xi leaned forward, eager to know the results in advance.","Getting on the teacher's good side meant things like homework penalties could be negotiated—this was something Xie Xi had secretly picked up from Sister Wei's son.","Ye Qiusuo's eyes wavered for an instant before she calmly stated, \"I got first place.\"","Although the points for the last five questions were substantial, they still didn't surpass Ye Qiusuo's total.","\"Professor, you really are amazing.\" Xie Xi entered his praise mode. \"So knowledgeable, truly worthy of being a PhD, and even the head of some company.\"","Xie Xi's trademark is his pleasant voice. Even when he's spouting nonsense, if you don't listen carefully, it might sound like sweet nothings.","\"...I'll head back first,\" Professor Ye said proactively.","\"Okay, goodbye, professor.\" The superstar Xie Xi waved very obediently, determined to be a good student in front of Professor Ye.","However, when the show aired the following week and Xie Xi was watching it at home: \"???\"","Such simple questions, and she didn't know a single one?!","The internet exploded once again.","Not long ago, someone had compiled clips showing Professor Ye's cold and indifferent side towards Xie Xi. Now, this was further proof of Professor Ye's lack of regard for him.","The fans' hearts were shattered!","Their beloved Xixi, whom they held in the palms of their hands, was actually treated with such disregard.","[Ahhh, didn't she just ask for our Xixi's autograph recently? Why doesn't she even know the names of his albums? Sob, she even knew such old lyrics from the previous question.]","[My heart aches for our Xixi, his sincere feelings poured out in vain.]","[Please, Professor Ye, learn a bit more about our Xixi, okay? Our boy is truly worth it!]","[Suddenly I doubt whether Professor Ye was really asking Xixi for an autograph in that photo.]","[Don't say that, let us keep some hope!]","[By the way, who would have thought Teacher Dong would also like Xixi so much? Wow, Xixi really has fans spanning the old, middle-aged, young, and little kid generations.]","[Isn't there still Professor Ye, the one who slipped through the net?]","[Sisters, how about we crowdfund to send Xixi's albums to the TV station for Professor Ye, so she can understand how worthy our Xixi is!]","[Seconded!]","Where could fans get as many albums as Xie Xi himself?","After brooding all night, Xie Xi went to find Professor Ye the next day, bringing with him all his albums from his debut to the present."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25","paragraphs":["From his debut to the present, Xie Xi had released quite a few albums. He found an exquisite wooden box, put all his albums inside, and just like that, carried it to Huajing University.","When Ye Qiusuo pushed open the classroom door, she saw Xie Xi with his head bowed, fiddling with the items inside the box.","\"These are for you.\" Hearing her enter, Xie Xi simply turned the box around, its opening facing Ye Qiusuo. \"My albums. After listening to all of these, you definitely won't answer incorrectly again.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at the box full of albums and instinctively said, \"Thank you, but that's not necessary. I'll just memorize the lyrics.\"","For a song that lasts a few minutes, she could memorize the lyrics in under thirty seconds. Moreover, she had already memorized the lyrics to all of Xie Xi's albums.","Professor Ye would not stumble over the same stone twice.","Xie Xi: \"?\"","He never imagined that one day, as a top male singer in the current music scene, he wouldn't even be able to give away his albums.","\"Even if it's not for the competition, you can still listen to my songs.\" Xie Xi forcibly stuffed the albums into Ye Qiusuo's hands. \"Or... do you dislike listening to my songs?\"","\"I don't dislike them. You sing very well.\" Professor Ye stated the truth.","That line was music to his ears.","Xie Xi's eyebrows and eyes lifted slightly. \"Then take them home to listen.\"","\"Alright.\" Ye Qiusuo glanced down at the albums piled inside, reached out to close the box lid. \"It's already class time. Start your copying.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\" Why couldn't this harmonious atmosphere between teacher and student continue? Did she have to bring up class?","While he was copying, Ye Qiusuo was also looking through the homework Xie Xi had completed earlier. Dyslexia is caused by issues in a specific area of the brain, but the information transmitted isn't a complete, rule-less mess. As long as the underlying rules and connections can be identified, supplemented with tools, perhaps reading wouldn't have to remain such an obstacle.","Ye Qiusuo suddenly asked, \"When you're reading, do the characters shake severely?\"","Xie Xi twirled the pen in his hand, propping his cheek with one hand, and said languidly, \"Those characters dance on the paper.\"","Professor Ye noted this down on her computer, then also transmitted the pages of his previously completed homework to the lab, asking them to analyze and summarize this visual-writing behavior pattern when they had time.","\"It will take some time, but perhaps in the future, reading won't be so difficult for you.\"","Xie Xi's hand paused, the spinning pen stopping. \"Professor, can you treat illnesses too?\"","\"No, but it might be possible to find a solution.\" Ye Qiusuo said seriously. This wasn't a project; it couldn't be rushed.","\"Then I'll wait for the teacher to solve this problem.\" Xie Xi lowered his gaze to look at the notebook on the desk, his tone light and unconcerned.","Just before they parted, Xie Xi asked Ye Qiusuo if she would still get questions about him wrong if the show had more.","Xie Xi added, \"If the teacher is willing, during our make-up class next Sunday, I can tell the teacher some information about me.\"","Ye Qiusuo gave him a faint glance, puncturing his fantasy. \"If there are more questions about you, I won't make mistakes. Make-up class is only for doing homework.\"","...","Starting from the previous episode, the show's director had secretly instructed adjustments to the question selection probability. Having Ye Qiusuo win all the time didn't fit the show's dramatic effect. So, questions about Xie Xi began to increase, becoming much more detailed—difficult for anyone who wasn't a fan to answer correctly.","There were now fewer than ten guests remaining. The civilian contestants had also been moved onto the main stage, sitting face-to-face with the celebrity guests, with a live audience invited to watch below.","\"Another question about Xie Xi's albums.\" The host said in surprise, then teased, \"Last episode, I remember Professor Ye didn't seem to know the answers. I wonder how she'll do this time? If she still can't answer, Xie Xi's fans might be heartbroken again.\"","The audience present burst into laughter, clearly recalling last week's trending meme.","After heating up the atmosphere, the host began to read the question: \"In the seventh song of the album 'Starlight'... Oh, Professor Ye has hit the buzzer!\"","The camera lights shifted to Ye Qiusuo.","The host stood in the middle. \"Professor Ye, I haven't finished reading the question. Are you sure you want to answer? An incorrect answer will deduct points.\"","Over on the celebrity side, Dong Junjian was still trying to remember what the seventh song was. The show's question was too sneaky—who paid attention to the order of songs on an album?","Ye Qiusuo nodded. \"Confirmed.\"","Down below, the director slapped his thigh, filled with regret.","\"Before, she wasn't familiar with film, TV, or music-related questions. For the next recording after she learns, she'll answer better than anyone. We shouldn't have chosen Xie Xi-related questions again for this episode. Ye Qiusuo must know them all now.\"","\"Professors are just professors.\" A staff member beside him said with admiration.","Director: \"...\"","Sure enough, on stage, after the question was fully read, Ye Qiusuo answered correctly.","Among that initial group of civilian guests, there were other professors and PhDs. How was Ye Qiusuo just so strong?","On stage, Ye Qiusuo didn't know what the director was thinking; she was focused on answering questions.","\"Who is known as the 'King of Song' in modern Chinese history? Here are four options.\"","\"C, Yang Bing.\"","\"...Correct.\" The host's tone carried a hint of numbness. He came on each episode with the hope that today Professor Ye might finally meet her Waterloo, yet that hope was almost always dashed.","Was this the terrifying aspect of a genius?","The episode once again ended with Ye Qiusuo in first place.","Ye Qiusuo didn't get to leave immediately. The director introduced someone who wanted to meet her, saying the person was looking for a guest from \"Knowledge Q&A\" to be a spokesperson.","As soon as she heard, she knew which company it was: Likou.","The book had mentioned this company approached Wan Yourou, who was ranked first at the time, to be their spokesperson.","Now that Ye Qiusuo was first, the company naturally approached her.","\"I don't have any extra time.\" Ye Qiusuo's first reaction was to refuse. She wasn't clear on the process of being a spokesperson, but it sounded troublesome.","Shows like \"Knowledge Q&A,\" recorded once a week in the evening, only sacrificed Ye Qiusuo's own rest time.","The company representative was stunned, never expecting someone would refuse their endorsement offer.","It was important to note that Likou Beverages had only ever hired A-list celebrities in the past; this was the first time they were extending an olive branch to a civilian.","\"Our shooting time won't be very long, one day at most.\" The Likou representative quickly recovered and explained.","One day?","Ye Qiusuo asked him, \"How much is the endorsement fee?\" If the fee was high, she could squeeze out the time. She could just stay up a few nights.","Someone asking about the endorsement fee as their second question was a first for the representative. It felt unreal, especially since the other party was a genius professor.","\"Our maximum budget is one million.\" The Likou representative said sincerely. \"That's almost the highest price a civilian can get.\"","In the industry, endorsement fees for A-list celebrities range from five to twenty million, for B-list from two to five million, and for C/D-list the minimum is around five hundred thousand. This price was indeed very high for a civilian, but the representative wasn't factoring in Ye Qiusuo's current popularity.","If Ye Qiusuo's talent agency had been monitoring the data, they would find that since \"Knowledge Q&A\" began airing, her search volume has remained consistently high, and the level of discussion (i.e., heat) has also been quite significant.","Apart from not officially entering the entertainment circle, Ye Qiusuo possessed all the elements of a star.","\"That's a bit low.\" Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment. \"Can you add a little more?\"","Professor Ye wasn't very skilled at bargaining, but she still wanted to earn a bit more money.","Likou Representative: \"...\" Is being this direct really okay? She looks so upright, not like someone obsessed with money.","\"Professor Ye, if you don't join the entertainment circle, there will be less program exposure later, and the effectiveness of the endorsement will actually be greatly reduced. How about we go back and reconsider this, is that alright with you?\"","\"Fine.\"","Originally, the Li Kou representative came hoping to discuss things over a meal with Ye Qiusuo, but by the time they reached the elevator, their conversation had already concluded.","Ye Qiusuo took the elevator down and headed towards her car. Just after making a U-turn out of the television station and stopping at a red light, she glanced over and noticed two people sitting in the adjacent car.","— Lu Mingzhe and Wan Yurou.","Truly the male and female leads, this kind of fate simply couldn't be severed.","Ye Qiusuo tried to recall the entire book, only to find her memories being swallowed by boundless darkness. Those intricate details she once remembered clearly were beginning to fade, leaving only the major events between the main characters roughly preserved in her memory.","...","Two days later, Li Kou company called, saying they could raise the endorsement fee by another five hundred thousand, but they would also add the currently second-ranked Wan Yurou as a co-endorser.","\"Fine.\" Professor Ye only cared if the money had increased.","One point five million, although just a drop in the bucket for her project, saving up bit by bit could eventually amount to something.","Actually, she would have agreed even for the original one million, since the other party said it would take at most one day.","Endorsements were something Ye Qiusuo knew nothing about. She took some time to search online but didn't find anything useful. Remembering Xie Xi, whose endorsements were plastered everywhere, she figured he must be quite familiar with such matters and decided to ask him.","\"An endorsement?\" Xie Xi perked up immediately upon hearing Ye Qiusuo's voice message. He called her directly, \"Professor, I know all about this. I can explain it to you in detail.\"","Just imagining Professor Ye standing under the studio lights, pretending to convey the desired effect of the product, sounded incredibly amusing.","After all, she was completely unlike someone who could act.","\"Thank you.\" Ye Qiusuo listened carefully to his advice and precautions, though given her lack of familiarity with cameras and such, she only grasped half of it.","Xie Xi, full of interest, explained a great deal and finally asked, \"Professor, where are you shooting the ad?\"","\"Dongheng Studio.\"","As soon as the call ended, Xie Xi said to the two people in the living room, \"We're going to Dongheng Studio this Thursday.\"","\"Xixi, I remember you don't have any shooting schedules this month,\" He Feng looked up. \"What are you going there for?\"","\"To see how Professor Ye handles an endorsement.\" A glint of amusement flashed in Xie Xi's eyes. His album was finished anyway; he might as well go watch out of boredom.","...","On Thursday, Ye Qiusuo postponed her work for a day and went to Dongheng Studio for the endorsement shoot.","When she arrived, Wan Yurou was already there, having changed into her outfit early, with a group of people gathered around her doing her makeup.","The moment Ye Qiusuo entered, she immediately seemed out of place.","Given her height, looks, and the recent popularity of her show, no one could ignore her. However, Professor Ye was clearly from a different world than those around her; her academic aura was too strong.","\"Professor Ye, we've prepared clothes for you over here.\" A staff member approached, leading her away politely and respectfully.","By the time Ye Qiusuo changed and came out, she saw a commotion at the entrance.","\"Is that Lu Mingzhe?\"","\"The champion from 'Tomorrow's Star'.\"","\"It's not that simple. His surname is Lu.\"","\"You mean that Lu family...\"","\"Shh—\"","Wan Yurou had finished her makeup. Dressed in a white gown, she looked like a lotus flower emerging from water, elegant and beautiful.","\"Mingzhe, what brings you here?\" Wan Yurou asked, feigning surprise.","\"I'm shooting an endorsement nearby too, thought I'd drop by.\" Lu Mingzhe was wearing a suit, his hair clearly styled, revealing his handsome face.","The two standing together did indeed look like a perfect match.","\"This is my friend Lu Mingzhe. We sang together on stage before.\" Wan Yurou proactively introduced him to those around her.","Lu Mingzhe nodded. Upon seeing Ye Qiusuo, he asked in surprise, \"Are you the one who saved Yurou at the pool that day?\"","Wan Yurou: \"...\" Could we please not bring that up in public?!","That was the shame of her life. Just mentioning it made her remember Xie Xi's detestable face.","Ye Qiusuo had no goodwill towards Lu Mingzhe. She didn't want anything to do with someone of questionable character.","This was also the first time Lu Mingzhe had been so thoroughly ignored, instantly displeasing him.","\"Professor Ye, please sit here. I'll apply some light makeup for you.\" A makeup artist led Ye Qiusuo to sit aside.","The two sides were clearly demarcated, and the atmosphere grew somewhat tense.","Most people gathered around Wan Yurou's side, especially since Lu Mingzhe was there. Hearing he was from the Lu family, everyone wanted to curry favor.","Ye Qiusuo let the makeup artist do her work while her eyes remained on her phone, reading an email—experiment logs sent by a student.","The makeup artist, standing behind her, used her height advantage to sneak a few glances at the screen: Completely incomprehensible. A professor is truly a professor.","\"Later, you'll walk over from there holding the drink, and then...\" The director had already started explaining the endorsement script to Wan Yurou.","Over here, Ye Qiusuo felt somewhat neglected.","\"Ahhhhhhh! Xixi!!!\"","A staff member who was a fan of Xie Xi inside the studio happened to glance towards the entrance and immediately screamed excitedly, stomping her feet and pointing at the doorway.","The people inside were startled by the scream and looked where she was pointing, instantly erupting into excitement once again.","Unlike Lu Mingzhe, Xie Xi had a solid, massive fanbase spanning all fields.","Seeing Xie Xi standing silhouetted against the light at the entrance, Lu Mingzhe instinctively took a step back. He feared Xie Xi deep down, even if he was unwilling to admit it.","\"Xixi is so handsome, I'm going to faint,\" someone nearby whispered.","Lu Mingzhe thought inwardly, annoyed: He's backlit, you can't even see his face. How is that handsome?","\"Wuwuwu, my darling, his legs are so long, I could admire them for a year.\"","\"Oh my god, it's Xie Xi!\"","Lu Mingzhe and Wan Yurou instantly lost everyone's attention.","Wan Yurou could even see people starting to record videos. What's so great about a man full of malice towards women?","She gritted her teeth, unable to suppress the memory of that day by the pool when Xie Xi casually said he wouldn't save her.","Xie Xi, dressed in casual clothes, walked in, scanned the room, and his gaze landed on Ye Qiusuo: \"Professor Ye, you're doing an endorsement?\""]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26","paragraphs":["A collective, sharp intake of breath was clearly audible in the photography studio.","As fans of Xie Xi, they certainly hadn't forgotten the edited fan video pairing him with her that had circulated not long ago.","All eyes shifted towards Professor Ye, curious to see her reaction.","\"Mhm.\" Ye Qiusuo gave a nod. It wasn't exactly cold, a response somewhere between acknowledging an acquaintance and a familiar face.","Xie Xi walked towards the director with natural ease, greeting him before turning his gaze to Lu Mingzhe, a tone of familiarity in his voice: \"Mingzhe, what are you doing here today?\"","An onlooker might have thought they were on excellent terms.","\"The sponsor asked us to come film the endorsement today,\" Lu Mingzhe replied, his smile not reaching his eyes.","\"Is that so... You should hurry over then. Don't wander around; your teammates might be looking for you. And don't leave a bad impression with the sponsor,\" Xie Xi said, his tone a masterful imitation of a senior mentor offering advice, hitting the mark perfectly.","Lu Mingzhe felt like vomiting blood hearing this, but he couldn't make a scene in front of so many people. He forced a strained smile. \"I'll head over now.\"","Xie Xi gave a dignified nod. \"Be more careful next time.\"","Wan Yurou watched Lu Mingzhe leave, her hatred for Xie Xi growing by several degrees. Last time, after finishing recording at the TV station, she had specifically waited for Lu Mingzhe so they could go to a restaurant together.","It was Lu Mingzhe who had pulled strings with Li Kou to secure this endorsement for her.","After her failed audition last time, if she didn't get this endorsement, she would basically have no valuable work offers left. Lu Mingzhe had come today to lend her support. His presence alone had made the director significantly more enthusiastic.","But now, with Xie Xi's interference, Lu Mingzhe had left without a backward glance.","Were the Lu family afraid of Xie Xi too? Wasn't he just a singer?","\"Please continue. I'm just here to ask Professor Ye a few questions,\" Xie Xi said to the director with a smile. \"I hope the director doesn't mind?\"","\"Not at all, not at all.\" Sweat beaded on the director's forehead. As a mere commercial director, how would he dare offend Xie Xi?","Thank goodness he hadn't had time to give Ye Qiusuo a hard time earlier.","Only then did Xie Xi, satisfied, walk towards Ye Qiusuo, not sparing a single glance for Wan Yurou the entire time.","\"Are you here to film an endorsement for the sponsor too?\" Ye Qiusuo asked, having just finished with makeup as she stood up.","Initially, she had thought the plot from the book was correcting itself again. In the original story, Wan Yurou consistently took first place and was invited by Li Kou to be their endorser. During the first shoot, Lu Mingzhe, having wandered into the wrong studio by mistake, watched her performance under the lights and found himself somewhat mesmerized, marking a point where their feelings deepened.","But now, Xie Xi had suddenly appeared and, with a few words, made Lu Mingzhe leave.","The original plot had deviated once more.","\"Nope.\" Xie Xi hooked a nearby chair with his foot, pulling it over and sitting on it backwards. He draped his arms over the chairback and rested his chin on them. \"Professor, it's your first time filming an endorsement. I came to watch.\"","Those eavesdropping around them felt puzzled upon hearing the word 'Professor'.","\"Didn't Xie Xi drop out in middle school? Why is he calling Professor Ye 'teacher'? What's going on?\"","\"No idea. I actually thought Professor Ye was Xie Xi's fan. Wasn't it said last time that in one of Wan Yurou's selfies, Xie Xi was signing an autograph for Professor Ye?\"","Xie Xi not finishing middle school was a point brought up by gossip accounts every time they wanted to criticize him. Over the years, Xie Xi had never refuted it, so fans automatically assumed he hadn't pursued further education. But his songs were so good, and he was so good-looking—what more could you ask for?","Besides, the entertainment industry was full of celebrities with low educational backgrounds. A high degree was at most a bonus; strong professional skills were what mattered.","\"Aren't you busy?\" In Ye Qiusuo's impression, the more popular a celebrity was, the busier they were, reportedly flying around every day.","Could Xie Xi say that he had initially come purely out of a sense of curiosity, wondering what on earth Professor Ye was doing filming an endorsement?","But after arriving, that feeling had faded.","The photography studio was full of professional staff. Ye Qiusuo had come alone, knowing nothing. It was hard to say if it was the unshakeable confidence of a professor or something else.","\"Not busy. The new album is already recorded.\" Xie Xi suddenly straightened up. \"Professor, guess which number album this new release will be for me.\"","\"Twenty.\" Ye Qiusuo answered without hesitation. She had memorized all the lyrics from the previous nineteen albums.","Xie Xi was satisfied.","\"Our two endorsers can come over and get ready to shoot now,\" the director interrupted their conversation. All the equipment was in place.","Filming endorsements was a tedious and often painful process, especially for food and beverage ads. Sometimes, to get the perfect shot, the endorser had to keep eating. By the end, they often felt sick at the sight of the product.","The Li Kou beverage Ye Qiusuo was endorsing only required drinking, but the shoot involved the endorser consuming it.","\"Professor Ye, you'll need to walk from here to the yellow marker over there. Then Yurou will come from the side, deliver her line to you, you'll share a smile, and then open the cap and take a big drink.\"","Listening to the director say \"share a smile\" from the sidelines, Xie Xi couldn't help but laugh. He simply couldn't imagine her \"sharing a smile\" with anyone.","\"Damn, Xi Xi's smile just melted my heart.\"","\"Wuwuwu, what do I do? Xi Xi seems to really like Professor Ye. It feels like there are stars in his eyes when he looks at her.\"","\"Sis, don't get too carried away with the ship.\"","A few staff members who were fans huddled together, whispering.","After the director explained it once, Ye Qiusuo memorized all the markers, how the camera would move, and how she should face the lens.","One thing had to be said: geniuses picked up any task faster than ordinary people.","When filming began, Ye Qiusuo performed surprisingly well. She remembered all her marks and showed no discomfort in front of the camera.","Then Wan Yurou walked over from the other side, handing Ye Qiusuo a bottle of Li Kou. The two were supposed to share a smile.","On camera, both of their smiles looked painfully forced. The final scene of drinking the beverage was a complete disaster.","\"Cut, cut, cut! Professor Ye, a smile,\" the director said, somewhat helpless. He demonstrated by baring eight teeth in a grin that, combined with his round face, looked slightly terrifying. \"And Yurou, don't let Professor Ye affect you. You must maintain a good smile.\"","They shot the scene several times, always getting stuck at Ye Qiusuo's smile. She really couldn't act, not even managing a convincing fake smile.","Earning one hundred and fifty thousand a day really wasn't that easy after all.","Maybe she should just focus on securing research grants to make money next time.","Professor Ye was tasting the flavor of defeat.","\"Director, if they're just drinking a beverage, why do they need to share a smile before drinking?\" Xie Xi asked from his seat.","\"It's... for the advertising effect.\"","\"That kind of detail should be optional, right? Isn't the focus supposed to be on drinking the beverage?\" Xie Xi stood up, took a bottle from a nearby case, and held it in one hand, shaking it in front of the camera lens. \"Wouldn't a close-up like this look better?\"","His knuckles were distinct, his fingers long and slender. Holding the orange-red drink, he made the liquid look exceptionally beautiful.","If only Li Kou could get him to endorse their product...","That was the director's first thought.","\"Ahem, let's try one more time. Yurou, just hand over the drink directly, then open it and drink.\" Adopting Xie Xi's suggestion was also because the director had other versions to shoot later and couldn't afford to waste time.","They went through the motions again, and this time it felt much more natural.","\"Cut! Wan Yurou, could you drink a bit more? That last action wasn't very noticeable.\"","Wan Yurou gripped the drink bottle, instinctively frowning. The drink was full of sugar, and despite being careful, she had already sipped her way through nearly half a bottle.","But... Wan Yurou glanced at Ye Qiusuo beside her. She couldn't let herself be outshone by an ordinary person.","\"Sorry, director. Let's do another take.\" Wan Yurou swapped for a fresh bottle.","After the final version was shot, the crew immediately and swiftly replaced the surrounding props and brought in a group of stylishly dressed young people.","\"This version is set to a summer dance track. Wan Yurou will hold a guitar and sing. Professor Ye, you'll skateboard over and hand her the drink,\" the director explained, pointing to the skate ramp behind them. \"Later, you just need to jump a few times; we'll add the special effects in post-production.\"","The young people standing at the back, each holding a skateboard, were already warming up, flipping and jumping—clearly a group of professionals.","Ye Qiusuo imagined herself pretending to jump around and felt she absolutely couldn't pull it off.","\"Can I actually skate?\"","Director: \"What?\"","Seeing the director's confusion, Ye Qiusuo took a step back, borrowed a skateboard from one of the young people, stepped onto it, and shot straight up the ramp. As she came down, she executed a perfect ollie, jumping with the board and landing steadily before continuing to the next platform. She went semi-airborne, spinning the board 360 degrees.","As her feet landed back on the board, she sped toward a white foam box, deftly scooping out a drink from the ice water. For a moment, water droplets sprayed up and fell back down.","She pressed down with her back foot, coming to a smooth stop right in front of a stunned Wan Yurou, offering her the drink. Her gaze met the director's. \"Like this.\"","The group of skateboarders behind her immediately erupted in cheers and applause.","Everyone in the studio: \"???\"","The professional expertise and consistently steady, dignified demeanor Professor Ye displayed on the program had led everyone to subconsciously overlook her age, forgetting that she, too, was a young person.","This kind of thing completely didn't match the image of Professor Ye.","Even Xie Xi, standing nearby, was astonished.","His teacher seemed like such a rigid person; who would have thought she could do this?","The director stood rooted to the spot, unable to process what he'd just seen. He thought he'd hired a Bronze, but it turned out to be a Wangzhe (literally \"king\" — a top-ranked pro/champion).","\"Director, take a look at the footage,\" the cameraman suddenly whispered, leaning over. \"I kept the camera rolling just now.\"","Finally snapping out of it, the director turned to review the recorded scene.","Watching it again was still shocking. Because the ad's backdrop was summer, Ye Qiusuo was wearing a black overall shorts. Whether flipping in the air or crouching to grab the drink, every move was perfect. The occasional, unintentional glance she shot toward the camera was brimming with overwhelming coolness.","The only flaw was Wan Yurou standing there dumbfounded, which was a bit of an eyesore.","\"Professor Ye, that works! That works perfectly. We'll go with the real skating,\" the director said excitedly. \"Remember to get close-up shots.\"","...","\"Brother Xi, Professor Ye is seriously amazing,\" Zhang Dong, who had been quietly keeping to himself, said in awe. Was there anything in this world she couldn't do?","Although surprised, Xie Xi quickly reined in his emotions. His gaze fell on Ye Qiusuo's reddened fingers. He turned to his assistant. \"Go buy something to warm her hands.\"","Zhang Dong: \"Brother Xi, are you cold?\"","That shouldn't be the case. Even though it was November and the weather was turning cool, the indoor heating was on, and his Brother Xi was still wearing a jacket.","Xie Xi glanced at Zhang Dong. \"Go buy it.\"","\"Oh, I'll be right back.\"","Over at the director's side, filming was now in full swing. If people had been stealing glances at Xie Xi before, now everyone's attention was completely fixed on Ye Qiusuo.","Even Xie Xi himself watched, unable to look away."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27","paragraphs":["The skateboard version of the shoot went exceptionally smoothly, with only a few close-up shots of Ye Qiusuo on the skateboard needing to be filled in. Wan Yurou listened as the director and several others kept praising Ye Qiusuo, grinding her teeth with resentment.","Wan Yurou had actually received the scripts for these endorsement shoots in advance. Originally, the director wanted her to perform the skateboarding part, but she and her agent agreed it didn't suit her image.","Wan Yurou had always maintained an ethereal, gentle persona and naturally didn't want to do skateboarding moves like that.","Now, seeing Ye Qiusuo perform so well, Wan Yurou began to regret it: this role was originally hers.","\"Professor Ye, Yurou, you two take a break first. We'll shoot the next version in a little while,\" the director said kindly.","Today's shoot had gone more smoothly than he had expected. Although there were some minor teething problems at the start, those were just part of the normal NG process.","This was when the difference between a celebrity and a layperson became apparent. As soon as filming paused, Wan Yurou's assistant immediately brought over a coat to drape over her shoulders, with all sorts of things prepared and readily available.","Ye Qiusuo's hands were wet and cold from the ice water. She looked around, wanting to find a tissue to dry them, but couldn't see any nearby for the moment.","\"Your coat.\" Xie Xi had specifically gone to ask a female staff member for Ye Qiusuo's previously changed-out overcoat.","\"Thank you.\" Ye Qiusuo was momentarily taken aback, then reached out to take the coat.","\"Professor, you should dry your hands first.\" Xie Xi pulled the coat back and, with his other hand, took out a handkerchief to hand to her.","Ye Qiusuo took it, dried her hands, and only then retrieved her coat to put on.","Right then, Zhang Dong happened to arrive carrying an armful of hand-warming items: \"Brother Xi, I'm here!\"","Xie Xi reached into his arms, picked through the items, and finally pulled out a disposable hand warmer. It would self-heat once the packaging was opened. He handed it to Ye Qiusuo for her to warm her hands.","\"...Thank you.\" Ye Qiusuo wasn't a particularly delicate person by nature. After repeatedly dipping her fingers in the ice water, her first reaction after filming was to dry her hands clean. She hadn't even remembered that her hands were red from the cold.","\"Professor, your sense of control in front of the camera is quite good.\" Professor Ye was nothing like the wooden image he had imagined; she was completely at ease in front of the lens.","Ye Qiusuo looked down, holding the steadily heating hand warmer, and said casually, \"It's about the same as giving a speech on stage in front of a camera.\"","That was a huge difference.","Zhang Dong nearly dropped the pile of things in his arms. Professor Ye's words were almost infuriating. If performing well on camera were that easy, there wouldn't be so many people who practiced hard but still couldn't grasp the knack.","Of course, his Brother Xi didn't belong to the \"practiced hard\" category. Some people were just born for this line of work.","While they were resting, the props team had already changed to another background entirely. The director called for the two endorsers to continue.","The subsequent filming went smoothly. Aside from a few NGs, they were basically able to complete the shots perfectly later on.","By the time it ended, it wasn't even dark yet.","Xie Xi had left during the later part of the shoot. After Ye Qiusuo finished filming, she glanced at the crowd outside but didn't see him.","After changing back into her own clothes, she picked up her phone and only then saw Xie Xi's voice message.","\"Professor, we've left first. Hope the endorsement went well.\"","It was as if he had just been passing by.","Ye Qiusuo turned off her phone, walked out of the studio alone, and drove back by herself.","The studio crew had just started packing up the filming equipment. A few staff members were still talking about it, unable to let it go.","\"What's the relationship between Xixi and Professor Ye? He calls her 'teacher' and even came specifically to see her.\"","\"Professor Ye teaches students at the university. Calling her 'teacher' is normal.\"","\"Xixi isn't a university student.\"","\"I really want to know what their relationship is.\"","None of them let their thoughts wander in any other direction. If it were Xie Xi going to see another woman, it would probably cause an uproar. But with Ye Qiusuo, it was impossible to associate any hint of romance with her.","Perhaps that's the halo of being a scholar.","\"You went to watch Professor Ye film the endorsement today?\" Wei Qi came to ask Xie Xi that evening.","\"Mhm.\" Xie Xi sat in front of the drum kit, tapping away. \"Did Zhang Dong or Sister He tell you, Sister Wei?\"","\"Neither of them.\" Wei Qi covered her ears. \"Xixi, what are you doing? Stop for a minute, I have something to say.\"","Xie Xi haphazardly banged out another series of beats before stopping. \"Go ahead, Sister Wei.\"","\"Today, in a small group chat, people were saying you went to see Professor Ye, and someone even took photos.\" Only after the various percussion sounds ceased did Wei Qi put her hands down. \"Everyone's asking what your relationship is. Since your album is releasing tomorrow, the news about you inviting the professor could be let out around this time.\"","\"You decide, Sister Wei.\"","Wei Qi frowned. \"In a bad mood?\" First, he was sitting in the music room banging on the drums randomly, and now he sounded listless. But from the photos she saw, he looked like he was in a good mood.","\"I didn't draw the card I wanted.\" Xie Xi said absentmindedly, \"So I'm in a bad mood.\"","\"You... just draw again. It's not a big deal.\" Wei Qi was used to this sort of thing with Xie Xi. His most enduring hobbies, aside from music, were probably just playing games.","\"Don't feel like drawing anymore today.\" Xie Xi gave a loud 'clang' on the nearby crash cymbal and started drumming again.","The room was instantly filled with the sounds of percussion.","Wei Qi covered her ears and shouted, \"Fine! Remember to repost the studio's Weibo tomorrow.\"","It was only after the agent left that Xie Xi suddenly stopped, placing a hand over his chest.","Ever since he came back, it had been beating a little abnormally."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28","paragraphs":["On Friday, Xie Xi's new album \"Empty\" was officially released on major music platforms, sparking a wave of purchases and fervent discussion.","In this era where physical records have declined, digital albums have replaced the original records, and at the same time, the sales of singer's albums have also become heavily distorted, with countless methods for chart manipulation and inflating sales. Sometimes, singers have to constantly participate in various activities to boost sales.","This is an era where traffic is king.","However, Xie Xi is an exception within the industry.","He released his album so quietly, yet achieved massive sales revenue, making everyone in the music industry envious.","Not to mention how well Xie Xi sings, just his face alone garners all kinds of attention. The so-called \"traffic stars\" currently in the industry, if really pulled out to compare looks with Xie Xi, it's hard to say who looks more like the typical idol.","Moreover, Xie Xi has songs with extremely high popularity, as well as songs with superb technique that are used as benchmarks within the industry. His albums have almost never failed.","That very day, Xie Xi trended in various ways and through various hashtags.","Xie Xi's new album","\"Empty\" sales soar to number one today","An elderly person in their sixties asks nearby police how to use a smartphone to buy Xie Xi's album","Netizens from all walks of life were also discussing his new album. Even the male and female leads from the drama \"v\" were brought up for discussion, and his past works were dug up by netizens, obviously riding on Xie Xi's popularity to gain heat.","[Ahhhhh! Xixi's new album! Please, KTVs, keep up with the times and quickly add our baby's songs! I want to go sing karaoke with my girlfriends!]","[Same request! I've already made plans with my mom, dad, aunt, and third uncle to go sing Xixi's songs together!]","[Wuwuwu, Xixi's songs are still so good. This new album seems to have an ethereal style; after listening, I feel like my soul has been cleansed.]","[Xixi's songs aren't songs; they're a \"Heart-Cleansing Sutra.\" After listening, all worries disappear.]","\"Heart-Cleansing Sutra? Who commented that?\" Xie Xi suddenly sat up from the sofa, looking at Zhang Dong.","Could it be that reciting too many sutras back then made his singing carry a hint of that flavor?","Zhang Dong had been picking out comments to read to Xie Xi. Interrupted, he looked down at the commenter's username and avatar. \"Brother Xi, this must be one of your fans. The avatar is your photo, and the username is... 'Xixi Is in My Bed'.\" What kind of obsessed fan is this?","Xie Xi: \"...Continue.\"","On the other side, Wei Qi had already arranged for people to start releasing information about Xie Xi finding a teacher to study with. The company had specifically maintained accounts for this purpose. Some things, when revealed by a third party on the surface, achieve better results.","Using the tone of a passerby, they described accidentally seeing Xie Xi attending classes at Huajing University, with Professor Ye Qiusuo being his teacher, along with a few photos of Xie Xi at Huajing University.","Today, the search volume for the two-character term \"Xie Xi\" was extremely high. This Weibo post was quickly pushed to the top. Marketing accounts, seeing fresh material, immediately began frantically reposting it.","Professor Ye is Xie Xi's teacher","Ye Qiusuo's popularity had also remained high recently, and netizens could find very little information about her. Once the related keyword appeared, her fans felt as if they'd discovered an oasis in the desert and rushed to click to see it. The trending topic instantly skyrocketed.","[What am I seeing?!]","[Doubting my eyes, Professor Ye is Xixi's teacher???]","[This crossover is completely broken. Do the two really know each other?]","Watching Professor Ye on the last episode of the show, she had no idea about Xixi's album, so the autograph thing should be fake. Professor Ye definitely isn't Xixi's fan. Since the two have a teacher-student relationship, then is it possible... Xixi was handing in homework or something like that at the time.","[This isn't fake news, is it? Just because Xixi went to Huajing University?]","Um... actually, it's true. My friend kind of has one foot in the scene. Yesterday, Professor Ye accepted an endorsement, and later Xixi came over and called her \"teacher.\"","[Really?!]","[Teacher-student y? I'm back on board! Sisters, wait for me, I'm getting up from my sickbed right now to edit a video!]","[Caught the madam upstairs! Madam, isn't your hand fractured? You should rest and recover properly.]","[No!!! I'm already on my way to get the cast removed. Everyone bless me, and wait to be fed fanworks!]","...","Throughout the day, various news stories and trending searches about Xie Xi hardly ceased. Outsiders watch the commotion, but those on the inside have their own thoughts.","Some singers really are top-tier, their names widely known to the public, yet their albums don't sell well. They've essentially started reinventing themselves, appearing on every kind of program to stay in the spotlight. Watching Xie Xi's albums create a sensation each time, it's hard not to feel envious.","However, there are also plenty of people who feel they can surpass Xie Xi.","Xinyou Culture.","\"After this competition ends, I want to release an album,\" Lu Mingzhe said, interlacing his fingers and resting his arms on the desk as he spoke to his manager.","\"That's a good opportunity, right after you win the championship while the heat hasn't died down.\"","Lu Mingzhe let go, lowered his head and brushed off the nonexistent dust on his clothes: \"It would be best if we could achieve the same scale as Xie Xi's today.\"","Agent: \"...\" How audacious to compare.","\"We can buy a few more trending topics like these. My fan count is almost seven million now. Once I win the championship, it will definitely surpass ten million,\" Lu Mingzhe said very casually. \"Later, with the company's promotion, the album will sell as well as it did today.\"","\"To reach Xie Xi's current level... would still be a bit difficult.\" The agent smiled faintly. \"That kind of sales volume doesn't come from just a few trending searches.\"","Currently, no one in the music industry can rival Xie Xi.","Hearing this, Lu Mingzhe was somewhat displeased: \"Winning the championship—isn't that enough attention?\"","Agent Jiang Jingyuan was inwardly amused. Lu Mingzhe didn’t know whether he was overconfident in his own abilities or in the Lu family backing him.","The winner of a talent show thinks they can surpass Xie Xi just by riding the hype? If that were true, Xie Xi wouldn't be so envied in the industry, nor would so many people constantly try to piggyback on his popularity.","Xie Xi has remained unshaken for so many years, thanks to the strong abilities of his agent, who even managed to turn his occasional bad temper with the media into an image of a \"true personality\".","Jiang Jingyuan wasn't that old—he was in his early thirties—and had already nurtured two promising artists, one of whom had even won Best Actress. But he had long been studying Wei Qi's methods for controlling public opinion.","\"After you win the championship, the company will do its best to help with promotion. For now, you just need to focus on winning the competition.\" Jiang Jingyuan advised, \"The momentum definitely won't be small.\"","Lu Mingzhe wore a reluctant expression, clearly not very pleased with his agent's statement. However, Jiang Jingyuan was currently the fastest-rising agent at Xinyou and had plenty of resources. Lu Mingzhe wasn't stupid enough to actually offend him.","...","Friday was destined to be a crazy day. If you were a fan of Xie Xi, you enjoyed a day full of happiness—listening to the album, sharing thoughts with fellow fans online, and, of course, joining group chats to swap gossip.","\"Jiajia, did you record the experimental data from last time?\" Ding Hong turned to ask Sun Jiajia, who was crouching in the corner.","Sun Jiajia was squatting there, wearing headphones, one hand holding her phone, the other pressed into her mouth to stifle a scream; her body twisted from time to time, clearly overwhelmed with excitement.","Not getting a reply, Ding Hong had to walk over and pat her shoulder: \"Jiajia?\"","Sun Jiajia's face was flushed with suppressed excitement. Feeling a tap on her shoulder, she looked up to see Ding Hong. She removed her headphones. \"What's up?\"","\"Did you record the experimental data from last time?\"","\"Yeah, I did. Open the document in the bottom right corner; I saved it there.\" Sun Jiajia coughed and finally returned to reality.","\"Got it. You... carry on?\"","Sun Jiajia was a fangirl. Anyone who spent enough time with her would figure it out, and Ding Hong naturally had.","As soon as he left, Sun Jiajia huddled back into the corner to read comments. She had been following several bloggers who promised to edit fan videos pairing the mentor with Xixi, and now she was just waiting to be fed new content.","She started rewatching videos previously edited by her favorite uploaders, along with some old clips that had been re-cut with a fresh perspective.","\"Wuwu, so shippable! So good!\"","However, her peaceful indulgence was short-lived today. Someone entered the lab and walked over to her corner.","\"Sun Jiajia, are you alright?\"","Ye Qiusuo had originally come to the lab building because all five of her students were there today. She wanted to check on them and see if they had any questions.","She had visited Lin Lu first before coming here. Ding Hong was standing with his back to the door, comparing data on his computer. At a glance, Ye Qiusuo didn't see her other student and thought she was absent, until a strange whimpering sound came from the corner. She turned to find the student crouched down, head buried, shoulders trembling.","In a lab with only two people, one was acting normally while the other was hiding in a corner crying?","With a serious expression, Ye Qiusuo asked the student, who didn't respond. Only then did she notice the earplugs, so she tapped Sun Jiajia's shoulder, just as Ding Hong had done earlier.","\"Huh?\" Sun Jiajia looked up, her face flushed red, the corners of her eyes still wet with the happy tears of someone deeply immersed in fandom delights.","Ye Qiusuo: What happened to make her so sad?","Professor Ye's mind immediately began listing various possibilities.","Seeing her advisor, Sun Jiajia was startled. She yanked off her headphones and stood up hastily, but pulled too hard, disconnecting them from the audio jack.","\"Professor Ye, you don't love me.\" A heartbroken male voice played clearly through the speakers.","\"I was just toying with you. Xie Xi, you're nothing but an entertainer.\" A female voice followed immediately after.","Sun Jiajia: \"...\" The dialogue from her beloved fan edit, which usually thrilled her, instantly lost its appeal.","\"Xie Xi?\" Upon hearing the first line, Ye Qiusuo thought her student was watching some emotional TV drama. After the second line, she wondered if it was a news clip. \"What's wrong with him?\"","\"N-nothing's wrong.\" Sun Jiajia fumbled to turn off her phone. \"Professor, what brings you here?\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at her student and noticed she didn't seem genuinely upset. If something had happened to Xie Xi, her reaction would likely be different.","\"I reviewed the emails you all sent. Some issues are better discussed in the lab.\" Ye Qiusuo steered the conversation back on track, choosing not to press further.","...","After leaving the lab, Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment and opened the Weibo hot search list. She noticed an unusually high number of trending topics related to Xie Xi today. Looking closer, she realized it was because he had released a new album.","Was she on the hot search too?","Ye Qiusuo clicked the link and found it was about her teaching, so she didn't pay it much mind.","Xie Xi released his album today...","Following links in other people's comments, Ye Qiusuo opened a purchase link and bought ten copies, as a way to support her student.","She had just bought them and hadn't listened yet when Rong Shiyun, far away in the Western world, started bombarding her with over a dozen shared videos in quick succession. Finally, a message from Rong Shiyun arrived: [Qiusuo, look what treasures I found!!!]","Frowning, Ye Qiusuo looked at the shared videos. The title formats and interfaces were unexpectedly familiar."]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29","paragraphs":["The screen was filled with titles like 【The Domineering Professor and the Charming Singer】, 【The Gangster Boss's Runaway Sweetheart】...","Professor Ye: \"?\"","All the links came from the same website, which looked familiar to Ye Qiusuo. Xie Xi had once sent her a link before, with a similar format, though the titles weren't this exaggerated.","Ye Qiusuo casually clicked on one, discovering that the program she had previously recorded for Gaoxing TV and the video of her passing by Xie Xi at the entrance had been extensively edited, slowed down, and had background music added. It did feel... quite different.","Professor Ye continued scrolling and was surprised to find videos that didn't actually exist, using clips from some actor's movie with her face digitally swapped in.","Those uploaders were also in a difficult position. There was only so much footage of Professor Ye available. They went to great lengths to make her fit the character archetype. In contrast, Xie Xi was easy to edit, with plenty of material to work with.","The dialogue was cheesy, the plots exaggerated, yet the logic somehow connected, and the endings even tied up the foreshadowing from earlier.","Compared to the video Xie Xi had forwarded to her before, one was like a short Vlog, while these could almost pass for movies.","With an expressionless face, Professor Ye clicked on another one. As she watched the barrage of comments flooding the stream with the word \"car,\" she didn't understand at first, but a second later she saw what the so-called \"car\" was.","Not only that, a bit later in the playback, she heard two familiar lines.","Exactly the two lines that had come from her student's phone earlier.","\"...\"","At this moment, Professor Ye's feelings were somewhat complex.","Rong Shiyun kept sending voice messages. Though she was across the ocean, her heart seemed desperate to fly back home.","\"Qiusuo, isn't it thrilling?\"","\"It's so good to ship them! Did you watch the third video? I almost got a nosebleed!\"","\"Even though it's fake, these uploaders are amazing. The film industry is lacking talents like them.\"","Ye Qiusuo held down the voice message button and said slowly, \"Rong Shiyun, don't you have experiments to do? Projects to develop? So much free time?\"","Three consecutive questions successfully silenced Rong Shiyun. She sent a 'gotta run' sticker and then truly vanished.","Leaving Professor Ye alone to slowly digest the videos she had seen today.","...","The next day, both programs from Gaoxing TV were airing. Viewers clearly noticed that Professor Ye's knowledge of Xie Xi's albums had improved by leaps and bounds, surpassing even the most die-hard fans.","Compared to the previous episode where she couldn't answer at all, it was a world of difference now.","The contrast was so stark that Ye Qiusuo, along with the ever-present Xie Xi in the searches, once again happily landed on the trending list.","Just yesterday, Xie Xi had pushed Ye Qiusuo's name onto the trending list, so they were now even.","【Aww, our professor must have spent this whole week seriously catching up on Xi Xi's albums.】","【Is this how strong high-IQ people are?】","【Professor Ye understands our Xi Xi even better now~】","Um... doesn't anyone else find it suspicious that the show is directing the questions at Professor Ye? If the last episode being a coincidence was one thing, this time there were several questions about Xie Xi again. I have reasonable grounds to suspect the show increased the proportion of Xie Xi-related questions, and this just happened to give Professor Ye a week to prepare.","Actually, it's normal. After all, Professor Ye is so strong that the other guests hardly had a chance to score on the quick-response questions.","Calling all uploaders, come take a look — you might get new inspiration! Please write a story about a female professor secretly pining for a beautiful, sweet-voiced male singer!","...","Ye Qiusuo didn't see any of this, but as the program kept airing, her life was more or less affected.","Walking on the street, people gradually started turning their heads and even gathering around to follow her. It wasn't that no one looked at her before, but most just thought she was good-looking. Now, those who turned could call out her name and ask if she was Professor Ye.","When she went to places with heavy foot traffic these days, Ye Qiusuo basically always wore a mask. It wasn't much trouble. But as a teacher at Huajing University she inevitably had to spend a certain amount of time on campus. She drove onto campus and parked at the entrance to her college building, which already kept her from encountering many students. Still, her office was there and her office hours were fixed. There were always students from other departments, curious to see \"Professor Ye\" from TV, lingering outside and, while they were at it, asking for autographs and photos.","When Xie Xi entered the campus today, he noticed there were many more students on the paths than usual, many walking aimlessly in small groups.","Although he was wearing a mask, hat, and sunglasses, his years of experience as an artist made him sensitive; he could still feel people secretly glancing at him.","Something wasn't right.","Xie Xi quickened his pace towards the Literature Building. After entering the classroom, he didn't rush to pull down his mask, but waited.","Sure enough, a few minutes later, someone came in holding books and sat directly in the front row, seemingly here to study on the weekend.","However, the next second, someone else came in through the back door and sat down.","Xie Xi stood up and left directly, heading towards Ye Qiusuo's office. As he walked, he called her.","\"What's wrong?\" Ye Qiusuo's first thought upon answering was that he couldn't make it today.","\"Teacher, I'm coming to find you,\" Xie Xi said hurriedly. \"There are a lot of people following me.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned. Her phone beeped with a WeChat notification. She asked Xie Xi, \"Do you still remember the way to the office? Turn left, go around in a circle, and come in through the small side door. I'll meet you there.\"","After hanging up, Ye Qiusuo immediately grabbed her faculty card and went downstairs. Xie Xi had just arrived at the small door.","Ye Qiusuo placed her card on the access reader. The door beeped open. She pulled it open to let Xie Xi in.","\"Students following you?\"","\"A lot,\" Xie Xi said after entering, finally pulling down his mask and sunglasses.","\"Go to my office for today.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't ask further, letting Xie Xi follow her.","Once they were in the office, Xie Xi first walked to the desk and gently touched the small cactus with his finger. It seemed to be doing well.","Ye Qiusuo looked down at the message she had received earlier on her phone. It was from her student, Sun Jiajia.","To her surprise, it wasn't about academic matters, but several long screenshots and a voice message.","\"Mentor, I saw on the forum that someone organized an activity to find Xi Xi. Your schedule has also been leaked.\"","Just as Ye Qiusuo was about to open the screenshots, Sun Jiajia sent another voice message: \"Mentor, I saw in the post that they said you teach Xi Xi in the Literature Building's classroom. Someone has already seen Xi Xi inside! Mentor, you should both leave quickly.\"","\"Sure enough, they found me,\" Xie Xi said upon hearing the two messages, turning around.","Ye Qiusuo looked up at Xie Xi. After a moment, she said, \"Today, you'll have your lesson here. Next time, I'll come to you.\"","\"Come to me?\" Come to whose place?","A rare trace of confusion appeared in Xie Xi's eyes.","\"Strictly speaking, I'm your tutor. Home visits are normal.\" Professor Ye's logic was sound.","Xie Xi: \"...Okay.\" Though he actually felt it might be a bit inappropriate.","Ye Qiusuo cleared the desk, leaving half for Xie Xi opposite her. Once again, they sat in the same positions, only this time with a small pot of cactus on the desk.","\"Teacher, this is for you.\" After sitting down, Xie Xi's first action wasn't to begin studying, but to pull a CD from his coat pocket and slide it across the table. \"My latest album. You can put it with the others.\"","Ye Qiusuo replied, \"I've already bought ten copies of your album. I don't need another one.\""]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30","paragraphs":["Professor Ye made her first-ever album purchase, buying ten copies to support her friend Xie Xi.","\"...Digital albums don't have a physical copy,\" Xie Xi struggled to explain his sales pitch. \"But CDs are collectible.\"","He had a bit of an obsessive streak. Having previously given all his other albums to Ye Qiusuo, he was left with just this new one. He felt compelled to give it to her to complete the set.","Professor Ye frowned. She felt she had already received quite a few things from Xie Xi, which went against her professional ethics as a teacher.","\"The university has repeatedly issued strict prohibitions against faculty accepting gifts or money from students. You can't keep giving me things.\"","Xie Xi: Another week, another new educational shock.","\"I'm not a student at this university,\" Xie Xi retorted, raising an eyebrow as he continued pushing the album toward her. \"Professor, I've already given them to everyone I know. It's not anything valuable.\"","After some back-and-forth, the album ultimately stayed with Ye Qiusuo.","Today was the recording of the \"Knowledge Q&A\" finals, which had been scheduled earlier. After her class, Ye Qiusuo drove her car to the back door of the administration building to give Xie Xi a ride out.","\"I'll park very close. You can come out from inside then.\" To prevent any students who might still be lurking outside, Ye Qiusuo decided to drive him to the school gate where he could switch cars.","The university had too many students, including a fair number of avid fans, plus the general public's curiosity about celebrities. It being a Sunday, this situation was only to be expected.","But it was disrupting their normal routine.","By the time they reached the school gate, Xie Xi's assistant was already waiting. Wrapped up tightly, Xie Xi got out and slipped into his own car.","\"Xi-ge?\" Zhang Dong was still scanning the people passing through the gate when Xie Xi suddenly appeared.","\"Let's go.\" Xie Xi leaned back in the seat. \"No need to come to the university next week.\"","Zhang Dong turned his head. \"Xi-ge, is the tutoring over?\" He remembered the contract was for half a year.","Xie Xi lowered his sunglasses. \"From now on, Professor Ye will come to my place for the tutoring sessions.\"","...","For the finals recording, the stage lighting and set were completely revamped. The overall champion was practically a foregone conclusion in everyone's minds. Ye Qiusuo only needed to answer five more questions correctly for the remaining contestants to have no chance of surpassing her, and answering five questions was child's play for Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo was pulled into the makeup room—or rather, all the non-celebrity guests were. For tonight's finals, everyone needed a fresh look, so the program team had hired makeup artists for the non-celebrity guests. The celebrity guests, of course, had their own.","\"Professor Ye, congratulations in advance,\" said an engineer at the next makeup station, her face stiff, daring not to move, only her lips twitching.","\"Thank you,\" Ye Qiusuo accepted without modesty. She absolutely had to win the championship.","\"When I was in university, I almost chose your major. Unfortunately, I got placed in a different program. Otherwise, we might be colleagues now.\" The engineer, probably in her thirties, clearly wasn't used to being made up either.","\"You're very accomplished as you are,\" Ye Qiusuo said, recognizing her. \"Your team developed the domestic composite balanced shield tunneling machine project.\"","\"That was the team's achievement. I was just a small part of it.\"","The two began conversing about their professional fields, leaving the makeup artist beside them utterly bewildered and completely lost. Usually, they overheard all sorts of gossip in the makeup room most easily. So... is this how top experts talk to each other?","Once everyone was made up, they filed onto the stage. The moment Ye Qiusuo appeared, the audience and those on stage fell silent for an instant.","Ye Qiusuo's looks were truly unlike a typical non-celebrity. The female stars on stage couldn't outshine her; in comparison, they even seemed a bit plain.","The finals finally began. The host, wearing a striking blue suit today, stood energetically in the center of the stage. \"Esteemed guests, after several rounds of competition, we have finally arrived at the finals today. I believe everyone is as excited as I am.\"","After a lengthy ten-minute recap of the previous matches, the host announced the official start of the finals.","Ye Qiusuo unsurprisingly scored first. Answering five questions correctly was hardly difficult for her. By the time the host began reading the sixth question, the overall champion had already been decided.","Most of the contestants had practically given up struggling, but not Wan Yourou. She still answered every question, fighting for each one.","Even if she couldn't get the championship, having a reputation for perseverance and never giving up could still make for good material on the trending searches.","...","\"The result for the overall champion is out. It's obvious—it's our Professor Ye! Congratulations! Next, second place goes to... Wan Yourou! Third is Qian Jin! At the same time, congratulations to everyone for persevering until now, bringing the audience such a unique program. Thank you all.\" The host gave a deep bow to the audience below the stage.","The main part of the program ended. Next, several guests shared their thoughts, with Ye Qiusuo being the last.","Sitting there, the thought of 6.5 million consecutively entering her account made her uncharacteristically happy.","\"Professor Ye, having participated in this competition and won the championship, what would you like to say?\" The host invited Ye Qiusuo to the center of the stage.","\"The program is quite good.\" The prize money is generous.","The host waited specifically for a moment, only to realize she had already finished. He had to steer the conversation back himself before making a final summary.","At this point, all the guests stood in the center of the stage. Even the director was called over. Amid a shower of confetti, everyone struck poses for the camera. Only after the photos were taken did people start to leave.","The director happened to be standing next to Ye Qiusuo, so she took the opportunity to ask, \"Director, when will the prize money be issued?\"","\"...It can be today, but there are procedures to follow. You might have to wait here for a while.\" Although the director had seen Ye Qiusuo negotiate the endorsement deal with the Likou representative last time, her bluntness about money was still something he needed a moment to get used to.","\"Alright.\"","Ye Qiusuo followed the director backstage and successfully received her prize money. It wasn't the full five million—taxes had to be deducted—but she was in a good mood nonetheless.","...","After the program recording finished, Ye Qiusuo didn't idle. She began researching populations with dyslexia, discovering that similar cases could be as high as twenty percent, yet they had never received the attention they deserved.","For example, when students get low scores on reading tests, they are often criticized for being careless or not reading the questions clearly. Perhaps it's due to dyslexia, but they themselves don't realize it.","Of course, cases as severe as Xie Xi's, which affect learning and daily life, are relatively fewer.","Perhaps this could be a project worth initiating.","Ye Qiusuo could see the business opportunity within. Having handled so many projects, she keenly perceived that if a product could be developed specifically to help people with dyslexia see text clearly, it would be a good opportunity.","The next day, Ye Qiusuo went to Tianqiu Technology Company to find Zhang Chengjue, hoping he would approve a new project for her.","\"What project?\" Zhang Chengjue asked.","\"Regarding dyslexia.\" Ye Qiusuo had stayed up all night finishing the project proposal. She turned on the projector in Zhang Chengjue's office and presented it to him.","After listening, Zhang Chengjue was silent for a long time before saying, \"Qiusuo, you have a misconception. Do you know why this disorder affects twenty percent of people, yet not many are aware of it? It's because a significant portion of parents don't care and are unwilling to admit their child has this condition. They've managed all these years like this; it's always been this way, so they don't see the need for this. Therefore, your market valuation here is mistaken.\"","\"Always been this way, so no need to change?\"","Zhang Chengjue let out a long sigh: \"Qiusuo, I know you want to initiate a project whenever you decide to, and I've always allowed you that freedom. But the artificial synapse project was just approved not long ago. Isn't it a bit too hasty to push for another one so urgently? Moreover, you have other projects in hand. Many people in the company are already dissatisfied, feeling you're taking up the majority of the capital flow. I... can't always shield you.\"","Ye Qiusuo slowly pushed her silver-rimmed glasses up with her middle finger, the thin chain swaying slightly. For a moment, Zhang Chengjue, sitting behind the desk, had the illusion that her aura had shifted.","The next second proved it was not an illusion.","She said coldly, \"The reason I have many projects is that I conceive of things others haven't thought of and accomplish what others cannot. Many in the company are dissatisfied? Dissatisfied with being too foolish to even propose a viable project?\"","Ye Qiusuo was a child prodigy, looking down upon the masses. It was impossible for someone like her not to have arrogance, though she had always concealed it well.","Hearing her words so abruptly, Zhang Chengjue's expression changed several times before finally calming down, a somewhat helpless smile appearing on his face. \"Qiusuo, these aren't my words, don't be angry with me. It's just that the company is entering a critical period now. The therapeutic mushrooms project on the eighth and ninth floors has absorbed a significant investment. There's no way to start a new project at the moment.\"","\"The mushroom project has already started receiving investment... I didn't receive any meeting notice.\" Ye Qiusuo frowned. Company rules stipulated that when project funding reached a certain threshold, a shareholders' meeting was required. She was completely unaware of this matter.","Zhang Chengjue was taken aback. \"Qiusuo, you forgot. A few years ago, you said that for future company shareholders' meetings, I should just vote on your behalf and not bother calling you in.\"","Ye Qiusuo had indeed said that. Back then, she was swamped with work, begrudging even time for sleep, let alone caring about shareholders' meetings. Plus, at that time, the company required shareholder votes for almost every project, and she simply had no energy to deal with it.","In the past two years, the company rules changed. Shareholders' meetings were only held for exceptionally large sums, and the large-scale projects had always been ones Ye Qiusuo herself took on, requiring her attendance. She had completely forgotten about that delegation.","\"I will attend shareholders' meetings from now on.\"","Ten minutes after Ye Qiusuo left the office, the assistant sitting outside received a call.","\"Little Zhao, come and clean up my office.\"","Ye Qiusuo stopped on the twelfth floor, intending to retrieve the data she had previously requested an experimenter to investigate. If Tianqiu Tech wouldn't approve the project here, she could seek funding elsewhere.","Ye Qiusuo stepped out of the elevator, walked down the corridor, and glanced below to see someone carrying a box towards the elevator, not wearing a company uniform.","It was the person in charge of the mushroom project.","Frowning, Ye Qiusuo turned around and re-entered the elevator, pressing the button for the first floor.","By the time she exited, the person in charge was almost at the security gate.","\"Zeng Liqing.\"","\"Professor Ye?\" Zeng Liqing, holding the box, turned around, clearly not expecting Ye Qiusuo to stop him.","\"You resigned?\" Ye Qiusuo glanced at the box in his arms.","For a moment, Zeng Liqing's expression was extremely complicated, but in the end, he just said calmly, \"Yes. I still prefer the feeling of teaching.\"","Ye Qiusuo stared at Zeng Liqing for a while, then shifted her gaze to the project announcement board behind and to his right. There was no notification about the mushroom project on it.","\"When was the mushroom project approved?\"","\"The 28th of last month.\" Zeng Liqing wasn't sure why she was suddenly asking this. After answering, he said, \"If there's nothing else, I'll be going now.\"","\"Mm.\"","Ye Qiusuo stood in place, watching Zeng Liqing's retreating figure until it disappeared from sight, then looked up towards the upper floors.","Some things had changed imperceptibly.","...","In the Huajing Six Tyrants group chat.","Ye Qiusuo: [I have a new project here and need help. Are you all willing to assist?]","Lin Lu (Second Tyrant): [I'm willing! I can! Pick me, Mentor!]","Sun Jiajia (Third Tyrant): [Mentor, he can, then I can!!!]","Ding Hong (Sixth Tyrant): [Mentor, I'm also willing to help.]","...","As soon as Ye Qiusuo sent the message in the group, her five students immediately flooded the chat, each saying they were willing. A hint of a smile appeared in her eyes.","Next step: secure the investment."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31","paragraphs":["The finals of \"Knowledge Q&A\" trended on social media even before airing.","#Can't bear to watch \"Knowledge Q&A\"#","[I already know who the champion is without even watching this finale.]","[Hahahaha, I feel so sorry for the guests, having to go up against Professor Ye.]","[Why are you all so sure Ye Qiusuo will win? What if someone makes a comeback?]","[To the person above, a comeback requires Professor Ye not answering five questions correctly. Do you think that's possible? Unless Professor Ye isn't in the finals.]","[The guests are so pitiful, just running along this whole time, but why am I so excited? Wuwuwuwu, protecting the best Professor Ye in the world.]","When the broadcast time arrived, the show's ratings skyrocketed from the start, clearly everyone was anticipating the finals.","As soon as each guest appeared on stage, the barrage of comments began to multiply.","[Wow, ordinary people can actually look really good when dressed up. Is makeup some kind of dark art? That male guest next to her changed his hairstyle and instantly looks ten years younger.]","[Holy crap!]","[Holy crap! Holy crap!]","When the camera switched to Ye Qiusuo walking on stage, the screen was suddenly flooded with \"holy crap\".","[This... I knew Professor Ye was good-looking, but I didn't know she could be this stunning!]","[I'm in love, is this the feeling of a heart fluttering?]","[Ahhhhhhh! Professor, look at me! Look at me!!!]","[Wuwuwu, it's not enough that she's super smart, her looks have to crush everyone else too. Professor Ye is just too much, wuwuwuwu tvt]","After things calmed down, all the guests began waiting for the questions, and the audience grew tense too. With every question Ye Qiusuo answered correctly, the comments started counting, all the way to the fifth question, when the comments went completely wild, throwing virtual flowers everywhere.","[Grand Champion!!!]","[Ahhhhh, is this the power of knowledge?]","[Our Professor Ye is simply the strongest on the planet!]","The following result was obvious: Ye Qiusuo won the grand championship.","Then came the lengthy guest speeches, paired with moving background music, pushing the atmosphere to its peak.","When it was Ye Qiusuo's turn, the audience waited for her speech, wanting to know the professor's thoughts. Instead, she ended her thank-you speech with just one brief sentence.","[Hahahaha, the host's bewildered look. He probably hasn't encountered this situation before.]","[Normally, the champion should give a speech that moves everyone and themselves to tears to end the show. Our Professor Ye is truly not an ordinary person.]","[Sigh, I like Professor Ye so much. I wish she would open a Weibo account.]","While the comments were still feeling sentimental, Ye Qiusuo's words asking the director for the prize money were picked up by a nearby microphone. Some viewers who had their volume turned all the way up heard their conversation.","[I think I just heard what Professor Ye said to the director...]","[It wasn't my imagination? I heard it too.]","[What did she say?]","[I rewound it, turned up the volume, and listened two more times. Hahahahaha, Professor Ye asking for the prize money so seriously is so adorable!]","Viewers, not content to just finish the show, would always go find fellow fans to discuss it with. At this time, Weibo was a great place to go. Ye Qiusuo's conversation with the director was quickly clipped and, at an extremely fast speed, shot up the trending searches.","#What did Professor Ye say to the director?#","Many viewers don't like to watch with comments on, so naturally they didn't know about this extra clip. Curious, they clicked in and saw the short clip of what Professor Ye said to the director.","[Shocked, why didn't I hear this part?]","[Dying of laughter, is it really okay for Professor Ye to be this direct?]","[The director even stuttered a bit when he spoke, clearly not expecting someone to ask him for the prize money right on stage.]","[The director isn't great either, insisting on having a prize money segment at the end but only giving out a glass trophy.]","[Did Professor Ye only come to this show for the prize money to utterly dominate?]","[The epitome of bluntness? Professor Ye.]","[Being so direct that people can't play mind games is actually pretty good too.]","[Hahahahaha, Professor Ye is really so straightforward. She remained unmoved even by our Xi Xi's beauty. I suspect only that little temptress Academia can capture her attention.]","\"Brother Xi, Professor Ye said a few more words to the director afterward.\" Zhang Dong said while looking at the trending searches.","They had just finished watching the \"Knowledge Q&A\" finals together. Xie Xi didn't like seeing the comments, so he had turned them off on the projected TV. Zhang Dong only found out about the extra segment when he browsed Weibo and immediately shared it.","\"Play it and let me see.\" Xie Xi sat on the sofa, a homework book still resting on his lap, with just one page left before finishing this one.","Zhang Dong immediately projected the video from his phone onto the TV in front of him: \"Brother Xi, look.\"","Xie Xi looked up at the specially clipped segment on the TV, the audio amplified, and thought to himself: \"...The teacher seems to be short on money.\"","\"Haha, Professor Ye is really interesting.\"","Xie Xi frowned and turned his head, looking at his assistant staring at the person on TV with a silly grin: \"Do you like her?\"","Zhang Dong, still unaware, chuckled: \"Who doesn't like Professor Ye? She's amazing.\" The only feeling from following this show was pure satisfaction.","Xie Xi got up and turned off the TV: \"I need to do my homework, don't disturb me.\"","\"Okay, Brother Xi.\" Zhang Dong finished and added, \"Brother Xi, Professor Ye will come here tomorrow, right?\"","Xie Xi: \"...I need to concentrate on my homework. Leave the living room.\"","Zhang Dong: \"Oh.\" What's up with his Brother Xi today, actually doing homework seriously.","After the person left, Xie Xi looked down at the homework book, flipped back a few pages. On several pages, words had been specifically circled by Ye Qiusuo, with graphic marks made next to them. He didn't know what they meant. But looking at their handwriting intertwined on the page, he just felt...","Thump—","Xie Xi closed the homework book, then lay down on the sofa, pulling a nearby blanket over his head.","His heart was broken.","Otherwise, why would it be beating so fast?","...","\"I've already negotiated with these two hospitals. The data they have on dyslexia will be sent over later. Sun Jiajia will be responsible for the statistics and records then.\" Once Ye Qiusuo decided on something, she would solve it with maximum efficiency. She had only decided to start this project last week, and now everything was almost ready, only lacking investment.","\"Professor, what should we do?\" Lin Lu asked.","\"Not needed for now. We'll start once the investment arrives.\" Ye Qiusuo looked at her five students. \"Don't worry about other things for the time being, focus on your own projects first.\"","She spent the morning at the university, and at 1 PM, Ye Qiusuo drove to Xie Xi's place.","She stood at the door and rang the bell. After a while, someone came to open it.","\"Teacher, please come in.\" Xie Xi stepped aside to let Ye Qiusuo enter.","The living room on the first floor was extremely spacious, with a fireplace that even had a real fire burning inside. The decor was cozy, with wool rugs spread everywhere; stepping on them, your feet would sink softly. The TV in front of the sofa was huge, not hard to imagine that watching movies from there would be an enjoyable experience. Many photos of Xie Xi himself, of varying sizes, hung on the walls.","Ye Qiusuo didn't pay attention to any of these things. She scanned the room upon entering and said: \"There's no table here.\"","There was only a dining table, with place settings at each seat, and the chairs came with their own cushions.","The entire first floor showed no trace of a formal, hard-lined office area. The feeling upon entering was one of comfort, a place where you could lie down and rest at any time.","\"Where do you usually do your homework?\"","Xie Xi pointed at the sofa.","Ye Qiusuo was clearly not the type to curl up on a sofa to work. She preferred to stay alert and clear-headed, believing it led to higher efficiency.","\"There's a study on the second floor with a desk. We could go there.\" Xie Xi said this somewhat insincerely; he didn't like the study at all and had hardly ever been inside.","\"Not necessary yet.\" Ye Qiusuo asked him for his homework notebook. \"You should have finished it.\"","\"Do I need a new notebook again?\" Xie Xi asked, holding the second notebook he had filled.","\"Not today.\" Ye Qiusuo took it and began flipping through, standing right there for a good ten minutes. Just as Xie Xi's anxiety was growing, she finally spoke. \"Do you have money?\"","Xie Xi was taken aback. \"...Yes.\"","\"Would you be willing to become my investor?\" Ye Qiusuo asked seriously.","\"Okay.\" The answer almost leaped from Xie Xi's lips.","Professor Ye, however, looked puzzled. \"I haven't even said what the investment is for.\"","Xie Xi's eyes darted away for a moment. \"Anyway, I have plenty of money. I don't mind.\"","\"It's for a project related to dyslexia. Although symptoms vary from person to person, there are patterns...\" Ye Qiusuo held up Xie Xi's homework notebook. \"You all perceive things according to certain rules.\"","Xie Xi didn't understand these things, but he had money.","\"I can invest right now.\"","Before Ye Qiusuo could even finish outlining the project's general content, or get a chance to pull the USB drive from her pocket, she had successfully secured the investment.","\"Since I'm investing, can I skip the homework?\" Xie Xi attempted to bargain.","\"Sure.\" Ye Qiusuo agreed immediately.","Before Xie Xi could react, she added, \"You've already finished it.\"","The living room fell quiet for a moment before Ye Qiusuo spoke again. \"You need to come with me to the hospital for some tests.\"","Xie Xi was quite cooperative, immediately gathering his things to go with her.","At the doorway, Ye Qiusuo looked at her car and turned to ask Xie Xi, \"Where's your assistant?\"","She had originally assumed the assistant would drive Xie Xi, allowing them to go their separate ways after the tests.","\"He's busy.\" Xie Xi wasn't about to say he had sent Zhang Dong away himself.","In the end, Xie Xi got into Ye Qiusuo's car to go to the hospital.","The hospital they went to wasn't an ordinary one, but a specialized training hospital.","Because Xie Xi was a celebrity and couldn't be seen easily in public, Ye Qiusuo took him in through a special entrance.","\"Qiusuo, I've prepared the room for you.\" A man in his thirties stood at the entrance. He came forward as soon as he saw them. \"I have a few children to attend to later, so I won't disturb you.\"","\"Thank you.\" Ye Qiusuo took the key.","\"No problem. When you're ready to leave, just give the key to the nurse at the front desk.\"","\"Alright.\"","\"The director of this hospital is a friend of mine.\" Ye Qiusuo added an explanation as she led Xie Xi inside.","\"Hmm.\"","Pushing the door open, they entered a very dark room. In the center was a single chair, with an instrument in front of it.","\"Is this a psychiatric treatment room?\" Xie Xi felt the place resembled those movie sets where patients are taken for experiments.","\"It's just for testing.\" Ye Qiusuo turned on the room's lights. It instantly transformed into a playful space. The walls were painted in bright colors and covered with various cartoon characters, very appealing to children. All sorts of small toys were scattered in the corner.","Ye Qiusuo stood in the middle adjusting the instrument. Xie Xi wandered over to the corner, squatted down, and poked a finger at the toys. Suddenly, he spotted a bright yellow duck.","He couldn't resist giving it a squeeze. The room was instantly filled with a long, drawn-out 'QUACK'—"]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo turned her head to look at the corner, where the big star Xie Xi was squatting, glancing over guiltily.","\"It's fine, you can play.\" Professor Ye understood. \"This is for relaxation.\"","It's just that the original target users were children.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","He let go of the duck, placed it back where it was, stood up, as if nothing had happened.","\"Am I supposed to sit here later?\" Xie Xi walked over to the chair and asked, reaching out to fiddle with the metal headset above the chair. It really did look like a mind-control device.","After adjusting the final data, Ye Qiusuo looked up: \"Yes, you can sit down now.\"","Xie Xi hesitated, looking at Ye Qiusuo, and pointed at the headset: \"Is there electricity on this?\"","\"There is an electric current.\"","The big star felt a bit panicked inside, but his face remained calm: \"Can I not wear it? This headset looks small, probably won't fit.\"","Professor Ye reached out and pulled the metal headset: \"It's adjustable.\"","Xie Xi thought: Maybe he should pretend to go to the bathroom and then leave.","Seeing him hesitate to sit down, Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment: \"It doesn't hurt, just a mild current.\"","She had seen how the dean tested children; you had to coax them.","\"Really?\" Xie Xi didn't quite believe it. They said there was electricity on it, and it wouldn't hurt?","\"Really.\"","Xie Xi dawdled as he sat down. He was tall, and sitting on the chair, he seemed a bit cramped, his long legs having nowhere to go.","\"The chair was custom-made for this machine, so it can only be this height,\" Ye Qiusuo explained, but it was suitable for the average adult. Children needed a cushion to barely manage.","Her words distracted Xie Xi. Then she pulled open the headset and gently placed it on his head, carefully adjusting it.","Xie Xi lowered his eyes, only able to see Ye Qiusuo's clothes—a dark brown jacket with several worn spots, very much like the industrial style popular on the streets.","He bet Ye Qiusuo definitely didn't wear that jacket because it was trendy.","Xie Xi stared at one of the damaged spots and suddenly realized it looked like something had splashed onto it and burned it like that.","\"Your jacket is torn here.\" Xie Xi reached up and touched the jacket.","Ye Qiusuo glanced down casually: \"Mhm.\"","\"Was it burned?\" Xie Xi thought the mark was strange—not a long scratch, but several small irregular circles, faintly revealing the jacket's lining.","\"No, sulfuric acid splashed on it during an experiment.\"","A small test tube was placed on the lab table. A classmate bumped the table, knocking over the tube. Most of it spilled on the table, but a few drops splashed onto Ye Qiusuo's jacket. That was several years ago.","\"Sulfuric acid...\" The big star was shocked. He had only heard of it and never seen it in real life; it felt so distant from him. \"Are your experiments that dangerous?\"","\"It's just special equipment; we don't usually handle it.\" As she spoke, Ye Qiusuo finally finished adjusting the metal headset. She lowered her hands and took a few steps back. \"How do you feel?\"","Encased in the metal headset, Xie Xi tried to turn his head and found it didn't hinder his movement much. \"A slight feeling of pressure.\"","\"That's normal.\" Ye Qiusuo turned around, turned off the lights in the room, and turned on the projector slides at the front. She went through them one by one, each time asking Xie Xi what he saw and having him describe it.","...","About two hours later, Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo finally emerged from the room.","\"I'll go return the key, then drive you back.\" Ye Qiusuo told him to wait here. There were too many people up front; Xie Xi might get recognized.","\"I'm thirsty.\" Xie Xi had been talking for nearly two hours, which was more tiring than a concert.","Ye Qiusuo paused for a moment. \"Wait here.\"","The front desk was quite far from their room. By the time Ye Qiusuo returned the key and bought water from the vending machine, Xie Xi was already gone.","Ye Qiusuo looked around, then started calling Xie Xi while walking toward the back exit.","The phone was still ringing, unanswered, but Ye Qiusuo spotted Xie Xi.","He was standing in front of a cotton candy vendor, looking utterly out of place because he was surrounded by a group of children.","By the time Ye Qiusuo walked out, Xie Xi had already made his purchase, holding a colorful cotton candy in his left hand and a white one in his right.","Seeing her, Xie Xi immediately wanted to wave, but his hands were full, so he gave a slight wave instead and quickly walked over to Ye Qiusuo.","\"That person can turn sugar into cotton candy, and this one even has color.\" Xie Xi raised the colorful one in his left hand.","He had only read about it in books or seen it in movies and TV shows, but never had the chance to see it in real life.","During his teenage years, his food, clothing, housing, and transportation were all handled by dedicated staff; everything was delivered to him. Now, as a singer, even going out was problematic, requiring assistants and life managers to accompany him.","\"He spins a stick, and it appears.\" Xie Xi was curious and casually offered the colorful cotton candy to Ye Qiusuo. \"This is for you.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't take it. Instead, she explained to him: \"The crystalline structure of the sugar is destroyed by heating, turning from granulated sugar into liquid sugar syrup. The machine's outlet is narrow. When the liquid syrup comes out and meets the cold air, it instantly solidifies into solid sugar strands. The color comes from added dye.\"","Xie Xi looked down at the cotton candy in his hand. \"But they're so pretty, like clouds.\"","\"Mhm.\" Professor Ye was actually more interested in the transformation process than the cotton candy itself. But people are different—some lean more emotional, some more rational. She doesn't judge viewpoints different from her own.","\"Eat it after we get in the car.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed at the mask on his face.","\"Do you still want it?\" Xie Xi asked as they walked.","In the end, the two sat in the car, each eating a stick of cotton candy.","Xie Xi pinched off a small piece and put it in his mouth, feeling like he was eating nothingness—no real sensation. He pinched off a larger clump and ate it, finally tasting a bit of sweetness.","The flavor wasn't particularly great, just sweet.","After a few bites, Xie Xi didn't want anymore, holding the stick. \"Looks good, doesn't taste good.\"","\"I'll go throw it away.\" Ye Qiusuo couldn't finish hers either; it was just the taste of plain sugar, something only kids would like.","\"Wait.\" Xie Xi took Ye Qiusuo's cotton candy as well, then took out his phone and took a picture of the two. \"To commemorate my first time eating cotton candy.\"","Professor Ye sat quietly beside him, watching Xie Xi take photos. His way of doing things was very different from hers.","\"Done.\" Xie Xi handed both sticks of cotton candy to Ye Qiusuo.","When Ye Qiusuo returned after throwing them away, she heard Xie Xi on the phone.","\"My phone was on silent, didn't hear it. I was with Professor Ye; her phone was on silent too.\" Xie Xi said something else in response to the person on the other end. \"The class location changed, I know, I'm heading back now.\"","Ye Qiusuo took out her own phone and only then noticed over a dozen missed calls from numbers belonging to Wei Qi, Zhang Dong, and several others.","When they had entered the room earlier, to avoid interruptions, they had both put their phones on silent.","...","As soon as Ye Qiusuo dropped Xie Xi off, she saw Zhang Dong standing at the entrance, pacing anxiously.","\"Brother Xi, you're finally back. Sister Wei is inside.\"","Usually, after finishing his lessons, Xie Xi would be picked up for styling and makeup, then go record a show.","During this tutoring session at home, Zhang Dong was sent out on an errand. He returned exactly two hours later, only to find the place empty. After waiting for half an hour, he called Xie Xi over a dozen times—no answer. He then tried Professor Ye's number, with the same result.","Almost an hour passed, and both the stylist and makeup artist started calling. The situation even alarmed Wei Qi, who was now inside the apartment.","\"I understand,\" Xie Xi said, turning to look at Ye Qiusuo in the car. \"See you next week.\"","\"See you next week.\" Ye Qiusuo stepped on the accelerator and drove off.","Zhang Dong watched the car leave, then looked at Xie Xi, feeling that something was subtly different.","Since when did his brother Xi no longer look weary after finishing a lesson? He even said \"see you next week\" to Professor Ye?!","The moment Xie Xi stepped into the living room, he could feel the chill emanating from his agent, Sister Wei.","\"Xixi, why didn't you tell anyone before going out? You should have at least taken Zhang Dong with you.\" Wei Qi was genuinely angry.","People have a herd mentality, and Xie Xi was far too popular. Being surrounded and trapped in public was no small matter; one never knew who might take advantage of the situation to cause trouble.","A few years back, there was an incident when everyone had let their guard down. Xie Xi, unaware of just how much attention he attracted, had simply put on a mask and a pair of sunglasses to visit a newly opened viral amusement park. Right after buying his ticket, he lowered his mask for the security check and was recognized. He had only taken a few steps inside when people who had finished checking in before and after him swarmed around. Someone bold even grabbed Xie Xi, refusing to let him leave, demanding a photo. Others nearby started shouting his name, drawing even more people over.","That viral amusement park was already crowded, full of young people. Upon hearing Xie Xi's name, they abandoned their rides and games, squeezing towards the commotion. The park's security couldn't maintain order, and Xie Xi was trapped in the middle, unable to escape. In the end, the management had to call the police, and it took the entire afternoon to disperse the crowd.","Because of this incident, Xie Xi was repeatedly singled out and criticized by the media: knowing he was a celebrity, yet still wandering around recklessly, causing disturbances and wasting public resources.","Wei Qi wasn't particularly concerned about the media bashing Xie Xi; he just wanted to visit an amusement park like any ordinary person, which wasn't wrong in itself.","But during that chaos, Xie Xi had gotten injured in the scuffle.","Wei Qi didn't want to see a similar scene happen again.","\"Understood,\" Xie Xi immediately admitted his fault.","Wei Qi's anger subsided. \"Let's go, I'll take you there. This episode is to select the top three, right?\"","\"Probably.\" At the mention of this, Xie Xi's expression turned indifferent. \"I don't want to participate in any more talent shows in the future.\"","This show was full of tricks and murky depths, which Xie Xi genuinely disliked. He could directly breach the contract and quit—money wasn't an issue—but it would cause trouble for his team.","...","At the recording site of \"Tomorrow's Star.\"","\"Only five of us are left. After tonight, two more will leave,\" a contestant sighed backstage.","\"Even if someone leaves, we'll all still be brothers.\"","Lu Mingzhe stood to the side, a hint of sarcasm in his eyes. Once they left, who would still keep in touch?","\"Mingzhe is definitely secure, he has the most fans.\"","\"Until the very last moment, no one can be sure,\" Lu Mingzhe said, straightening his collar. \"Focus on the competition, don't overthink it.\"","Selecting the top three required combining the votes from the mentors and the live audience.","Sitting in the mentor's seat, Xie Xi listened to the audience chanting Lu Mingzhe's name in unison, his gaze turning cold.","Among the many contestants, Lu Mingzhe was famously popular, but none of the top five finalists lacked fans. For all five hundred selected audience members to be chanting only for Lu Mingzhe seemed far too coincidental.","It was hard not to suspect some behind-the-scenes manipulation.","Judging from the past few episodes, the production team was determined to push Lu Mingzhe to debut."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33","paragraphs":["\"Lu Mingzhe! Lu Mingzhe! Lu Mingzhe!\"","After Lu Mingzhe finished singing, the five hundred audience members below the stage chanted his name in unison, even forgetting that there were still other contestants waiting to perform.","\"Shh—\"","Lu Mingzhe raised a finger to his lips, signaling his fans to quiet down.","\"Ahhhhhh!!!\"","\"Mingzhe, I love you!\"","The screams from below grew even more frenzied.","\"He's not even debuted yet, but it feels like Lu Mingzhe is already a superstar,\" remarked the male judge on the right, sighing at the sight of the wild audience.","\"Can't be helped. Girls nowadays all like handsome guys. Lu Mingzhe is indeed good-looking and sings quite well too,\" the female judge beside him laughed. \"If I were ten years younger, I'd probably be chasing after Lu Mingzhe too.\"","In the center seat, Xie Xi leaned lazily back in his chair, spinning a pen on the table, not joining the conversation.","Instead, the judge on the right took the initiative to address him: \"We almost forgot, Xie Xi has way more fans. It must have been even crazier back then, right, Xie Xi?\"","The female judge's face twitched slightly, but she didn't respond.","The two were simply not on the same level; this comment clearly belittled Xie Xi while elevating Lu Mingzhe.","Xie Xi glanced at him, flicking open the cap of a black ballpoint pen with his thumb: \"Among male singers in the industry right now, is there anyone who can surpass me? You?\"","No one, the female judge beside him mentally finished the sentence.","The smile on the male judge's face almost faltered; he didn't know how to reply. Could he surpass him? Of course not.","\"I was joking,\" Xie Xi suddenly laughed, asking with feigned sincerity, \"You're not angry, are you?\"","\"No, haha,\" the male judge felt his insides twist with irritation, yet he couldn't show it, because he was the one who had started this exchange.","Fortunately, the next contestant came on stage, interrupting their conversation, and everyone quieted down to listen to the performance.","This contestant, whether due to lack of confidence or some other reason, chose a slow ballad, sung without much technique—a suicidal choice for a competition.","\"All the way to this point, I've been very nervous. Today, I can finally breathe a sigh of relief. Even if I leave, I won't have regrets. I was here, I sang, I cried, I met all of you.\" After singing, it should have been the vote-pulling segment, but the contestant sounded like he was giving a farewell speech.","Among the five contestants, the one with the highest online votes would advance directly to the top three. The remaining four would compete in pairs, with the winners staying to enter the top three.","After this contestant finished, Lu Mingzhe returned to the stage. The two stood waiting for the judges' critique.","\"What's really admirable is that the contestant who came on later actually had the courage to sing a slow song,\" the male judge said with emotion. \"Everyone knows slow songs aren't as explosive live; it's hard to captivate the audience. That really deserves respect.\"","\"Thank you, judge. With this song today, I just wanted to give my best to everyone,\" the contestant's eyes were moist, and he took several deep breaths.","\"It's okay,\" Lu Mingzhe stood beside him, patting his shoulder in comfort. \"We all understand you.\"","\"Everyone has been very brave today. I hope no matter who leaves, you will all continue to sing well in the future,\" the female judge said sincerely. \"You're still young; you have a long road ahead.\"","For this competition to enter the top three, the director required every judge to give comments. As per convention, critiques in the later stages tended to lean towards sentimentality, with fewer pointed out flaws.","\"Xie Xi, do you have anything to say?\" the female judge asked.","Xie Xi put down his pen: \"If your vote count is lower than Lu Mingzhe's, it's not because you sang a slow song. It's because you didn't sing it well.\"","The tears that had been shimmering in the contestant's eyes froze upon hearing Xie Xi's words.","Competing here required strategy. He had intended to take this emotionally manipulative path, had just been fishing for sympathy votes. It would be great if he could unexpectedly surpass Lu Mingzhe; if not, he could still generate buzz and attention.","\"A slow song isn't the crime; singing poorly is.\"","Xie Xi truly disliked a certain sentiment prevalent in singing competition shows nowadays—the idea that upbeat songs are more explosive live and more pleasing to the audience. Good singing is good singing. A slow song can equally touch hearts and earn respect.","Having come this far, yet among the top five there were hardly any who truly loved music and fought for it. Instead, all kinds of tactics kept emerging. No wonder the music scene was declining, with people so impatient and superficial.","Xie Xi pulled off his earpiece, finally free from the director's incessant voice demanding he smooth things over.","\"Your rendition of this song was superficial and weak. I didn't hear any technique or emotion in it.\" Xie Xi didn't like Lu Mingzhe, but that didn't mean he could tolerate other contestants lying through their teeth right in front of him.","\"Ahem.\" The female judge covered the mic on her clothes, using the motion of brushing her hair to whisper a reminder to Xie Xi beside her. \"Don't be too harsh. What if the contestant is psychologically affected?\"","These days, part of the reason judges on shows weren't sharp enough in their critiques was due to the general environment. If a contestant had issues, it might easily be blamed on the judge.","Xie Xi had said what he wanted to say and naturally didn't continue.","\"Xie Xi, you might have misunderstood. Everyone's understanding and conveyance of emotion is different. The fact that the contestant chose this song for such an important competition is proof enough of his sincerity. I think I could hear emotion in his singing,\" the female judge quickly steered the topic back, wanting to comfort the contestant.","\"I also heard very strong emotion in it,\" the male judge, having been put in his place earlier, deliberately agreed with the female judge this time.","The two contestants were still standing together on stage. Lu Mingzhe turned his face slightly towards the backstage, a flash of impatience in his eyes: Because of Xie Xi's few sentences, the other two judges had instead started speaking up for his opponent.","Having both judges agree with him and refute Xie Xi—this was unprecedented in the competition so far. The contestant felt a surge of confidence like never before.","\"Judge, perhaps our expressions of emotion are just different. Regardless of win or lose today, maybe you could demonstrate live what it means to be 'full of emotion'?\"","Xie Xi saw the contestant staring at him and after a moment asked, \"Me?\"","\"Yes. Before I leave, I'd like to receive some guidance from the judge,\" the contestant said, thinking himself clever.","The female judge raised a hand to cover most of her face, hiding the helplessness in her eyes. \"Actually wants to compete with Xie Xi?\" she thought. This contestant had completely given up his chance of entering the top three.","Xie Xi let out a short laugh. Before anyone could react, he lifted the mic on his clothes and began singing a cappella right there on the spot—no backing track, no accompaniment.","Even so, the moment he opened his mouth, the entire venue fell silent. Everyone's gaze was involuntarily drawn to Xie Xi. As he sang, some closed their eyes to listen, while others had tears glistening in their eyes.","That voice seemed capable of piercing through the defenses that wrapped around everyone's hearts.","The difference was immediately clear.","After finishing the song a cappella, Xie Xi lowered his hand, meticulously and casually reattaching the mic to his clothes. Only then did the audience below suddenly erupt in screams, beginning to chant Xie Xi's name.","Even the male judge beside him had a flicker of apprehension in his eyes.","Once the mic was properly secured, Xie Xi finally looked up at the contestant. \"What do you think?\"","The contestant was left speechless, his face burning with shame. The gazes from the audience below suddenly felt piercing.","Lu Mingzhe's mood improved considerably. After Xie Xi's performance like that, the guy next to him was undoubtedly getting eliminated.","Comparing the two, even a fool would know how to vote.","Sure enough, in both the live audience and the mentor votes, that contestant's tally was pitifully low.","Xie Xi didn't feel the slightest bit of happiness.","He had hoped to see contestants who truly loved music.","...","\"Bro Xi, don't be angry. There was still one pretty good contestant, right? The first one to make it into the top three, what's his name... Guo something,\" Zhang Dong carefully probed, trying to gauge his idol's mood.","\"Guo Yuan,\" Xie Xi said, turning to look out the car window.","\"Right, him. Actually, based on my years of watching talent shows, it's pretty good if one person gets really popular from a single program.\"","\"You have an early schedule tomorrow, so you need to rest early tonight,\" He Feng, sitting in the passenger seat, turned to tell Xie Xi. \"After finishing recording this show, you can ask Sister Wei for some time off.\"","\"We'll see.\"","In the blink of an eye, a week passed, and \"Star of Tomorrow\" aired its top three competition.","Unsurprisingly, the highlights of this episode focused on Xie Xi and that contestant. The editing deliberately juxtaposed the two, giving them plenty of screen time.","[I also thought that contestant was kind of weird. It's like he'd already lost before the competition even started.]","[This song really isn't that good. Even if you pick a slow song, don't pick this one. What was he thinking?]","[Damn, Xie Xi really dares to speak his mind. The contestant's tears were still welling up.]","[I think Xie Xi is right. I didn't feel any emotion from it at all. Am I deaf?]","[You can't really blame the contestant. The song itself isn't appealing; it's too ordinary.]","[They already said it's not about the song, and you're still talking about appeal? Good singing is what makes it appealing.]","[Easier said than done. If you have the skill, sing this song well yourself. No one could make this song appealing.]","Comments were flying from all sides, with some even starting to say Xie Xi was just putting on airs. The moment the contestant said he wanted to hear Xie Xi sing, the barrage exploded with exclamations.","[This kid has guts! Xie Xi is called the Siren for a reason. Crushing him would be a piece of cake, right?]","[Um, I think the contestant has a point. We always see the mentors being dissatisfied with this and that. At least give us, the audience, a demonstration.]","While the barrage was still arguing, Xie Xi had already picked up the mic.","[Ooooh! Xi Xi's moving, he's moving!]","[Ahhhhhhh! Is this what heavenly music sounds like?!]","[My mom asked me why I'm crying. I said I fell in love with a man.]","[Holy crap, this song can actually be sung like this? Is Xie Xi even human?]","After hearing Xie Xi's rendition, the contestant's earlier performance was instantly made to sound like a duck's harsh quacking, devoid of any gentle, melodic nuance.","[Xi Xi's killer gaze is here! Ahhhhhh, what kind of divine creature is this!!!]","It has to be said, with Xie Xi's talent on full display, even the gossip accounts couldn't find a way to hate. His earlier comments were perfect for stirring up drama, but after his performance, netizens had only one thought: Winning or losing really has nothing to do with the song, only with the person singing it.","\"Wuwuwu, Qiusuo, have you seen the latest episode of 'Star of Tomorrow'?! Our Zai Zai's singing was absolutely incredible!\" Rong Shiyun called from the other side of the planet. \"And that killer gaze! Without even realizing it, our Zai Zai has grown into such a charismatic man.\"","Professor Ye had the call on speakerphone while checking some materials. She could only grasp about a third of what Rong Shiyun was saying, something about Xie Xi being amazing.","\"That killer gaze GIF, I sent it to your WeChat. You have to look at our Zai Zai! Look right now!\"","Hearing Rong Shiyun's desperate, impassioned fangirling, Ye Qiusuo frowned and picked up her phone. She opened WeChat, and sure enough, there was a GIF: Xie Xi sat in a deep red mentor's chair, a white table in front of him, his fingers still resting on the mic clipped to his clothes. Suddenly, he looked up, his gaze meeting the camera.","For a split second, you'd think Xie Xi was looking right at you.","\"Well? Did you see it? Isn't it amazing?\" Rong Shiyun continued her frantic promotion.","Ye Qiusuo exited the chat and returned to the call screen. \"Are you very free lately?\"","She asked seriously. Normally, it was fine if Rong Shiyun didn't contact her for months. Recently, they'd been in touch a bit too frequently.","Rong Shiyun's voice seemed to be suddenly cut off. After a moment, it returned: \"Qiusuo, saying that hurts my feelings a little. There are no fellow fans here. Those foreigners only care about muscular men; seeing them is annoying. Besides, aren't you Teacher Xie Xi's professor? Can't I even talk to you about him?\"","\"That's not it,\" Ye Qiusuo said suddenly. \"Xie Xi has muscles too.\"","Rong Shiyun: \"???\"","\"Ah—\" A scream came from the other end of the line. \"How do YOU know our Zai Zai has muscles!!!\"","\"I just happened to see them, that's all.\" Professor Ye's voice was completely flat."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34","paragraphs":["On the other end of the phone, Rong Shiyun paused, swallowing: \"Qiusuo... how are the muscles on our baby? Are they nice?\"","She had been a fan of Xie Xi for years, yet hadn't seen a single shirtless photo of him. His team never accepted any revealing endorsements for him, and concerts were out of the question. Xie Xi could conquer everyone with just his voice, without any flashy stage antics.","\"You just said you disliked muscular men.\" Professor Ye pointed out her logical inconsistency.","\"Ah, I meant those with overly bulging muscles, the ones who look like monsters. That doesn't include my baby,\" Rong Shiyun declared solemnly before pressing on, \"You still haven't answered my question. When did you see them, where, and how many packs?\"","\"When I went to his place before. How many packs of what?\"","Rong Shiyun said coyly, \"You know, how many abs.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned: \"I don't know. I haven't seen them.\"","Rong Shiyun: \"?\"","\"He was wearing a jacket. You could see muscles on his arms,\" Professor Ye added.","That day when she visited Xie Xi at home, he was wearing a long-sleeved T-shirt. In the few seconds he raised his arms to put on his coat, Ye Qiusuo happened to see the thin fabric clinging to his arms, revealing their shape.","\"Oh, arm muscles.\" Rong Shiyun felt a little disappointed; she had thought it was somewhere else. \"Some fans analyzed our baby's figure before. It's definitely the lean type that looks slim in clothes but is toned and firm underneath.\"","Ye Qiusuo gave a noncommittal \"Hmm,\" showing little interest in the topic.","\"I've got to go,\" Rong Shiyun abruptly ended the conversation. \"I'll talk to you again in a while.\"","After the call ended, Ye Qiusuo stared at the screen for a moment.","...","\"Is everyone here?\" Ye Qiusu stood at the head of the round table, with other professors seated on either side. \"I believe you've all received the notice from the faculty.\"","The previous department head had been transferred, and Ye Qiusu was temporarily promoted. As the new department head, she was here to introduce herself.","\"I don't have much to say. Please continue with your teaching and research as usual. Additionally, I travel frequently on business. I recently secured a project in cooperation with the local government, so I likely won't be on campus much lately. If you have any issues, you can contact me by phone,\" Ye Qiusu said with a friendly smile.","\"In a little while, there's a skills and knowledge competition for the freshmen. According to past practice, their senior students guide them. However, this is Professor Ye's first year with students, so she doesn't have any seniors from the previous year. Should we assign some people to help guide her group?\" Professor Li, who had been at the university for over twenty years, was well-versed in the various rules.","Ye Qiusu pondered for a moment before saying, \"Professor Li, I've considered that as well. But I checked the students' teaching schedules this year. The senior students are already quite stretched guiding their own juniors; we can't afford to take up more of their time. Since these are Professor Ye's first students, why not let her guide them herself? It would be a good opportunity to bond with the students.\"","\"Alternatively, we could assign Professor Ye's students to join other groups,\" Professor Li suggested. \"Professor Ye has her own pile of projects. Moreover, this is a competition among students. Having a professor guide them directly might not be entirely fair.\"","\"They are competitors themselves. Having Professor Ye's students join other groups obviously isn't ideal,\" Ye Qiusu said, looking at Ye Qiusuo. \"Let's make an exception this time. Professor Ye can guide her own students.\"","\"Alright,\" Ye Qiusuo agreed.","After the meeting, Professor Li called out to Ye Qiusuo.","\"Professor Ye, with all the projects you're handling, no student assistants, and now having to guide freshmen, you should have declined just now,\" Professor Li advised earnestly. \"It's just a skills competition; it's not worth it.\"","There are different types of mentors. Those who want to climb the ladder handle administrative duties, travel frequently, attend meetings everywhere, collaborate on projects with local governments or companies, constantly initiate projects, and convert project outcomes, but often achieve little in pure research—similar to Ye Qiusu. Then there are young mentors who work hands-on, guiding students meticulously. Some of these will develop into leading figures, achieving great things in their professional fields.","Someone like Ye Qiusuo is destined to become a leading figure, or rather, she has already achieved recognition in the academic field. She might not have as many projects as other mentors, but each one carries significant weight.","Having walked this path herself and now nearing retirement, Professor Li had become more easygoing, but she couldn't stand seeing such a young mentor waste her time.","\"Professor Li, it's fine. I have a handle on it,\" Ye Qiusuo felt it was manageable, not a difficult task.","\"Well, you judge for yourself. Teach the students, but don't neglect your own work either.\"","\"I know.\"","Professor Li shook her head as she turned to leave. Professor Ye wasn't someone easy to deal with; she was highly competitive and adept at administrative matters. It was hard to say whether Professor Ye wouldn't receive 'special treatment.'","After returning, Ye Qiusuo adjusted her schedule, incorporating the student skills and knowledge competition, setting aside an extra afternoon each week to guide her students.","...","\"A sweet burden,\" Sun Jiajia said, holding a soldering iron and wearing a mask as she crouched on the floor, welding equipment they would need later.","\"What?\" Ding Hong turned his head from the computer to ask.","Sun Jiajia finished welding the last piece with a 'zizz' sound before removing her mask: \"I said our mentor guiding us lately is a sweet burden. Among all the graduate students in the department, we get the most guidance from our mentor. Some people don't see their mentor for ten days or half a month. I feel like we're taking up our mentor's time.\"","Ding Hong's fingers flew across the keyboard inputting data: \"Hmm.\"","\"Oh, I almost forgot you transferred from Professor Ye Qiusu's group. Her students rarely see her; they're mostly guided by senior students,\" Sun Jiajia mused, leaning on her mask. \"We are the first generation, the founding disciples.\"","\"Senior students don't teach everything completely,\" Ding Hong said, lowering his gaze. Everyone had to learn through trial and error. Expecting them to pass on all their skills—few did that. Most taught half and held back half. Not that one could blame them; everyone had come up that way.","As they were talking, Lin Lu knocked and came in, calling them to leave together: \"The mentor asked us to wait for her in the classroom.\"","Today, Ye Qiusuo primarily lectured her five students on how to search and apply literature, as well as techniques for publishing papers in core journals.","The students listened attentively. Ding Hong kept his head down, taking notes rapidly.","After about two hours, Ye Qiusuo finished. She checked the time and looked up: \"Lin Lu, did you drive to school today?\"","\"Professor, yes, I did,\" Lin Lu raised his hand.","Ye Qiusuo nodded: \"I'm treating everyone to dinner.\"","\"Wow!\" Sun Jiajia cheered, even blowing a kiss towards Ye Qiusuo. \"Professor, mwah!\"","Professor Ye's expression remained unchanged, though inwardly she wondered what language 'mwah' was from.","The group went to a restaurant at the top floor of the city's tallest building for dinner.","Ding Hong couldn't help but look around. He had thought it would just be an ordinary restaurant for dinner, not such a fancy place.","Reservations were needed for private rooms at this restaurant; otherwise, you could only sit at tables outside the rooms. Fortunately, when they arrived, there was still a table available right next to the floor-to-ceiling windows.","\"Professor, let's take a group photo,\" Sun Jiajia said, pulling out her phone.","\"Just the two of you? I want in too,\" Lin Lu immediately took out his own phone.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...Let's all take one together.\"","In the end, a passing waiter helped them take a group photo, with the neon lights outside as the backdrop and the entire city visible below.","\"Professor Ye?\"","Lu Minglang had just come out of a private room with a client and was heading downstairs when he unexpectedly spotted Ye Qiusuo.","\"Mr. Lu.\" Ye Qiusuo stood up to greet him.","\"These are...\" Lu Minglang's gaze swept over the five people. Professor Ye didn't seem like the type to go out for fun with peers.","Ye Qiusuo: \"My students.\"","Lu Minglang concealed his surprise and smiled lightly. \"Professor Ye, do you have time to visit the company sometime? The lab technicians seem to have many questions they'd like to ask you.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned. \"I left my contact number. They can reach me directly if needed.\"","For the project she was collaborating on with Lu Minglang, the personnel and lab facilities were provided by the Lu Group. She only supplied the ideas, general plans, and oversaw later stages. There was no need for her to visit frequently, especially since it was still in the early experimental phase with a lot of repetitive, mechanical work. Her presence wouldn't be useful.","\"Mr. Lu merely wishes to invite Professor Ye for a tour of the company, if you are willing.\" Dressed in a black suit under the dazzling lights, Lu Minglang stood with deep-set eyes and handsome features, speaking with a gentle, aristocratic courtesy reminiscent of an earl.","\"Whew—\" Sun Jiajia drew in a small, sharp breath, her eyes wide and unblinking, practically sparkling with hearts. She almost wanted to accept the invitation on her professor's behalf.","\"I don't have time at the moment. I'll visit once the project progresses further,\" Professor Ye stated matter-of-factly.","\"Very well.\" Lu Minglang showed no displeasure. He exchanged a few more words with Ye Qiusuo before leaving.","After he was gone, Sun Jiajia looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"Professor, is he your project partner?\"","\"One of the investors,\" Ye Qiusuo nodded.","\"He's so handsome...\" Sun Jiajia recalled Lu Minglang's face and those long legs, feeling like she might start drooling.","Beside her, Lin Lu covered his eyes, unable to bear watching. Whenever Sun Jiajia saw a handsome guy, she lost all control, even daring to discuss an investor's looks right in front of their professor.","Ye Qiusuo felt puzzled by her student's behavior. She asked, \"You said before that you liked Xie Xi.\" How could she immediately like someone else?","\"Professor, girls like her are particularly fickle. They can like lots of people,\" Lin Lu eagerly explained Sun Jiajia's star-chasing mentality. \"They switch favorites one after another.\"","Although Professor Ye was about the same age as these students, their social lives and communication weren't always smoothly aligned.","Like right now.","Ye Qiusuo couldn't quite understand what Lin Lu was saying. She looked at Sun Jiajia. \"If you like someone, you should be serious about it.\"","\"I am serious about liking Xi Xi! I might have a few other favorites, but Xi Xi will always be number one in my heart!\" Sun Jiajia hurriedly clarified in a 'playgirl' style.","The other students were quietly snickering.","Ye Qiusuo didn't really understand the feelings of Sun Jiajia or Rong Shiyun. In her eyes, people were only distinguished by whether their facial features and limbs were intact or not. Things like appearance seemed vague and intangible to her.","\"Professor, which company was that investor from? He looks very familiar,\" Lin Lu suddenly asked.","\"The Lu Group.\"","\"That Lu Group?!\" Lin Lu was shocked. No wonder he looked familiar. He'd seen him from afar before, but Lin Lu's family background wasn't at a level to interact with Lu Minglang.","\"Yes.\"","As the conversation flowed, the atmosphere became relaxed and harmonious, less formal.","Professor Ye listened quietly as her students enthusiastically shared amusing stories from campus life—experiences she herself had never had.","...","Before leaving, Ye Qiusuo went to pay the bill, only to be told it had already been settled.","\"Was it Mr. Lu?\" Ye Qiusuo asked the cashier for the name of the person who paid.","\"Yes, it was.\""]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35","paragraphs":["After the program recording ended, Ye Qiusuo thought the public would forget her and she could return to normal life, but that wasn't the case.","Because Li Kou had replaced their ads with the ones featuring the two new spokespersons, broadcasting them daily across major platforms.","Li Kou had received several sample tapes from the shoot and, after discussion, unanimously chose the version with skateboarding and music.","It must be said, Professor Ye skateboarding shattered the fixed image many viewers had of her, leaving them utterly astonished.","As soon as the ad aired, people within smaller circles immediately began asking everywhere: was this special effects or real? How did they ever think of having Professor Ye do such a thing?","【Is this Professor Ye?!】","【Wuwu, her legs are so long and straight.】","【Is that skateboarding trick real? Even an aerial flip? Are you sure it's not CGI?】","【A professional here: that's not CGI, she's really skating.】","【???Are you even leaving any room for us ordinary people?!】","【With such standard moves, I suspect Professor Ye is a pro.】","【If I drink Li Kou, can I become as skilled as Professor Ye?】","【Mom, I'm unfilial, I think I'm bending...】","【Is this the charm of the top golden talent? Love it, love it.】","【Going downstairs to buy a bottle to support our Suosuozi!】","...","No one could have predicted that a single advertisement could generate such massive discussion and heat. According to insider news, Li Kou sold out in supermarkets and convenience stores that very day, and their official website was overwhelmed, with netizens in the comments urging them to hurry up and release the new packaging.","As for Li Kou having two spokespersons this time, the public completely ignored the other; everyone only had eyes for Ye Qiusuo.","Late that night, Li Kou's headquarters immediately called an emergency meeting, demanding packaging manufacturers start producing the new design right away to capitalize on the peak sales period.","The reason Ye Qiusuo found out about this later was because during the Sunday summary session with her students, all five of them had a bottle of Li Kou drink with her face printed on it placed in front of them.","Ye Qiusuo picked one up to look at it. Seeing her own face on the drink bottle gave her a strangely eerie feeling.","\"Professor, you're so cool...\" Sun Jiajia whispered from behind, her eyes sparkling like stars.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at her: \"What?\"","\"Professor, do you really know how to skateboard?\" Once Ye Qiusuo looked at her, Sun Jiajia immediately straightened up and changed the topic.","The other students also stared intently at Ye Qiusuo. They were too curious. Their professor, someone engaged in academic research, really didn't seem the type to be into such a trendy sport, let alone be so good at it.","\"Yes.\" Ye Qiusuo put down the drink and nodded.","Lin Lu immediately raised his hand: \"Professor, when did you learn?\"","\"In university.\"","\"Professor, I can skateboard too! Let's go skating together someday!\" Lin Lu said excitedly.","\"I'll arrange a time with you when I'm free.\" Ye Qiusuo had been too busy the past couple of years to play much, but it remained her one and only hobby.","\"Wow, Professor, can we come watch then?\" Sun Jiajia asked, cupping her face.","Professor Ye thought: The students seem to be getting livelier and livelier.","...","Li Kou's advertising strategy had always been an overwhelming, blanket-style promotion: major TV stations, online platforms, LED screens—anywhere ads could be placed, they wouldn't miss it.","Just a few days after the ad aired, Xie Xi saw Ye Qiusuo's commercial on the giant screen of a skyscraper. It was even more stunning than seeing it live on set. The multi-angle camera cuts perfectly captured how she executed the aerial flip with her skateboard, and with the addition of slow motion, it almost had the visual impact of a blockbuster movie.","\"This ad has received high praise within the advertising industry. I heard the director's asking price has gone up,\" Wei Qi remarked casually, noticing Xie Xi watching the ad outside the car window.","Xie Xi, remembering the director's snobbish attitude at the beginning, snorted. \"This ad is popular because of Ye Qiusuo.\"","Wei Qi smiled. \"Professor Ye being able to do this is indeed very captivating.\"","If Professor Ye were a man, she'd probably have millions of girls swooning. But as it is now, it doesn't seem much different; reportedly, the number one spot on the 'most wanted to sleep with' ranking in the lesbian community had already been taken by Professor Ye.","\"Why isn't Zhang Dong back yet?\"","They were on their way back from a magazine cover shoot when Xie Xi suddenly asked the car to stop, telling Zhang Dong to go fetch something for him from the mall. The car had been idling outside for a while, and Zhang Dong still hadn't returned. Wei Qi looked around and said.","After waiting a few more minutes, Zhang Dong finally emerged, carrying a large box.","Wei Qi squinted to see: A skateboard? And it looked custom-made.","\"Brother Xi, got it.\" Zhang Dong stood outside asking, \"Put it in the trunk or?\"","\"Bring it in.\" Xie Xi took the box and placed it on his lap.","Wei Qi turned to ask Zhang Dong: \"What took so long?\"","\"It was a bit crowded inside. Lots of people were looking at skateboards,\" Zhang Dong hadn't expected it to be so packed. \"While I was waiting, I overheard people talking. Seems like they want to learn to skateboard like Professor Ye.\"","It was just like fans chasing stars, wanting to buy the same things as their idol.","Speaking of which... Zhang Dong turned to look at Xie Xi. Why did his Brother Xi order a skateboard?!","After returning, Xie Xi didn't rush to rest. Instead, he opened the box and took out the skateboard. He had ordered it custom after returning from the Dongheng studio last time. The pattern was his own design, using several bright colors, outlined with gold lines around the edges.","He squatted, looking at the skateboard for a long time, then reached out and touched a small corner on the bottom. There was a slightly uneven spot where he had asked the manufacturer to engrave his signature—very small, almost invisible.","Xie Xi wanted to give this skateboard to Ye Qiusuo.","However, Professor Ye had already sternly stated before that she would not accept any more gifts from him.","Mood instantly soured, the big star Xie Xi hugged the skateboard and sat on the sofa, not even interested in playing games anymore.","\"No, how come you don't understand when I tell you to substitute 2 into the equation?\" Zhang Dong, on the other end of the living room, was about to be driven mad by his little nephew. \"What did you even listen to in class? You just learned this formula a few days ago.\"","Xie Xi slowly turned his head to stare at Zhang Dong, suddenly struck by an idea.","As soon as Zhang Dong hung up the phone, he felt a chill run down his spine. He looked up to see Xie Xi staring at him and asked awkwardly, \"Brother Xi, was I disturbing you? My little nephew, just started middle school, just can't seem to grasp math.\"","\"Are there any more problems?\" Xie Xi suddenly asked.","\"?\"","\"Help me find a page of math problems. The harder, the better.\" Xie Xi stood up, increasingly convinced this was a brilliant idea. Seeing his assistant still looking at him, he added, \"They need to be middle school level problems.","...","The next day, Ye Qiusuo received a PDF file sent by Xie Xi. She opened it to find a page full of middle school math problems.","Just as she thought Xie Xi had sent it to the wrong person, he sent several voice messages.","\"Teacher, my little nephew sent me all these math problems, saying he doesn't know how to do them and wants me to teach him.\"","\"Teacher, you know my situation—I get dizzy just looking at words.\"","\"Could you help write out the answers, preferably with the reasoning process?\"","Xie Xi deliberately made the request very detailed, making it seem to an outsider like he was intentionally being difficult.","For Ye Qiusuo, doing these problems was equivalent to writing one plus one equals two—completely without difficulty.","\"When do you need it? Is tonight okay?\" Professor Ye asked.","\"Okay.\" Xie Xi deliberately crafted the impression that he was coming to her for help. After saying this, he didn't say anything else.","During the day, Ye Qiusuo had work to do. She differed from the average young professor—her academic achievements were notable, she led major projects, some of which had already been commercialized and had been on the market for years. In terms of connections within the circle, she was no less established than other professors in the department; she just didn't show it off normally.","The only similarity, perhaps, was that like other young professors, she wasn't very familiar with the political factions within the university, nor was she interested in knowing.","\"Professor Li mentioned today that according to past practice, the knowledge and skills competition includes a segment on operating experimental equipment. Pay extra attention to that,\" Ye Qiusuo said after consolidating the materials needed for several projects in her office, finally coming to the lab to check on her students.","\"Professor, we heard Tianqiu Tech has a newly built wind tunnel lab,\" several students exchanged glances before Lin Lu was pushed forward as the spokesperson.","\"Yes, it's underground,\" Ye Qiusuo looked at her students. \"Do you want to go?\"","All five students nodded immediately.","\"I'll find a time to take you there.\" Ye Qiusuo had a project experiment scheduled there anyway, so it was perfect to bring the students along.","\"Thank you, Professor!\" the students chorused.","Ye Qiusuo waved a hand dismissively. \"Have you encountered any problems these past few days?\"","The students brought up their questions one by one. Ding Hong had the most, even producing a notebook filled with his queries.","Ye Qiusuo took his notebook, flipped through it, and then began answering each question in detail.","It wasn't until 5 PM that Ye Qiusuo left the lab. She walked to the first-floor vending machine, originally intending to buy water, but spotted the newly packaged Likou beverage inside.","A strange feeling, hard to define as either awkward or pleased.","Professor Ye stood in front of the machine for a moment, then finally bought a bottle of water and the Likou drink.","In the evening, Ye Qiusuo spent half an hour completing the problems Xie Xi had sent over. She wrote out various solution methods for each problem, using clear logic and explanations for easier understanding.","The moment she sent it back, Xie Xi saw it immediately.","What was originally one page came back as seven.","The densely packed text made Xie Xi's head ache just from a glance.","Not knowing how much effort she had put into it, the superstar Xie felt a twinge of guilt.","But with the fabricated nephew already in play and the problems solved, Xie Xi could only press on.","\"My little nephew says he can understand it.\"","\"That's good if he can understand.\" Ye Qiusuo had already tried her best to avoid using knowledge beyond middle school level to solve the problems.","Xie Xi mentally prepared himself, then held down the voice message button: \"Teacher, my little nephew asked me to thank you on his behalf.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"Mhm.\"","Sending a gift now still seemed too abrupt. Xie Xi thought about it and decided to send the gift out in a couple of days.","This incident didn't leave a deep impression on Ye Qiusuo. She carried on as usual with her projects and guiding students.","On Sunday, Ye Qiusuo went to Xie Xi's residence for his tutoring session, or more precisely, to continue the visual cognition tests.","The moment Xie Xi heard the rhythmic three-doorbell chime, he knew it was Ye Qiusuo.","He turned off the game projected on the TV, stuffed the messy blankets on the sofa directly underneath it, then quickly walked to the foyer. Before opening the door, he took a quick glance at himself in the foyer mirror.","\"Teacher,\" Xie Xi now said the word naturally and smoothly.","\"A few more tests and we'll be done,\" Ye Qiusuo said as she entered.","She walked in and immediately laid out the test cards on the coffee table in front of the sofa, arranging them in a row.","When she turned around, she saw Xie Xi standing behind her holding a skateboard.","\"This...\" Xie Xi's eyes darted around as he handed the skateboard over. \"My little nephew saw your commercial on TV and insisted on giving you a skateboard as a gift for teaching him the problems.\"","Ye Qiusuo lowered her gaze to look at the skateboard in his hands. It was beautiful and solidly built."]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36","paragraphs":["\"This skateboard was picked out by my little nephew. If he comes over tomorrow and sees it still here, he might cry.\" Xie Xi added another reason.","When Ye Qiusuo met Xie Xi's eyes, all she could see was a clear, transparent gaze. She instinctively believed his words.","Just for doing one page of problems, Professor Ye couldn't accept a child's gift with a clear conscience.","Not having anticipated this situation beforehand, Ye Qiusuo naturally hadn't brought any return gift. She carefully searched her mind for anything of decent value she had on her, and finally turned to go back to her car to retrieve the limited-edition model car that decorated her dashboard.","Ye Qiusuo propped the skateboard beside the sofa and turned to leave. Xie Xi thought she had discovered his ulterior motive and that's why she suddenly departed.","Fortunately, Ye Qiusuo returned quickly, handing the model car in her hand to Xie Xi: \"Please give this to your nephew for me.\"","\"Alright.\" Xie Xi took the palm-sized model car, verbally agreeing while casually slipping it into his pocket.","This was his now!","With the gift exchange concluded, Ye Qiusuo had Xie Xi take a cognitive test.","This wasn't a simple task for Xie Xi. He often had trouble concentrating, his mind wandering as he looked things over, though he possessed wildly imaginative creativity in art and music.","A test originally scheduled to take one hour ended up taking two.","Ye Qiusuo silently adjusted her plans. She collected the cards: \"Next week I'll bring another set of test cards. After that, the lessons won't be necessary anymore.\"","Xie Xi: \"No more lessons?\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at Xie Xi with surprise, noticing he didn't seem happy. Based on his past behavior, he should have been delighted to hear this.","She explained: \"It was originally set to end next week, but we didn't finish one set of tests today, so I'll come over next week.\"","A feeling of frustration welled up in Xie Xi's heart. He had just started...","\"I'll head back now. I wish you a smooth recording for the show.\" Ye Qiusuo said earnestly.","This final episode of \"Tomorrow's Star\" would select the champion. In the original book, Lu Mingzhe took first place, but Xie Xi had said his singing wasn't as strong as the second and third place winners. Later, when the episode aired, netizens widely believed Xie Xi thought Lu Mingzhe was stronger than his younger self, hence the criticism.","It was a serious public opinion incident, but in the book, Xie Xi just let it develop.","Because... because of what?","Sitting in her car, Ye Qiusuo suddenly couldn't remember the reason.","She remembered something very important happened, leading to Xie Xi's reputation worsening later on.","Professor Ye drove all the way back, still unable to recall what had occurred.","Indeed, memories of this book seemed to fade over time. It also couldn't be ruled out that changes in the male and female leads' experiences were causing her memory of the story to disappear.","Ye Qiusuo sat in the living room thinking for a long time, finally finding a blank notebook. She wrote down all the plot points she currently remembered, using a character-decomposition cipher she had devised, incomprehensible to normal people.","After writing, she went over the original book's plot again, but still couldn't remember what happened that caused Xie Xi's career to decline later, eventually making him a stepping stone for Lu Mingzhe.","Thinking of Lu Mingzhe, Ye Qiusuo naturally thought of Wan Yurou. Since the program recording ended, she hadn't heard any news about Wan Yurou, nor had she appeared much on hot searches.","She didn't know what she was doing. Wan Yurou's trajectory seemed completely deviated from the original book.","Ye Qiusuo closed the notebook. She inexplicably hoped Xie Xi could also deviate from his path in the original book, staying at the pinnacle of the music scene all along.","...","The next morning, Ye Qiusuo obtained the visit passes for her students to Tianqiu Tech and took them there in the afternoon.","As before, Lin Lu drove their project group over; she brought two students.","\"Zai Zai went to shoot a magazine spread, wuwu, when will he show a little skin.\" Sun Jiajia whimpered in the back seat, clutching her phone. The greater her stress, the more she liked to browse Xie Xi's Weibo super-topic.","\"Show a little of what?\" Ding Hong didn't quite understand.","Sun Jiajia instantly stopped whimpering, a meaningful smile appearing on her face. She gestured to her upper body, pausing pointedly at the abdomen: \"Here.\"","Ding Hong: \"...\"","Sun Jiajia loved dragging Ding Hong into these discussions. She shook her head and sighed: \"His manager seems to have always rejected all magazine covers and endorsements that involve showing skin. I don't know if it's Zai Zai's own preference.\"","Hearing Sun Jiajia's words from the back seat, Ye Qiusuo glanced at the car's display screen showing the time. Something suddenly flashed in her mind. She hit the brakes: \"Ding Hong, Sun Jiajia, take a taxi to Tianqiu Tech. I'll call later and have a teacher from the lab meet you to take you in.\"","\"Professor, what about you?\" Sun Jiajia got out of the car, confused.","\"I have important business to handle. You go ahead.\" Ye Qiusuo picked up her phone, transferring a hundred yuan to Ding Hong via WeChat. \"Take Sun Jiajia by taxi to the company.\"","Ding Hong nodded: \"Professor, you go ahead.\"","Ye Qiusuo stepped on the accelerator and drove straight towards Huayun Entertainment Company. On the way, she contacted a friend at the wind tunnel lab today, asking him to come out and take the five students in for the visit.","\"Sun Jiajia, Lin Lu... Ding Hong, these are my students' names. Verify their ID cards against their visit passes before letting them in.\" Ye Qiusuo instructed.","After the other party hung up, Ye Qiusuo tried calling Sister Wei, but it kept showing no answer.","Ye Qiusuo frowned at the time on the display. If it followed the book, there should still be time.","She didn't stop dialing, calling continuously all the way. By the time she reached the entrance of Huayun Culture and Entertainment Company, Sister Wei's phone was still not going through.","The front desk receptionist on the first floor saw a stranger enter and immediately stepped forward to stop her, looking up and feeling she seemed somewhat familiar.","\"Are you Professor Ye?\"","Ye Qiusuo glanced at her, then stared at the elevator not far away. She said politely: \"Yes, I'm here to discuss contract matters with Sister Wei.\"","The receptionist looked at Professor Ye up close, feeling a bit dazzled, but a trace of reason remained in her eyes.","Professor Ye moved a bit closer to the receptionist and said softly: \"We might be colleagues in the future.\" With that, she gave her a polite smile.","The receptionist blushed, avoiding Ye Qiusuo's gaze, looking down at the smooth floor. When she looked up again, Professor Ye had already entered the elevator.","She felt a twinge of regret. If they were going to be colleagues, why didn't she stay and chat a bit longer?"]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37","paragraphs":["Standing inside the elevator, Ye Qiusuo looked at the flickering floor numbers, thinking about the things she had recalled.","Previously, her focus had been entirely on Xie Xi, and she had forgotten there was another person behind him.","For so many years, Xie Xi had remained at the top without facing widespread attacks. It wasn't that no one tried to smear him, but because the gold-medal agent Wei Qi was behind the scenes, manipulating things to minimize all negative impacts and never giving opponents any chance to amplify them.","There were too many people in the industry secretly watching Xie Xi, wanting to pull him down.","In the original book, on the day after the finals recording, which is today, something happened at Huayun Culture & Entertainment Company.","— Xie Xi's agent, Wei Qi, fell to her death.","The death of a non-celebrity couldn't generate much heat and was only mentioned in passing in the book. Yet, it led to Xie Xi being completely surrounded by public opinion when the finals aired the following week. Eventually, voices emerged saying it was his terrible temper and constant harassment of his agent that caused Wei Qi's depression and suicide.","Without Wei Qi's tough yet flexible methods for handling public opinion and scandals, Xie Xi immediately fell into a predicament. The agents who later replaced her lacked the ability to deal with so many underhanded schemes and manufactured scandals flying about. His resources began to decline steadily.","Given Xie Xi's talent, he could have simply released a new album to win back popularity and make the public forget those ambiguous scandals.","But Xie Xi didn't. He even went along with the wave of scandals and directly retired from the industry.","The book didn't detail the reason, but in a later chapter, to highlight the male lead Lu Mingzhe's 'kind' quality, it mentioned he discovered his new agent had some connection to Wei Qi's fall.","The day before, workers had been doing construction. They had placed a warning sign near the rooftop guardrail. This agent saw it, then turned and left, but accidentally knocked the sign over. She didn't pick it up. As a result, the next day when Wei Qi went to the rooftop to smoke, she leaned against the unstable guardrail and fell directly.","Lu Mingzhe comforted the agent, telling her not to blame herself, that it wasn't her fault.","From then on, the agent worked hard, striving to secure resources for Lu Mingzhe.","Ye Qiusuo had forgotten about this incident before. She only vaguely remembered Lu Mingzhe changing his original agent, and that agent later went on to manage another actor.","She pressed the button for the top floor. As soon as the elevator door opened, Ye Qiusuo headed towards the emergency staircase, looking up; there was still one more floor.","Ye Qiusuo quickly walked up to the rooftop and, sure enough, saw Wei Qi walking towards the guardrail, head down as she lit a cigarette.","\"Sister Wei.\" Ye Qiusuo called out to her, raising her voice.","Hearing someone call her from behind, Wei Qi turned around. Seeing it was Ye Qiusuo, she was taken aback. She looked around again, confirming it was the company rooftop and she wasn't hallucinating. \"Professor Ye, what brings you here?\"","Ye Qiusuo couldn't directly say the guardrail was about to collapse. She adopted her teacher's demeanor and said seriously, \"I wanted to discuss Xie Xi's situation.\"","It must be said that Xie Xi was a useful tool. The next second, Wei Qi stubbed out her cigarette and quickly walked over to Ye Qiusuo. \"Xi Xi, is he not cooperating with you? Professor, as I mentioned before, he gets dizzy looking at words, so could you possibly make an exception regarding the homework and such?\"","\"It's not about homework.\" Seeing Wei Qi move away from the guardrail, Ye Qiusuo felt a wave of relief. \"Xie Xi invested in my project. He only transferred the money; we haven't signed a contract yet.\"","\"Investment?\" Wei Qi was completely unaware.","\"Perhaps, Sister Wei, you can ask him about it later.\" After saying this, Ye Qiusuo glanced at her phone. \"Sorry, on my way here, I must have accidentally held down your number.\"","Wei Qi instinctively took out her own phone. Over twenty missed calls, all from Professor Ye.","\"Phones are prone to accidental touches. I've had that happen before with those old button phones too.\" Wei Qi didn't mind and smiled. \"I'll find time to ask Xi Xi about this matter.\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded, then looked at the floor to the right behind Wei Qi. \"It seems something fell over there.\"","Wei Qi followed her gaze and finally noticed the extra sign. \"This wasn't here yesterday.\"","As she spoke, she went over, picked up the sign, and wanted to see what it was. She then saw the warning on it: Guardrail unstable. Do not approach.","A chill ran down Wei Qi's spine. She had just been about to walk towards that guardrail. By her usual habit, she liked to come up here, lean on the guardrail, smoke, and clear her mind.","If Professor Ye hadn't come to call her just now, then...","\"If Professor Ye hadn't come today, I might have fallen.\" Wei Qi propped the sign up properly, feeling fortunate.","Seeing that sign, Ye Qiusuo knew she hadn't remembered wrong. Many things in this world were still developing according to the original book.","\"I must treat Professor Ye to a meal,\" Wei Qi said with a smile.","\"No need, I still have some matters to attend to. I'll take my leave first.\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded to Wei Qi and went downstairs.","Just as she stepped out of the elevator on the first floor, the receptionist called out softly, 'Professor Ye.' When Ye Qiusuo looked over, the receptionist immediately waved slightly, clearly excited.","Professor Ye: \"...\" She had already performed too much today.","Wei Qi came down from the rooftop and went directly to find the person in charge of managing and maintaining the building. She asked him why they hadn't added supports to the guardrail and only placed a sign there.","\"The workers came yesterday and told me they ran out of materials, so they couldn't put up a barrier. They temporarily put up a sign. The materials are already on the way today and will be installed shortly.\" Seeing Wei Qi's troubled expression, the person in charge asked if something had happened.","\"I almost fell.\" The more Wei Qi thought about it, the more frightened she became. If Professor Ye hadn't come looking for her today, she might have fallen.","\"Didn't you see the sign? We were planning to dismantle and rebuild that guardrail. It would collapse under a person's weight.\"","\"The sign was lying on the ground.\"","The person in charge frowned. \"I went up to check yesterday afternoon. The workers specifically placed it in a conspicuous spot out of the wind. How could it have fallen over for no reason?\"","\"Have someone guard the rooftop now, until the reinforcement is complete. I'm going to check the surveillance footage.\" Wei Qi felt something was off.","The gold-medal agent of Huayun Culture making a big deal about checking surveillance footage made some sensitive people smell something unusual. They began discussing privately about what had happened.","After Wei Qi finished reviewing and downloading the surveillance footage, even the company director was alarmed and came down specifically to ask her what was going on.","\"See for yourself.\" Wei Qi had the director sit down and played the exported footage for him.","There were three segments. One was from the afternoon, showing several people chatting and laughing by the guardrail. Then workers came to dismantle it and shooed the people to the other side.","Halfway through the dismantling, a worker made a phone call. After hanging up, he went downstairs, brought up a sign, and placed it near the dismantled guardrail. He also said something to those few people from the company.","After a while, the people who had been chatting earlier returned to their work area. By then, the warning sign was already in place.","\"This is?\" The director didn't quite understand.","\"Keep watching.\"","Wei Qi clicked on the next surveillance clip. It was already evening. Someone approached, holding another intact section of guardrail. Judging by their movements, they seemed to be shouting to let off steam, a common stress-relief method at the company.","None of that was the main issue. The key point was that as she left, she took a few extra steps and accidentally knocked over the warning sign.","That person glanced at the ground but showed no intention of picking it up, simply walking off the rooftop terrace directly.","The director watched the person leave: \"Is that Shi Ru? Her manners are rather poor.\"","Wei Qi didn't respond, instead opening the last segment of surveillance footage, which showed her walking towards the terrace earlier.","That section of guardrail was the best viewing platform, offering a direct view of the downtown landmark building and a distant look at the natural lake to the left. Many people who came up to the terrace liked to stand there, and Wei Qi also enjoyed leaning there to relax. If she couldn't be found in her office, she could usually be spotted on the terrace.","\"I just called and asked the worker from yesterday. He reminded those few people who came up not to let colleagues lean on the guardrail these next few days.\"","Those people belonged to different departments. Other departments had already notified all their members in group chats yesterday, but the talent agent department hadn't received any message.","Hua Yun's agents were often out on the road. Wei Qi had been out all day yesterday having meals with industry insiders, maintaining connections, and was completely unaware of this matter.","But Shi Ru knew she had been at the company all day and would definitely go up to the terrace when she went downstairs.","\"My conflict with Shi Ru isn't a new thing.\" Wei Qi reopened the second surveillance clip. \"There are plenty of good actors in the company. We can let them see whether Shi Ru knocked over that sign on purpose or not.\"","The director sighed. \"It's a good thing you didn't walk over. I'll call everyone in for a meeting later.\"","It was difficult to pin responsibility on Shi Ru for this incident. She knocked over the warning sign, but even if it was intentional, it couldn't be judged as attempted murder. However, the malicious intent was clear for everyone to see.","The final outcome was the company dismissing Shi Ru.","Perhaps out of a guilty conscience, Shi Ru left quietly without offering any rebuttal.","...","\"What project did you invest in for Professor Ye? She mentioned your contract hasn't been signed yet.\" Wei Qi went to Xie Xi's place that evening to ask him.","Xie Xi: \"A tech project.\"","Seeing he wasn't willing to elaborate, Wei Qi didn't press further, simply saying, \"Get the contract signed soon. Professor Ye came to the company specifically to talk to me about this today.\"","\"Why didn't she come directly to me?\" Xie Xi felt a twinge of dissatisfaction. He was the investor, not his agent.","\"Probably assumes all your contracts go through me.\" Wei Qi smiled. \"Thanks to Professor Ye coming over, otherwise you might not have seen me again.\"","Hearing the odd note in his agent's words, Xie Xi slowly sat up straight. \"What do you mean?\"","After listening to Wei Qi's account, Xie Xi frowned. \"Not reporting it to the police?\"","\"Reporting it wouldn't help. She only knocked over a warning sign. If I had fallen, it wouldn't have been because she pushed me.\" Wei Qi was actually quite unsettled inside. Anyone who had a brush with death wouldn't remain calm, but she had been masking it with work.","Wei Qi roughly outlined the arrangements for the second half of the year to Xie Xi.","Xie Xi listened attentively and, once she finished, said, \"Wei-jie, you should go back and rest first.\"","\"Alright, I really am tired.\"","After Wei Qi left, Xie Xi took out his phone and opened Ye Qiusuo's WeChat.","His notes usually weren't in text. For Ye Qiusuo, Xie Xi had entered a green leaf emoji and a female avatar wearing glasses in the note field, representing Teacher Ye.","This way, he wouldn't get dizzy looking at it and could still recognize who it was.","He held down the voice message button, then let go after a moment, suddenly not wanting to send a voice message. Perhaps text would seem more formal.","Xie Xi stared at WeChat for a long time before finally deciding to type it out character by character.","[Thank you for Wei-jie's matter.]","It took him several minutes to type this one sentence, mainly because he couldn't see clearly—the characters seemed to be dancing.","Ye Qiusuo was still in the underground wind-tunnel laboratory. Visitor passes were only issued for a single day. Exceeding that time would invalidate the ID card, and the next application would have to wait at least a month. This was a rule she had put in place when the company was first founded, intended to protect intellectual property and prevent outsiders from stealing research results.","\"Professor, can I give it a try?\" Lin Lu looked at a piece of equipment, eager to get hands-on.","\"No.\" Ye Qiusuo refused her student's request. \"Visitors cannot touch the instruments. If you want to operate these, you need to become an employee of Tianqiu Tech.\"","\"Then after graduation, can I apply to come here?\" Lin Lu was utterly envious of the abundance of experimental equipment inside Tianqiu Tech.","\"You can submit an application then.\"","It wasn't until 11:30 PM that Ye Qiusuo led her still-reluctant-to-leave students out. Exceeding midnight would deactivate the ID cards, and leaving afterward would trigger the alarm.","Only after sending the students back did Ye Qiusuo see the message from Xie Xi. She stared at the last character for a moment, turned off her phone, and did not reply to his message.","It was already past midnight. Replying now might disturb his rest.","Meanwhile, in the villa, the great star Xie, unable to sleep and getting up to check his phone in the middle of the night, hugged his completely silent phone. The white light illuminated his face, giving him a somewhat forlorn look.","The great star Xie tossed and turned in bed, finally opening Weibo and posting the photo he had taken earlier: [Disgusting. picture.jpg]","Although he posted in the middle of the night, fans who were still awake immediately saw it.","[Xixi, it's 3 AM! Why aren't you asleep?!]","[Zai Zai, what are you eating at this hour? You'll gain weight.]","[Awooo, I ate that today too. Rounded up, that means Zai Zai and I ate together~]","[I also thought it was disgusting, totally tasted like artificial sweetener.]","[Am I the only one who noticed Zai Zai is holding two?]","[Zai Zai is eating two by himself, one white and one colored. I ate like that the first time too.]","[Zai Zai changed cars? This one seems more ordinary, but that model car on top must be a limited edition. People were paying high prices for that a couple of years ago.]","[Zai Zai hasn't been active for so long. Besides the new album, we can only see him on \"Tomorrow's Star.\" Saturday's episode of \"Tomorrow's Star\" is the finale, boohoo.]","Although it took a while to fully read the fans' comments, Xie Xi felt comforted watching the comment count rise within a minute. It seemed someone was replying to him instantly after all.","...","When Xie Xi woke up, he discovered Ye Qiusuo had replied to him, timestamped at exactly 7:00 AM.","And it was three voice messages!","The slight awkwardness in Xie Xi's heart dissipated a bit. He decided to delete the Weibo post from early morning later. Actually, it was okay, just a bit too sweet.","\"You're welcome.\"","\"You made a typo in the last character. You can send a voice message and convert it to text. No need to type. Didn't you say looking at characters makes you dizzy?\"","\"I will expedite the project conversion. Once it's done, you can simply wear the glasses and see the same characters as we do.\"","Professor Ye spoke like an all-business robot, devoid of any emotion.","After listening to these three voice messages, Xie Xi decided not to delete that early morning Weibo post after all.","...","On Thursday morning, Ye Qiusuo received a notification that Tianqiu Tech required shareholders to attend a voting meeting in the afternoon.","That afternoon, Ye Qiusuo drove to Tianqiu Tech.","She arrived half an hour early, but by the time she entered, the shareholders were mostly already assembled. She could even hear the murmur of conversation before pushing the door open.","\"Qiusuo, sit here.\" Zhang Chengjue gestured for her to take the seat at the front right. \"Professor, you may begin.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked toward the person walking to the head of the conference table—an unfamiliar face she hadn't seen before.","\"The company previously invested a sum to initiate the Therapeutic Mushroom project, which has now achieved excellent results. The next step requires another round of funding for market expansion.\" That professor's actual capabilities were unknown, but he was certainly a smooth talker.","After he finished presenting the proposal, the shareholder vote began.","Including Zhang Chengjue and Ye Qiusuo, there were five shareholders in total. Ye Qiusuo voted against, one abstained, and the rest agreed.","With the majority against one, the Therapeutic Mushroom project secured its second round of investment.","Before leaving, Zhang Chengjue called out to Ye Qiusuo. \"Qiusuo, there's something I'd like to discuss with you.\"","\"What is it?\" Ye Qiusuo looked at him calmly.","\"Well, recently, someone reported that you frequently bring students here for visits, saying you disregard the regulations. We...\"","Ye Qiusuo interrupted him. \"Twice. I've only brought them here twice, and every procedure strictly followed the regulations.\"","Zhang Chengjue smiled helplessly. \"I know you're not that kind of person. I've already reprimanded the individual who made the report.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't acknowledge his remark. \"The person earlier is not a member of the Therapeutic Mushroom project team.\"","\"You mean Professor Zhao? He joined recently. He's one of the fifty talents recruited last year under the company's talent plan.\"","So that's how the talent plan was being used.","Ye Qiusuo's expression suddenly cooled. She looked at Zhang Chengjue. \"I have other matters to attend to. I'll be leaving now.\"","In just one year, Ye Qiusuo had been subtly sidelined without even realizing it. With five shareholders, as long as two sided with Zhang Chengjue, her vote became insignificant.","Ye Qiusuo walked onto the glass sky bridge, looking down at the logo on the main entrance. This company contained so much of her heart and soul.","After a long moment, she withdrew her gaze and headed toward her own laboratory.","...","She continued coming to the company as usual, conducting experiments according to plan. Ye Qiusuo still followed her own schedule methodically every day, until one day when her project's progress was consistently delayed. She went to the top floor to find Zhang Chengjue.","\"Access denied. Current permissions invalid.\"","This phrase repeated from the gate alarm as Ye Qiusuo swiped her card several times.","Soon, security guards from the other side came running over to see who was trying to force entry.","\"This area is off-limits to you. Which floor are you from? Hand over your ID card.\" Several guards stared at Ye Qiusuo, demanding she surrender her ID.","Ye Qiusuo looked at the unfamiliar faces of the guards and said expressionlessly, \"I'm looking for Zhang Chengjue.\"","\"What's everyone gathered here for?\" Zhang Chengjue's assistant approached from the side.","\"Assistant Zhao, this person has been lingering here.\"","\"This is Professor Ye. All of you, step aside.\" Zhao Guiyin used his own ID card to open the gate and let Ye Qiusuo in.","Ye Qiusuo watched as the guards simply let her pass and lowered her eyes.","\"Professor Ye, are you here to see CEO Zhang?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I'll take you to him.\"","\"Why has the security on this floor been replaced?\" Ye Qiusuo asked him.","\"CEO Zhang said the previous ones were slacking off, so they were replaced.\"","Ye Qiusuo asked no further questions and followed the assistant inside. Zhang Chengjue sat in his office, his back to them, gazing at the view outside the floor-to-ceiling windows, seemingly completely unaware that anyone had entered."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38","paragraphs":["They had originally planned to assign that floor as an office for him and Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo, finding it a waste of time to go all the way to the top floor, declined. Instead, she chose an office on a lower level for easier access to the various labs.","Now, there was only one office on the top floor, belonging to Zhang Chengjue.","Ye Qiusuo's gaze fell on his desk, where a brand new golden ID card lay. The access permissions at the gate must now require this card.","\"President Zhang, Professor Ye is here,\" Assistant Zhao proactively announced.","Only then did Zhang Chengjue swivel his chair around. He looked at Ye Qiusuo, suddenly stood up, and put on an apologetic expression. \"Qiusuo, what brings you here? Oh, my memory. My ID card broke not long ago, so I had to get a new one. I forgot to tell you.\"","Ye Qiusuo gave a noncommittal \"Hmm.\" \"I need you to approve the documents I had sent over earlier. I'll need them tomorrow.\"","\"Documents? For something like this, you could just call. No need to come up. Didn't you used to say that yourself?\" He said, rummaging through the thick stack of papers on his desk, finally finding Ye Qiusuo's documents at the very bottom. \"I'll approve them for you right now.\"","Ye Qiusuo watched as Zhang Chengjue finished signing and handed the documents over.","\"Qiusuo, next time just call. I'll have Xiao Zhao bring them down for you. It'll save you time,\" Zhang Chengjue said with a smile, putting on a show of consideration for her.","Ye Qiusuo stared at Zhang Chengjue for a long moment, waiting until the smile on his face was about to falter, before reaching out to take the documents and turning to leave.","\"Why did you let her in?\" Zhang Chengjue asked Zhao Guiyin with a darkened expression.","\"I thought Professor Ye had something urgent,\" Zhao Guiyin explained, lowering his head.","\"Next time she wants to come in, make her wait half an hour.\"","\"But...\"","\"No buts.\"","Zhang Chengjue was practically hoping Ye Qiusuo would make a scene now. The company's shares were currently divided. At most, she only held 24%. He held the same amount, but the other two shareholders together had 35%. Once he won them over, he would hold the greatest internal authority.","The prospects for Tianqiu Company were too good. Having sat in this position for just a few years, Zhang Chengjue never wanted to step down. The outside world knew him, Zhang Chengjue. As for Ye Qiusuo... she was just someone who could get her name on project papers.","They were a company, businesspeople. What did a researcher need with so much power?","Zhang Chengjue wasn't afraid of Ye Qiusuo taking new projects to other companies either. Currently, Tianqiu Tech had the best experimental environment and the most complete equipment in the country, which continuously attracted countless researchers.","Of course, Tianqiu Tech owed its current scale to Ye Qiusuo, who had liaised with various parties back in the day to secure such comprehensive equipment.","Zhang Chengjue wasn't afraid of Ye Qiusuo leaving. Even if she started her own venture, she could never build another Tianqiu Tech.","The favors Ye Qiusuo had called in back then were all used up. There was no possibility of building a lab better than Tianqiu Tech's.","There was another reason for Zhang Chengjue's audacity: Ye Qiusuo seemed to have run out of good projects.","Since last year's medical watch, her projects had all had an air of fantasy about them. Many of the newly recruited, capable researchers thought her ideas were pie-in-the-sky, baseless, and that she was just recklessly burning through money, relying on the company's success.","Zhang Chengjue had heard that scholars generally stopped making significant contributions after forty, with achievements mostly coming from their youth. But he hadn't expected Ye Qiusuo's inspiration to dry up so quickly; otherwise, they could have remained harmonious for a few more years.","He was a businessman. Chasing profit was in his nature.","...","Ye Qiusuo left very calmly. She had sensed earlier that Zhang Chengjue had changed, though the speed was still unexpected. At the recent shareholders' meeting, those two other shareholders were likely Zhang Chengjue's people now.","Starting the company together hadn't been smooth sailing. To raise funds quickly, they had brought in another shareholder. Later, to attract researchers, both Ye Qiusuo and Zhang Chengjue gave up one percent of their shares each, distributing them among the researchers. As the company's projects expanded further, the two shareholders from the meeting were introduced by Zhang Chengjue.","Ye Qiusuo suddenly smiled, though her eyes held no mirth.","As usual, she finished her experiments at Tianqiu Tech before leaving. However, she didn't go straight home but went to a research institute instead.","\"I'm looking for Dr. Zeng.\"","The small institute wasn't big on formalities. Someone passing by called out, and Zeng Liqing came out.","\"Professor Ye?\" Zeng Liqing was surprised to see her. \"What brings you here?\"","\"I want to know why you resigned, Dr. Zeng,\" Ye Qiusuo got straight to the point.","Zeng Liqing's expression was complicated. \"Researchers resigning is normal. I just had some friction with others that affected the project progress.\"","\"What kind of friction?\"","Zeng Liqing studied Ye Qiusuo carefully before sighing. \"I believed the therapeutic mushroom was being pushed to market too quickly. While experiments had cleared its toxins, there were still side effects—it could cause severe hallucinations. It wasn't suitable for mass production and release.\"","\"But the hallucinations aren't harmful to the human body.\"","\"Yes,\" Zeng Liqing agreed. \"So the company considered this side effect negligible. But once on the market, who knows what the consequences might be.\"","\"So it's a therapeutic mushroom. Patients can only consume it in hospitals, under supervision,\" Ye Qiusuo stated the strategy discussed at the meeting to address such concerns.","\"Did Professor Ye come today to tell me this?\" Zeng Liqing had resigned simply because he felt the company was becoming too aggressive and might run into trouble in the future, so he left early, even though the project was originally his idea.","Ye Qiusuo looked around the biological research institute. \"Dr. Zeng, this place isn't suitable for you. Tianqiu Tech has the best experimental equipment in the country.\"","\"Did Professor Ye come to persuade me to return?\" Zeng Liqing didn't think an ordinary doctor like him was worth Ye Qiusuo's time to personally recruit back.","Ye Qiusuo shook her head. \"Not today. I'll come find you again later, Dr. Zeng.\"","...","On Saturday, Ye Qiusuo, unusually, did not continue working. Instead, she turned on Gaoxing Channel 2 to watch the grand finale of \"Star of Tomorrow.\"","However, shortly after turning it on, the TV displayed a message about cable area maintenance, stating it would be unavailable for another five hours.","Ye Qiusuo had to watch on her phone, but she wasn't a member. After five minutes, she was forced to pay for a subscription.","By the time she finished paying and started watching again, the number of bullet comments had multiplied. Professor Ye watched \"Star of Tomorrow,\" wondering if after this episode aired, Xie Xi would still suffer the same fate as in the original story.","[Hahahaha, Xi Xi really doesn't hold back when he speaks.]","[I think Lu Mingzhe's win is really strange. Xi Xi wasn't wrong; it's already pretty good that Lu made it to the top three.]","[Could Lu Mingzhe really have gotten the underdog script?]","[I heard from a friend in the industry that Lu Mingzhe is a super-rich second generation, his family is loaded. This show is basically to promote him.]","[This is hilarious, only Xie Xi has so many water army fans. His temper is so bad, his words so harsh, and you all still kiss up to him. Unbelievable.]","[Lu Mingzhe's talent is obvious to all. Even the other contestants see him as a strong rival. If he had no skill, why would anyone mention him?]","[Could it be that Xie Xi is afraid Lu Mingzhe will steal his spotlight in the future, so he keeps putting him down?]","[Don't you know Xie Xi has done this before? He's been extremely harsh towards juniors.]","...","Ye Qiusuo watched the barrage comments and saw the trend beginning to emerge. After finishing the show and clicking into the hot search, there was already a topic about Xie Xi waiting for everyone to discuss.","\"Xie Xi Suppresses Lu Mingzhe\"","Clicking in, one could see someone had edited together all the things Xie Xi said to Lu Mingzhe and his looks during \"Tomorrow's Star.\" In a short five-minute video, it fully 'demonstrated' how Xie Xi suppressed Lu Mingzhe and the disdainful looks he gave him.","[Holy crap, is Xie Xi really like this? I thought he was just a bit bad-tempered.]","[No way, no way, has everyone already forgotten how a junior from the same company was suppressed so badly back then that he left the company in obscurity?]","[Xie Xi just relies on his good singing to cover up all his flaws.]","[Lu Mingzhe is really pitiful, constantly torn apart by Xie Xi's words, yet he still has to smile and thank the mentor for his guidance. So tragic.]","[Lu Mingzhe truly deserves the championship. Thankfully, the other mentors and the audience had good judgment and didn't let him be wronged.]","...","Online comments are always like this. As soon as someone points out one thing, netizens quickly blow it out of proportion and start playing the 'justice warrior.'","Ye Qiusuo scrolled through the various comments and old videos below and, unsurprisingly, found this to be a premeditated manipulation of public opinion.","But unlike in the original story, half an hour later, the entire direction of public opinion had completely shifted.","Because Wei Qi had stepped in."]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39","paragraphs":["That widely circulated five-minute video was reposted on Xie Xi's studio's Weibo account. This time, however, it contained some slight alterations. The so-called disdainful glances and body language towards Lu Mingzhe in the original video were actually an illusion created by someone intentionally slowing down the footage several times over.","[Our studio has discovered that this video contains distortions, exaggerations, and false rumors, which have severely impacted Mr. Xie Xi. We will pursue legal action and will not tolerate such behavior.]","Within just half an hour, Xie Xi's team not only identified all the problematic parts in the video but also systematically debunked every point netizens had used to attack Xie Xi.","The alleged suppression of Lu Mingzhe was, in fact, just Xie Xi being serious and responsible.","Wei Qi had someone release the fan-recorded footage from when Xie Xi angrily left the competition venue after a dispute with the director. She had obtained this video long ago but kept it under wraps—first, to avoid offending the production team initially, and second, as a precaution for a situation like today.","Before posting this video, Wei Qi specifically contacted the production team, hoping they would help clarify matters. However, the production team, clearly eager for higher ratings, merely gave a difficult excuse, saying there was nothing they could do.","At that point, Wei Qi had no more reservations.","The fan's on-site recording was obviously not as high-definition as the professionally edited five-minute video, but everything that needed to be seen was visible, and Wei Qi had someone amplify the audio.","In the video, three judges were sitting together, preparing to vote for a contestant. Xie Xi, in the middle, suddenly turned to look off-stage, took off his earphone, and asked, \"Am I the judge, or are you? You've been telling me to vote for Lu Mingzhe since the last round, and you're doing it again now?\"","The voice was very clear. The recorder immediately zoomed in the lens, focusing on the director off-stage. In the video, the director's embarrassment was obvious to anyone—his face flushed red, clearly not expecting Xie Xi to call it out directly.","The director hurried onto the stage and said something to Xie Xi, even trying to cover the microphone. In response, Xie Xi simply shrugged him off and left the venue alone, so quickly that even his assistant didn't have time to react.","The person recording happened to be near the exit. Xie Xi walked closer and closer to the camera, his face cold and stern, clearly extremely displeased.","[Holy crap, what is this? I always said Lu Mingzhe's underdog champion win seemed too easy. So there really was a script?]","[Inside job? Is the production team that shameless?]","[So Lu Mingzhe's smooth journey and praise from other judges were because he has connections?]","[Lu Mingzhe signed with New... not important a long time ago.]","[Not Important doesn't mean he doesn't want it. I'm suddenly starting to suspect who released that maliciously edited video today.]","Someone must be behind this, pushing a narrative and systematically smearing Xie Xi.","To overturn public opinion, you need to create news even more explosive than before. Now, all fingers were pointing at the production team's behind-the-scenes manipulation, and people had started questioning the authenticity of Lu Mingzhe's championship.","Xie Xi was cleanly extracted from the controversy, becoming the victim instead.","Ye Qiusuo was scrolling through Weibo when she came across this video. Watching Xie Xi in it, she found him somewhat unfamiliar—completely different from the person she usually saw. In the video he appeared as a handsome, mature man, upholding the core principles of his field.","\"How did a video like this get leaked?\" Half an hour earlier, Lu Mingzhe had been happily scrolling through various updates, watching the buzz around his discussion skyrocket, only for things to suddenly take a sharp turn for the worse. \"Weren't the audience's phones collected when they entered?\"","\"Can't rule out someone bringing two phones,\" Jiang Jingyuan said, as if he had anticipated this. \"With Wei Qi there, you shouldn't have dragged Xie Xi into this.\"","From the start, Jiang Jingyuan had advised that for tonight's Championship Night they should focus solely on the champion. Yet Lu Mingzhe thought he could bring Xie Xi down.","\"Are you my agent (manager) or not?\" A trace of impatience flashed in Lu Mingzhe's eyes. \"We're both agents. Are you inferior to Wei Qi?\"","Jiang Jingyuan, however, nodded in acknowledgment. \"I really am not as good as her. I still have more to learn.\"","Lu Mingzhe stared at him for a long moment, then suddenly laughed. \"Brother Jiang, do you have a problem with me? You always oppose me, praising Xie Xi's side. People who don't know might think you're their agent.\"","\"I'm just making judgments based on facts.\" Jiang Jingyuan considered himself a good agent, capable and shrewd. But compared to Wei Qi, that seasoned veteran—an old fox who had been in the industry for years—he still fell somewhat short.","\"Brother Jiang, go back and rest for now. Let others handle suppressing this matter.\" Lu Mingzhe stood up and left without giving Jiang Jingyuan another glance.","The door opened and closed, finally falling silent. After a long while, Jiang Jingyuan sighed.","The next day, the tide of public opinion shifted slightly again, suggesting that someone behind the scenes was targeting both Xie Xi and Lu Mingzhe, making them both innocent victims.","Simultaneously, Jiang Jingyuan was no longer assigned to Lu Mingzhe. The company stripped him of all the artists under his management.","Jiang Jingyuan simply submitted his resignation. The company approved it extremely quickly, as if they had been waiting for it.","It was unclear who the company had brought in internally; they were completely indifferent to his departure.","At noon, Jiang Jingyuan finished packing his things, walked out of the company, took one last look at the building's signboard, and finally left carrying his belongings. His face showed no trace of despondency, as if he had seen it coming all along.","...","\"Professor Ye, those students of yours are quite something.\" In the office corridor, Professor Li and Ye Qiusuo stepped out for some fresh air. Standing together, they looked down at the green belt below.","\"Students?\"","\"Yesterday the Dean happened to pass by and casually asked them how they were doing at school and whether they had any questions he could answer,\" Professor Li smiled. \"You know, the Dean actually came up through our department. Your students started firing off a bunch of subject-related questions, leaving the Dean stunned right there on the spot.\"","The Dean had been in administration for many years and hadn't taught in a long time, so his knowledge was basically rusty.","That day, the Dean maintained his composure on the surface, but everyone around him was extremely embarrassed. Department Head Ye Qiusu looked at the students and told them they needed to learn more about renqing shigu (the ways of the world/social graces), and not be like clueless idiots who bring up awkward topics.","The Dean stopped the Department Head, telling her not to say more. It was due to his own rustiness in his field, and he continued conversing with the students.","Ordinary students would have either stammered or fallen silent at that point. But these students immediately picked up the topic of conversation, steering it in other directions—talking about campus life and future plans. This was something the Dean knew all too well and could talk about at length.","\"Those students are all quite good. Sun Jiajia and Lin Lu, right?\"","\"Mm.\" Ye Qiusuo responded, her gaze falling on a certain tree. There was a furtive shadow there. Looking more closely, the person had long limbs and looked very familiar.","After a moment.","Ye Qiusuo spoke up: \"Professor Li, I'm going to buy something.\"","Go ahead. I just happen to need to finish writing my paper anyway.","After Professor Li went inside, Ye Qiusuo went downstairs and walked over to the tree. \"Xie Xi.\"","The furtive figure emerged from behind the tree trunk, bundled up tightly with only his eyes showing. He pulled out a stack of documents. \"Our contract.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at Xie Xi, who was already starting to attract the attention of passersby. \"Let's go upstairs first.\"","Xie Xi followed her into the office before finally taking off his mask and glasses, revealing a handsome face.","Ye Qiusuo glanced at him, finding no difference from usual. It seemed the public opinion incident from the other day hadn't affected him much.","As long as Wei Qi was around, she could shield Xie Xi from the majority of malicious attacks and slander.","\"The contract.\"","Xie Xi handed the contract in his hand to Ye Qiusuo: \"Sister Wei has already looked it over. She said it's fine like this.\"","The dense text was enough to give anyone a headache, let alone Xie Xi. He had barely read it; Wei Qi had handled all the vetting.","\"Mhm.\" Ye Qiusuo took it and read quickly. Flipping through at that speed, an ordinary person would only get the gist, but she managed to read every single clause.","After reviewing all the terms, Ye Qiusuo signed her name on the contract. Xie Xi's signature and personal seal were already on the other side.","\"Are we partners now?\" he asked seriously after she finished signing.","\"Yes.\" Ye Qiusuo kept one copy for herself and handed the others back to Xie Xi. \"You are one of my partners.\"","One of?","Xie Xi felt a subtle sense of being one among many.","He was just a small wave in the ocean.","\"Professor...\" Xie Xi cleared his throat, \"Actually, I have quite a bit of money.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up at him, not understanding what he meant.","\"If there are more projects in the future, I can continue to invest.\"","\"We'll talk about future matters in the future.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't have many thoughts on the subject.","\"Oh.\" Xie Xi felt dejected.","He stood by the office desk, looking at the small potted cactus. Unable to resist, he picked up the small watering can beside it, intending to water it.","Ye Qiusuo reached out and grasped his wrist. The warm touch made both of them pause for a moment.","She quickly withdrew her hand: \"I already watered it today. Watering it again will cause the roots to rot easily.\"","The big star Xie felt awkward, so he firmly refused to admit he had wanted to water it: \"I just wanted to look at the watering can.\"","They stood facing each other in silence for a while before Professor Ye spoke first: \"Do you have anything else?\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","\"Go back early. Don't wander around outside. Things like contracts can be delivered by your assistant in the future.\" Professor Ye, thinking about how Xie Xi might fall into an abyss like in the book, always felt she should pull him back if she could. Her tone carried a hint of lecturing.","Fortunately, Xie Xi wasn't annoyed by her lecturing.","His attention was caught by the 'in the future' in Ye Qiusuo's words.","Did that mean they would have opportunities to cooperate again?","Xie Xi was pleased.","\"I'll leave first.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Ye Qiusuo followed him out, standing by the corridor railing and looking down below until Xie Xi appeared downstairs and slowly walked away.","It was strange.","In the original book, the two of them had no intersection at all; now, however, they had become acquainted and were even collaborating on a project.","This meant the plot of the original book had deviated significantly.","It was just unclear how things were progressing with the male and female leads.","...","The original novel's plot had indeed changed considerably because of Ye Qiusuo's intervention, especially where Wan Yurou was concerned. In the book, she had skyrocketed to fame by leveraging the \"Knowledge Q&A\" feature, but now it was Ye Qiusuo who became famous while she was forced into the background. Even the endorsement deal with Likou that she had worked so hard to secure only ended up drawing netizens' attention to Ye Qiusuo.","To this day, Wan Yurou was still lingering around the second- or third-tier level, with no standout works to her name.","\"What are you doing?\" Mo Hong came over with a new role and found Wan Yurou dressing up, preparing to go out in full attire.","\"I have a dinner appointment with Mingzhe.\" Wan Yurou smiled lightly at her reflection in the mirror. \"I might be back late, or perhaps not at all.\"","Mo Hong placed the role script on Wan Yurou's dressing table: \"The second young master of the Lu family? It's good you know him. That last banquet wasn't for nothing.\"","Why bring up that banquet of all things?","Wan Yurou thought of Xie Xi's devilishly handsome face. Her hand paused, and she almost cursed."]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40","paragraphs":["Wan Yurou wore a black dress today, with heavy makeup, black hair and red lips, looking stunningly beautiful. It couldn't help but catch the eye of Lu Mingzhe, who was sitting at the table.","\"This is for you.\" Wan Yurou took a gift from her bag and pushed it towards Lu Mingzhe.","\"What's this?\" Lu Mingzhe raised an eyebrow slightly.","\"Congratulations on winning the grand championship of 'Tomorrow's Star'.\" Wan Yurou struck the perfect tone, neither overly intimate nor distant.","Lu Mingzhe felt a great surge of vanity. He picked up the gift box: \"May I open it?\"","Wan Yurou nodded, then picked up the teacup beside her, holding it gently and taking a small sip.","Lu Mingzhe opened it to find a silver-blue tie.","\"I watched the live broadcast of the grand championship night,\" Wan Yurou put down her teacup and looked at Lu Mingzhe across the table. \"I always felt the tie you wore on stage was a bit plain. I happened to see this one and thought it suited you.\"","She spoke openly and frankly, not as if she were deliberately giving a tie to create an ambiguous atmosphere.","Lu Mingzhe was very much taken by this approach.","He didn't like those who threw themselves at him, nor would he pay attention to those who were overly cold. Someone like Wan Yurou... was rather interesting.","The two exchanged a glance, sharing an unspoken understanding, with an ambiguous tension lingering in the air around them.","Just then, a waiter passing by with a water glass suddenly stumbled, falling to the side. The tray in his hand slipped, threatening to spill its contents all over Wan Yurou.","\"Be careful.\"","Ye Qiusuo steadied the waiter with one hand and caught the tray with the other.","The waiter's face turned deathly pale, his hands trembling.","Wan Yurou beside them was startled. If that tray hadn't been caught, all the water would have spilled on her.","Ye Qiusuo helped the waiter sit down at a nearby seat: \"Low blood sugar?\"","The waiter nodded weakly, his face pale, unable to even speak.","Fortunately, there were sugar cubes on the table. Ye Qiusuo took one and gave it to him. The waiter held the sugar in his mouth and gradually stopped trembling so much.","The manager, having heard the commotion, came over. He first apologized to the customers, then helped the waiter leave.","Only then did Ye Qiusuo turn and head to the other side. Lu Minglang had arranged to meet her here.","\"The service quality here is getting worse and worse,\" Lu Mingzhe said displeasedly. He looked at Wan Yurou, \"Are you alright?\"","Wan Yurou shook her head: \"Just a bit startled, that's all.\"","\"Was that Professor Ye, the one you recorded the show with?\" Lu Mingzhe asked.","\"...Yes. I wonder why she's here.\" Wan Yurou glanced in the direction Ye Qiusuo had gone. That area seemed to be private rooms, which were hard to book.","A minor interruption, Lu Mingzhe didn't dwell on it. The two sat by the window and continued their previous conversation.","Ye Qiusuo turned into the corridor leading to the private rooms. Halfway there, she suddenly remembered she had ruined Wan Yurou and Lu Mingzhe's romantic opportunity.","In the original book, there was a scene where Wan Yurou, dressed beautifully in a black dress, was having a meal with Lu Mingzhe at a restaurant. A waiter accidentally spilled water on Wan Yurou. In the end, Lu Mingzhe took off his suit jacket and draped it over Wan Yurou, taking her to his home. Their feelings for each other rapidly intensified from then on.","It was just that when she passed through the walkway earlier, she hadn't seen the two of them. She only saw the waiter about to fall and quickly stepped forward to help.","Professor Ye felt a twinge of guilt.","\"Professor Ye?\" Lu Minglang, seeing Ye Qiusuo distracted since she entered, couldn't help but call out.","\"Apologies.\" Ye Qiusuo snapped back to attention. She looked at the young man across from her and seriously discussed the progress of their project.","Lu Minglang lowered his gaze, his fingertips tracing the teacup. Ye Qiusuo was actually a simple person, thoroughly a researcher's style—firm, straightforward, not one for devious thoughts, and not overly focused on profit.","After all the project details were discussed, Lu Minglang looked at Ye Qiusuo: \"Tianqiu Tech... has been making quite a splash recently. CEO Zhang seems somewhat dissatisfied with you, Professor Ye, and is actively recruiting new researchers from outside.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up: \"What are you trying to say?\"","\"Zhang Chengjue doesn't seem like the type who can tolerate you, Professor Ye, holding so many shares. Perhaps we could cooperate...\" This was Lu Minglang's real purpose.","Tianqiu Tech was too enviable. Achieving its current success in just a few short years—who wouldn't want a piece of the pie?","Those three shareholders who got in early were already the envy of countless people.","Lu Minglang was young, his ambitions greater than others. He had his eye on Tianqiu.","Ye Qiusuo suddenly let out a light laugh. Lu Minglang across from her was taken aback.","For a company, Tianqiu Tech hadn't been established for long, but because it had strictly adhered to the established rules from the start, it was now very mature in all aspects.","But now, just any outsider could easily find out about internal issues. It had to be said that Zhang Chengjue was treating the company like a toy.","\"This is a matter between us,\" Ye Qiusuo stopped smiling. \"Outsiders can't interfere.\"","There wasn't a hint of amusement in her eyes.","\"My apologies,\" Lu Minglang quickly said sincerely, swiftly changing the subject. It had to be said he was extremely handsome, speaking unhurriedly, which made him quite likable.","However, this had no effect on Professor Ye.","The two parted after the meal. Lu Minglang returned to his car and let out a long sigh. Had he known this would happen, he wouldn't have brought up the matter. Now, Professor Ye probably had a poor impression of him.","Ye Qiusuo didn't pay much mind to Lu Minglang. She was thinking about how many people knew about the internal problems at Tianqiu. Of course, perhaps only Lu Minglang knew, being from the Lu family, whose reach was longer than others.","The company initially needed a public-facing representative and someone to handle business investments and such. Ye Qiusuo wasn't willing to manage those things; her mind was entirely on research. Back then, Zhang Chengjue held half the shares and was even somewhat uneasy.","People's hearts are easily changed.","\"I don't want to go. I'm not recording.\"","Xie Xi covered his ears, avoiding his manager's arrangements.","Wei Qi blocked Xie Xi's path: \"You have to participate. This is a great opportunity for you.\"","After the near-accident last time, Wei Qi suddenly realized something: the outside world knew too little about Xie Xi, and she had protected him too well. If something happened to Xie Xi and she wasn't the one handling it, he would inevitably be attacked.","\"A reality show. The audience will definitely like you,\" Wei Qi said with certainty. After spending time with Xie Xi, no one could help but like him.","\"Aren't reality shows all fake?\" Xie Xi currently didn't want to record any shows. The experience with 'Tomorrow's Star' had successfully killed his interest in any program.","\"I've vetted it properly. It won't be like last time where we ran into that kind of production team. Also, regarding editing issues, it's written in the contract this time that our side gets to review it before it's released.\"","Xie Xi was willful for a long while, but Wei Qi still wouldn't budge. In the end, he could only agree.","\"Just be yourself during the recording, the same as you usually are.\" Wei Qi sighed inwardly. She was taking a risk this time. \"Xixi, make the most of it.\"","\"What do you have to do on a reality show?\" Xie Xi asked.","\"There are three resident guests. For the first three episodes, you'll record at each other's homes. After that, it will be based on mission themes.\" Seeing that Xie Xi was willing to listen, Wei Qi sat down and explained carefully.","\"Besides you, there are two other guests. One is the film director Xu Qingwei, and the other is the young actor You Feibai.\"","Just from looking at the other two participants, one could tell the production team had put thought into it. Director Xu Qingwei, hailed as the queen of art-house films, and You Feibai, a young actor who had risen in the past two years and won Best Actor last year. All three were top talents in their respective fields.","\"They're coming to my place?\" Only now did Xie Xi grasp the meaning behind Wei Qi's earlier words.","Wei Qi: \"...Yes.\"","Xie Xi felt a bit reluctant.","\"You'll be going to their homes too,\" Wei Qi comforted him. \"Besides, there's not much to see at your place anyway.\"","Xie Xi was not comforted.","After explaining everything, Wei Qi left, and Xie Xi curled up alone on the sofa.","...He lowered his head to play games.","If you're unhappy, just play some games; that fixes everything.","\"Holy crap!\"","A hushed exclamation came from somewhere in the living room.","\"What are you doing?\" After playing a few rounds, Xie Xi got up to get some water and saw his assistant squatting in a corner, clutching his phone and whispering excitedly.","Zhang Dong jolted, turned around, saw it was Xie Xi, and waved him over. \"Look, Professor Ye!\"","It was a press conference, being broadcast live on a certain channel, with Ye Qiusuo speaking.","\"Professor Ye is really amazing! She's even on the news!\" Zhang Dong had also become a fan of Professor Ye after watching \"Knowledge Q&A.\"","Xie Xi took the phone and looked at the person on screen. He had to admit, Professor Ye stood out brilliantly among a crowd of middle-aged people. Coupled with her fluent, script-free explanation, it made people admire her even more.","\"What is she talking about?\" Xie Xi felt he understood each word individually, but put together, it was completely incomprehensible.","Zhang Dong leaned in to watch and shook his head. \"No idea. Seems really impressive though.\"","Xie Xi, self-taught in this regard, started taking screenshots. After about ten minutes, Ye Qiusuo finally stepped down, giving the camera over to someone else.","\"Let me borrow your phone for a bit.\" Xie Xi took his assistant's phone, intending to pick a few screenshots to send to himself.","This one looks good, that one looks good too... In the end, Xie Xi sent all the screenshots to his own phone, then meticulously deleted every single one from his assistant's phone, even cleaning out the \"recently deleted\" folder that kept items for thirty days.","When Zhang Dong got his phone back, he wanted to check the screenshots, but found nothing.","\"...\"","Even as a fan, his Xixi was this domineering and not exactly a model one.","What fan didn't wish the whole world could see the person they liked?","Xie Xi hugged his phone, looking at the screenshots. As he looked, a sudden feeling of unease settled in his chest. Last week, Ye Qiusuo had come to him for the final round of tests, marking the end of their scheduled sessions.","They basically had no chance to meet again unless the project results came out.","Maybe he should go supervise the project's progress?","The next day, Xie Xi swaggered off to find Ye Qiusuo.","Of course, this was only Xie Xi's own perception. In Ye Qiusuo's eyes, he still seemed rather sneaky.","\"Aren't you afraid of being spotted by students?\" Professor Ye was just by the corridor railing getting some air when she saw the fully disguised Xie Xi waving from below. To avoid causing a commotion, she had no choice but to bring him into her office.","\"Zhang Dong's car is nearby. If anyone notices, I'll just run back to it,\" Xie Xi declared confidently after entering, first inspecting the small cactus before speaking.","\"What did you need to see me about?\"","Xie Xi cleared his throat, hand covering his mouth, then stated with an air of righteous seriousness, \"I came to supervise the progress of that project.\"","Coming from Xie Xi, these words felt oddly out of place.","When Lu Minglang came to see Ye Qiusuo, it was also to discuss project progress, at least ostensibly. As for Xie Xi...","He seemed more like he was here on a casual visit.","Nevertheless, Ye Qiusuo still earnestly began explaining the project to him. The main difficulty currently lay in data collection. In the past, too few people cared about dyslexia. Nowadays, those who typically came to hospitals were young parents with very young children who naturally knew few characters, making testing difficult. Therefore, progress wasn't as fast as hoped.","Xie Xi's eyes glazed over: He didn't understand a word.","But Professor Ye looked really good when she was talking seriously."]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41","paragraphs":["\"Do you have any other questions?\" After Ye Qiusuo finished speaking, she asked Xie Xi.","Questions? I couldn't even understand what she was saying, where would I get questions from.","\"No questions.\" Xie Xi nodded, pretending to be profound. \"You explained it very well.\"","Professor Ye, who was being complimented, remained unmoved. She looked at Xie Xi: \"Does your manager know you came here?\"","\"...No.\" Xie Xi felt a little guilty.","\"You don't need to report when you go out?\" His manager was still around. With the previous scandal completely reversed, Ye Qiusuo didn't know what Xie Xi's future career path would be.","But one thing was certain: no matter what happened, the storyline between the male and female leads would always persist; what was supposed to happen would still happen. For example, last time when Wan Yurou and Lu Mingzhe were dining together, the waiter almost spilled water on Wan Yurou.","\"It seems to have grown a bit.\" Xie Xi suddenly said, looking at the small cactus on the desk.","\"It grew one centimeter.\" Professor Ye measured it daily with a soft ruler.","Xie Xi stood on the ball of one foot and started jiggling his leg. He was nervous.","When he gets nervous, he wants to sing.","\"Do you want to hear me sing?\" he asked her.","Ye Qiusuo wasn't even surprised by his state; perhaps people with dyslexia always had jumping thoughts.","So, Professor Ye refused: \"No.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","The big star Xie left in a huff.","Such a childish temper.","Professor Ye wasn't the least bit surprised.","With Xie Xi not coming, their lives indeed began to proceed without interfering with each other. Ye Qiusuo lived a very regular life every day: working on projects, guiding students, writing papers.","This month, several of her project results began to convert into profits, and she had considerably more money on hand.","\"Qiusuo, how is the smart medical watch project going?\" Zhang Chengjue asked at the monthly review meeting. \"The company's funds are tight recently. Your project has been going on for almost two years now.\"","\"Still in the debugging phase.\" Ye Qiusuo said calmly.","\"I still hope you can speed it up.\" Zhang Chengjue's gaze fell on another person. \"Professor Ye, I believe you and Qiusuo are in the same professional field. Perhaps you could find time to go and help.\"","The review meeting wasn't small; all project representatives from the entire company had to attend. Today, there were nearly a hundred people in the conference room.","\"President Zhang, non-project personnel cannot be arbitrarily added.\" A researcher objected, and there were murmurs of discussion below.","Zhang Chengjue's words were practically an insult to the project leader. Any serious researcher, putting themselves in that position, would be unhappy upon hearing such a statement.","Although he regretted it as soon as the words left his mouth, Zhang Chengjue was still very displeased with the researchers whispering below. He was used to being the top decision-maker and had begun to find it hard to accept others questioning him.","Fortunately, this situation wouldn't last much longer. Once the new batch of researchers was recruited, these people would become expendable.","The world doesn't stop turning without anyone, and given Tianqiu's current standing, the researchers they recruited now would only be more capable than the previous ones.","During the meeting, Ye Qiusuo basically didn't express her stance. To outsiders, she seemed very passive. After all, when it came down to it, she was just a researcher. No matter how many shares she held, what did she really understand?","Now, signs of division were already appearing at Tianqiu Tech. New researchers and old researchers formed two factions, looking down on each other.","Some of the old researchers, because of today's incident, were even disappointed in Ye Qiusuo, believing she was powerless to resist and that it was better to find a way out for themselves early.","The day after this meeting, someone sought out Ye Qiusuo.","\"Dr. Xu?\"","\"I came to tell you something.\"","\"Please, come in first.\"","\"No need.\" Dr. Xu stood at the doorway, not moving. \"Just a few sentences. I have an experiment to do later.\"","\"Please go ahead.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't insist.","\"Yesterday, all of us discussed it. If you need it, the combined two percent of shares in our hands will all be given to you.\" Dr. Xu said seriously to Ye Qiusuo. \"This matter was passed unanimously. The shares were originally a gift from you to us.\"","Ye Qiusuo was taken aback: \"I only distributed one percent. The other one percent came from the shares in Zhang Chengjue's hands.\"","Dr. Xu applied a double standard: \"Since he distributed them to us, we are free to handle them.\"","A person who doesn't understand research leading a group of researchers is fine if the leadership is good, but to say something like that in a meeting makes it hard to believe the researchers' lives would be good after Tianqiu was completely under Zhang Chengjue's control.","\"You can have them whenever you want. I should go now.\" True to his word, Dr. Xu left after just a few sentences.","Ye Qiusuo held the doorknob, and after a long while, suddenly laughed softly.","She naturally wouldn't let Zhang Chengjue take the company so easily. Ye Qiusuo was waiting, waiting for an opportunity to completely take the company into her own hands.","...","Xie Xi had recently started recording a reality show. It was much freer than sitting in the mentor's chair before. The production team didn't provide a script; they simply had the guests visit each other's homes.","The first episode was edited from footage of three guests visiting each other's homes.","For the reality show, the production team needed a sense of authenticity. Since the recording dates weren't specified, one day the team brought the other two guests to raid Xie Xi's residence.","The doorbell rang.","Xie Xi, curled up on the sofa playing a game: \"Zhang Dong, go get the door. I'm in the middle of a game.\"","\"Bro Xi, isn't that a single-player game? I'm also in a game; I can't abandon my teammates.\" Zhang Dong said, eyes fixed on his phone screen.","Xie Xi: \"...I order you to go, little assistant.\"","Little assistant Zhang Dong had no choice but to get up and slowly shuffle towards the door, opening it while still staring at his screen.","Xie Xi had scheduled a housekeeping company today to tidy up the place, so his real lifestyle wouldn't be too exposed.","Zhang Dong glanced at a bunch of feet out of the corner of his eye, thinking it was the housekeeping staff.","\"Come in, remember to close the door.\"","The production team and the two guests looked at each other and, in perfect tacit understanding, fell silent. The cameras started recording frantically.","They had made countless assumptions on the way over, never expecting that the person opening the door wasn't Xie Xi, that the person opening the door wouldn't even look at them before going back inside, and certainly not expecting Xie Xi's home to look like this.","It looked... extremely sleep-friendly.","The entire first floor seemed to have places to sleep everywhere: what looked like soft, squishy carpets, various beanbag chairs, all in a riot of colorful, vibrant hues.","Was this really the legendary home of Xie Xi?","Everyone present was doubtful.","But the camera had already captured Xie Xi's back; he was sitting over on the sofa.","Xie Xi sat cross-legged on the sofa, holding a game controller, staring at the screen. He got angry: \"What a crappy game, always making me die right here.\"","Once angry, he picked up the duck beside him and made it squeak.","It made him feel much better.","Squeezing the duck always helped relieve stress.","Of course, this was better done at home. He couldn't let people see this. That reality show thing... after the housekeeping company came today to pack everything away, they'd have no chance of filming his real life.","Xie Xi thought to himself. He'd switch to Nordic-style furniture later, choose grey wallpaper, be a bit aloof, and he'd be the handsome, unruly big star again.","The production team: \"...\" It seemed they had really captured something extraordinary.","There was always a feeling of being watched from behind. Xie Xi thought it was Zhang Dong standing behind him and couldn't help turning around. \"Zhang Dong, step back a bit...\"","Seeing the several cameras pointed at him, the duck in Xie Xi's hand started quacking again.","\"Brother Xi, what's wrong?\" Zhang Dong had just finished a round of gaming. He turned his head and, seeing these people, was startled. \"Aren't they... from the housekeeping company?\"","He was guilty.","Xie Xi: \"...\" He wondered if Professor Ye could invent a time machine; he would definitely be the first to try it.","\"Xiao Xie, long time no see. The last time we met was when I invited you to sing the theme song for my movie.\" Director Xu Qingwei stepped forward with a smile, taking the opportunity to introduce, \"This is You Feibai. I don't know if you've met before.\"","You Feibai, the newly crowned film emperor, tall with long legs, handsome features, arguably the most popular actor in the film and television industry at the moment.","\"Hello, I'm You Feibai.\" You Feibai was more composed and calm than the others, his face not showing an obvious smile as he introduced himself perfunctorily.","With a reality show crew at his door, Xie Xi still mustered his professional spirit, first shaking hands with You Feibai, then reluctantly leading them on a tour of his house.","\"This is the music room.\" Xie Xi pushed open a room on the second floor, filled with various professional equipment and instruments.","\"Do you usually write songs and compose music here?\" Xu Qingwei took on the role of asking questions.","\"...Mhm.\" What Xie Xi loved most was actually wandering around, with various musical scores scattered all over the floor.","Clothes and shoes each occupied their own room, accessories like ties and such also had a dedicated room, and there was even a specialized thermostat for maintaining temperature. None of this was considered excessive in the eyes of industry insiders.","\"This room is specifically for displaying albums.\" Xie Xi led everyone inside. The walls were hung with various posters from his concerts, all framed.","Several glass walls stood in the middle, with various CD albums hanging on them.","\"I have these albums in my collection at home too.\" Xu Qingwei said with a laugh, looking at a few albums on the wall.","You Feibai's gaze swept over the walls. \"Some are missing.\"","If You Feibai hadn't mentioned it, everyone would have thought the glass walls were originally like that, with some albums missing. Looking more carefully, they realized the albums hanging on the walls followed a certain pattern.","\"Gave them away.\" Xie Xi explained casually.","After looking around, Xu Qingwei asked, \"Are your trophies in another room? Take us to see them.\"","Xie Xi opened the wooden cabinet beneath the glass wall. \"They're here.\"","A pile of trophies were heaped together, looking messy.","Mainly because the space below was too cramped, there were too many trophies, all squeezed together, making them look far less impressive than the albums on the glass walls.","Xu Qingwei couldn't help but laugh. \"This is too much, piling the trophies up like this. You really should clear out another room for them.\"","Xie Xi's eyes shifted evasively. The last room on his second floor was already used to store the things he liked.","\"There's one more room. What's over there?\" You Feibai asked.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","\"Nothing much.\"","\"Xiao Xie, what are you hiding? Hurry up and take us to see.\" Xu Qingwei dutifully fulfilled the task given by the production team.","The first floor had been completely seen, and seeing the second floor wouldn't be much more of a loss anyway. His dignity had long been lost.","Xie Xi led the group to the room he liked to spend time in the most.","As soon as the door was pushed open, everyone was stunned.","Inside were all sorts of animal toys with a strong plastic feel, looking cheap and childish.","Xu Qingwei picked up a squeaky chicken and squeezed it, immediately producing a piercing sound. She then tried another frog, which also made a noise.","The production crew: \"...\"","Is this for real?","Xie Xi had already entered a state of resignation. \"My screaming room. Everything in here can make a sound.\"","Feeling good? Come in and squeeze something. Feeling bad? Come in and squeeze something. In short, whenever his emotions were unstable, he would come in and squeeze.","The little yellow duck keychain he had given to Ye Qiusuo last time was picked out from this very room."]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42","paragraphs":["The people who went inside couldn't help but reach out to pinch the pile of things, leading to immediate shrieks and a cacophony of various sounds filling the room.","Gotta say... it was pretty satisfying.","The guests and the production crew were too shocked. After finishing the tour, everyone's mood was complicated.","However, the on-site directors were delighted. They could already imagine how many interesting segments they could cut from this footage.","If the other two guests could also be as mind-blowing as Xie Xi, the show would definitely be a massive hit.","Unfortunately, observing Director Xu Qingwei and You Feibai, it was clear they were also stunned by the things in Xie Xi's home.","\"Next, we are going to visit You Feibai's and Teacher Xu's homes,\" the on-site director said to the three guests.","While they were leaving, the cameras were turned off. As a rule, reality shows are not allowed to reveal the stars' residences, so they deliberately drove a considerable distance before turning the cameras back on inside the car.","Everyone was sitting in the same vehicle.","\"Xiao Xie, don't blame us for earlier when we arrived,\" Xu Qingwei said with a smile. \"The director told us to try and dig out any areas you might not want people to see.\"","Xie Xi was already exposed. He presented a state of surrender: \"There's nothing inside that can't be seen.\"","The group first went to the nearest house, Xu Qingwei's. The famous director's home wasn't overly opulent; the design, by contrast, had a kind of Jiangnan (the regions south of the Yangtze River) charm, with most of the furniture and fittings made of wood.","The house was very beautiful, with a special place for displaying trophies. Xu Qingwei introduced the origins of each trophy one by one.","After walking around for less than an hour, they were done. The group set off again for You Feibai's home.","You Feibai's home absolutely fits the public's imagination of a male celebrity's lifestyle. The walls were painted dark gray, and the furniture largely followed a cool Nordic style. There weren't many possessions in the house. There was a dedicated walk-in closet, but it was smaller in scale than Xie Xi's. The only large room was the trophy display room, which, like Xu Qingwei's, had been carefully designed, clearly showing how much importance the owner placed on it.","Unlike them, You Feibai's entire house was equipped with smart controls, from small faucets to large curtains and staircases. Almost every applicable high-tech feature was present here.","The style was flashy, cool, and aloof.","Celebrity Xie suddenly felt very embarrassed.","\"Feibai, can you cook?\" Xu Qingwei asked, turning around as they passed the kitchen. \"How about we just cook today?\"","\"I know a little. Let me see what's left in the fridge.\" You Feibai opened the fridge to check. \"We can make scrambled eggs with tomatoes, and there's also a box of pork belly and a head of cabbage.\"","\"Alright, let's make three dishes then,\" Xu Qingwei nodded. \"We don't need to eat out.\"","\"Then let's make a stir-fried pork with chili peppers, but we're out of peppers at home.\" You Feibai said as he took out the ingredients.","Xu Qingwei took the cabbage and glanced at Xie Xi, who was out of the loop: \"Is there a supermarket nearby? Let Xiao Xie go buy some.\"","\"There is.\"","\"Buy what?\" Xie Xi only caught the last part.","\"Feibai wants to make stir-fried pork with chili peppers. I'll help wash the cabbage. You go buy some peppers from the nearby supermarket.\"","\"Oh.\"","Following the directions You Feibai pointed out, Xie Xi went to find the supermarket. Around three or four in the afternoon, the supermarket was relatively empty. When he entered, only the supermarket aunties were organizing the goods.","Following the signs above the supermarket aisles, Xie Xi successfully found the pepper section.","\"Which kind should I buy?\" Xie Xi turned to ask the on-site director.","\"The kind for stir-frying meat,\" the director whispered.","How would Xie Xi know which peppers were for stir-frying meat? Looking at the green, red, and even yellow peppers, he finally pulled a bag from the side, picked one of each type of pepper, and headed straight for the checkout counter.","\"Young man, where are you going?\" The weighing auntie, seeing Xie Xi walking off with the bag, couldn't help but remind him.","\"Me?\" Xie Xi turned back. \"To pay.\"","\"Weigh them first, then pay.\" The auntie called him over, snatched the bag, and prepared to weigh it.","The auntie looked inside the bag: Oh my, a riot of colorful peppers.","\"The price per jin (catty) is different for each of these. Why did you put them all in one bag?\" The auntie looked at Xie Xi and clicked her tongue. \"You look quite like the star on my granddaughter's desk, but you're not very bright.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Those colorful bell peppers were large; putting just one on the scale didn't seem like much. Finally, the auntie held up a tiny red bird's-eye chili and said, \"You want just this one?\"","The auntie wasn't even sure if the scale could register it.","Xie Xi nodded definitely.","It was finally weighed. The auntie stared at the price tag for a moment before sticking it on the bag and throwing the pepper inside. \"They'll scan the code on your bag later.\"","Xie Xi just carried the bag, plastered with a bunch of tags, back. Xu Qingwei smiled and took it. \"The scrambled eggs with tomatoes are just about to come out of the pan. Perfect timing to make the stir-fried pork with peppers now.\"","She looked down, opened the bag, and saw: \"...\"","You Feibai came out carrying a dish, passed by, saw the peppers inside the bag: \"...\"","\"Hahaha, well then we can only cook with what we have today.\" Xu Qingwei maintained her expression, took the bag of peppers, and went to wash them.","Xie Xi stood in the kitchen, watching them bustle about, his eyes betraying a faint bewilderment. He hardly ever went into the kitchen.","Behind them, a group of on-site directors all looked excited. For reality shows, you need topics. If everyone is reserved and everything goes perfectly, the audience won't love it either.","At that moment, everyone on the production team shared the same thought: fortunately they had invited Xie Xi.","...","After recording the first episode, Wei Qi made a point of asking Xie Xi how he felt.","\"Average.\" Xie Xi had already given up on maintaining his image. \"Is that You Feibai very impressive?\"","\"He's very well liked by those prominent directors in the film and television circle,\" Wei Qi smiled. \"There's no conflict of interest between the two of you.\"","They were in different circles, and their niches weren't the same either.","Xie Xi absentmindedly agreed. He hadn't contacted Professor Ye for a long time. The previous excuse of checking on the project's progress should probably still work.","Actually, even if Xie Xi didn't go looking for Ye Qiusuo, she would take the initiative to come find him.","Quite a lot happened this month.","Zhang Chengjue had already arranged for the production line to mass-produce the mushrooms and delivered them to his partners. They were very popular at first. Wealthy people like things that are good for their health, even if the price is steep.","Initially, the use of the therapeutic mushrooms was limited to severely injured patients to accelerate wound healing. However, because the mushrooms could cause hallucinations as a side effect, patients' hands and feet were restrained during use.","After a week of experiments, the results weren't good.","Because severely injured patients shouldn't engage in vigorous movement. Although eating the therapeutic mushrooms could speed recovery, the hallucinations immediately after consumption caused patients to thrash about, unintentionally worsening their wounds.","So later, they lowered their targets, and the effects only then began to appear.","This thing seemed to possess a miraculous power, especially because of its hallucinogenic effects.","Rumors began to circulate privately that these mushrooms could beautify and promote longevity. The wealthy, who lacked neither money nor connections, gradually began contacting Zhang Chengjue's side privately.","A large amount of funds flowed back in, and Zhang Chengjue immediately swelled with ambition. He felt that relying solely on the mushrooms, Tianqiu's reputation could be completely established worldwide. Perhaps these mushrooms could even branch out into cosmetics?","As is well known, women's money is the easiest to earn.","The more inflated he became, the more he disliked Ye Qiusuo, feeling she held too many shares.","At Tianqiu Technology, Ye Qiusuo could clearly feel herself being increasingly constrained and sidelined.","She was in no hurry, as if watching someone stride quickly toward an abyss.","The therapeutic mushroom product was good. With a gradual, steady approach, the future would undoubtedly be bright. Yet Zhang Chengjue couldn't wait. He overextended himself, abruptly threatening too many people's interests, and the mushrooms had a fatal flaw—they could induce hallucinations.","Once others reacted, Tianqiu Technology would undoubtedly face fierce attacks.","Ye Qiusuo wanted a huge sum of money to later increase capital and expand shares, diluting Zhang Chengjue's stake.","Cooperating with Lu Minglang might make things smoother, but the Lu family was even more ambitious and cunning than Zhang Chengjue. Partnering with him would be like making a pact with a tiger.","Ye Qiusuo wanted absolute authority and didn't want a second Zhang Chengjue to emerge.","Borrowing money was a good idea, but from whom?","For some reason, Ye Qiusuo thought of Xie Xi.","He had money.","Within a year, Ye Qiusuo was confident she could repay it, but it depended on whether the other party was willing.","When he received Ye Qiusuo's call, Xie Xi was somewhat incredulous—Professor Ye was actually contacting him first.","\"I need to ask you for a favor. Can we meet to talk?\" Ye Qiusuo said directly.","Xie Xi naturally agreed happily, his mind filled with guesses along the way.","When Ye Qiusuo saw Xie Xi, she suddenly didn't know how to begin. In her view, they hadn't known each other long; they might not even be considered friends, at most collaborators.","She didn't know why she had suddenly thought of Xie Xi that day, listing him as someone she could borrow money from.","\"I want to borrow a sum of money from you...\" Ye Qiusuo explained the entire situation clearly, without any concealment. She didn't believe Xie Xi would disclose it to others.","Xie Xi listened quietly, then suddenly asked, \"Can I become a shareholder of Tianqiu Technology?\"","Then he would be part of Tianqiu Technology too, and could visit Ye Qiusuo anytime in the future... no, visit the company for inspections anytime.","Ye Qiusuo quickly calculated in her mind, then nodded: \"If I borrow the money, I can allocate one percent of the shares to you as your interest.\"","\"Deal,\" Xie Xi agreed without hesitation.","Professor Ye: \"...Are you sure you want to lend me this much money?\"","Before coming, she had thought the whole idea was too idealistic.","\"I have plenty of money,\" Xie Xi said casually, propping his head on one hand.","\"Thank you,\" Ye Qiusuo said seriously.","\"I'll transfer the money to you tomorrow and write an IOU,\" Xie Xi calculated. If he lent it tomorrow, they could meet again.","Ye Qiusuo shook her head: \"Not needed for now. I'll come find you when I need to borrow the money.\"","She was waiting for Zhang Chengjue to fail.","Xie Xi: So she wasn't in a hurry after all. He felt a little disappointed.","...","Inside Tianqiu Technology.","\"Xiao Ye, lend your lab to our team for a while.\" That afternoon, Ye Qiusu came specifically to find Ye Qiusuo.","\"My lab is not for lending.\"","All of Ye Qiusuo's experiments were inside, and she used it daily. It was impossible to give it to others.","\"Xiao Ye, you can't hog the lab forever. Instruments in school labs are for public use,\" Ye Qiusu advised in a patronizing tone.","\"This is a company, not a school,\" Ye Qiusuo frowned. \"Your team's project can be completed in other labs.\"","There was no need to use the instruments in her lab at all.","\"Our team just wants to be more precise. Everyone knows your lab has the best instruments,\" Ye Qiusu said matter-of-factly. \"We're all working for Tianqiu. Xiao Ye, don't develop a possessive mindset.\"","Ye Qiusuo stared at Ye Qiusu for a moment, then said calmly, \"If your team can't perform well, the project can be handed to others. As a shareholder, I still have that right.\"","Ye Qiusu hadn't expected her to say that; after all, at the university, she was considered Ye Qiusuo's superior.","In the end, she could only leave in a huff, mentally noting the offense.","After she left, Ye Qiusuo's eyes turned cold.","Ye Qiusu was a newly recruited researcher, part of Zhang Chengjue's faction."]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43","paragraphs":["\"Has it already been launched on the market?\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded. \"All the procedures have been completed. The demand is currently increasing continuously.\"","Zeng Liqing stood in the outer courtyard of the research institute, his expression complex. \"If this can help people, it counts as a good thing.\"","\"If given the chance, would you be willing to come back?\" Ye Qiusuo asked.","\"What do you mean?\" Zeng Liqing stared at Ye Qiusuo. When he left the company, everything was still harmonious. He didn't know that now, Zhang Chengjue and Ye Qiusuo were only one step away from an open confrontation.","Ye Qiusuo lowered her gaze to a wild grass by the roadside. Compared to the surrounding withered yellow lawn, it looked particularly conspicuous.","\"After you left, several other members of the research team also left Tianqiu.\"","\"They left too? Without them, how will the follow-up research proceed?\" Zeng Liqing's face changed. \"From start to finish, you never planned to devote effort to eliminating the mushroom's side effects.\"","Removing this side effect while preserving the mushroom's medicinal efficacy required immense effort and financial resources. As researchers, they had hoped to eliminate the side effects before launch. However, the company deemed this side effect harmless and not worth the wasted time and money.","\"If I asked you to come back and continue researching how to eliminate the side effects, would you be willing?\"","Zeng Liqing was stunned, finally beginning to sense something was amiss. The biology departments on the eighth and ninth floors were brought into the company by Ye Qiusuo, but the person who later took control and managed them was always Zhang Chengjue; she hadn't been very visible.","\"What about Zhang Chengjue?\" Zeng Liqing probed, a suspicion forming in his mind.","\"My invitation has nothing to do with him.\"","Ye Qiusuo's visit to Zeng Liqing today was for a later plan. The Healing Mushroom was a good project, the result of so many researchers' hard work. It would be a shame to waste it.","These words... Zeng Liqing seemed to understand something. He looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"We can return, but the project's progress must be under our own control.\"","\"Agreed.\"","There was one more thing Zeng Liqing hadn't figured out. \"But the Healing Mushroom is already on the market. Are we preparing for a second phase?\"","\"When the time comes, I will contact you again. For now, please trouble Dr. Zeng to contact the other members.\"","...","Day by day passed. Zhang Chengjue, watching the continuously flowing funds, grew increasingly inflated. In the company, he was now almost openly taking control, pushing Ye Qiusuo to the sidelines.","Previously, most projects originated from Ye Qiusuo, so he had to respect her. Whenever he represented Tianqiu Tech externally, he received everyone's respect, but once back at the company, basically no one listened to him. Now it was different. The Healing Mushroom project came from his team, and its revenue stream was even better than several of Ye Qiusuo's projects. In his eyes, Ye Qiusuo no longer existed.","Ye Qiusuo endured quietly, waiting for the day to erupt. However, even she hadn't anticipated it would come so quickly.","A certain public account suddenly published an article directly targeting Tianqiu Tech's latest Healing Mushroom project.","\"Exposing the Three Major Crimes of Tianqiu's Healing Mushroom: When Tech Companies Tamper with Healthcare, Where Should the Common People Turn?\"","The article was written with deep emotion and was highly inflammatory. It even linked to several of Ye Qiusuo's projects to accuse Tianqiu Tech of having grand ambitions, attempting a monopoly.","Of course, the key issue of the Healing Mushroom was also detailed, specifically regarding its hallucinogenic effects.","The word 'hallucination' too easily made people associate it with something else. The article's author even provided a set of data, claiming that after the Healing Mushroom went on sale, a group of people, in pursuit of stimulation, were secretly purchasing it at high prices.","Having grown to its current size, Tianqiu Tech naturally had a PR department. Zhang Chengjue's first reaction was to have PR contact the publisher. That very night, the public account article was reported and deleted.","In the internet age, if you truly want to conceal something, deleting a public account article isn't enough to handle it.","The act of reporting and deleting the article, instead, blew the matter wide open, directly exploding onto the headlines.","Food and drug safety issues have always been a bottom line the public will not tolerate. Tianqiu Tech was also the most famous tech company in recent years, with many comparing it to major foreign corporations.","[??? Since when did Tianqiu Tech get involved in medicine and food?]","[I know about this mushroom. A relative used it not long ago, and the effect was quite good. Originally needed two months to recover, but was completely healed in less than a month.]","[Side effects cause hallucinations? Not what I'm thinking, right?]","[Isn't this just drugs? Selling this openly? Are the relevant authorities dead?]","[Seriously, can't tech companies just focus on tech products? Why must they get involved in the medical field.]","[People above probably don't know how profitable the medical field is.]","[Is this Professor Ye's company? So disgusting?]","[Let's be fair, this matter has nothing to do with Professor Ye, right? It wasn't her research.]","The situation grew bigger and bigger, with various people behind the scenes adding fuel to the fire. Tianqiu Tech, because of the Healing Mushroom incident, was suddenly exposed to the storm.","Zhang Chengjue held an emergency shareholders' meeting overnight to discuss how to suppress the matter.","\"All relevant procedures, we completed them. We got the certificates. Where's the problem? It's just a hallucination,\" Zhang Chengjue was practically speechless about the online discussions. \"What drug doesn't have side effects?\"","He wanted to fight head-on, but a shareholder took a different approach, coming up with a marketing angle.","\"In recent years, haven't many people wanted to go to Yunnan to eat poisonous mushrooms, to experience the hallucination of seeing little people? Ours is non-toxic, harmless, and good for the body. We can market it. The product would be perfect as a snack.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","Yet, Zhang Chengjue's eyes lit up, thinking this was a great idea. Their product was, after all, convenient and easy to consume.","\"This marketing won't work,\" Ye Qiusuo finally spoke up to remind them. \"Once you associate it with hallucinations, they won't let you sell it as a snack.\"","\"This hallucinogenic effect is harmless to the human body,\" Zhang Chengjue originally needed to think about it, but as soon as Ye Qiusuo spoke, he felt she didn't take him seriously. \"Market it this way. Let's vote.\"","The next day, Tianqiu Tech's official blog began promoting that a snack version of this Healing Mushroom would soon be released. The mushroom content would be reduced, but the taste would be better, and those fated might even see little people dancing around them.","Seeing that message on the official blog, Ye Qiusuo's expression turned grim.","She knew Zhang Chengjue would crash and burn later, but she didn't expect him to be so brainless as to actively hand the knife to outsiders.","This was no longer just a side effect issue; it was an ideological issue.","One week after the mushroom snack was released, someone sued Tianqiu Tech in court.","Because their child was addicted to eating this stuff, leading to neglecting studies and becoming immersed in seeing hallucinations every day.","Shortly thereafter, someone revealed that in the week after the mushroom snack hit the market, the regional suicide rate instantly skyrocketed—allegedly all of the suicides occurred after consuming the mushrooms.","Regardless of its truth, once this news came out, it was fatal.","[I said early on this stuff is just drugs. Tianqiu Tech not only didn't take it seriously but also made it into a snack for the market. Who wouldn't say capital is amazing?]","[We hope the relevant departments conduct a thorough investigation and take all these so-called mushroom products off the shelves.]","[Should Professor Ye come out and explain?]","[What does this have to do with Professor Ye? She's just a researcher.]","[Tsk tsk, it seems the public still doesn't understand how Celestial Sphere Tech got its start. This company wouldn't have gotten off the ground back then without Ye Qiusuo. To this day, Ye Qiusuo holds as much stock as Zhang Chengjue, the company's spokesperson. She has a say in company resolutions. So, do you think Professor Ye should come out and explain?]","[So Professor Ye is also an executive?]","[They're all capitalists, bloodsuckers. Who cares about us ordinary folks?]","This matter quickly attracted the attention of higher authorities.","It must be said that Zhang Chengjue had stepped over the line with pinpoint accuracy. Soon, officials from above began to intervene, demanding the removal of the so-called mushroom snacks from shelves and even launching an investigation into the therapeutic mushrooms.","The results came quickly: the snack products were permanently banned, and the therapeutic mushrooms were temporarily suspended for rectification.","Regarding the therapeutic mushrooms, the relevant authorities did not completely shut them down, as they were indeed beneficial. However, given the current public outcry, they could not go against popular sentiment.","\"Once you resolve these side effects, you can apply again for approval as a medical food.\"","Upon receiving this news, Zhang Chengjue felt a pang of anxiety.","That's how companies are. When they run smoothly, funds flow in continuously. But if one link in the chain breaks mid-operation, the entire structure can collapse.","He had expanded his operations too aggressively.","Even without him calling for it, the other shareholders proactively demanded a meeting to discuss the next steps.","\"This project is essentially ruined.\"","\"The top priority now is damage control.\"","\"The initial capital investment was too large; recouping it now will be very difficult.\" Song Jiren looked at Zhang Chengjue. He had previously cast an abstention vote on this project.","\"I know.\" Zhang Chengjue was growing visibly impatient. He turned his focus to Ye Qiusuo. \"How much longer until your project can enter the market? Our company needs funds now.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up. \"At least another year. Furthermore, funding for the project needs to be allocated this month.\"","Not only did her project have no results to show, but it was also asking the company for more money.","Zhang Chengjue's expression darkened. The meeting concluded without a concrete plan. The other shareholders remained on the sidelines, watching. At this moment, it truly seemed the company was his alone.","The situation was far more complicated. Because of this incident, other tech companies that had been wronged in the past began to secretly undermine Celestial Sphere Tech, trying to carve away its market share.","Zhang Chengjue worried about money every day. He went to the company to see if any valuable projects could be fast-tracked for development, only to find that the newcomers had no useful projects in hand. The projects from the older researchers looked promising but were still far from yielding results.","\"What is the meaning of this?\" Zhang Chengjue received a call notifying him of a shareholders' meeting. When he arrived, he found Ye Qiusuo sitting in his usual seat.","\"Professor Ye has invested a sum of money to help the company's operations.\"","Song Jiren kindly explained the situation from behind.","Zhang Chengjue's face fell. This was essentially a capital increase and share expansion, diluting their existing shares.","\"I don't agree.\"","\"The vote has already concluded,\" Ye Qiusuo said calmly. \"It obtained two-thirds of the voting rights of the shareholders present and is effective immediately.\"","\"What do you mean 'present'? You never notified me.\" While speaking, Zhang Chengjue looked at the two other shareholders who had previously sided with him, only to find them avoiding his gaze completely.","\"Is that so? Perhaps there was an issue with the company's notification system.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed to the seat opposite her. \"Have a seat.\"","Zhang Chengjue did not move.","Ye Qiusuo didn't mind. Those two shareholders were easy to deal with; all they sought was profit. Having witnessed the consequences of following Zhang Chengjue, little persuasion was needed.","However, shares like these needed to be reclaimed slowly."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44","paragraphs":["The tactics once used against Ye Qiusuo, Zhang Chengjue now got to experience himself, and the taste was exceptionally unpleasant.","Over the years, the company had seen many researchers come and go, buried in their projects. Many didn't even know their own monthly salary, their minds and eyes filled only with experiments. Having seen this often, Zhang Chengjue naturally took Ye Qiusuo for this kind of person; otherwise, the company wouldn't have remained under his control for so long.","He never imagined that Ye Qiusuo would not only retaliate but also turn his own methods back on him.","\"Have you been waiting for this opportunity all along?\" Zhang Chengjue questioned Ye Qiusuo, his eyes full of disbelief, as if betrayed.","Ye Qiusuo said calmly, \"Good advice is wasted on those doomed to perish.\"","\"This company has your share too. Don't you know how devastating the failure of this project would be for the company?\" Zhang Chengjue challenged.","\"So...\" Ye Qiusuo lowered her gaze to her newly scabbed fingertips, a faint smile curling at the corner of her lips before she looked back at Zhang Chengjue, \"Now I'm cleaning up your mess.\"","Zhang Chengjue: \"...\"","Among the five people in the conference room, apart from Ye Qiusuo, perhaps only Song Jiren remained somewhat calm.","After all, from the very beginning, he had been neutral, not blindly following Zhang Chengjue.","A shareholder should just collect dividends; meddling in all that messy business was pointless.","Moreover, Song Jiren understood clearly what the rise of Tianqiu Tech was truly built upon.","Even a pig can fly if it stands in the right wind.","If Ye Qiusuo was that powerful wind, then Zhang Chengjue was the pig on the wind's edge. Once the wind stops, the pig is bound to fall to its death.","With the dilution of shares, Ye Qiusuo became the company's largest shareholder, reclaiming decision-making power. Zhang Chengjue's original ID card was revoked; he didn't even get to keep the purple one, instead receiving a white ID card like the other shareholders.","Zhang Chengjue could still go to the office, but there was nothing left for him to handle. He could, like the other shareholders, not come to the company unless necessary, only needing to vote in major meetings and collect dividends in the future.","If Zhang Chengjue were the type to quietly accept dividends, he wouldn't have done such things in the first place. This blow hit him extremely hard.","After this shareholder meeting, Zhang Chengjue still came to the company every day. He wanted to see how Ye Qiusuo, an academic researcher, could manage the company without him handling all matters, big and small.","However, reality defied Zhang Chengjue's expectations.","Ye Qiusuo not only kept the company running, but she also acted with a heavy hand.","It had taken him two years to bring in new people, yet Ye Qiusuo uprooted them effortlessly.","First, she purged the company's security personnel and reinforced all systems, restoring Tianqiu Tech to its former impenetrable state.","Back when Ye Qiusuo heard Lu Minglang's probing, she knew Tianqiu Tech's internal stability was compromised. For a tech company, information leaks are the greatest taboo, and at worst, they lead to technology theft.","Next, all researchers hired in the past two years were re-screened, a task Ye Qiusuo handled personally.","Anyone unqualified was dismissed immediately, with compensation paid on the spot.","Researchers who were just there for credentials or experience were kicked out, and those with questionable backgrounds were also filtered out one by one.","\"Professor Ye, is this your way of getting revenge?\" Ye Qiusu stormed in, resignation letter in hand, to confront her.","Previously, she only knew Ye Qiusuo as one of Tianqiu Tech's earliest batch of researchers, unaware she was a major shareholder. Ye Qiusuo had always kept a low profile; old-timers in the company weren't big on gossip, and newcomers didn't know about this.","It wasn't until Zhang Chengjue was ousted and became a dividend-collecting shareholder that everyone learned Ye Qiusuo was the company's largest shareholder.","\"Revenge for what?\" Ye Qiusuo removed her glasses; she had been reviewing researchers' files all day.","\"I...\" Ye Qiusu was at a loss for words. She couldn't very well say she had subtly targeted her at the university.","As women in the same field, Ye Qiusu had once been the center of attention. Because she was female, everything she did was prefixed with 'beautiful.' Admittedly, Ye Qiusu enjoyed this label; it made her feel special.","But now she was in her forties, her youth faded, and suddenly Ye Qiusuo appeared. Yet, no one specifically pointed out Ye Qiusuo's gender. Logically, Ye Qiusu should have been pleased, but now she understood one thing: all these years, the so-called 'beautiful professor' title actually carried undertones of discrimination and gossip.","\"I want to know why you're making me leave.\" Ye Qiusu suppressed her anger. Joining Tianqiu Tech had brought her too many benefits; her recent appointment as department head was also closely tied to her position at Tianqiu Tech, signifying full recognition of her abilities.","\"This project has no research value.\" From her review these past days, Ye Qiusuo didn't realize the company had so many messy projects. Take Ye Qiusu's project, for instance. Not only had it been researched before, but Ye Qiusu herself had done it five years ago. Now, with a name change, it actually got approved at Tianqiu Tech.","\"The project isn't finished yet. How can you say it has no research value?\" Ye Qiusu sneered. \"Professor Ye, that's not the attitude a researcher should have.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked seriously at this department head. \"Perhaps the department head would like to discuss this project in detail with me?\"","Ye Qiusu: \"...\"","At this point, anyone with real substance would have stepped up to discuss it with Ye Qiusuo.","Unfortunately, Ye Qiusu felt a pang of guilt. She really was just riding on her long-established reputation.","Tianqiu needed renowned researchers, and she needed to borrow Tianqiu Tech's prestige. In theory, they could have coexisted peacefully.","Ye Qiusuo reached out, brushed aside her silver chain, picked up her glasses and put them back on, lowering her head to look at the documents on the desk. \"If there's nothing else, department head, you may leave.\"","Strictly speaking, Ye Qiusu wasn't a Tianqiu Tech employee, as her main job was at Huajing University. If Tianqiu terminated the project, they might not even need to pay compensation.","Zhao Guiyin was about to knock and enter when he bumped into Ye Qiusu storming out, unusually furious. Her usual elegant demeanor was gone, replaced only by a look of humiliation.","He watched her leave, deep in thought.","Presumably, Ye Qiusuo had been rather direct.","Since being recruited, compared to Zhang Chengjue, who became increasingly blinded by power, Zhao Guiyin had always seen things clearly.","Ye Qiusuo appeared upright and steady, but in reality, her methods were formidable. When dealing with people of little threat, she was always blunt and direct, seeming to lack cunning. But if her bottom line was crossed, she could effortlessly seize their weaknesses and then act.","Zhang Chengjue forgot, but he didn't.","When the project that propelled Tianqiu Tech's meteoric rise was still in the experimental phase, two key researchers were bribed separately. One company even rushed to be the first to release a product.","And then?","Just as everyone was furious, feeling years of effort were wasted, that company's product suddenly encountered frequent problems. The other company's product was still on the production line, unsure whether to proceed or halt.","Both companies had poured vast amounts of capital into it, and it all went down the drain.","At that moment, Ye Qiusuo produced another product, casually remarking, \"There were still some issues with the previous one that weren't resolved. Now it's ready.\"","No one knew that the hard-earned achievements from back then contained flaws.","And Ye Qiusuo had known about the researchers' issues from the start; she had just pretended not to.","Back then, Zhao Guiyin understood one thing: a person whose intellect borders on the supernatural only calculates others based on whether they are willing to or not.","\"President Ye, here are last month's reports.\" Zhao Guiyin came in holding a thick stack of papers. He had switched his form of address with unusual smoothness. While others were still calling out 'Professor' or 'Doctor,' he had already started calling her President Ye.","Ye Qiusuo looked up at him and ultimately didn't ask him to change it.","Reports like these could easily be sent directly to a computer, but staring at a screen for too long is bad for the eyes, which is why Zhao Guiyin had printed them out.","As an assistant, he always managed to be meticulous and leave no room for error.","...","\"Xixi, where's the money in your accounts?\" Wei Qi sat facing Xie Xi, somewhat shocked. \"All the money from every account has been withdrawn. What are you planning to do?\"","Xie Xi leaned back in his chair. The warm winter sun streamed through the glass, spilling over him, giving his whole person a lazy, languid air. He took a sip of the hot tea he was holding and said nonchalantly, \"Lent it to someone.\"","Wei Qi: \"???\"","She suddenly remembered the early days when a celebrity had been scammed and couldn't help but take a sharp breath. This money was basically everything Xie Xi had saved up over all these years. Just the interest alone was an astronomical figure, and now...","\"Call the police, Xixi. It's not too late to call the police now.\" Wei Qi stood up abruptly. \"For a telecom fraud case involving such a large amount, the police will definitely investigate immediately.\"","Xie Xi: \"Telecom fraud?\"","Wei Qi was exasperated. \"No matter what the other person says, anyone asking for money is a scammer!\"","Xie Xi slowly finished the hot tea in his cup. \"Is Professor Ye a scammer too?\"","Wei Qi: \"???\" What does Professor Ye have to do with this?","After a moment, Wei Qi finally grasped Xie Xi's meaning. \"You... Professor Ye borrowed money from you? What does she need such a large sum for?\"","\"Don't know.\" Xie Xi knew nothing, having answered none of the questions. Back then, when she asked to borrow it, he just agreed. Ye Qiusuo had even carefully drafted a contract for him. Xie Xi signed it casually without even glancing at it.","Wei Qi: \"...\"","Knowing it was Ye Qiusuo put Wei Qi's mind slightly more at ease.","Professor Ye couldn't possibly be running a scam. Finding her would be easy enough.","\"You signed a contract? Let me see it.\" Wei Qi still wasn't fully reassured. It was such an enormous sum. After Xie Xi withdrew it, the bank had even sent people through indirect channels to sound out the situation.","Xie Xi went upstairs, dug out the contract, and tossed it to his agent. \"She said she'd pay it back within two years.\"","Wei Qi started reading it carefully, growing more and more astonished as she went. \"Xixi, did you draft this contract?\"","Curled up in a soft armchair, his long legs folded, Xie Xi said lazily, \"No.\"","His attention was fixed on the tree outside the window. The plum blossoms seemed to be blooming.","After finishing the entire contract, Wei Qi wore an expression of speechless complexity. Looking at the interest rate, it was clearly usurious.","If Xie Xi were the one borrowing the money, Wei Qi would have been furious.","And this Professor Ye, what did she need such a huge loan for anyway?","Wait, since when had their relationship become this close?","Wei Qi was just about to ask Xie Xi when she realized he had fallen asleep just like that.","\"...\"","What Wei Qi didn't know was that it was precisely because their relationship wasn't particularly close and their fields were different that Ye Qiusuo had asked Xie Xi for the loan in the first place.","When borrowing the money, Ye Qiusuo had even already prepared her strategy, planning how to persuade him.","In the end, Xie Xi agreed without even asking a single question. Even now, he still didn't know how high the two-year interest would amount to.","...","The major purge at Tianqiu Tech was common knowledge within the industry. There was even talk that Tianqiu was about to collapse, as the Mogu incident had already damaged Tianqiu Tech's reputation, dragging down their other products.","However, just as everyone thought Tianqiu Tech was about to decline, Ye Qiusuo's project was completed.","— The Smart Medical Watch.","A watch capable of detecting over a hundred common illnesses was launched."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45","paragraphs":["The emergence of smart medical watches is, in fact, inseparable from the rapid development in various fields in recent years. What Ye Qiusuo seized by launching this product was the first-mover advantage in integration.","Such a novel item naturally wouldn't sell like hotcakes right from the start. Moreover, Tianqiu Technology had been involved in a scandal not long ago. Many outsiders were saying that what Tianqiu launched wasn't a smart medical watch, but a product to test one's IQ, claiming that anyone who bought it was a fool.","The watch face of this product is somewhat similar to the sports watches currently on the market—a small waterproof black screen with several designs like round and square shapes. The watch straps come in a wide variety and are quite stylish. As for the price, it's not outrageous, costing around three to four thousand.","Some young people who love electronic products were the first to try it out and bought one. Others, who aren't short on money, didn't believe the claims about detecting illnesses, but finding the design of this Tianqiu watch appealing, bought it anyway.","Even so, the sales were just mediocre.","The turning point came a month later.","The reality show \"Their Lives\" began airing.","Even before it was broadcast, it had already caused a sensation, trending on hot search lists countless times. Countless people were urging the production team to film faster, as they were desperate to see Xie Xi and You Feibai.","[What kind of divine pairing is this, my two favorite male gods!!!]","[Please, production team, be decent and release it earlier!]","In short, it was a hit before it even aired.","Later on, perhaps unable to withstand the public's enthusiasm or for other reasons, the show, originally scheduled for a later release, quietly went online.","[???]","[What's going on? This isn't a trailer? An hour and a half?!]","It turned out people had been clicking on the trailer every day to get their fix. Who would have thought that upon clicking, they'd find the show had suddenly premiered.","What viewers saw upon entering was You Feibai and Xu Qingwei meeting in a car—a multi-seat business van with the two sitting in the very back. Outside the frame was presumably the follow-up director.","\"Our first visit is to Xie Xi's home, but we haven't contacted him to say we're coming today.\" The follow-up director's voice held a hint of laughter. \"We'll surprise him later and see what Xie Xi is usually like in his daily life.\"","\"I haven't seen Little Xie in a long time.\" Xu Qingwei also smiled. \"At this time of day, he's probably writing songs or something.\"","Mid-morning, usually a time for work.","The follow-up director turned the camera towards another young and handsome man in the car: \"Feibai, what do you usually do at this hour?\"","You Feibai's face is perfectly suited for the big screen—handsome and rugged in just the right measure, avoiding any hint of effeminacy or excessive roughness. He looked up, his narrow, deep-set eyes dark and expressive: \"When I don't have work, I usually read scripts or watch films.\"","\"Director Xu's mission this time is to take everyone on a tour of Xie Xi's home.\"","The production team's surprise attack naturally aimed to capture something fresh.","Then, the audience watched as the group stood outside a door and knocked. Someone came out holding a phone, opened the door, barely glanced at them, simply said \"come in,\" then turned and went back inside.","[Who is that?]","[Ahhh, that's Xi Xi's assistant, Zhang Dong! Is Xi Xi inside? Can I see Xi Xi wearing just pants?!]","Among the three guests, Xie Xi and You Feibai both have massive fan bases. At this moment, half the viewers didn't know who Xie Xi's assistant Zhang Dong was, though of course, some were fans of both.","Once inside, the screen was filled with sofas and soft rugs. Even the post-production team added subtitles: [Looks very sleepable~]","[Wrong door, right??? This definitely can't be Xie Xi's home.]","[Ooooh, this is my dream house! You can collapse and sleep as soon as you walk in!]","[This is Xie Xi's place? He seems... quite that refined type.]","This was the general impression people had of Xie Xi: a great singer, good-looking, a bit of a bad temper, and likely living in a high-end, luxurious style.","[Hahahaha, the focus should be on Director Xu and Feibai's expressions. Xie Xi is amazing, he even shocked Feibai.]","Not only that, when the camera finally landed on Xie Xi sitting on the sofa, everyone was stunned. What work? He was playing video games.","When Xie Xi noticed the extra crowd in his room, everyone's gaze and the camera lens fell on his feet.","Xie Xi was wearing a pair of wildly colorful toe socks, each toe featuring a different pattern.","[OMG hahahaha! Link, please! I want these socks too!!!]","[Ooooh, Xi Xi can't be this cute! nosebleed emoji]","The entire barrage of comments was in a state of shock and uproarious laughter.","Hot search topics were immediately arranged.","Xie Xi's home looks sleepable","[I really never would have imagined Xie Xi's home being like this. It looks so comfortable to sleep in! He really knows how to enjoy life!]","[Suddenly feeling a bit like a casual fan turning into a real one. Compared to those high-end mansions, this feels much more lived-in.]","[This reality show is too good! They really did a surprise attack, look how startled my Xi Xi is.]","The first episode captivated viewers right from the start, attracting many spontaneous fans, and the audience instantly flooded in.","Seeing them later enter Xie Xi's toy room had everyone laughing even harder. No one expected a whole room full of squeaky toys—stepping or squeezing them by accident would make sounds. Even funnier was that they all had names.","[Is this still the Xie Xi I know?]","[I always thought Xie Xi was temperamental and cold towards people, but he's like this in private???]","[People commenting earlier clearly aren't familiar with Xi Xi. Those who know him know his temper is only for those who are unreasonable.]","[Finally, the secret that our Xi Xi is a big sweetheart can't be hidden anymore?!]","Throughout the first episode, the show's highlights basically revolved around Xie Xi. This wasn't intentional; it was mainly because there was so much usable footage of him. After touring all three homes, the laughs mostly came from him.","Viewers felt pity seeing him wandering confused in the supermarket. Then, when Xie Xi picked one of each type of chili pepper, and the auntie responsible for weighing gave him a deeply conflicted look while placing that one tiny red bird's eye chili on the scale, everyone burst out laughing.","[They can even weigh a chili pepper that small? Learned something new.]","[Good thing they didn't put the price sticker directly on this chili. Otherwise, peeling it off would take a layer of skin, and this chili would have just been for smelling, hahahaha!]","[Has he never been to a supermarket? He's missed out on so much joy.]","Unaware of the audience's teasing, Xie Xi happily bought the chilies home. Unsurprisingly, You Feibai and Xu Qingwei were dumbfounded, but they were still chilies. Even if the resulting dish wasn't pretty, it was edible.","[Sniff, Feibai is so amazing, he can even cook! A true homebody, good man.]","After this episode aired, it almost swept aside all other programs. Unlike previous shows like \"Tomorrow's Star\" or \"Knowledge Q&A,\" this reality show was a genuine blockbuster hit, experiencing a sudden, explosive surge in viewership without any promotion.","Want to be a toy in Xie Xi's home / Is You Feibai's cooking delicious?","After the first episode finished airing, a string of hot search topics appeared, several related to them. Clicking into each one revealed super high discussion and repost volumes.","[I want so badly to be a toy in Xie Xi's home, to be squeezed by him every day, to be called by him in that tender, lingering voice...]","[We humans are worse off than toys, wuwuwuwu]","[I want to eat Feibai's cooking. It looks really delicious.]","[Even if it's not tasty, I could still eat it. After all, Feibai made it himself. I wonder who will get to enjoy that privilege in the future.]","Due to the success of the premiere, the production team urgently reviewed their later-stage plans overnight. After all, their show was on the verge of becoming a massive hit. There are plenty of famous shows, but truly phenomenally popular ones are rare. Currently, \"Their Lives\" had only aired its first episode but was already showing this potential. Who wouldn't be on edge?","The location for recording the second episode was also decided after repeated discussions by the production team. They planned to film a scenario of the celebrities shopping in their daily lives.","Clothes, shoes, jewelry—putting together a full outfit for a banquet hosted by the production team that evening.","No payment was needed; the various stores in the mall would provide the items, also taking the opportunity for some advertising.","The production team had only one requirement: authenticity.","They hoped the three celebrities would shop just as they normally would.","To achieve the best effect, they even dispensed with camera crews following them. Instead, they refitted the entire five-story mall with high-definition surveillance cameras, as the mall's original ones weren't clear enough.","Xie Xi was dragged there early in the morning, still drowsy. He let his assistant and life manager pick for him, changing into outfit after outfit.","It wasn't that they looked bad; on the contrary, every single one looked good, making it hard to choose.","Each time Xie Xi changed and came out, Zhang Dong would stand opposite him to take photos. After seven or eight changes, Zhang Dong handed his phone over for Xie Xi to pick.","\"This one.\" Xie Xi casually swiped and chose a set.","Then came the shoes.","Once the clothes were chosen, picking shoes was easier.","\"Still missing a watch,\" He Feng said after looking him up and down.","The watches were on another floor. Xie Xi followed them onto the escalator. His hair, not yet styled, was a bit messy, strands falling loosely across his forehead, giving him a carefree look.","You Feibai happened to be coming up from another escalator, presumably also heading to pick a watch.","Xie Xi lazily greeted him.","The floors were quite high, and the escalator ride was long. Bored, Xie Xi looked around and suddenly spotted a store sign on the upper floor that read 'Tianqiu Technology'.","\"Xixi, the watches are on the fifth floor.\" He Feng and Zhang Dong stepped off the escalator one after the other. They had reached the fourth floor and were heading to another up escalator.","\"I'm going to check that place out,\" Xie Xi said casually, pointing to the left.","The entire mall, apart from the counter staff, had no other customers. It was completely closed off just for the three of them to pick an outfit.","As they spoke, You Feibai also arrived. He cast a brief glance at Xie Xi's retreating figure but showed no curiosity and didn't follow, proceeding directly to the fifth floor.","Xie Xi walked under the sign for 'Tianqiu Technology'. There was a counter here displaying the company's products from recent years.","\"Take these few watches out, let me try them on,\" Xie Xi said, looking down at the newly arrived watches in the glass counter.","He Feng caught up and, seeing him trying on this type of watch, made a face as if constipated: \"Xixi, you're wearing a suit today. You should still go to the fifth floor to pick a proper watch.\"","A watch was the kind of accessory that best showcased a man's status and position, especially with You Feibai—whose figure and looks were no less impressive than Xie Xi's—also on the show.","Xie Xi nonchalantly switched to another stylish watch: \"This one looks pretty good.\"","The counter staff seized the chance to advertise: \"This is our company's latest medical watch. It can detect hundreds of common illnesses and also reminds you of potential health issues.\"","Xie Xi picked out a watch, put it on his wrist, and didn't take it off: \"I've chosen.\"","He Feng: \"...\"","He Feng looked carefully. Although it was a bit of a mismatched style, on Xie Xi's wrist, it didn't look bad.","Xie Xi then took two more watches to give to He Feng and Zhang Dong, and asked the counter to run his card.","The items he was wearing were free, but anything extra still had to be paid for.","He Feng had no choice but to put hers on.","The counter staff eagerly gathered around to help them set up the data. Just after adjusting it, the watch on He Feng's wrist started making sounds, alerting her to a health issue.","He Feng immediately turned the sound off: \"...I already went to the hospital the day before yesterday. I'm on medication.\""]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46","paragraphs":["Xie Xi made an unexpected detour to the electronics floor and picked out a watch. When he came down, Xu Qingwei's gaze fell on his wrist, and she couldn't help but ask curiously why he was wearing that kind of watch.","Xie Xi simply said it looked nice, offering no further explanation.","But once the show aired, it inadvertently served as an unofficial advertisement for Tianqiu Tech.","Last time, the items that sold out online were some screaming toys. This time, while not exactly selling out, the sales figures for this watch model showed a noticeable increase.","As sales went up, the probability of detecting issues naturally increased. A few days later, a blogger suddenly posted a long Weibo post, tagging Tianqiu Tech's official account to thank them for developing this watch, and also tagging Xie Xi, saying her idol had saved her life.","People were puzzled and clicked in to read.","This blogger had nearly a million followers. She was a skilled illustrator, a fan of Xie Xi, and initially gained popularity by frequently drawing fan art of him.","Whenever Xie Xi had a new show, this blogger would watch it immediately. She would search for and buy any product related to Xie Xi on Taobao. After watching the new episode of \"Their Lives\" and seeing Xie Xi choose a watch costing three to four thousand yuan, she was instantly captivated.","She couldn't casually buy those watches costing hundreds of thousands or millions, but this one was a luxury she could afford.","She placed the order that very night. The watch arrived the next day, and she immediately set it up, putting it on with delight.","The watch required setting an emergency contact, which the manual stated was for accident prevention.","The illustrator wasn't close to many people. Besides working on commissions in her rented apartment, she had almost no friends. Usually, only colleagues who were urgently chasing her for manuscripts would come by.","She thought for a long time, unsure who to set as the emergency contact. Just then, a colleague from above was pressing for the manuscript, so she informed them and set the contact as this colleague she rarely saw, maybe once every few months.","Once she received the commission details, the illustrator started working day and night. She drew until her vision went dark, a sharp pain struck her chest, and she collapsed headfirst onto the floor.","The watch on her wrist detected the abnormality and immediately dialed the emergency contact. The colleague was asleep at home. After hanging up the late-night call, it rang again shortly after. When no one spoke, the colleague realized something was wrong and rushed to the illustrator's home, shocked to find her on the floor with a head injury.","Fortunately, the arrival was timely; had it waited until morning, she might have bled out.","As soon as she recovered, the illustrator immediately posted a long Weibo. First, to thank her idol and Tianqiu Tech for the watch, and second, to warn others not to keep such irregular hours.","【Is this for real? Isn't this watch just an IQ tax?】","【I bought one a few days ago for my grandma. The blood sugar alerts and other reminders are really convenient.】","【As a doctor, I can genuinely recommend this watch. Technology has indeed advanced. For common conditions, detecting surface symptoms can now allow for early warnings.】","...","Because of this blogger's long post, another wave of users bought the watch, finding it impressive. For a time, it became a trend: giving Tianqiu Tech watches as gifts was a must. The watch seemed suitable for all age groups.","\"...So, Xie Xi inadvertently promoted it on the show?\" Ye Qiusuo asked after hearing the company's investigation results.","The watch sales had risen unusually during this period, so she had asked someone to look into the cause.","\"Yes, and a blogger also posted a long article promoting our watch.\"","The company's marketing department was also stunned. The watch hadn't been out long, and they hadn't even started advertising yet. Sales suddenly shot up at a near-vertical angle. After investigating, they realized it was because of Xie Xi.","\"Perhaps we could seize the opportunity and ask Xie Xi to be our spokesperson.\" The marketing department had already discussed it. They had felt rather idle at the company over the past few years, having only placed webpage ads. They had never had a real celebrity endorser.","Ye Qiusuo rejected the proposal: \"The company has no money to spend on a spokesperson. Since sales are already up, we just need to perfect the system.\"","Tianqiu Tech had never used celebrity endorsers, relying solely on word-of-mouth to attract customers, except for the recent damage to its reputation from the mushroom incident.","When Ye Qiusuo had some free time later, she curiously opened \"Their Lives\" to see how Xie Xi had done the promotion.","That night, for the first time ever, Professor Ye wasted three hours on a variety show instead of working.","...","The facts proved that competitors weren't so willing to let Tianqiu Tech rise again easily. Now, whenever any positive news about the watch surfaced, the comments below would inevitably be flooded with people bringing up the mushroom incident to smear Tianqiu Tech.","Although there was some exaggeration, it was true that the mushrooms caused hallucinations and led to incidents.","Ye Qiusuo personally stood at the company entrance to invite the original team members back, hoping they could eliminate the side effects of the mushrooms.","Professor Ye had never intended to abandon the medical mushroom project from the start. As Zhang Chengjue had said earlier, the profits in the medical field were too high, and everyone wanted a bite.","Other companies had even obtained samples of the medical mushrooms earlier and were privately researching them, hoping to replicate them.","When Zeng Liqing walked back into the lab, his eyes were slightly red. As a researcher, everyone dreams of a good laboratory, and Tianqiu Tech was indeed a leader in this regard. He remembered the excellent atmosphere when he first joined. It was a pity...","But now with Ye Qiusuo in control of the company, things should get better.","\"Once the company's funds recover, we'll build a separate building on the empty land next door, dedicated to your biotechnology work.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed to the vacant lot on the left.","\"Good, I'll look forward to it.\" Zeng Liqing felt a surge of emotion, reigniting the fighting spirit he had when he first joined.","For a company to operate, money is paramount. The huge sum Ye Qiusuo borrowed from Xie Xi had already been fully invested in the company. The research team underwent a major overhaul, useless projects were scrapped, but new projects also required funding.","Ye Qiusuo prioritized funding for crucial projects. After going back and forth, she found her new project once again facing a broken funding chain.","No money.","Every day when Professor Ye woke up, her first thought was poverty.","As time passed, the company gradually got back on track, but her new project still couldn't get funding.","\"Professor Ye, someone is here to see you.\"","As soon as Ye Qiusuo entered the office building, the security guard at the entrance greeted her.","When she went to her office, she found two middle-aged men sitting inside, discussing something in low voices.","\"You were looking for me?\" Ye Qiusuo assessed the two men. They didn't look like parents or researchers.","\"Professor Ye, this is the director of 'The Lake,' and I'm the producer,\" said the shorter middle-aged man in a black cotton-padded jacket with a smile. \"We'd like to invite you to make a cameo appearance as a character in our series.\"","As a professor with daily work and various responsibilities, Ye Qiusuo almost had the refusal on her lips.","But Rong Shiyun's words suddenly echoed in her mind: The entertainment industry is the fastest way to make money.","\"I don't know how to act,\" Professor Ye said, gesturing for the two to sit, clearly indicating she was open to discussion.","The director smiled and said, \"Our series is set in the late Republican era. Professor Ye would only need to make a cameo as a professor—it's practically your own profession.\"","They sought out Ye Qiusuo, naturally because she possessed the aura of a scholar from that era. Furthermore, she was good-looking and well-liked by audiences, having been quite famous recently. The director felt she was more than suitable for this role.","\"Besides, no one knows how to act from the very beginning. Our series has many newcomers, and with ample budget and time, we can take it slow and polish things.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned slightly; her time wasn't that plentiful.","\"What about the filming schedule?\" Ye Qiusuo taught at a university and had winter and summer vacations. She completed her university tasks quickly, not requiring much time, and the dean had specifically reduced her administrative burdens from the start, so she didn't have to handle many things.","As for her research projects, those already on track only needed her review once a week, with people below taking care of them. Projects that hadn't gotten off the ground had all stopped due to lack of funding.","These two people certainly came prepared.","\"We can start filming soon. The cast is mostly set, with only the professor role left.\" The director had thought it through carefully. \"Professor Ye's scenes can be filmed first.\"","Ye Qiusuo calculated the time and found it feasible, so she asked about the compensation. Her direct manner didn't surprise the two, clearly indicating they had done their homework before coming.","Fortunately, the timing worked out, the pay was substantial, and Professor Ye signed on without much hesitation.","...","\"After you go home, read more papers. Remember to check the journals I pointed out every month.\"","Before the term ended, Ye Qiusuo called her students into the classroom for a meeting, specifically outlining the reading materials.","She quite liked these students; they were motivated and not rigid.","They had recently won first place in a competition, reportedly breaking records set by previous seniors. However, the department head had scoffed, saying Ye Qiusuo had an unfair advantage because she took her students to Celestial Sphere Tech.","Ye Qiusuo paid no mind. A win was a win. Why wouldn't she use the resources she had for her students? Besides, other advisors weren't without their own methods, taking students to visit companies where they held positions. The department head himself didn't prioritize his students, and after losing, he resented others for having resources.","Professor Ye didn't understand that kind of thinking and stopped dwelling on it.","\"Professor, have you watched 'Their Lives'? Xixi is in it too!\"","Before leaving, Sun Jiajia tried to make a recommendation.","Sigh, one an outsider to the industry, the other an insider—shipping them as a couple wasn't easy.","\"Let's go.\" Lin Lu pulled Sun Jiajia away by the collar, lest she annoy their professor.","Professor Ye closed her meeting notebook, a faint smile appearing at the corner of her lips, clearly reminded of Xie Xi's performance in the show.","So childish.","...","Just a few days into the winter break, Ye Qiusuo received a notification to report to the film set.","Ye Qiusuo had never been to a set before and didn't know what to prepare, so she just went directly.","Fortunately, they weren't filming immediately but preparing for the opening ceremony.","Ye Qiusuo wasn't a lead actor, so she only needed to offer incense from the back, unlike the main cast who also had to pray to the deities.","\"Are you Professor Ye?\"","Standing to the side, Ye Qiusuo had already been asked the same question by several staff members. She nodded.","\"Are you here to film too?\"","\"Yes.\"","Hearing her reply, two girls nearby covered their mouths, their faces blushing as they giggled.","Professor Ye didn't notice, however. Her gaze was fixed on the person kneeling in worship: Was Wan Yurou also filming in this series?","\"Lake\"?","Ye Qiusuo thought about it. In the original book, she forgot the name of the movie Wan Yurou filmed, only knowing the other male lead was the powerful, deeply devoted supporting male character from the original story.","That supporting male character was called...","\"Is that You Feibai?\" Ye Qiusuo pointed at the man in the very center, kneeling alongside the director, and asked a nearby staff member.","The staff member glanced at the person Ye Qiusuo pointed to. \"Yes, that's You Feibai. They say our director spent over half a year persuading him before the film emperor agreed to come.\"","After speaking, she looked back at Professor Ye, her face blushing again.","Professor Ye had an even more commanding aura than on TV! Her legs felt weak."]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47","paragraphs":["After the various procedures of the opening ceremony, those behind only needed to follow and offer incense. Just as Ye Qiusuo had inserted her incense stick, the director called her over.","\"Professor Ye, these are the main actors of 'The Lake'. They will be playing your students in the show.\"","In the drama, Ye Qiusuo also played a professor, while the protagonists were a group of students fighting for freedom and their country.","Her role wasn't extensive, but the director respected scholars, so he specifically introduced them.","Ye Qiusuo nodded and shook hands with each of them.","\"Speaking of which, Professor Ye should know Yurou, as you were on the same program before,\" the director suddenly said with a laugh after seeing Ye Qiusuo shake hands with Wan Yurou.","\"The previous recording was quite rushed, so I didn't really get a chance to speak with Professor Ye,\" Wan Yurou also smiled. \"It's fate that we're working together again on this shoot.\"","Ye Qiusuo did not engage further.","\"This is Feibai,\" the director pointed to the handsome man next to him and continued the introductions. \"He plays Fang Zhouyue.\"","The two shook hands politely, without further conversation.","\"We can start filming tomorrow. Let's all look out for each other then. If you have any problems, feel free to come to me,\" the director said after the introductions before heading off to attend to other matters.","After the group photo was taken, Ye Qiusuo prepared to leave as well, intending to go home and wrap up some loose ends from the university.","She had just driven out when suddenly a car swerved out from her right side and slammed directly into her car.","If that car had hit her head-on, she probably would have gone straight to meet Marx.","She immediately stepped on the accelerator to surge forward while turning the steering wheel hard to evade.","The other vehicle was a large, fast-moving van. Even though Ye Qiusuo spotted it and reacted extremely quickly, the rear half of her car was still smashed to pieces.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","She sat in the car for a moment to collect herself. Without even getting out, she already knew whose car it was.","You Feibai.","It was only after the collision that Ye Qiusuo remembered this plot point.","On the day of 'The Lake's' opening ceremony, someone had tampered with You Feibai's van, causing the driver to lose control. It eventually crashed into a wall.","You Feibai, sitting in the back without a seatbelt, was thrown against the seat and knocked unconscious. It was the female lead, Wan Yurou, who helped him out, and from then on, the male supporting character remained deeply devoted to her.","And now, the newly added Professor Ye, driving her car, had become that wall.","Fortunately, Ye Qiusuo reacted swiftly; only the rear section of her car was destroyed. She pushed the door open and got out, looking at the two crashed vehicles. The other party was fully at fault for this accident.","Several people from the other car also got out, seemingly uninjured. You Feibai was momentarily stunned upon seeing Ye Qiusuo and was about to say something when he was interrupted.","\"This is my WeChat. You can transfer the compensation directly here,\" Professor Ye said, opening WeChat and adding You Feibai. Then she turned to leave.","The car was wrecked beyond any point of worthwhile repair, and Ye Qiusuo didn't want to waste time on it.","You Feibai called after her, \"Are you... sure you don't want to go to the hospital and get checked?\"","Given the significant size difference between the two vehicles and the devastating scene of Ye Qiusuo's car, her simply adding his WeChat and leaving, as if the accident hadn't fazed her at all, was surprising.","Ye Qiusuo turned back and pointed at her car. \"I'm not injured. I just hope for a prompt resolution regarding the compensation.\"","Professor Ye didn't have much money to buy a new car; she could only wait for the compensation payment.","\"What happened?\" The assistant who had gotten out from the other car was already questioning the driver.","\"I don't know. The brakes and accelerator seemed to malfunction,\" the driver said fearfully. If the other car hadn't reacted so quickly, he might have been responsible for a death.","Seeing the crowd gathering, You Feibai frowned. \"Call the police and retrieve the dashcam footage.\"","He then turned and left to borrow a car from the director, brushing past Wan Yurou who was standing to the side.","...","\"What about the parking lot surveillance?\"","\"The police have already taken it, but we managed to get a copy beforehand.\"","You Feibai had his assistant play it.","\"A man in a hat tampered with our car. The surveillance didn't capture his face,\" the assistant said, his expression grim. This had been far too dangerous.","\"Right.\"","The incident couldn't be covered up, what with the police report and investigation. It made it to the trending searches that very night: You Feibai in a car accident after the opening ceremony.","A movie star being in a car accident instantly caused an uproar.","Some gossip accounts, having obtained on-scene photos of the crash from unknown sources, posted pictures of the two severely damaged vehicles, making netizens gasp.","[Is Feibai okay? How did he crash out of the blue?]","[Feibai doesn't seem injured.]","[Was it that white car speeding in the parking lot that caused the collision?]","[Don't they know the basic rule of driving slowly in parking lots? The white car owner should bear full responsibility.]","[Could it be a sasaeng fan chasing the car? This isn't the first time.]","[Inside info: the white car owner is Professor Ye.]","[???]","As time passed, more information surfaced, including a photo taken by a passerby. It showed not only a complete picture of both cars but also Ye Qiusuo standing nearby, both of them holding their phones.","Once this photo emerged, the previously one-sided blame directed at the white car owner paused.","[The white car owner is Professor Ye? It was probably an accidental collision, right?]","[Someone with years of accident investigation experience here. The damage patterns absolutely indicate one vehicle was moving at high speed. Otherwise, the white car wouldn't be so severely damaged.]","[I heard You Feibai crashed into Professor Ye's car because his own vehicle had been tampered with.]","You Feibai's popularity was immense; the hashtag for the car accident was marked with an 'explosive' symbol. Netizens began speculating about his relationship with Ye Qiusuo.","Finally, You Feibai's studio issued a statement on Weibo, clarifying that their vehicle had malfunctioned, leading to the collision with Ye Qiusuo's car. The police were already investigating the cause, and they urged everyone to refrain from further speculation.","Xie Xi heard about the trending search just before bed, as his assistant, holding a phone, read the headlines from top to bottom.","He only asked Zhang Dong to click and read the ones that piqued his interest.","Listening to the stream of headlines, Xie Xi found none of them interesting and wasn't particularly concerned about You Feibai's accident either.","If it was just called a 'car accident,' it meant no injuries—probably not even a scratch. Otherwise, the headline would have been 'You Feibai injured in car crash.'","Xie Xi wasn't interested, but Zhang Dong was. After reading a headline, he clicked in to take a peek himself. \"Brother Xi,\" he gossiped, \"You Feibai crashed into Professor Ye's car.\"","Xie Xi, who had been about to rest, immediately looked up at Zhang Dong upon hearing 'Professor Ye.' \"What did you say?\"","Zhang Dong promptly read You Feibai's studio's Weibo post aloud to him.","Halfway through, Xie Xi lost patience. \"Was she hurt?\"","\"Seems not. There's a photo here too,\" Zhang Dong said, showing Xie Xi the picture of the two exchanging WeChat contacts.","Seeing the person in the photo was unharmed, Xie Xi let out a sigh of relief.","He returned to his room. After a while, he got up again, opened his phone, and scrolled through the pictures under that Weibo post. Just looking at the collision marks on the two cars told him how severe the impact must have been.","Xie Xi tossed and turned for a long time but ultimately exited WeChat.","...","Despite the accident, filming had to proceed as scheduled.","Ye Qiusuo's car was gone, so she had to take a taxi there the next day. When she arrived at the film crew, people around her sized her up to some extent. After all, she was one of the parties involved in the car accident the day before.","\"Professor Ye,\" You Feibai stood up, still holding the script in his hand. \"I'm sorry about what happened yesterday.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't really care. The other party didn't do it on purpose. The person who tampered with the car seemed to have been caught later. It was a fan of a female celebrity who had once collaborated with You Feibai. Since the gossip about You Feibai and the female celebrity spread, the fan had always harbored hatred.","Ye Qiusuo went back and flipped through the notes she had taken last night. There was no mention of this person in it. She might only remember what happened in the original book when it was about to happen or had already happened.","You Feibai nodded to his assistant, and the assistant immediately brought a bank card. \"There is compensation money in this card. The password is six 1s.\"","Ye Qiusuo calmly took the bank card.","\"Also, here are the keys to my car. It's parked nearby. I'd like to lend it to you for some time. I hope it won't cause you any trouble.\" You Feibai was very tactful in handling things. There was a period between buying a car and getting the license plate, so he offered his car.","Ye Qiusuo glanced at the keys in his hand and refused. \"No need. A temporary license plate will do.\"","While they were talking, the staff around them would look over from time to time, obviously curious about what they were talking about, especially with the bank card involved.","However, Professor Ye soon walked away and was pulled to change clothes.","\"Brother Feibai, were you okay in the car accident yesterday?\" The leading actress, Li Yandie, came over and asked.","\"I'm fine.\" You Feibai put away the car keys in his hand, his eyes looking profound.","Two hours later, all the actors' costumes were finally ready. It was the first time for them to shoot a film, so there had to be some running - in. They first shot the scene where the male lead, the female lead and several others skipped classes. Ye Qiusuo watched from the side, observing the shots and the actors' performances.","Compared with shooting endorsements, it was much more difficult. There were more shots, repeated walk - throughs again and again, and repeated lines, which could easily drain one's energy.","Ye Qiusuo watched several scenes. From morning until after lunch, it was finally her turn to shoot.","\"Professor Ye, just think of this place as a school. Don't feel awkward,\" the director instructed before the shooting. \"Just ignore us here.\"","Except for the area within the camera range, the surrounding was full of staff. An ordinary person would really feel awkward.","Considering that it was Ye Qiusuo's first time shooting a film, the director chose a relatively simple scene. It was the scene where this professor first entered the classroom and gave a lecture to the students. There were not many lines and no significant emotional changes.","Ye Qiusuo had changed into a light - blue long gown and worn a short - hair wig. She was tall. Although the long gown didn't show off her figure, she looked neat and elegant.","She pushed the door open and entered. In the classroom, the students' voices gradually died down as they curiously looked at her.","At this time, the camera was not only focused on Ye Qiusuo but also on the male lead, the female lead and several others.","\"From today on, I'll be your teacher, Pei Jinxi.\"","...","They shot this short scene four times in a row before it was finally passed. The film shots were different from the endorsement shots. Ye Qiusuo only found the right feeling on the third take.","\"Why is there a problem at this time? It was supposed to be a cameo. Where can we find someone else now?\"","Before leaving, Ye Qiusuo heard the director talking to the assistant director. Their voices were a bit loud.","\"We can postpone it for a few more days. I'll look for other suitable people.\"","\"Alright, alright, you look for them. I'll go and ask around again.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't know what problem they had encountered. She withdrew her gaze and slowly walked out of the studio avenue, planning to take a taxi back.","\"Teacher, what a coincidence.\"","A silver - gray car smoothly pulled up beside Ye Qiusuo. The rear window rolled down, and Xie Xi's extremely good - looking face appeared in front of Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo was stunned for a moment and then said, \"Good evening.\""]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48","paragraphs":["\"How did you end up here?\" Xie Xi asked. He had come to take some photos and didn't expect to see Ye Qiusuo when he was leaving.","\"Filming.\"","Not only Xie Xi, but even Zhang Dong, who was driving in front, instinctively looked over at Ye Qiusuo.","\"You're filming here?\" Xie Xi was stunned, as Professor Ye wasn't part of the entertainment industry.","\"Mhm, playing a professor.\" Ye Qiusuo glanced into the distance; she hadn't seen any taxis coming or going for a long time.","Xie Xi pushed open the car door on one side and looked up at Ye Qiusuo standing outside. \"Do you want to ride out with us? It's very hard to get a taxi here at night.\"","The film and television city was in the suburbs. There were cars during the day, but by night, taxis became much scarcer, and even ride-hailing apps were hard to find.","\"Are you heading back to the city?\" Ye Qiusuo asked.","Xie Xi shifted over to the other side before turning his head. \"Yes.\"","Only then did Ye Qiusuo get into the car. As soon as she entered, she caught a whiff of a light, masculine fragrance.","The door closed, and the car started moving.","\"Professor, you have something here.\" Xie Xi leaned halfway against the armrest, looking at Ye Qiusuo. He extended his fair, slender finger and lightly tapped his own lips.","Professor Ye, who was usually focused solely on making money and working on projects, turned to look at Xie Xi's overly attractive lips. For a moment, she didn't process what he was saying, only thinking: What did he put on his lips? They're so red.","\"Professor?\"","Xie Xi's voice, tinged with confusion, sounded in the car once more.","Ye Qiusuo finally snapped out of it. \"What?\"","Xie Xi had no choice but to reach out and touch her lips. \"There seems to be something here.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned and leaned her head back, then wiped the spot with the back of her hand. It was the lipstick from the set earlier—a pale, slightly purplish shade. In the movie, this professor was not in good health. After filming wrapped, everyone removed their makeup. Professor Ye, without a dedicated assistant or makeup artist, had found some makeup remover and wiped it off hastily, not getting it all.","Xie Xi turned on the dome light and rummaged through a box his life manager kept in the car. He pulled out a clean cotton pad and handed it to Ye Qiusuo. \"Use this to wipe it off.\"","There was no mirror in the back seat. Ye Qiusuo wiped haphazardly, feeling it was clean enough.","\"The makeup here doesn't seem to be fully removed.\" Xie Xi pointed to the side of her face.","Ye Qiusuo then wiped a few more times based on feel, but Xie Xi still shook his head. Finally, he took out another cotton pad and leaned closer. \"Let me help you.\"","As he leaned in, that light masculine fragrance became even more noticeable.","Professor Ye couldn't identify the scent, only finding it pleasant.","Xie Xi raised his hand and carefully wiped away the remaining makeup on Ye Qiusuo's face. Outwardly calm, his heart was actually starting to race again.","Even through the thin cotton pad, he could feel that her face was nice to touch, not at all like the stern impression she usually gave off.","\"Professor Ye, you must thoroughly remove your makeup to avoid damaging your skin,\" Zhang Dong, who was driving, spoke up, breaking the slightly awkward atmosphere.","Xie Xi: \"...\" This assistant can be thrown away.","He could only withdraw his hand and retreat to his seat, leaning against the car window.","\"Professor Ye, what are you filming here? Was the car accident with Movie King You yesterday here too? Are you both okay? From the pictures I saw, the cars were pretty badly smashed.\" Zhang Dong asked gossipily.","\"Filming 'The Lake' here. The car was wrecked, but people are fine.\" Ye Qiusuo answered each question one by one.","Xie Xi, lazily leaning against the window, had his ears perked up sharp, memorizing everything she said.","\"'The Lake,' Movie King You's film?\" Zhang Dong suddenly remembered. \"Professor Ye, so you're filming together.\"","With Zhang Dong the gossip hound along the way, Xie Xi learned quite a bit of news. This assistant was somewhat useful after all.","\"You can stop here, thanks.\" Ye Qiusuo had them stop outside the residential compound and walked in herself.","Big Star Xie pressed against the car window, watching for a long time. Only when a passerby turned to look at him several times, seemingly about to approach, did he close the window and tell Zhang Dong to drive back.","...","Ye Qiusuo had no scenes the next day, so she went to buy a car, the same series as her previous one.","After getting temporary license plates, she could drive it temporarily, so Ye Qiusuo drove straight to the company.","As soon as she entered the building, she saw Zhang Chengjue waiting there.","Since the failed medical mushroom project last time, after his shares were diluted and he became a dividend-receiving shareholder, he hadn't been to the company for a while.","The first thing Zhang Chengjue said upon seeing Ye Qiusuo was, \"Qiusuo, let's talk.\"","Ye Qiusuo stopped. \"What is it?\"","Zhang Chengjue observed her expression, thinking she seemed her usual self, which put him half at ease. \"What happened before was my fault. I've been reflecting at home all this time. I was too impulsive and took such reckless measures.\" He completely avoided mentioning his previous attitude towards Ye Qiusuo and the matter of privately changing the ID card.","\"So, I want to come back to work. You'll still be in charge of the company.\"","Ye Qiusuo stared at Zhang Chengjue for a moment. Just as he thought he wouldn't get a response, she smiled mildly. \"Alright. Where would you like to work?\"","Zhang Chengjue immediately relaxed. As expected, Ye Qiusuo didn't hold grudges; she only cared about projects.","\"You're managing the company, and it wouldn't be good for me to take a prominent role. I'll start from my old position.\" Zhang Chengjue said, as if making a concession.","\"Fine. Go register with HR.\" Ye Qiusuo agreed.","In less than a day, the news that Zhang Chengjue had returned to work at the company had spread throughout the entire office. Morale became unsettled. Those who had stayed on basically knew what had happened earlier and never thought Zhang Chengjue would come back one day.","Some with wandering minds began to think Ye Qiusuo was just a paper tiger, and her previous win was purely due to having more money.","Zhao Guiyin from the assistant's office heard the news and shook his head, sympathizing with the former boss for a second.","\"Director Ye, should I... keep an eye on Director Zhang?\" Zhao Guiyin asked in a low voice before Ye Qiusuo left the company.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at him and said calmly, \"No need.\"","...","Once familiar, twice at ease. Ye Qiusuo was getting somewhat used to going to the film set. All her scenes were scheduled upfront, so she had scenes to film every time she went.","\"Cut!\" the director called. \"What's going on with the female lead? Where's her presence?\"","This scene involved several students debating with the professor, mainly highlighting the progressive and open-minded thinking of the male and female leads.","You Feibai was okay; after all, he was a Movie King. Once he got the script and lines, he immediately became the student leader of that era. But the female lead was somewhat new, and she always lacked a bit of presence in this scene.","\"I-I'll try harder,\" the actress playing the female lead said, somewhat avoiding Ye Qiusuo's gaze.","She was supposed to play a top student, but when the real professor on set looked at her, she felt insecure inside.","The professor's gaze was downright intimidating.","The director shot several takes back and forth, then shook his head. \"Let Feibai coach you a bit. Don't let your eyes wander all over the place.\"","While the male and female leads discussed, the other actors naturally stopped. Ye Qiusuo went to the side to rest, conveniently near the director.","The director, meanwhile, kept taking and making calls.","\"Schedule conflict? Alright, alright, we'll collaborate next time.\"","\"On vacation? Can't come back? Oh, honeymoon. Okay, okay, congratulations.\"","Sitting nearby, Ye Qiusuo guessed they were probably trying to cast an actor for a role in the drama.","The director hung up the phone and let out a long sigh. He wanted this film to be perfect, which was precisely why he had sought out a real professor. Now, there was a vacant supporting role—a male dan (female impersonator) character. He had specifically arranged for a performance student specializing in opera to take the role. The student had excellent stage presence and captivating eyes, perfectly fitting the character. Unfortunately, the student had suddenly backed out, citing an international competition.","Finding an actor suitable for such a role wasn't easy, especially for just a supporting part. If it were a lead role, there would probably be plenty of people scrambling for it. The director was practically worrying himself gray.","Just then, his phone rang again. Ye Qiusuo glanced over at the director and noticed he was answering the call with a strange expression.","\"Yes, there is such a role. Are you bringing a new talent?\" The director gripped his phone and suddenly stood up. \"Really? Of course, of course it's possible.\"","Ye Qiusuo watched as the director paced in a small circle, his voice excited. \"Acting skills can be honed. If I get the camera angles and lighting right, that's half the battle.\"","An actor's performance isn't solely dependent on themselves; it also relies on the director's vision and framing. Otherwise, there wouldn't be cases where an actor wins awards under one director but gets panned in another project.","Had they found a suitable person?","Listening to the director's rambling, it sounded similar to the pitch he used when signing her on. The other person was probably also someone with no prior acting experience.","After the director finished that call, he gathered the male and female leads, and filming resumed, plunging the crew back into busyness.","...","\"Did he agree?\" Xie Xi sat across from his agent, asking with some nervousness.","\"You can go.\" Wei Qi put down her phone and studied Xie Xi. \"Why the sudden interest in acting?\"","Xie Xi leaned back, feigning nonchalance. \"I've been too idle lately.\"","\"Don't you still have that reality show?\" Wei Qi felt something was off.","\"Lately, I feel like acting.\"","If Zhang Dong had been in the room, he would surely have connected the dots on why Xie Xi wanted to join \"The Lake.\" Unfortunately, he was outside the office, and Wei Qi was also unaware that Professor Ye was part of \"The Lake\" crew.","For this role, Xie Xi didn't even need an audition. The director agreed immediately. Under the pretext of observing and learning, Xie Xi went to the film set the very next day.","He quietly approached the set. A crew member, upon seeing Xie Xi's face, simply waved him through.","Xie Xi looked around. Ye Qiusuo wasn't among those currently filming. After scanning more carefully, he finally spotted her squatting in a corner, a laptop on her knees, wearing headphones.","Moving closer, he realized she was in a meeting.","Xie Xi silently shifted to the side, moving out of Ye Qiusuo's camera view.","After about ten minutes, Ye Qiusuo finally took off her headphones, shut down her computer, and turned around. \"What are you doing here?\" She had already caught a glimpse of Xie Xi flashing past in her video call.","Xie Xi replied with a touch of reserve, \"The director asked me to take on a role. It just happens to be in your crew. What a coincidence.\"","Ye Qiusuo stood up, holding her computer in one hand, and gave him a somewhat odd look. In the end, she didn't mention that she had clearly seen the director being approached about him. Perhaps his agent had actively secured the role for him.","\"How many scenes have you filmed? I've never acted before. Could you guide me later?\" Xie Xi followed behind her and even added, \"...Teacher.\"","\"I'm not very experienced with acting either,\" Ye Qiusuo said, slowing her pace to look at Xie Xi. \"You could ask someone else to guide you.\"","\"I'll just watch you all film for now,\" Xie Xi changed the subject. \"Your company's watches are quite good.\"","Bringing that up, Ye Qiusuo said earnestly, \"I still have to thank you for that impromptu advertisement during the show. Our sales shot straight up.\"","\"I was just casually looking at it,\" Xie Xi said with surface-level humility.","He actually wouldn't mind landing an endorsement deal along the way.","\"Mhm, you're a bit expensive. When our company has more money in the future, we could consider you for an endorsement,\" Professor Ye calculated meticulously.","Xie Xi: \"...\" He was a bit expensive?"]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49","paragraphs":["Xie Xi came to observe the filming and casually took a seat.","Staff nearby would occasionally glance in his direction. Logically, these people had seen plenty of celebrities, yet their eyes kept getting drawn to Xie Xi.","The director noticed but didn't call them out, as long as their work wasn't affected.","To be honest, people in the film industry had long wanted to collaborate with Xie Xi, but he had never wanted to cross over into acting. No one knew why he was taking the initiative to cooperate this time.","\"Professor Ye, we'll do another take. Keep your eyes on the camera.\"","Hearing the director's instruction, Ye Qiusuo looked toward the camera behind You Feibai. She didn't particularly enjoy acting; the repetition was too high. The same line had to be delivered from this angle, then that angle.","Dislike aside, Professor Ye still performed her duty and repeated the scene diligently.","\"I think Professor Ye is a bit like a machine. Every time the director approves a take, she can keep it exactly the same.\"","\"You're only noticing now? She even keeps her intonation identical.\"","Acting is a complex thing. Even for a skilled actor like You Feibai, delivering the same scene and lines over multiple takes would inevitably have slight variations.","Xie Xi rested his chin on his hand, listening to the staff's hushed discussion as he looked at Professor Ye on set: If she were a machine, she'd definitely be the most beautiful and formidable one.","But... why did You Feibai seem so irritating to look at?","While Xie Xi sat on the sidelines finding someone irritating, there was someone else on the other end who found him displeasing.","Wan Yurou had finally succeeded in her audition, securing the female lead role and entering the crew of \"The Lake.\" First, she saw Ye Qiusuo at the opening ceremony and learned she would also be acting in it. Then, before filming had even progressed a few days, Xie Xi showed up.","She truly, deeply disliked these two people. She always felt that when these two were together, it boded ill for her.","Xie Xi was an unrestrained character, as evident from the previous pool incident. What normal man would do something like that?","Wan Yurou's originally gentle and beautiful face darkened several shades in an instant. Her assistant beside her didn't know why but instinctively lightened her movements.","\"Brother Xi, what role are you guest-starring as?\" Zhang Dong asked curiously. It was also his first time in such a formal film set.","\"No idea. An opera singer?\" Xie Xi had no clue about the role; he just came when he heard there was an opening.","He picked up the script and, without looking, handed it to Zhang Dong. \"Read it.\"","Zhang Dong complied and began reading, only to discover his Brother Xi was to play a male opera performer, specializing in female roles (dan). In the drama, the character was extremely popular and had close ties with the powerful. Later, he would be brought down by the male lead and others, losing his backing.","Xie Xi could accept the beginning, but upon hearing the later part, he turned to look at Zhang Dong. \"I get trampled by You Feibai?\"","Zhang Dong coughed. \"It's more like... he takes you down. The protagonist can't stand the opera performer colluding with the powerful.\"","The big star Xie was somewhat displeased, but the role was set, and as a guest star, he had little say.","By the time Zhang Dong finished summarizing the plot and lines, Ye Qiusuo happened to finish her scene. She went into the dressing room to remove her makeup, changed back into her own clothes, and prepared to leave.","Xie Xi sat for a moment longer before getting up and saying goodbye to the director.","\"Alright, you can come by more often these next few days. It'll be your turn to film soon,\" the director said with a smile.","Xie Xi nodded in agreement, pretending to be nonchalant as he walked toward Ye Qiusuo's direction.","Just then, Ye Qiusuo came out.","\"Are you heading back? I'm leaving too. Need a ride?\"","\"I drove here.\" Ye Qiusuo opened her hand, revealing a new car key in her palm.","Xie Xi: \"...\" Does she change cars that fast?","Even so, Xie Xi still walked with Ye Qiusuo. There was only one parking lot nearby, so they were headed the same way.","\"Don't I need to do any more tests?\" Xie Xi asked. \"What about the copying assignments?\"","Zhang Dong, lagging behind, thought to himself: Who was it that kept procrastinating on writing them every day? Now that the course is over, your tone makes it sound like you still want to do them?","Ye Qiusuo glanced at him in surprise. \"Your data collection is complete. No more tests or copying are needed.\"","\"Oh.\"","They passed several trailers. One had its door open, with You Feibai still in costume standing outside, holding a cup of water. His assistant stood opposite him, seemingly in conversation.","You Feibai also saw Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi. He gave them a slight nod before turning away, unscrewing the cap of his water and raising it to take a drink.","Xie Xi gradually fell back a few steps. He took out his phone and secretly messaged Zhang Dong: [Pretend the car broke down later.]","The moment she saw You Feibai lift his head, a passage suddenly surfaced in Ye Qiusuo's mind: You Feibai drank that water, and his throat immediately burned with pain. At that moment, Wan Yurou, who was passing by, supported him and called an ambulance...","His assistant was right there. Why would it be Wan Yurou supporting him and calling the ambulance?","Professor Ye couldn't make sense of the logic at all.","But now wasn't the time to dwell on logic. Ye Qiusuo quickly strode toward You Feibai, reached out, and snatched the water from his hand. Before she could explain, You Feibai spoke.","\"Is there a problem?\" You Feibai asked politely, but his handsome features had already darkened. His long-time assistant beside him recognized this as a sign of anger.","Ye Qiusuo looked up at him, took a step back, placed the water on the ground, and said, \"There's something wrong with your water.\" With that, she turned and continued walking toward her car.","She showed no intention of offering any further explanation.","You Feibai was taken aback, then immediately recalled the deliberate car accident. He promptly instructed his assistant to pick up the water bottle, recap it tightly, and send it for testing.","When he looked toward Ye Qiusuo again, she was already gone.","\"What was wrong with that water?\" Xie Xi asked curiously.","Ye Qiusuo pressed her car key, turned to look at Xie Xi, and suddenly felt a bit better. \"Someone drugged it.\"","\"Drugged?\"","\"Someone tampered with his car before, causing the accident that damaged my car,\" Ye Qiusuo mentioned, though she wasn't happy about it. She had driven that car for years and was used to it. Moreover, if her reaction had been slightly slower, she would have been the one injured.","\"Water bottles should never leave your sight; if they do, don't drink from them.\" Xie Xi frowned, his impression of You Feibai worsening once again. This was almost an unwritten rule in their circle. Otherwise, if an accident happened, there would be no way to undo it.","Ye Qiusuo was still waiting for him to ask how she knew the water was drugged, but Xie Xi showed no sign of asking.","\"Brother Xi, our car broke down!\" Zhang Dong popped up, shouting dramatically with a very pitiful tone.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Though a bit exaggerated, the show had to go on.","\"Could you... possibly give us a ride?\" Xie Xi asked, lowering his eyes cautiously. \"If it's not convenient, just dropping us in the city would be fine too.\"","Ye Qiusuo opened the car door. \"Where do you need to go? I'll take you.\"","Xie Xi immediately walked around to the other side and openly took the passenger seat.","Zhang Dong then got into the back seat.","\"Is it okay if I sit here?\" Xie Xi turned to ask Ye Qiusuo.","\"What?\" Ye Qiusuo didn't quite understand his meaning.","Zhang Dong in the back seat covered his face and looked out the window: Brother Xi, you should have at least asked that before buckling your seatbelt. Now that the seatbelt's on, you're asking?","\"Many people reserve the passenger seat only for their significant other,\" Xie Xi explained.","\"I don't have that habit. You can sit there,\" Ye Qiusuo replied as she reversed the car out.","Xie Xi: ...That wasn't the answer he wanted to hear.","At the critical moment, it was Zhang Dong who knew what to ask: \"Professor Ye, doesn't your boyfriend sit in the passenger seat? Or does your boyfriend usually do the driving?\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"I don't have that kind of friend.\"","Professor Ye wished she could split every day in two—where would she find the time for romance? Moreover, having been a child prodigy, she had always been surrounded by people with a significant age gap, with those a dozen years older being extremely common.","A faint, almost imperceptible smile touched Xie Xi's lips as he sat in the passenger seat, his eyes slightly curved as if holding a glimmer of starlight.","Ye Qiusuo drove the two directly to their residence before leaving.","Her car had been gone for quite some time, but Xie Xi remained standing motionless in the same spot.","Zhang Dong coughed several times. \"Brother Xi, we should go in now.\"","So his Brother Xi was actually having a springtime flutter of the heart. Should he tell Sister Wei? But nothing's happened yet, so maybe it's okay not to tell.","Zhang Dong pondered hesitantly.","\"Don't you dare tell Sister Wei,\" Xie Xi warned just before going inside, as if reading his mind.","\"Okay, Brother Xi.\"","...","That water bottle had already been sent to a specialized agency for testing, which would take a few days. However, You Feibai's manager had already retrieved the surveillance footage from around the RV and confirmed that someone had indeed put something in the bottle. The assistant had been looking down at his phone at the time and hadn't been watching the water at all.","\"This isn't the same man from before,\" You Feibai's face darkened.","The person adding something to the water bottle in the surveillance footage appeared, from the back, to be a woman.","The manager tried to reassure him. \"We'll add a few more people around you. I've already spoken to the police; they'll continue the investigation and have pulled all the surveillance footage from the area.\"","As for the assistant, even though he had been with You Feibai for years, the manager still fired him.","When they went to film the next day, everyone noticed the increased number of assistants around You Feibai. The director, having received a call the night before, was also aware of the situation and came over to pat him on the shoulder.","You Feibai exchanged a few words with the director, then began looking around for Ye Qiusuo. He wanted to know how she had known the water was drugged yesterday.","After looking around without seeing her, he walked back over to the director.","\"Director, isn't Professor Ye coming today?\"","\"It seems something came up at her company unexpectedly. She's rescheduled for the afternoon,\" the director said with a smile. \"You're the second person to ask about Professor Ye.\"","When the contract was signed, Ye Qiusuo had mentioned to the director that her schedule might change, to which the director had agreed, so he readily adjusted the shooting schedule.","\"The second?\"","\"Xie Xi asked earlier,\" the director said, pointing towards the person sleeping under a tree, covered by a military coat on a long bench.","You Feibai glanced towards the tree, only making out a completely covered human form. An assistant stood guard nearby, having somehow procured an extension cord to power an electric heater fan.","Quite comfortable, You Feibai thought, withdrawing his gaze without a ripple of emotion in his heart.","...","Xie Xi had gotten up too early and, failing to see the person he wanted to see, simply lay back down on the bench for a nap. He didn't wake up until past ten o'clock. Handing his eye mask and earplugs to Zhang Dong, he sat wrapped in the military coat, watching the people in the film set act.","\"Brother Xi, shall we eat with the crew later or order takeout?\" Zhang Dong asked, warming his hands.","\"Takeout,\" Xie Xi said listlessly. \"What time will she come this afternoon?\"","\"I asked the production assistant. Professor Ye is in the first scene this afternoon, which starts at two. I figure she'll probably arrive a little after one.\"","\"Where's the script?\" Xie Xi asked Zhang Dong. \"Do I have any scenes with her?\"","Zhang Dong rummaged in his bag, pulled out the script, and flipped through it. \"Brother Xi, Professor Ye only has scenes with the male lead, Fang Zhouyue.\"","Xie Xi frowned with distaste. \"What's so good about their scenes together?\""]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50","paragraphs":["At one o'clock in the afternoon, Ye Qiusuo arrived at the film set and was immediately pulled away for makeup and costume fitting. Xie Xi watched her go in with eager eyes but didn't follow. He still needed to maintain a bit of reserve.","However, upon seeing You Feibai knock and enter the room, and the people inside being ushered out, the big star Xie couldn't stay calm anymore.","\"Are you ordering milk tea? I'll go ask the professor what she wants to drink.\" Xie Xi said to Zhang Dong before immediately getting up and heading towards the makeup room.","Zhang Dong: \"...\" There was really no need to pin it on him like that.","Xie Xi knocked on the door, growing even more unsettled because it was locked. He asked from outside, \"Professor, can I come in?\"","Both people inside recognized Xie Xi's voice.","Ye Qiusuo stood up to open the door, but You Feibai reached out and stopped her. \"Professor Ye,\" he clearly didn't want her to open it.","Ye Qiusuo withdrew her hand. \"You can say whatever it is directly.\"","She then opened the door and looked at Xie Xi outside. \"What is it?\"","Seeing her come out, Xie Xi immediately smiled, looking extremely handsome. \"Zhang Dong is going to buy milk tea. What would you like?\"","\"No, thank you.\" Professor Ye really had no interest in such things.","\"Everyone is getting one,\" Xie Xi insisted.","\"...Anything is fine. The same as last time would work too.\"","Their voices weren't loud, but they were clear enough for You Feibai inside the makeup room to hear, stirring up an inexplicable emotion within him.","As a movie star, his profession involved studying and embodying different people's behaviors and expressions. How could he not perceive the subtle difference in Ye Qiusuo's attitude towards him versus Xie Xi?","\"You... have something to discuss?\" Xie Xi glanced inside and asked hesitantly.","Ye Qiusuo turned to ask You Feibai, \"Filming is about to start. What did you want to ask?\"","Xie Xi showed no intention of leaving the doorway, and Ye Qiusuo showed no inclination to close the door.","\"How did you know that bottle of water was drugged? I watched the surveillance footage. You were still filming when that person put the drug in.\" You Feibai had watched the footage all night, and his eyes were still slightly red.","Ye Qiusuo gave a casual reason. \"I saw someone tamper with your water while filming. Later, I saw a person wearing a wig and a skirt, but their bone structure seemed off—probably a man—hurrying past. It was among Li Yandie's fans before. You could ask her.\"","Li Yandie was the star playing the female lead and also the goddess in the hearts of male fans in the original story. That man had gotten angry before upon hearing rumors about the two of them, and hearing about You Feibai collaborating with Li Yandie made him snap.","Ye Qiusuo hadn't actually seen anything while filming, but she had seen that man wearing black stockings. It's just that men's and women's bone structures are somewhat different. She initially thought it was just a cross-dresser, but later understood. Combined with the surveillance footage You Feibai had previously sent her from the parking lot, mixing truth with fiction, this reason wasn't far-fetched.","You Feibai was silent for a moment. \"Thank you.\"","\"Perhaps you should be more careful in general.\" Ye Qiusuo simply didn't want to be implicated by him. Last time he crashed her car, although the compensation was quickly paid, buying a new car and getting plates took time. If he had drunk that water and something happened, as the lead actor, filming would be delayed, wasting her time again. At that time, Wan Yurou also wasn't nearby as the original story said.","Xie Xi, watching from the side: Suddenly felt a bit happy.","The three of them didn't stay long. The director was already calling for people over there. Ye Qiusuo simply went out directly, with Xie Xi following behind. When they were still some distance from Zhang Dong, Xie Xi specifically told him what milk tea to get.","Zhang Dong, true to his reputation as an excellent assistant, immediately acknowledged.","By the time he returned with a pile of milk tea, Professor Ye had already finished filming one scene and moved on to other matters.","...","The scene to be filmed this time was again a debate between teacher and student. The male lead, Fang Zhouyue, wanted to take his friends out to protest, but was stopped by Pei Jinxi. The students thought the teacher was ineffectual, while the teacher urged the students to act calmly and not recklessly take the lead. Thus, the two stood in the corridor debating.","Throughout the entire series, the character Pei Jinxi had an unusual influence on the protagonist. This scene should be the male lead's second ideological liberation, deepening his understanding of freedom.","Fang Zhouyue stood at the front, righteous and spirited. \"If everyone turtles up here, if no one steps forward, our freedom will be crushed inch by inch.\"","\"Freedom is not unorganized, arbitrary provocation. If you go now, you'll merely become a weapon for the enemy's propaganda.\" Ye Qiusuo's voice was cool and clear. Both her lines and expression perfectly matched Pei Jinxi's character.","As they went back and forth in their debate, Fang Zhouyue's imposing manner gradually dissipated.","You Feibai always practiced immersive acting. At that moment, it was as if he truly were Fang Zhouyue from that era, and his feelings toward the teacher grew increasingly complex with each exchange.","When the director called cut, Ye Qiusuo immediately left the camera area, picked up her coat, and put it on. Standing outside in the depths of winter was indeed quite cold.","Several of You Feibai's assistants—some bringing clothes, others handing him a thermos—swarmed around him, blocking everyone's view. He took the water, lowered his eyes, concealing the complex stubbornness within them.","—He hadn't completely come out of character yet.","\"Professor Ye has really entered the entertainment industry now,\" Wan Yurou said with a smile, standing beside Ye Qiusuo.","From Ye Qiusuo's first day of filming, Wan Yurou had been watching her. She seemed to learn everything quickly and adapted well. The more she watched, the more uncomfortable she felt inside.","Ye Qiusuo glanced at her and could roughly guess what Wan Yurou was thinking.","\"Don't you have scenes to film later? Shouldn't you rehearse in advance?\" Ye Qiusuo looked back at You Feibai, surrounded by his assistants. The male lead and female lead just needed to get entangled; she was only here to earn some extra money.","Wan Yurou was about to say something when she was interrupted.","\"Professor, come warm up over here.\" Xie Xi not far away waved at Ye Qiusuo, very enthusiastically.","The staff nearby were already used to it because Zhang Dong had explained it to everyone yesterday: Ye Qiusuo was Xie Xi's teacher, giving them the illusion that the two were close.","Ye Qiusuo hesitated for a second but ultimately walked over.","Compared to those two, she preferred sitting with Xie Xi.","\"Zhang Dong will be here soon.\" Xie Xi got up to let Ye Qiusuo sit in the lounge chair, pulling over a small stool for himself to sit on. He also draped the army coat over her, bustling about.","Ye Qiusuo, with the army coat stuffed into her arms, was momentarily stunned. Smelling the familiar men's cologne on it, she then put it on.","\"Zhang Dong bought this,\" Xie Xi said, pointing at the electric heater. His legs were too long, making sitting on the small stool awkward.","\"Xie Xi,\" Ye Qiusuo called him.","\"Hmm?\" Hearing her call his name, the back of Xie Xi's neck instantly tingled. This time it wasn't from fear of being called on, but... anyway, the tips of his ears turned slightly red.","\"When do you start filming?\" Ye Qiusuo asked casually.","\"The day after tomorrow or the next, depending on the director's schedule.\" Xie Xi's slender, clean fingers twisted together. He felt a bit inexplicably nervous; she seemed too close.","The day after tomorrow... by then, her scenes would be almost finished too.","Xie Xi's eyes darted around, finally deciding to start getting closer through praise. \"You acted really well. That male lead was too impulsive.\"","\"After all, they're kids in their twenties. It's hard to avoid being impulsive.\" Ye Qiusuo thought the script's conflict was well-set. College students, full of youthful vigor, whether in the past or now, are always the group most prone to impulsiveness and being easily provoked.","\"...Teacher, you're also in your twenties.\" A sense of crisis arose in Xie Xi. Why did her words carry such a world-weary tone?","People in their twenties are still kids? Would she perhaps not like people in their twenties? When will he turn thirty? There are still several years to go!","The big star Xie was instantly filled with question marks.","\"Hmm, I forgot.\" Ye Qiusuo's intellect developed too early, and her sense of time is different from others'.","Over there, Zhang Dong arrived with a car full of hot milk tea, bustling about as he distributed it to everyone. Finally, he came over holding two cups, handing them to Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi.","\"Brother Xi, I specially went to Huajing University to buy these two cups.\" Zhang Dong had brought them over in a thermos cup. It was a bit strange, but they were still hot.","As soon as Ye Qiusuo opened hers, steam was still rising.","A cup of hot milk tea warmed her right up.","After sitting for a while longer, the director called them over for reshoots. Ye Qiusuo handed the thermos cup to Xie Xi before going over.","\"Brother Xi, give it to me. I'll wash it clean later.\" Only after Professor Ye left did Zhang Dong sidle over and say.","Xie Xi slowly screwed the lid back on and didn't hand it over. \"I'll do it myself when we get back.\"","Zhang Dong: Alright then.","...","The news that Xie Xi had been going to the set early in the morning these past two days finally reached Wei Qi's ears. When she came over in the evening, she specifically asked, \"Do you like acting? I can help you look for other roles.\"","In Wei Qi's mind, Xie Xi deserved the best. Since he wanted to act, he should at least get a male lead role.","\"No need. Let's finish filming this one first.\" What Xie Xi was interested in wasn't acting at all. He lowered his head, carefully rinsing the milk tea stains from inside the thermos cup.","\"That's fine too. After you finish filming, if you still feel like acting, tell Sister Wei.\" Wei Qi watched him washing the cup. \"Why are you doing this yourself? Let the housekeeper do it.\"","This was a cup Professor Ye had drunk from. How could he let anyone else touch it? Xie Xi thought to himself, but on the surface he said, \"Practicing life skills.\"","\"Because of what happened on that reality show last time?\" Wei Qi remembered the first episode of the program and wanted to laugh. Xie Xi was truly the type who couldn't tell one grain from another.","Reality show?","The big star Xie had been so focused these past few days on figuring out how to get closer to Professor Ye that he had almost forgotten about the reality show.","\"Hmm, learning more.\" Xie Xi accepted this misunderstanding.","Once Wei Qi left, Zhang Dong, who had been pretending to play on his phone, looked up. \"Brother Xi, you have to film tomorrow. I found some videos called 'The 21-Day Actor Crash Course.' Want to watch?\"","Xie Xi refused. \"That name sounds like a scam from the get-go.\"","Zhang Dong suddenly winked and made a suggestive face. \"Brother Xi, maybe you could go ask Professor Ye for advice.\"","Xie Xi wiped the water off the thermos cup, thoughtful. \"That could work.\"","That very night, Xie Xi was on WeChat, calling her 'Teacher' this and 'Teacher' that, saying it was his first time acting and he wanted to ask Ye Qiusuo for some experience.","Unfortunately, though, Professor Ye was up late busy with work and didn't reply at all.","The big star Xie fell asleep just like that, holding his phone and waiting for a reply.","It wasn't until the next day that Ye Qiusuo saw the messages on her phone—a full eight voice messages. She listened to them patiently.","\"That character has some overlap with my usual life, so it was easy to act. For others, I might not be able to explain clearly.\" After earnestly explaining, Ye Qiusuo asked, \"Didn't your agent help you find a tutor?\"","Over on his side, Xie Xi was still asleep. Zhang Dong had to call him to wake him up before he rolled over to grab his phone. \"What time is it?\"","\"Brother Xi, it's seven o'clock.\"","Xie Xi found his phone, and his first reaction was to check for messages. He happened to see the message from Ye Qiusuo. He half-knelt on the bed, phone held to his ear, hair disheveled, his expression extremely serious as he listened to the voice message."]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51","paragraphs":["After listening to Ye Qiusuo's voice message, Xie Xi slowly got up. He was thinking about how to reply, and by the time he had thought it through, he had already arrived at the film set.","The director, as always, was the earliest to arrive. He waved Xie Xi over: \"You start filming today. A tutor will be here later; he'll teach you how to carry yourself with the proper stage movements over the next few days.\"","An opera performer naturally has to sing opera. In the movie, it's not absolutely necessary to sing for real, but the stage movements and postures must look elegant and beautiful.","However...","\"Xiao Xie, can you sing opera?\" the director asked him. \"I remember you have a Chinese-style album with several songs featuring opera-style singing.\"","\"I know a little.\"","The director clapped his hands: \"Good, good. The tutor will teach you a few lines later, and we'll see if you can sing for real when the time comes.\"","Xie Xi responded casually, his gaze sweeping the surroundings. Had she not arrived yet?","After half an hour, when most people had gathered, Ye Qiusuo finally walked over.","By then, Xie Xi had already been called over by the tutor. That tutor had sung opera for many years and won numerous major awards. Later, due to a physical injury, he had to retire from the stage and now specialized in coaching actors on physicality and voice for film crews.","\"Your waist must be soft, your eyes must be alluring, but not forced.\" The tutor patted Xie Xi's waist, then demonstrated by walking a few steps himself. Despite wearing a padded jacket, his movements still exuded a captivating, coquettish charm, even though he was a middle-aged man.","Xie Xi twisted his waist. Zhang Dong, standing beside him, couldn't hold back a snorting laugh and earned a glare from Xie Xi.","Everyone around watched them with curiosity, Ye Qiusuo being no exception. She stood at the back of the crowd, watching the tutor guide Xie Xi through his swaying movements.","After twisting around for a bit, Xie Xi turned back and saw Ye Qiusuo standing nearby. He immediately froze, unsure what to do next.","\"Keep walking. Don't be overly affected. The softness should emanate from your very bones, but with strength underneath.\" The tutor said sternly.","Xie Xi: \"...\" This is embarrassing.","After practicing for about an hour, Xie Xi was taken away for his costume fitting. It was a typical opera performer's outfit, though his face wasn't made up yet, as they weren't filming the stage performance scenes today.","The people around began attending to their own tasks. Ye Qiusuo's styling was simple and didn't take much time. She sat on a stool, next to an electric heater that Zhang Dong had moved over for her.","Ye Qiusuo pulled out her laptop from her bag and opened an interface displaying an architectural floor plan. A red dot was moving across it, occasionally stopping at certain points. She watched as the red dot repeatedly entered and exited a marked black area, her eyes turning slightly cold.","This red dot represented the ID trace of Zhang Chengjue. At Tianqiu, you could lose almost anything, but never your ID card. It was required everywhere, even to use the restroom.","Her earlier agreement to let Zhang Chengjue return to work had merely been a test by Ye Qiusuo. If he behaved, he could stay at the company. But if he tried anything underhanded, Ye Qiusuo had the authority to deal with anyone harming the company's interests. Kicking Zhang Chengjue out would then be perfectly in line with company regulations.","This floor plan had been sent to her internally by the company yesterday. During a system check, they discovered Zhang Chengjue's ID card had accessed areas his current position should not permit.","Ye Qiusuo had suppressed the matter for now.","\"We tracked down the fans of Li Yandie from that day, checked their photos, and found the man who dressed as a woman. The police are interrogating him today. The contents of that water bottle have also been tested; it contained dilute sulfuric acid.\" You Feibai stood beside Ye Qiusuo and reported.","Ye Qiusuo reached out, closed her laptop, and put it back in her bag. She looked up: \"Congratulations on catching the suspect.\"","You Feibai sat down seriously. \"Catching him was largely thanks to Professor Ye... I'd like to invite you to dinner tonight.\"","\"No need. It was just a small effort.\" Ye Qiusuo had no desire to waste time on a meal.","You Feibai's expression faltered. He had assumed she would agree. In the adult world, exchanges of benefit were paramount, unrelated to personal likes or dislikes.","If she wanted to enter the entertainment industry, befriending him wouldn't be a bad strategy.","\"Director Yi Qicai has a film that's missing a female lead. If you're interested, Professor Ye, I could recommend you.\" You Feibai decided to simply offer her a favor.","Ye Qiusuo didn't answer immediately. Her gaze fell on Xie Xi, who had just changed into his opera costume.","He was wearing a set of loose, brightly colored opera robes, holding a round fan with a tassel dangling from its handle. His lips were painted with rouge, an unusually vivid red. It was originally a flamboyant, feminine style of dress, but when Xie Xi walked out, he resembled a frivolous young noble from a prestigious family, exuding an air of refined elegance and brilliance.","Xie Xi looked around, and upon meeting Ye Qiusuo's eyes, he smiled.","Ye Qiusuo withdrew her gaze. \"I don't have any plans to act again for the time being. Thank you for your kind offer.\"","Filming for a lead role could take months at the shortest, or even years.","She didn't have the time.","This kind of cameo role, which happened to fall during the winter break, was the only type that met the conditions for earning some extra money.","Having been rebuffed several times, the light in You Feibai's eyes dimmed. He stopped pressing the issue, stood up, and left.","\"Something doesn't feel quite right?\" The director looked at Xie Xi in full costume, shaking his head repeatedly. \"This isn't the feeling I'm going for.\"","The tutor standing nearby also frowned. \"His walking posture is off, and his eyes aren't right either.\"","The opera performer in \"The Lake\" is a man who has played female roles since childhood, inevitably imbued with a certain softness and charm. Coupled with his nature of currying favor with the powerful, he needs an added touch of sly seductiveness.","But Xie Xi, the moment he walked out, was like a graceful orchid or jade tree; even this flamboyant costume couldn't suppress his clear, noble radiance.","\"Can the makeup be changed further?\" the director asked the makeup artist.","\"The eyeliner could be extended a bit more, but it won't make a huge difference.\" The makeup artist was also troubled. She had done plenty of seductive-style makeup; it really depended mostly on the eyes, and Xie Xi's eyes were just too pure.","After several adjustments, another half hour passed before they were finally satisfied.","\"Where's the cat?\" The director turned and asked the props team.","Soon, someone from the props team brought over a Ragdoll cat with beautiful, watery blue eyes.","The director handed the cat to Xie Xi and explained the scene: \"Later, you'll be half-reclining on the daybed, with this cat curled in your arms. You can pet it while you speak.\"","This scene depicted the opera performer conversing with a distinguished guest. Fang Zhouyue arrives to find that guest, hoping he will join their organization's efforts, and subsequently clashes with the opera performer. More precisely, the opera performer humiliates the male lead.","\"Lean your body more this way, don't be so stiff.\" The tutor instructed Xie Xi on how to lie on the daybed. Although the script described the opera performer lounging casually and lazily, actually portraying that on camera wasn't simple for the actor.","\"Like this?\" Xie Xi spent an excessive amount of time lounging on his sofa at home; he could portray laziness easily.","The tutor: \"...\" What's with this aura?","\"No, lift your shoulder a bit more, put some strength in your elbow, relax your forearm, let your fingers hang naturally.\" The tutor pointed out adjustments from top to bottom. In short, the parts of the body hidden under the clothes needed to be exerting force, while everything visible to the outside world had to appear relaxed.","Finally, after much adjustment to his posture and bearing, he did seem to have a hint of lazy charm at first glance. But when the tutor looked up and saw Xie Xi's eyes, he immediately knew the task was still daunting. \"Your eyes shouldn't be so pure. Even a slightly post-coital look would work.\"","Xie Xi looked at the tutor: \"After singing opera?\"","\"...\" Damn it, 'after singing opera'? He knew this actor's eyes were just a bit too impossibly pure.","The tutor coughed. \"Do you have someone you like? Maybe try imagining her, that heart-pounding feeling when you see her, with just a touch of shyness.\"","\"Add a little more... the eyes should be seductive, but not in a real-life way. It's more like the allure of a lowly subordinate tempting someone of higher status,\" the director added from the sidelines.","After hearing this, Xie Xi instinctively glanced toward where Ye Qiusuo had been earlier. She was gone, even her bag was missing.","Xie Xi couldn't help but lower his gaze, hiding that flicker of disappointment.","After both the director and the acting coach had imparted their insights, they finally had Xie Xi prepare to start filming.","The result proved it was completely off; the look in his eyes wasn't right.","\"Xiao Xie, do you understand shyness and seduction?\" the director shouted through his megaphone. \"Seduction! Think about seducing someone!\"","The entire set echoed with the word 'seduction.'","Ye Qiusuo arrived after finishing a video conference with her company's project team and found their filming at a standstill.","She originally intended to sit down, but someone had taken her previous spot. So, she shouldered her bag and went to stand near the director, which gave her a good view of the filming.","\"Take a breather, Xiao Xie. Try to find the feeling again.\" The director felt this scene would likely take a long time to get right today.","Xie Xi looked toward the director and was surprised to see Ye Qiusuo standing behind him. His heart gave a heavy thump.","After a few minutes, the cameras reset, and they started filming again.","The opera singer, in resplendent costume, reclined languidly on the daybed. His right hand propped up his head, the wide sleeve slipping down to reveal a forearm of cool white skin. His eyelashes were lowered, and his left hand gently stroked the cat in his lap. His slender, straight fingers moved through the white fur, making it hard to tell which was whiter, the hand or the cat.","The male lead pushed the door open. Not seeing the person he wanted, but only a money-grubbing opera singer, he frowned and began to admonish him.","The opera singer lazily raised his eyes.","In that instant, Xie Xi wasn't looking at the camera, but at Ye Qiusuo behind it. His gaze grew complex, a seduction hidden yet unmistakable in his eyes, laid bare unabashedly before the lens.","An inexplicable allure suddenly bloomed.","At the same moment, the kitten in his lap happened to turn its head and look toward the camera. Its watery blue, innocent eyes, paired with its master's, created a contrast that somehow also felt harmonious.","Professor Ye, standing directly in Xie Xi's line of sight, felt her heart skip a beat and unconsciously averted her gaze.","He acted much better than she had anticipated.","The director drew in a sharp breath, struggling not to yell 'cut,' and watched as Xie Xi continued the scene until his lines were finished before finally raising his hand to call it.","\"Good, good! That's the one!\" The director never expected Xie Xi to nail this scene in one take. It was even better than the effect he had imagined. And the timing of the cat turning to look at the camera was so perfect. Such a wonderful accident would definitely add points to the film.","\"Brother Xi, let me help you up.\" Zhang Dong immediately came over to help Xie Xi to his feet.","Xie Xi tugged uncomfortably at his sleeve and asked Zhang Dong quietly, \"How did you think I did?\"","Zhang Dong gave a thumbs up. \"Brother Xi, if you ever played a country-toppling seductress, you'd be perfect!\"","That one glance he gave... tsk tsk, you'd give him your life, your heart, everything. No exaggeration.","Xie Xi's face darkened. \"Shut up.\"","Xie Xi was still holding the cat, and someone from the props department came to take it away. He tugged at his collar again, then walked nonchalantly toward the director, pretending to watch the playback and listen to the praise from the director and the coach, while his mind had already drifted to Ye Qiusuo standing nearby.","\"Professor, what did you think of my performance just now?\" Xie Xi shuffled closer to Ye Qiusuo and asked in a low voice.","Ye Qiusuo glanced briefly at Xie Xi. \"You acted very well.\"","\"Actually, I was just acting blindly. I didn't even know what I was doing,\" Xie Xi whispered. \"When I was acting, I saw you come over.\"","It was seeing you that made me perform like that.","Xie Xi added silently in his heart."]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52","paragraphs":["The following days, Xie Xi's filming went surprisingly smoothly. Aside from occasionally not meeting the movement requirements set by the instructor, his eye expressions were on point. The most brilliant part was the scene where the opera singer stood on stage performing an unfinished piece.","That scene was specifically scheduled for the evening. The flickering candlelight illuminated the stage. Dressed in a red opera costume, the singer seemed to pour all the joys and sorrows of life into his song, his words trailing off as if holding back, half-hidden by his flowing sleeve.","The recorded vocals were Xie Xi's own voice. He had been learning opera these past few days, and with his prior foundation, singing a few lines wasn't difficult.","Xie Xi stood on the stage, his long sleeves layered, turning as his robe fell, his gaze landing on the audience below. She wasn't there.","But for a moment, Xie Xi seemed to see Ye Qiusuo in the audience, standing quietly by the camera, watching him.","As he sang, the look in Xie Xi's eyes began to change.","\"Not bad at all,\" the director murmured to the person beside him.","This scene was a long take. The opera singer stood on stage singing a few lines; the object of his gaze in the audience was the patron he sought to win over, his eyes shifting with ambiguous intent. The very next moment, the male lead schemes to have him dragged off stage.","It was a difficult scene to shoot. The director was fully prepared, but he never expected Xie Xi to nail it in one take. When it came time for the extras to rush the stage and seize the singer, most of them were still looking up, listening to Xie Xi sing, and didn't react in time.","\"Move, hurry up!\" the director urged them in a low, anxious voice.","Only then did the group snap out of it and rush onto the stage to grab him.","It was the first time a scene was completed in a single take. The director walked over to Xie Xi and praised him profusely.","Xie Xi reverted to his usual lazy nonchalance, the ambiguous aura that had enveloped him moments before vanishing without a trace.","\"Brother Xi, some water?\" Zhang Dong held a small electric heater fan pointed at Xie Xi with one hand, while offering a thermos with the other. Inside was hot honey and pear juice.","Seeing this, the director said no more and went over to You Feibai to discuss the next scene.","Xie Xi took it and drank a few sips, then asked Zhang Dong, \"Did you ask the production assistants...\"","Zhang Dong cautiously glanced around, and seeing no one was paying attention, whispered, \"Professor Ye's final scene is the day after tomorrow. She's not coming tomorrow.\"","Tonight was Xie Xi's final scene, but Ye Qiusuo didn't have any night scenes and had left early. Her last scene was also the day after tomorrow, so their schedules completely missed each other.","Xie Xi frowned, racking his brain for any reason he could find to come back the day after tomorrow.","\"Brother Xi, maybe you should go remove your makeup first.\"","Xie Xi still had the stage makeup on his face.","\"Mm.\"","After changing back into his own clothes, before his makeup was fully removed, someone knocked on the door.","Zhang Dong went to open it and was startled to see the person outside. \"Professor Ye?\"","Hearing these three words, Xie Xi immediately stood up, not caring that his makeup wasn't fully off.","\"You...\" Xie Xi was taken aback upon clearly seeing the person at the door, his heart beginning to race erratically. \"Why are you holding flowers?\"","Ye Qiusuo walked in and handed him a bouquet. \"For you. Wrapping... happy.\" She paused, adding the last two words.","The flowers were just ordinary ones, mostly conveying good wishes. If they had been roses, Xie Xi's heart would have done more than just race erratically.","Xie Xi took them, still happy inside. His Professor Ye had given him flowers.","\"Why the sudden flowers?\" Xie Xi couldn't help asking.","Ye Qiusuo looked at the several people in the makeup room, her gaze lingering on Zhang Dong for a moment before she said, \"I thought it was customary to give flowers when someone wraps filming.\"","She had heard it from Zhang Dong before and thought it was something everyone gave to departing actors.","Ye Qiusuo wasn't familiar with the customs and intricacies of film sets. Having just left the company and passing by a flower shop, she remembered Zhang Dong mentioning that today was Xie Xi's last day of filming, so she bought flowers and brought them over. But walking through the set just now, she hadn't seen anyone else holding flowers.","Upon hearing this, Zhang Dong immediately looked down and started fidgeting with his hands. He had deliberately been vague, never expecting Professor Ye not only to believe it but also to actually buy flowers.","Seeing his assistant's reaction out of the corner of his eye, Xie Xi knew exactly where the problem originated. His feelings became slightly complicated.","\"Professor, we're taking group photos later. Want to join?\" Xie Xi proactively invited.","The two of them went out together. Just then, the director came over holding a bouquet—this was the proper way for the crew to send off an actor wrapping their role.","\"Hey, how come...\" The director came over cheerfully with the flowers, only to find Xie Xi already had a bouquet in his arms.","Not giving the director a chance to say more, Xie Xi reached out, took his flowers, thanked him, and then said they were going for the group photo.","The director, somewhat bewildered, turned around to call everyone for the photo.","Ye Qiusuo was like an NPC who had completed her task. After delivering the flowers, she simply stood in an available spot for the group photo with everyone.","Xie Xi turned his head and saw she wasn't beside him. While smiling and talking to the person next to him, he slowly shifted over and called for Zhang Dong across the way to take a photo of them.","\"Professor, shall we take a photo together?\"","\"Okay.\" Ye Qiusuo stood beside him, looking quietly at the camera.","Before they could take more than a few photos, someone else gathered the courage to ask for a photo with Xie Xi, so Ye Qiusuo moved aside.","\"I'll head back first.\"","Xie Xi wanted to ask her to stay a bit longer but felt it would be taking up her time. In the end, he could only watch Ye Qiusuo leave.","\"Xixi, look over here!\" a staff member taking photos called out.","Xie Xi glanced down at the flowers Ye Qiusuo had given him, and when he looked back at the camera, the expression in his eyes was exceptionally soft.","...","The next day at nine o'clock.","\"Have you called the police?\" Ye Qiusuo turned her head to ask Zhao Guiyin.","\"Already done. The police will be here in half an hour,\" Zhao Guiyin replied cautiously. Early this morning, Ye Qiusuo had told him to call the police, saying someone at the company was stealing technical data. She hadn't said more, but he guessed it was related to Zhang Chengjue.","After all, with a whole wave of personnel changes at the company, Zhang Chengjue was the most suspicious.","Ye Qiusuo went to her office and carried on with her work as usual, not at all like someone who had just had the police called.","In contrast, Zhao Guiyin, sitting at his desk, couldn't settle down.","Half an hour later, when the company's operations were basically underway, the police arrived.","\"Assistant Zhao, please go greet the police and take them to the 12th floor,\" Ye Qiusuo pressed the intercom and said to Zhao Guiyin in the outer office.","\"Yes.\" Zhao Guiyin immediately stood up, a hint of secret excitement in his heart.","Given Tianqiu Tech's reputation, seven or eight police officers arrived at once, all seemingly experienced with economic cases.","Zhao Guiyin led the police to the 12th floor. One officer behind him, observing the layers of security checkpoints, couldn't help but remark, \"Your company is this strict?\"","\"It's a tech company. Some things involve confidential matters, so we have to be cautious,\" Zhao Guiyin turned and explained with a smile.","The group's movement caused quite a stir. When Zhang Chengjue came out and saw them, his expression changed, but he quickly calmed down. \"Xiao Zhao, what's going on? Why are you bringing the police up here? The things here aren't meant to be shown publicly.\" Zhang Chengjue specifically pointed at the body camera on one officer.","\"President Ye instructed that the officers should come to the 12th floor,\" Zhao Guiyin said politely but distantly.","Hearing 'President Ye,' Zhang Chengjue's face showed a trace of panic. He looked toward the elevator. \"I'm not feeling well today. I'm going to leave early and go to the hospital.\"","Zhao Guiyin stopped him. \"Manager Zhang, if you're leaving, should we record the half hour you worked today?\"","Tianqiu had two modes for taking leave: one by the day, and one calculated by the hour.","\"No need to record it, consider it a day's leave for me.\" Zhang Chengjue waved his hand, not wanting to deal with Zhao Guiyin, and walked straight towards the elevator door.","'Ding—'","The elevator door in front of Zhang Chengjue opened, revealing Ye Qiusuo standing inside, looking at him.","\"...\"","Ye Qiusuo stepped out, and Zhang Chengjue instinctively took a step back.","\"I'm not feeling well, I'm heading back first.\" Zhang Chengjue smiled at Ye Qiusuo and tried to step into the elevator.","Ye Qiusuo reached out to block him: \"There's something that needs your involvement to handle. Please wait a moment.\"","Zhang Chengjue's expression darkened. He glanced at the group of police officers, clenched his fist, and turned around: \"What needs to be handled?\"","Ye Qiusuo was holding a tablet. She walked towards the police and said to the one in charge, \"We wish to report that someone within the company has stolen technical data, causing severe impact on our company.\"","She handed the tablet to the police officer; it clearly contained all the evidence.","Zhang Chengjue's heart skipped a beat. He suppressed the impulse to snatch the tablet and smash it. It might not be him; he had cleaned up meticulously at the end. No one knew his ID card still retained those access permissions.","Yet, the very next second, when the police asked who the person was, Ye Qiusuo pointed directly at him.","\"Qiusuo, what is the meaning of this? Framing me?\" Zhang Chengjue asked sharply.","Ye Qiusuo glanced at him and said to the police, \"All the evidence is inside. Thank you for your trouble, officers.\"","As he wasn't convicted yet, the police didn't handcuff Zhang Chengjue, only asked him to follow them.","Zhang Chengjue refused to move, his face contorted with agitation: \"I know the last project was my mistake, but you can't just slander me like this. I have a stake in this company too; I'm a shareholder here.\"","\"When a shareholder commits a serious error that damages the company's interests, their shares can be used to compensate for the losses. After your conviction, your shares will be removed,\" Ye Qiusuo looked at him and said calmly.","Zhang Chengjue suddenly calmed down: \"From the moment you agreed to let me come back, you had already planned this, didn't you? Waiting for me to make a mistake so you could take my shares!\"","The police asked him to return to the station with them. Zhang Chengjue was forced into the elevator, and Zhao Guiyin went down with them to see them off.","Ye Qiusuo watched the elevator doors close and lowered her eyes: It wasn't from the time she agreed to let Zhang Chengjue return that she had planned this. Rather, from the very beginning, when he colluded with other shareholders to conceal his series of actions and quickly invested in the convalescent mushroom project, she had already prepared to take back the shares in Zhang Chengjue's hands.","Even if Zhang Chengjue hadn't made this mistake, she had other methods to get them back. It just depended on whether she was willing.","Previously, the company had always been managed by Zhang Chengjue. It wasn't that she couldn't do it; she simply didn't want to waste time here.","...","There was still one final scene left to shoot at the film set. Ye Qiusuo woke up early in the morning to a world of white outside her window.","It was snowing.","She hurried to the set, where the director was quite pleased.","\"I was just thinking this scene needed snow. If there wasn't any, we'd have to add it in post-production. This is perfect.\"","\"The actors will have to bear with it in a moment.\"","In this scene, Pei Jinxi is reported and framed by a student, imprisoned, and later dies, though the death scene isn't shown in the drama. The final shot is of Professor Pei leaning against the iron-barred window, catching a snowflake in his hand, staring outside as he smiles absently.","Ye Qiusuo wasn't good at controlling this emotion and couldn't fully achieve the complex, shifting mood the director wanted.","After several NG takes, the director finally settled on a camera angle and called it a wrap.","Ye Qiusuo's part was also finished. She removed her makeup, changed into her own clothes, and was just about to push the door open when she heard people standing outside talking.","\"The other night, she came running over late to deliver flowers, saying it was to celebrate Xie Xi's wrap-up. It's hilarious; she couldn't even find a better excuse to curry favor.\"","\"She stole the director's job, and the director wasn't even angry?\"","\"No, the director probably didn't notice.\"","Ye Qiusuo was about to open the door when the discussion outside suddenly stopped."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53","paragraphs":["Ever since receiving flowers the day before yesterday, Xie Xi had been planning to use the excuse of delivering flowers to visit Ye Qiusuo today. As he walked to the makeup room door, he overheard a few crew members gossiping, and his expression immediately turned cold.","Previously on set, although Xie Xi didn't interact much with the crew, he seemed relatively mild-mannered, not at all like the difficult-to-approach, bad-tempered person the media portrayed.","But now, as the few people came face-to-face with his frosty gaze, they couldn't help but freeze.","\"Currying favor with whom? You?\" Xie Xi looked them up and down with a critical eye.","The group felt somewhat awkward, their eyes darting around.","Inside, Ye Qiusuo heard a familiar male voice outside and pushed the door open directly. Sure enough, she saw Xie Xi standing at the door, still holding flowers.","As soon as Xie Xi saw Ye Qiusuo, the coldness on his face vanished, replaced by a polite, slightly reserved expression: \"Professor, happy wrap.\" He then stepped forward to hand her the flowers.","He had spent a long time choosing this bouquet at the florist today. Besides the usual congratulatory flowers, he had hidden a bunch of white hyacinths inside.","Ye Qiusuo accepted the flowers: \"Thank you.\"","Xie Xi moved closer to Ye Qiusuo and glanced at the people nearby, his voice not loud but just enough for them to hear: \"Even though I didn't finish junior high, I know you shouldn't gossip behind people's backs.\"","Professor Ye: \"...\" He actually included himself in that.","Those people lowered their heads, wanting to leave but not daring to, and refuting him was even more impossible. Xie Xi hadn't even said much, and had even dragged himself into it.","In the end, it was only when Ye Qiusuo walked towards the director's area, with Xie Xi following alongside, that they finally breathed a sigh of relief. They exchanged glances and scattered, not daring to say anything more.","\"Xiao Xie, what brings you here?\" The director, having just finished his work, asked in surprise upon seeing Xie Xi.","\"The professor wrapped her scenes, I came to deliver flowers.\" Xie Xi said frankly.","The director recalled the flowers Ye Qiusuo had sent the day before yesterday and their teacher-student relationship, nodding: \"Of course, of course.\"","Originally, in Ye Qiusuo's plan, she could leave quietly and peacefully. However, with Xie Xi's arrival, he stayed by her side, making the scene extremely lively.","\"Maybe my wrap day won't be this lively,\" Wan Yurou laughed softly, then turned to look at the man beside her. \"Brother Feibai, I'm still not very confident about the scene later.\"","\"You'll get it with more takes.\"","You Feibai's gaze fell on the two of them. He couldn't figure Ye Qiusuo out. She even remembered the placement of his water bottle, yet she seemed unwilling to be associated with him.","Wan Yurou watched You Feibai, then turned to look at Ye Qiusuo, who was about to leave the set, and her mood suddenly improved a bit.","Although the female lead, Li Yandie, had many scenes, she had started avoiding You Feibai these past few days. You Feibai also hadn't been discussing acting with her much lately. Others might not know, but Wan Yurou had already found out that You Feibai's near-accident was because of Li Yandie's obsessive fan.","Now that Ye Qiusuo had also wrapped her scenes, the only person left on set who could get close to You Feibai was her.","Her agent had worked hard to get her this role, not just because of the director and script, but more importantly because the male lead was You Feibai. This show was bound to be a hit. Any actress associated with him, whether for good or bad topics, would absolutely attract a massive amount of attention.","\"Meow~\"","Xie Xi was trying hard to find opportunities to talk to Ye Qiusuo, thinking about how to leave together later. It would be even better if they could have a meal together. Suddenly, a soft, sweet sound came from near his feet.","He looked down. It was the Ragdoll cat he had held before, lying on its back in front of his shoes, belly up.","Hearing the commotion, the director looked over and made a surprised sound: \"Huh? Why is this cat still here?\"","A staff member from the props department hurried over with a cage, apologizing: \"The pet shop was closed, so we could only keep it for a few more days before returning it.\"","The cat was rented from a pet shop. It was said to be a cat abandoned by its owner. When the props department went to rent a cat, they thought this one was well-behaved and good-looking, suitable for filming, so they chose it.","\"Kitty, come here.\" The staff member tried coaxing the cat into the cage, but it completely ignored them.","After coaxing for a while with no success, the staff member had no choice but to try and pick it up to put it in the cage. However, the cat quickly clung to Xie Xi's pant leg, meowing.","Professor Ye watched the scene of the kitten's blatant act, a hint of amusement in her eyes. It looked so well-behaved, yet was utterly shameless.","\"Kitty!\" The staff member's voice grew a bit louder.","The kitten still paid no attention.","Xie Xi glanced at Ye Qiusuo, then bent down to pick up the cat. He asked the nearby staff member: \"Does it have an owner?\"","\"No, it's an abandoned cat.\"","\"Can I adopt it?\" Xie Xi asked, lowering his head to play with the kitten, which immediately snuggled obediently in his arms.","The staff member hesitated for a second, then said: \"Yes, I'll just let the pet shop owner know.\"","Suddenly having gained a cat, Xie Xi felt a bit more confident. After playing with it for a moment, he walked towards Ye Qiusuo: \"Do you want to pet it?\"","Professor Ye looked at the kitten's watery blue eyes, then finally extended a finger, touching its ear extremely lightly and quickly before withdrawing her hand as if nothing had happened.","The kitten let out a confused meow, the tip of its ear twitching.","Xie Xi chuckled softly, feeling like his Professor Ye had become quite a bit more childish in that moment.","The two walked out of the film set one after the other, heading towards the parking lot.","Xie Xi, holding the kitten in his arms, watched Ye Qiusuo walking ahead, his emotions in turmoil.","When you truly like someone, you become apprehensive about gains and losses, not daring to take a step forward easily, afraid the other person might turn and leave immediately.","\"I'm leaving now.\" Ye Qiusuo opened the car door and, before getting in, turned to Xie Xi.","\"...Okay.\"","Xie Xi didn't walk forward anymore. Holding the cat, he stood in place watching Ye Qiusuo drive away.","Xie Xi lowered his head and touched the kitten's ear: \"She's gone.\"","\"Brother Xi, the staff gave us the cage.\" Zhang Dong caught up from behind, carrying a cage. \"I transferred the money to the staff member to pass on to the pet shop owner.\"","\"Mmm.\"","Zhang Dong's work was always meticulous.","...","The third episode of \"Their Lives\" aired as scheduled, with fans eagerly waiting to watch.","In this episode, the three participants weren't filmed together. Instead, the program crew carried cameras to separately follow each of them through a day of work, from morning until night.","At the beginning, the screen was split into three sections, with a clock-style timer in the middle informing the audience that it was now 6 AM. Two of the people were already up, only Xie Xi was still asleep.","Director Xu Qingwei finished washing up, made a sandwich, sat down to flip through a book by his side, the morning sun streaming in through the floor-to-ceiling window, creating a quiet and elegant atmosphere. On the other side, You Feibai was exercising for an hour. He wore a black tracksuit, which, soaked with sweat, clung tightly to his chest, clearly outlining his muscles.","[Damn, Feibai's physique is seriously hot!]","[No wonder my brother's figure is so good. Disciplined people are never too bad.]","[Yet someone is still sleeping.]","[Xixi only knows how to sleep all day. Now I know why he's never active online—he's busy sleeping.]","At eight in the morning, You Feibai had a commercial shoot to attend. Sitting in the car, he held a script while a makeup artist applied his makeup, not wasting a single moment. Xu Qingwei, meanwhile, was talking back and forth on two phones, sending voice messages to who knows who. Clearly, both were fully immersed in work mode.","As for Xie Xi... he was still asleep.","Even the fans were starting to feel a bit impatient, with bullet comments urging him on.","[Xixi, get up already, the sun is shining on your butt!]","[Please get up and start working, look at the person next door reading lines while getting styled.]","[It's 8:30! Xixi, you should be up by now!!!]","[Why on earth did I fall for such a lazy celebrity, boohoo, damn charming little imp!]","Finally, close to nine o'clock, Xie Xi got up.","He sat on the bed with a dazed expression for a good while, then suddenly flopped back down, hugging the blanket to continue sleeping. However, the abrupt movement caused a corner of his pajamas to ride up.","[He's this lazy and still has abs???]","[Maybe Xixi exercises at night or something.]","[He must have been working late last night, that's why he's sleeping until nine, everyone should be understanding.]","\"Brother Xi, time to get up for breakfast.\" Assistant Zhang Dong came in carrying a bowl of noodles, pushing the door open and calling out.","[You've got to be kidding. Judging by how practiced his assistant is, I bet he brings a bowl up every day.]","[Tsk, Xie Xi seems too lazy, even having his assistant bring food to bed. Might as well hang a pancake around his neck so he can just lower his head to eat when hungry.]","[Hey, watch your words up front. What's wrong with the assistant bringing up noodles?]","Inside the video, Zhang Dong was unaware of the bullet comments. He set the noodles aside, pressed the stereo on the table a few times, and a song sung by Assistant Zhang Dong himself immediately started playing.","After doing this, Zhang Dong sat down, picked up the bowl, and started slurping the noodles, his foot tapping along to the music's rhythm.","[Hahaha, the assistant is so mean, he actually started eating it himself!]","Xie Xi suddenly sat up, walked barefoot to Zhang Dong's side, and reached out to turn off the stereo: \"Sounds terrible.\"","Seeing he was awake, Zhang Dong said while chewing noodles, \"Sister He made noodles today, with a fried egg too.\"","Normally, a housekeeper would do the cooking. Sister He would cook for the two of them when she had time. Having nothing much on today, she made noodles.","Xie Xi went to change, wash up, then came downstairs to eat noodles with them, looking leisurely and utterly unlike someone about to start work.","Not just him, but the few people around him were also unhurried, whereas You Feibai's side was like a battlefield, everyone rushing from one engagement to another, tense and busy. Xu Qingwei's side wasn't as packed as You Feibai's, but his phone kept ringing non-stop.","After breakfast, Xie Xi finally started work by going to the recording studio. In a good mood today, he sat at the drum set and played for half an hour before starting to discuss a new song with others in the studio. He spent the whole day there without leaving, even lunch was takeout.","But with Zhang Dong around, even takeout in the recording studio felt like a feast. A folding table was set up in the studio, and a bunch of people sat down to eat, the conversation still revolving around the new song.","On the other fronts, You Feibai had already rushed to his next schedule, an event at a shopping mall. Xu Qingwei went to meet with actors to discuss his own drama.","By six in the afternoon, Xu Qingwei had returned home and started reading books and watching shows. You Feibai was still in the car, memorizing his script lines while a makeup artist removed his makeup.","[Brother really works so hard, I haven't seen him rest all day, he was even memorizing lines while eating.]","[My heart aches for You Feibai.]","[No wonder he won Best Actor at such a young age, it all comes from hard work and dedication.]","The entire screen was discussing You Feibai, listing his achievements.","At six-thirty, Xie Xi began working with his team to finalize and sing the song they had created that day.","[???]","[!!!]","[Th-this... a whole song finished in one day?!]","[So impressive, nothing in the morning, and the entire song is done by afternoon.]","[It sounds great, wow, thanks to this show for letting me hear Xixi's new song.]","[I wonder how long until it's included in an album and released. Good thing I recorded the screen, I can listen to it every day!]","\"Hmm... feels pretty good.\" The teacher in charge of the accompaniment nodded, stroking his chin.","\"If we refine the chorus a bit more, this song is basically done.\"","Xie Xi took off his headphones: \"I don't like this song. Scrap it.\"","With one sentence, he abandoned this nearly finished song. The team members beside him showed no surprise, clearly accustomed to this.","[What does 'scrap it' mean?]","['Scrap it' means this song won't be performed publicly again, ever.]","[So the whole day's work was for nothing?]","[Xixi seems to be like this. Anyway, he writes all these lyrics himself, so he discards them as he pleases.]","[I really feel for his team with Xie Xi acting like this.]","[Hah, the team is paid to do their job, what's there to feel sorry for? Besides, isn't Xixi just trying to create good music for us to hear?]","[Xie Xi's team seems to have been with him since his debut. If there were problems, they would have made a fuss long ago.]","[A bystander wants to say: Xie Xi's focus on just one thing is actually much better than trying to do everything. Although You Feibai works hard, he could refuse some of those commercial activities and focus more on studying the script.]","[No comparisons, please. Both are amazing, taking my Bai with me.]","At eight in the evening, Xu Qingwei started spending time with his family, reading to his child. You Feibai was at an audition; due to confidentiality, the camera switched to filming the scenery and passersby downstairs. Xie Xi, meanwhile, started playing video games.","He played for a bit, then lay down on the sofa, bored, staring at the ceiling, letting his game character die.","Xie Xi hadn't been in the mood for gaming lately, even feeling a bit like writing.","\"Zhang Dong, read out the hot searches.\"","\"Brother Xi, let me finish this round first.\" Zhang Dong looked down at his phone. After a while, he began his daily task: reading the hot searches.","The next moment, all viewers watching this reality show episode were treated to the scene of Xie Xi ranting about the Weibo hot search list."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54","paragraphs":["\"Xia Zhoubing with a buzz cut.\"","Xie Xi, having pulled out a squeaky frog toy from who-knows-where, squeezed it while frowning: \"Why is a buzz cut trending too? This guy was trending the day before yesterday for his fingers, a week ago for having long legs. Trending this many times a month, he might as well just call himself Xia Feifei / Xia Boiling.\"","\"Brother Xi, let's look at the next trending topic,\" Zhang Dong said, remembering the program's monitoring cameras around them, trying to steer the conversation away.","\"Is he that handsome?\" Xie Xi asked instead.","Zhang Dong: \"Brother Xi, in my eyes, you are the only most handsome person in the industry.\"","[Hahahaha, the assistant's flattery.]","[Hahahaha Xia Feifei / Xia Boiling, that's brilliant!]","[So Xie Xi also thinks Xia Zhoubing's trending searches are too frequent, just like me. Did he buy a monthly package?]","Xie Xi wasn't buying Zhang Dong's act at all. He directly reached for his phone to look at the photos, opening several to examine them carefully: \"Average. Didn't You Feibai also trend with a buzz cut last year? He looked better than this Xia Zhoubing.\"","\"Yes, yes, Brother Xi, I think you should go to sleep.\" If he kept reading and making sarcastic remarks like this, who knows how many people Xie Xi would offend.","\"You haven't finished reading all the trending topics,\" Xie Xi glanced at Zhang Dong, thinking his memory was terrible.","Zhang Dong immediately put his eloquence to work, reciting all the trending search terms within a minute.","Xie Xi's attention was clearly no longer on the trending searches; he remembered something: \"Last year, You Feibai trended with his buzz cut, legs, hands, and even eyelashes. Xia Zhoubing is still missing the eyelashes.\"","Zhang Dong almost wanted to kneel and beg his brother to stop talking—the cameras were still on!","Last year, when You Feibai's popularity peaked, even a single strand of his hair was scrutinized. Combined with his genuinely excellent qualities, those trending searches weren't surprising. Now, with Xie Xi pointing it out, anyone with half a brain would realize Xia Zhoubing was following You Feibai's playbook.","[Now that Xie Xi mentions it, it really does seem that way.]","[Shocked. As a fan of You Feibai, I didn't even realize Xia Zhoubing was copying my idol's strategy.]","[Even though they're both actors of the new generation, the gap between them is so huge. Who would have thought? Isn't this overreaching?]","[Xie Xi is really daring to speak his mind! Suddenly want to switch fandoms.]","[I have a question. Didn't Xie Xi go for tutoring? And he even hired the famous Professor Ye. Why does he need his assistant to read trending searches to him? Can't he read that little text? No wonder his handwriting is so poor.]","[? It's just reading a trending search. Why are you making such a big deal?]","[Actually, I'm also puzzled. Xie Xi's speech and demeanor don't seem like someone uneducated, so why does he make so many typos? And it's not just reading trending searches; several times when there was text to read, it was that assistant reading it. He didn't look at it himself.]","[Celebrities undergo specialized training, so of course their demeanor doesn't seem uneducated.]","[But still, Xie Xi seems to have not changed at all since his debut, except his face matured. You can find this info on any gossip account.]","[Does your family require academic qualifications for singing now? How annoying!]","Actually, by saying this on the program, Xia Zhoubing's team could easily paint Xie Xi as narrow-minded, looking down on a second-tier actor—there were several ways to smear Xie Xi.","But there was one very unfortunate coincidence.","Although the third episode of \"Their Lives\" was airing now, it was filmed at least two weeks prior. And tonight, two weeks later, right after the episode aired, the last trending search from the package Xia Zhoubing's team bought last month went live.","It was precisely \"Xia Zhoubing's Incredible Eyelashes.\"","The team was waiting for a wave of praise and compliments from the public, but the top-liked comment was: [\"I'm so embarrassed I could dig out a three-bedroom apartment with my feet.\"]","The second comment was: [\"Are you the great prophet? Xie Xi\"]","[Damn, hahahahaha! So awkward. I'm genuinely embarrassed for Xia Zhoubing.]","[No way, is he really copying my idol's path?]","Because of this coincidence, Xie Xi quickly trended himself, paired with the tag \"Prophet Xie Xi.\"","By the time Xia Zhoubing's team reacted, the fact that they had bought trending searches mimicking You Feibai's was already known across the internet. Taking down the trend was useless.","Xia Zhoubing could only swallow this bitter pill, mentally noting a grudge against Xie Xi.","...","The change in Tianqiu Tech's shareholding structure didn't cause much of a stir within the company. Everyone was busy with their own work, and besides, the company operated no differently than usual. It was just that Ye Qiusuo was now the undisputed largest shareholder, practically able to decide all matters.","The first thing Ye Qiusuo did was to find a spokesperson—someone to represent Tianqiu externally without holding power, a non-executive spokesperson.","It needed to be someone internal, familiar with the company's processes, but not particularly versed in technical details. Ye Qiusuo directly skipped the researchers. However, people in other positions also often had technical roles and weren't especially skilled with words, likely unable to withstand the media's intense questioning.","Finally, Ye Qiusuo set her sights on her own assistant. She felt Zhao Guiyin met these conditions.","\"Spokesperson?\" Zhao Guiyin, called into the office, was momentarily stunned after hearing Ye Qiusuo's explanation.","\"The spokesperson salary will be calculated separately for you, if you're willing.\"","Suppressing the mix of emotions in her heart, Zhao Guiyin immediately agreed, \"I'm willing!\"","And so the matter was settled.","Ye Qiusuo became somewhat less busy because two projects were temporarily paused due to funding issues. Her main focus shifted to the dyslexia glasses. The data collected from several hospitals was almost ready for experimental use.","She planned to first try making a pair of glasses for Xie Xi. After all, he was the investor and deserved to be the first to receive a pair.","The lenses of these glasses looked no different from ordinary ones, but the material was completely different and relatively expensive. Both the frames and lenses contained chips that could correct and fill in missing or incorrect characters.","After the company stabilized, Ye Qiusuo concentrated on researching the glasses and successfully designed a prototype just before the Minor New Year.","However, remembering that Xie Xi was a major celebrity, ordinary frames might not be suitable. She specifically asked her assistant to invite a frame designer to create a more... fashionable pair of glasses.","Or perhaps several pairs, so he could switch them up.","The designer, a bit flustered, came in, glanced at Ye Qiusuo, and suggested, \"Your face is small. Large frames would obscure your features and put more burden on your nose bridge. The pair you're wearing now suits you very well.\"","He thought she wanted frames designed specifically for her.","Zhao Guiyin coughed and whispered to the designer, \"This is the person in charge of our glasses project. The person needing the frames isn't her.\"","Only then did the designer notice she was wearing a lab coat like the others, with an ID badge on her chest.","\"Please design a few frame styles suitable for him. Later, we'll design mass-market frames based on the data,\" Ye Qiusuo said, pulling up a photo of them together on set from her phone to show the designer.","The designer stared at it for a moment, then asked, \"Is this a custom order for this client specifically?\"","Ye Qiusuo nodded.","\"In that case, could we obtain precise facial measurements for this client? That way, the designed frames would fit him to the greatest extent possible.\"","\"Can't you tell just from the photo?\"","\"I can get a general idea, but to design frames that both suit him and are comfortable to wear, I'll need his measurements.\" The designer loved working on these custom single-prescription glasses—it was where his skill truly shone.","Ye Qiusuo put her phone away. \"Let me ask him first.\""]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55","paragraphs":["When Ye Qiusuo's message came through, Xie Xi was in the recording studio playing the drums. He had recently taken a liking to this, neglecting his singing, giving his team a break, and coming to bang on them every day.","After listening to her voice message, and even though he knew it was just to get measurements for glasses, the big star's heart beat louder than the sound of the drums.","After a moment, Xie Xi said with feigned reserve that he didn't know how to measure his facial features and was afraid the data would be inaccurate, asking if she could come find him if she had time.","Ye Qiusuo quickly replied: \"We can come over now.\"","Xie Xi's attention was completely captured by the latter half of the sentence, 'can come over now,' completely missing the plural pronoun at the beginning.","He stood up, paced nervously for a bit, then said to Zhang Dong beside him: \"Let's go back.\"","Zhang Dong was watching a TV drama. He let out an \"Ah?\" and said, \"Bro Xi, you're done practicing?\"","\"She's coming to find me.\" The corners of Xie Xi's lips lifted slightly before he quickly pressed them down. \"Let's head back first.\"","As soon as Zhang Dong heard 'she,' he knew who it was.","\"Bro Xi, did you tell Professor Ye to go to the villa?\"","\"Not yet.\" Xie Xi gripped his phone, about to reply.","Zhang Dong earnestly advised, \"Bro Xi, they say people are most attractive when they're focused on their work. I think it would be better to have Professor Ye come find you here, with you right in the middle of practicing.\" This way, he could also finish watching these two episodes of the drama.","Xie Xi thought it over carefully, found his reasoning sound, and sat back down: \"Then I... won't leave?\"","\"Bro Xi, I'll keep watch outside for you. As soon as Professor Ye arrives, I'll notify you.\"","\"Okay.\"","Zhang Dong immediately walked out of the recording booth to keep an eye out at the main entrance.","Only then did Xie Xi reply to Ye Qiusuo, sending her an address.","...","\"Sorry to trouble you to come along.\" After hearing the address Xie Xi gave, Ye Qiusuo took the designer with her.","Sitting in the car, the designer couldn't help asking curiously, \"Is Tianqiu developing some high-tech glasses?\"","Tianqiu Technology had long been associated with high-tech in the public's mind.","Ye Qiusuo originally intended to say they were just glasses to correct dyslexia, but suddenly remembered that Xie Xi seemed to have never publicly disclosed his condition. So she gave an ambiguous acknowledgment.","Half an hour later, Ye Qiusuo arrived at the address Xie Xi had sent. She and the designer walked in together.","Zhang Dong, who had been squatting behind the main door, saw her and immediately sent a message to Xie Xi in the recording booth: [Bro Xi, Professor Ye is here!]","Xie Xi inside the booth had been waiting all along. As soon as he read Zhang Dong's message, his foot immediately pressed on the bass drum pedal and his hands picked up the drumsticks to start playing.","Meanwhile, Ye Qiusuo had already led the designer towards the recording booth. The hallway was lined with them, various sounds leaking from within.","She only stopped when she reached Xie Xi's studio, reaching out to knock on the door.","There was no response. She gave it a light push, and the door opened.","Xie Xi was playing the drums. He wore only a thin shirt, a black headband around his forehead, longer strands of hair falling outside it. A similar black wristband was on his wrist, making his skin appear even more cold and pale like jade, his profile breathtakingly handsome.","Ye Qiusuo stood at the doorway, stepping aside to let the designer in. She didn't go further, intending to wait for him to finish playing.","Xie Xi saw them enter from the corner of his eye, waiting for her to come over and call him. To his surprise, she didn't move.","Xie Xi almost stopped himself, but remembering Zhang Dong's words, he pretended nothing was amiss and kept going. Only after finishing the piece did he gradually stop, a light sweat on his brow.","\"Professor, you're here.\" Xie Xi pretended to have just noticed her, getting up to greet her.","\"Yes, sorry to interrupt.\" Ye Qiusuo introduced the designer beside her. \"We need to measure your facial features to make glasses that fit you better.\"","Xie Xi understood this perfectly well; the optician had said the same when he first got glasses.","The designer rummaged in his bag for his tools, asked Xie Xi to sit down, and prepared to take the measurements.","Ye Qiusuo watched from the side. Before the designer began, she pulled a tissue from nearby and handed it to Xie Xi. \"Wipe.\"","He still had sweat on his forehead.","\"Oh.\" Xie Xi obediently took it, removed the headband, and wiped off the sweat.","The designer mainly measured the distance between his eyes, the height of his nose bridge, and his ears, taking other areas in passing. As he measured, he marveled inwardly at how exceptionally well-proportioned the young man's features were; the data could practically be used for 3D modeling.","\"All done.\" The designer noted down the data and packed up his tools.","Ye Qiusuo said, \"We'll head back now.\"","Xie Xi hadn't expected her to leave so soon. He stood up and asked, \"When... when will the glasses be ready?\"","\"If the designer finalizes the design, they can probably be made in a day or two.\"","\"It won't take me many days. I can have the design ready by the day after tomorrow at the latest,\" the designer said confidently from the side.","Xie Xi looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"When they're done, I'll come find you to get them.\"","\"Alright, come directly to the company.\" Ye Qiusuo nodded and then left.","After they were gone, Xie Xi stood where he was, motionless, until Zhang Dong slipped in.","\"Bro Xi, Professor Ye left already? It hasn't even been ten minutes.\"","\"She just came to take measurements.\" Xie Xi hooked a chair over with his foot and sat down, feeling dejected. \"And someone else did the measuring.\"","As an all-around capable assistant, Zhang Dong felt compelled to solve Xie Xi's woes. After thinking, he said, \"Bro Xi, didn't you invest in this project? You can totally visit often for check-ups. Once a month isn't excessive.\"","\"Then if I invest in a few more projects, can I see her every week?\" Xie Xi extrapolated.","\"...Theoretically, yes, but Bro Xi, you seem to be out of money.\" He had heard that conversation with Sister Wei loud and clear—all the money in his accounts over the years had been withdrawn.","Xie Xi: Annoying.","\"Ask Sister Wei tomorrow if there are any gigs.\" Xie Xi finally developed an awareness of needing to work.","...","Within a week, the eyeglass frames had been designed. Not only were there regular frames for daily wear, but also several sunglass frames. Ye Qiusuo had lenses fitted to them, resulting in ten pairs in total, all neatly boxed.","She then contacted Xie Xi, asking him to come pick them up and to test whether the glasses were successful.","Xie Xi arrived extremely quickly. Ye Qiusuo hadn't even finished reading a document before he was already downstairs at Tianqiu Technology.","\"I'm going down for a bit. If there's anything, please wait.\" Ye Qiusuo came out and said to Zhao Guiyin.","\"Understood, President Ye.\"","Ye Qiusuo took the elevator to the first floor, got two temporary ID cards from the front desk, and then walked to the lobby, where she saw Xie Xi sitting on a sofa.","\"These are ID cards. You'll need to swipe them to go up later.\" Ye Qiusuo handed them to him and his assistant.","Xie Xi took his, feeling as if it still carried her body warmth.","Ye Qiusuo led them upstairs to the lab.","\"These are your glasses. Pick a pair to wear first; they're all the same. You can try the sunglasses again later.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed to a row of glasses cases.","Xie Xi randomly picked a pair of glasses and put them on. Ye Qiusuo led him to a station, where she took out two booklets. The top lines of both had text, and the lower halves were filled with paragraphs.","\"Feeling dizzy?\"","Xie Xi shook his head. There was no dizziness at all, and the words in the paragraphs no longer danced or swirled.","\"Write down what you see.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed to the blank space in the upper section.","This time, Xie Xi copied willingly, even feeling a bit nostalgic.","Ye Qiusuo stood beside him, watching him write. His strokes were almost all wrong; writing for him was like drawing characters, but at least the overall structure was finally complete.","\"The glasses are effective.\" Ye Qiusuo felt relieved. \"You can relearn how to write later.\"","Xie Xi was also delighted that he could see the characters clearly, his eyes brimming with intense joy.","\"Wear them for the whole day first to see if there are any other issues.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed to the other three glasses cases. \"You can try the sunglasses now too.\"","She had intended to watch him try the sunglasses, but a researcher called Ye Qiusuo over, so she had to leave Zhang Dong to keep an eye on things.","\"Brother Xi, can you really see clearly?\" Zhang Dong found it somewhat miraculous.","\"Mhm.\" Xie Xi opened a sunglasses case, took out the sunglasses inside, put them on, and wrote another page before showing it to Zhang Dong. \"Is it correct?\"","Zhang Dong nodded. \"Completely correct.\"","The corner of Xie Xi's mouth lifted slightly. \"The glasses she made for me.\"","After putting down the sunglasses, Xie Xi opened all the other glasses cases and looked them over. Suddenly, he picked up the pair in the middle and asked Zhang Dong, \"Doesn't this one look like the pair she was wearing just now?\"","Zhang Dong examined it carefully. \"Somewhat similar. They both have metal frames, but Professor Ye's has a chain.\"","Xie Xi fiddled with them for a moment and then put them on directly. \"A chain can be added separately.\" Besides, he knew where to find an identical chain.","Zhang Dong sighed inwardly: To find a connection with Professor Ye, his Brother Xi was really going out of his way to spot similarities.","After speaking a few words with the researcher, Ye Qiusuo walked over. \"Have you tried them all? How are they?\"","\"The sunglasses work too. I really like all these glasses,\" Xie Xi said bluntly.","He didn't dare say he liked the person directly, but saying he liked the sunglasses? That he could do.","\"That's good. Wear them for a while first. If no issues arise, we'll start mass production here.\" Adopting the attitude of the project lead, Ye Qiusuo said seriously, \"There will be a project plan then. You're welcome to come and participate when you have time.\"","Xie Xi, of course, agreed immediately. He promptly asked, \"When?\"","He even wanted to come tomorrow.","\"First, give yourself some time to adjust.\" It was best to be cautious about such things.","\"Then... can I come tomorrow?\" Xie Xi asked, his mind running ahead of him.","\"Tomorrow?\" Ye Qiusuo was surprised.","Xie Xi pinched his palm, pretending to be calm. \"Don't you need my data? I can come for testing every day.\"","Ye Qiusuo was taken aback for a moment, then said, \"No need for such trouble. As long as you're comfortable wearing them and your eyes are fine, that's all that matters.\"","\"Could there be eye problems?\" Xie Xi asked.","\"If the glasses aren't suitable, they could indeed cause issues for your eyes.\"","Xie Xi said gravely, \"Then I'd better come every day. My eyes can't have problems.\"","Celebrities indeed had to pay more attention to their health, especially areas like the eyes. Ye Qiusuo expressed understanding. \"That's also possible. Just let me know the day before you come. You'll need a temporary ID card to enter and exit the company.\"","This actually worked?","Zhang Dong stood to the side, watching his brother tell such a straight-faced lie. He felt sorry for Professor Ye.","\"You're the first case. A batch of other test subjects will be receiving their glasses this month gradually, so don't worry too much.\" Professor Ye felt it necessary to reassure Xie Xi, after all, he was the first to wear the glasses.","Xie Xi, wearing the pair of glasses similar to the ones on Ye Qiusuo's face, listened to her comforting words, feeling utterly pleased.","Starting tomorrow, he would come every day, doing his best to get closer to her.","\"Brother Xi.\" Once the two of them were downstairs, Zhang Dong burst his bubble. \"Coming occasionally is fine, but every day is impossible.\"","\"Why?\" Xie Xi felt he had a perfectly good reason to come daily.","\"You forgot? You asked Sister Wei to find you some work.\" Zhang Dong took out his phone. \"She's already booked some.\""]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56","paragraphs":["\"I've signed you on as the spokesperson for Luli's Asia region. There's a brand event in France this month, perfect timing, you need to go.\" Wei Qi was in a good mood. Xie Xi was finally willing to take the initiative in his career. Luli was one of the global luxury brands; of course she had to secure good resources for him.","Xie Xi: \"...I have to go to France this month?\"","\"Of course you have to go. It's the annual brand event, all the important spokespersons need to attend.\"","The person in question, Xie Xi, was now filled with regret, deep regret.","\"How many days minimum for France?\"","Wei Qi calculated: \"Round trip, plus attending the event, at least six days.\"","Xie Xi: \"...Is the endorsement fee high?\"","Wei Qi looked at her artist. \"You've been acting a bit strange lately.\"","Xie Xi immediately reverted to his usual lazy demeanor. \"Just asking casually. My accounts are all empty.\"","\"Don't worry, Luli's endorsement fee won't be low,\" Wei Qi said with a smile. \"There are also three more episodes of the reality show to record. Between the endorsement and the show, get some good rest tonight.\"","He had almost forgotten about the reality show. That would take at least three days.","The more Big Star Xie thought about it, the unhappier he became.","\"What's going on?\" Wei Qi suddenly asked seriously.","\"What?\"","Wei Qi pointed at the glasses on his face. \"Why are you wearing glasses so late at night?\"","Mentioning this, Xie Xi said with a touch of pride, \"Professor Ye gave them to me.\"","\"Professor Ye gave... oh, that research glasses project.\" Wei Qi caught on.","Xie Xi nodded, straightened up, and brushed past a box nearby. He opened the magnetic clasp, lifted the lid, revealing a row of glasses cases inside. \"Professor Ye gave me all of these.\" His tone carried a hint of showing off.","However, Agent Wei clearly didn't pick up on it. \"Can you see the characters clearly now? Why so many pairs?\"","\"Yes. Professor Ye was worried that having only one pair wouldn't match all my outfits, so she specially had so many made for me.\" Xie Xi employed a bit of creative phrasing, suddenly making Professor Ye sound rather ambiguous.","\"Professor Ye is so thoughtful,\" Wei Qi nodded. \"Having only one pair really isn't very convenient.\"","Xie Xi: Why is there no reaction at all? He had been so blatant. Shouldn't she suspect something?","In reality, in Wei Qi's mind, Professor Ye belonged to the category of people who would never have a closer relationship with a star like Xie Xi in this lifetime. After all, she seemed too upright, exuding an air of a scholar.","...","The next day, at 8:30 in the morning, Ye Qiusuo received a call and came downstairs to lead Xie Xi up.","\"Did you wear them after going back last night? Do your eyes feel uncomfortable at all?\" Ye Qiusuo was wearing a white lab coat, holding a tablet, scrolling quickly.","Xie Xi, using his height advantage, could easily see the content on her tablet. Although looking at characters no longer made him dizzy, he still couldn't understand what was on it; it was very complex.","\"My eyes feel a little tired.\"","\"Hmm, your brain might still be adapting. It should get better in a few days. If it doesn't, we'll need to make adjustments.\"","The elevator opened. Ye Qiusuo led him towards the same lab as yesterday. It was basically empty now, all the experimental data and various items had been removed.","\"Sit.\" Ye Qiusuo took a brand-new notebook from a drawer in another desk. \"You can try writing. Have your assistant check if it's correct.\"","Different from the previous teaching and copying sessions, Xie Xi didn't slack off this time. Instead, he sat up straight and proper, holding the pen and starting to trace.","Ye Qiusuo watched for a while and shook her head. \"Since you can see now, you can find time to start practicing your handwriting properly.\" It would also save others the chance to criticize him.","Looking at his own crooked and scrawled characters, Xie Xi suddenly felt he had found a new way to spend money.","When Ye Qiusuo got up to talk to someone who had come from outside, Xie Xi immediately called Zhang Dong over and whispered a few words to him.","When Ye Qiusuo came back in, Xie Xi was still sitting with his back straight, copying diligently. His assistant approached.","\"Professor Ye, could we trouble you to be Brother Xi's teacher again? We'll pay the same hourly rate as last time,\" Zhang Dong sighed. \"You know how many people out there say Brother Xi didn't finish junior high, that he's uncultured and makes tons of character mistakes.\"","\"With that money, you could easily hire a professional calligraphy teacher.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't understand his reasoning.","Zhang Dong coughed, pulling Ye Qiusuo towards a corner, lowering his voice. \"It's like this, Professor Ye. Brother Xi isn't very willing to deal with strangers. Plus, he thinks your handwriting is very beautiful. Professor Ye, you don't need to teach too meticulously. Just let Brother Xi practice by copying your notes, and you can check his work.\"","Seeing Ye Qiusuo still hesitating, Zhang Dong started playing the sympathy card. \"Professor Ye, you know Brother Xi's situation. He's a big star. If he rashly hires a teacher, it could easily cause problems. You, on the other hand, know the background, and you wouldn't talk about Brother Xi's affairs outside.\"","This line could only fool an outsider who didn't understand the entertainment industry. Coincidentally, Ye Qiusuo truly didn't understand it at all. She frowned, looking at Xie Xi writing earnestly across the room. He sat at the long white table, his profile clean and handsome, as if no foulness could come near him.","\"Alright,\" Ye Qiusuo agreed.","Although she agreed, Ye Qiusuo didn't have extra time right now. She wasn't at the company to sit in an office; she had matters to handle.","\"The temporary ID card is still valid for over two hours. You can practice your handwriting here. When the time is almost up, I'll come get you.\" Before leaving, Ye Qiusuo pointed at the door. \"I won't lock this door. You can go out into the hallway, but don't wander to other areas. It will trigger the alarm.\"","\"Understood.\"","As soon as she left, Xie Xi asked Zhang Dong, \"How did it go? Did she agree?\"","Zhang Dong nodded. \"She said she agreed, but didn't specify a time. Professor Ye seems really busy.\"","The two sat inside whispering, while Ye Qiusuo went to the first-floor lobby to meet a guest.","...","\"Professor Ye, long time no see.\" Hearing footsteps, Lu Minglang turned and saw Ye Qiusuo, then corrected himself. \"I should call you President Ye now.\"","\"President Lu, is there something you need?\"","Lu Minglang looked at the cool and detached Ye Qiusuo opposite him, his gaze meaningful. \"I came to discuss cooperation with President Ye.\"","\"If I remember correctly, there were no issues at the conclusion of our previous cooperative project.\"","Lu Minglang was wearing a custom-made light grey suit today, making him appear even more tall and straight. He curled the corner of his lips. \"The previous project was a pleasant cooperation, which is why I, Lu, wish to continue working with President Ye. To clean up the mess left behind by Zhang Chengjue, I imagine Tianqiu Tech's capital chain has been operating under extreme strain.\"","Tianqiu had been watched by major industry players for the past two years, so it was normal for someone to have estimated this. Ye Qiusuo looked at Lu Minglang. \"So?\"","\"So, President Ye's new project must have no capital to invest.\" Lu Minglang said this, switching back to 'Professor Ye'.","A research scientist, originally only wanting to research her own projects, now in control of a company, yet without the funds to conduct her own research—no one would be too happy about that.","Lu Minglang was extremely confident the other party would agree.","\"I have several new projects. Which one is President Lu referring to?\"","Lu Minglang lowered his head, straightening his sleeve, then looked up. \"The one Professor Ye needs funding for the most.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked expressionlessly at Lu Minglang. He knew about her new project—the artificial neural synapse project she had only mentioned at the shareholders' meeting, for which she had secured funding but had not yet begun research and development.","\"President Ye, merely stripping shares without a gag order is still troublesome,\" Lu Minglang chuckled lightly. \"Zhang Chengjue often drowns his sorrows in drink; anyone could easily pry information from him in a bar.\"","In that moment, the lofty eldest son of the Lu family reminded Ye Qiusuo, for no apparent reason, of the male lead in the book who had sailed smoothly through the entertainment industry relying solely on the Lu family's reputation.","Ye Qiusuo finally frowned. \"Perhaps President Lu needs to have a bit more respect for the law.\"","\"I merely came to remind you, President Ye,\" Lu Minglang said with a smile on his handsome face. \"After all, we are still partners.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't want to entangle with him any further. \"I will not cooperate with you on the new project.\"","Lu Minglang's smile froze at the corners of his mouth. After a moment, he resumed an air of casual indifference. \"Professor Ye, what if someone releases this project before you?\"","\"No one will get ahead of me. Tianqiu Technology has all the necessary experimental instruments; no laboratory, domestic or international, can match that,\" Ye Qiusuo replied, a rare hint of arrogant pride flashing in her eyes. \"And most importantly, Tianqiu Technology has me.\"","With that, Ye Qiusuo walked directly toward the elevator doors without looking back.","Lu Minglang watched her retreating figure deeply. After stepping out of Tianqiu Technology's main entrance, he turned, looked up at the logo, and suddenly laughed softly for no reason. \"Interesting.\"","...","\"President Ye, did he come to... declare war?\" Zhao Guiyin, watching from upstairs as Lu Minglang got into his car and left, couldn't help but ask.","The Lu family appeared formidable to the outside world, but many companies and enterprises did not like them. For no other reason than that the Lu family excelled at mergers and acquisitions. Entering a new industry, they would first start a company, then slowly swallow others up, always targeting the most powerful companies in the field.","They had played this game to perfection for many years.","By now, Ye Qiusuo's expression had returned to its usual calm, her features peaceful. She always hid that streak of arrogance extremely well.","\"I'm going downstairs.\" Ye Qiusuo wanted to go see Xie Xi practicing his calligraphy and also ask about his teaching schedule. \"Tomorrow, give me a list of all the new employees who joined last month.\"","\"Yes.\"","When Ye Qiusuo went down one more floor, Xie Xi was still writing. She felt a bit surprised. Usually, he loved to slack off, often making small movements when he thought she wasn't looking.","Back then, thinking he was genuinely uncomfortable looking at the characters, she had pretended not to see.","So now, since looking at the characters doesn't make him dizzy anymore, he's stopped slacking off?","\"Professor Ye.\" Zhang Dong called out upon seeing her enter, also reminding Xie Xi to perk up.","Ye Qiusuo walked to Xie Xi's side and looked at the half-page of weak, floating characters he had written. \"Do you recognize these characters?\"","He used to see them in a blur. Now, the characters he sees are completely different from before, so he should probably start learning from scratch.","\"I'm learning,\" Xie Xi admitted. Many characters were essentially being seen clearly for the first time.","\"Mm, start with the basic strokes when practicing calligraphy.\" Ye Qiusuo exported her schedule from her phone and sent it to Xie Xi. \"I've marked my available time in red. See what time works for you.\"","Xie Xi looked it over and was utterly shocked.","Because the schedule Ye Qiusuo marked in red completely conflicted with his own.","\"...\"","\"What's wrong?\" Ye Qiusuo asked, noticing his strange expression.","\"I need to go back and ask my manager to know my schedule,\" Xie Xi lied, his eyes darting away slightly.","Ye Qiusuo nodded. \"You can message me tonight.\"","Under normal circumstances, if Professor Ye actively asked him to send a message, Xie Xi would secretly feel happy for a while. But now, his mind was filled with the thought: maybe I should just stop working for a bit.","\"Alright, I'll take you both downstairs. I have something to attend to outside, so you can't stay here for the full three hours,\" Ye Qiusuo said.","This was also Tianqiu Technology's rule: when the person who applied for the temporary ID leaves, the people they brought must also leave.","Because of Lu Minglang's sudden visit, Ye Qiusuo suddenly had something she needed to do."]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57","paragraphs":["[Ahhhh, I'm here, brother!]","[So happy, this episode features the trio together, finally we get to see two handsome guys in the same frame.]","For this episode of \"Their Lives,\" the recording theme is what celebrities usually eat in their daily lives. To film this episode, the crew followed them for fifteen days, observing what they ate for three meals a day. Then, the three of them sat together in a restaurant, having dinner while watching and commenting on the playback of their own footage.","The first one shown was You Feibai. Because he's so busy, his meals are mostly packed and brought over by several assistants, largely consisting of salads made from various vegetables and fruits, along with some chicken breast and eggs.","\"Being an actor is tough. To maintain their figure, they often eat these kinds of bland, oil-less foods,\" Xu Qingwei remarked with a sigh. She turned to ask You Feibai, \"Do you usually feel full eating these?\"","\"It's alright. I don't have any particular obsession with food,\" You Feibai said with a light laugh. \"A lot of the time, my focus is on the script, and I don't really pay attention to what I'm eating.\"","\"Feibai is practically a workaholic. He never lets go of his script, even during meals,\" Xu Qingwei shook her head. \"When I was young, I only knew how to have fun.\"","\"I've taken on too much this year. I'll appropriately reduce my schedule next year,\" You Feibai said, sitting upright with his long fingers interlaced on the table. Compared to the various changeable roles he plays in movies, he himself isn't very down-to-earth; he belongs to the type that you can tell is distinctly different from ordinary people at a glance.","The videos edited for the show, although focused on eating, also captured the context before and after. Xu Qingwei is more ordinary. When work is busy, she eats out with colleagues or grabs something casual. When not busy, the housekeeper prepares home-cooked meals for the family to sit down and eat together.","\"I'm not very good at cooking. I can manage porridge, but that's about it,\" Xu Qingwei said, looking somewhat helplessly at the footage of herself. \"When I lived off-campus during university, I tried cooking myself once and nearly started a fire. I've had a bit of a phobia of open flames ever since.\"","\"You could use an induction cooker,\" Xie Xi said bluntly.","Xu Qingwei was taken aback for a moment, then had to admit, \"I don't really enjoy cooking either. My husband will cook when he's in the mood.\"","Xie Xi seemed thoughtful. Perhaps he could also learn how to cook. Professor Ye probably wouldn't cook either when busy.","[Hahahaha, why does Xixi even know about induction cookers?]","[Eh, Xixi is wearing glasses today, feels like he's reached a new level of handsome.]","[Silver-rimmed glasses with an anti-slip chain, doesn't it look familiar, sisters?]","[Lots of celebrities wear this style, right?]","[Professor Ye was wearing this exact type of glasses when he appeared on the show!]","[Awooo! Xie-Ye shippers never sleep!]","From their meals, you can tell how the three of them usually live. Xu Qingwei is like an ordinary middle-aged career woman. Apart from work, she talks with her children at the dining table, and the dishes are quite normal. You Feibai is busy every single day, often eating at makeshift tables in various locations, with meals mostly planned by a nutritionist—low oil, lots of vegetables and protein.","As for Xie Xi...","The two people beside him watched with their eyes wide open.","His three meals a day couldn't even be described as lavish anymore.","In the morning, the cook prepares several styles, both Chinese and Western. Which one Xie Xi eats depends entirely on his mood that day. For lunch, whether at home or out, it's the same variety of dishes with meat and vegetables, plus a hearty broth or clear soup. Even when ordering takeout, his assistant Zhang Dong ensures everything is perfectly arranged.","The most classic scene was when Xie Xi went to a forest park to shoot a commercial. The park was extremely far from the city center, with basically no restaurants around, except for one very small KFC outlet. Shooting from morning until noon, the staff could only make do with burgers and such.","Just as everyone was eating burgers, Zhang Dong arrived leading a car. He had placed a large takeout order early in the morning, timed perfectly for delivery, and brought it for the staff to eat.","After doing this, Zhang Dong began, with a clear conscience, to receive another vehicle. He unloaded a table, chairs, and tableware from it. The chairs even had long-haired soft cushions, making them comfortable to sit on. Over a dozen exquisite, delicious, and still-hot dishes were transferred onto plates. Sharp-eyed netizens could completely tell that this tableware set was the same one Xie Xi used at home.","They even temporarily set up a canopy to block the wind.","Although the staff's meals were plentiful, they weren't as refined as what Xie Xi ate. Of course, no one had any complaints, since they were still eating food he provided, and it wasn't bad at all.","In the video, Xie Xi displayed his picky eating habits to the fullest. Out of over a dozen dishes, he only actually took bites from two or three.","After watching the edited footage from so many days of following him, everyone gained a renewed understanding of Xie Xi's daily three meals.","[Holy crap, this is the celebrity lifestyle I imagined.]","[Xixi is so picky. Out of a huge table of food each time, he only eats a few dishes.]","[It mainly feels like he eats based on interest. He likes this today, that tomorrow.]","[Has no one noticed that across so many meals, there are hardly any repeated dishes?]","[I feel like Xie Xi's assistant could probably equal several of You Feibai's assistants.]","[Same feeling. Every time Xie Xi doesn't even have to say anything, his assistant has everything prepared. You Feibai's assistants seem to only do things within their scope; anything else, if You Feibai doesn't mention it, they don't do it.]","[Hahaha, don't you think Zhang Dong is like a chief steward? Figuring out Xixi's thoughts, taking care of everything for him in advance.]","[So just because he's a celebrity, he can waste a whole table of food every time? Also, being an assistant is just a job. Why should they be like servants? It's not the Qing Dynasty anymore. Only you fans still find it cute.]","[Slowly typing out a question mark. Is the person upstairs sick? Xie Xi has money, can't he eat well? Wasting is his own business. What era is this? Surely no one still forces themselves to eat leftovers regardless of their health just to avoid waste? Don't bring up people in poor areas not having enough to eat. Xie Xi donates money every year. Do you?]","[Some people are just jealous of the rich. Besides, do you even know about stimulating domestic demand through consumption?]","[Person who spoke earlier, did you really watch the show properly? Haven't you seen how Xie Xi and his assistant interact before? They clearly seem more like friends. Do you think You Feibai's assistant would dare play games in front of him?]","[You Feibai's assistant also wouldn't go into his room to slurp noodles, hahahaha.]","\"Xiao Xie is still the same as ever,\" Xu Qingwei said, unsurprised after watching the video. Seeing You Feibai look over, she kindly explained, \"I directed a celebratory music film before and collaborated with Xiao Xie at the time. His assistant and lifestyle manager... tsk tsk, every day they protected Xiao Xie like he was something precious. The manager would also drop by every few days, afraid he'd be at a disadvantage.\"","Xie Xi felt the information conveyed by the show wasn't good for his image. What if Professor Ye saw it and thought he was really this picky?","\"They're just worrying unnecessarily,\" Xie Xi defended himself. \"I'm actually very easy to take care of.\"","[??? Xixi, what kind of wild words are you saying?]","[Xixi, I'll collect scrap to support you!]","[Hahahaha, Xixi, if you're easy to take care of, then there's no one in this world who's hard to take care of.]","[Sigh, why isn't Feibai more open? I feel like this Xie Xi is really witty, I'm starting to like him a little.]","That very night, the hashtag \"Xie Xi: I'm Very Easy to Keep\" shot to the top of the trending searches, bringing quite a bit of traffic to the show.","...","Professor Ye was still working late into the night. The batch of glasses scheduled for after the New Year was about to go into production, and she still had several papers to publish before the year's end. She typically couldn't rest until two or three in the morning.","She came out of her study and checked her phone before bed, finding a message from Rong Shiyun. Clicking it open, she saw it was a shared Weibo link.","It was a short video clip of Xie Xi saying on the show that he was very easy to keep.","Rong Shiyun: [Our Zai Zai is really so good. I wonder which jerk will get to have him in the future, wuwuwuwu. What if that person can't afford to keep him or doesn't care about what Zai Zai likes to eat? With Zai Zai's temperament, he definitely wouldn't speak up.]","Professor Ye: \"...\" So, why must someone keep him at all?","Before she could reply, Rong Shiyun sent another message: [Back when his first assistant tried to fob him off with one of those cheap roadside breads that cost a few yuan, Zai Zai just ate it. He ended up with diarrhea that night and almost missed his stage performance.]","Ye Qiusuo: [Wasn't Zhang Dong his assistant from the very beginning?]","Rong Shiyun: [The first assistant was let go after three months. But Professor Ye, is that really your takeaway from this?! Shouldn't it be that Zai Zai got sick just from eating that mass-produced factory bread!!!]","Looking at her friend's message, Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment and replied: [If one consistently eats overly refined food, their digestive system's resistance can become weaker than average. That's normal.]","There's an old saying about eating a little dirt building immunity, largely because the body gets used to it and develops resistance to certain bacteria.","For someone like Xie Xi, raised so delicately, he really shouldn't eat just anything from outside.","Rong Shiyun then sent several more screenshots of Xie Xi from the show: [Zai Zai wore glasses today, doesn't he look good?]","Ye Qiusuo: [They seem quite suitable.] They wouldn't affect his appearance on the show.","Rong Shiyun: [Speaking of which, your glasses seem to be a similar style. I saw someone today who edited a new video, suggesting your glasses were a gift from Zai Zai, and Zai Zai's glasses were a gift from you. Hahaha.]","Seeing this, Professor Ye couldn't help but frown: [Who edited that video? How do they know about this?]","Seeing the first part of the message, Rong Shiyun immediately sent over a link. Only after sending it did she read the second half clearly: [???]","Rong Shiyun: [What do you mean?! Did you two really exchange glasses?!!!]","Had she accidentally stumbled upon real sugar?","Professor Ye didn't reply. She was watching that one-minute video. After viewing it, she realized it was another fan-edited, narrative-driven fake video. For a moment there, she had been wondering who could know both things simultaneously.","Recently, because of her previous conversation with Lu Minglang, she had become more vigilant. The company had also re-screened its staff, and several employees with problematic resumes or falsified work experience had been let go.","Ye Qiusuo exited the video and replied: [That pair of glasses was his compensation for breaking mine. As for the pair he's wearing, it's a product from a collaborative project.]","Rong Shiyun: [Oh, I see.]","She felt a twinge of disappointment.","Ye Qiusuo didn't send another message. Instead, she directly initiated a video call.","Flustered in her bed, Rong Shiyun immediately declined the call.","Ye Qiusuo: [?]","Rong Shiyun: [My roommate is sleeping, it's not convenient to take a call.]","Ye Qiusuo: [Rong Shiyun, don't you live alone?]","Rong Shiyun: [Hahaha, living alone was too lonely, so I found a roommate.]","The last bit of sleepiness Ye Qiusuo had vanished completely. She sat down, looking at the message her friend had sent.","When a project gets busy, even sleep becomes a luxury. How could one possibly have the mental space to think about other things?","Ye Qiusuo: [I have a student who, whenever under too much pressure, likes to chase celebrities.]"]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58","paragraphs":["Rong Shiyun stared at the message, holding her phone motionless.","Soon, Ye Qiusuo sent another message: 【If something's wrong, you can tell me.】","Rong Shiyun rested a hand on her forehead, couldn't help but let out a laugh, yet her eyes reddened after laughing.","She gazed at the ceiling for a long time before finally dialing Ye Qiusuo's voice call.","The other side answered quickly, clearly having been waiting for her.","\"Didn't you say you were afraid of waking your roommate?\"","Rong Shiyun exaggeratedly went 'ahh' a few times: \"You already knew I was lying, why ask.\"","Ye Qiusuo also chuckled lightly: \"What happened? That trip back home wasn't just for a simple visit.\"","\"Nothing gets past you,\" Rong Shiyun muttered, then her voice grew a bit louder, \"I can't make it here anymore.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't interrupt, quietly waiting for her to continue.","\"You know the environment back home isn't great either. I just wanted to focus on research, but they kept pressuring me to change my nationality, suppressing me openly and covertly. I was suspended right before I returned home last time,\" Rong Shiyun said helplessly. \"That last trip back was to ask my mentor about this.\"","Rong Shiyun didn't want to stay abroad permanently. She had planned to gain skills and experience before returning, hoping domestic institutions would have developed more by then, but things weren't that simple.","Ye Qiusuo asked her: \"What are you doing right now?\"","\"Hunkering down in my rented apartment,\" Rong Shiyun said guiltily. That's why she had so much free time to obsess over the entertainment industry.","\"Come back home first,\" Ye Qiusuo said directly. \"Your resume is stronger than most. You graduated from Tsinghua or Peking University back then. Come back now, have your mentor recommend you, you could be a lecturer.\"","Rong Shiyun sighed: \"I'm not cut out to be a teacher. You know how much nonsense I talk; lecturing would just mislead students. I just want to focus on research.\" That's why she worked for a large private company abroad. To do research back home, especially at top institutions like Tsinghua or Peking University, one must handle both research and teaching. And crucially, the internal politics at Tsinghua and Peking University are too complex; she couldn't navigate them.","On the surface, Rong Shiyun seemed more socially adept, but in reality, apart from having above-average intelligence, her emotional intelligence and maturity weren't much different from an ordinary person in their early twenties. In contrast, Ye Qiusuo, though appearing rigid and unworldly, was actually the clearest-headed; no one could outmaneuver her.","\"Come back and try first.\"","\"Qiusuo, what's the atmosphere like at your university? Maybe I'll go to yours.\"","\"Rong Shiyun.\" Ye Qiusuo called her name calmly and softly, and the other end immediately fell silent. \"In this field domestically, if you want to achieve anything, you can only go to Tsinghua or Peking University. If you don't know how to lecture, then learn.\"","\"...I should have switched majors like you back then,\" Rong Shiyun grumbled quietly.","Ye Qiusuo pretended not to hear. If Rong Shiyun hadn't genuinely loved her field back then, she wouldn't have stubbornly stayed on this path.","\"Recent policies seem to be changing. You might return at a good time.\"","Those at the top weren't entirely unaware of researchers' hardships. In recent years, several fields have seen significant talent drain abroad. It can only be said they are still slowly exploring solutions.","\"Alright, I'll call my mentor tomorrow and ask him to help recommend me.\" Rong Shiyun suddenly cheered up again. \"I'm still young, I can wait.\"","...","After the conversation with Rong Shiyun, it was almost 4 AM. Ye Qiusuo slept until 6 AM and got up again. She drank a strong cup of coffee in the morning, marking the start of a new day.","Because of the messages Rong Shiyun had sent earlier the previous day, Ye Qiusuo instinctively opened Weibo while having breakfast.","The top trending topic was related to Xie Xi, though it was no longer the cheerful hashtag from yesterday, but one directly accusing Xie Xi of being excessively wasteful with his three meals a day.","The comments below were fiercely critical, as if overnight Xie Xi had become public enemy number one.","Ye Qiusuo frowned. She clicked into the edited video to watch. Indeed, Xie Xi had many dishes each time he ate, many of which he only tasted a bit before leaving untouched.","But she also noticed something: every time, after Xie Xi finished eating, Zhang Dong would carefully pack up the leftover food into a large container. He used that container nine times out of ten. The container had several compartments inside and didn't look like it was meant for throwing things away.","Only on one day, when they flew to another province, that container wasn't used, and the amount of food that day was also halved.","It seemed no one in the comments had noticed this detail.","Just as Ye Qiusuo was still pondering, Xie Xi's studio released a video and a statement.","【Thank you for your concern! Xi Xi has a sensitive stomach, so we try our best to ensure he eats well. However, the food is not wasted. We have an ongoing connection with a local stray cat and dog shelter manager, and we deliver the food there daily.】","The video showed the large container Zhang Dong always used. The food was basically poured into bowls for the cats and dogs. Food unsuitable for cats and dogs was given to chickens raised by the shelter manager.","【I think I've seen this shelter before. Did it trend on Weibo a few years ago?】","【Ah, I remember this. I think it was about the manager not having enough funds to cover the food for the strays, and later many kind people started sending leftover food.】","【Xie Xi's team is really something, finding a PR excuse so fast. Recording one video proves it's delivered daily?】","【Um, the shelter seems to have a Weibo account. The manager posts videos daily, and that container appears in them regularly.】","Netizens immediately followed the clue to browse the shelter's videos. Many hands make light work. Soon, someone found several videos and screenshots, asking everywhere: 【Isn't this hand in the shot definitely Xie Xi's?】","The shelter's Weibo videos received hundreds of comments daily, mostly from people who loved cats and dogs. Occasionally, someone would comment on the hand in the shot, saying it looked nice, but that was it. Now, with Xie Xi's fans flooding in, they almost instantly recognized it as their idol's hand.","【Our baby has a tiny mole on the tip of his ring finger. That's right! This is our baby!】","People from the city often came to donate and pet the cats. Some with a connection would adopt one. Occasionally, people would appear in the videos. Fans dug through and found that just this year, Xie Xi's hand had appeared in the shots five times.","When the manager recorded videos daily, carrying that large container and pouring food into the bowls, he sometimes remarked: \"See what the big patron donated for you today,\" and so on.","Now, anyone could guess who the \"big patron\" was.","\"How does his luck turn out good every single time?\" Lu Mingzhe sneered after reading the trending topics. Waking up early to see negative posts about Xie Xi had made him quite happy. He didn't expect the situation to reverse so quickly.","\"Wei Qi is cunning and calculating; she can turn black into white. That's normal,\" Shi Ru said disdainfully. \"Maybe she even staged this whole thing herself.\"","If Wei Qi were present, she would definitely recognize Shi Ru as the former colleague who deliberately didn't hold up the signboard, trying to make her fall from the height.","Both mentioned Wei Qi, but Shi Ru's words sounded much more pleasant than Jiang Jingyuan's earlier.","Lu Mingzhe tapped the desk with one hand, thinking replacing Jiang Jingyuan with Shi Ru was a good choice.","...","\"Brother Xi, what are you looking at?\" Zhang Dong was startled to see Xie Xi wearing glasses and looking at his phone in the morning. Now his boss didn't even need him to read the trending topics anymore. Before, he could secretly skip over the negative posts.","\"Scrolling through Weibo,\" Xie Xi said matter-of-factly.","Zhang Dong: \"Bro Xi, the studio has already clarified, you don't need to be on...\"","He had just leaned over, only to discover Xie Xi was watching a fan-made compilation video of him and Professor Ye.","\"Clarify what?\" Xie Xi asked Zhang Dong casually, having just finished watching the video once and pressing replay to watch it again.","\"...Nothing, haha.\"","Xie Xi glanced up at Zhang Dong, reluctantly exited the video, then clicked into the trending topics. After looking, he didn't seem displeased. He stood up and called towards a corner: \"Lili.\"","A snow-white kitten immediately emerged from the corner and jumped into Xie Xi's arms.","\"Take a picture of me and Lili.\" Xie Xi tossed his phone to Zhang Dong. This was for fan engagement while also introducing Lili—this was the cat whose ears Professor Ye had touched!","After Zhang Dong took the photo, Xie Xi logged into his Weibo account and posted it: [\"Our Lili. [image.jpg]\"]","The shelter director had Xie Xi on special follow. As soon as he posted this Weibo, she immediately commented: [\"Finally taking some responsibility.\"]","Five minutes after Xie Xi posted the Weibo, his agent, Wei Qi, called Zhang Dong, instructing him to go to the fan groups to explain the origin of this cat and why Xie Xi hadn't adopted a cat from the shelter before.","Some of the stray cats at the shelter were actually abandoned purebreds, good-looking and no less appealing than Lili. In the past, Xie Xi would only donate and pet the cats for a while, firmly refusing to adopt. He felt he was too lazy, and that entrusting the cat's care to others was worse than not having one at all.","But now, to care for Lili, Xie Xi could even get up early. Lili was also peculiar, only warming up to him.","Once the fans found out, they naturally spread the word to prevent anyone from smearing Xie Xi as looking down on shelter cats.","\"Your career paths are different, and you're collaborating lately. You could leave a comment; it won't cost you anything,\" Jiang Jingyuan said, standing before You Feibai.","He was now You Feibai's agent.","This all stemmed from when Jiang Jingyuan was ousted from Xinyou. After leaving, he joined You Feibai's company, initially just planning to manage artists again. But not long ago, You Feibai's previous agent was suddenly diagnosed with a serious illness and could no longer work. The company had been quietly looking for a good replacement. Coincidentally, Jiang Jingyuan had taken on a minor artist and, through his handling, made them popular. The company discussed it and felt You Feibai needed to shift towards a different image now, so they promoted Jiang Jingyuan.","\"You want me to ride on his coattails?\"","\"Not riding, it's mutually beneficial,\" Jiang Jingyuan said seriously. \"You're in different fields. Coming together creates a synergy greater than the sum of its parts.\"","Jiang Jingyuan was actually a bit apprehensive. Some stars have immense pride; even leaving a comment like this could feel like an insult to their principles.","But since the company didn't want You Feibai to remain just a low-profile acting award winner, they had to loosen up a bit.","In the end, You Feibai left a comment: [\"This cat looks more lively than it did on set.\"]","Many netizens who saw You Feibai's comment couldn't believe it, repeatedly clicking into his profile to check if it was really him. Soon, the crowd pushed his comment to the top.","[OMG, OMG! Are the two male gods actually friends?!]","[I can die happy now!]","It has to be said, agents must have a clear grasp of online trends. Wei Qi called Xie Xi, telling him to reply to You Feibai's comment.","\"Got it.\" Xie Xi had already logged out of Weibo, engrossed in taking pictures of Lili to send to Professor Ye for her 'appraisal'.","\"Reply naturally, don't sound too distant,\" Wei Qi instructed. She needed to go find out what was up with You Feibai's agent. Given that agent's usual low-key, principle-driven style, it was unlikely they'd have made You Feibai comment."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59","paragraphs":["\"I think so too.\"","After replying, Xie Xi asked Zhang Dong, \"Does the tone sound natural enough?\"","Zhang Dong: \"...Quite natural.\" It was already sent, no point in retracting it now.","Xie Xi, holding Lili, tossed his phone aside: \"Should I go to Tianqiu Tech today?\"","Zhang Dong fell silent, wanting to say that the receptionists at Tianqiu Tech were already looking at them strangely. They had been going there every few days this month, and Professor Ye herself came down to escort them upstairs. Last time he tried chatting up a receptionist, she was already probing about their relationship.","Fortunately, most people at Tianqiu Tech were absorbed in their own work, so they didn't pay them too much attention.","\"Brother Xi, we're leaving tomorrow. Don't you need to pack?\"","\"You stay and pack for me. I have a class to attend,\" Xie Xi declared righteously.","Zhang Dong: \"...\" Who was it that used to think of every excuse to avoid homework?","Now that they had resumed their teacher-student relationship, Ye Qiusuo had agreed to teach Xie Xi calligraphy. Originally, she intended for him to practice from copybooks, but Xie Xi claimed he couldn't learn that way and found it easier to practice from her handwriting.","So, Ye Qiusuo specially set aside two hours each week to copy a few pages of characters in a loose-leaf notebook, then took the pages out for him. Basically, while Xie Xi copied from her notes, she would sit down with him one day to write the content for the next week.","Xie Xi enthusiastically stuffed a bunch of colorful pens into his bag, then abandoned his assistant, planning to go to Tianqiu Tech alone.","\"Meow~\"","Lili once again demonstrated her clingy prowess, clinging to Xie Xi's pant leg and refusing to let go.","\"Lili, I'm going to see Professor Ye. You can't come,\" Xie Xi tried to make her release him.","The kitten clung stubbornly, clearly intent on going out with him.","\"Brother Xi, why don't you just take Lili along,\" Zhang Dong suggested gleefully.","\"Let me ask her.\" Xie Xi actually considered it for a moment. He took out his phone, squatted down, took a picture of Lili, and sent it to Ye Qiusuo.","[Teacher, can I bring Lili to Tianqiu Tech? Image.jpg]","Ye Qiusuo had just come out of a meeting. Seeing Xie Xi's message, she stared at the picture of the kitten for a long time before replying: [This is a company. It might not be very convenient.]","\"Professor Ye says it's not convenient.\" Xie Xi squatted on the ground, showing Lili the phone screen. \"You can't go.\"","A second later, another message came in: [If there's really no other way, you can bring her.]","Xie Xi looked at the message, then down at the kitten, reaching out to stroke its head. \"Lucky you.\"","...","\"I'll be downstairs later. If anything comes up, come find me there.\" After replying to Xie Xi's message, Ye Qiusuo turned to Zhao Guiyin.","\"Understood, President Ye.\" Zhao Guiyin knew immediately who was coming upon hearing this.","Ye Qiusuo took a loose-leaf notebook from her office drawer and placed it on the desk before continuing her work. After waiting about forty minutes, the front desk called to say Xie Xi had arrived.","She picked up the notebook and went down to the first-floor reception to sign him in.","\"The other temporary ID card can be deactivated.\" Ye Qiusuo glanced at Xie Xi not far away and filled in the form: Bringing one cat.","After getting the temporary ID card, Ye Qiusuo led Xie Xi inside. \"She needs to go through security too.\"","This was also to prevent any high-tech devices from being hidden on the cat.","After security, Xie Xi followed Ye Qiusuo into the elevator, holding Lili.","\"Meow~\"","The kitten nestled against Xie Xi's arm, softly meowing at Ye Qiusuo with her watery blue eyes.","\"Lili really likes you, Teacher.\" Xie Xi turned his head, smiling with curved eyes. Holding Lili, he extended her towards Ye Qiusuo. \"Teacher, do you want to hold her?\"","Professor Ye stood in the elevator, expressionlessly reaching out to restrainedly stroke Lili's chin, then quickly withdrew her hand. \"There.\"","The kitten squinted contentedly. After waiting half a day without further pets, she started meowing, each sound softer than the last.","The elevator doors opened at that moment. Professor Ye was the first to step out, with a hint of fleeing the scene.","Xie Xi lagged behind, picking up the kitten and following.","By the time they entered the empty lab, Ye Qiusuo had regained her usual calm composure. There was only one wide, long table suitable for sitting and writing, which could seat four or five people. The two sat opposite each other, with considerable distance between them.","Xie Xi placed Lili on the table. In the brief moment he looked down to get his stationery, the kitten had already walked over to the other side and settled quietly beside Ye Qiusuo's hand, watching her.","\"Teacher, Lili likes you,\" Xie Xi said with a laugh, looking up to see the kitten's well-behaved posture.","Professor Ye remained unmoved, uttering an \"Mhm,\" her pen continuing to copy without pause. However, when her peripheral vision caught Lili, her ramrod-straight posture relaxed just a tiny bit.","Two hours couldn't pass without a break. After copying for a while, Xie Xi began to play with Lili. The pen in his hand had a cap shaped like a dried fish when closed. He extended it to tease her.","Lili gently placed her two front paws on his hand, playing along.","The man and the cat were having a great time.","Ye Qiusuo looked up at them, her fingers resting on the loose-leaf notebook twitching slightly: That kitten is very pleasant to pet.","After playing for a bit, Xie Xi rummaged through his pencil case, pulled out a pen with a small ball hanging from its cap, and handed it to Ye Qiusuo. \"Teacher, this is for you.\"","Ye Qiusuo lowered her gaze to the pen on the table, a struggle visible in her eyes. Finally, she picked up the pen and, as if by instinct, began using the ball to tease Lili.","\"Meow~\"","Lili was exceptionally good at acting spoiled, especially with those willing to get close. Soon, she focused entirely on Ye Qiusuo, clinging to her and meowing, her little tail swishing back and forth.","Professor Ye felt immensely satisfied inwardly, but her facial expression grew increasingly impassive, as if she weren't the least bit invested in playing with the cat.","In the end, seeing Xie Xi lower his head to write, she finally stopped. She gave the pen to Lili to play with, but her gaze lingered on the kitten.","Lili pressed the ball with both paws, quietly gnawing on it by herself for a while before losing interest. She then lightly leaped over one of Ye Qiusuo's hands, snuggled against her palm, curled up on the loose-leaf notebook, and began to sleep.","The A4-sized loose-leaf notebook was now two-thirds occupied by Lili.","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","For the first time ever, the never-procrastinating Professor Ye took the initiative to give up: \"I'll copy the pages for next week tonight and give them to you tomorrow.\"","Xie Xi pretended not to see Professor Ye's hand secretly stroking Lili's soft fur: \"I'm going to France tomorrow. I probably won't be in the country next week.\"","Ye Qiusuo was taken aback, then seemed to remember something. \"What time is your flight tomorrow?\"","\"My flight is at eleven tomorrow morning.\"","This was the first time she had proactively asked about his affairs. Xie Xi's heart pounded fiercely.","\"That works. I have to pick up a friend in the morning. I'll copy them tonight and bring them to you at the airport tomorrow.\" Ye Qiusuo looked down at the little ball of fur before her, secretly finding it rather adorable.","Xie Xi: So that's how it is.","...","After leaving the company, Xie Xi held Lili and murmured, \"You got to take advantage first.\"","Early the next morning, Sister Wei arrived.","\"Does this look good?\"","As soon as she entered, she saw Xie Xi—who would normally still be asleep at this hour—already up and asking Zhang Dong how his overcoat looked.","Wei Qi: \"?\"","Given Xie Xi's temperament, when traveling on business in the dead of winter, especially on international flights, he never cared about his look. He'd just wrap himself in any down jacket and be done with it. So why was he in the mood to dress up today?","\"Sister Wei, you're here! Quick, help Brother Xi pick out some clothes.\" Zhang Dong's eyes lit up upon seeing Wei Qi, as if he had spotted a savior.","\"What's going on?\" Wei Qi asked Xie Xi.","Xie Xi naturally couldn't say it was because Ye Qiusuo was going to deliver his homework notebook today, so he needed to dress especially well.","\"An artist must always pay attention to their image. I've been too lax before,\" Xie Xi said, lying through his teeth.","\"Brother Xi, you'd look good even in a burlap sack,\" Zhang Dong said sincerely. His Brother Xi had broad shoulders and long legs, a natural clothes hanger.","Hearing Xie Xi's words, Wei Qi believed him about thirty percent: \"Change into that black overcoat, the one with the hood.\"","After much dawdling, the group finally set off for the airport. Xie Xi spent the entire journey holding his phone, staring at it without moving.","\"Who are you waiting to hear from?\" Wei Qi asked, having turned to look at him several times and seen him like this.","\"No one.\"","When they arrived at the airport, Xie Xi finally received a message from Ye Qiusuo saying she had arrived.","Ye Qiusuo: 【I'll come find you.】","Xie Xi immediately replied \"Okay,\" then straightened his coat collar and smoothed his hair.","The group quickly entered the airport. Xie Xi looked east and west, trying to spot Ye Qiusuo.","\"Xixi, walk in the very middle, stop looking around,\" Wei Qi reminded him. The airport was crowded and full of prying eyes, and Xie Xi stood out too much in a crowd, making it easy for him to be recognized.","Just as they were about to enter the VIP channel, Xie Xi finally saw Ye Qiusuo standing nearby. He threw Wei Qi's instructions to the wind, broke away from the group, and walked straight towards Ye Qiusuo.","\"Xixi?\"","Wei Qi turned her head and saw Xie Xi walking away, momentarily stunned. She asked Zhang Dong, \"What's going on?\"","Zhang Dong had also seen Ye Qiusuo and pointed in her direction. \"Maybe he's going to say hello to Professor Ye?\"","\"Here you go.\" Ye Qiusuo took a few sheets of loose-leaf paper out of her bag.","Xie Xi took the papers but didn't leave immediately. \"I'm going to France for a brand endorsement event. I'll be back in four or five days.\"","Professor Ye deliberately glanced towards his arms but didn't see the kitten. \"Is there someone looking after Lili at home?\"","Xie Xi hesitated for a moment. \"I set up an automatic feeder. It has enough food for six days.\"","\"Professor Ye, what brings you here?\" Wei Qi walked over with the others to greet her, just in time to interrupt what Ye Qiusuo was about to say.","\"To see someone off at the airport.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed at the papers in Xie Xi's hand. \"And to give him the characters he copied.\"","Just then, an announcement for a departing flight came over the loudspeaker. Ye Qiusuo said goodbye to them and turned to leave.","\"What copied characters?\" Wei Qi asked Xie Xi. She didn't know the two had resumed their teacher-student relationship.","Xie Xi's gaze shifted evasively. \"I can see the characters clearly now, so I want to start practicing my handwriting. Professor Ye is teaching me.\"","Wei Qi glanced at the papers in his hand. Frankly, Professor Ye's handwriting was very beautiful, but still... for something like teaching calligraphy, wouldn't a professional teacher be better?","Although she thought this, Wei Qi didn't say it out loud, keeping the question to herself. If Xixi was willing, that was enough.","...","After arriving in France, they only rested for a day before starting preparations for outfits and styling for the event.","\"I'm keeping the glasses on.\"","Xie Xi refused to take off his glasses.","The stylist was still trying to persuade him, arguing that the glasses ruined the look. Xie Xi had Zhang Dong bring over a large box, which he opened to reveal an assortment of glasses inside. \"If this pair doesn't work, switch to another. If that still doesn't work, we can switch you out.\"","The stylist: \"...\"","After the stylist finalized the plan and left, Zhang Dong clicked his tongue. \"That worked out fine. What was all that reluctance about earlier?\"","The stylist for this event was hired by the brand, not their usual one who traveled with them."]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo's residence had been quite lively lately, because Rong Shiyun had returned to the country. Her job interview application had passed and was currently under review, so she was staying here temporarily.","\"Why is your fridge so empty?\" Rong Shiyun was utterly shocked.","The two hadn't been roommates back in their domestic university days. Later, when they went abroad, although they became roommates, Rong Shiyun was usually the one who cooked, and the fridge was mostly stocked by her. This was her first real glimpse into Ye Qiusuo's solo living habits.","\"The supermarket is nearby, you can go buy things. There's a larger supermarket a bit farther away.\"","When Ye Qiusuo returned in the evening, she found her fridge and kitchen fully stocked with all sorts of food.","\"Are you living an ascetic life?\" Rong Shiyun kept shaking her head. \"This morning I thought the fridge was just temporarily empty, but then I checked your kitchen and found a layer of dust. Turns out the fridge is always empty.\"","Ye Qiusuo sat down to eat. The dishes in front of her were all prepared by Rong Shiyun. Not being picky didn't mean she didn't enjoy good food; she was just usually too busy and couldn't be bothered to spend time on it.","\"What do you usually eat at home?\" Rong Shiyun asked as she also sat down and picked up her bowl and chopsticks.","\"Eggs, milk, bread.\"","Rong Shiyun: \"...You've been eating like that all these years since you came back?\"","Ye Qiusuo denied it: \"I often eat at the cafeteria.\"","\"You're something else, truly Professor Ye.\" Rong Shiyun was impressed. She picked up some food with her chopsticks and said, \"These days, I'll let you taste if my cooking skills have improved.\"","Back abroad, she had all these culinary skills but couldn't use them fully because many ingredients were hard to find in Chinatown.","After dinner, Rong Shiyun sprawled on the living room sofa, turning into a couch potato, and started fangirling on her phone.","\"Qiusuo, do you know Zai Zai recently went to France?\" Rong Shiyun was quite excited. \"Zai Zai finally decided to be active! There's a fancam today.\"","She switched back and forth between the super topic and several fan group chats, finally getting the first-hand news.","At exactly 3:00 PM French time that day, the brand event officially began. Countless top global celebrities walked the red carpet. Of course, the brand ambassadors from several regions received the most attention from the organizers.","Xie Xi was one of them. He stepped out of the car accompanied by the brand's design director.","\"Wow wow wow! Design Director Luli is actually walking the red carpet with Zai Zai!\" Rong Shiyun exclaimed excitedly, doing a kip-up from the sofa and standing up. She turned her phone screen towards Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo glanced at it, not getting the point. \"So?\"","Rong Shiyun simply jumped off the sofa, ran over to Ye Qiusuo, and explained: \"Although Luli has a long history, it almost went bankrupt once and was saved by its design director. He's the soul of the brand! He has never walked the red carpet with anyone before, so the director must really like Zai Zai!\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at the video where the gray-haired French man was chatting and laughing with Xie Xi; they did seem close.","\"Wuwuwu, Zai Zai's outfit is absolutely stunning!\" Rong Shiyun's eyes welled up with tears.","Xie Xi on the red carpet was indeed eye-catching. Even among the generally tall and burly foreign male stars, he didn't lose out at all. He wore a smoky gray suit with a white shirt underneath and a tie with intricate patterns. The video wasn't very clear, but overall, his broad shoulders, narrow waist, and long legs were all perfectly proportioned. The silver-rimmed glasses with a chain added a touch of aloofness to his face.","Rong Shiyun stared intently for a moment, then suddenly glanced at Ye Qiusuo with a strange look before shaking her head: she must have been shipping too many couples, otherwise why would she think Qiusuo and Zai Zai looked somewhat alike as a couple?","The video was only a little over 4 minutes long, following Xie Xi until he finished the red carpet.","Rong Shiyun sighed with regret. \"It's over.\" She could only wait for photos from inside the event.","\"Can I go now?\" Ye Qiusuo had been forced to stand there and watch the entire red carpet walk. She looked down at the hand on her arm, signaling Rong Shiyun to let go.","\"Please, go ahead.\" Rong Shiyun immediately released her hand.","As Ye Qiusuo turned and walked halfway, Rong Shiyun suddenly asked from behind, \"Qiusuo, don't you think Zai Zai is very handsome?\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't respond, but inwardly, she didn't disagree.","Just as excited as Rong Shiyun were thousands of fans, who were also frantically scrolling through the super topic, screaming in various posts. Due to the high traffic, it directly trended on the hot search.","Some fans couldn't wait and used VPNs to check platforms in other countries for photos from the event. They actually found a short video and some photos. Judging by the background, they were likely taken by people inside, as they were standing in small groups chatting, holding champagne glasses.","In the video, Xie Xi stood opposite the Luli design director, holding a champagne glass. After clinking glasses with the director, he took a small sip and then didn't drink more. Instead, he absentmindedly twirled the champagne flute. His slender, fair fingers contrasted with the pale yellow champagne. The light shone on the glass, making it exceptionally crystal clear.","This video had gone viral on foreign platforms, with everyone asking who this man was.","[\"Isn't this the vampire prince of my dreams?\"]","[\"Oh, I adore this man. Please give me all his information.\"]","Fans who used VPNs naturally reposted the video back home, also translating the series of comments from the international netizens eagerly searching for Xie Xi's information.","Marketing accounts looking to boost their engagement also uniformly found a few pictures to post on their blogs. Back and forth, it became impossible for Xie Xi not to trend.","#InternationalNetizensAskWhoXieXiIs#","[\"I'm dying of laughter. A classmate I knew while studying abroad, who I haven't contacted in years, suddenly sent me a photo of Xie Xi today, asking if I knew him. Apparently, she's asked every Asian classmate she knows. Hahahaha, I know him all too well!\"]","[\"Actually, a significant number of people abroad do know who Xie Xi is. My roommate listens to his songs all the time. There's even a Xie Xi fan club in our building, full of foreigners.\"]","[\"Xie Xi should participate in more of these international events. Once he does, the international netizens will get to know him.\"]","[\"By the way, why has Xie Xi been wearing glasses so often lately?\"]","[\"I noticed that too. He's been wearing them in every appearance.\"]","[\"Has Xie Xi become nearsighted?\"]","Tonight was almost a carnival night for Xie Xi's fans, with constant discussions.","His manager in faraway France had been monitoring the situation. Seeing the buzz grow ever higher, Wei Qi contacted his domestic studio to immediately release a set of professional photos from the event.","Professional photographers were on a completely different level compared to random shots by passersby. The release of this photo set directly pushed Xie Xi's popularity beyond his usual fan circle, which in turn fed back to international platforms.","When the day's events were mostly over, Wei Qi found Xie Xi and asked him, \"Do you want to explain about the glasses?\"","Given his current momentum, it seemed he wanted to keep wearing them.","The stylist from last time had discriminated against Asians and didn't want to put in the effort. Xie Xi retorted, and although the styling was eventually completed, the stylist secretly spoke ill of him to others. Wei Qi overheard and reported it directly to the person in charge at Luli. Later the design director intervened, and Xie Xi's entire look today was created by the design director's team.","\"What should I explain?\"","Wei Qi took out her phone and showed him a trending topic on Weibo: #Xie Xi Nearsighted#","Xie Xi thought for a moment: \"Let me explain.\" He also planned to show off that the glasses were designed for him by Professor Ye.","Wei Qi was busy contacting other people and didn't notice what Xie Xi posted. After this brand event, even during the event, many people expressed hope to collaborate with Xie Xi.","Back in China, many fans were still browsing Weibo when suddenly Xie Xi posted an update: [\"Not nearsighted. These are corrective glasses from Professor Ye's project, specifically designed for people with dyslexia.\"]","This post contained a lot of information, and some fans took a while to process it.","[\"What are corrective glasses? Correcting what? What's wrong with Zai Zai?\"]","[\"Xi Xi, you're wearing glasses for people with dyslexia... does that mean you have dyslexia?\"]","Once one fan figured it out, others who saw the post began to understand, and past clues gradually became apparent.","[\"So that's why Xi Xi wrote so many wrong characters? And why he didn't finish junior high? Was it because of this?\"]","A quick explainer: Dyslexia can range from mild to severe, but its prevalence is actually quite high—around twenty percent. Many people who tend to skip lines or miss words when reading might actually have this condition without even knowing it. Someone like Xie Xi, who mostly writes characters incorrectly, shows that his symptoms are quite severe and have already affected his daily life.","[\"I suddenly feel so heartbroken for our Zai Zai, wuwu, we never knew about this.\"]","[\"Didn't you guys notice the middle part? This project was developed by Professor Ye. Is Professor Ye the one I'm thinking of?\"]","[\"For real, g. Professor Ye and Xi Xi are still in contact privately?! I'll start shipping them right now.\"]","[\"Where can I buy these glasses? I want a pair too. When I was little, my parents always scolded me for poor grades. It wasn't until later that I found out I had dyslexia.\"]","[\"This kind of thing is really overlooked by many people. If it's mild, it's okay, you just get labeled as careless, but if it's severe, it affects your life.\"]","...","After returning to the hotel, Xie Xi casually scrolled through the comments, then began practicing his characters seriously. After finishing, he had a legitimate reason to message Professor Ye.","[\"Teacher, I've finished practicing today's characters. image.jpg\"]","It was already late at night in China. Ye Qiusuo was about to go to sleep when she saw the message and replied: [\"You had time to practice characters while attending an event today?\"]","Xie Xi felt a bit happy. She actually knew he had an event today. Did that mean she paid a little attention to him?","Xie Xi: [\"The event is already over, teacher. Some people are asking where to buy the glasses.\"]","Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment and replied: [\"They'll be available after the Lunar New Year. Right now, based on the usage data coming in from the trial participants, we're still making adjustments.\"]","Unlike the glasses designed for other trial participants based on big data calculations, Xie Xi's glasses were made using his own personal data, so they were already in the best possible state without needing adjustments.","Xie Xi: [\"Then I'll let the fans know.\"]","Professor Ye hesitated for a second before asking him: [\"Are you advertising?\"]","Looking at the line of text on his phone, Xie Xi sent a voice message directly: \"I'm a project partner. I'll advertise without an endorsement fee.\"","Professor Ye thought that made some sense.","Soon, Xie Xi replied to the fan who wanted to buy the glasses, saying they would be available after the New Year.","He also casually gave himself a title: Spokesperson for Professor Ye's Glasses Project.","After finishing her various contacts, Wei Qi returned to the hotel, opened her phone, and discovered that Xie Xi had not only posted on Weibo but had also replied to several people in the comments. It was a headache.","She knew about the project and the loan, but when did Xie Xi and Professor Ye get so close?"]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61","paragraphs":["Recently, a certain super topic has been quite active because the actual subjects openly came out to 'give out candy,' which instantly energized all the fans shipping the couple.","【If Professor Ye ever debuts, we'd definitely have a lot of material to edit.】","【Wuwu, they are so good to ship. Now Xixi has new material for replacements, can the big editors start using it?】","【Hahaha, I heard several big editors are already working on edits overnight.】","\"Brother Xi, we're returning to the country tomorrow, don't stay up too late,\" Zhang Dong reminded before leaving the room.","\"Got it,\" Xie Xi responded casually, scrolling through the super topic on his phone, feeling a bit disappointed that everyone was still editing and he hadn't seen any new videos yet.","It seemed he'd have to wait until returning home to see the newly edited videos.","Yes, Big Star Xie was secretly using a side account to ship his own CP with Professor Ye, and his phone was filled with countless videos of the two of them. It's just that some uploaders were too skilled at editing; certain videos made his face flush red.","...","\"The review passed. I can start as a lecturer after the new year when the semester begins.\" Rong Shiyun stretched, feeling the heavy weight in her heart finally lighten a little.","\"Congratulations.\" Ye Qiusuo was still busy, with endless tasks to do every day.","Rong Shiyun didn't mind. She got up to cook, thinking of adding a few more dishes to celebrate: \"What do you feel like eating today?\"","Before Ye Qiusuo could answer, Rong Shiyun calculated for herself: \"Anyway, everything tastes good to you.\"","By the time she finished cooking, Ye Qiusuo hadn't moved an inch from her spot, with only the sound of her fingers tapping on the keyboard filling the air.","\"Have you ever taken a vacation in all these years?\" Rong Shiyun asked her.","\"I rest every day,\" Ye Qiusuo stated matter-of-factly.","Rong Shiyun shook her head. In Ye Qiusuo's mind, resting equaled a break; sleeping time each day was considered rest. She had no concept of taking an actual vacation.","\"By the way, I'm going home in a few days to prepare for the New Year,\" Rong Shiyun put down her bowl and chopsticks. \"When are you going back?\"","Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment and said, \"I'll go back the day before New Year's Eve, just in time for the celebration.\"","Rong Shiyun: \"...You'll just work the same way at home. Aren't you afraid of upsetting your parents by going back so late?\"","\"It's fine,\" Ye Qiusuo said seriously. \"My parents said it's okay to go back later if I'm busy.\"","Sometimes, Rong Shiyun couldn't tell if her friend was truly naive or just pretending. Clearly, no one could outsmart her outside, but she actually believed the comforting words parents say to their children?","\"Being your friend is okay, but being your family must be tough,\" Rong Shiyun sighed.","\"Why do you say that?\"","\"You haven't seen them all year. Your parents definitely want you to go back early. Only you would believe those comforting words they said.\" Rong Shiyun urged her, \"Go back earlier and spend some time with your parents.\"","Professor Ye didn't understand: \"I am going back. Many researchers at the company aren't going back for the New Year either.\"","Rong Shiyun: \"Is that the same? They followed the regular educational path. Think about how long you've been away from your parents since when.\"","\"I'll ask them.\"","After the meal, Ye Qiusuo indeed called her parents to ask. Rong Shiyun sat nearby, shaking her head as she listened.","\"Mom, Dad, do you want me to come back earlier?\" Ye Qiusuo asked bluntly.","She started school early, attended university young, and had been on her own since. After completing her direct Ph.D., she went abroad for further studies, almost staying overseas like Rong Shiyun. She hardly had any chances to see her parents throughout the year.","Father Ye answered the phone. He fell silent for a while after hearing her question and said, \"Let me get your mom.\"","When Mother Ye got on the phone, Ye Qiusuo asked again. Mother Ye also fell silent, and after a long pause, she cautiously said, \"If it doesn't interfere with your work, could you come back a bit earlier if possible?\"","\"Understood. I'll go back earlier.\"","After Ye Qiusuo hung up, Rong Shiyun wore an expression of understanding. \"See, your parents actually want you back early.\"","Ye Qiusuo's parents were ordinary workers, common people, the kind of neighborly uncle and aunt you'd pass on the street. Sometimes, Mother Ye even wondered if her child had been switched at birth. Not to mention Ye Qiusuo's intelligence being far above average, even her looks were exceptionally outstanding, inheriting the best features from both Father and Mother Ye.","When she was little, she somewhat resembled them, but after growing into her features in university, Mother Ye hardly recognized her when she came back.","Because of Rong Shiyun's reminder, Ye Qiusuo went back home more than half a month early this year.","When Xie Xi returned, wanting to find a roundabout way to see Ye Qiusuo, he discovered she had already gone back to her hometown.","Big Star Xie felt very dejected. He had thought of several excuses to meet her on the plane, but now they were completely useless.","The gloomy big star Xie still had to work. His agent had accepted an invitation for him to perform at a gala event, where he would sing on stage.","Xie Xi drew inspiration from this. He pretended to have a video call with Ye Qiusuo to practice calligraphy and later asked her, \"Teacher, will you be watching the New Year's Eve gala?\"","\"My family will watch it together,\" Ye Qiusuo replied. She was already home, sitting in her room, with no attempt to hide anything during the video call.","Xie Xi could clearly see the room's setup behind her—a large bookshelf filled with nothing but books, no toys in sight.","\"Qiusuo, would you like some fruit?\" Mother Ye came in with a fruit platter, immediately spotting Xie Xi on Ye Qiusuo's computer screen, which gave her quite a shock.","Although her daughter was different from ordinary girls at this age, as a typical mother, she had still wondered what kind of person her daughter might like in the future.","Suddenly seeing such a handsome boy, especially around the time before the New Year, Mother Ye naturally assumed their relationship was... not shallow.","\"Teacher, I'll hang up now,\" Xie Xi said, having also noticed someone entering the room. He had gotten the answer he wanted.","Ye Qiusuo closed her laptop, stood up, and took the fruit platter. \"Thank you, Mom.\"","Hearing her say thank you made Mother Ye feel a bit sad. A daughter being too polite wasn't something to be happy about.","\"Have some fruit to tide you over. I'll start making dinner now.\" Mother Ye's hand, hanging by her side, twitched. She originally wanted to touch her daughter but held back, afraid she might find it uncomfortable.","\"Mhm.\"","Mother Ye walked out, pulled Father Ye aside, and whispered, \"I just saw Qiusuo video calling a boy.\"","Father Ye clearly didn't think in that direction: \"A colleague of Qiusuo's?\"","\"Definitely not a colleague,\" Mother Ye stated firmly.","In previous years during the New Year, colleagues had called for video chats, and Mother Ye had seen them. Both Qiusuo and the person on the other end were always very serious. This time when she entered, she didn't see any seriousness from Qiusuo at all. Moreover, the boy in the video didn't look like a stern, straight-laced professional.","And also...","Mother Ye carefully recalled the boy she had just seen. She tugged at Father Ye's sleeve: \"I think that boy looks a bit familiar.\"","\"Where would you know Qiusuo's friends from?\" Father Ye said helplessly. \"You must be mistaken.\"","Father and Mother Ye usually didn't pay much attention to celebrities. At most, they watched TV dramas at home and occasionally tuned into the movie channel. They might recognize You Feibai if mentioned.","...","\"Sister Wei, I'm going to the gala,\" Xie Xi told Wei Qi early in the morning.","I know you're attending the gala tonight and singing on stage.","\"Not today's event, it's the nationally broadcast New Year's Eve Gala,\" Xie Xi said eagerly. \"Didn't you say last time a singer had a last-minute problem and couldn't make it?\"","For such an important gala, preparations start half a year in advance. From beginning to end, there are always various issues, though by this time, the program lineup is usually pretty much set.","If someone can't make it, the program inevitably needs adjusting. The most common method is to extend other performances or New Year's greetings to fill the time.","\"Aren't you spending Spring Festival at home?\" Wei Qi asked, surprised.","Every year, Big Star Xie goes home to celebrate the New Year with his parents, refusing all engagements. What's going on this year?","\"I want to perform at this year's gala.\" Xie Xi had even composed a cheerful new song just last night.","\"I'll reach out and ask, but don't get your hopes up. The gala organizers might not be willing to take the risk.\"","The news that Xie Xi wouldn't be home for New Year's immediately caused an uproar with his parents. They kept asking why. When he said he was going to perform at the gala, his mother grew anxious: \"Xixi, are you short on money? Mom will send you money. Let's not do that gala.\"","\"That gala doesn't pay.\"","\"Then why?\" came the serious voice of Father Xie.","Xie Xi raised a fist to his lips, clearing his throat lightly. \"If I sing at the gala, the entire country can see me.\"","Father and Mother Xie: \"?\"","\"That way, the person I like can see me when the New Year countdown happens.\"","In fact, on that day, not only would the person he likes see him, but a future mother-in-law would also discover her future son-in-law on TV."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62","paragraphs":["Because of Xie Xi's words, Father Xie and Mother Xie couldn't sleep well for several days. As soon as night fell, they would start guessing who the person he liked was and what their personality was like.","\"Xixi has really grown up,\" Mother Xie said with a sigh.","\"Should we call and ask again? Ask our son who he likes, if there are any photos or things like that,\" Father Xie urged.","Mother Xie shook her head: \"If Xixi wanted to tell us, he would have done so that day.\"","Although in the end Father Xie and Mother Xie never found out who Xie Xi liked, they decided to attend the gala in person.","There were two reasons. First, since Xie Xi couldn't come home for New Year's Eve, they would go to the venue instead, so they could still celebrate together. Second, the program cameras would sweep over the audience. Since their son would appear in front of the entire nation to be seen by the person he liked, they, as parents, should also appear in front of that person Xie Xi likes.","And so, after Xie Xi's stage performance was confirmed, Xie Xi's parents also managed to get two front-row tickets. The cameras would undoubtedly sweep over them.","...","On New Year's Eve, the Ye household was noticeably quieter compared to the surrounding neighbors.","Father Ye and Mother Ye were worried about disturbing Ye Qiusuo's work, moving about and speaking in hushed tones. Apart from the new red lanterns and Chinese knots hung inside the house, there was no festive atmosphere at all.","\"Qiusuo, wishing you an early Happy New Year. I'm going out with my siblings tonight to watch the fireworks.\" Rong Shiyun called via video at noon, even showing her the noisy crowd of people at her home. \"It hasn't stopped since early morning. It'll get even crazier on the first day of the new year.\"","Halfway through, Rong Shiyun suddenly noticed Ye Qiusuo was sitting in front of her computer. She asked in shock, \"It's New Year's Eve today, and you're still working?\"","\"There's a bit of finishing work left to do.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't see any problem with it.","Rong Shiyun tilted her head, listening carefully for a moment: \"Why is your house so quiet?\"","\"It's always been quiet.\" Ye Qiusuo smiled slightly. \"They're afraid of affecting my work.\"","\"It's the New Year, you...\" Rong Shiyun looked pained and exasperated. \"Qiusuo, can't you put down your work and go talk to your parents?\"","\"Talk about what?\"","\"Isn't there the New Year's Eve dinner today? You should go help your parents. You can wash vegetables, chop them, do something together.\" Rong Shiyun wished she could reach through the screen and teach her hands-on.","The two of them were indeed a bit different. The consequence of starting school too early was having few friends their own age.","However, Rong Shiyun had many relatives and lots of children in her family. Having played with these kids since childhood, it was actually okay for her. But Ye Qiusuo completely lacked young friends; that kind of lively, youthful energy was completely absent in her.","Ye Qiusuo: \"Okay, I'll go help in a bit.\"","\"Alright, I'll hang up then. Stop working and spend a good New Year with your family.\" Rong Shiyun ended the video call.","Staring at the computer screen for a while, Professor Ye resisted the urge to finish the remaining work, stood up, and walked outside.","Mother Ye was busy in the kitchen. Father Ye had just finished cleaning the windows and was walking outside with a pair of spring festival couplets, ready to paste them on the front door.","\"Qiusuo, why are you out?\" Father Ye asked immediately upon seeing her. \"Are you hungry? Should I ask your mom to make you a bowl of noodles? The New Year's Eve dinner will still take a while.\"","\"I'm not hungry.\" Ye Qiusuo looked at the couplets in his hand. \"Dad, let me help you.\"","Father Ye didn't agree immediately but asked cautiously, \"Is your work finished?\"","Ye Qiusuo hesitated for a moment, then nodded: \"It's finished.\"","Only then did Father Ye hand her the bowl of paste he was holding: \"You hold this for me.\"","The two walked to the doorway together. Father Ye stretched open the couplet, stepped onto a stool, turned around, dipped the brush into the paste, and brushed it on one side of the door. Then he held up the couplet, comparing its position, and asked Ye Qiusuo: \"Is it crooked?\"","\"Move it a bit towards the upper left corner. No, down a little.\"","When Mother Ye came out to get vegetables and saw the father and daughter standing at the doorway pasting the couplets together, she couldn't help but stop, a smile on her face.","\"How about this?\"","\"That's good.\"","Finally, the pair of couplets was pasted. Father Ye met Mother Ye's smiling face inside the house and felt a bit embarrassed: \"Thanks to Qiusuo, otherwise these couplets would definitely have been pasted crooked today.\"","\"Mom, let me help you wash the vegetables.\" Ye Qiusuo's gaze fell on the cabbage in Mother Ye's hands.","\"Let your dad do the vegetable washing. Are you hungry? Mom will make you something to eat first.\" Mother Ye shoved the cabbage into Father Ye's hands.","Father Ye nodded beside them: \"Have some fruit too. Go watch TV. Leave the vegetable washing to your dad.\"","In the end, Ye Qiusuo didn't get to wash any vegetables. Her parents settled her on the living room sofa, the TV was on, and all sorts of fruits and snacks were placed in front of her.","On this day, all TV channels were filled with jubilant celebrations. Professor Ye sat in front of the television, aimlessly switching channels, her mind in the kitchen.","After watching TV for a while, Ye Qiusuo got up, took out the household garbage to throw away. Passing by several households in the stairwell, some doors were slightly ajar, with constant laughter coming from inside—everyone was very lively.","The house did seem too quiet.","Ye Qiusuo returned home. Father Ye came out carrying a bowl of noodles, with a poached egg on top, several large slices of beef, and a green vegetable leaning against the side of the bowl.","\"Qiusuo, your mom made you a bowl of noodles. Fill your stomach first.\"","\"What about you, Mom and Dad?\"","\"Us? We'll just eat some cooked meat in the kitchen, that'll be enough.\" Father Ye said cheerfully.","Years of this way of interacting couldn't be changed easily. Both Father Ye and Mother Ye, and Ye Qiusuo herself, were overly polite and courteous with each other.","Ye Qiusuo smiled at her father, took the bowl of noodles, sat down, and started eating.","It wasn't until past seven in the evening that all the dishes were finally ready.","Although there were only three people in the family, Mother Ye, thinking that Ye Qiusuo had finally come home, made an especially large number of dishes.","\"Someone's setting off firecrackers outside.\" Mother Ye stood by the window looking down. At this time, there were still people just starting their New Year celebrations.","\"Should we go down and set some off?\" Father Ye asked.","This year, there was only one open space in the residential area where firecrackers were allowed. But getting there from their place would take a while and was quite troublesome.","\"Let's go.\" Mother Ye felt the ritual shouldn't be skipped, especially with their daughter home.","Ye Qiusuo disagreed: \"Dad, it's too far.\"","\"The sound of firecrackers makes it feel like New Year.\" Mother Ye still wanted more of a sense of ritual.","Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment: \"We can have the sound of firecrackers without going down.\"","In the end, Father Ye didn't go. Because Professor Ye found firecracker sound effects online, connected them to the speakers, and played them for a full five minutes.","Father Ye and Mother Ye stared at the speakers, listening to the realistic firecracker sounds coming from them, and couldn't help but laugh.","After the firecrackers finished, they finally started the New Year's Eve dinner. It took about half an hour to finish eating, then the whole family cleared the dishes together and washed them in the kitchen.","\"Qiusuo, you and your mom go to the living room to watch the program. The gala should have started already.\" Father Ye stayed in the kitchen, letting mother and daughter go out.","The day had been too lively outside, and the atmosphere inside the house gradually warmed up. Father Ye soon came out too, and the family of three sat on the sofa watching the annual gala.","\"These lanterns are really beautiful,\" Mother Ye remarked, admiring the opening ceremony of the gala.","\"I wonder what programs they have this year?\" Father Ye said as he pulled the nut tray over and placed it in front of Ye Qiusuo. \"Qiusuo, have some of these.\"","\"They'll announce the list later,\" Mother Ye remembered the usual practice from previous years.","Ye Qiusuo lowered her head to look at the nut tray and slowly began shelling a handful of pistachios, placing them to the side. She remembered her mother had always liked eating these.","On the gala, someone was singing—Lu Mingzhe, dressed in a red suit, singing and dancing.","Ye Qiusuo glanced up briefly before continuing to shell the nuts. It wasn't particularly pleasant to listen to, and for the sake of auspiciousness the lyrics were rather empty—essentially \"you're happy, I'm happy, everyone's happy.\"","Father Ye and Mother Ye mainly watched the skits on this day every year, occasionally pointing at a pretty girl on TV and commenting on her looks, or saying how nice the hosts' voices were, and so on.","After the midway point had passed, Ye Qiusuo estimated her food had digested, and only then did she place the pile of shelled pistachio kernels she had prepared in front of Mother Ye. \"Mom, have these.\"","Mother Ye was taken aback, blinking for a moment before standing up. \"I... I'll go wash my hands first.\"","\"Dad,\" Ye Qiusuo casually handed the peeled orange she had to Father Ye so he could eat it.","\"You have some too.\" Father Ye awkwardly divided the orange in half and gave one half back to Ye Qiusuo.","Mother Ye stayed in the bathroom for quite a while. Later, Father Ye specifically called out to her, and she only then responded, \"Coming.\"","Before leaving the bathroom, Mother Ye made sure to check her eyes in the mirror. They weren't too red, so she walked back to the living room with peace of mind.","After sitting down, Mother Ye carefully picked up the pistachio kernels, almost unwilling to eat them, and ate them very slowly.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at her, thinking Mother Ye was too full and hadn't digested yet. \"Mom, if you can't eat them, just leave it.\"","\"No, how could I not eat them? I can eat them!\" Mother Ye sounded a little anxious and flustered.","Father Ye laughed beside her. \"Your mom just can't bear to — she doesn't want to eat them all. After all, you shelled these, Qiusuo.\"","\"Mom, you eat them. I'll shell more for you.\"","\"No need for that trouble, you watch the show.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't listen. She got up to fetch an empty plate and continued shelling with her head down. Beside her, Father Ye and Mother Ye watched the skit, laughing constantly.","Skit and song performances were usually interspersed. The next program was another song.","By coincidence, the neighbors downstairs started setting off firecrackers again, and someone nearby was probably setting off fireworks too. The noise was quite loud. With her head bowed, Ye Qiusuo couldn't clearly hear who was singing.","Once the noise outside subsided, Ye Qiusuo then heard a clear, bright male voice humming a melody coming from the TV, very catchy.","And also very familiar.","Ye Qiusuo raised her eyes and, sure enough, saw that the person standing on the gala stage was Xie Xi.","\"Oh, isn't that the...\" Mother Ye squinted her eyes for a long time before suddenly remembering why this young man looked so familiar. Wasn't he the boy who was video calling with her daughter that day?","Father Ye and Ye Qiusuo both looked at Mother Ye.","\"What's wrong?\" Father Ye had never seen Xie Xi before.","Mother Ye paused. \"This young man is quite good-looking. Is he a celebrity? I've never seen him in any TV dramas.\"","Father Ye turned to take a very, very close look at Xie Xi. \"The young fellow really, really is handsome. Since he can be on the gala, he must be a celebrity.\"","\"He's a singer,\" Ye Qiusuo volunteered.","\"A singer, no wonder he sings so well,\" Mother Ye began praising Xie Xi. \"This kid is good-looking, and his songs are pleasant to listen to. Not bad, really not bad.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked at the person on stage and didn't find anything wrong with what Mother Ye said.","However, in the original book, only Lu Mingzhe's participation in the gala was mentioned. The author completely omitted Xie Xi's participation — after all, according to the original book's timeline, Xie Xi's reputation was already getting worse and worse.","While the family was watching the gala, netizens across the country were watching too. Essentially, as soon as a performance ended, it would start trending on the hot searches—after all, everyone was at home watching the show that day.","Among them was one particularly special hot search topic concerning the audience below the stage.","Who are those two people sitting in the audience?"]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63","paragraphs":["Tonight's hot search list was almost entirely dominated by the gala. As soon as a topic about two audience members sitting in the audience appeared, it immediately sparked widespread discussion and gossip among netizens.","There were GIFs and screenshots, and the two people inside were none other than Father Xie and Mother Xie. In order to appear before the entire nation, they not only secured the seats closest to the stage but also came specially styled.","Father Xie wore a black suit, his figure in no way inferior to current male celebrities, and he carried an air of authority. Not to mention Mother Xie sitting beside him, stunningly beautiful—no one would guess she already had a son in his twenties.","【I've been wanting to ask, were those two former celebrities? How are they both so handsome and beautiful.】","【When I was watching, they seemed to be holding hands the whole time, smiling so sweetly, wuwuwu, for a moment I didn't know who to envy more.】","【Are they a couple? Their child would definitely be good-looking.】","【Honestly, looks aside, these two have incredible presence, even the surrounding celebrities can't compare.】","【The seats they're sitting in are specially reserved by the gala for people who have driven economic impact—in short, major entrepreneurs, the kind comparable to chaebol-level.】","【Rich and beautiful, I'm so jealous.】","【By the way, don't you guys think these two look vaguely familiar.】","【They really do seem a bit familiar, not sure where I've seen them.】","【Ah, I also think they look familiar, but if I had seen them before, I would definitely remember.】","Below the comments, more and more voices started saying they looked familiar, until Xie Xi came out to sing.","【Ahhhhhh, Zai Zai has been working so hard lately!】","【I can't believe we get to see Xixi at the gala, a miracle!】","【??? I think Xie Xi looks a bit familiar.】","【What are you saying above?】","【...Why do I also have a sense of déjà vu.】","It wasn't until the camera panned across the audience, showing viewers those two overly good-looking audience members from earlier.","Netizens were confused for a long time, finally going to Weibo to seek validation.","【Am I seeing things? Why do I think those two audience members look a bit like Xie Xi.】","【Beautiful people often look alike, it's normal, right? I also think Professor Ye and Xixi look alike, hahahaha】","【No, they really do look alike.】","【Friends, friends!!! Haven't you all noticed something? Those two audience members have been sitting elegantly the whole time since the start, even their applause had a 'leadership inspection' vibe, but! Look when Xie Xi comes out! GIF】","In the GIF, Father Xie and Mother Xie in the audience suddenly sit up straight, stop holding hands, stop whispering, and seriously watch Xie Xi on stage, clapping vigorously.","All that elegance was long forgotten.","【Holy crap, a terrifying guess just popped into my head.】","【Not gonna lie, I also have an absurd idea.】","【Long-time Xie fans from his debut days should remember, back then he was a newcomer with no resources, yet his lifestyle was better than top-tier celebrities. The outfits for events, others rented or borrowed, only Xixi bought his. If the guess is true, then all those past things can be explained.】","【No way, no way, could those be Zai Zai's parents sitting there?!】","【Hiss—so in the end, we were the ones reaching too high for Xixi, how are we worthy of being 'mom fans', wuwuwu.】","Xie Xi's parents","This topic quickly topped the trending list, even showing signs of 'exploding' in popularity.","The manager waiting outside, Wei Qi, saw this news and didn't have time to verify if it was true or false, she could only arrange for someone to suppress the hype.","It's the New Year, this kind of attention isn't good, and Xie Xi doesn't need this trending topic anyway.","As for Father Xie and Mother Xie inside the venue, while their son was singing on stage, they excitedly clapped. Only after Xie Xi left the stage did they remember they were supposed to maintain elegance. They immediately put their hands down, Father Xie nonchalantly straightened his sleeves, while Mother Xie smoothed her long hair and gave an elegant smile to the camera panning over, as if they weren't the ones just clapping wildly moments ago.","After leaving the stage, Xie Xi sat in the celebrity area at the back, unable to sit with Father Xie and Mother Xie.","He took his phone out of his pocket and secretly sent a message to Ye Qiusuo, not mentioning he was at the gala today: 【Professor, I sang a new song.】","When Ye Qiusuo received the message, she was still in the living room watching the program with her parents, though Father Ye was struggling to stay awake, having dozed off on the sofa. Mother Ye was still awake but also drowsy, fighting to keep her eyes open.","\"Mom, you two should go to bed first, watch the replay tomorrow,\" Ye Qiusuo said.","Mother Ye woke up: \"Mom and Dad will stay up with you to count down the New Year. Don't young people like the New Year's countdown?\"","\"No need, I'm going to sleep too.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't have that kind of obsession with the countdown. For her, today was just another day, no different except for being able to have a reunion dinner with her parents.","\"You're tired too? Then let's go to sleep.\" Mother Ye turned off the TV, stood up, and patted Father Ye to wake him up for bed.","\"Qiusuo's not watching anymore?\" Father Ye asked, waking up.","\"Not watching anymore.\" Ye Qiusuo helped him up. \"Dad, you two go rest.\"","\"Okay, you rest early too.\"","Only after her parents went into their room did Ye Qiusuo return to her own room, planning to finish up some work. It was then that she saw the message from Xie Xi.","Ye Qiusuo: 【Sounded great.】","Xie Xi waited a while for the reply and immediately asked: 【You watched the gala?】","Ye Qiusuo: 【Yes, my parents also said you sang well.】","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Right then, the camera panned over, and a blushing Superstar Xie appeared before the entire nation.","Although it was just a fleeting glimpse, fans naturally wouldn't miss this detail.","【Why is Xixi's face so red?!】","【The tips of his ears are red too, is he feeling unwell?】","【This expression doesn't look like he's unwell at all, it seems more like shyness.】","By the time the next camera shot swept over Xie Xi, he had already lowered his head, so the audience couldn't see his face.","Xie Xi was messaging his parents.","Xie Xi: 【She praised my singing, and her parents said it was good too.】","Mother Xie, taking advantage of the camera being elsewhere, replied: 【Our Xixi's singing has always been great. Mom is so proud of you.】","As for Father Xie, he asked reservedly: 【Did the in-laws mention us?】","Xie Xi: \"......?\"","Xie Xi: 【Dad, we're not even... Besides, they don't know you, and you weren't performing on stage.】","Father Xie: 【That's true.】","...","Later, for the countdown, everyone who had performed had to go on stage, and the cameras started cutting everywhere.","After the final number was counted, the audience watching on TV saw the brilliant fireworks outside. After the fireworks, the broadcast cut back to the venue, and the first shot happened to land on Xie Xi's face.","Xie Xi looked into the camera, his eyes almost enough to drown anyone who met his gaze, and slowly, silently mouthed: \"Happy New Year.\"","To his professor.","Unfortunately, the person he was speaking to beyond the camera didn't see this scene, as she had already started working.","Instead, it was the fans who were mesmerized by that look.","Xie Xi's killer gaze","I feel like he's saying Happy New Year to me.","He is saying it to me.","That look he gave made my legs go weak, I feel so deeply adored.","Zai Zai has gotten so smooth lately? Such good acting skills, he's ready to be in dramas.","Ahhhhh, that look could literally kill, it's too much!","Xixi is really good at fan service now, what's going on? Where's the old Xie Xi who was too lazy to even take endorsements?!","Throughout the entire gala, Xie Xi's stage performance wasn't actually the main focus, more like filler material, but he ended up singing so beautifully. It wasn't overly exaggerated or blatantly festive, just a simple melody, even his humming had its own unique charm.","Several topics trended. If Wei Qi hadn't suppressed it, that topic about his parents would have blown up even more.","He was basically one of the biggest winners of the gala, along with a certain sketch that also caught everyone's attention.","Xie Xi came out with his parents. Although the family didn't have their New Year's Eve dinner at home, they still spent a special New Year together. The parents were especially happy after learning that Xie Xi had someone he liked.","\"Xixi, how far along are you two now?\" Mother Xie probed.","\"...Business partners.\" Xie Xi's sore spot was poked. \"She doesn't seem to have any interest in liking someone romantically.\"","\"You're alright, you're quite likable. Don't lose heart.\" Father Xie expressed his support for his son in a reserved manner.","\"What are you cooperating on?\" Mother Xie continued. \"Singing? Is she in the entertainment industry?\"","There are actually quite a few singers and celebrities who don't attend the gala.","\"Not exactly. I invested in her project.\"","Father Xie immediately looked over: \"You like Professor Ye?\"","Xie Xi: \"!\"","\"What Professor Ye?\" Mother Xie instantly latched onto Father Xie. \"How do you know who it is?\"","Father Xie coughed: \"Our son posted about it on Weibo, that glasses project.\"","Xie Xi had been wearing glasses to various events before, so Father Xie and Mother Xie specifically called to ask what was going on, wondering if he had become nearsighted like the netizens said.","Xie Xi then explained his collaborative project with Ye Qiusuo; they were corrective glasses. They had always followed Xie Xi's Weibo, but Mother Xie hadn't made the connection at first.","\"The name Professor Ye sounds a bit familiar.\" Mother Xie grew excited.","Father Xie remembered and reminded her: \"That knowledge competition show before.\"","\"Is it her?\" Mother Xie stared at Xie Xi, afraid he would say no.","Xie Xi: \"...Yes.\" He shouldn't have said so much just now.","\"Mom really liked her back then. So smart. If you two have children in the future, combining your genes, we wouldn't have to worry about intelligence issues.\"","Xie Xi sounded a bit downcast: \"She still doesn't like me.\"","The family suddenly fell quiet.","After a while, Father Xie spoke first to comfort him: \"If she doesn't like you, she doesn't like anyone else either. You still have a chance.\"","Mother Xie immediately nodded: \"Son, it's okay. Use your sincerity to win Professor Ye over.\"","...","On the first day of the Lunar New Year, custom dictates paying New Year's visits, but the Ye family didn't have many relatives, so they skipped that formality.","Father Ye and Mother Ye got up at their usual time. Not seeing Ye Qiusuo come out, they didn't disturb her, making breakfast quietly and waiting for her to get up.","Ye Qiusuo had stayed up late last night finishing some wrap-up work and, for once, slept until eight. When she got up, she saw missed calls from Rong Shiyun on her phone. Checking WeChat, she found it had been bombarded by her too, along with some New Year's greetings from students.","An hour ago, Rong Shiyun had sent a photo of fireworks from last night, sharing it with her.","Ye Qiusuo first replied to the students' messages, then got to Rong Shiyun.","Ye Qiusuo: Looks nice.","Rong Shiyun immediately sent a message back: Where have you been? Not answering my calls on New Year's Day?","Ye Qiusuo: Was sleeping.","Rong Shiyun: Incredible. Our Professor Ye actually slept in. By the way, let me show you our Zai Zai's charming side. Seriously, our Zai Zai has been working really hard on fan service lately. Be nicer to him, don't assign too much homework.","Soon, Rong Shiyun sent over a GIF. It was the scene from yesterday where Xie Xi silently said \"Happy New Year\" to the camera.","Ye Qiusuo clicked on the GIF. Stunned by the look in his eyes directed at her, it took her a moment to see Rong Shiyun's follow-up message.","Rong Shiyun: How is it? Does it feel like he's saying it directly to you?","Ye Qiusuo frowned: To me?","Rong Shiyun: It's just a metaphor. When Zai Zai looks into the camera like that, for us watching, it's as if he's saying it to each one of us personally. Our fan groups and super topics are going crazy. Zai Zai is so earnest when he does fan service, even his gaze is lethal. Wuwuwu, it's too much. It really feels like Zai Zai grew up overnight.","Professor Ye clicked on the GIF again. Looking into Xie Xi's eyes, she felt Rong Shiyun's description wasn't wrong.","Looking at it this way, she too felt Xie Xi was saying Happy New Year to her."]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64","paragraphs":["On the eighth day of the Lunar New Year, Ye Qiusuo left home and returned to her residence. The company had already begun operations yesterday, so she had to go there, and also to prepare for the mass production of the glasses project.","Speaking of the glasses, before she came, Xie Xi had specifically mentioned wanting to be the spokesperson, for free.","Ye Qiusuo agreed. Since it wouldn't cost any money and there was a celebrity endorsement, she naturally consented.","On the tenth day of the new year, the first meeting of the year was held, attended not only by shareholders but also by technical representatives and the public relations department, to discuss plans for the new year.","\"We had a batch of successful projects before the new year. Perhaps we can ride on this momentum and hold a product launch event to restore Tianqiu Tech's reputation,\" suggested the head of the public relations department.","\"What momentum?\" Ye Qiusuo was still thinking about the project just discussed and didn't understand what he meant.","The PR head explained, \"You just mentioned Xie Xi will be the spokesperson. Perhaps we can organize a launch event and invite him.\"","The manager had high hopes. Xie Xi had immense national popularity. Although Tianqiu Tech's reputation had been damaged not long ago, with so many new products now, they could completely ride on Xie Xi's popularity to rise again.","It was worth remembering that when Xie Xi had casually bought a Tianqiu watch on a show, their sales had immediately skyrocketed—though the superior quality of their products also played a part. Now, when netizens think of Tianqiu Tech, their first thought is the smart medical watch, no longer the failed mushroom product.","\"That idea is feasible, but it also depends on whether Xie Xi himself is willing,\" said shareholder Song Jiren. He thought the idea was good but its feasibility was low. Having investments in the entertainment industry, he knew a bit about Xie Xi; this person was notoriously difficult to deal with in the circle.","The PR head looked toward Ye Qiusuo. Most people in the meeting, who didn't pay attention to those coming and going from the company daily, naturally weren't aware that Xie Xi had been coming frequently before the new year.","\"Let's put this matter aside for now. I'll give you an answer in a while,\" Ye Qiusuo said, neither agreeing nor refusing.","After the meeting adjourned, Ye Qiusuo returned to her office. Remembering the profit summary report from before the new year, she finally decided to ask Xie Xi if he could attend Tianqiu Tech's product launch.","\"I can go,\" Xie Xi blurted out before she could even finish her sentence.","\"It's not a launch specifically for the glasses, but a launch event for our company's various products,\" Ye Qiusuo reminded him.","Xie Xi didn't care at all: \"I know. When is your launch event?\"","\"Currently, it's just a rough idea. The specific event planning won't be finalized until later,\" Ye Qiusuo said. Having heard Rong Shiyun's constant talk about how Xie Xi was now diligently working, she wasn't sure about his schedule. \"If there's a conflict with your schedule, you don't have to come.\"","Xie Xi: \"My time is all yours... the company's.\"","He had spoken too quickly and almost slipped up, hurriedly correcting himself: \"I don't have much going on recently. Any time works.\"","\"Alright. Once the launch time and content are finalized, I'll contact you,\" Professor Ye said seriously.","The two fell silent for a moment. Just as Ye Qiusuo was about to say goodbye, Xie Xi spoke up: \"Teacher, I've finished practicing those copybooks. Do you want to check them?\"","\"You can just take photos and send them to me,\" Ye Qiusuo said without much thought. \"I'll see how your handwriting practice is going from them.\"","Xie Xi: \"...\" That completely defeated the purpose.","\"Teacher, there are too many copybooks to photograph. Do you have time now? Let's video call, and you can see my handwriting?\" Xie Xi tried a different approach.","\"Now?\" Ye Qiusuo thought about it. The company had just finished the meeting. Apart from the technical staff rushing to meet deadlines, more people only had to work half a day today, and she was the same. \"Alright.\"","Xie Xi immediately hung up the phone and called via video.","Doing something like this in the office was a first for Professor Ye. She pursed her lips and answered the video call from Xie Xi, looking at the person on the screen.","\"Teacher, I'll flip through them for you. It'll be faster this way,\" Xie Xi said earnestly, switching his camera to the front-facing one.","\"Mhm.\"","Ye Qiusuo watched the loose-leaf notebook pages being flipped through and was somewhat surprised. Xie Xi's handwriting had improved remarkably fast.","Perhaps it was related to his strong artistic ability and his foundation in drawing.","Flipping to the later pages, Xie Xi's handwriting had already begun to show the style of her own script, though lacking in strength.","\"I'll copy another copybook for you to practice with.\"","\"Thank you, teacher.\"","Because of this, after leaving the company at noon, Ye Qiusuo specifically went to a bookstore to buy copybooks. She stood in that section, picking and choosing, finally selecting one with many characters and complete paragraphs, though the content was different from what she had copied before.","Knowing that Xie Xi was improving exceptionally fast, Ye Qiusuo didn't copy a little at a time like before. Instead, she spent the entire afternoon and evening copying the whole copybook. She didn't feel it was a waste of time; after all, there was compensation.","Ye Qiusuo: [The copybook has been copied. When you're free, you can have your assistant come get it.]","Ye Qiusuo sent the address of her residence.","When Xie Xi received this message, he was originally lounging on the sofa playing games. Upon seeing it, he immediately got up from the sofa, walked around the coffee table a few times, then turned to Zhang Dong beside him: \"Tomorrow, you won't be feeling well.\"","Zhang Dong: \"?\"","\"So, I'll have to go get the copybook myself,\" Xie Xi said, nodding.","Zhang Dong: Alright then. It must be related to Professor Ye.","\"I'm going home to sleep tonight,\" Xie Xi said to Zhang Dong after walking around upstairs and downstairs and picking out the clothes he would wear tomorrow.","\"Brother Xi, are you serious?\" Zhang Dong asked, looking at the wall clock that already read 11 PM.","Xie Xi walked to the entrance hallway and turned off the main power switch: \"There's a power outage here, so I can only go back to my house to sleep.\"","When it came to the skill of lying with a straight face, his Brother Xi was truly unmatched.","Zhang Dong resignedly turned on his flashlight and followed him out to drive Xie Xi to his home.","If Sister He were here, Brother Xi wouldn't be this unrestrained. Unfortunately, Sister He was recently busy with matters concerning her child and wasn't staying here.","So Xie Xi went home. His parents were already asleep, and it was the butler who came to open the door.","\"Young Master, should I go wake...\" the butler asked hesitantly. His young master had never returned at this hour before.","\"No need. There's a power outage at my place, so I'm staying here for the night. I'll tell my parents tomorrow morning,\" Xie Xi said, then proceeded to order a list of exquisite pastries he wanted for breakfast tomorrow.","Zhang Dong, listening from behind as his Brother Xi listed a bunch of fancy pastry names, understood: his Brother Xi probably had something in mind.","\"Very well, Young Master. Please go rest. I'll have the cook make them tomorrow,\" the butler said, leading the two to their rooms.","Xie Xi tossed and turned in his own room.","He actually wanted to mooch some pastries from home. His mother liked pastries, so they had a dedicated cook at home, a professional pastry chef. The pastries she made were the kind people would rush to buy if sold outside.","Xie Xi wanted to take some tomorrow to give to Professor Ye to eat.","...","Waking up early the next morning, Mr. and Mrs. Xie were indeed very surprised to see Xie Xi.","\"When did you get back?\" Mrs. Xie stepped forward and pinched her son's cheek. \"Mom told you to stay home a few more days. Now you're back, aren't you?\"","Xie Xi pulled his mother's hand away and looked at the various pastries on the table. \"There was a power outage over there last night, so I came here to sleep. I have work this morning, so I won't be having breakfast here. Please pack all of these up for me.\"","Mrs. Xie watched as Xie Xi picked up the packaged pastries and left, feeling puzzled. She turned to look at Mr. Xie. \"Why is our son acting so strange?\"","Mr. Xie glanced at a message on his phone. \"I asked someone at the power company over there. There wasn't a single power outage last night for any household. Our son probably just wanted to come back and get some pastries.\"","Mrs. Xie immediately sat down. \"If Xi Xi wants to eat pastries, he can just come back and eat them. Why make up an excuse?\"","\"He's probably taking them for someone else to eat... like, for instance, Professor Ye.\" Mr. Xie said meaningfully.","Mrs. Xie's eyes lit up. \"Butler, note down which pastries Xi Xi asked for yesterday. From now on, make these when Professor Ye visits.\"","\"Yes.\"","...","Xie Xi got into the driver's seat carrying several boxes of exquisite pastries, then said to Zhang Dong, \"I'll drive you to catch a taxi. Remember to rest well.\"","Zhang Dong was very calm. He had guessed this would be his fate last night.","He had to admit, his Brother Xi was going to great lengths to find a reasonable excuse to see Professor Ye.","\"Brother Xi, I wish you all the best.\" Zhang Dong got out at an intersection with taxis passing by and gave Xie Xi a cheering gesture.","Xie Xi navigated all the way to Ye Qiusuo's residence. After parking the car, he slowly walked toward the building in the complex. The closer he got, the faster his heart beat.","He carried pastry boxes in both hands, wearing a knitted cap, glasses, and a mask on his face.","Fortunately, at this hour, the complex wasn't busy. Everyone was probably still sleeping in, so no one noticed Xie Xi.","He entered the elevator, pressed the button for her floor. Thinking of something, his face beneath the mask grew increasingly red, and the only visible part, his fair earlobes, turned a light pink.","The elevator doors opened. He turned right and finally arrived at Ye Qiusuo's door.","Xie Xi took off his mask and even deliberately straightened his clothes, wanting to present his best self to Ye Qiusuo.","However, as Ye Qiusuo passed by the living room, she had already glimpsed the screen by the entrance, showing someone standing outside her door.","Ye Qiusuo walked toward the entrance. In the video feed, she saw the person outside diligently adjusting his hat, his collar, and even trying to take something out of his pocket, but his hands were too full to manage it.","\"Where's your assistant?\" Ye Qiusuo opened the door and said to the stunned person outside.","\"...Zhang Dong isn't feeling well today, he took the day off. So I came to get the copybook.\" Even though he had already prepared this excuse, actually saying it out loud made Xie Xi feel quite guilty. Luckily, Ye Qiusuo didn't seem to notice.","\"Come in.\" Ye Qiusuo stepped aside to let him pass.","Xie Xi didn't look around aimlessly. He directly placed the things in his hands on the living room dining table. \"Professor, these pastries from this shop are really delicious. You should try them.\"","To persuade Ye Qiusuo to eat them, he added, \"It's a New Year's gift.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"Thank you.\"","\"Professor, have you had breakfast yet? If not, you can try some.\" Xie Xi wanted to know which ones she liked, so he could maybe have the cook make them again in the future.","Ye Qiusuo brought over a filled-in loose-leaf notebook from the nearby coffee table. \"This is the completed copybook. Take it and practice by following it.\"","\"Okay.\" Xie Xi was the picture of a model student now.","Then he began opening the boxes, looking at Ye Qiusuo with eager eyes, waiting for her to eat.","Professor Ye: \"...\" She couldn't shake the feeling something was off.","\"Let's eat together.\" Ye Qiusuo went to the kitchen and brought back two forks.","Xie Xi slowly looked down at the fork in his hand. This wasn't just any fork; it was a signal that they had taken another step closer!","While Ye Qiusuo wasn't paying attention, the big star Xie secretly took a photo of the fork.","He decided he would create a small social media account for himself, to record the story of their beautiful love."]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65","paragraphs":["\"Aren't you going to eat?\" Professor Ye frowned, looking at Big Star Xie who was playing with his phone, head bowed.","She had clearly heard his stomach growl earlier, obviously he hadn't eaten breakfast before coming, which was why she specifically brought two forks for them to share.","Now, after taking one bite, Xie Xi had lowered his head to play with his phone again.","This behavior was all too familiar to her. Back during tutoring sessions, Xie Xi would always slack off the moment she wasn't looking, preferring to play with his own fingers rather than pick up a pen. Back then, he'd get dizzy looking at words, and she could barely pretend not to notice.","Why was it the same with eating now? He seemed to enjoy being distracted, like a child.","Xie Xi turned off his phone screen and looked up, his gaze evasive. \"I'm eating.\"","He had just secretly registered a Weibo side account using another one of his phone numbers. His first Weibo post was a repost of a Xie-Ye fan video edited by a creator he really liked.","Taking a bite of the pastry, he ate for a bit before lowering his head again, looking at his phone under the table, searching for videos of himself and Ye Qiusuo, reposting any Weibo that even remotely mentioned them.","\"Don't play with your phone while eating.\" Professor Ye endured it for a while but finally reminded him.","\"Oh.\" Xie Xi agreed verbally, but his hands were still busy posting on Weibo.","He posted a photo of the stainless steel fork he had just taken: [This is a fork from her home. It's beautiful.]","Perhaps because he had reposted so many Xie-Ye CP videos, a fan searching for keywords discovered his Weibo. Just as they clicked in, they saw this blogger named 'My Professor Ye' post his first original Weibo.","[Utterly bewildering. Isn't this just the kind of fork you get three for ten yuan? What's beautiful about it?]","But by now, Xie Xi had completely put down his phone, eating his pastry quietly and a bit guiltily.","It wasn't until he returned home, took out his phone, and prepared to continue his grand mission of reposting Xie-Ye CP videos and short fanfics that Xie Xi saw a comment from someone named 'Zaizai is the Most Handsome' under his Weibo post.","Big Star Xie replied with great patience: [Its beauty lies in it being my beloved's fork.]","...","About a week later, the date for the Tianqiu Tech product launch was finalized. Ye Qiusuo contacted Xie Xi and told him about it.","Xie Xi immediately posted the news on Weibo, saying he would attend Tianqiu Tech's launch event that day.","To make the post look more like an advertisement, Xie Xi specifically tagged Tianqiu Tech's official Weibo and various service accounts, a bunch of blue text following the black font, making it look exactly like a promotional post.","When his manager, Wei Qi, came across this Weibo post: \"?\"","How did she not know Xie Xi had taken on an advertisement?","Fans initially filled the comments with various praises and declarations of love, but eventually, CP fans began to sniff out a different scent.","[Tianqiu Tech launch event? Will Professor Ye be there?!]","[Awooo, will my god and goddess appear together?!]","[I'll definitely watch the livestream!!!]","Most CP fans immediately started howling with excitement from their own imaginations, vowing to watch the livestream that day.","On the day of the launch, Xie Xi specifically got up early to get styled, all to present his best side.","\"Brother Xi, which watch should you wear?\" Zhang Dong came over to ask.","\"This one.\" Xie Xi picked out the Tianqiu smart medical watch he had bought when recording the show.","Zhang Dong: \"Won't it clash with your outfit?\"","Today, Xie Xi exuded luxury from head to toe, complete with a pair of cat's eye gemstone cufflinks. All he was missing was a luxurious watch, yet he wanted to pair it with that Tianqiu watch.","\"I think it matches.\" As Xie Xi spoke, he put the watch on his wrist. After the makeup artist finished, he also picked up the glasses nearby and put them on.","Today's launch event was conducted via livestream, with both online and offline interaction.","Xie Xi only needed to appear during the segment for the glasses project. The focus of the entire launch wasn't on this project, after all, the original collaboration with Xie Xi was with Ye Qiusuo personally, not with Tianqiu.","When he arrived backstage at the launch venue, Ye Qiusuo was talking with others and didn't even notice Xie Xi had arrived.","It was Zhao Guiying who first noticed Xie Xi's arrival and proactively welcomed him in.","\"Please wait here for a moment.\" Zhao Guiying led Xie Xi to a room. \"President Ye will be here shortly.\"","...","After Ye Qiusuo finished speaking with several people from the company, her assistant came over and said Xie Xi had arrived.","\"Where is he?\"","Zhao Guiying pointed to the room assigned to Ye Qiusuo: \"He's waiting for you inside.\"","Ye Qiusuo pushed the door open and was momentarily taken aback upon seeing Xie Xi sitting in the chair.","A quiet Xie Xi was somewhat different from usual.","\"Professor, will we be going on stage together later?\" Xie Xi asked, looking up at the sound of the door opening.","The scene of sharing the stage had been lingering in his mind ever since he received Ye Qiusuo's invitation, and today it was even a livestream!","\"Probably not.\" Ye Qiusuo recalled the launch schedule. \"You'll go on stage during the middle segment. I'll be introducing the product at the very end.\"","The last product was the most representative of all the products presented today. As the company's representative figure, she needed to go on stage.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Even his dream of sharing the stage was shattered.","\"Let's go take our seats first. Many others will be arriving soon.\" Ye Qiusuo had come in mainly to call him to go to the front of the launch venue together.","Although disappointed, Xie Xi perked up. Today, they were both wearing glasses.","Big Star Xie had even already imagined the material the Xie-Ye CP fans would have for editing.","Most of the people in the first row were from Tianqiu Tech. Xie Xi was also in the first row, but separated from Ye Qiusuo by one seat.","The person sitting between them was Song Jiren.","When Song Jiren saw Xie Xi, he greeted him with a smile: \"I'm considered half a part of the entertainment circle too. We could add each other on WeChat.\"","Xie Xi, eyeing the seat he was sitting on, was very agreeable about exchanging WeChats. Then he spoke up: \"Could we switch seats?\"","Song Jiren was taken aback. He looked at his own seat but didn't see any difference between the two seats; they were both in the middle of the first row.","However, Xie Xi was a guest after all. Song Jiren nodded in agreement: \"Of course we can.\"","They finally switched seats. Xie Xi successfully sat down next to Ye Qiusuo. To avoid raising Song Jiren's suspicions, after switching seats, the two of them even chatted for a little while.","The launch had invited many people. As the event time approached, more and more people entered. Lu Minglang was one of them.","Holding a first-row invitation, he directly sat down on the other side of Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo was looking down at her tablet and didn't notice Lu Minglang.","\"President Ye, even working during the launch event time. No wonder Tianqiu is developing so fast.\" Lu Minglang waited for a while, but Ye Qiusuo was still looking at her tablet, so he finally spoke up.","Only then did Ye Qiusuo turn her head to look, realizing Lu Minglang was sitting beside her. Her gaze shifted to the name tag on the back of the chair; the name on it belonged to a partner from another company.","Lu Minglang followed her gaze and chuckled lightly: \"President Li had something come up today, so he asked me to attend in his place. You... aren't welcoming me?\"","With the Lu family's influence, obtaining an entry ticket wasn't difficult.","Ye Qiusuo withdrew her gaze, looking straight ahead at the stage: \"Tianqiu has always welcomed anyone to visit reasonably.\"","As soon as Xie Xi finished exchanging pleasantries with Song Jiren, he turned his head and noticed Professor Ye speaking with Lu Minglang. His ears immediately perked up to listen.","However, everyone present soon quieted down. The host had taken the stage, all cameras were ready, and the online livestream had begun.","The livestream camera first focused on the stage, then cut to the first row before panning across the audience behind.","[Finally got in! Where's Xi Xi?]","[I want to see Professor Ye, sigh. She hasn't appeared at all since the show ended.]","[Professor Ye isn't part of the entertainment circle after all; she has her own work.]","[Oh my god, oh my god! That quick shot that just flashed by—bring it back!]","[I saw Xi Xi and Professor Ye sitting together! Ahhh, the camera cut away too fast; I didn't even have time to screenshot.]","[Am I the only one who thinks the man on the other side of Professor Ye is also super handsome? Is he some invited celebrity? I've never seen that face before.]","The camera finally settled on the stage, where a technician from Tianqiu Tech took the stage to explain the company's newly released product.","As he continued his presentation, the camera occasionally cut to the audience below, sometimes close, sometimes far. But whenever it panned to the first row, Ye Qiusuo and the few people around her inevitably drew attention.","[What kind of celestial-level beauty are these three people in the middle? I'm in love.]","[To be honest, I think these three's looks put everyone else in the industry to shame.]","[Everyone has their own unique beauty, no need to put others down. But seriously, who is that guy next to her? He's really good-looking.]","[Seems like he's the young heir who took over the Lu family conglomerate in the last couple of years. Insanely rich and insanely handsome. He should have collaborated with Ye Qiusuo on a project before.]","\"This blood pressure monitor seems a bit off; I don't know how to set it up.\" After watching the presentation for a while, Xie Xi seized the moment when the speaker went to fetch a product to deliberately complain that the smart health watch he was wearing wasn't working.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look, surprised to see him wearing this particular model.","Normally, this health watch might look somewhat stylish, but today, with Xie Xi dressed in such a formal suit, the watch gave off a distinctly plastic feel.","However, personal taste was personal taste, and Ye Qiusuo wouldn't interfere with others' choices.","\"Let me take a look for you,\" Ye Qiusuo said.","Xie Xi intentionally didn't take the watch off, instead directly offering his wrist to her.","\"Go into the settings. There's an item here; click on it and you'll find the option.\" Ye Qiusuo checked the set parameters and found nothing unusual. \"Were you sitting still when you took the measurement?\"","Xie Xi didn't hear a single word, his attention fully on the close distance between them.","Not hearing a reply, Ye Qiusuo looked up and asked again.","\"Yes,\" Xie Xi finally snapped back to reality.","Ye Qiusuo frowned. \"There might be an issue somewhere.\"","As she spoke, she tried to take the watch off Xie Xi's wrist, her fingertips accidentally brushing against the inside of his wrist.","It was just a warm, slight touch, but Xie Xi felt as if he'd been scalded. From the inside of his wrist to his forearm, his cool, pale skin rapidly flushed red.","Ye Qiusuo didn't notice. She had already taken the watch off, examining the battery and detachable parts, but found nothing wrong. She then put it on her own wrist to test it, feeling the readings were normal.","\"Maybe there was an issue with your measurement method, or you were nervous before testing.\" Ye Qiusuo handed the watch back to Xie Xi.","Lu Minglang on the other side had been observing them the whole time and couldn't help but laugh. \"So buying a Tianqiu Tech watch gets you a personal inspection from President Ye. I'll have to go buy one to wear after this.\"","Before Ye Qiusuo could respond, Xie Xi spoke up first. \"If you were Tianqiu Tech's spokesperson, maybe you could get the professor to check it for you.\"","Others might need to consider the Lu family's standing, but Xie Xi couldn't care less.","Many CP fans watching the livestream had no idea what was being presented at the press conference. They spent the whole time eagerly staring at the screen, hoping to catch some sweet interactions to indulge in. The cameras faithfully captured the three of them talking and transmitted the scene to the livestream."]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66","paragraphs":["This kind of launch event typically attracts industry insiders or enthusiasts of the field. Apart from Xie Xi being a celebrity, the others are ordinary people.","Therefore, the trio of Ye Qiusuo sitting in the middle was extremely conspicuous, as if they were from a different dimension compared to the others. Furthermore, Ye Qiusuo is the largest shareholder of Tianqiu Tech, so the cameras naturally cut to her from time to time.","The fans in the live stream, especially those who adore Professor Ye but have had no way to see her, were absolutely thrilled, as if celebrating a festival.","[Damn, three pairs of long legs. Can people nowadays be even better-looking than celebrities?]","[I want the details of the man next to Professor Ye within five seconds.]","[Someone mentioned it earlier, but let me explain again. This is Lu Minglang, the current heir of the Lu Group. A little tidbit: Lu Mingzhe is his younger brother.]","[Wow! Lu Mingzhe and Lu Minglang. Just from the names, you can tell they're related. So they're brothers.]","[Doesn't that mean Lu Mingzhe is also... haha, is he just playing around in the entertainment circle?]","[Am I the only one wondering what they're talking about?]","[Ahhh! Oh my god! What is Professor Ye doing?! Is she touching Xi Xi's hand?!]","[Sisters, what are you waiting for? Screenshot now! A historic moment captured together, and Professor Ye is making a move!]","[Huh? Turns out she was just taking the watch. But why is Xi Xi wearing that watch today? It doesn't really match the outfit.]","[It's the Tianqiu Tech product launch today. He's wearing the smart medical watch produced by Tianqiu Tech, and the project lead is Professor Ye. Xie-Ye CP is real!!!]","[Aww, Professor Ye put it on! What's going on?!]","[What are the two of them saying? So curious.]","However, at that moment, the camera cut back to the person on stage, and the audience couldn't see the follow-up between Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi below.","[Hey, cameraman, cut back!]","[Why switch the shot now? Let me see, let me keep watching!!!]","By the time the camera switched back, the two were already sitting upright in their seats, and the watch was back on Xie Xi's wrist.","However, Lu Minglang next to them said something to Ye Qiusuo. Before she could respond, the audience saw Xie Xi turn his head and say something.","[Is that handsome guy talking to Xie Xi or Professor Ye?]","[Judging by the eye contact and the angle of his turn, it should be Professor Ye.]","Baby Xi seems a bit unhappy. When he's usually angry, one of his eyebrows raises.","[Come on, it's just talking. You're reading too much into it.]","[Suddenly, I'm shipping a love triangle.]","...","The launch event continued. Finally, it was Xie Xi's turn to go on stage, and the audience below immediately got excited. After all, seeing a real-life celebrity in person is different from seeing them on TV or a phone screen.","\"Welcome, welcome.\" The host guided Xie Xi to stand in the center of the stage, then took a pair of glasses from the central podium and said to the camera, \"This is the first time Tianqiu Tech has hired a spokesperson, for these glasses designed to correct and rehabilitate visual issues for those with reading and writing disorders.\"","The audience below began to applaud. After the applause died down, the host faced Xie Xi again: \"I'm also a fan of Xie Xi. I've always known your handwriting isn't great, but I only found out about this issue of yours not long ago. So, I'd like to ask Xi Xi, what was your world like before, or how did you experience reading and writing?\"","\"I have a relatively severe case of reading and writing disorder. Words appear incomplete to me, and it causes dizziness.\" Xie Xi hadn't wanted to disclose this before, simply not wanting to garner sympathy. Now it's fine; mentioning it can help with the product promotion anyway.","[So, that's why Xi Xi didn't continue his studies.]","[No wonder on the reality show, the assistant often had to read things to Xie Xi. It turns out he couldn't see clearly.]","[Actually, long-time fans know that even though he didn't finish junior high, he doesn't know less than someone who went to university.]","[Right, right! I remember an early program where Xi Xi and a few other celebrities participated. It was like an early version of \"Knowledge Q&A,\" just for fun among celebrities. He performed exceptionally well. Not sure about math, but he never lost in literature-related topics.]","\"And now, after wearing these glasses, can you see clearly?\" the host asked.","\"Yes, I'm practicing my handwriting now.\" Xie Xi deliberately added the latter part, mentally noting that the practice copybook was personally transcribed by Professor Ye before she gave it to him.","\"Then we look forward to seeing Xi Xi's improved handwriting in the future,\" the host said with a smile.","Subsequently, the host began to demonstrate and explain the functions and parameters of the glasses, with Xie Xi standing beside him, responsible for holding the glasses.","[Professor Ye is watching so intently. They even have matching glasses. This is too sweet for me!]","[Start editing, sisters! Such great material. I've already imagined it ten thousand times!]","Later, when Ye Qiusuo went on stage and Xie Xi sat below looking up, the CP fans went even crazier.","It always seemed that when the camera shot from the front, there was a light in Xie Xi's eyes.","The launch event lasted over three hours. After it ended, Lu Minglang still hadn't left.","There was one thing he couldn't understand. When they first cooperated, they got along quite well. But later, when he offered well-intentioned advice, the other party not only didn't appreciate it but became wary instead.","However... he wasn't without his own intentions either.","\"President Ye, looking forward to meeting at the upcoming industry conference,\" Lu Minglang said, standing up, buttoning his suit jacket, and giving a light laugh.","Xie Xi, who was just about to speak to Ye Qiusuo, immediately felt alarm bells ringing. What conference were the two of them going to attend?!","\"President Lu wants to stay and have a meal with us at Tianqiu? However, Tianqiu Tech only welcomes employees with ID cards,\" Ye Qiusuo said, not responding to his previous statement. As she spoke, she glanced at the door, clearly not welcoming him to stay any longer.","Xie Xi: Good, she doesn't like Lu Minglang.","Lu Minglang wasn't angry either. He turned and left with people from another company.","Ye Qiusuo watched his retreating figure and instinctively frowned. She knew Lu Minglang was not simple and had designs on Tianqiu Tech, so their subsequent conversations were hardly ever amicable.","She found it troublesome and didn't want other complications. Either be direct competitors; there was no need for pretense.","\"Is there a dinner arrangement too?\" Xie Xi suddenly spoke up beside her. \"Can I go? I'm hungry.\"","Ye Qiusuo withdrew her gaze and turned to look at him: \"Did you eat this morning?\" She remembered last time he came to see her, he hadn't eaten either.","Xie Xi: \"No, I didn't.\" (He actually had.)","\"Let's go.\" Professor Ye led Xie Xi towards the backstage. The company had already booked a private room over there. The earlier comment about needing an ID was purely for Lu Minglang's benefit; it wasn't about eating in the company cafeteria anyway.","Xie Xi thought delightedly: She really treats him differently!","As for Xie Xi joining the dinner gathering, the people at Tianqiu Tech were welcoming. After all, he is Tianqiu Tech's first spokesperson and deserves special treatment. Moreover, it's said he's also an investor in this glasses project.","Even though this project isn't entirely under Tianqiu, everyone still regarded him as a partner.","Of course, taking a group photo when dining together is a must, especially with a celebrity present.","Seizing the opportunity, after the big group photo, Xie Xi simply took a separate photo with everyone, successfully obtaining a picture of just him and Ye Qiusuo.","He saved it, resisting the urge to post it on Weibo to show off, and instead sent it around on WeChat, of course setting it to be visible only to his parents plus one Zhang Dong.","Zhang Dong: Wow! Professor Ye and Brother Xi look so well-matched!","Mother Xie: My son is making fast progress, keep it up!","Father Xie: Seeing all those extra bowls and chopsticks on the side means there were many other people; you just managed to tag along for this, didn't you.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","Although Father Xie had seen right through him, Xie Xi wasn't discouraged. He logged into his alternate account and posted today's diary entry: We took a photo together, another small step forward~","\"Xie Xi.\" Ye Qiusuo noticed Xie Xi across from her looking down at his phone again and called his name with a frown. \"Eat first.\"","There were about a dozen people in the private room, split between two tables. The atmosphere was quite noisy as everyone ate and chatted. Being technical staff, they didn't feel the need to particularly ingratiate themselves with the shareholders. Moreover, Professor Ye herself was also technical staff, so no one really paid attention to their little interaction.","Except for one person.","Zhao Guiyin.","As a top-tier assistant, he could not only handle all sorts of matters for his superior but also act as the company's spokesperson, possessing a keen ability to read people and situations.","Ye Qiusuo could be described as someone who normally didn't pay attention to others. It wasn't that she couldn't, she just didn't want to—a common trait of those deeply immersed in science.","But she had taken note of something as minor as Xie Xi not eating.","This was rather strange.","However, since CEO Ye could invite the notoriously hard-to-get Xie Xi, perhaps the two had a good private relationship, Zhao Guiyin reasoned to himself.","\"Oh.\" Xie Xi sent that Weibo post and immediately picked up his chopsticks to eat.","Even though he liked Professor Ye now, whenever she called out 'Xie Xi', he still felt a bit of a jolt.","...","\"Brother Xi, was the food good?\" Zhang Dong came to pick up Xie Xi and asked casually.","\"It was good,\" Xie Xi replied absentmindedly, cradling his phone.","What's going on? No one has edited a video yet? Where are the Xie-Ye CP fans?","Xie Xi didn't know that the video editors among the CP fans were at home, swooning over the content for ages, squealing and rolling around, completely unable to focus on editing. Others were working on edits, but progress was slow; they'd need at least until tomorrow to finish, requiring an all-nighter today.","Unable to find any new videos, Xie Xi grew anxious.","In his anxiety, he started calling his agent.","\"Sister Wei, I want to post a Weibo.\"","\"You're asking me about posting a Weibo? What do you want to post?\" Wei Qi was startled.","\"Oh, it's a group photo with Professor Ye. I want to do some more promotion for this project,\" Xie Xi declared with righteous seriousness.","\"Promotion? Sure, you can post that,\" Wei Qi said, not reading anything into it. Mainly because upon hearing \"Professor Ye,\" she couldn't really imagine anything else.","As soon as Xie Xi hung up, he immediately posted the photo he had only shared on WeChat using his official account, hoping to stir up the CP fans.","Xie Xi: [Post-release dinner. image.jpg]","To avoid making the two of them too obvious, yet still letting the CP fans find some sugar to enjoy, Xie Xi posted nine pictures. The first eight were randomly selected from the earlier group photos, and the ninth and final one was the photo of him and Ye Qiusuo.","As expected, the CP fans once again went into a frenzy.","[The real deal is giving us sugar?!]","[Professor Ye! I actually get to see Professor Ye! What press conference was this?]","[Sisters above, go check out the Skyball Tech press conference, there should be a replay.]","[The two of them sitting together is absolutely perfect, how are they so well-matched? Sob, I'm dying from this sweetness.]","[Hehehe, XiXi actually took off his jacket. He looks good in a white shirt too.]","[Can I just say that all the people Xie Xi took photos with are industry giants? You might not know them by name, but you definitely know their research or the products they've already developed.]","[Yeah, for the first time, I'm not jealous of the people taking photos with Baby Xi, but jealous that Baby Xi gets to take photos with these giants.]"]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67","paragraphs":["\"Qiusuo, you guys met today! You didn't even invite me to the press conference!\"","Ye Qiusuo had just arrived home when Rong Shiyun called, asking excitedly.","At first, she didn't realize who 'you guys' referred to, but on second thought, there was only one person who could make Rong Shiyun this excited.","\"Yeah, we had dinner together after the live stream. What would you have come for?\"","\"I...\" Rong Shiyun's voice grew lower and lower, \"To see Xie Xi, of course.\"","She couldn't possibly be going to watch the press conference; she wouldn't understand a thing anyway.","\"When do you start work?\" Ye Qiusuo didn't continue the topic.","\"In a few days. My mentor has already been taking me around for visits.\" Hearing her question, Rong Shiyun restrained her earlier excitement. \"When I officially start, I'll treat you to dinner.\"","\"Okay.\"","...","\"Get out!\"","Wan Yurou pointed at the door, telling her assistant to leave. As soon as the door closed, she swept her hand across the table, smashing all the cosmetics to the floor.","\"This is a film set, there are still people outside. Tone it down a bit,\" her manager reminded her as he pushed the door open and looked at the mess on the floor.","During the New Year, \"Red Ear\" blew up, and the second female lead became an overnight sensation. Now, many big productions and endorsements were seeking out the actress who played her.","It should be known that the second female lead of \"Red Ear\" was originally supposed to be played by Wan Yurou. The director had clearly stated that he favored her the most, but he went back on his word at the last minute. The role was snatched away by a rookie from Huayun Culture, and now that rookie was famous.","From the time the movie aired until now, Wan Yurou had been holding back her resentment.","Recently, she had taken on the female lead role for a major director. Today was supposed to be the day they bought trending searches and coordinated with marketing accounts. However, because of Tianqiu Technology's press conference, the spokesperson Xie Xi thoroughly captured everyone's attention, along with that Ye Qiusuo.","The netizens' attention was entirely drawn to them, and her popularity couldn't be salvaged at all.","The rookie was from Huayun, and Xie Xi went without saying—he was Huayun Culture's most important artist. Wan Yurou absolutely hated this company; she felt like they were her natural nemesis.","\"It shouldn't be like this. The one who got famous should have been me!\" Wan Yurou couldn't calm down at all. Subconsciously, she always felt that all of this was originally hers, but reality proved otherwise.","\"Alright, that role was a long time ago. There's nothing we can do now that she's famous; the movie has already aired. As for the trending searches, once Xie Xi makes an appearance, no one can compete with him.\" The manager stepped around the pile of shattered cosmetics on the floor and found a chair to sit down. \"I'll find an opportunity to promote you in a while. I came to see you today because I have a variety show for you.\"","\"A variety show?\" Wan Yurou said in annoyance. \"I want to act.\"","The manager smiled. \"Aren't you acting right now? You're the female lead for a big director. The director of that show is Zheng Longju. She's been a good friend of mine for years. If you go, she'll help you establish a good persona.\"","Wan Yurou finally calmed down.","Zheng Longju had a huge reputation in the industry, and public opinion of her was extremely polarized.","With just one show, she could determine a celebrity's 'life or death' through post-production and editing.","There was once a star on the verge of making it big who, because of her editing, was cyberbullied by the entire internet. It got so bad that they almost left the entertainment industry, unable to even maintain normal appearances, and later stayed at a third- or fourth-tier level just to earn a living.","There were also stars plagued by scandals and dark histories who regained the audience's affection because of her.","\"What kind of variety show is it? Who else is participating besides me?\"","\"It's a puzzle-solving detective variety show. For Zheng Longju's program, the celebrities who can get on are definitely all A-listers,\" the manager affirmed.","Wan Yurou was pleased by the word 'A-listers' from her manager's mouth, and her mood improved a bit. \"I'll participate.\"","The manager nodded in satisfaction, pulled a tissue, and stood up. He then bent down, gathered some of the spilled liquid and powder from the floor, and reached out to smear it on one side of Wan Yurou's arm and thigh.","Wan Yurou instinctively tried to dodge, but the manager pulled her back and coated her thoroughly.","Afterward, the manager went out. When he opened the door, the assistant was still standing there.","\"Go find the stage manager. Tell them Yurou fainted from low blood sugar and accidentally knocked over the cosmetics on the table. We will compensate for the damages.\"","The assistant peeked carefully into the dressing room and then agreed, \"Yes.\"","The next day, the news of Wan Yurou fainting on set due to low blood sugar spread like wildfire, successfully making it onto the trending searches.","...","The big star Xie Xi waited an entire day before finally seeing the Xie-Ye ship videos released by the fan editors. Excitedly, he first retweeted them using his alt account, and then slowly watched them one by one.","The first one was incredibly exquisite and even had a storyline. The subsequent ones were also not bad.","There was one about him secretly having a crush on Ye Qiusuo. It used the footage of him sitting in the audience looking at Ye Qiusuo, paired with inner monologues from movies and TV shows. It couldn't be more vivid. Then came a flashback using the clip of them sitting in the audience, taking off and putting on the watch.","Xie Xi felt touched just watching it.","Later on, there was a video about Ye Qiusuo secretly having a crush on him. This time, it started with the video of him standing on stage and Ye Qiusuo in the audience, and then added a scene from his music video a few years ago where he was playing basketball in a blue and white school uniform. Probably because there was too little footage of Ye Qiusuo, this video creator directly used face-swapping technology to replace the face of a female lead sitting on the bleachers in a campus drama with Ye Qiusuo's face without glasses.","The young female lead secretly loved the male lead on campus. Later, they entered society; the male lead joined the entertainment industry and became a singer, while the female lead worked hard, climbing up step by step until she finally became a big boss. The two had no interaction for many years. Occasionally, the female lead would stop on the street, looking up at the big star on the LED screen. She would also support him on his birthday, buying up all the advertising spaces on the street to display messages wishing him a happy birthday and everyday happiness.","When the male lead became a top-tier star in the entertainment industry, the female lead's company had already become the most awesome technology company in the country. Any celebrity who could endorse her company would instantly be elevated to a higher tier than others. One day, the company needed a new spokesperson and held a press conference. In the conference room, the big boss strongly recommended the male lead. Finally, the two met at the press conference, except one was standing on stage, while the other, wearing gold-rimmed glasses with silver chains and already a successful woman, sat in the audience. The person on stage thought it was just business, but the person in the audience was full of deep affection.","As Xie Xi watched, he blushed, feeling a slight bitterness in his heart, as if he could truly feel the emotions of a long unrequited love.","Just as he wanted to keep watching, the screen suddenly went black, and a line of text appeared: To be continued. There's really no more footage, the creator can't edit any further.","Xie Xi: \"...\" So annoying. He wanted to see what happened next.","The comments section was going even crazier.","[Holy crap, this storyline is so complete. A tiny bit of sugar mixed in with countless glass shards.]","[This is so good to ship! I love this, it's both angsty and sweet, sob sob sob, I bet it's definitely a happy ending.]","[A bad ending isn't impossible either, just an unrequited love with no end.]","[Fuck! How is the creator so good at editing? I want to see the rest!!!]","[Are there any talented authors writing a fanfic for this? Ten thousand people are begging for a written ending.]","[Ten thousand people +1]","When Xie Xi scrolled to this comment, he used his alt account to retweet and comment: [Ten thousand people +2]","Up until this point, Xie Xi's mood was quite pleasant, but when he saw the last video, he became unhappy.","Because... someone actually edited a love triangle! And the ending wasn't him and Professor Ye together!","That uploader probably preferred Lu Minglang. She edited the press conference footage over and over again. By using slow motion and various other techniques, she managed to cut the video down to two minutes. There were three main characters in total: him, Ye Qiusuo, and Lu Minglang.","The superstar Xie's face darkened. Tapping his phone screen, he deleted the forwarded video.","This kind of video editing was terrible!","...","Once the New Year passed, time seemed to fly by. Ye Qiusuo had to start mentoring students again and occasionally teach classes.","She was doing alright; she only had to teach small classes to her few students, so her schedule was quite flexible.","On the contrary, Rong Shiyun had been coming over quite often lately. She would take advantage of the lunch break to eat with her and ask for advice on how to mentor students.","\"Just explain the key points clearly,\" Ye Qiusuo said as she took out her old lesson preparation notes from her bag and pushed them over. \"Our majors are different, but the purpose of a teacher's lecture is the same: to impart knowledge. You can take this and have a look.\"","Rong Shiyun put the notes away and slumped on the table. \"It's not that I can't teach. I try my best to cut down on my rambling, but I just always feel like the students think I have no authority.\"","Rong Shiyun was in her early twenties, not much older than those college students. Plus, she loved to joke around normally, so when she stood on the podium, she didn't look like a teacher at all.","Speaking of this, Rong Shiyun looked up at Ye Qiusuo with envy.","At the same age, Ye Qiusuo could make people overlook how old she was; the deepest impression she left was only those calm, quiet eyes.","\"There are plenty of teachers who mingle well with their students.\" Ye Qiusuo didn't think there was anything wrong with Rong Shiyun. \"No one is used to teaching at the very beginning. You'll be fine after a while.\"","\"I hope so.\" Now that Rong Shiyun had found a job, she wasn't as dispirited anymore. She sat up and started chattering again. \"What have you been up to lately? Is the company holding another press conference? Has Zai Zai shot the endorsement?\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"...No.\"","Rong Shiyun put her hands together in a pleading gesture. \"When he shoots the endorsement, you'll definitely go watch, right? Take me with you, please?\"","Professor Ye frowned. \"There are designated people in charge of his endorsement shoot. I don't manage that.\"","Rong Shiyun put on a serious face. \"Qiusuo, this is where you're wrong. As the boss of Tianqiu Technology, you should attach importance to your very first spokesperson. Besides, the number of brands Xixi has endorsed over the years can be counted on one hand. Since he's shooting an endorsement for you, you should go see it even more. Only then can you experience the good atmosphere of cooperation between both parties.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"...\"","\"Furthermore, from another perspective, he is also the investor for your project. Are you really not going to visit him on set?\" Rong Shiyun advised earnestly.","\"I'll ask him tonight when the shoot is,\" Ye Qiusuo finally relented helplessly.","Rong Shiyun instantly became excited and even ate an extra bowl of rice.","...","These past few days, whenever Xie Xi came home and had some free time, he would project that secret crush fan-made video onto the big screen. The uploader's editing was exquisite and their skills were superb. At first, when Zhang Dong leaned over to watch it for the first time, he was shocked. If he hadn't been following Xie Xi around all year round, he would have almost believed it.","By now, Zhang Dong had grown numb to watching it, but his Brother Xi still watched it with great relish. It was a good thing that all the reality show cameras in the house had been dismantled; otherwise, playing it like this would let the whole world know that the idol himself was shipping his own ship.","\"Brother Xi, you're going to shoot the Tianqiu Technology endorsement the day after tomorrow. Maybe you'll get to see Professor Ye.\" Zhang Dong tried hard to attract the attention of Xie Xi, who was lying on the sofa looking heartbroken after watching the video.","Xie Xi said listlessly, \"The endorsement shoot is at the advertising agency's venue, not at Tianqiu. How are we supposed to meet?\"","Especially since after Xie Xi finished copying that calligraphy practice book, Ye Qiusuo told him he could just practice it repeatedly. The two of them hadn't seen each other for over two weeks."]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68","paragraphs":["Shooting an endorsement commercial was naturally a job for a professional advertising agency. Although Xie Xi didn't charge an endorsement fee, the advertising agency still required a hefty service fee.","Therefore, when Professor Ye processed the payment from the company's account, she felt a little pang of heartache over the money.","When the day of the commercial shoot arrived, Ye Qiusuo remembered her good friend's words and decided to go over and take a look.","She was still at the university in the morning. By noon, she called to invite Rong Shiyun to go with her.","\"At noon?\" Rong Shiyun wished she could hug her poor self. \"There's a welcome party on the professor's side, and I have to go.\"","\"Xie Xi will be shooting until six in the afternoon at the latest before he leaves.\"","Rong Shiyun whimpered a few times, and finally could only say, \"Then you go visit the set. If you see him, it's as good as me seeing him.\"","\"...Mhm.\"","In the end, the person who originally wanted to go couldn't make it.","Ye Qiusuo went over alone to watch Xie Xi's shoot, arriving just in time for their break.","Xie Xi was sitting in a chair letting the makeup artist touch up his makeup, while the director was saying something next to him. As soon as he saw Ye Qiusuo, he tilted his head to dodge the makeup artist's hand, stood up, and walked toward the main entrance.","\"You...\" Noticing that the nearby staff members were observing them, Xie Xi changed his words, \"Why is Professor here?\"","Generally speaking, after the advertising agency finished the final cut, they would hand it over to the company to choose. The client wouldn't specially come over to check on the shoot.","\"To come see you,\" Ye Qiusuo said straightforwardly.","Before today, if Xie Xi had heard this sentence, he would definitely have been very happy, and might even wonder if the other party cared about him a little.","But the shooting had already been going on for the whole morning, and right now, Xie Xi absolutely did not want Ye Qiusuo to come over and watch him shoot the commercial.","For no other reason than the fact that the advertised product was a pair of glasses. In order to make it easier for ordinary people to understand, the commercial's visual effects utilized a sci-fi-like scenario where the human eye, looking through the glasses, would see a light blue wireframe composition. However, as the spokesperson, Xie Xi had to act out interacting with thin air, which looked incredibly awkward to watch live on set.","The director over there obviously also recognized Ye Qiusuo. He walked over to greet her, assuming that Ye Qiusuo was here to supervise the work. He instantly perked up, wanting to explain the progress to her.","\"Director, please go about your business. I'm just here to take a look.\" Ye Qiusuo's original intention was to bring Rong Shiyun along, but in the end, she came alone.","\"Brother Xi, it's time for lunch.\" Zhang Dong came in carrying bags of food, followed by a few people carrying large insulated boxes.","Seeing Professor Ye, Zhang Dong subconsciously looked toward Xie Xi.","Had his brother's dream come true?","He had been dispirited for the past few days, wanting to see Professor Ye. Now that she had come to visit the set, he should be happy!","\"Have you... eaten yet? Want to join me?\" Xie Xi asked Ye Qiusuo.","\"Professor Ye, join us. We definitely ordered extra food,\" Zhang Dong chimed in from the side.","Finally, under Zhang Dong's arrangement, a folding table was set up and filled with various dishes. The other large boxes were ordered for the staff present; each of them received a box of rice, a box of dishes, and a bowl of soup.","\"You didn't send me your calligraphy practice yesterday,\" Ye Qiusuo picked up her chopsticks and suddenly said.","Xie Xi's hand paused, his heart feeling somewhat complicated. He would send her the results of his handwriting practice every week. Yesterday marked a week, and he had already taken the photo, but in the end, he gave up on sending it.","Every time Ye Qiusuo received his calligraphy photos, she basically only replied with two sentences.","Beginning: Received.","End: You've made progress, keep up the good work.","Xie Xi almost thought he was talking to a software bot.","So yesterday he deliberately didn't send it. By the end of this morning, having received no message from her, Xie Xi was feeling down. While shooting the commercial, others couldn't tell, but Zhang Dong became increasingly cautious, terrified of provoking this diva.","He never expected that at noon, Ye Qiusuo would come to the shooting set and ask him this question.","Could it be that Professor Ye specially came today just because he didn't send a message yesterday?","Xie Xi suddenly felt that playing hard to get was a great strategy!","\"I wasn't feeling well yesterday, so I forgot to send it.\"","\"I see...\" Professor Ye thought for a moment and said, \"You don't need to send it anymore. Just practice on your own at home.\"","Xie Xi: \"???\" That wasn't what he meant!","Shouldn't a normal person ask what was wrong with his health, or if he was feeling better now, or other such caring words?","\"My handwriting still isn't good enough,\" Xie Xi could only say dryly.","\"You've already made a lot of progress. You learn very quickly.\"","After Xie Xi put on his glasses and could see the characters clearly, he spent time matching them with the text in his memory, and learned very quickly after that.","The great superstar Xie profoundly experienced what it meant to shoot oneself in the foot.","Sitting next to him, Zhang Dong cast a sympathetic glance at Xie Xi before burying his head to eat.","\"This is delicious.\" After a while, Xie Xi pointed at a plate of stir-fried lamb and said to Ye Qiusuo. He didn't pick up the food and put it directly into her bowl.","When facing someone you truly like, you always worry about gains and losses, act constrained, and dare not overstep your bounds even a single step.","Ye Qiusuo was just about to give it a try when her phone suddenly rang. She looked down at the screen; it was a call from the company. She turned slightly and answered the phone: \"What is it?\"","Opposite her, Xie Xi raised his eyes to look at Ye Qiusuo's profile. Her eyelashes were incredibly long and curled. She was clearly breathtakingly exquisite, yet it seemed no one had ever noticed, perhaps because her gaze was always so firm and calm.","\"Breach of contract?\" Ye Qiusuo lowered her eyelashes, her face turning frosty. \"How many people?\"","The person on the other end must have still been explaining. After listening, Ye Qiusuo said, \"I'm heading over right now.\"","After hanging up the phone, Ye Qiusuo bid farewell to the two of them. She had only taken a few bites of the food on the table.","\"Wait.\" Without thinking, Xie Xi grabbed Ye Qiusuo's hand. When she looked over, he immediately let go. \"Take this with you.\"","He picked up a creamy green jujube from the table and stuffed it into Ye Qiusuo's hand.","\"Thank you.\" Ye Qiusuo accepted it, turned around, and left.","After she left, Xie Xi sat back down, completely losing his appetite.","\"She's run into some trouble.\"","This was the first time Xie Xi had seen Ye Qiusuo's mood change so drastically. He didn't know what the person on the other end had said, but her expression had changed almost instantly.","\"Brother Xi, don't worry. I think someone as amazing as Professor Ye will definitely be able to solve it,\" Zhang Dong comforted him.","...","Ye Qiusuo drove to Tianqiu Technology, various thoughts swirling in her mind along the way.","Tianqiu Technology had been established for less than ten years. The first batch of researchers who joined had a very good relationship with Ye Qiusuo; they were the initial founding members of the company. The contracts Ye Qiusuo had drawn up back then were basically in favor of the researchers, granting them a great deal of freedom. Later, as the company grew, this contract template was continuously maintained.","Excluding the researchers recruited in the past two years, the middle batch of researchers had almost shouldered the entire development process of Tianqiu Technology. They enjoyed the same treatment as the first batch of researchers, except they didn't hold shares. They were the mainstays of the entire company.","Just now, the company called to say that two researchers who had initially signed one-year contracts and automatically renewed them year by year had submitted their termination agreements together today. There were two others who had signed ten-year contracts right off the bat; since they couldn't terminate them normally, they were directly offering to pay the penalty for breach of contract.","Four people wanting to leave on the exact same day—who would believe there wasn't a problem behind this?","Ye Qiusuo took large strides through the company's main entrance, took out her ID card to swipe through the turnstile, and walked briskly into the elevator. By the time she stepped out, she had already regained her composure.","\"Professor Ye.\"","\"Professor Ye.\"","As soon as Ye Qiusuo walked in, the two individuals looking to terminate their contracts greeted her. The other two researchers, who were there to pay their breach of contract penalties, stood silently to the side.","There were two other people in the room. One was the HR Director of Tianqiu Technology, whose face was filled with anxiety, and the other...","Was the top-tier lawyer of the Lu Group. He handled all sorts of thorny cases for the Lu Group year-round and had never lost a single one.","Ye Qiusuo walked straight past the group and went directly to the desk. She sat down in the chair and opened the four contracts laid out in front of her.","A few minutes later, Ye Qiusuo picked up a black gel pen nearby, signed her name on all four contracts, and then took the company seal to stamp each one.","\"You may leave now.\"","Everyone in the room froze.","No one had expected her to let them go so straightforwardly the moment she arrived.","\"President Ye!\" the HR Director cried out anxiously.","These four people leaving wasn't just a simple departure. Aside from the completed projects, if they left, they were allowed to take their current, unfinished projects with them. This was a special perk granted in their original contracts.","It was important to note that the projects these four were currently handling were exactly the ones Tianqiu had been heavily developing over the past few years. Setting aside the massive funding already invested, what they held in their hands was the very future of Tianqiu.","If they were allowed to leave, Tianqiu would inevitably suffer a devastating blow. It might not be immediately apparent, but the plans for the next few years would essentially have to start from scratch.","\"Sign here,\" Ye Qiusuo said, handing the pen to the HR Director. \"Let them go.\"","The HR Director locked eyes with Ye Qiusuo, but ultimately could only lower his head and sign the papers.","Seeing her let them go so easily, the four researchers suddenly felt a twinge of indignance. After all, prior to today, they had been highly valued within the company; it went without saying that everyone who saw them would respectfully greet them.","\"Does Professor Ye have anything to say to us?\"","Ye Qiusuo looked up at them and said indifferently, \"Pay the breach of contract penalty first, then you can take your contracts and leave.\"","\"...\"","Ye Qiusuo picked up the desk phone and dialed the internal line for the IT department. She listed off the names of the four individuals and instructed, \"Deactivate these four ID cards.\"","Afterwards, she had Zhao Guiyin apply for four single-use exit passes.","\"Director Ji, please wait until the penalty fees have been received before having Assistant Zhao issue their single-use exit passes,\" Ye Qiusuo said, before standing up to leave.","\"Understood.\"","A single-use exit pass was different from a temporary ID card. Anyone holding this pass would be subjected to a strict security check. Personnel would be dispatched to conduct thorough inspections at every turnstile to ensure that departing employees did not take any company property with them.","Since these four were also taking their projects with them, their inspection procedures would be different from those of regular departing employees. Another department would also be mobilized; all of their materials had to be openly reviewed to ensure nothing extra was being smuggled out before they were permitted to leave.","\"Professor Ye,\" called out another one of the men who had chosen not to renew his contract, stopping Ye Qiusuo in her tracks. \"We just want to see our projects succeed. Now that Tianqiu is under your leadership... we researchers should just focus on what researchers do best.\"","He didn't believe Tianqiu Technology had a bright future. Although Ye Qiusuo excelled at her projects and was much smarter than most, managing a company was a task better suited for someone with actual business acumen. Furthermore, the compensation offered by the Lu Group was simply too high. Between a startup established less than a decade ago and a corporate behemoth of a family enterprise, he naturally chose the latter.","\"Then I wish you all the best in getting what you want.\"","The news of the four researchers leaving Tianqiu Technology together quickly spread throughout the entire company. After all, the commotion was too big to ignore.","That evening, Song Jiren and several other shareholders rushed over, demanding to know why Ye Qiusuo had let them go.","\"We've invested so much capital, and now they're leaving with more than half of the results. Is Tianqiu supposed to just feed on air for the next few years?\"","\"President Ye, you must already have a countermeasure. Could you enlighten us?\" Song Jiren asked."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69","paragraphs":["\"I don't have a countermeasure,\" Ye Qiusuo said expressionlessly.","At this, even Song Jiren, who usually didn't interfere much in the management, couldn't sit still. \"So we're just going to let them leave like this?\"","\"If they want to leave, we can only let them leave.\" On her way here, it wasn't that Ye Qiusuo hadn't thought about ways to stop them, but after weighing the options, letting them go was the fastest way to solve the problem. Besides, they could still get the penalty fees for breach of contract from two of them.","Those four had already made up their minds to leave. If the company refused to let them go, they wouldn't put their hearts into the project anyway. The two sides would just drag each other down, and in the end, it would be Tianqiu that suffered the drain. Not to mention, their opponent was the powerful and influential Lu Corporation. Even if you ignored everything else, they had plenty of money; they could easily bleed Tianqiu dry just by dragging things out.","Lu Minglang hadn't inherited the Lu Corporation that long ago, and he was eager to produce results. He had set his sights on Tianqiu Technology, but there was one thing he hadn't yet figured out. For Tianqiu Technology to have come this far, the researchers were no longer an irreplaceable part of it. The perfect experimental system and equipment of Tianqiu Technology alone would attract countless outstanding researchers who genuinely wanted to do research.","Perhaps by poaching the crucial projects of Tianqiu Technology for the next few years, he might cause Tianqiu Technology some painful muscle-tearing damage, but it wasn't enough to strike at the bone.","Especially since Lu Minglang's actions were too aggressive. With four people leaving at once, she couldn't just sit back and do nothing.","\"Regarding the project part, the researchers' contracts need to be amended. I'll finish revising them tonight and post them on the company's intranet,\" Ye Qiusuo informed the shareholders.","\"Even if we change it now, what about Tianqiu's interests over the next few years?\" another shareholder asked in a bad mood. \"Those four are still going to take the projects with them.\"","Ye Qiusuo lightly tapped the fountain pen on the desk with her finger and said calmly, \"Starting from four years ago, the patent applicant for all projects has been Tianqiu Technology.\"","Most of the people at Tianqiu Technology were researchers who liked to bury themselves in their work. So, to save them time, a vote was held four years ago to have Tianqiu Technology uniformly apply for patent rights.","The inventors could enjoy the right of authorship and the right to receive rewards, but the patent rights belonged to Tianqiu Technology.","Song Jiren was the first to react. \"Do you mean the company will continue these projects and have someone else take over?\"","Tianqiu Technology had backups of all the materials those four had taken with them. Although they had single-handedly advanced these projects, all the materials were now readily available. It wasn't impossible to have someone else take over; they just needed to find people more outstanding than them and strive to complete the projects before them.","\"Is it that easy to find suitable people to take over?\" the other shareholders instinctively poured cold water on the idea. The reason those four dared to leave so arrogantly was because they were the cream of the crop in their field. Who knew what massive benefits the Lu Corporation had promised to poach them all at once.","Ye Qiusuo looked up at that shareholder. \"I will handle this matter. You just need to collect your dividends.\"","The shareholder instantly fell silent. Everyone present knew exactly how Zhang Chengjue had left.","...","\"Brother Xi, Lake has an official release date. It's premiering in theaters next Wednesday,\" Zhang Dong came over excitedly, holding his phone.","\"Find someone else to watch the movie with you. I'm not interested.\" Xie Xi turned his back to Zhang Dong, holding Ye Qiusuo's calligraphy copybook in his hand, looking at the object and thinking of the person.","Zhang Dong walked around to face Xie Xi and said seriously again, \"Brother Xi, it's Lake! The movie that both you and Professor Ye are in.\"","Xie Xi's hand, which was flipping through the copybook, paused. He slowly looked up. \"Book two tickets. I'm going to watch it.\"","\"Brother Xi, I've already booked two.\" Zhang Dong felt he was a very competent assistant.","\"Mhm, give these two to me, and go book another one for yourself. Don't sit too close to us,\" Xie Xi instructed.","Zhang Dong: \"...\" He had forgotten. His Brother Xi was definitely going to invite Professor Ye.","However...","\"Brother Xi, how about booking the whole theater? You and Professor Ye can watch it alone, and it reduces the risk of being discovered.\"","\"No booking the whole theater. We'll just go to the cinema a bit late that day.\" Xie Xi wanted to sit together with Ye Qiusuo in the crowd.","Zhang Dong opened his phone to book a seat for himself. Going into that screening now, only the corner seats were left. It didn't matter, as long as he could see the movie.","\"Brother Xi, do you think Professor Ye will agree to go since she's so busy?\" Zhang Dong asked a heart-piercing question after buying his ticket.","Xie Xi: Couldn't he just fantasize about it first?","\"I'll call and ask.\" The big star Xie nervously dialed Ye Qiusuo's number.","No one answered.","He could only send Ye Qiusuo a message, asking if she was free next Wednesday, as he had bought two premiere tickets for Lake.","It was about three hours later when Ye Qiusuo finally replied to Xie Xi: [What time?]","Professor Ye had twenty-four hours a day, and every block of time was planned out.","Xie Xi asked cautiously: [From 7 PM to 9 PM, or later is fine too.]","Next Wednesday at 7 PM she should be working at home. Sparing two hours... wasn't entirely impossible.","Ye Qiusuo: [Does the movie start at 7?]","Seeing this message, Xie Xi's heart settled a bit. Was there hope?","Xie Xi: [Starts at 7, ends at 8:55.]","Ye Qiusuo: [Okay.]","Xie Xi stared at that word for a long time, and a starry smile gradually rippled in his eyes.","As for Ye Qiusuo, she put down her phone and wondered why she had agreed to go to the movies with Xie Xi. Even though she had appeared in Lake, she didn't really care much about it.","It was probably because she had been under a lot of pressure lately, and her instinct was to relax for a few hours.","Professor Ye judged her own behavior in her heart.","...","During class these past two days, Ye Qiusuo clearly felt that her students were a bit restless. They listened attentively enough during the lecture, but during the ten-minute break, several students were exchanging glances, especially led by Sun Jiajia.","However, as long as they paid attention in class, Professor Ye didn't care what they did in private.","\"That's all for today's class. If you have any questions, you can email me.\" Ye Qiusuo packed up her teaching materials and left the classroom.","As soon as their mentor left, the few of them immediately packed their things, having absolutely no intention of discussing their studies today.","Sun Jiajia hopped in place twice. \"Where are we going to eat later?\"","\"I know a nice seafood restaurant that opened recently. Are any of you allergic to seafood? If not, how about we go there?\" Lin Lu asked.","All four said no.","\"But a seafood restaurant sounds expensive,\" Sun Jiajia rubbed her chin. \"I'm trading five movie tickets for you to treat us to dinner. Aren't you losing out on this?\"","\"Let's go, as long as it's delicious,\" Lin Lu waved his hand dismissively.","A couple of days ago, Sun Jiajia bought five movie tickets, saying it was her idol Xie Xi's first time acting in a movie, and demanded that the four of them must go support him with her.","Since they were planning it anyway, they decided to just make it a post-New Year dinner gathering, and then go watch the movie.","...","On the other side, Ye Qiusuo also went home for a bit and conveniently handled a few matters sent over by the company. At 6:30, Xie Xi's car parked punctually downstairs in her residential complex to pick her up.","Actually, Xie Xi had already arrived nearby at 6:00, but waited half an hour to pretend he had just arrived.","Before this, Xie Xi had made a special trip home early in the morning, bringing back two large boxes of pastries. He had asked the cook to prepare a fresh batch of every single pastry that Ye Qiusuo had taken an extra bite of last time.","When Ye Qiusuo came downstairs and saw their car parked outside, she walked over and knocked on the window.","Xie Xi immediately opened the door and slid over to make room for her to get in.","Ye Qiusuo got in and closed the door, noticing that the privacy partition had been raised, blocking the view of the front seats.","\"Zhang Dong is driving,\" Xie Xi explained instinctively, catching Ye Qiusuo's gaze.","\"Mm.\"","Xie Xi felt a bit nervous. With the partition up, the space suddenly felt much smaller, leaving just the two of them together in the back.","His hands slipped a few times as he reached for the pastry box. He finally managed to get a steady grip, opened it, and offered it to Ye Qiusuo.","\"I brought these from home. Try some.\" Xie Xi had considered taking Ye Qiusuo to a restaurant after the movie, but on second thought, he realized he was already taking up over two hours of her time. She usually rushed through her meals as it was, and he didn't want to hold up her work any further.","Ye Qiusuo hadn't eaten dinner since leaving the university. Remembering her movie plans with Xie Xi, she had rushed to finish her work and naturally skipped eating.","The two of them sat in the backseat, quietly sharing the pastries, with the muffled sound of car horns occasionally drifting in from outside the windows.","It was already six fifty-seven by the time they arrived at the theater. Zhang Dong ran off to print the tickets, handing them each one upon his return while keeping the ticket for the most cornered seat for himself.","The lights were already off when they entered, so the three of them used the faint glow from the screen to find their seats.","Xie Xi was wearing a face mask and an orange beanie; in the darkness, no one noticed him.","He stole a quiet glance at Ye Qiusuo, just as she inadvertently looked his way.","The screen darkened at that moment, but Xie Xi's heart still skipped a beat. The audience fell silent, and he could clearly hear his own rapid heartbeat.","The movie began. The main characters of \"The Lake\" were You Feibai and Li Yandie, so naturally, the first ten or so minutes focused on them.","Ever since the movie's release date was announced, a third of the audience had come for You Feibai, another third came to see Xie Xi's silver screen debut, and the rest were fans of the other cast members.","Around the twenty-minute mark, the main characters entered the joint academy for their studies, where several distinguished professors imparted their knowledge. When a certain figure appeared on screen, a slight commotion rippled through the theater.","The commotion from a few people in the eighth row was particularly noticeable.","\"Holy crap, is that our advisor?!\" Lin Lu choked on a piece of popcorn, nearly gagging himself to death.","Ding Hong stared at their advisor on the screen in astonishment. They had only come to the movies today because Sun Jiajia wanted to see Xie Xi. They were merely tagging along, completely unprepared to see their advisor in the film.","As for Sun Jiajia, she was already pinching her philtrum. The rush of excitement had hit her so fast she nearly passed out.","\"When did our advisor film a movie with Xixi? Sob sob sob, I'm alive again!\" Sun Jiajia was moved to tears.","Since the movie starred both You Feibai and Xie Xi, the director had focused the promotional campaign entirely on them, completely leaving Ye Qiusuo out of it. Most people had no idea she was in it, making her appearance a nice little surprise.","Down in the sixth row, Xie Xi was also staring intently at Ye Qiusuo on the screen, unwilling to even blink.","He just felt a little sour inside. He and Ye Qiusuo didn't share any scenes; all of her interactions were with You Feibai.","When Ye Qiusuo finally disappeared from the screen, Xie Xi couldn't help but let out a long sigh.","Hearing him, Ye Qiusuo turned her head and asked in a low voice, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Professor, you acted really well,\" Xie Xi replied, changing the subject.","\"I was just teaching,\" Ye Qiusuo said. She didn't feel like she was acting at all; she was simply recreating what she normally did in class, just with different subject matter.","The movie continued. The moment the opera singer made his entrance, screams began to erupt throughout the theater. And when the classic scene of Xie Xi holding a cat and gazing into the distance appeared, the audience was filled with endless screams and gasps."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70","paragraphs":["The scene where Xie Xi stood on stage singing opera in costume had already caused a stir in the audience, as many had come specifically for him. When he leaned back in the chair, his long hair scattered, wearing only a white inner robe, and looked over, along with the ragdoll cat with big, watery blue eyes in his arms, everyone present was stunned.","Ye Qiusuo tilted her head slightly to look at the person on the screen. In that moment, she felt an indescribable, complex emotion.","\"Holy shit.\" Sun Jiajia, sitting in the back row, pinched her hand hard. \"I would do anything for him.\"","This 'him', of course, referred to the opera singer played by Xie Xi in the movie.","\"No wonder you like Xie Xi,\" Lin Lu said, shaking his head as he leaned against the back of his chair. \"Is he usually like this too?\"","For a man... he was a bit too seductive. Every look and expression carried a hint of enticement.","Hearing the word \"usually,\" Sun Jiajia suddenly deflated a bit, because Xie Xi was definitely not like this normally.","Oh no, she liked the Xie Xi in the movie more, that breathtaking feeling.","After a while, the theater gradually calmed down. However, when the male lead, Pei Jinxi, caused the opera singer to be arrested, there was another commotion, only this time, it was mostly indignation.","Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi didn't have much screen time in the film; the rest of the movie focused entirely on the male and female leads and a few other characters.","\"Bullshit!\"","A voice suddenly rang out in everyone's ears, and then a girl in the middle got up and left the theater without looking back.","After that, people left one after another, expressing their extreme dissatisfaction with the male lead in the movie.","Ding Hong and Lin Lu both turned to look at Sun Jiajia, afraid that she would also jump up and leave the theater.","\"What?\" Sun Jiajia was still looking up at the movie. Noticing the strange looks from both sides, she couldn't help but ask in a low voice.","\"I thought you were going to leave too,\" Lin Lu also whispered.","As he spoke, another person silently left.","Sun Jiajia: \"...I paid for this movie ticket. It would be a waste not to finish it.\"","The film was mainly about the male lead, Pei Jinxi's, journey of growth. No matter how passionate young students were, they were bound to have shortcomings. This was also the director's intention: not to create a perfect male lead, but to have him gradually become better.","Logically speaking, the director's approach wasn't wrong, and he handled the plot conflicts and details very well.","However, he underestimated Xie Xi's popularity. The scene where Xie Xi raised his eyes to look over was enough to be called a classic. The audience had just been struck by his beauty and felt immense affection for him, only to see the male lead cause the opera singer to be thrown into prison the very next second, using him as a stepping stone to connect with another faction.","Not only were the fans who came for Xie Xi angry, but even ordinary people couldn't help but sigh in their hearts: what kind of progressive youth was this, sacrificing someone else's life to achieve his own justice?","As soon as the movie ended and the credits rolled, Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi got up and left, avoiding the crowd.","\"That person looked quite like our professor,\" Lin Lu said to Ding Hong and the others.","\"The professor probably wouldn't come to see a movie, let alone with a friend.\" Ding Hong shook his head. Their professor was always busy and rarely wasted time, not to mention on entertainment.","Sun Jiajia had been looking down to send a message and didn't see the two who had already left, but she chimed in, \"The professor even acted in it, so why wouldn't she come to see it? It's her first movie, she'd probably want to watch it.\"","Lin Lu stroked his chin. \"Not necessarily. The professor is different from ordinary people like us.\"","...","\"Brother Xi, over here.\" Zhang Dong had come out earlier than them and had driven the car to the entrance to wait.","Xie Xi opened the car door and let Ye Qiusuo get in first, placing his hand over the door frame to protect her head. Only after she was seated did he get in himself.","\"Lili is a bit bigger than when we were filming,\" Ye Qiusuo said, watching the window slowly roll up in front of them.","Xie Xi changed his WeChat profile picture every few days, and it was always of Lili. It would be hard for Ye Qiusuo not to know.","Actually, Xie Xi had initially posted pictures of Lili on his WeChat Moments. Then he realized that Ye Qiusuo might not necessarily check Moments, so he simply used his profile picture to live broadcast Lili's status. It seemed to have worked.","\"She's grown a bit, but she still doesn't like strangers,\" Xie Xi feigned composure.","Lili was very strange. His manager, Wei Qi, always said she only looked like a ragdoll cat but actually had the personality of a feral cat.","Normally, this breed of pet cat was easy to take care of, especially affectionate and clingy, making them very lovable. But apart from acting like this towards Xie Xi, Lili was very cold to everyone else and wouldn't let anyone else pet her. He still had no idea how she was chosen by the production crew in the first place.","\"That's good.\" Ye Qiusuo glanced sideways at Xie Xi as she spoke. The neon lights outside the car window flashed by, faintly casting shadows on his face. His long eyelashes drooped slightly, and for a second, she had the illusion that Xie Xi would look over at her just like the person in the movie. \"A cat that clings to anyone doesn't really feel like your own cat.\"","Xie Xi's hand, resting by his leg, twitched slightly. This was the first time she had engaged in casual small talk.","...","No one anticipated the developments following the premiere of The Lake.","The director's initial thoughts were correct. With Xie Xi and You Feibai, plus his directing, the film's premiere box office soared straight up—a prelude to massive success. Not to mention that tickets for the following days were already fully booked. All major theaters were sold out, forcing cinema chains to temporarily add more screenings.","The main creators were already anticipating the public's reaction after the premiere.","Just half an hour after the first screening ended, trending topics were already beginning to surge.","However, the first thing to hit the hot search wasn't anyone in the movie, but a pitch-black video recorded in the theater, with only a little light from the screen in the background.","Trending Topic: The Lake Premiere Fan Argument","Clicking on it revealed a three-minute video posted by a film and television blogger. It showed Xie Xi's fans and You Feibai's fans arguing. The cause was that Xie Xi's fans, upon seeing Pei Jinxi scheme to report the opera singer, had cursed the male lead a few times. Unexpectedly, the people sitting next to them were You Feibai's fans, and so the argument broke out.","[Just came out of the movie theater. I'm not a fan of either of them, but I have to say, Pei Jinxi's actions were really a bit too much. Although he got better later on, the beginning really ruined my impression of him.]","[Went to see it, didn't finish it. I couldn't stand Pei Jinxi's behavior. Isn't this just being a condescending justice bitch? Harming others to play the hero of justice, I'm going to throw up.]","[I finished watching it, but several people in my screening left halfway through.]","[+1. People in my screening also walked out directly, and they even cursed Pei Jinxi before leaving.]","[Indeed, what Pei Jinxi did wasn't very kind. The opera singer didn't do anything heinous, and he even helped the students once before. Yet Pei Jinxi turned around and ruined him.]","[The male lead is written in the script, why curse You Feibai?]","[? Is the person above toxic? The comments are all talking about Pei Jinxi, who mentioned your idol?]","[The main thing is that Xie Xi's performance in it was absolutely stunning. When he looked over, I felt my bones go soft.]","[Hahahahaha, there were constant gasps in my screening at that moment.]","[Dragged my boyfriend to see it, and he was one of the people gasping.]","The topic in the comments below suddenly shifted and began to polarize. By the time the second screening finished and more people came out, other topics started to heat up.","The subsequent trending topics on the hot search generally met the director's expectations, though the sheer number of people cursing Pei Jinxi deviated slightly from the plan.","\"Is Pei Jinxi really a good person\", \"Xie Xi is breathtaking\", \"Xie Xi and the cat\"","Under these trending hashtags, half of the discussions centered on Pei Jinxi, while the other half focused on Xie Xi.","\"I want to know how the director came up with the idea of casting Xie Xi as the opera singer. That single upward glance of his was an invisible killer.\"","\"Especially when the cat in his arms looked over at the exact same time. I was absolutely stunned on the spot, it was just too beautiful.\"","\"That cat looks a bit familiar.\"","\"Isn't that Lili? Baby Xi posted pictures of it on Weibo before. No wonder You Feibai mentioned being on set back then.\"","By the time the audiences for the third and fourth screenings finished watching, it was already the next day. Someone even started a super topic called \"Abandon The Lake\".","It listed one hundred and eight sins committed by Pei Jinxi, immediately drawing in a large crowd.","\"When I went to see it, I thought the rumors were exaggerating, but my fists were literally clenched by the end. Pei Jinxi is the classic example of someone who will use any means necessary to get what he wants.\"","\"Once Xie Xi's scenes were over, I left. The more I watched, the angrier I got. For the sake of your own health, it is best to leave the theater early.\"","\"I am both angry and proud. Angry at Pei Jinxi, but also thinking about how amazing Baby Xi is. To have this level of skill on his first acting attempt is incredible.\"","...","Ever since returning yesterday, Xie Xi had been glued to Weibo. He did not care about how the movie was doing; he only wanted to see news related to Ye Qiusuo. Ideally, someone would edit a video of the two of them together. It was such great material, after all.","However, by the next day, not a single person had even mentioned Ye Qiusuo. All the trending attention had been monopolized by him and You Feibai.","Xie Xi had no choice but to personally take matters into his own hands and steer the narrative himself.","He went around leaving comments under the trending topics: \"Professor Ye also looks beautiful in it.\", \"Professor Ye is in The Lake!\" ...","However, he failed to make any waves. Using a burner account to comment under trending posts with tens of thousands of replies meant that hardly anyone saw his words.","Later on, Ye Qiusuo did actually make it onto the trending list, just not in the way Xie Xi would have liked.","It was because someone said that Ye Qiusuo and You Feibai were a perfect match.","\"Ahhhh! I just got back from watching The Lake. Are none of you shipping You Feibai and Professor Ye? A story about a female professor and a male student, wow! Every time Pei Jinxi obediently listens to the professor, I feel this subtle romantic tension between them. In contrast, the female lead feels a bit too weak.\"","\"Finally, someone said exactly what I was thinking! Every time the professor and Pei Jinxi face off, it feels like the very air changes. When the two of them stand together, it gives off a powerful power-couple vibe.\"","\"I hope the movie gets released on streaming platforms soon. I really want to see the master editors make videos of them!\"","Xie Xi: \"...\"","The great superstar Xie Xi was getting a little angry. Why was no one talking about him and Ye Qiusuo?!","Weren't the female professor and the male student supposed to be Professor Ye and him? Furthermore, was a professor and an opera singer not a good ship? Why was no one stepping up to talk about them?","This time, Xie Xi managed to catch the front row of the trending topic. He used his burner account to share the post and commented: \"I would much rather ship the opera singer and the professor. It would be best if it was a story where a male student falls from grace to become an opera singer, and the professor swoops in to rescue him from his fallen state.\"","The great superstar Xie even wanted to claim the identity of the student. You Feibai was nothing but a fake student in the movie; he was the real one in real life.","People started to like and reply to his comment: \"Oh, this idea actually sounds pretty thrilling too.\"","\"If you had not mentioned it, I would not have even remembered! Professor Ye and Baby Xi are the real couple! Sob, it must be because we have had so little content to feed on recently that I almost forgot about the Xie-Ye ship.\"","\"Zhang Dong, how do you get more followers?\" Xie Xi asked his assistant with a serious expression. That blogger who posted about the You Feibai and Xie Xi ship only made it to the trending list so quickly because they had a lot of followers.","\"Huh?\" Zhang Dong was momentarily stunned. \"Brother Xi, you already have so many fans. You still want more followers?\"","\"Not for my main account. I mean for an ordinary account that was only registered recently.\"","Zhang Dong pondered Xie Xi's words for a moment before replying, \"To gain followers quickly, you either have to buy them or get onto the trending list for some reason. If neither of those are options, there is one other way.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Host a giveaway.\""]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71","paragraphs":["After spending half an hour, the big star Xie Xi finally understood the various procedures of Weibo lucky draws. He decided to embark on the path of using lucky draws to attract fans.","Xie Xi logged into his alternate account and posted a lucky draw Weibo: [Follow the blogger, repost, and comment on this Weibo. In five days, twenty-two people will be randomly drawn to share two hundred and fifty thousand, and nine additional autographed photos of Xie Xi will be given away.]","This Weibo post spread at an extremely fast speed. Reposts and comments surged, and the number of followers continued to increase.","Among them, there was a group of people who specifically kept an eye on lucky draws on Weibo, trying their luck no matter whose draw it was. There was also a group of Xie Xi's fans who saw it while searching his name in real-time. These fans made up the majority. Since they mingled with other fans, the news spread from one to ten, and ten to a hundred. Soon, the number of followers on this alternate account shot up.","[I don't care about the money; I mainly want Xi Xi's autograph at the end.]","[No way, you actually have nine of Baby Xi's autographs, blogger? Do you go to every event Baby Xi attends?]","[So jealous. How many autographs do you have to be willing to give away nine?]","[Tsk, Xie Xi's autograph is nothing. If you have the ability, blogger, give away Professor Ye's autograph, otherwise you are doing a disservice to your username.]","Xie Xi's alternate account was named: My Professor Ye.","With all the reposting, five days passed. After the draw was completed, Xie Xi's alternate account had grown from a few hundred followers to one hundred and fifty thousand.","Xie Xi was not very satisfied, because the blogger who led the shipping of You Feibai and Ye Qiusuo had a full seven hundred and fifty thousand followers. What was even more infuriating was that the blogger was an insider in those small circles, knowing the fanfic authors and fanart artists, and interacting with them frequently. Since she took the lead in shipping them, even though the movie was not yet available on streaming platforms, fanfiction and couple fanart were produced one after another. They even named the ship 'Bai Qiu Yi Sheng' (A Lifetime of Bai and Qiu).","Compared to the disorganized atmosphere of shipping the Xie-Ye CP, the Bai Qiu Yi Sheng CP was booming and extremely professional.","Because he was always looking at these things, Weibo's big data algorithms recommended related content all day long. As soon as he logged in, he could see people carrying the banner of 'Bai Qiu Yi Sheng' posting on Weibo. The big star Xie got a headache from the anger.","Not even three days had passed, and Xie Xi started another lucky draw: [Follow, repost, and comment on this Weibo. In two days, twenty-two people will be drawn to randomly share two hundred and fifty thousand yuan, and randomly receive nine albums autographed by Xie Xi.]","That wasn't all. Xie Xi posted another one and pinned it to the top: [Calling for Xie-Ye fanfiction, CP videos, and fanart. Three people will be selected from the submissions to equally share nine hundred and ninety thousand yuan.]","If the previous lucky draw Weibo could attract a lot of people to follow and comment, then this last one caused an absolute uproar.","Equally sharing nine hundred and ninety thousand meant three hundred and thirty thousand yuan for each person.","The three circles were all shaken. They never expected that there would be a day when they could make money by shipping a CP.","[What kind of peerlessly rich person is this, just for shipping a CP?]","[If I had known, I would have learned video editing back then, or learned to draw, or at least practiced writing, instead of just crying and squealing over the fanworks produced by the creators. Then I would have had a chance to make money today.]","[Draw, I'll draw it out today!]","[Everyone, I'm going to write fanfic now.]","[The blogger is so rich and so thoughtful. Is ninety-nine wishing Xie and Ye to be together for a long time?]","[So... does anyone know what twenty-two and twenty-five mean? I feel like it's a bit strange that the blogger used these numbers both times.]","[Love love and love me?]","[... I know now. Twenty-two is the number of strokes in Ye Qiusuo's name, and twenty-five is the number of strokes in Xie Xi's name.]","[Holy crap! I counted, and it's actually true. Is the blogger really that dedicated?]","[Love it, love it. Following the blogger immediately. As long as you ship Xie-Ye, we are good friends.]","[I don't care about the money, I mainly just want to make friends with the blogger.]","Facts proved that no matter how many followers one had, it couldn't beat being rich.","The number of followers on Xie Xi's account easily rose to a million, surpassing the blogger who shipped Bai Qiu Yi Sheng.","As for the three circles of fanfiction, fanart, and video editing, they also began to vigorously produce Xie-Ye CP content because of Xie Xi's Weibo post. It didn't matter if they actually liked the ship or not; they mainly wanted that three hundred thousand.","Of course, there were even more people who both liked the ship and wanted to be selected.","It was said that in order to be selected, some people specially went to the cinema to watch \"Lake\" several times. Others dug into Xie Xi's alternate account and found his previous comments talking about the actor and the professor.","Videos were hard to edit since there was only so much footage. If edited poorly, it was hard to stand out. But fanfiction and fanart were different; new content could be produced anytime and anywhere.","Ever since Xie Xi successfully started consuming Xie-Ye CP fanworks, there was something new every day without repeating. Whenever he saw something he liked, he would repost it with his alternate account. More and more people came to know about the Xie-Ye CP. The once-booming Bai Qiu Yi Sheng was no longer worth mentioning, turning into a true \"Bai Qiu\" (asking in vain).","Xie Xi could finally sleep peacefully with satisfaction.","......","\"You donated three hundred thousand?\" Ye Qiusuo asked, looking at her student.","She had been too busy recently. Not only did she have her own work, but she also had to go everywhere to find suitable people to take over the mess left by those four people. She had already found three, and was only short of one, which was also the most important and difficult project.","Having just returned to the university yesterday, several teachers looked at her and said her student was interesting.","This month, the college was looking for alumni to donate money to add some new experimental equipment. As a result, one of Ye Qiusuo's students suddenly showed up and donated three hundred thousand yuan.","Compared to the tens of millions needed for experimental equipment, the money was naturally not much, but for an ordinary student, it was a considerable sum.","If Lin Lu had donated it, Ye Qiusuo wouldn't have been surprised. His family background was better than ordinary people's. But the person who donated the money was Sun Jiajia.","Sun Jiajia's eyes darted around. She had kept thirty thousand, precisely because she didn't want people to associate it with the popular lucky draw on Weibo a while ago. Now that her mentor was standing in front of her asking, Sun Jiajia couldn't hold it in: \"I... that money is from a lucky draw I won. I thought this way, Professor, you would be slightly less... angry.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned at her student. \"Money from a lucky draw is obtained through legitimate channels. You should keep it for yourself. Why would you donate it to make me not angry?\"","Sun Jiajia: How on earth was she supposed to explain that she had written fanfiction about her mentor and Xi Xi on Weibo, and was ultimately selected by that blogger, winning three hundred and thirty thousand?","Sun Jiajia's writing could only be considered passable. As soon as the nine hundred and ninety thousand was announced, even professional writers showed up. The reason she stood out among the crowd was that she included a lot of details about Ye Qiusuo. After all, it was her own mentor. Xie Xi could easily immerse himself into the story as soon as he read it, so the first person he selected was her.","After a while, Sun Jiajia couldn't bear it anymore and voluntarily confessed.","Professor Ye: \"...\"","\"I've helped you get that three hundred thousand refunded. Keep it for your own use.\" Ye Qiusuo had asked the teacher in charge of collecting the money to return Sun Jiajia's money yesterday, and filled the gap with her own money.","\"Professor, how about we use that money specifically to buy materials for our lab?\" Sun Jiajia felt uneasy using such a sudden windfall.","\"Are you sure?\"","\"I'm sure.\"","\"Alright.\"","......","After returning home, Ye Qiusuo thought for a moment. She took out her phone, opened Weibo, and found the blogger Sun Jiajia had mentioned today. She scrolled for a while and found the winning fanfiction among a few popular posts. It wasn't long, only a little over ten thousand words.","After reading it, Professor Ye had mixed feelings.","Flipping casually through the fan art again, Professor Ye stared at the two people embracing in the picture for a long time, feeling a strange complexity in her heart.","There was another popular picture depicting Xie Xi's most classic scene in \"The Lake,\" but the person standing in front of him was replaced by Ye Qiusuo.","Professor Ye paused just as she was about to exit the page, and saved the picture.","It looked very much like him.","The next day, when Ye Qiusuo arrived at the university, she was pulled aside by Professor Li.","\"Little Ye, I heard you're looking for someone recently.\"","Ye Qiusuo hadn't made a big fuss about it, but Professor Li had been in the circle for many years and had a wide network of contacts, so naturally, he had heard some news.","\"Yes, do you have someone to recommend, Professor Li?\"","Professor Li smiled, \"I actually do. A student I used to tutor. He's very strong and should meet your requirements.\"","\"A student?\" Ye Qiusuo thought back but couldn't recall anyone Professor Li had taught at the university who fit her criteria.","Professor Li coughed, \"When I was in grad school, I was his college entrance exam tutor. Even though so many years have passed, it's not an exaggeration to call him my student.\"","\"He's not from our university?\" Ye Qiusuo realized.","\"Yu Zhengkang. He's currently a professor at Western University, and he's not very easy to talk to.\" Professor Li relayed all the information he had gathered to Ye Qiusuo. \"I heard that due to internal problems with a previous project, he hasn't taken on any projects for several years and doesn't really want to. You can go and give it a try.\"","\"Thank you, Professor Li.\" Ye Qiusuo noted this down. \"I'll go check it out.\"","With the clue provided by Professor Li, Ye Qiusuo looked into Yu Zhengkang and found that he seemed tailor-made for the Celestial Sphere project. The only issue was that the last project he failed to complete—and swore never to touch again—was fundamentally similar to the Celestial Sphere.","Ye Qiusuo arranged a meeting with him. She rushed over, but after exchanging just a few words, his face darkened. He bluntly said it was impossible, leaving no room to continue the conversation.","\"Professor Yu,\" Ye Qiusuo called out to stop him. \"Is it because of people problems that you won't touch this field anymore?\"","Yu Zhengkang snorted coldly, \"I just don't want to.\"","The two parted on bad terms.","Ye Qiusuo didn't look for anyone else; she believed Professor Yu Zhengkang was the most suitable candidate.","Because of this, Ye Qiusuo went to ask Professor Li, wanting to know what had happened back then.","\"I'm not clear on the specifics either.\" Professor Li shook his head and said after a while, \"Since he rejected you, there's no hope. Find someone else as soon as possible; don't waste your time on him. This guy is incredibly stubborn. Back in his senior year of high school, his grades were a complete mess. Then he suddenly became interested in our field, hired a tutor to catch up, and wanted to get into our university. However, he ended up getting into Western University and has stayed there ever since.\"","\"Professor Yu Zhengkang... there probably isn't a more suitable candidate than him.\" Ye Qiusuo felt a bit helpless. Initially, her focus had been on researchers who had excelled in recent years. Yu Zhengkang hadn't touched the related field for almost nine years, purely dedicating himself to teaching. Now that she knew about him, she naturally couldn't let it go.","\"Anyway, I don't think you have a chance.\" Professor Li suddenly remembered some gossip. \"I heard his wife is a big director in the entertainment industry, named Zheng something. She's much more cunning than Yu Zhengkang. Back then, very few of the people who had conflicts with Yu Zhengkang ended up well.\"","Ye Qiusuo listened casually and didn't take it to heart. She wanted to keep looking for other opportunities to get him to agree.","A few days later, this opportunity fell from the sky and landed right in front of Ye Qiusuo.","\"A detective variety show?\" Ye Qiusuo looked at the person who came and instinctively refused, \"I don't have time.\"","She was indeed very short on money, but this kind of variety show wasn't like a trivia quiz show where she only needed to spare two or three hours a week; it required at least a full day.","\"Money is not an issue,\" the other party said confidently, evidently having done their research before coming.","\"I'm sorry, I...\" Ye Qiusuo suddenly looked down at the business card the person had just handed her, which read: Zheng Longju.","Professor Li's words echoed in her ears."]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72","paragraphs":["\"May I ask what your husband's name is?\" Ye Qiusuo asked the other party.","Zheng Longju was taken aback for a moment, then remembered something and smiled, \"Does Professor Ye know my husband?\"","Zheng Longju was preparing to produce a detective puzzle-solving show and was currently scouting for candidates. She had seen Ye Qiusuo's previous performance on \"Knowledge Q&A,\" and especially with the recent broadcast of \"The Lake,\" Professor Ye had been receiving a lot of attention. Therefore, she came to invite Ye Qiusuo. Firstly, she had the popularity; secondly, the combination of ordinary people and celebrities was currently trending, which would generate more topics for discussion.","When Ye Qiusuo asked, Zheng Longju remembered that her husband used to be in this field as well.","\"Professor Yu Zhengkang, who teaches at Xida?\" Ye Qiusuo asked.","\"Yes, our Old Yu should have a similar major to Professor Ye,\" Zheng Longju nodded.","Since they knew each other, Zheng Longju began to think that she could have her husband persuade Ye Qiusuo to participate in her show.","\"Director Zheng, if I participate in your show, could you help me persuade Professor Yu?\"","Zheng Longju: \"?\" Why is this reversed?","The two talked in the office for over an hour, discussing all the details, and in the end, both parties were satisfied.","...","When Zheng Longju went home that night, she specifically mentioned this matter to her husband: \"This show of mine is very important, just consider it doing me a favor.\"","Yu Zhengkang sat in the living room without saying a word, but his movements of flipping through his book grew louder.","Zheng Longju sat in front of her husband: \"Stop reading. I know you've been bored all these years. Why didn't you agree when Professor Ye sought you out before?\"","Professor Li was right; Yu Zhengkang was a stubborn person. But after so many years of not touching the field he was most interested in, his heart had long begun to waver. All he needed was an opportunity.","Yu Zhengkang flipped the pages of his book rustling loudly. When he reached the end, he put the book down and snorted in annoyance, \"I was waiting for her to come find me one more time, but look at her, she got herself roped in instead.\"","\"Good thing you didn't agree at first,\" Zheng Longju rejoiced. \"It's also because I acted fast, otherwise I wouldn't have been able to invite Professor Ye.\"","Yu Zhengkang glanced at his wife. \"Her agreeing to join your show is one thing, but don't go overboard.\"","\"Alright, I'll take it easy.\" Zheng Longju was also happy for her husband.","...","Since agreeing to Director Zheng, Ye Qiusuo felt a pang of regret for the first time. Recording this kind of show required continuously freeing up time. The work at the company was easy to handle, but the school was a bit complicated. She might have to swap classes with other teachers. In addition, she had to arrange for a few students to go on internships so they could gain experience faster.","However, once Professor Yu Zhengkang arrived at Tianqiu Technology, Ye Qiusuo's slight feeling of regret dissipated.","A major characteristic of Zheng Longju's shows was that she liked to whet the audience's appetite well before the show even started.","First, she opened an official Weibo account for \"Game Within a Maze\" and posted the first Weibo update. There were a total of six seats, and currently, three card seats were already occupied by Wan Yurou, Ye Qiusuo, and Lu Mingzhe.","Zheng Longju was the first to repost: [It is a great honor to be able to invite Professor Ye to participate in the show. Looking forward to everyone's performance later on. There are currently three seats left. Everyone can leave a comment in the comment section on who you want to see, and our production team will try our best to invite them.]","Her Weibo post was full of explosive points from beginning to end. The first half with Ye Qiusuo had already attracted a portion of people who liked Professor Ye; they had long suffered from being fans of Professor Ye but getting no content. The latter half attracted all kinds of celebrity fans. Especially second and third-tier celebrities, they absolutely wanted to be on her show. Whether it was bad publicity or good publicity, popularity was popularity.","However, the fans of those celebrities who were already popular or currently trending did not want their idols to go. After all, too many celebrities had crashed and burned on Zheng Longju's shows, especially due to editing issues, which were unavoidable.","[??? Are my eyes playing tricks on me? Is it the Professor Ye I'm thinking of?]","[Holy crap, they actually managed to invite Professor Ye. Suddenly, I don't dislike Zheng Longju as much.]","[The show is called Game Within a Maze, right? Following it first, waiting for the broadcast.]","[Still missing three people. Am I the only one who wants to see Fei Bai and Professor Ye appear on the show together? Bai-Qiu CP is just too sweet to ship. If Director Zheng Longju can invite Fei Bai over too, then I will never scold you again.]","[Is our Xie-Ye CP not standing high enough, or are there not enough lucky draws? I cast my vote for Xie Xi.]","[Voting for Baby Xi, I want to see them on the show together.]","...","Today, when Zheng Longju did her promotion, Wan Yurou, who had paid special attention to her, saw the notification and reposted it immediately. After it was sent out and she clearly saw the content, her face instantly turned ugly.","\"Why is Ye Qiusuo also participating in the show?\" Wan Yurou called to question her manager.","\"I'm not sure about this either. At the time, you were the first person Zheng Longju invited,\" the manager comforted her. \"Don't worry, I have already found out the rules of the show. You will have the upper hand when the time comes.\"","Even though her manager kept comforting her, Wan Yurou still felt uneasy. She hated Ye Qiusuo, or more accurately, she feared Ye Qiusuo to her bones.","This person seemed to be her natural nemesis; whenever they ran into each other, nothing good ever happened.","Wan Yurou stared at that Weibo post for a long time. Finally, she called that person in her phone contacts and asked them out for a meal together.","...","\"Brother Xi, Brother Xi.\" Zhang Dong called out a few times before Xie Xi, who was practicing the drum kit opposite him, stopped.","\"What is it?\"","\"Brother Xi, look at this.\" Zhang Dong showed him the Weibo post he had just scrolled past. \"Professor Ye is going on a new show.\"","Xie Xi: \"!\"","He took the phone and carefully looked at Zheng Longju's Weibo post, then said seriously, \"I want to go on this show too.\"","Xie Xi could not possibly give up such a perfectly justifiable opportunity to get in touch with her.","He just didn't expect that she would have the time to participate in this kind of show.","Xie Xi returned the phone to Zhang Dong, got up to get his own phone, and called his manager, saying that he wanted to go on this show.","\"'Game Within a Maze'? Why do you suddenly want to go on this show?\" Wei Qi felt that since before the New Year, Xie Xi had been a little different. In the past, apart from writing and releasing songs, he didn't care much about anything else.","\"...I'm tight on money.\" Xie Xi casually made up an excuse.","Wei Qi reopened Weibo and looked at the photos of the three people posted by the official account of \"Game Within a Maze\": \"Didn't the endorsement fee from a while ago just get transferred to your card? Professor Ye is also participating in this show; Zheng Longju really has the capability to invite her.\"","\"Can I go on it?\"","\"If you want to go on it, of course you can. They'll be over the moon to have you,\" Wei Qi said nonchalantly. Ever since a popular celebrity crashed and burned on a previous show, it had been very difficult for Zheng Longju's shows to invite big-name artists. Usually, only second or third-tier celebrities, or former A-listers wanting to make a comeback, would go.","\"Thank you, Sister Wei.\"","Wei Qi laughed: \"Xi Xi, if you want to make money, I'll help you take on a drama. After 'The Lake' aired last time, you have no idea how many directors came to me wanting to collaborate. It pays much more than this kind of show.\"","The remuneration for variety shows wasn't considered high; they were mainly for building popularity. Once fame increased and there was more traffic and discussion, endorsements and various acting roles would come knocking. But the key point was that Xie Xi already had these resources without needing to participate in such shows.","Xie Xi: \"...I won't take on any dramas for now. This show looks quite interesting to me.\"","Wei Qi didn't mind either. \"It seems Zheng Longju is determined to produce a hit show this time. He even managed to invite Professor Ye.\"","After hanging up the phone, Xie Xi decided to sound out Ye Qiusuo.","He knew Ye Qiusuo was always incredibly busy. He usually had to deliberate for a long time before reaching out to her, so he certainly hadn't expected her to participate in a variety show.","Xie Xi: \"Professor, I saw that you're also participating in The Enigma Game. Are you not busy lately?\"","Naturally, Ye Qiusuo didn't see the message immediately. She was still at the company, showing Professor Yu Zhengkang around to familiarize him with the environment. As he walked in, he appeared calm on the surface, but inwardly, he was marveling at the fact that Tianqiu Technology truly deserved its reputation as the most sought-after company for researchers in recent years. With so many advanced laboratories, no researcher could resist such temptation.","\"You can pick any lab on these two floors,\" Ye Qiusuo said after showing Yu Zhengkang around.","\"I'll take this one.\" Yu Zhengkang pointed to the laboratory they were currently standing in, which happened to be the one previously used by the researcher whose contract had been terminated. \"Can I start working today?\"","\"You may.\"","\"Alright, then I'll start now.\" After saying this, Yu Zhengkang glanced at Ye Qiusuo, his eyes clearly asking if she needed anything else.","\"If you have any questions, Professor Yu, you can contact me.\" Ye Qiusuo turned to leave. She didn't find Yu Zhengkang's attitude offensive; people wholly devoted to their research were often straightforward in temperament.","It was only after stepping outside that she saw Xie Xi's message.","Staring at the word 'also', Ye Qiusuo replied: \"I am busy. My schedule is currently being adjusted. Are you participating in this show as well?\"","Unlike her, Xie Xi had been practically guarding his phone. He replied instantly: \"Sister Wei is negotiating with the production team. I'll probably go.\"","Xie Xi's reply was quite reserved.","Ye Qiusuo: \"Then... see you on the show.\"","Even though it was just a standard, polite remark, the great superstar Xie was over the moon. First, he favorited the message, and then he posted a status update on his alt account: \"Today, she said 'see you' to me~\"","Ever since the previous lucky draw incident, this alt account's follower count had already hit the million mark, making it the top fan account for the Xie-Ye CP. Many people interested in the Xie-Ye CP would send their submissions to him.","Superstar Xie had now developed a new nightly hobby: reviewing his direct messages and reposting any amusing anecdotes or fan art that caught his eye.","Over time, his follower count continued to grow, and the engagement rate remained incredibly high.","It even got to the point where the blogger who originally led the Bai-Qiu CP shippers thought there was a professional PR team running this account behind the scenes.","\"She? I feel like I'm onto something. Could the blogger be a guy?\"","\"Come on, are we really assuming genders in this day and age?\"","\"I don't care! Blogger, I can say 'see you' to you every day! It's not about the money; it's about the emotional bond we share.\"","Xie Xi didn't bother reading the comments; he purely just wanted to show off.","Once things were finalized on Wei Qi's end, others in the industry caught wind of it as well. Among them, You Feibai's manager, Jiang Jingyuan, had the strongest reaction.","\"I think you should accept the offer for this show,\" Jiang Jingyuan analyzed. \"Currently, you're only active in the film and television circles. Participating in a variety show like this will not only help you maintain your relevance and buzz, but it will also give the audience a sense of freshness.\"","\"I have more than enough resources in the film industry to keep me busy.\" You Feibai carried the inherent pride of an actor and didn't want to be overexposed. However, he was also highly ambitious. He didn't just want to win awards; he wanted to make money quickly. Otherwise, he wouldn't have earned the reputation of being the industry's ultimate workaholic.","\"I've received reliable information that Xie Xi will be participating in The Enigma Game,\" Jiang Jingyuan said.","\"Xie Xi?\" You Feibai reached out to push away the makeup artist's brush. \"His manager is actually letting him participate in Zheng Longju's show?\"","Wei Qi was famous for being fiercely protective of Xie Xi.","\"Which is why I'm guessing this show is going to explode in popularity.\" Jiang Jingyuan looked at You Feibai seriously. \"Your current endorsements aren't high-end enough. You need to push for better ones.\"","Perhaps it was because You Feibai's on-screen roles left too profound an impression, but luxury brands rarely approached him for endorsements. Even though he was young, handsome, and an acclaimed Best Actor, he still couldn't compare to Xie Xi when it came to securing those top-tier resources."]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73","paragraphs":["No one ever expected that Xie Xi and You Feibai would be among the final three guests announced for The Maze.","When Zheng Longju shared the official Weibo post, the comments section completely exploded.","\"Baby Xi and Feibai? From now on, you are my Sister Zheng!\"","\"Inviting just one of them would usually require a long promotional campaign. I can't believe Zheng Longju actually got both of them. I underestimated you.\"","\"Holy crap, Sister Zheng, you're really stirring the pot! You actually invited Xie Xi and You Feibai to the same show.\"","\"Wait, why can't they record a show together? You shippers have lost your minds, insisting on shoving your ships right in front of the actual people involved.\"","With this, all six guests for The Maze were finally assembled: Xie Xi, You Feibai, Ye Qiusuo, Lu Mingzhe, Wan Yurou, and Xia Zhoubing.","In fact, even Zheng Longju herself had not expected her final lineup to be these people.","She had actually invited You Feibai right from the start, but was rejected. His manager was afraid of her editing style. Even after she promised not to maliciously edit the footage and ruin his reputation, Jiang Jingyuan only kept stalling.","Zheng Longju was mentally prepared for this. She originally just wanted to create a new show to improve her own reputation, meaning her editing could not be too outrageous anyway. She was ready for You Feibai's manager to take a wait-and-see approach.","However, Xie Xi's manager suddenly reached out to her, saying they found the show interesting and wanted to give it a try.","Zheng Longju naturally agreed. But the moment she did, You Feibai's manager could no longer sit still and also took the initiative to contact her.","This show was showing every sign of becoming a massive hit before filming even began.","...","Even before the show started recording, Xie Xi had already begun simulating the scene of their meeting in his head. One moment, he felt he should be a bit more reserved; the next, he decided it was best to provide an opportunity to feed the Xie-Ye CP shippers. He absolutely could not allow the Bai-Qiu Forever ship to rise from the ashes.","\"Brother Xi, I think there is something you absolutely have to do before going on the show,\" Zhang Dong said while playing a game in the living room.","\"Let's hear it.\" Xie Xi thought Zhang Dong was going to give him some constructive advice.","\"You need to change your phone's lock screen wallpaper. It won't look good if people see it.\"","\"...\"","Xie Xi looked down at his phone screen. On it was a piece of Xie-Ye CP fanart drawn by a talented artist. He really liked the atmosphere of the two of them leaning against each other, so he had been using it all this time. Anyway, he usually only went to the recording studio, so no one else ever saw it.","Xie Xi picked and chose but could not find a suitable replacement.","Finally, before going on the show, he custom-ordered a small leaf-shaped lock and hung it on his favorite squeaky duck. He took a picture of the two items together and set it as his new wallpaper.","Since there would be a gap between the recording and the broadcasting of the show, Zheng Longju deliberately arranged for people to wait outside and take pictures when the six guests arrived for filming, or she coordinated with two or three guests to release airport photos, all to generate buzz.","Xie Xi had been tipped off in advance. Knowing there would be cameras snapping pictures at the entrance before he went in, he very cleverly lit up his phone screen at the door as if by accident.","When these photos were posted online, he used his alt account to lead the comments: \"A leaf-shaped lock? The Xie-Ye CP will never fall.\"","\"Tsk tsk, to be able to make that connection... I have to say, our Hao Hao is truly impressive.\"","\"Hao Hao, you are surfing on 5G today. So fast.\"","Yes, because Xie Xi's username was a bit difficult to pronounce, the netizens and fans simply started calling him Tuhao, which eventually evolved into Hao Hao.","This was probably because the majority of these fans were Xie Xi's own fans. They were used to calling him Xi Xi and had developed a fondness for repeating syllables.","\"Oh my god, I am so looking forward to them doing a show together. Just thinking about it makes me too excited.\"","\"Actually, Baby Xi and Professor Ye have known each other for a long time. Who knows how close they are in private? After all, they have a teacher-student relationship. Didn't they say that when Professor Ye was doing an endorsement earlier, Baby Xi even went to visit her on set?\"","\"I am already shipping them.\"","While Xie Xi was still looking down at the comments, Ye Qiusuo came in through the door. She had originally wanted to greet him when she saw him, but she was stopped by Zheng Longju.","Xie Xi finally heard the commotion and immediately hid his phone in his pocket. He sat up straight and respectfully, watching Ye Qiusuo and Zheng Longju talk opposite him.","\"Professor Ye, I remember you don't have a Weibo account yet. Why don't you register one? When the time comes, you can interact with the production team. It'll be a good way to engage,\" Zheng Longju said politely.","\"I do have a Weibo account.\" Ye Qiusuo had browsed Weibo before. Since reading comments required registering and logging in, she had casually logged in using her WeChat account.","\"I don't mean an alt account. How about I help you register a main official account and apply for verification while we are at it?\" Zheng Longju looked a bit troubled. \"You also know that making a show is not easy. Once the show is over, you don't have to keep using this Weibo account.\"","\"I will register one myself.\" Ye Qiusuo took out her phone.","It took a little while for Ye Qiusuo to complete the verification process. She used her real name.","By this time, the other five guests had all arrived. Among them, the ones with the highest status were You Feibai and Xie Xi. As a rising star, Lu Mingzhe was not modest at all; he had recently been trending towards stardom.","On the other hand, Wan Yurou's superficial manners were flawless, and she greeted everyone smoothly.","Xie Xi glanced at her and found her somewhat familiar. However, he did not care too much because Ye Qiusuo was walking over.","\"Teacher.\" Xie Xi used this title to distinguish himself from the others.","Ye Qiusuo nodded and looked down at her phone again. After getting verified, the first Weibo post she made was a professional promotional one, congratulating the start of filming for The Maze. Following that, she followed Xie Xi's account, completely ignoring everyone else.","She had absolutely no idea how much room for imagination this action of hers would give to the Xie-Ye CP shippers later on."]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74","paragraphs":["After recording the first episode of Lost in the Game, none of the six guests, with the exception of Ye Qiusuo, looked particularly pleased.","As for Xie Xi... he was completely out of the loop. He hadn't immersed himself in the game from the very beginning; his mind was entirely occupied with how to get closer to Professor Ye during the show.","\"Today is the first time we're recording the show, so everyone please stay for dinner,\" Director Zheng Longju came out to ask the six of them to stay. \"We might use it for post-production footage.\"","The six of them had no choice but to stay. Ye Qiusuo had already mentally prepared herself for the fact that taking on this show would consume a lot of time, so she didn't resist.","Since they were recording footage, the six of them sat around a large table, maintaining a harmonious facade, with over a dozen rich dishes laid out before them.","\"Just chat casually, about anything,\" the director said from behind the cameras.","Anyone in the entertainment circle who had recorded a variety show knew a little unwritten rule: talking to artists with a bigger status than yourself made it easier to get screen time.","Wan Yurou was dressed in a rather crisp and androgynous style today, a departure from her usual gentle image. She had specially and meticulously prepared for this show.","\"Before I came, I didn't expect Brother Feibai to be here too,\" Wan Yurou was the first to speak, then she cued the other two. \"It's also not my first time working with Mingzhe and Zhoubing. Coming to this show is a kind of destiny.\"","\"I heard it was interesting, so I came over,\" You Feibai smiled politely, without the expected air of a senior. He had always been impeccable in front of the camera.","They started chatting. Xie Xi lowered his head and took a few bites with his chopsticks before losing his appetite; it wasn't really to his taste. However, the fruit pastries in a small dish tasted pretty good, probably bought from some popular bakery.","Those few people were still talking about meaningless things, idly picking at their food with their chopsticks. Xie Xi quietly pulled the dish closer to Ye Qiusuo and said, \"This tastes pretty good.\"","Ye Qiusuo glanced at Xie Xi.","For some unknown reason, he was extremely enthusiastic about sharing pastries with her.","It just so happened that Ye Qiusuo didn't have much of an appetite for the meal either, so she picked up a sweet and sour pastry. It wasn't bad.","She looked down at the email inbox on her phone. Her students had sent a few emails asking questions, and during the gaps in the meal, Ye Qiusuo replied to them one by one. Because she wasn't at home, she couldn't send the ready-made materials from her computer, so she could only tell the students where to find them first, pinpointing the exact book, page, and line.","\"Xie Xi was Mingzhe's mentor back then, so you two also share a bond,\" You Feibai, annoyed by being pestered by these people, casually shifted the topic to Xie Xi sitting opposite him.","Lu Mingzhe was somewhat different now compared to back then. Having become a star, he naturally had an indescribable aura that he lacked as an ordinary person; after all, it was piled up by capital and illuminated by starlight.","\"I'll be relying on my mentor's guidance for the rest of the show,\" Lu Mingzhe raised his wine glass to toast Xie Xi.","\"I don't know how to play either, so there's nothing to guide you on,\" Xie Xi said out of sheer boredom, resting his face on one hand, not even bothering to pick up his glass.","He hated Lu Mingzhe.","The cameras over there were still recording. Ye Qiusuo pressed the send button, looked up, picked up the wine glass next to her, and raised it in the middle. \"Since we all share a bond, let's toast together.\"","With her sentence following the previous one, Xie Xi's words were sandwiched in the middle, making his coldness seem less obvious.","Xie Xi was the second to raise his glass, and You Feibai closely followed suit.","Since the two biggest stars present had both raised their glasses, the other three naturally had to do the same, amidst laughter and cheerful banter.","Ye Qiusuo just wet her lips and didn't drink. While they were talking, she went back to replying to messages from her company.","Wan Yurou watched her actions and sneered inwardly. They were told they were recording footage, yet this person was actually playing on her phone in broad daylight. Neither Xie Xi nor You Feibai was as audacious as her.","\"I watched Lake a while ago and really loved it. Since the four of you are all here, could you sign your names for me?\" Xia Zhoubing said, asking the staff for pen and paper, acting exactly like a fan.","Xia Zhoubing's career had been stagnant lately, making him much more cautious with his words, and he didn't leave Ye Qiusuo out of the autographs.","The piece of paper was passed from You Feibai, who was closest to Xia Zhoubing, then to Wan Yurou, through Lu Mingzhe's hands, and finally to Ye Qiusuo.","She picked up the pen, signed her name, and passed it to Xie Xi.","Xie Xi stared at the name Ye Qiusuo on the paper for a moment, then wrote down his own name.","It was in cursive script, not his previous artistic signature.","Finally, it returned to Xia Zhoubing's hands. He originally intended to show off his fan persona in front of the camera, looking at the signatures, but he was stunned when he saw Xie Xi's signature. \"Why did Brother Xie change his signature?\" It looked so similar to Ye Qiusuo's handwriting just before it. If he hadn't watched them write it separately, he would have thought it was written by the same person.","Xie Xi suddenly felt that Xia Zhoubing looked somewhat pleasing to the eye. He acted as if nothing had happened and said, \"After I could read clearly, I practiced with the teacher's copybook for a while.\"","In fact, he hadn't missed a single day until now, taking special time out every day to practice his handwriting.","\"No wonder they look so similar,\" Xia Zhoubing chuckled a few times, his eyes darting between Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo.","Because of the casual chat, the topic slowly opened up a bit. After Ye Qiusuo finished sending her messages, she put her phone away and listened to them talk, though she was mostly uninterested.","They had already started chatting about netizens' misunderstandings about them and the hardships of contemporary artists.","Beside her, Xie Xi was probably quite bored too. He had put down his chopsticks and was tugging at the tassels of the tablecloth, braiding them into a four-strand braid.","Professor Ye watched his long, clean fingers nimbly winding around the tassels, and ended up staring for quite a while.","The meal remained fairly peaceful until it was over.","\"Teacher, do you want to take my car back?\" After coming out, Xie Xi called out to Ye Qiusuo. \"You drank some wine just now, and you don't have an assistant with you.\"","Zhang Dong followed beside him and nodded, \"Professor Ye, please take our car back.\"","Ye Qiusuo wanted to say that she had only wet her lips and hadn't drank at all, but Xie Xi had already opened the car door and was standing outside waiting for her to get in.","\"...\"","In the end, Professor Ye still took his car back.","The next day, Wei Qi specifically came over to ask Xie Xi how the recording went.","Wei Qi said, \"This show is considered a domestic original. Do you think the setup of the show's segments is interesting?\"","A momentary blankness flashed across Xie Xi's eyes, and then he nodded, \"It's quite interesting.\"","After all, having managed Xie Xi for many years, seeing his expression, Wei Qi was a bit suspicious of his words. \"Is it?\"","\"...Yeah, it's pretty fun.\" Throughout the whole process, he hadn't used his brain at all, only thinking about how to get a little closer to Ye Qiusuo.","...","The day before the show aired, which was also when they finished recording the second episode, the official Weibo account released a short cut. It was exactly the scene of the six of them sitting together eating.","It was two minutes in total. The first minute was Wan Yurou responding to rumors, and the second minute was the others talking. In the final short segment, Lu Mingzhe told Xie Xi to give him guidance in the future shows, and Xie Xi replied that there was nothing to guide him on.","Originally, this rather awkward remark had been dissipated by Ye Qiusuo's interruption to raise her glass. However, unexpectedly, the production team had edited out the conversation between Lu Mingzhe and Xie Xi separately and put it in this two-minute cut, which was immediately magnified infinitely by netizens.","[Um, Xie Xi really gives no face when he speaks.]","[This isn't his first or second time, right? Relying on his popularity, he always shoots his mouth off to suppress newcomers.]","[To be fair, who can blame him when he has the skills? Highly capable people don't have the time to care about what others are thinking.]","[That's completely unnecessary. You Feibai is a Best Actor, yet he remains humble.]","...","After these negative comments surfaced, Wei Qi, uncharacteristically, made no move.","Because Zheng Longju's team had already shown her the sample footage scheduled for release tomorrow, Wei Qi knew exactly what to expect. She had watched the entire first episode with a twitching mouth, wondering how Xie Xi had the nerve to claim earlier that the show was interesting.","\"Wei Qi is actually letting those online comments fester.\" Jiang Jingyuan looked at You Feibai. \"When you guys were recording the show, did Xie Xi perform well?\"","You Feibai thought carefully: \"...I don't know what your definition of 'well' is.\"","\"I'll go to Director Zheng later to ask for the sample footage.\" When Jiang Jingyuan was negotiating the contract with the program team, it was agreed that he could review the sample footage, specifically to check if they were using the same malicious editing as in their previous shows.","By the time the first episode aired, quite a few casual haters were already itching to jump in and flame Xie Xi.","There was no deep reason for it. Xie Xi's kind of gaffe was simply great at drawing netizens' attention, and bashing him would always make them feel a sense of satisfaction.","So even this kind of person makes mistakes—some people harbored this exact mentality.","The show began. The six cast members took turns drawing cards that detailed their roles and missions for this episode. One of them was the villain, and everyone had to keep their identities a secret. After checking their cards, they placed them back into the box and proceeded down a passageway.","The setting for the six of them this episode was a cabin in the woods. They walked through a pitch-black tunnel, passed through a forest, and entered the only cabin in the woods. Inside, the air conditioning was blasting realistically to simulate winter.","[At least let us see what roles they all got.]","[Am I the only one who thinks they're so pleasing to the eyes?]","[Yurou looks so handsome today, completely different from before.]","[She's so brave, actually taking the lead and walking in front. Sister, I'm yours!]","The six of them entered the woodland cabin. It wasn't large and could be taken in at a single glance. On the left was a wooden bookshelf, along with some hunting gear and a fake deer head. Right in the middle was a fireplace.","Wan Yurou walked closer for a look: \"It's fake.\"","It was made of an electronic screen.","\"Try to see if it can be lit,\" You Feibai said from behind.","The temperature in here was too low.","The group immediately started searching the surroundings. Wan Yurou was the first to find a candle-shaped metal ornament. She rummaged around the fireplace and, sure enough, discovered a mechanism that perfectly fit the metal candle.","Once inserted, the fireplace lit up. Realistic flames began to burn, the blasts of cold air in the room stopped, and the temperature slowly began to rise.","[Wan Yurou isn't bad, finding her rhythm so quickly.]","[What is Xie Xi doing?]","On the show, while Ye Qiusuo casually picked up a book from the table to flip through, Xie Xi was toying with a marker he found on the desk. The deer head happened to be nearby, so relying on his tall stature, he leaned in close to its face.","[Damn, a visual critical hit!]","The deer head's eyes were actually two of the show's hidden cameras.","[Although Xie Xi's character isn't great, his face is quite something.]","[Baby Xi, you goofball. Anyone who watches movies or TV shows knows it's best not to get close to animal heads like this; there's bound to be something sketchy going on.]","After Xie Xi finished examining the deer head, his fingers got itchy, and he started using the marker to black out the deer's eyes.","The audience, slowly realizing the camera lens was turning pitch black: \"...\"","Fortunately, there was more than one camera in the cabin. The program team had already cut to another angle, clearly showing Xie Xi's back as he began coloring in the other deer eye.","\"Xie Xi, what are you doing?\" Professor Ye, having finished reading her book, voiced the audience's inner thoughts.","Xie Xi, who was coloring vigorously, turned around with a blank expression: \"...I just thought its eyes didn't look very nice.\"","He was a bit dissatisfied with the black marker in his hand; it was too monotonous and limited his artistic expression.","Ye Qiusuo: \"Come back and sit down. Don't touch those things.\"","\"Oh.\"","Xie Xi put the marker back in its original place and sat down on the carpet, no longer moving. After a while, he reached out to feel the rug, then softly called Ye Qiusuo over to sit with him: \"It's warm here.\"","He wasn't the only one who noticed this. Lu Mingzhe, who walked over later, also realized it and called everyone to sit down together.","[Tsk, the contrast in character is obvious.]","[One only cares about himself, while the other knows to share information with everyone else. Honestly, a certain singer really isn't cutting it.]","After all six of them sat down, Xia Zhoubing touched his throat: \"I'm a bit thirsty.\"","Wan Yurou looked around: \"I remember seeing... water over there.\"","Saying that, she got up, went to a corner, and picked up a kettle. She opened it to take a look and asked the group: \"Should we boil it?\"","\"We don't know if the water is clean, so it's better to boil it,\" Lu Mingzhe quickly added.","Wan Yurou placed the kettle on the gas stove to boil, and the group began discussing their thoughts on the cabin.","\"There are books, so the owner must be cultured. Hunting might be a hobby. This cabin should be a place where someone from the city comes to stay on a regular basis,\" Xia Zhoubing analyzed.","\"I roughly flipped through those books. They are basically all about how to cultivate flowers and trees. The owner should be someone who loves nature,\" Wan Yurou said, pointing at the bookshelf.","The water boiled quickly. A few minutes later, the kettle started whistling. Wan Yurou turned off the heat and asked Lu Mingzhe to help bring the cups over. She sterilized each metal cup with hot water, poured six cups of water, and brought them over on a tray.","The room's temperature hadn't fully risen yet, so the allure of a hot cup of water was clearly strong. You Feibai was the first to take one, followed by Xia Zhoubing and Ye Qiusuo. After Lu Mingzhe and Xie Xi took theirs, Wan Yurou took the last one.","[Yurou is seriously so gentle. She does things at a steady pace, which is so soothing to watch.]","[Suddenly feeling the chemistry between Lu Mingzhe and Wan Yurou with that water-serving interaction.]","\"Xia Zhoubing, out!\"","A voice suddenly rang out in the cabin.","[???]","[What sound?]","Not only the audience, but even Xia Zhoubing and the others were confused.","But the broadcast continued: \"Will the eliminated player please take the initiative to walk out of the cabin and follow the path out.\"","Xia Zhoubing: \"What's going on? How am I out?\"","\"Eliminated players may no longer speak,\" the program team's voice continued.","Looking incredibly frustrated, Xia Zhoubing left the cabin.","\"Someone in the room poisoned Xia Zhoubing's water, resulting in his elimination. Right now, there is a killer among the five of you.\" The broadcast continued, \"Among you is a Judge who can sentence the killer to death. However, if they guess wrong, the killer can immediately kill the Judge, and the villain faction wins this round. We look forward to the Detective discovering the killer first.\"","The five of them listened carefully. Afterwards, You Feibai spoke up: \"A Killer, a Judge, a Detective. The rest should be Civilians.\"","It was a game similar to Werewolf.","\"The ones who had the opportunity to poison the water just now are me, Brother Feibai, and... Professor Ye,\" Wan Yurou took the initiative to deduce. \"Even though Mingzhe handled the cups, I had already sterilized them.\""]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75","paragraphs":["[No way, where did the poison come from? Didn't they come in empty-handed?]","[The vibe changed too fast, I didn't even have time to react.]","[The person who had the longest contact with the kettle and cups is Wan Yurou. I think she's the killer.]","[Would the killer point out that they are a suspect themselves?]","[Even if she didn't say anything, she would still be the biggest suspect. Bringing it up herself is the best way to reduce suspicion.]","The remaining people began to explain what they had been doing since entering the house. Xie Xi was still holding his hot water, taking slow sips, occasionally glancing at Professor Ye next to him from the corner of his eye.","\"I was by the fireplace the whole time. Professor Ye, what were you looking at by the table?\" You Feibai asked.","\"A book, a book about flower fertilizer.\" Ye Qiusuo looked toward the table. \"It should be what the previous owner was reading before they left.\"","\"Xia Zhoubing was poisoned to death...\" Lu Mingzhe looked at Ye Qiusuo. \"A book on flower fertilizer should mention chemicals, right?\"","\"Flower fertilizer mostly consists of trace elements, it can't kill a person.\" Ye Qiusuo suddenly smiled, carrying an inexplicable undertone.","The group sat for a while before they had no choice but to get up again and see what else they could find in the cabin.","But compared to when they first entered, the atmosphere was noticeably stiffer. No one knew when the killer would strike next.","Xie Xi followed Ye Qiusuo at a moderate distance. Then, an old-fashioned phonograph in the corner caught his eye. He searched around and found a vinyl record on the bookshelf.","While everyone was warily examining the various furnishings in the room, on guard against the killer, classical music suddenly echoed through the house.","The group was startled and turned around to look: \"...\"","Xie Xi was still looking at the record's packaging, wondering how many tracks were on it. When he looked up, everyone was staring at him. \"What's wrong?\"","\"Could you turn this off first? Everyone is really tense right now,\" Wan Yurou smiled politely.","\"Listening to music when you're tense helps you relax,\" Xie Xi said earnestly.","[Hahahaha, what a massive silly moment.]","[Could Xixi be any sillier?]","The house was really not that big. Standing near Ye Qiusuo was Wan Yurou, who had already checked most of the area. The distance between the two was getting closer and closer.","Although the house had everything it needed, most of the furnishings had a rough, rustic style. The beautiful crystal ball on the fourth shelf of the bookcase looked increasingly bizarre the more one looked at it; it completely clashed with the style of the place.","Ye Qiusuo tilted her head back to look at it for a moment, then continued walking forward.","However, Wan Yurou noticed what Ye Qiusuo was looking at and immediately said, \"I think this crystal ball is a bit strange.\"","\"How so?\" Lu Mingzhe walked over.","\"Don't you guys think this crystal ball is completely out of place with the rest of the things in the house?\" Wan Yurou said quite seriously, though she felt a bit smug inside.","Playing games naturally required a quick mind. It seemed that Ye Qiusuo was completely clueless about this sort of thing.","Hearing Wan Yurou's words, Lu Mingzhe stepped forward to grab the crystal ball.","Just as he got his hands on it, before Lu Mingzhe even had time to take a close look at the crystal ball, the broadcast voice sounded again:","\"Lu Mingzhe is out.\"","Lu Mingzhe: \"...\" He finally understood how Xia Zhoubing felt earlier.","[What's going on? Another one is gone.]","[There's something wrong with Wan Yurou, right? She was the most likely person to have poisoned the water earlier, and now she's the one who pointed out the strange crystal ball, resulting in Lu Mingzhe getting out.]","[I don't think that's likely, it's too obvious. We still don't know who the judge is, it would be too risky.]","\"Does the judge wish to exercise their power to point out the killer? You will have three seconds to consider. In addition, the detective has the right to ask everyone present one question.\"","After hearing the broadcast, the quick-witted viewers had pretty much figured out the roles of the remaining four people.","[Among the four people, there must be at least a killer and a judge, otherwise the game would already be over. Add a detective, and the last one is a civilian?]","[Not necessarily. If you listen closely to the broadcast, you'll notice they never specified the number of killers. There might even be two killers.]","[True, from beginning to end they only said the word 'killer' without any quantifiers in front of it.]","None of the four people present spoke. If one looked closely at their micro-expressions, they would find that only Wan Yurou had the most complex expression. You Feibai seemed to be pondering something, Ye Qiusuo was as calm as ever, and Xie Xi was spacing out.","\"Is this crystal ball poisoned too?\" Wan Yurou's face looked a bit pale; she hadn't expected this at all.","\"Be careful, don't just touch things around here randomly anymore,\" You Feibai warned.","\"There must be a special trigger mechanism here. Xie Xi touched so many things earlier and was fine, but Mingzhe got out just by touching the crystal ball.\" Wan Yurou's mind worked quickly. \"It's best not to touch anything that seems out of place.\"","With a killer on the loose and special trigger items around, the situation for the four of them was far from good.","At that moment, the lights flickered, clearly due to unstable voltage.","Wan Yurou walked over to the desk and pulled open a drawer. There wasn't much inside, just a small knife and some matches. She slipped the knife into her sleeve, closed the drawer again, and walked to the next spot as if nothing had happened.","[Holy crap, I knew Wan Yurou was the killer, she actually hid the knife.]","[There are still three other people. With the way she's acting, if one more person gets out, the other two will definitely suspect her. As long as the one who dies isn't the judge, the villains are bound to lose.]","[She's too good at acting. Just a moment ago, I thought it was too obvious to be her.]","[Turns out I was only thinking on the second level, while Wan Yurou is already on the third level.]","Ye Qiusuo casually pulled a book from the shelf. Finding the light too dim as she flipped through it, she turned on the floor lamp nearby. She read a few pages and then put the book back.","\"It seems like there's nothing left to look at.\" You Feibai had a vague idea forming in his mind, but it hadn't fully taken shape yet, and he didn't know what it was.","\"Since we're inside the house, we're bound to find clues related to the owner. He likes planting flowers and hunting. Aside from these...\" Professor Ye finally began her analysis. \"What is the thing he does most often in this house?\"","You Feibai scanned the surroundings. The simple gas stove could be used for cooking and boiling water. The rug was close to the fireplace, making it great for warming up, but not suitable for reading.","A chair.","Earlier, before Ye Qiusuo turned on the floor lamp, the corner opposite the window was too dark to see clearly. Now, he could faintly make out the traces of dust on the floor.","You Feibai stepped forward and finally saw it clearly: it was the outline of a chair. So, where was the chair?","He proceeded to turn on all the lights in the house. It was then that a folding wooden chair leaning behind the door was discovered.","Just as You Feibai pulled the chair out and bent down to unfold it, he accidentally caught a glimpse of several cups in the trash can. They were made of wood.","In that instant, he seemed to understand something.","\"You Feibai is out.\"","The exact moment the broadcast spoke, the power in the cabin went out, plunging it into sudden darkness.","[Holy crap, that scared me! How is another person out?]","[Is it just going to stay pitch black like this? Won't it be easier for the killer to strike?]","[Why can't I see them anymore?]","In the darkness, You Feibai was escorted off the scene by the staff.","It was so dark that Xie Xi's immediate reaction was to stumble toward where he remembered Ye Qiusuo was standing.","At the same time, Wan Yurou's first reaction was to turn around and pull open the desk drawer. She took out the matches inside and struck one: \"I...\"","\"Wan Yurou is out.\"","Wan Yurou: \"...\" What the heck.","[I am a bit confused.]","[So there are a lot of things here that cannot be touched casually, right?]","[Wait, they are getting out one by one, but the game is not over yet.]","[The Judge and the Killer are still here.]","[I think it is Xie Xi. He has been touching and bumping into things everywhere, and he is completely fine. He reasonably avoided all the dangerous items.]","Since Wan Yurou was out, the match naturally went out.","Ye Qiusuo, relying on her memory, walked to the desk, relit the match, and a faint light lit up.","Xie Xi blinked, his brain finally clicking into gear: \"You are the Killer.\"","So what if she is the Killer? What is with that joyful tone of yours?","\"Ye Qiusuo is out, the Judge wins.\"","[I am totally confused watching this, but what is the deal with Xie Xi? Is he playing dumb to catch everyone off guard?]","[Huh? That is it? Am I the only one looking completely lost?]","[Plus one, I have no idea how any of this happened.]","In the elimination room, the four people stood together.","You Feibai had already figured out how they were eliminated: \"It is the mutual restraint of the Five Elements. The production team told us who the Killer was from the very beginning, but none of us noticed.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Xia Zhoubing asked, voicing the thoughts of all the viewers in front of their screens.","\"When we drew the mission cards, everyone's card was a different color. Mine was yellow, representing Earth.\"","\"Mine was green, so that is... Wood?\" Xia Zhoubing realized.","You Feibai nodded: \"Red is Fire, gold is Metal, and white is Water.\"","Wan Yurou, who had come in later, suddenly understood: \"The Killer is Ye Qiusuo; she drew the gray card.\"","At this moment, the broadcast sounded, announcing that the righteous faction had actually won.","Everyone gathered again and took back their mission cards. The camera cut to each of them in turn.","The mission of the Civilian role was to protect themselves. Xia Zhoubing, Wan Yurou, and Lu Mingzhe were all Civilians, while You Feibai's role was the Detective, responsible for finding the Killer.","The Judge was Xie Xi. His mission was to hide himself well and point out the Killer when necessary.","Finally, Ye Qiusuo received the Killer card. It stated that the Killer had to make these people willingly get themselves killed.","With the mutual restraint of the Five Elements, as long as they proactively took the items that countered their own element, her mission would be considered a success.","But Ye Qiusuo lost at the hands of Xie Xi.","Next, the viewers saw the details in a replay.","The winding path they walked at the beginning was actually in the shape of a Bagua array. The group walked through it in a daze, and their heads were still spinning when they entered the cabin. Wan Yurou entered first, and Ye Qiusuo fell to the back. The small kitchenette was to the side of the door, but everyone's attention was immediately drawn to the deer head at first glance.","Ye Qiusuo had already begun to act.","There was a tray of cups on the kitchen counter, made of metal and wood. Ye Qiusuo silently took out the wooden cups, threw them into the trash can, and then seamlessly kicked the trash can into the shadows.","After that, every time she looked or spoke, it carried a heavy misdirection.","The only reason Wan Yurou found the crystal ball was because Ye Qiusuo had stared at the fourth shelf of the bookcase for a long time. Even You Feibai invisibly harbored trust in Ye Qiusuo's words.","The matches were originally on the tabletop. When Ye Qiusuo was flipping through the book, she deliberately put the matches into the drawer. She had practically anticipated Wan Yurou's actions.","Because she noticed the unstable voltage, she deliberately increased the use of electrical appliances, waiting for a power outage. This led Wan Yurou to proactively grab the matches, just as she had earlier lured You Feibai into looking for a chair.","[I feel like everyone was influenced by Professor Ye's aura outside the show, so they did not fully get into character and trusted her too much.]","[Professor Ye's traps are absolutely foolproof. She is too ruthless.]","[Seriously, let alone the roles, just talking about personalities: You Feibai is good at observation and analysis, so she dropped a bait and he willingly took it. As for the others, she did not even need to scheme against them.]","[But for such a calculating Professor Ye to lose so quickly in the end... Baby Xi is still the most amazing.]","[Hmm... why do I feel like Professor Ye did not factor Xie Xi into her plans from start to finish?]","[Right, since she used a chain of schemes to trap You Feibai and Wan Yurou, why did she not add Xie Xi in, especially since Xie Xi likes to touch and bump into things everywhere.]","[Maybe Professor Ye thought Xie Xi was just a Civilian.]","[But there is no evidence to prove who the Judge is, so leaving Xie Xi would only be a hidden danger. I do not believe Professor Ye would not know this risk.]","[Maybe Xie Xi was just acting to hide himself.]","Then, in the very next second, the viewers watched the camera cut to Xie Xi. He still had a blank look on his face, completely out of the loop.","\"Why did you lose?\" Xie Xi quietly asked Ye Qiusuo beside him, but the sneaky production team amplified the audio during editing, so all the viewers could hear it."]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo turned her head to look at him and said lightly, \"The judge pointed out the killer, so the good guys won.\"","\"Oh,\" Xie Xi replied on the surface, but one glance was enough to tell he still hadn't understood.","[Don't tell me the game is over and Xie Xi still doesn't know the rules? No way, no way.]","[Is this what they call coasting to victory?]","[I seriously suspect Professor Ye was going easy on him.]","[Suddenly worried about Baby Xi's future episodes. If he draws the killer card, will his first move be to expose himself?]","[So this is the charm of a sweet and innocent fool, I'm loving it.]","The game ended much faster than the production team had anticipated, so they included a lot of footage from the meal. After watching for a while, the audience saw Lu Mingzhe saying he wanted to ask Xie Xi for advice, which was the exact short, highly controversial conversation previously released by the official Weibo account.","[??? Forgive me, but I actually think Xie Xi is right. What can he teach? The art of coasting to victory as a salted fish? Hahahaha!]","[Dying of laughter. Shouldn't he be asking Professor Ye for advice? No matter who he asks, it shouldn't be Xie Xi.]","[After all, Xie Xi and You Feibai are big stars, while Professor Ye isn't in the entertainment industry.]","[After reading the previous comments, I feel like Lu Mingzhe's words sounded a bit weird.]","[Don't you guys feel like none of them even mentioned Professor Ye? This circle is a bit snobbish.]","[Heh, your Professor Ye was buried in her phone. How were the others supposed to talk to her?]","The production team didn't blur the phone in Ye Qiusuo's hands. When the camera occasionally zoomed in, if netizens slowed down the playback speed and had sharp eyes, they could vaguely see a bit of the screen interface.","[Professor Ye seems to be replying to emails.]","[It's probably an academic matter. I usually contact my advisor via email too. Advisors don't really use other apps; email is very convenient for them.]","[Actually, I can't quite figure out why Professor Ye came to participate in this show. Shouldn't she be focusing on her academic research?]","[Probably short on money, hahahaha.]","[What is Baby Xi doing?]","Originally, those few people were chatting about industry matters, some scandals and rumors, which was a good opportunity to explain things while they had the spotlight. However, many people ended up being captivated by Xie Xi's nimble braiding skills.","Wan Yurou and the others were still talking, while Xie Xi leaned halfway back in his chair, tugging at the tassels of the tablecloth underneath the table, having the time of his life.","[Hahahaha, Xixi has great skills! It's actually a four-strand braid, I'm a girl and even I don't know how to do that.]","[Even Professor Ye beside him was intrigued.]","[Holy crap, it's true! Professor Ye has been staring at Baby Xi for a long time.]","[Everyone, I suddenly feel like I'm shipping something.]","[If I edit a video right now, is there still a reward? Will Hao Hao still give out money?]","...","After the first episode of Lost in the Game aired, the previous smear campaigns against Xie Xi were naturally overturned.","Professor Ye suffers a crushing defeat at the hands of Salted Fish Xie; Someone please carefully explain the game rules to Xie Xi; Professor Ye is strong","Clicking into these trending topics, they were filled with sheer amusement. Netizens were shocked by Xie Xi's effortless, salted-fish-style victory, but at the same time, they couldn't help but put themselves in his shoes and feel a sense of satisfaction.","After all, most people didn't possess astonishing analytical skills. Who could possibly outplay Professor Ye?","It had to be said, sometimes working diligently to record a show wasn't as effective at drawing fans as someone else just being a salted fish. This was probably what they called audience appeal.","Half of the trending topics for the first episode were taken up by Xie Xi.","The braids Xie Xi made","[Am I the only one who thinks Xie Xi's braiding is pretty good? With such skilled techniques, he must have practiced a lot at home.]","[Right? Even Professor Ye was captivated by his exquisite craftsmanship, staring intently without blinking.]","[Here comes the question: how did he hone this skill?]","[I want Xie Xi to braid my hair.]","[The person above can keep dreaming, Baby Xi is already braiding my hair in bed.]","[Excuse me, sister, step aside, Xixi is in my arms.]","...","Xie Xi scrolled through these comments, feeling very disappointed in these people's professional capabilities.","An hour-and-a-half-long episode had already finished airing two or three hours ago, yet no one had started editing footage of them together.","It would be one thing if videos took a long time to make, but why hadn't anyone even posted many screenshots?","After waiting a bit longer, Xie Xi only managed to refresh and find one or two screenshots posted on Weibo.","Finally, the great superstar Xie decided to take matters into his own hands.","He personally took screenshots of all the scenes in the show where the two of them were close to each other, sometimes standing together and talking, and then posted them using his alt account: [Lost in the Game is pretty good. Image.jpg]","His short sentence looked exactly like a fan recommendation, but the more than thirty photos that followed didn't look like a normal recommendation at all.","The comments below instantly filled with Hahahaha.","[Hao Hao, there's no need, there's really no need.]","[Hao Hao, I made a GIF.]","It was a GIF of Ye Qiusuo watching Xie Xi braid the tassels. There were only the two of them in it; the others had been cropped out.","Although his intentions had already been seen through by them, Xie Xi's alt account post attracted a lot of photos and GIFs. He kept an eye on the comments, saving any pictures he liked.","Over here, while he was still enthusiastically saving photos, Professor Ye suddenly called, startling Xie Xi.","He hurriedly answered the phone in a flurry: \"Teacher?\"","\"Mhm, the dividends were just transferred to your card. Also, the extra portion is to pay you back.\" Ye Qiusuo recently had funds returned from a project, which she conveniently used to repay him.","Because it was the first time, she specially called to let him know.","\"Do you... have enough money?\" Xie Xi asked hesitantly.","Standing in front of the floor-to-ceiling windows of her office, looking at the heavy traffic below, Ye Qiusuo suddenly let out a silent chuckle: \"It's enough.\"","\"Oh, then I'll hang up.\" Xie Xi wanted to talk to her a bit more, but remembering how busy she was, to the point of reading messages even while sitting in a car, he decided not to disturb her too much.","After hanging up the phone, Xie Xi checked his text messages. Sure enough, there was a bank notification about a change in his balance. He had been so focused on saving photos earlier that he hadn't noticed.","...","\"President Ye, about tonight's dinner... are you still going?\" Zhao Guiyin knocked on the door and came in to ask.","\"I'm going.\" Ye Qiusuo retracted the faint smile in her eyes, turning back into her usual calm self.","Lu Minglang had invited her to dinner a few days ago. Ye Qiusuo hadn't refused, nor had she agreed.","The Lu Group and Celestial Sphere Technology had completely torn off all pretenses. After all, several important researchers from Celestial Sphere had been poached by them, and coupled with the personnel changes in the Lu Group recently, it was obvious they were moving into this field.","Quite a few people were watching to see a good show.","Upon arriving at the restaurant, Lu Minglang stood up and pulled out a chair for her: \"I thought President Ye wouldn't come.\"","Ye Qiusuo: \"What do you want to talk about?\"","\"You're always so direct,\" Lu Minglang said with some distress after sitting down.","He was handsome, and making such an expression actually made him look more lively and humane.","\"I heard that Professor Ye has already found a suitable person to take over the project. I hope things go smoothly for both of us.\" Lu Minglang poured two glasses of red wine, raising his to clink glasses with Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo wasn't surprised at all that Lu Minglang knew Celestial Sphere had found a suitable person. She twirled the stem of her glass, then raised it to lightly tap against his: \"Thank you for your kind words, President Lu.\"","A hint of surprise flashed through Lu Minglang's eyes: \"...President Ye seems a bit different.\"","\"Technological advancement benefits all of humanity. As for who develops it first, that is not so important.\" Ye Qiusuo gave a faint smile, delivering the same diplomatic platitudes.","Lu Minglang, however, felt a sudden jolt of apprehension. He suddenly found himself unable to read her.","...","With the recent massive popularity of the drama Enigma, Ye Qiusuo had once again been thrust into the spotlight. While they were having dinner together, paparazzi snapped photos of the two sharing a smile as they clinked their glasses."]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77","paragraphs":["Entertainment news always followed the latest trends. The hit broadcast of Bureau of Mysteries brought Ye Qiusuo back into the public eye, and any news about her naturally attracted the audience's attention.","It was quite a coincidence.","The person who snapped the photos of Ye Qiusuo and Lu Minglang was an up-and-coming paparazzo. He had just staked out and captured photos of an A-list celebrity's extramarital affair, and he had come to this restaurant today because the other party wanted to pay to buy his silence. After receiving the money, the paparazzo didn't leave. The meal had already been paid for, so it would be a shame not to eat it.","As a result, he witnessed this scene. He immediately picked up his camera, snapped a few shots, and slipped out before anyone noticed. He then turned around and sent these photos to various marketing account companies, earning himself another sum of money.","The marketing accounts were just worrying about the lack of interesting news lately. Upon receiving the photos, they couldn't wait to post them to hit their KPIs.","Professor Ye Dining with a Man Late at Night","It immediately skyrocketed up the trending topics list.","Wan Yurou was originally looking at her own trending topic, but when she backed out to look, Ye Qiusuo's trending topic was suddenly ahead of hers.","\"What kind of news is this to deserve being on the trending list? She's just an ordinary person,\" Wan Yurou thought resentfully.","Clicking into it, she couldn't help but freeze. The person sitting opposite Ye Qiusuo was Lu Minglang.","This was someone she couldn't even curry favor with, no matter how hard she tried.","She wasn't the only one who recognized him. As the topic climbed higher on the trending list and more people saw it, others also recognized who Lu Minglang was.","[The person sitting opposite her looks a bit familiar.]","[He's so handsome! Is he a new celebrity?]","[He's not a celebrity, he's the head of the Lu Group. Didn't he attend the Tianqiu Technology press conference a while ago? He was sitting right next to Professor Ye.]","[Tsk tsk, a candlelight dinner, and he even specifically went to support her at the press conference, so...]","[Are they a couple? Then is the Xie-Ye ship... going to sink?]","[It's just a meal, I don't believe it!]","[It doesn't really feel like a romantic relationship; it looks more like a business discussion between two equally matched opponents.]","...","Regardless, the photos of Ye Qiusuo and Lu Minglang were already circulating wildly on the internet.","Lu Minglang's side found out quickly enough, and someone asked him if he wanted to suppress the news.","Lu Minglang raised an eyebrow: \"We did indeed have a meal together.\"","As for Professor Ye, she didn't have time to check Weibo; she went straight to work as soon as she had a free moment.","...","\"What's wrong?\" When Xie Xi woke up, he found Zhang Dong looking extremely solemn.","\"Brother Xi, there's something you should know, but please don't be too sad,\" Zhang Dong let out a long sigh, speaking with some hesitation.","\"What is it?\" Xie Xi pulled out a chair, getting ready to eat breakfast.","Zhang Dong looked up at the ceiling and mumbled something vaguely and extremely fast: \"!\"","Xie Xi, biting into a piece of toast spread with strawberry jam, turned his head: \"Speak clearly.\"","\"...Professor Ye has a boyfriend.\"","\"...\" Xie Xi hadn't even finished biting off his mouthful of toast. He stared at Zhang Dong, suddenly freezing in place.","Zhang Dong: \"It seems like it, haha... It's not confirmed yet, Brother Xi. This is definitely a rumor.\"","Xie Xi slowly placed the toast back onto his plate: \"Where did you hear this?\"","\"Just, late last night, this suddenly popped up on the Weibo trending list, and it's still up there now,\" Zhang Dong muttered.","Big Star Xie felt his heart almost stop. With a stiff hand, he reached for his phone and opened Weibo. Sure enough, it was still hanging on the trending list.","Clicking on the hashtag, several photos popped up all at once. They were all pictures of Ye Qiusuo and Lu Minglang.","Smack—","Xie Xi slammed the phone face down on the table: \"It's just eating a meal together.\"","Zhang Dong remained unusually quiet beside him, even feeling a bit like sneaking away.","After a while, Xie Xi abandoned his breakfast and went upstairs with his phone. He tried hard to calm his emotions, opened Weibo once more, and stared at those photos.","Although they had no other intimate gestures besides clinking glasses, she had smiled at Lu Minglang.","Big Star Xie felt a bit jealous.","When he saw the numerous comments below saying how well the two matched, his heart grew even more jealous.","What was so great about Lu Minglang? He definitely couldn't sing as well as him, and... Xie Xi felt that he was taller than Lu Minglang, and better-looking too.","Xie Xi looked at the photo of them smiling and clinking glasses once again. Could they really... have some kind of relationship?","Just as Xie Xi was still pondering, Mother Xie called.","\"Mom?\"","\"Xixi, I saw the photos of Professor Ye and the eldest Lu son on Weibo. I see netizens are all saying they're together.\"","\"...They were just having a meal together, it shouldn't be anything.\" Xie Xi tried to hypnotize himself.","\"That's good. I was wondering how the eldest Lu son could be with Professor Ye while simultaneously going on blind dates.\" Mother Xie patted her chest, having almost thought her son's first secret crush had ended in failure.","\"Blind dates?\"","\"They've been preparing for a marriage of convenience recently and have looked at several families. Your dad and I reckon it's the lady from the Wang family.\"","\"Mom, I have something to do, I'll hang up first.\" Xie Xi immediately got up and went downstairs. He had a copy of Ye Qiusuo's work schedule in his hands, which he had beaten around the bush to get at the show's recording site that day.","\"Brother Xi, where are you going? Do you want me to drop you off?\" Zhang Dong shouted from behind.","Xie Xi grabbed his hat and mask: \"No need.\"","Today, Ye Qiusuo should be teaching at the university.","Xie Xi drove all the way to the university, familiarly parking his car in front of the office building. Wearing his mask and hat, he walked to the side door.","The door was closed.","Xie Xi looked down and took out his phone. After hesitating for a moment, he still sent a message to Ye Qiusuo, saying he was at the side door of the office building.","He hadn't even thought of an excuse for looking for her yet when a message came back from the other side.","[I'll come down to get you.]","Xie Xi froze for a second, then took off his mask and used the screen to check if his face was clean and if his collar was too messy.","\"What's wrong?\" Ye Qiusuo had been at the university for an hour, preparing her lessons.","Xie Xi's eyes darted around; he wanted to talk bad about Lu Minglang.","\"Let's go to my office first.\" Ye Qiusuo held the door open, letting him go up.","The office building was the territory of professors. Especially early in the morning, it was very quiet, with hardly anyone in the corridors.","Ye Qiusuo had pulled all-nighters for several days, and there were actually faint dark circles under her eyes. She had drunk two cups of coffee in a row early in the morning and was now sitting in her office preparing to teach her students.","Xie Xi followed behind her. Getting a little closer, he could smell the aroma of coffee on her.","Suddenly, he didn't want to say anything at all.","\"Don't you usually wake up at nine or ten?\" Ye Qiusuo closed the office door, turning her head and asking casually.","It was currently eight-twenty.","Xie Xi looked at Ye Qiusuo, taken aback: \"How did you know?\"","Ye Qiusuo unplugged the USB drive she had just finished downloading files to and looked up: \"Didn't you wake up around that time on the reality show before?\"","\"!\"","Xie Xi suddenly felt a bit happy: \"You watched my show?\"","Ye Qiusuo was so busy, Xie Xi completely didn't expect her to watch this kind of variety show, and his show at that!","\"Mhm, it's quite interesting.\" Professor Ye said it casually, but it landed differently in Xie Xi's heart.","The jealousy he had accumulated all morning suddenly lessened just a little bit.","Big Star Xie sat reservedly opposite Professor Ye, pretending not to care as he said, \"I might have a campus drama coming up, so I came over to get a feel for the atmosphere.\" As for what campus drama it was, who cares.","Ye Qiusuo placed the USB drive together with her lesson plans, then sat down, crossing her hands on the desk: \"Is there anything I can help with?\"","\"Nothing much, I mainly just want to familiarize myself with the environment.\" Big Star Xie blurted out effortlessly.","\"Mhm.\"","Xie Xi stole a glance at Ye Qiusuo, only to meet her gaze directly.","\"...On my way here, I saw some marketing accounts on Weibo posting photos of you and Lu Minglang,\" Xie Xi said, feigning casualness. \"Lu Minglang is obviously about to get married, yet those marketing accounts still want to use you for clout.\"","\"Photos?\" Ye Qiusuo raised an eyebrow. She took out her phone, opened Weibo, and sure enough, saw the pictures.","\"Do you want me to have Sister Wei handle it for you?\" Xie Xi asked tentatively.","\"We must have been photographed last night when we were having dinner together,\" Ye Qiusuo said, looking at the photos on her screen. \"We had a bit of a conflict over business.\"","As she spoke, she logged into her previously verified account and made her second ever Weibo post: \"Normal business negotiations for the company. No other relationship.\"","\"Professor...\" When Xie Xi heard her mention having dinner together, he felt a twinge of jealousy, but upon hearing about the conflict, he cheered right back up. \"I need to familiarize myself with the campus vibe. Can we have lunch together?\"","Just then, the alarm clock on the desk went off. It was eight thirty.","\"I need to head to class.\" Ye Qiusuo stood up, gathering her lesson plans and other materials.","Opposite her, Xie Xi stood up immediately as well.","Before leaving, Ye Qiusuo asked, \"Familiarizing yourself with the campus environment, all by yourself?\"","Xie Xi: \"...\" He panicked a little.","Ye Qiusuo turned to look at him and suddenly smiled. \"I have plans for lunch today. I'll call you tonight when I'm free.\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78","paragraphs":["After getting into the car, Xie Xi took out his phone and only then noticed the notification for a special following.","It was the Weibo post Ye Qiusuo had just published.","Staring at that simple sentence, the sourness in the great superstar Xie's heart completely dissipated; it turned out to be just a work matter.","He went back happily, sat back down at the table, and prepared to eat breakfast.","Zhang Dong: \"...Brother Xi, are you alright?\"","The emotional shift between going out and coming back was a bit too drastic.","Xie Xi leaned back in his chair: \"She said she's free tonight and asked me out for dinner.\"","It was completely different from the kind of commercial business dinner with Lu Minglang!","Zhang Dong: \"So... is Professor Ye free tonight?\"","Xie Xi: \"...You're so annoying.\"","Although his assistant's words were unpleasant to hear, Xie Xi was still very happy today, waiting at home with anticipation for Ye Qiusuo to be free.","Meanwhile, netizens saw the Weibo post Ye Qiusuo had made, and the buzz finally began to heat up.","[The person involved coming out to dispel the rumors themselves, not bad.]","[Nowadays in the entertainment industry, people start getting all worked up the moment they see a man and a woman eating together.]","[The point is, Professor Ye isn't really in the entertainment industry, right?]","[Lol, I think she really wants to be in the entertainment industry, otherwise why would she be recording shows every other day? Compared to this, academic research is much harder.]","[I also doubt she really has time for research when she's always participating in variety shows and even acting.]","[Always? Besides 'Knowledge Q&A' and the current 'Maze of the Bureau', what other shows are there? And it seems like acting only took her less than a week.]","[Hurdling, hurdling, the Xie-Ye CP is still alive! I'm going to edit a video today. 'The Lake' is already on the streaming platforms. Sisters, we can start editing!]","...","Throughout the day, Ye Qiusuo was at the university. After finishing her morning classes, she went to check on the lab. After lunch, she attended a meeting, and in the afternoon, she sat in her office to finish this week's university work ahead of schedule.","She didn't finish until after six o'clock. Then, she stood up, walked to the window, and called Xie Xi.","The other party picked up almost instantly.","\"...Teacher?\" Xie Xi had been waiting for her call, even though his assistant had mentioned that Ye Qiusuo being free didn't necessarily mean today.","\"Are you free to grab dinner together?\" Ye Qiusuo asked as she watched the sky gradually darken outside the window.","Xie Xi was definitely free. He replied reservedly, \"I'm free. Where do you want to go, Teacher?\"","\"Anywhere is fine, you decide.\"","The corners of Xie Xi's lips curled up, but he quickly pressed them down. \"Teacher, how about the restaurant you went to yesterday?\" He was just that petty.","Holding the phone to her ear with her left hand, a hint of a smile appeared in Ye Qiusuo's eyes. \"It was alright.\"","\"Then... let's go there.\"","\"Okay.\"","This was the first time the two of them had arranged to go out directly, without any excuses.","As soon as Xie Xi hung up the phone, he immediately started changing his clothes. Being too dressed up would seem deliberate, but being too casual wouldn't do either.","Zhang Dong watched Xie Xi bustling about. \"...Brother Xi, is Professor Ye free now?\"","\"Yeah.\" Xie Xi's eyes and brows brimmed with joy; he had completely forgotten about the events of the morning.","\"Brother Xi, remember to get a private room, don't let anyone see you,\" Zhang Dong advised. Getting photographed was a minor issue, but the key point was that if Professor Ye came out to dispel the rumors again, it would break their Brother Xi's heart.","\"Got it.\"","The two of them agreed to meet at eight o'clock. Xie Xi hurriedly tidied himself up again and immediately rushed to the restaurant.","However, when he walked into the private room, there were roses arranged on the table, and even the rug was in the shape of a pink heart.","Xie Xi: \"?\" He had just booked an ordinary private room.","\"Today is Valentine's Day, so we're giving roses to all our tables,\" the waiter said, making a heart shape with his hands.","Only then did Xie Xi remember that when he took the elevator up just now, he had been surrounded by all sorts of pink decorations.","As a long-term single guy, he really wasn't very sensitive to this kind of holiday. In the past, at this time of year, Xie Xi would just stay at home and play video games.","He sat inside the private room, which featured a large glass window looking out at the brightly lit city.","Xie Xi hesitated for a moment, took a picture of the roses on the table, and then posted it on his alternate account: [Having dinner together. She hasn't arrived yet. The restaurant gave us roses.]","[Hao Hao, are you a guy or a girl?]","[Am I the only one who noticed the hand reflected on the glass flower basket? This hand is absolutely stunning, it looks too good.]","[Although the glass reflection is a bit blurry, with such long fingers, I suspect Hao Hao is a boy.]","[Sob sob sob, Hao Hao, do you think I still have a chance? I will definitely take the initiative to ask you out, I won't make you wait.]","Since Xie Xi had nothing to do, he scrolled to this comment and replied: [No chance. I am hers.]","These fans only thought this blogger was an ordinary rich person; no one expected that the person behind the account was actually the superstar himself, so they were all just joking around.","A knock sounded on the door. It was only half past seven, so Xie Xi thought it was the restaurant staff and simply said, \"Come in,\" while he continued watching a newly released CP video.","\"Poor but Beautiful Opera Singer x Stuffy and Upright Professor\"","The footage was mostly sourced from \"The Lake.\" Someone had actually edited the video so that the person Xie Xi looked at when he raised his eyes was Ye Qiusuo.","Xie Xi pursed his lips, feeling a little self-conscious, his heart pounding. Back then, when he looked over, the person he had been thinking about in his mind was exactly her.","\"What are you watching?\" After Ye Qiusuo knocked and entered, she saw him with his head slightly lowered, wearing one earbud and watching a video on his phone, where she could vaguely see a familiar yet unfamiliar scene.","Upon hearing Ye Qiusuo's voice, Xie Xi: \"!\"","He scrambled to exit the screen and stood up, yanking out his earbud, thinking he was safe and sound. However, that particular video website had a feature where if you only exited to the home screen without closing the app, the video disappeared but the audio continued playing.","The lines Ye Qiusuo spoke in \"The Lake\" echoed clearly throughout the entire private room.","Xie Xi: \"...\"","\"Is 'The Lake' already on the streaming platforms?\" Ye Qiusuo asked casually as she sat down across from him.","\"Yeah, it's up.\" Xie Xi finally closed the video completely, breathing a sigh of relief in his heart. Luckily, she thought he was watching the movie.","Xie Xi looked up and pointed at the bouquet of roses resting in the glass flower basket on the table, instinctively explaining, \"The restaurant gave us this. They said today is Valentine's Day, so every table gets one.\"","Ye Qiusuo swept her gaze over the various heart-shaped items in the private room, then looked at the person across from her who wore all his thoughts on his face. \"Let's order.\"","As the two sat inside, Xie Xi was the one doing most of the talking, chatting about everything from composing music to his new album, and finally, he just started singing a cappella.","Ye Qiusuo listened very attentively. Most of what he talked about were things he found interesting. Conversely, if she were to talk about her field, the other party might not necessarily understand it.","Towards the end of the meal, when the waiter brought up the dessert, he also presented a small box of heart-shaped chocolates. \"Wishing you two a Happy Valentine's Day~\"","Across the table, the tips of Xie Xi's ears instantly turned red. He lowered his head, looking at the table guiltily. Seeing this, Ye Qiusuo naturally reached out and accepted the chocolates. \"Thank you.\"","After the waiter left, Xie Xi propped his forehead with one hand, still not daring to look up at Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo methodically opened the box of chocolates. Looking at the chocolates inside, which were also heart-shaped, she slightly raised an eyebrow. This restaurant had indeed put a lot of thought into it.","She took one out and held it out to Xie Xi. \"Try it.\"","Then, Ye Qiusuo unwrapped the gold foil of another piece and placed the chocolate into her mouth, chewing slowly.","She had never really liked eating these kinds of things, but trying it today, the taste was actually not bad.","Xie Xi stared at the heart-shaped chocolate before him, his heart quickening its pace.","He reached out and picked it up, hesitant to eat it. After all, this was a gift from his Professor Ye.","\"There are two left. One for each of us.\" Across from him, Professor Ye emptied the box and handed him another piece.","Only then did Xie Xi unwrap one and take a slow, deliberate bite.","Ye Qiusuo watched him from across the table. \"Is it sweet?\"","Xie Xi looked up, thought for a moment, and answered earnestly, \"It’s a little bitter.\"","\"Really?\" Ye Qiusuo unwrapped the final piece and popped it into her mouth. \"I think it’s sweet.\"","Xie Xi finished the other half. \"It tastes a bit sweeter now,\" he murmured.","Ye Qiusuo arched an eyebrow but said nothing, her gaze fixed intently on him.","\"Professor... is something wrong?\" Xie Xi asked, shifting uncomfortably under her gaze. He was already feeling self-conscious, terrified that he might have let his true feelings slip.","\"Right here.\" Ye Qiusuo pointed to her own lower lip. \"You have something on you.\"","Xie Xi instinctively wiped at his lip. \"Is it gone?\"","\"Not yet.\" Ye Qiusuo pulled out a tissue. \"Lean in a little.\"","As Xie Xi leaned forward, she moved closer to meet him. In an instant, he forgot how to breathe.","Ye Qiusuo’s eyes were fixed on his lower lip as she carefully wiped away the chocolate crumbs with the tissue. Even through the thin layer of paper, she could feel the softness of his lips.","\"There,\" she said, pulling back. A small dark smudge of chocolate now stained the tissue in her hand.","\"Professor,\" Xie Xi called out softly.","\"Yes?\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79","paragraphs":["“I... have a new song. Do you want to hear it?” Xie Xi suppressed what he originally wanted to say and changed the subject.","Ye Qiusuo stared at him for a moment and then shook her head. “I still have to go to the company. I’ll listen next time.”","“When is next time?” Xie Xi blurted out impulsively.","“Next time...” Professor Ye faced Xie Xi and said slowly, “It could be the next time we record the show, or it could be whenever we’re both free to meet up.”","After saying that, she turned and left.","As soon as Xie Xi returned, Zhang Dong swarmed him. “Brother Xi, today is Valentine’s Day. How was your dinner with Professor Ye?”","As a “single dog,” he had only realized it was Valentine’s Day from the flood of romance-flaunting posts on his social media feed. Realizing Brother Xi had gone out today, his gossip instincts immediately flared up.","“The chocolate was a bit sweet.” Xie Xi leaned back on the sofa, still thinking about what Ye Qiusuo had said.","Zhang Dong was delighted. “Brother Xi, Professor Ye gave you chocolate?!”","Had things really progressed to this point? He knew there was something fishy about them going out for dinner today.","Xie Xi glanced at his assistant. “The restaurant gave it.”","“Oh.” Zhang Dong felt a bit let down. “I thought you two had made some progress.”","So they really did just have an ordinary meal on such a special day.","Xie Xi: “...We’ve made progress. She asked me out for another meal.”","Zhang Dong immediately said, “Congratulations, Brother Xi!”","Xie Xi didn’t look particularly happy. He had almost spoken his mind earlier but had suddenly flinched. Rather than taking a step forward, he preferred to ensure he didn’t take a step back—at least they were still friends.","However, regarding the “next time” Ye Qiusuo mentioned, Xie Xi felt like she meant something else. His gaze fell on Zhang Dong. After hesitating for a moment, he decided to ask his assistant.","“Brother Xi, why don’t you start from the beginning? Don’t leave out a single detail.” Zhang Dong immediately sat down next to Xie Xi, his eyes wide with curiosity.","Xie Xi took the single piece of chocolate out of his pocket, looked down at it, and slowly told Zhang Dong the story.","...","“...Brother Xi, are you sure Professor Ye helped you wipe... um... there?” Zhang Dong was shocked. Professor Ye didn’t seem like the type of person who would do such a thing.","“It was just in passing,” Xie Xi denied, but the tips of his ears turned red at the memory.","Zhang Dong slapped his thigh. “Brother Xi, let me ask you: do you think Professor Ye would wipe my mouth for me?”","Hearing this, Xie Xi didn’t even want to look at him.","“Definitely not. Even if I couldn’t wipe it clean, Professor Ye would probably just tell me to look in a mirror, or at most use a phone screen as one. There are plenty of other ways.”","Xie Xi remained silent, but his heart began to thud again.","“Besides, what reason did you use to go out for dinner today?” Zhang Dong asked curiously. Every time Brother Xi wanted to see Professor Ye, he had to find a solid excuse.","“...I don’t know.” Xie Xi had gone to the university to find Ye Qiusuo on an impulse today, and then they had somehow ended up having dinner together.","Zhang Dong made a serious and bold guess. “Brother Xi, I think Professor Ye treats you differently. As soon as you went over to subtly ask about the situation with Lu Minglang, she turned around and posted a clarification on Weibo. That was only her second post ever. Plus, she only follows you.”","“That’s because she didn’t know about it before I mentioned it. Isn’t it normal for her to follow me? She’s not familiar with the others, and besides, I’m her student.”","“Well... anyway, I feel like Professor Ye treats you differently from everyone else,” Zhang Dong insisted. “Netizens are all talking about it. In the last episode, Professor Ye clearly could have won, but she put you last, and you ended up winning.”","“That was an accident,” Xie Xi refused to admit it, but his joy was impossible to hide. He stood up to go upstairs. “That’s enough. I’m going to write a song.”","...","“What have you been up to these past few days?”","Rong Shiyun had mostly settled in. Since she had no classes for half a day, she went to find Ye Qiusuo for a chat, carrying some food she’d bought. But she was shocked by Ye Qiusuo’s appearance.","Her hair was pulled into a messy ponytail, there were dark circles under her eyes, and her clothes were wrinkled. It was obvious she hadn’t rested in days.","“You’re here. Is work going smoothly?” Ye Qiusuo was holding a cup of black coffee. Rong Shiyun could smell the bitterness from five meters away. “What would you like to drink?”","“It’s going well. What else do you have besides water and coffee? Water is fine.” Rong Shiyun set the food on the table and shook her head at Ye Qiusuo. “If you go to school looking like this, you’ll probably scare the students.”","“I’m not going to school until tomorrow.” Ye Qiusuo went to pour her a glass of water.","“How many days has it been since you slept?” Rong Shiyun frowned as she took the water. “Is recording that show really that time-consuming?”","Ye Qiusuo took a sip of coffee. “I slept for an hour this morning. It’s fine. We record for at most two days in a row per episode.”","Rong Shiyun had been in the same lab as Ye Qiusuo before and knew her habits. Although they were in different fields now, Ye Qiusuo always made sure to leave herself enough time to rest—unless there was something else she needed to do, in which case she would work like a maniac to squeeze out the time.","“Then why are you in such a rush?” Rong Shiyun asked curiously. “What are you making time for?”","Ye Qiusuo stared at the coffee in her cup for a while, then said slowly, “I might be entering a relationship.”","“Oh,” Rong Shiyun responded reflexively. She had just taken a sip of water when she spat it all out. “You might be doing what?!” she asked in shock.","Professor Ye repeated seriously, “I might be entering a relationship.”","Rong Shiyun thought: I must still be in bed dreaming. This has to be a dream.","The two of them held their cups, staring at each other for a while before Rong Shiyun finally spoke. “This ‘entering a relationship’... involves a ‘might’?”","“Yes, there is a possibility.” Professor Ye was a rigorous person.","Rong Shiyun: “Heh, that’s... that’s great.”","It was indeed Ye Qiusuo’s style—if there was a possibility of a relationship, she would clear her schedule in advance.","“So, can I know who this ‘possibility’ is?” Rong Shiyun asked cautiously. Most of the people they knew were already settled down with families, and the people they interacted with were mostly middle-aged. There weren't many people their age.","Ye Qiusuo shook her head.","“Do I know him?”","“Yes.”","Rong Shiyun frantically searched her mind for young peers she knew. There were almost none. Their former classmates were scattered all over the world, and most of them had been so crushed by Ye Qiusuo’s brilliance in the past that they didn’t seem like likely candidates for a relationship.","“Qiusuo...” Rong Shiyun grew serious. “You’re not having something going on with one of your students, are you? Student-teacher romances are a bad idea.”","She thought back to the students Ye Qiusuo was advising. That one named Lin Lu was decent-looking, but he was way too hyper; he didn't seem like the type Qiusuo would like. On the other hand, there was Ding Hong. He was average-looking but had a steady personality.","“Both parties are adults. A teacher-student relationship isn't illegal,” Ye Qiusuo said calmly.","Rong Shiyun held her water cup, feeling uneasy. How could Qiusuo have fallen for that student Ding Hong? They didn't seem like a good match at all; he was just an ordinary guy.","Ye Qiusuo finished her coffee. “I still have work to do. Make yourself at home.”","Rong Shiyun watched her walk into the study, the shock still reverberating through her mind: How could she “possibly” be entering a relationship?!","During the filming of the third episode, Xie Xi didn't end up singing for Ye Qiusuo. Instead, he shuffled over to her side and tentatively asked if they could do it the following day.","“That’s fine,” Professor Ye agreed without a moment’s hesitation.","Xie Xi was so nervous that he failed to notice the ease of her agreement.","“Then... would my place be alright?” Xie Xi looked at Ye Qiusuo. “I have my instruments there.”","“Alright.”","Just as they finished speaking, the others approached, and the two naturally fell silent.","Xie Xi discreetly took out his phone and sent a message to Zhang Dong: [I’m giving you the day off tomorrow. You are not allowed to come back to the house.]","Zhang Dong: [Bro, did you buy a new gaming console? Are you trying to play it behind my back?]","Xie Xi: [You can take the console with you. The Professor is coming over tomorrow; don't show your face.]","Zhang Dong: [!!! Bro, remember to test the waters with Professor Ye tomorrow. I guarantee she feels differently about you!]","Xie Xi didn't reply because the cameras had started rolling again.","Filming usually took place before the previous episode aired, and today was no exception. A segment had run into issues, so they spent over an hour re-recording it. The director, Zheng Longju, reminded them that the next episode would be filmed out of town. Although the shoot itself would only take a day, the travel time meant they needed to clear their schedules.","Once filming wrapped, the six of them gathered for their usual post-show dinner and debrief. Xie Xi never found a private moment to speak with Ye Qiusuo, so he had to resort to a text: [I’ll be waiting for you at home tomorrow.]","Professor Ye was checking her emails when the notification popped up. She tapped it, then looked up at Xie Xi across the table, mouthing a single word: “Okay.”","***","The next day, Xie Xi had already finished tidying the house. Uncharacteristically, he was out of bed by seven in the morning.","Unfortunately, Professor Ye didn't arrive until after nine, having timed her visit based on his usual wake-up schedule.","As soon as the doorbell rang, Xie Xi lunged to his feet. He strode toward the door, but stopped to check his reflection in the hallway mirror one last time before opening it.","“Good morning, Professor,” Xie Xi said, trying his best to sound casual.","Ye Qiusuo held out a box of chocolates. “For you.” It was the same brand they had eaten at the restaurant the other day.","Xie Xi took them, his mind racing between Zhang Dong’s advice and the realization that bringing a small gift was a perfectly normal social gesture.","As they walked inside, Ye Qiusuo turned to him. “Are we doing the new song now?”","Xie Xi snapped back to reality. “I’ll take you to the music room.”","The music room was spacious and filled with various instruments. Xie Xi sat down at a grand piano and looked up at Ye Qiusuo. “Professor, sit here.” He patted the spot on the bench beside him.","The night before, Xie Xi had stayed up late moving every other chair in the music room into the storage closet.","Ye Qiusuo arched an eyebrow. “Alright.”","They sat side-by-side at the piano. Xie Xi began to play and sing; it was indeed a new song, one Ye Qiusuo had never heard before.","The Professor didn't know much about music or melodies, but that didn't stop her from sensing the raw emotion woven into the song—especially with the way he looked at her from time to time.","She listened in silence until he finished, then raised her hands to offer a light round of applause. “It’s beautiful.”","Xie Xi had only sung one song, yet the tips of his ears were burning. He felt a wave of relief, thankful for the stray strands of hair that partially hid them.","However, a second later, his entire body felt like it was on fire.","Ye Qiusuo reached out and tucked the hair behind his ear, her voice calm. “Your ears are red.”","Xie Xi froze.","Her fingertips lightly brushed against the pink-tinged tips of his ears—thin and warm to the touch. She let out a soft chuckle and pulled her hand back. “Is it too hot in here?”","Xie Xi stared at her, the shock in his eyes lingering.","“What is it?” she asked, acting as if nothing had happened.","“Bro, Professor Ye treats you differently than everyone else. If you don't believe me, just try her.”","Zhang Dong’s words began to play on a loop in Xie Xi’s mind.","“Professor...”","“Yes?”","“I like you.”"]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80","paragraphs":["After Xie Xi finished speaking, an exceptional silence fell over the music room.","He watched Ye Qiusuo, his nerves on edge.","Professor Ye lowered her head slightly. She reached out, her fingers gliding across the black and white keys and producing a series of wandering notes before coming to a stop in the center. She brushed against Xie Xi’s hand, which was gripped tightly to the edge of the piano, and then gently took it in hers. \"You like me? Then... do you want to date me?\"","Xie Xi pressed his lips together to keep from losing his composure, managing a reserved, \"I do.\"","His fingers felt warm, and a wave of inexplicable sweetness washed over him.","Professor Ye nodded. She pulled out her phone and sent her new work schedule to him. \"Take a look and see what times work best for us to date.\"","Anyone else might have found Professor Ye’s approach a bit too clinical, but Xie Xi didn't mind at all. He didn't even bother taking out his own phone. Keeping his hand clasped in hers, he leaned toward her to look directly at the schedule on her screen.","\"I'm free every week on this day, and from the afternoon until evening on this one,\" Xie Xi said, using his free hand to point out the overlapping slots on the schedule.","\"Mhm.\" Ye Qiusuo marked them down immediately.","Xie Xi cleared his throat softly. \"So... can we start dating now?\"","\"We can,\" Professor Ye replied, adding, \"Boyfriend.\"","The word \"boyfriend\" sent Xie Xi’s heart soaring. He looked down at their joined hands, briefly letting go only to lace his fingers through hers. He preferred it this way—fingers intertwined.","Noticing how focused he was on their locked fingers, Ye Qiusuo called his name. \"Xie Xi.\"","\"Yeah?\" Xie Xi looked up, the corners of his mouth still curled in a lingering smile.","A hint of a smile flickered in Professor Ye’s eyes. She leaned in and pressed her lips against his.","It wasn't just a fleeting touch; Xie Xi could clearly feel the soft, damp warmth of her lips against his.","Things were moving so fast.","His heart hammered against his ribs, but his lips parted instinctively, welcoming the kiss.","They were both inexperienced, but it didn't matter. Nothing in the world felt better than this kiss.","\"If you were one of my graduate students,\" Ye Qiusuo whispered, opening her eyes slightly as she pulled back just an inch to look at him, \"I’d be getting fired right about now.\"","Huajing University didn't forbid relationships between faculty and students in general, but a professor dating their own direct student was a different matter. Such an affair would trigger an investigation. The Ministry of Education had issued a directive stating that \"teachers must not sexually harass students or enter into inappropriate relationships with them.\" After all, the inherent power imbalance between teacher and student could easily lead to complications.","Xie Xi’s mind was still a chaotic whirl of joy from the kiss. He heard her words but didn't quite process the meaning, simply blurring out, \"Then... I’ll leave with you.\"","Ye Qiusuo let out a soft laugh. \"All right.\"","They didn't stay in the music room much longer. Holding hands, they made their way to the living room.","Now that their relationship had shifted so abruptly, Xie Xi found himself at a bit of a loss. He led her to the sofa and sat down, nervously rambling about his daily life—how he spent his time writing songs, singing, and playing video games. He even went into detail, introducing several of his favorites.","Ye Qiusuo had been listening intently. She was a rigorous person; even before their relationship was official, she had already begun making plans for the possibility of dating and worked hard to clear her schedule. Naturally, she wouldn't brush Xie Xi off now.","What do you want for lunch? Xie Xi glanced at the wall clock and asked Ye Qiusuo. I will order takeout.","He had given everyone the day off today, including the housekeeper.","Anything is fine. I am not picky.","Xie Xi called to order food directly from the catering department of a five-star hotel that required a VIP card for delivery.","Then he turned his head and asked, The second episode of Enigma airs today. Shall we watch it together?","Okay.","Xie Xi turned on the TV and tuned into the channel showing Enigma. He even went to wash some fruit and rummaged through Zhang Dong's fridge for a pile of snacks, stacking them all on the glass coffee table in front of the sofa.","Since the first episode had plenty of hype and the content was genuinely interesting—especially the unexpected twists—the second episode attracted even more viewers.","The second episode no longer followed the previous format. Instead, everyone acted as detectives, following clues provided by the production team to see who could solve the case first. The six participants were divided into three groups, with Ye Qiusuo and You Feibai paired together.","Aww! I am carrying the Bai-Qiu CP banner for life!","This CP hasn't disbanded yet?","If Xie Xi had seen the two of them grouped together before, he probably would have been jealous. But now... they were officially dating!","Xie Xi thought gleefully to himself. Then he turned to look at Ye Qiusuo, only to find she had fallen asleep against the sofa.","Only then did Xie Xi take a truly close look at her face. Her eyelashes were exceptionally long when her eyes were closed, but there were dark circles under them; she clearly had not been resting well.","He carefully pulled over a thin blanket, gently covering her, and then turned down the TV volume.","After watching her for a while, he turned back to the TV, but he could not focus on the show at all. Xie Xi took out his phone and logged into his alt account: We started dating today! Standard lucky draw to celebrate.","He had considered posting from his main account, but on second thought, if the news broke out, it might cause trouble for Ye Qiusuo. She was already busy enough as it was.","Xie Xi did not want to add to her burdens.","Wow, congrats Hao Hao! Wishing you two a long and happy life together!","The prize does not matter; I just want to wish Hao Hao and his partner a long-lasting relationship.","Sob, so happy for you. When will it be my turn for a sweet romance?","Xie Xi did not read the comments. He was watching the TV, where Ye Qiusuo and You Feibai were one team, while he was paired with Xia Zhoubing.","One had to admit Xia Zhoubing had a lot of restraint. Back then, he had bought a bunch of trending searches modeled after You Feibai's persona, which Xie Xi had exposed. Yet here they were on the same show, with Xia Zhoubing showing no sign that there had ever been any friction or grudge between them.","With Ye Qiusuo and You Feibai teamed up, the others basically had no hope of winning. If Xie Xi had turned on the live comments, he would have definitely seen a flood of messages shipping the two of them.","Halfway through the show, the hotel delivery arrived. Xie Xi brought it in and checked the time. After hesitating for a moment, he did not open it. He waited another half hour before waking Ye Qiusuo. Teacher... it is time to eat.","Upon hearing the first half of the sentence, Ye Qiusuo snapped awake instantly. Once she saw it was Xie Xi, she relaxed slightly and reached up to massage her neck.","“Is it sore?” Xie Xi asked, sitting beside her. He straightened up and pressed his hand against the back of Ye Qiusuo's neck. He hadn't dared to move her earlier for fear of waking her. Although his sofa was soft, leaning against the backrest for so long wasn't comfortable.","Warm fingertips massaged her neck, providing considerable relief. Ye Qiusuo checked the time; it was already 12:30 PM. “You haven't eaten yet?”","“I was waiting for you.” Xie Xi massaged her for a while longer before helping her up.","The food had gone cold, so he transferred it to plates to reheat.","Just by waking up from a nap, the distance between them seemed to have suddenly shortened.","“We have the afternoon and evening free the day after tomorrow. What would you like to do?” Professor Ye asked about their remaining date for the week.","Xie Xi thought for a moment. “I'll go find you that day.”","“Okay.”","Once the food was on the table, Xie Xi took a photo of it and sent it to his family group chat with the message: [The first day of my official relationship with Professor Ye.]","The photo and the message instantly caused an uproar between Xie Xi's parents.","Mother Xie: [Son, you and Professor Ye actually made it happen!!!]","Father Xie: [You'd better start learning how to cook. Are you going to order takeout forever?]","Mother Xie: [Mr. Xie, you act as if you know how to cook yourself. Our son can just hire a good housekeeper later on. _]","“Xie Xi.” Professor Ye disapproved of the big star's constant phone usage. “Focus on your meal.”","“Okay.” Xie Xi finished reading the group messages and didn't reply. He put his phone away and obediently ate with her.","Now, every time Ye Qiusuo called his name, the big star didn't feel guilty at all; he was thrilled.","It was an expression of love!","After finishing their meal, they didn't sit for long before Xie Xi claimed he was sleepy and needed a nap, dragging Ye Qiusuo to the balcony with him.","The balcony was in typical Xie-style: a thick carpet with two lounge chairs on top.","Calling them lounge chairs wasn't entirely accurate; they were more like modular sofas designed to perfectly fit the body's curves—ideal for napping while soaking up the sun.","Xie Xi settled Ye Qiusuo down first, then hurried to get a light blanket to cover her. He even looked for suitable throw pillows, appearing very busy.","Professor Ye watched him at first, but eventually, she closed her eyes and fell asleep.","She really was exhausted.","Xie Xi slowed his pace. He dropped the pillow in his hand onto the floor and, with his long legs bent, rested his head near Ye Qiusuo's hand, quietly watching her.","If their dating time was spent with her resting, it was actually... quite nice.","In this month, with the sun shining down, the inevitable spring drowsiness kicked in, and Xie Xi drifted off in that position.","...","By the time Ye Qiusuo woke up, the sun had shifted to the other side. As she sat up, she saw the person sleeping beside her hand. Half of his face was visible, looking exceptionally clean and handsome.","If she hadn't had that dream and let things take their natural course, perhaps the two of them would never have even met.","He would have been a singer, and she would have been a professor. Occasionally, she might have glanced at a poster of him and looked away without a second thought, until he eventually retired from the entertainment industry and even the posters disappeared.","The fate of the world is always so mysterious.","Ye Qiusuo smiled faintly. She reached out and touched his cheek. The smooth, warm sensation traveled from her fingertips to her brain. This was reality. Regardless of whether this was a book or not, at this moment, they were real people.","“Professor...”","Xie Xi woke up, his eyes fluttering open before his mind had fully processed his surroundings. As he straightened up, he realized he was still clutching a corner of the thin blanket she was wrapped in.","\"Mhm,\" Ye Qiusuo hummed in response. \"Time to get up.\"","Xie Xi tried to stand but failed. He looked up at Professor Ye, who was already on her feet, with a pitiful expression. \"My legs are numb.\"","Ordinarily, Professor Ye wasn't one to fall for such tricks, but some people were simply born with a natural talent for being charmingly helpless.","Professor Ye leaned down and extended her hand. \"I’ll pull you up.\"","Xie Xi took her hand to stand, but instead of letting go, he pulled her into his arms. Resting his chin on her shoulder, he wore a triumphant smile. \"I was lying.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't seem to mind; she simply stayed still and let him hold her.","\"From now on... we’re boyfriend and girlfriend,\" Xie Xi murmured, his voice sounding a little dazed.","The entire day had felt surreal, like a dream. He feared that once the dream ended, they would return to being just a celebrity and a professor—two people from completely different worlds with nothing to do with one another."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81","paragraphs":["Ye Qiusuo did not spend the night at Xie Xi's house. She had matters to attend to that evening, but having slept for a while, her mental state had improved considerably.","Just as she arrived home, her parents called. Ye Qiusuo found it strange; her parents rarely called her, fearing they might disturb her work, especially on a weekday.","\"Dad, is something wrong?\"","Ye Qiusuo's father hummed in response and then said softly, \"We're fine. We just suddenly wanted to call and talk to you.\"","Ye Qiusuo did not let her guard down. She continued to ask what had happened, knowing it was impossible for them to call at this time for no reason.","The person on the other end soon changed. Ye Qiusuo's mother took the phone, her voice sounding a bit raspy. \"Qiusuo, don't push yourself too hard while you're out there alone. We know you're doing great things, but your health is important too. Be a good girl and get more rest.\"","\"I know.\" Ye Qiusuo frowned. These were common refrains, but not enough to make her parents call specifically. \"What happened at home?\"","\"...\" Her mother sighed. \"The child from the family upstairs passed away today.\"","Ye Qiusuo was startled. \"Which family upstairs?\"","There were three households on the floor above them. Two children were the same age as her and had attended the same elementary school.","\"The child from the family that skipped grades along with you in the later years.\" Remembering the sounds of crying coming from upstairs today, Ye Qiusuo's mother felt a wave of panic in her heart. \"That child was too competitive and developed psychological issues. News came from the school today that something happened.\"","\"We just want you to be safe and healthy,\" her father shouted from the side.","\"I know.\" Ye Qiusuo decided to distract them. \"Dad, Mom, I have a boyfriend.\"","\"Yes, yes, you should get along well with your fri—what friend?\" Her mother was halfway through nodding when she finally reacted to what was said.","\"I have someone I like,\" Ye Qiusuo repeated patiently.","Her parents on the other end of the line seemed to disappear for a moment. It took a long time before her father spoke up. \"That’s good, haha.\" His voice was clearly filled with a dazed sort of joy.","After all, Ye Qiusuo's parents had already prepared themselves mentally for the possibility that their daughter might never get married.","Years ago, when Ye Qiusuo was in university, an old professor had visited their home and said something they always remembered: Qiusuo's studies were no longer just for herself.","The parents were in a state of immense shock; they didn't even remember to ask what kind of person the boyfriend was before hanging up.","In contrast, the three people in the Xie family WeChat group were very lively.","Xie Xi: [Red Envelope. I'm happy today.]","Xie Xi's mother: [Red Envelope. Cheers to our Xixi having a partner.]","Xie Xi's father: [Red Envelope. To buy things for my future daughter-in-law.]","The three of them sent red envelopes to each other, spamming the screen for several minutes before stopping. It was as festive as the Lunar New Year.","Xie Xi's mother: [Xixi, when can we go meet Professor Ye?]","Xie Xi's father had even learned internet slang: [+1.]","Xie Xi: [She’s very busy right now. Maybe in a while.]","Xie Xi had already planned to spend the two dating slots Ye Qiusuo had set aside just resting with her, so he didn't want his parents coming over.","Anyone with a bit of knowledge knew about the clash between Tianqiu Technology and the Lu Group, not to mention that Xie Xi himself was constantly paying attention to Ye Qiusuo’s side.","She was busy.","...","When the time for their second date arrived, Ye Qiusuo had spent the entire morning teaching classes at the university, and students had kept her back for over an hour asking questions.","Xie Xi started by waiting in the office building parking lot, but later he disguised himself, got out of the car, and tried to sneak toward the laboratory.","Since it was a workday and no one had cleared him in advance, Big Star Xie was stopped by the security guard at the entrance.","\"What are you doing? You look suspicious!\" The guard looked at the heavily muffled Xie Xi and asked sternly, \"This is a laboratory. What do you want?\"","Xie Xi lowered his voice and leaned toward the guard. \"I'm looking for my girlfriend.\"","Seeing him lean in, the guard thought it was going to be something serious, but hearing this, he completely lost his temper. \"Can't you go somewhere else to be romantic? You want to come into the lab building? Out, out! Wait at the gate!\"","Students these days really had no sense of propriety. How could they just let someone in for a girlfriend in such a serious place like the lab building?","The Big Star Xie was scolded and had no choice but to turn around and leave.","Just then, Professor Ye came down from upstairs and saw him. \"Why are you here?\"","Xie Xi immediately turned around upon hearing her voice. He glanced at the guard and whispered, \"I came to find you.\"","Ye Qiusuo lifted her hand to check the time; she had indeed run late. \"Sorry, we can leave now.\"","The guard knew Professor Ye and was stunned as he watched their retreating figures. \"Since when does Professor Ye have a boyfriend?\"","\"Uncle, what boyfriend?\" Lin Lu came down and asked casually.","\"Just now, some gho—some tall guy said he was Professor Ye's boyfriend,\" the guard said, scratching his head.","Lin Lu exchanged looks with Ding Hong and Sun Jiajia, who were beside him. As expected, they all looked shocked.","Sun Jiajia was the first to react, sprinting out immediately to see what kind of \"three-headed, six-armed\" legendary figure Professor Ye's boyfriend could be.","Lin Lu and Ding Hong followed close behind.","The three of them only managed to catch a glimpse of a back as he got into the car.","\"What a pity, we were one step too late,\" Lin Lu said, shaking his head.","Sun Jiajia, however, frowned as she watched. Why did that back look so familiar?"]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82","paragraphs":["“Waiting long? In the future, I’ll go find you,” Ye Qiusuo said as she got into the car.","During his creative periods, Xie Xi had plenty of free time and naturally didn’t want to waste hers. “Next time, I’ll just come a little later.”","“There are too many people at the university. From now on, you can come straight to my house,” Professor Ye said while buckling her seatbelt.","“...Alright.” The big star, Xie Xi, felt a bit shy. He felt like their progress was moving a little fast, but he liked it very much.","After arriving at her home, Ye Qiusuo didn't rush inside. Instead, she stood at the door and had Xie Xi record his fingerprint so he could let himself in later.","“Done.” On the surface, Xie Xi acted reserved, but his heart was bubbling with joy as he finished recording his fingerprint. Just as he straightened up, Ye Qiusuo suddenly pushed him inside.","The big star Xie Xi: !","Could it be that in broad daylight... it was already going to start?","Wasn't it a bit too fast?","In just one second, a battle was already raging in the big star’s mind.","As it turned out, Professor Ye snapped the door shut with a \"thud,\" but she didn't come in herself.","Xie Xi, who was currently letting his imagination run wild: “?”","“Professor Ye, how do you have time to come back at noon today?” A neighbor happened to step out of the elevator, carrying a takeout bag.","“I have nothing to do this afternoon.”","Ye Qiusuo stood at the door and chatted with the neighbor for a few moments before coming inside.","Seeing Xie Xi looking at her, she took the initiative to explain: “The tenant next door is a gossip reporter.”","Calling him a gossip reporter was a polite way of saying he was a ‘famous’ paparazzo in the industry. However, he usually acted like an ordinary young man, appearing quite friendly and greeting people as they came and went. The reason Professor Ye knew his identity was because someone had come to cause trouble next door recently. She heard he was moving out this month for fear of retaliation.","Calculating the time, he hadn't even lived next door for half a year.","“Oh,” Xie Xi muttered. So it wasn't that she wanted to do this or that to him.","“What do you want to drink?” Ye Qiusuo asked as she closed the door.","“Anything is fine.” Xie Xi scanned the interior. This was his first time here in the capacity of her boyfriend.","If Rong Siyun were to see the contents of Ye Qiusuo’s open refrigerator right now, she would surely scream about her friend choosing romance over friendship. When she visited, there were only water and coffee to choose from, but now the fridge was packed with all kinds of drinks.","Ye Qiusuo didn't know what Xie Xi liked to drink, so she had bought one of every beverage that was supposedly popular on the market.","“Xie Xi.” Ye Qiusuo turned around after opening the fridge. “Come over and pick one yourself.”","Xie Xi followed her and stood slightly behind her to her side. Looking at the dazzling array of drinks, he turned to look at Ye Qiusuo.","A normal person’s fridge couldn't possibly look like this, with one of every kind of drink. Besides, Professor Ye’s tastes didn't seem that broad.","Xie Xi suddenly lowered his head slightly, resting his chin intimately on Ye Qiusuo’s shoulder. His eyes were filled with a smile so thick it couldn't be dispersed. “Did you buy all of these for me?”","“What do you like to drink? I'll buy more next time,” Professor Ye didn't deny it.","Xie Xi picked out a bottle of milk beer from the edge. “This one.”","“What do you like to drink?” Xie Xi asked.","“Anything is fine for me.” Ye Qiusuo casually grabbed a bottle from inside and closed the fridge.","Perhaps because he knew she cared about him more than he had imagined, the big star suddenly became much bolder. Just as she turned around, he quietly hooked his finger around Professor Ye’s and even gave it a little shake.","Sure enough, Professor Ye said nothing, letting him hook onto her.","“What do you want to do after we eat?” Ye Qiusuo asked him.","“What do you usually do when you’re resting, Professor?” Xie Xi didn't say what he wanted immediately.","“Read books, read papers.”","Xie 'Ignorant Big Star' Xi: “...What else do you do besides that?”","Ye Qiusuo thought about it seriously and said, “Not much. You might find being with me boring.”","She had always been a dull person.","“It’s not boring.” As the two sat on the sofa, Xie Xi said with a serious expression, “Being with you, even sleeping is very interesting.”","The big star meant it in a very pure way; he felt that resting together with Professor Ye was a very romantic thing.","However, Professor Ye thought a little deeper. She looked up at Xie Xi, pondered for a moment, and said seriously, “You want to sleep with me?”","Xie Xi was about to nod, but meeting Professor Ye’s eyes, he suddenly realized something was wrong.","Their definitions of \"sleeping\" were most likely not the same.","“...I meant resting together with you.” The big star’s eyes flickered away. Actually, saying it out loud felt a little bit like a pity.","Professor Ye gave an “Mhm,” reaching out to brush away the stray hairs by his ear, revealing his reddened earlobe. She said calmly, “Red again.”","Xie Xi’s inner thoughts: What should I do if the Professor is always flirting with me unconsciously?","His face grew hotter and hotter. Finally, throwing caution to the wind, he tilted his head slightly and rubbed his cheek directly against Ye Qiusuo’s palm.","Pressing against her cool palm did indeed feel more comfortable. The big star even squinted his eyes contentedly and rubbed against it a few more times.","“You’re acting spoiled,” Professor Ye concluded after observation.","Then she added: “I like it very much.”","Xie Xi: !","The Professor said she likes it! Should I rub against her a few more times?","Unfortunately, Professor Ye soon withdrew her hand. She wasn't very good at cooking and planned to order takeout. Because Xie Xi was there, she rarely treated the meal carelessly, picking an excellent restaurant and ordering several dishes.","“Do you eat this?”","“No cilantro, no ginger, no garlic.”","Xie Xi didn't like food with heavy flavors, but he didn't like it too bland either.","The second time they spent time together as a couple passed just as plainly. There was no candlelight dinner, no going out to play, and they didn't even watch a movie. Yet, the big star was still very happy.","In any case, being together was what dating was about; as for what they did, that was just a formality.","...","The place where Ye Qiusuo lived wasn't large. It was a three-bedroom apartment. One room served as a study, one was the master bedroom, and the other was a guest room. Although there was a balcony, it couldn't fit two oversized soft chairs like Xie Xi’s place, nor did it have such good light.","She led Xie Xi back to the sofa and went to get a book.","Xie Xi wanted to lie down after eating. He lay down only to find that this sofa could actually accommodate him. Thinking about the space in this apartment, he felt the sofa was unusually large.","She didn't seem like the type of person who focused on enjoying life.","Although Xie Xi had been here before, he hadn't noticed the sofa and didn't remember if it had been replaced.","“Professor, is this the same sofa as before?”","Ye Qiusuo sat down with her book. “I changed it a few days ago. Why?”","Xie Xi’s brows were filled with a smile. He shifted and rested his head on Ye Qiusuo’s lap, testing the waters: “Was it because of me?”","“Yes,” Professor Ye admitted, flipping open her book.","The previous sofa had been provided by the developer. It wasn't particularly comfortable or large; it was merely functional. Ye Qiusuo had been too lazy to change it, so she had kept using it. After they confirmed their relationship, she had replaced the sofa.","The big star was now bubbling with happiness.","He suddenly sat up, drawing a side-glance from Ye Qiusuo.","Xie Xi leaned against the sofa, took out his phone, and snapped a photo of himself. He specifically found an angle that clearly showed the back of the sofa and posted it on his main account: [Getting ready for a noon nap~ Image.jpg]","Then he put his phone down and leaned back onto Professor Ye’s lap.","After a while, Xie Xi opened his eyes. “Professor, when are you going to sleep?”","“After I finish this chapter.”","Xie Xi looked up, trying to see what she was reading. Ye Qiusuo brought the book before his eyes, but unfortunately, he wasn't wearing his glasses today and couldn't see the words clearly.","The big star, acting spoiled by her favor, said, “I want to read it together too...”","Ye Qiusuo picked up the book again. \"Then I'll read it to you.\"","Xie Xi turned over, looking utterly delighted. \"In the future, Professor, you can be my eyes. I’ll just be content living as an illiterate.\"","Ye Qiusuo didn't reply as she began reading the article in her hand; she simply reached out and stroked his hair.","Xie Xi leaned against her legs, playing with the corner of her shirt as he listened.","He had originally intended to spend some quiet time resting with Ye Qiusuo, but the Professor hadn't even finished a single article before he drifted off to sleep.","It wasn't that Xie Xi did it on purpose; it was simply that the article was far too hypnotic. It was filled with professional jargon from beginning to end, sounding like a foreign language to his ears.","I'm not listening to this next time, Xie Xi thought dizzily just before he fell under.","Little did he know that while he slept, the comment section of his Weibo had exploded.","Xie Xi rarely posted selfies on Weibo, so when he suddenly dropped one today, his fans were naturally ecstatic, launching into full \"visual-worship\" mode.","[Ahhhhh! Zai Zai, you finally learned how to post a selfie for fans!!! Mama orders you to keep this up!]","[Zai Zai looks so good even with a close-up shot, *drools.jpg*]","[Xi Xi seems especially happy today, did something good happen?]","[This is the first time I've seen Xi Xi smile like this.]","[Zai Zai, post more selfies, okay? If there's something happy, share it so we can all be happy together!]","[Go take a nap, Zai Zai~]","At the same time, Rong Shiyun, who was taking the opportunity to surf the web, also came across Xie Xi's Weibo. She spent a moment admiring Zai Zai's looks, but when she long-pressed the image to save it, she suddenly froze.","That sofa looked familiar—really familiar. It was exactly the same as the sofa her friend had replaced just a few days ago.","After her moment of shock, Rong Shiyun saved the photo and left a comment: [Hahahaha! Zai Zai, your sofa is exactly the same as the one my friend just bought!!! What a coincidence!]","[Waiting for a link, I want the same sofa as Zai Zai.]","[This is a designer brand sofa from a certain country, right? The price is extremely expensive.]","[!!! Is this sofa trending lately? My family went to buy a sofa a few days ago and we actually liked this one too. Unfortunately, there was only one set left, and the person who happened to be buying it across from us was Professor Ye. So I switched to another set. Hehe, we even took a photo together.]","[Professor Ye also bought this sofa?! I ship it, I ship it!]","[The Xie-Ye ship is sailing! They even have the same taste in sofas!]","[Wooo, video editors, get to work! Quickly arrange a video of Zai Zai sleeping at Professor Ye's house, I want to see that!]","[I want to see it too!]","[But there’s no footage of Professor Ye's house.]","[Wooo, I don't care, let the tech geniuses make it happen.]"]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83","paragraphs":["When Xie Xi woke up, Ye Qiusuo had fallen asleep leaning against the back of the sofa, the book in her hand nearly slipping to the floor.","He reached out to take the book, then stood up and gazed at her profile for a long time. Only then did he pick up his phone and casually open Weibo. He hadn't expected that someone would actually spot Ye Qiusuo buying a sofa.","Xie Xi finished reading those few comments: \"...\"","Something was wrong with these fans. Things had already reached this point, yet no one had linked him to Professor Ye?","They were appearing on a show together and shared a teacher-student relationship—did they not know the phrase \"love grows over time\"?","Big Star Xie had originally intended to show off secretly without letting netizens catch on, but at this moment, he felt like exposing himself.","\"What’s wrong?\" Ye Qiusuo had just opened her eyes when she saw Xie Xi pursing his lips and staring at his phone, looking rather unhappy.","\"You're awake.\" Hearing Ye Qiusuo's voice, a smile instantly broke out on Xie Xi's face.","\"Mm.\"","Xie Xi let the words roll around on the tip of his tongue before finally moving closer to her. \"If we went public...\"","\"Do you want to go public?\" Ye Qiusuo asked.","Xie Xi had a feeling that if he said yes, she would absolutely agree.","\"Let's wait a bit longer,\" Xie Xi took the initiative to say. He wanted to wait until she didn't look so busy and could find the time to deal with the fallout before they went public.","\"Alright.\" Ye Qiusuo went along with whatever he wanted.","Xie Xi leaned directly against Ye Qiusuo's shoulder as if he had lost all his strength, nuzzling affectionately against the crook of her neck. \"Once we go public, you have to attend my concert and be my leading lady.\"","Hearing the words \"leading lady,\" Ye Qiusuo suddenly thought of Wan Yurou. Aside from seeing her on the show, she hadn't heard any news about her for a long time. Wan Yurou didn't seem to be making any waves in the industry; her career remained lukewarm despite participating in the show with Xie Xi and You Feibai.","Ye Qiusuo looked down at Xie Xi, who was still doing well as an artist in the industry, and asked, \"What reason would make you quit the industry and stop singing?\"","With his status, he could easily find another powerful manager. It wasn't like what was written in the book—that once Wei Qi died, he would lose all his support.","Of course, the lack of logic in the original author's writing extended far beyond just that point.","\"I'd quit if it stopped being interesting,\" Xie Xi said casually. \"I can sing anywhere.\"","Ye Qiusuo looked thoughtful, then said, \"I have to go to the company tomorrow. I'll see you at the next recording.\"","Xie Xi suddenly looked up and smiled. \"That will be our third time meeting this week.\"","\"Mm.\"","Wait until Ye Qiusuo got up to pour some water, Xie Xi switched to his alt account.","Even if they weren't going public for now, he still had to set the pace; otherwise, his alt account would be useless.","My Professor Ye: [The sofa in Xie Xi's house on the reality show isn't this one. He must have gone to Professor Ye's house for a nap.]","[Eh, now that Hao-hao mentions it, it's true. Zai Zai's sofa isn't this low-key Nordic style color. It's more likely that You Feibai has one like this.]","Xie Xi looked down at the sofa he was sitting on, and his mood suddenly turned sour.","In the future, they would definitely choose a bright color for the sofa in their new home.","[You guys don't understand. Does Zai Zai look like someone who only has one place to live? Maybe he has other houses, and it's possible one of them is in the Nordic style.]","[Sigh, if there was a photo of Professor Ye sitting on this sofa, I could come up with a sofa CP theory in minutes.]","Big Star Xie: ...Believe it or not, one of these days he would find an excuse to make this sofa appear on the teacher's Weibo!","The comments below were flying off in all directions except the one Xie Xi wanted, so he could only come out to set the pace once more.","My Professor Ye: [They are recording the same show and have a teacher-student relationship. It's not impossible for him to go to Professor Ye's house to hang out.]","Big Star Xie: Another clever attempt at setting the pace.","However, the netizens just wouldn't bite. Even if they seemed to ship the \"Xie-Ye\" CP with total sincerity usually, when it came down to it, they were faster than anyone at debunking rumors.","[Going over to play isn't impossible, but taking a nap there is a bit much. It's not very likely.]","[Exactly. We ship the CP for fun, but we still have to distinguish it from reality. It's clearly impossible for Professor Ye and Zai Zai to be together.]","Xie Xi: Why is it impossible?","...","Two days before the broadcast of \"The Game Within a Maze,\" the guests had already moved to another city to film the next episode at a large amusement park.","The production crew arranged a hotel for everyone. Ye Qiusuo and Wan Yurou lived on the same floor, while the others were on a different floor.","Ye Qiusuo arrived in a car provided by the production crew from the airport and happened to run into Wan Yurou, who was heading out. The other woman glanced at her, curled her lip, and turned her head the other way.","Ye Qiusuo didn't care. She walked to her room and swiped her card to enter.","On the contrary, Wan Yurou stood in the elevator with a face full of jealousy and hatred.","She had gained absolutely no traction from recording this show.","She didn't know what was wrong with Zheng Longju. Aside from the initial teaser having a hint of over-editing, the subsequent episodes were actually quite normal, with no scenes of infighting being edited in at all.","All the show's talking points were centered on Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo, with You Feibai added in at most.","When Wan Yurou's company integrated the data, they found that even You Feibai's numbers were average, and he couldn't even compare to Ye Qiusuo's data.","Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi were like a virus; anyone who got stuck with them would have no good outcome.","In the future, if there were shows with those two, she might as well not bother with the hype.","Wan Yurou felt indignant.","Unlike others, she always felt that the world should belong to her, that the whole world should revolve around her, rather than this feeling of powerlessness she had now.","As soon as the elevator doors opened, her assistant stepped out. Wan Yurou held down the elevator button and, as the doors were about to close, said to the assistant outside, \"I'm not going out anymore.\"","Leaving the assistant on the first floor, she returned to her room.","...","Xie Xi arrived earlier than Ye Qiusuo. Calculating the time from her flight landing to her arrival at the hotel, he began sending her messages.","Xie Xi: [Teacher, have you arrived?]","Seeing the message, Ye Qiusuo didn't reply but called him directly. \"I'm here.\"","Xie Xi stood by the balcony window, looking at the moonlight outside, and said softly, \"I... miss you.\"","\"Do you want to come up and see me, or should we video call?\"","Xie Xi hesitated for a moment. \"Can I come see you?\"","\"Okay, I'll wait for you.\"","After hanging up, Xie Xi immediately prepared to go find Ye Qiusuo. Before leaving his room, he specifically put on a hat and a mask.","He took the elevator up. As soon as the doors opened, he turned right and started walking. At the same time, the adjacent elevator opened, and someone stepped out.","Xie Xi didn't notice. He counted the room numbers and stopped at Ye Qiusuo's room, pressing the doorbell.","Ye Qiusuo came out very quickly. Before he could press it a second time, she had already opened the door to let him in.","Only after the door closed did someone emerge from the corner.","It was Wan Yurou's assistant.","After seeing Xie Xi go in, she even pretended to pass by that room to confirm the room number once more before going back to knock on Wan Yurou's door.","After a long wait, Wan Yurou opened the door and said crossly, \"What is it?\"","The assistant felt she had discovered a huge secret and didn't care about Wan Yurou's tone at all. She squeezed inside and whispered excitedly, \"Sister Yurou, guess who I just saw?\"","“Who did you see?” Wan Yurou asked, already changed into her silk bathrobe. She sat before the vanity mirror, carefully removing her makeup.","“I just saw Xie Xi knocking on Professor Ye’s door!”","Wan Yurou’s hand froze. “Has the production crew started filming already?”","The assistant stared at her, speechless.","“No, that’s not it,” the assistant insisted. “There is definitely... something going on between them!”","With a sharp clatter, Wan Yurou slammed her bottle of makeup remover onto the table. She whipped around to glare at her assistant. “And your point is? Do you expect me to go out and handle their PR for them?”"]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84","paragraphs":["Wan Yurou was beyond furious.","That shameless couple—she knew there was something fishy going on. They were always making eyes at each other every time they recorded the show.","But so what if she knew? Was she supposed to find someone to leak the news that they were a couple?","She had to pay to get herself on the trending searches; giving these two free publicity would be stupid. If they were cheating on someone, she could at least use it to smear them.","Not to mention how popular the Xie-Ye CP was on the internet right now. If this news came out, people would absolutely eat it up.","Sitting in front of the vanity mirror, Wan Yurou felt like she couldn't even breathe smoothly. The more she thought about it, the more frustrated she became. She waved her hand at her assistant, Go back to your own room. Don't mention this again. I need to rest.","...","During the recording the next day, Wan Yurou couldn't help but pay attention to Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi. Sure enough, she noticed something different—the two were flirting with their eyes even more intensely.","Everyone, draw lots to form teams. You will complete missions in the amusement park, the director shouted from off-camera.","Xie Xi drew first, and Ye Qiusuo drew last, yet they ended up with the same number.","Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo are a team.","Wan Yurou tried hard to maintain her facial expression. She didn't know what kind of dumb luck Ye Qiusuo had; last episode she drew You Feibai, and this episode she drew Xie Xi. She had snatched the two biggest stars on the show.","Wan Yurou drew Lu Mingzhe. She might have been happy about it at the very beginning, but compared to You Feibai, Lu Mingzhe was indeed lacking in this industry.","But he probably didn't care.","Wan Yurou comforted herself. After all, Lu Mingzhe was the youngest son of the Lu Group. No matter how capable Ye Qiusuo was, she would still be completely suppressed by the Lu Group.","Here, for you. Xie Xi took the mission card and shoved it directly to Ye Qiusuo. He stood quietly behind her, but his eyes were looking at You Feibai.","He didn't mean anything by it; he was just happy.","You Feibai: ...","Everyone in the entertainment circle was shrewd, and as someone at the very top, there was nothing he couldn't see through.","Xie Xi was clearly showing off.","But... how long had it been? Were they already together?","When they recorded the last episode, the two were clearly just regular friends, at most a bit closer than the rest of them.","The production team didn't care about any of this. Once the mission cards were distributed, the recording began. The six people split into three teams and moved freely.","After reading the mission card, Ye Qiusuo put it away and led Xie Xi forward.","Actually, clearing the game wasn't difficult. By stepping back and looking at the production team's intentions, one could easily figure out the best place to start.","The previous episodes had generated a lot of buzz. Changing cities suddenly for this episode wasn't just to give the audience a sense of freshness; there was also an advertising element to it.","This amusement park had only been open for a year. It was famous locally, but their goal was to become a national tourist destination. There was no better gimmick than hosting a recording of The Maze.","It was mutually beneficial.","Since they needed to promote the venue, the mission lines for the three teams were bound to involve these amusement rides. After reading the mission card, Ye Qiusuo knew that they just needed to play along the way, and they would naturally find clues.","The production team's intentions clearly aligned with the thoughts of Xie Xi, who was just slacking off on the show.","While the other teams were working hard to decipher the clues on their mission cards, he was looking around at all the fun attractions, feeling that this one was suitable for couples, and that one was too.","He wanted to play them all.","But there was a time limit for completing the missions. After agonizing over it for a while, Xie Xi tugged at Ye Qiusuo and pointed to the roller coaster nearby. Can we go on that?","Ye Qiusuo looked up at it. Okay. What else do you want to play?","Xie Xi acted coy. There might not be enough time to play everything.","It doesn't matter, there's enough time.","And so, the two went to line up for the ride.","Just as they sat down, a staff member came over and asked, Excuse me, do you know how long one round on this roller coaster takes?","Xie Xi was still looking down, checking Ye Qiusuo's seatbelt. Hearing this, he was about to look up and say he didn't know.","Two minutes and thirty seconds, Ye Qiusuo said, looking at the staff member.","It was written on the introduction board they had just passed.","Yes, this guest got it right! Holding a script, the staff member babbled on with a bunch of introductions about the roller coaster. After finishing the advertisement, they finally said, Our park is hosting an event. Since you answered the question correctly, there will be a reward waiting for you when you get off.","What kind of reward? Xie Xi asked happily. Can you give us one of those little plushies? I saw other people have them.","Staff member: ...","Ye Qiusuo turned her head to the side, raising a hand to cover the smile tugging at the corners of her lips.","Those little plushies were only given to children or parents with children.","Yes, yes, we have them. Unable to withstand Xie Xi's persistent stare, the staff member could only agree.","The roller coaster only started moving after the production team had set up their cameras.","Professor Ye was already frowning during the ascent; she disliked the feeling of weightlessness.","Xie Xi, on the other hand, looked completely relaxed.","Are you scared? Xie Xi turned his head to ask her.","Ye Qiusuo shook her head. I just don't like this feeling.","As the roller coaster went faster and faster, the two couldn't converse properly anymore, and the other tourists around them started to scream.","It paused at the highest point, giving the tourists a moment to catch their breath, before a new round of screaming began as they plummeted downward.","Ignoring the camera in front of them, Xie Xi reached out and held Ye Qiusuo's hand, though he didn't turn to look at her.","Going down right now, his face would be distorted by the wind, and he would look very ugly.","After one round, the staff member was indeed waiting for them at the bottom. Not only did they give them a new mission clue, but also two little plushies, one pink and one blue.","Xie Xi hugged the two plushies while Ye Qiusuo took the mission clue card.","Here's this one for you. Xie Xi gave the blue one to Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo took it extremely naturally, though her eyes remained on the card.","Xie Xi leaned over to take a glance and then stopped looking. Anyway, even if he read it, he wouldn't understand it as fast as she did.","The two walked forward, and they went on every ride Xie Xi was interested in. As a result, people kept coming up to them to ask all sorts of random questions, but there was nothing Ye Qiusuo couldn't answer.","Even though they were clearly just playing around, the clues in their hands kept multiplying.","Fortunately, the other two teams didn't know their situation, otherwise they would probably be mad with anger.","Teacher, do you want to eat some ice cream? Xie Xi was wearing a pair of bunny ears on his head. They were given by a staff member when they were on a ride earlier. He didn't know if the staff had coordinated with each other, but starting from the second ride, every attraction would give them various little trinkets as long as they answered the questions correctly.","There was only one pair of bunny ears left, which Ye Qiusuo had placed on his head, adding casually, It looks good.","Xie Xi hadn't taken them off since.","Let's go.","It was the first time for both of them, and the park was huge. Although there were signs, staff members, and maps everywhere, they never asked for directions. Xie Xi just followed Ye Qiusuo; it was as if she had an automatic navigation system in her brain.","Walking into the food court, the two started lining up to buy ice cream. They just happened to bump into Wan Yurou and Lu Mingzhe. The two of them had come from who knows where, covered in sweat, clearly having done a lot of physical activity.","Several windows here had lines, and Wan Yurou and Lu Mingzhe were just a bit further back in the line next to theirs.","As soon as Wan Yurou turned her head, she spotted the two of them.","They were too conspicuous.","Especially Xie Xi, who was holding several plushies in his arms and wearing a pair of bunny ears on his head.","There were people in all sorts of costumes in the park, but someone with his level of good looks was entirely one of a kind. If it weren't for the staff members keeping order nearby, the crowd would have likely gotten completely out of control.","Seeing their leisurely attitude, Lu Mingzhe couldn't help but ask, \"Are you guys just playing around and ignoring the tasks? Have you given up?\"","Wan Yurou stood to the side, annoyed to death.","She wanted to give up too. Doing these bullshit tasks in an amusement park—who didn't want to be treated like a little princess instead?","To make matters worse, Xie Xi was fanning the flames from the sidelines, \"You guys can give up too. It's pretty fun here, and they even give out free stuff.\"","Ye Qiusuo had already bought four ice creams, all in different flavors. She handed two to Xie Xi.","Watching Xie Xi take a huge bite of his ice cream, Wan Yurou felt even more irritated.","Damn it, she wanted some too.","She was so hot and thirsty right now.","\"Teacher, there are seats over there.\" Xie Xi pulled Ye Qiusuo to the side, managing to snag a spot right under a sun umbrella.","The city was quite hot, already reaching summer temperatures, so finding a shady place to rest was a nice relief.","On the other side, things weren't going so smoothly for Wan Yurou and Lu Mingzhe. First, the two most popular ice cream flavors at the counters were sold out, so they had to settle for other flavors. After finally getting through the line and buying their treats, they looked around only to find that every single available seat was completely packed with people.","Wan Yurou felt like the makeup on her face was about to melt off, which made her mood even more volatile.","Meanwhile, sitting under the umbrella, Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo painted a completely different picture.","\"Teacher... are those two good?\" Xie Xi stared longingly at the two ice creams in front of Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo hadn't taken a bite yet. She had just asked for two spoons from the counter and said, \"Try them and see for yourself.\""]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85","paragraphs":["In broad daylight, the two of them were being all lovey-dovey and affectionate.","Wan Yurou's eyes hurt just looking at them. She finished her ice cream in a few bites and turned around to continue her mission.","Facts proved that if the direction was wrong, all efforts would be in vain.","By the time Wan Yurou and Lu Mingzhe were sweating profusely and finally found a glimmer of victory, Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo had already successfully found all the clues and completed the mission.","Then You Feibai and Xia Zhoubing also completed their mission. When they finally returned, Xie Xi was already so bored that he had fallen asleep on a nearby table.","Wan Yurou: \"...\"","The person she hated the most right now was Xie Xi, followed closely by Ye Qiusuo.","After recording the show, the six people went back to their respective hotels to pack their things and leave. Except for Ye Qiusuo, the rest were all in the entertainment circle and had an endless stream of schedules.","Before Xie Xi came, he had asked Ye Qiusuo which flight she was taking, and the two bought tickets for the same flight.","Ye Qiusuo hadn't brought much with her. She went up to pack for about ten minutes and then waited for Xie Xi in the hotel lobby.","\"Professor Ye.\" You Feibai happened to come down as well, followed by two assistants. \"Waiting for Xie Xi?\"","He asked this casually, but the meaning in his eyes was not that simple. As long as Ye Qiusuo said she was waiting for Xie Xi, it was equivalent to admitting that their relationship was unusual.","Ye Qiusuo nodded. Her gaze swept past You Feibai to look behind him.","\"Teacher.\" Xie Xi walked out of the elevator, unable to hide the joy on his brow.","\"Let's go.\" Having waited for the person she wanted to wait for, Ye Qiusuo turned and walked toward the main door.","You Feibai watched their retreating backs, his heart filled with complex emotions.","He had worked with Xie Xi six or seven years ago. At that time, both of them were newcomers with boundless prospects.","Standing in front of the media, You Feibai couldn't show any negative emotions, but Xie Xi had been used to doing whatever he wanted from the very beginning. This circle was an opportunity for You Feibai; once grasped, he could soar to the sky. But for Xie Xi, it was just a pastime.","Very early on, You Feibai understood the differences between people.","As for Ye Qiusuo, actually he... had once had feelings for her.","There might have been a misunderstanding at first. When she looked at him, there was impatience hidden deep in her eyes; You Feibai could tell.","But perhaps because of her appearance, or because she had saved him, there was a bit of liking and affection for her in You Feibai's heart.","It was a pity that the two had no time to spend together. He had too many schedules and worked all year round without rest. Sometimes he would think of her late at night, but because he was too tired, he was not in the mood to make a special effort to contact her.","He didn't expect Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo to be together. It seemed they didn't have much opportunity to meet, right?","When Movie King You first had thoughts about her, he actually had someone inquire about Ye Qiusuo's schedule. Seeing that both he and Ye Qiusuo were busy, he gave up the idea. But he never expected Ye Qiusuo to have someone she was dating, and that it would be Xie Xi.","\"Feibai, this is your schedule for next week. You have to go to E City to film today,\" his manager stepped up from behind and said.","\"Got it.\" You Feibai put on his sunglasses, his inner heart returning to calmness, and strode outside.","...","Ye Qiusuo and Xie Xi took the same flight back. When getting off the plane, they happened to bump into a male celebrity who had recently become popular again. Fans swarmed up and completely blocked the surrounding area, while security guards desperately tried to maintain order nearby.","Xie Xi pulled down his hat to cover his forehead. Wearing a mask on his face, he put his arm around Ye Qiusuo, half-shielding her face, and squeezed his way out.","He reacted quickly. The fans' attention was all on the male celebrity, and they didn't notice a big star walking past them. At most, Xie Xi would only have a side profile and a back shot in those fans' photos.","Even so, after the male celebrity's fans posted the unedited photos, there were still sharp-eyed people who drooled over Xie Xi's back and side profile shots.","[That guy in the corner looks really handsome.]","[You can't even see his face, and he's already handsome?]","[With that height and figure, it's hard to imagine him not being a handsome guy.]","[Am I the only one drooling over this boy's hands? They look a bit like my ultimate bias Baby Xi's hands, clean and pretty, even the nails are pinkish.]","[I think his back also looks a lot like Xixi. At first glance, I thought it was Xixi at the airport.]","[Stop dreaming. The person this boy is protecting in his arms must be his girlfriend.]","[Sigh—]","The fans eliminated their idol by themselves, but manager Sister Wei was different. She knew Xie Xi's flight, and wasn't that time exactly when Xie Xi got off the plane? After looking at a few photos, she immediately recognized that the two people were Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo.","Sister Wei stared at the photos on her phone for a long time, then called Zhang Dong.","\"Sister Wei.\" Zhang Dong sounded cheerful on the other end, and the sizzling sound of barbecue could be heard from time to time.","\"Are you eating barbecue?\"","\"I just got hungry, so I came out to eat.\" Zhang Dong hadn't realized anything was wrong yet.","\"Did Xixi come out too?\"","\"No, Brother Xi is still at home playing with...\" Zhang Dong swallowed nervously, \"playing games.\"","Sister Wei stood up and walked to the window, looking at the heavy traffic downstairs. \"Playing games with Professor Ye?\"","Zhang Dong: \"...\"","He mumbled a few times and was about to pretend the signal was bad to hang up the phone.","\"If you hang up, don't even think about getting your bonus this year.\"","\"Sister Wei...\" Zhang Dong was very troubled.","\"Are they really together?\" Hearing his tone, how could Sister Wei not understand? \"Professor Ye actually agreed?\"","She wasn't surprised that Xie Xi liked Professor Ye. However, the fact that Professor Ye actually agreed was what surprised Sister Wei.","Seeing that Sister Wei had no intention of pursuing the matter, Zhang Dong breathed a sigh of relief. \"Anyway, it went pretty smoothly.\" Although he wasn't too clear on the details himself.","Having asked up to this point, Sister Wei didn't ask any further. She planned to talk to Xie Xi about how to handle this matter while he was working tomorrow.","Sister Wei wasn't worried. Xie Xi had a transcendent status in the industry and always relied on his singing skills. He didn't need to pander to fans. Dating seriously wasn't something he needed to be on edge about or hide in various ways.","...","\"You like pink?\" Ye Qiusuo asked from behind.","After returning to Xie Xi's house, Xie Xi carefully put away all the various plushies he had won. The plushies in the amusement park had very strong color characteristics, blue and pink, and the ones in his hands were all pink.","Xie Xi looked down at the plushies in his hands, then smiled with curved eyes: \"I'll keep yours safe, and you keep mine safe.\"","Ye Qiusuo let out a soft laugh and didn't ask any more.","When the two were on the plane, Xie Xi had said that his house was big and could sleep many people. Insinuating through his words, he wanted to stay with Ye Qiusuo for another night.","In the end, Ye Qiusuo didn't go back, but came back with him instead. This was also the reason why Zhang Dong was able to go out and eat barbecue.","Ye Qiusuo stayed here under a different identity. Although it was only for one night, Xie Xi was still extremely happy. He pulled her around everywhere, wishing he could spill every single detail about himself to her.","Ye Qiusuo listened until he finished speaking, and only then did she open her laptop to handle work matters.","Xie Xi went to take a shower by himself. He came back carrying a body full of moisture and sat obediently to the side doing his own things, looking up to glance at her from time to time, completely satisfied.","Later, when he got bored, he quietly took out his phone and started secretly taking pictures of his Professor Ye.","Xie Xi looked down and cropped the photo several times, finally leaving only a pair of hands resting on a keyboard. He then posted it on his alternate account: [She is still working. Heart Heart. Image.jpg]","Late at night, there were an exceptionally large number of people surfing the internet. When the fans of this alternate account saw these hands, they instantly perked up.","[I could lick these hands for a year!]","[Wuwuwu, Hao Hao's girlfriend's hands are so pretty. Drool.jpg]","[Hao Hao, you have a girlfriend, but you still like Professor Ye. Won't your girlfriend get jealous?]","Xie Xi immediately replied to this comment: [No.]","After reading the comments for a while longer, Xie Xi successfully showed off that he was no longer a single dog, then finally turned off his phone and continued to keep Ye Qiusuo company.","Later on, however, he started to doze off. Ye Qiusuo turned her head and saw that his eyes were about to close, so she shut down her computer and told him to go rest.","...","Wei Qi came looking for Xie Xi early the next morning. He had work today, and she wanted to casually ask about his situation with Professor Ye. As a result, Xie Xi was still sleeping in, and the manager ran into Professor Ye in the living room instead.","Wei Qi: \"...Professor Ye is here too?\"","These two had already progressed to this stage, and as his manager, she was actually only finding out now!","Ye Qiusuo had just finished reading the company's financial reports. She stood up and nodded, \"He is still asleep. I will go wake him.\"","Wei Qi stood downstairs and rubbed her nose: It seems the assistant and lifestyle manager will have to move out from now on.","\"Xie Xi, time to get up.\" Ye Qiusuo pushed open the door. A certain someone was sleeping soundly. If it weren't already ten o'clock, she might not have had the heart to wake him.","Xie Xi rolled over, automatically burying his head into the pillow, not wanting to get out of bed at all.","\"I am leaving now.\"","Xie Xi, whose head was buried in the pillow, suddenly opened his eyes. He sat up abruptly, kneeling on the bed and turning his head toward the door: \"You are leaving now?\"","Last night, Ye Qiusuo had slept in the guest room next door. After he got into bed, he suddenly suffered from insomnia and couldn't fall asleep, only finally drifting off very late.","\"Your manager is waiting downstairs.\" Ye Qiusuo walked forward a few steps and reached out to smooth down a tuft of his hair that was sticking up. \"See you the day after tomorrow.\"","Xie Xi's eyes revealed his disappointment. They wouldn't be able to see each other tomorrow; he had to wait an extra day.","\"Get up.\" Ye Qiusuo's hand slid down to cup his face. She bent over and kissed the corner of Xie Xi's lips. \"I won't be this busy after a while.\"","Xie Xi's eyes suddenly widened, and then he said, completely dropping his reserve, \"If you kiss me one more time, I will get up.\"","Ye Qiusuo let go of him, a smile in her eyes. She took a few steps back and leaned against the door, saying lightly, \"I already kissed you. If you want more, come here yourself.\"","The great superstar Xie immediately got out of bed and walked over to Professor Ye. He bent down, closed his eyes, and gently touched her lips. Then, he took a step back and shamelessly whispered, \"That one doesn't count. You owe me until the day after tomorrow.\"","...","After Ye Qiusuo left, Xie Xi was still changing his clothes and getting his styling done.","Wei Qi stood to the side: \"When did you two get together?\"","\"A while ago.\" As Xie Xi spoke, his brow carried a joy he couldn't conceal.","\"What does Professor Ye like about you?\" Wei Qi muttered to herself. It was truly hard to imagine what kind of person someone like Professor Ye would like, although Xi Xi was indeed not bad.","Xie Xi overheard this. He turned his head and looked at his manager: \"She likes my good looks.\"","\"Yes, yes, you are the best looking,\" his manager quickly praised him.","After a moment, Wei Qi asked again, \"When are you planning to go public?\"","\"After Teacher isn't so busy anymore.\"","Although he said that, the fact that the two of them were together was becoming increasingly obvious. Especially after the amusement park episode aired, quite a few netizens noticed something fishy.","It was the first time these two teamed up, and the look in their eyes was clearly different from everyone else.","Not to mention there was the contrast of the previous episode where Ye Qiusuo and You Feibai teamed up; back then, the interaction between Ye Qiusuo and You Feibai could only be described as completely distant and distinct."]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86","paragraphs":["When the amusement park episode aired, neither Ye Qiusuo nor Xie Xi watched it, as it happened to be the time for their date.","However, when the show aired, the audience was watching, and the show's view count maintained a stable, incredibly high number.","Unlike the recording process, the audience could see all three groups simultaneously. With the comparison, it became even more obvious how different Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo's group was.","After the six people drew lots and formed groups, You Feibai also had a general idea, but he was misled by the task card he received at the very beginning. He and Xia Zhoubing spent the first half of their time looking for clues on the ground, without spending any time going on the rides.","According to the original script design, if none of the three groups got on the right track, the program team would privately remind them. But Zheng Longju had never been soft on the guests. Since one group had already started playing the attractions from the beginning, they decided not to remind the other two groups for now and just keep recording. Sweating celebrities were also a kind of fresh material.","[This show is too addictive. Honestly, you wouldn't know without comparing, but putting Xia Zhoubing and You Feibai side by side, it's truly tragic.]","[I remember Xia Zhoubing secretly trying to copy You Feibai's route before, right? Later, she was exposed by Xie Xi.]","[Speaking of which, the guests invited to this show are really heading for a disaster. They all seem to have some conflicts. But, I love it, hahahahahaha!]","The audience first watched two groups sweating profusely, panting, and anxiously looking for clues, and then the scene shifted. Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo were leisurely playing games and even asking the staff for small plush toys.","[Shocking, a popular male singer throws away his dignity for a small plush toy.]","[Xie Xi is too shameless, hahahaha, the staff clearly asked Professor Ye.]","[Hehe, Professor Ye obviously doesn't care, she will definitely agree to give it to Baby Xi.]","[Hahahaha, I've played here before, their plush toys are indeed very cute, but previously they only gave them to children. I'm angry! Who isn't a baby?]","[If the park gives away small plush toys, then I'll go too.]","[Plus one.]","[Am I the only one who thinks Professor Ye spoils Baby Xi a lot? She agrees to whatever Baby Xi says.]","[Hehe, I love this show, there's plenty of material. I can already edit several videos in my head.]","When it was time to ride the roller coaster, the program's editing team stirred things up by specifically zooming in on the scene of the two holding hands, and then adding the word friendship, but netizens obviously didn't think so.","They took screenshots while expressing their shock.","[Holding, holding hands?!!!]","[Holy crap, isn't this the scene I fantasized about?!]","[Sisters, what are you waiting for, take screenshots!]","[I can rest in peace, actually getting to see Professor Ye and Baby Xi holding hands, sobbing, so sweet, so sweet.]","[The Xie-Ye CP must be real!]","These were only the beginning. For the later attractions, Xie Xi got a pair of rabbit ears, and Ye Qiusuo personally helped him put them on, even flicking one of the ears. Netizens simply went crazy on the spot, alternately struck by Xie Xi's stunning looks and desperately shipping this hard-won CP material.","There was no need for uploaders to edit it!","The other two groups were dull to watch, and people just wanted to fast-forward to see Xie Xi and Ye Qiusuo. These two were practically emitting pink bubbles all around them.","[Awww! Eating ice cream together!!!]","[Baby Xi, you are amazing. Usually, it's the girl tasting the boy's ice cream, but you, you ate two and still wanted to eat Professor Ye's.]","[I announce that I no longer hate Zheng Longju. Because of her, I get to see such a wonderful scene.]","[Dying of laughter, what is that expression on Wan Yurou's face? She looks like she's about to pass out.]","After Ye Qiusuo took Xie Xi smoothly eating, drinking, and having fun while completing the tasks, the audience's attention could only shift to the other two groups.","There is a saying that things will develop in the opposite direction when they become extreme. Because Wan Yurou looked too miserable, sympathetic bullet comments actually began to appear during the broadcast, feeling that she was too pitiful and was simply being brutally abused.","After the hit show aired, it was bound to trend on hot searches, especially Xie Xi, who had an exceptionally large number of hot searches.","One of the hot searches was particularly eye-catching: Little Princess Xie Xi","Many netizens rubbed their eyes subconsciously upon seeing this tag, wondering what kind of devilish combination this was.","When they clicked in, they saw the big star Xie wearing pink and white rabbit ears, holding various pink and tender little plush toys in his arms, with an overly good-looking face, plus the filter adjusted by fans.","He was simply a princess himself!","[Mom fans are breaking their hearts. Who will be worthy of our Baby Xi in the future?]","[Baby Xi, I'll pick up trash to support you!]","[I'm twenty-eight this year, female, have a house and a car, and millions in savings. A proper young talent. Baby Xi, follow me, I'll spoil you for a lifetime.]","[Millions are still too little, tens of millions is barely enough.]","[... I'm different. Am I the only one who thinks Baby Xi's pants look a bit familiar?]","[Worn before?]","[Huh, I also think they look very familiar.]","[... This... aren't these the pants worn by the passerby guy in a certain star's airport photo the other day?]","[???]","As soon as this comment came out, netizens exploded instantly and immediately went back to dig. Comparing the back and side photos, they looked more and more familiar, but half of them still didn't quite believe it.","[It might be a coincidence, just a pair of pants and a similar figure, so they look alike.]","[Yeah, does Baby Xi look like someone who could get a partner?]","[I don't believe it! Sobbing, the Xie-Ye CP is the real one!!!]","[Shouldn't he still be recording the show that day? How could he appear here.]","However, another wave of netizens provided explanations one by one.","[The plane flies back in two hours. That time point perfectly matches when they finished recording the show. That day, Lu Mingzhe flew to another city to attend an event.]","[The pants are limited edition, especially the pattern on the side pocket, which can be customized.]","[... The pattern on both their pants is a little yellow duck.]","Although it was just catching shadows, the vast majority of people defaulted to the person at the airport being Xie Xi. The originally happy comments suddenly took a turn, and everyone was asking who the person Xie Xi was holding at the airport was.","Due to the angle of the photo, Ye Qiusuo was not captured, only a blurry outline could be seen. She was also wearing a jacket, so netizens didn't recognize her.","The netizens, especially those who had just finished shipping the Xie-Ye CP, were heartbroken.","As sweet as it was just now, that's how bitter it was now.","They thought they were eating sugar, but it was actually glass shards, making their mouths bleed.","[Sobbing, at least let me ship it for one day, sobbing.]","[No, I don't believe it. The person at the airport must not be Xie Xi. Even if it is Xie Xi, the person he is holding must be Professor Ye. Yes, that's how it is.]","[As long as Xie Xi hasn't admitted it, then this person isn't him.]","[But Xie Xi hasn't denied it either.]","A large swath of people online was heartbroken, while Xie Xi was still completely unaware.","He was making a loving dinner.","Ye Qiusuo temporarily went to the study to handle some matters, and Xie Xi used a heart-shaped mold in the kitchen to fry an egg - a true loving dinner.","Of course, in order to make a perfectly shaped heart egg, he wasted a whole bag of eggs.","Xie Xi opened the camera, took pictures from various angles and with various filters, then picked the best-looking photo, logged into his alternate account, and posted it: [A loving dinner made for her ~ picture.jpg]","...","Tonight, Weibo was destined to be anything but peaceful. First, Xie Xi, the little princess himself, trended on the search rankings, with everyone joking and laughing. Then, someone dug up that the passerby in the airport who had his arm around his girlfriend was actually Xie Xi. The Xie-Ye CP shattered, and countless shippers abandoned ship.","Rong Shiyun didn't make it in time to watch the show today, and being short on time, she planned to save it for later. However, she couldn't resist her curiosity and logged onto Weibo. As soon as she got online, she was dumbfounded.","When did her baby start dating?!","After reading through the whole story, Rong Shiyun felt a sense of loss. She actually shipped the Xie-Ye CP too, especially since Ye Qiusuo was her good friend. If it were true, it would be keeping the goodies within the family.","Feeling disappointed, Rong Shiyun clicked into the Weibo profile of the biggest Xie-Ye CP fan account. She happened to see their latest post. She stared at it for a long time, dumbfounded once again.","With trembling hands, she typed out a comment: ??? Who are you??? Why are you in Qiusuo's kitchen???","That plate, that pot, that cutting board—Rong Shiyun had bought them all!","Not to mention the kitchen background in the photo.","As soon as Rong Shiyun posted, the comments below were uniformly filled with question marks.","???","???","??? Is the Qiusuo you mentioned the Qiusuo I'm thinking of?","??? I just want to know what relationship the commenter has with Professor Ye, and how she recognizes Professor Ye's kitchen.","I'm blind. What day is it today? I shouldn't have gone online. One CP has been brutally torn into two.","??? No, wait, my logic is suddenly confused. Assuming, if, supposing Hao Hao and Professor Ye are a couple, then why does he ship the Xie-Ye CP?","Hahahaha, I know! The blogger must be a girl. Maybe she knows Professor Ye and they are friends. This explanation makes sense.","Scared me to death. I thought Professor Ye also had a partner.","??? Are you guys stupid? Didn't Hao Hao's previous Weibo post say he had a girlfriend?","After commenting, Rong Shiyun also experienced a momentary lapse in logic. She first clicked into this blogger's homepage, wanting to scroll through their past posts. She remembered there was a previous photo mentioning a midday nap on a sofa, and that sofa looked exactly like the one in Qiusuo's house.","Wait a minute...","Rong Shiyun suddenly realized: the person taking a midday nap on the sofa wasn't this blogger, but Xie Xi.","Rong Shiyun: ???","After a moment of logical chaos, Rong Shiyun directly called Ye Qiusuo.","Qiusuo, are you actually dating my baby?","When Ye Qiusuo answered the phone, she was still holding a fork with a small piece of egg on it. Unable to eat it herself, she fed it to Xie Xi beside her. You found out?","I... I... Rong Shiyun was shocked for a long time before blurting out, Badass, and then snapped the phone shut to digest this information herself.","Xie Xi hadn't had time to check the comments on his alt account because Ye Qiusuo had come out of the study. He had happily trotted out with the heart-shaped egg and was now watching her eat.","It's delicious. Xie Xi swallowed the piece of egg Ye Qiusuo had just fed him.","Meanwhile, the entire internet was collectively dumbfounded by what they had dug up.","What exactly had they uncovered?!","A netizen assumed that Rong Shiyun's comment was true and hypothesized that this blogger was indeed making heart-shaped eggs in Professor Ye's house. Connecting the previous and subsequent Weibo posts, these two were most likely a couple. Then the question arose: was this person actually Professor Ye?","The netizens showed off their skills, superimposing a pair of hands that had previously appeared in a photo with Professor Ye's hands from the show. The overlap rate was as high as ninety-eight percent!","However, another netizen posted a screenshot of the photo Xie Xi had previously posted about his midday nap, along with the coincidental sofa that had caused such an uproar at the time.","I want to know if this is a coincidence or the exact same sofa.","Fuck, are the Xie-Ye CP shippers riding a roller coaster tonight?!"]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87","paragraphs":["Shocking the whole family, the top fan account of Xie-Ye CP is suspected to be the real person involved.","That night, entertainment accounts started posting clues compiled by netizens everywhere. Although there was no concrete evidence throughout the posts, in order to grab traffic, the accounts spared no effort in promoting that the top fan account was Xie Xi.","Wei Qi, his manager, also made no move. She saw it, but didn't react, planning to ask Xie Xi how to handle it tomorrow, and to see what Xie Xi's top fan account had posted.","The two people involved were still unaware, because a certain someone started making a fuss.","\"Teacher, why don't you check my phone?\" Xie Xi took a few bites of the egg Ye Qiusuo fed him, and his whole being felt like it was floating. He leaned on Ye Qiusuo's shoulder and asked incessantly.","\"Why would I check your phone?\" Ye Qiusuo found it strange.","Xie Xi said seriously, \"Other people's girlfriends always check up on them, look at their phones, scroll through their social media, and even check their call records.\"","Ye Qiusuo frowned, \"I don't check those things.\" Everyone is an independent individual, and it's normal to keep some privacy.","The big star Xie clutched his chest and said pitifully, \"Why don't you check? Do you... not love me?\"","\"...\"","Professor Ye was genuinely confused. How did he come to this conclusion?","\"...I don't not love you,\" Professor Ye said with some difficulty. Saying such overly intimate words still felt rather strange to her.","The big star Xie, however, immediately came back to life, and then stuffed his phone into Ye Qiusuo's hand. \"Then look at my phone.\"","Ye Qiusuo casually flipped through it and found that the lock screen was her, and the social media posts he made were also about her. In short, any place where he could show off their affection, he had utilized.","\"Do you want to change our profile pictures to matching ones?\" Ye Qiusuo asked as she returned the phone to Xie Xi.","Xie Xi: \"!\"","His Professor Ye actually knew about matching couple profile pictures.","In fact, Professor Ye frequently updated her knowledge base of dating skills; she was just too busy and hadn't had the time to put them into practice.","\"T-then let's change them,\" the big star Xie said reservedly.","Then he spent half an hour picking out matching profile pictures with great relish.","...","Various trending topics made their rounds at night. When Xie Xi woke up the next day, Ye Qiusuo surprisingly hadn't gotten up early. She was sleeping beside him, her brows slightly furrowed.","Xie Xi raised his hand to gently trace the outline of her face, hesitating whether he should wake her up.","Taking a day off should be fine, right?","The big star Xie was always used to doing whatever he wanted, but he couldn't easily make decisions regarding Ye Qiusuo's matters.","Ye Qiusuo, with her eyes closed, pulled Xie Xi's hand down. Her voice was slightly hoarse, \"Not sleeping anymore?\"","Xie Xi moved closer to her and asked softly, \"Do you have to go to work today?\"","\"I already asked for a leave last night.\" Ye Qiusuo opened her eyes. \"I don't need to go today.\"","Xie Xi became happy. He held her hand and shook it a few times. \"Then we can continue sleeping.\"","He reached out with his other hand to grab his phone. He originally wanted to check the time, but WeChat was filled with messages from Zhang Dong and his parents. Upon opening them, Xie Xi instantly became wide awake.","His top fan account had been discovered!","\"What's wrong?\" Seeing that his expression was off, Ye Qiusuo asked subconsciously.","Xie Xi stole a glance at Ye Qiusuo. How was he supposed to tell her that he was the top fan account vigorously organizing netizens to ship the Xie-Ye CP?","It should be fine, anyway... his Professor Ye already said yesterday that she liked him.","This was just a small matter.","\"We seem to have been exposed,\" Xie Xi said hesitantly.","Ye Qiusuo didn't have much of a reaction. \"As long as you don't mind.\"","How could Xie Xi mind? He wished the whole world knew they were together.","The two didn't go back to sleep. Ye Qiusuo sat up to accompany him in browsing the trending topics.","[Is Hao Hao really Xie Xi? No wonder when the Bai-Qiu for a Lifetime CP came out before, he raised the banner for the Xie-Ye CP so high and made the lucky draw event such a huge spectacle.]","[Actually, there's no solid evidence saying that this blogger is a side account opened by Xie Xi.]","[Then can the person above explain why the sofa in the background of Baby Xi's previous post was exactly the same as Professor Ye's? The commenter in that Weibo thread had mentioned that it looked exactly like the new sofa her friend bought, and later asked the blogger why they were at Professor Ye's house. It's obvious that the commenter and Professor Ye are friends.]","[Honestly, the behavior of these two in \"Maze Setup\" was obvious enough, right? I feel like whenever Xie Xi looks at Professor Ye, there's light in his eyes.]","[Wuwuwu, this must be true. The CP I ship is real!]","[Actually, I still think it's best for Professor Ye and You Feibai to be together. Their personalities are more similar, and they'd have more topics to talk about.]","[Yes, yes, yes. Although Xie Xi is okay, he's too casual and impulsive. Such a person might not be suitable for Professor Ye. And well... their educational levels are too far apart, so they won't have anything to talk about in life. The Bai-Qiu for a Lifetime CP is still the best.]","Xie Xi couldn't stand it when he saw this comment. He turned to look at Ye Qiusuo: \"They say we're not a good match.\"","Ye Qiusuo glanced at the comment, memorized the Weibo handle and the avatar of the commenter, and then picked up her phone from the bedside table. She opened Weibo, used that Professor Ye account she hadn't logged into for ages, and retweeted and commented on the post: [Except for him, no one is suitable for me.]","Xie Xi watched her post it from the side, and his face immediately turned red. \"That seems a bit too direct.\" But he liked it.","He also immediately logged into his side account and first replied to that reader's comment: [Die of anger, you shipped Bai-Qiu for a Lifetime for nothing!]","Then he used his main account to retweet Ye Qiusuo's Weibo: [My Ye Qiusuo]","Ye Qiusuo let out a laugh and took the phone from his hand. \"I still want to sleep for a bit. Will you join me?\"","With their phones turned off, the two completely isolated themselves from the outside world.","However, the internet completely exploded. The dark red word 'Explosive' shot straight to the top headlines.","Xie Xi and Professor Ye officially announce their relationship","[What what what?!!! Help, I need a ventilator!]","[Ahhhhh, oh my god, I never expected that one day the CP I ship would become real!!!]","[The CP becoming real isn't surprising, but anyway, I never expected the top CP fan account to actually be the real person involved. Baby Xi is truly the most shameless.]","[Wuwuwu, wishing you a long and lasting relationship!]","[I'm dying of laughter. Did anyone see Baby Xi using his side account to reply and his main account to retweet the comment? Talk about a stark contrast, that's too much hahahahaha.]","[Everyone, I'm going to re-watch \"Maze Setup\". It's too sweet, wuwuwu. Whenever I think about how what I'm shipping is completely real, I almost can't control my screaming.]","...","Xie Xi didn't know any of this, nor did he care. His phone was already turned off and placed on the bedside table by Ye Qiusuo.","Ye Qiusuo was indeed tired and soon fell into a deep sleep. On the contrary, Xie Xi wasn't sleepy at all. He brushed away the long hair on her face, stared at her for a while, and the tenderness in his eyes almost overflowed.","Finally, he slightly propped himself up on his arms, lowered his head, cast down his eyes, and kissed his Professor Ye."]}]);
